('ebd184e4-ec4e-5ff9-8fe4-a85184cd65ed', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '17bc21e4-5e91-5a10-b376-d0b3020efdab', '73886620-44f0-5907-990b-548f14480bbc', 'mop floor', '/mɒp flɔː/', 'A2', 'phrase', 'Dùng cây lau để làm sạch sàn nhà.', 'to clean the surface of a room using a tool with a sponge or thick string.', 'After spilling juice, I had to quickly mop the floor to prevent it from getting sticky.', 'Sau khi làm đổ nước ép, tôi phải nhanh chóng lau nhà để tránh sàn bị dính.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance staff will mop the floor in the main lobby after the building closes tonight.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên bảo trì sẽ lau sàn ở sảnh chính sau khi tòa nhà đóng cửa tối nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mop-floor-ljspeech-0be7245a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mop-floor-cori-0be7245a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mop-floor-4e4e8795.webp', '[\"clean the floor\", \"wash the floor\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"mop the kitchen floor\", \"meaning\": \"lau sàn bếp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wet mop\", \"meaning\": \"cây lau nhà ướt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sweep the floor\", \"note_vi\": \"sweep là quét bằng chổi, mop là lau bằng cây lau nhà có nước\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"mop\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mop-floor-cori-0be7245a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mop-floor-aru0-0be7245a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mop-floor-aru5-0be7245a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mop-floor-aru6-0be7245a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mop-floor-aru10-0be7245a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mop-floor-aru9-0be7245a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mop-floor-aru3-0be7245a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mop-floor-aru7-0be7245a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mop-floor-ar