('15a93703-1351-551d-8969-13d9ebacf4ae', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '1aae1a92-dcee-520d-88b3-43b345ff611f', '0eba3904-7194-5f16-b32f-92511d414a9c', 'make up', '/meɪk ʌp/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Các sản phẩm dùng để trang điểm cho khuôn mặt.', 'substances like powder or lipstick that people put on their faces to look better.', 'She always carries a small bag of make-up in her purse.', 'Cô ấy luôn mang theo một túi nhỏ đồ trang điểm trong ví.', '{\"en\": \"The store manager decided to expand the section for high-quality make up and beauty products.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý cửa hàng đã quyết định mở rộng khu vực dành cho mỹ phẩm chất lượng cao và các sản phẩm làm đẹp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-ljspeech-a65504d2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-cori-a65504d2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/make-up-c1514b63.webp', '[\"cosmetics\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"apply make up\", \"meaning\": \"trang điểm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"make up products\", \"meaning\": \"các sản phẩm mỹ phẩm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"make-up\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-cori-a65504d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-aru0-a65504d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-aru5-a65504d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-aru6-a65504d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-aru10-a65504d2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-aru9-a65504d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-aru3-a65504d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-aru7-a65504d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-aru8-a65504d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-aru2-a65504d2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-ljspeech-a65504d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-lt408-a65504d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-lt138-a65504d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-lt624-a65504d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-lt396-a65504d2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-lt498-a65504d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-lt132-a65504d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-lt288-a65504d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-lt42-a65504d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-up-lt90-a65504d2.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ viết là \'make up\' hoặc \'makeup\', động từ là \'make up\' (bịa chuyện/làm hòa).', 'shopping', 1, 7),
('92771ff9-f320-510e-930b-728aed0c2ba2', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '1aae1a92-dcee-520d-88b3-43b345ff611f', '0eba3904-7194-5f16-b32f-92511d414a9c', 'much', '/mʌtʃ/', 'A1', 'determiner', 'Một lượng lớn hoặc số lượng đáng kể (dùng với danh từ không đếm được).', 'a large amount or quantity of something, used with uncountable nouns.', 'Don\'t spend too much money on unnecessary things.', 'Đừng tiêu quá nhiều tiền vào những thứ không cần thiết.', '{\"en\": \"There is not much budget left for the marketing campaign this quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Không còn nhiều ngân sách cho chiến dịch tiếp thị quý này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/much-ljspeech-7d3f4472.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/much-cori-7d3f4472.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/much-77fa7bb0.webp', '[\"a lot of\", \"plenty of\", \"a great deal of\"]', '[\"little\", \"few\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"much time\", \"meaning\": \"nhiều thời gian\"}, {\"phrase\": \"much effort\", \"meaning\": \"nhiều nỗ lực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"much work\", \"meaning\": \"nhiều công việc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"many\", \"note_vi\": \"\'many\' dùng với danh từ đếm được, \'much\' dùng với danh từ không đếm được.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/much-cori-7d3f4472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/much-aru0-7d3f4472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/much-aru5-7d3f4472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/much-aru6-7d3f4472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/much-aru10-7d3f4472.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/much-aru9-7d3f4472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/much-aru3-7d3f4472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/much-aru7-7d3f4472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/much-aru8-7d3f4472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/much-aru2-7d3f4472.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/much-ljspeech-7d3f4472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/much-lt408-7d3f4472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/much-lt138-7d3f4472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/much-lt624-7d3f4472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/much-lt396-7d3f4472.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/much-lt498-7d3f4472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/much-lt132-7d3f4472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/much-lt288-7d3f4472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/much-lt42-7d3f4472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/much-lt90-7d3f4472.mp3\"]}}', '\'Much\' chỉ dùng với danh từ không đếm được; với danh từ đếm được phải dùng \'many\'.', 'office', 1, 8),
('5ec934b6-4b79-5de6-bacf-76455ac2a06a', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '1aae1a92-dcee-520d-88b3-43b345ff611f', '0eba3904-7194-5f16-b32f-92511d414a9c', 'good-looking', '/ɡʊdˈlʊkɪŋ/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Có vẻ ngoài hấp dẫn, dễ nhìn.', 'having an attractive physical appearance that is pleasant for other people to look at often.', 'The new actor is very good-looking and talented.', 'Diễn viên mới rất ưa nhìn và tài năng.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team hired a good-looking model to promote the new luxury watch collection effectively.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã thuê một người mẫu có ngoại hình ưa nhìn để quảng bá bộ sưu tập đồng hồ cao cấp mới một cách hiệu quả.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/good-looking-ljspeech-a1dbc962.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/good-looking-cori-a1dbc962.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/good-looking-1f36caae.webp', '[\"attractive\", \"handsome\"]', '[\"unattractive\", \"ugly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"good-looking person\", \"meaning\": \"người có ngoại hình đẹp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"very good-looking\", \"meaning\": \"rất ưa nhìn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"well-looking\", \"note_vi\": \"Sai ngữ pháp, người bản ngữ dùng good-looking hoặc attractive.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/good-looking-cori-a1dbc962.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/good-looking-aru0-a1dbc962.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/good-looking-aru5-a1dbc962.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/good-looking-aru6-a1dbc962.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/good-looking-aru10-a1dbc962.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/good-looking-aru9-a1dbc962.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/good-looking-aru3-a1dbc962.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/good-looking-aru7-a1dbc962.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pro