('8a4f0991-67d4-5c3c-a188-df409ab0f511', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '1aae1a92-dcee-520d-88b3-43b345ff611f', '0eba3904-7194-5f16-b32f-92511d414a9c', 'coin', '/kɔɪn/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Đồng tiền kim loại nhỏ, thường hình tròn.', 'a small, round piece of metal used as money.', 'She inserted a silver coin into the vending machine to purchase a cold beverage.', 'Cô ấy đã nhét một đồng tiền xu bằng bạc vào máy bán hàng tự động để mua một món đồ uống lạnh.', '{\"en\": \"The vending machine in the lobby only accepts a specific type of coin.\", \"vi\": \"Máy bán hàng tự động ở sảnh chỉ chấp nhận một loại tiền xu cụ thể.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-ljspeech-3478fe69.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-cori-3478fe69.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/coin-e283060c.webp', '[\"change\", \"specie\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"flip a coin\", \"meaning\": \"tung đồng xu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"insert a coin\", \"meaning\": \"nhét đồng xu vào\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"corn\", \"note_vi\": \"corn nghĩa là ngô (bắp)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"coin\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"coinage\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-cori-3478fe69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-aru0-3478fe69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-aru5-3478fe69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-aru6-3478fe69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-aru10-3478fe69.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-aru9-3478fe69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-aru3-3478fe69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-aru7-3478fe69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-aru8-3478fe69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-aru2-3478fe69.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-ljspeech-3478fe69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-lt408-3478fe69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-lt138-3478fe69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-lt624-3478fe69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-lt396-3478fe69.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-lt498-3478fe69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-lt132-3478fe69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-lt288-3478fe69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-lt42-3478fe69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coin-lt90-3478fe69.mp3\"]}}', 'Coin là tiền xu bằng kim loại, phân biệt với note/bill là tiền giấy.', 'finance', 1, 12),
('8696ae0e-6cc1-5746-8e79-09a688387053', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '1aae1a92-dcee-520d-88b3-43b345ff611f', '0eba3904-7194-5f16-b32f-92511d414a9c', 'thoughtful', '/ˈθɔːt.fəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Quan tâm đến người khác hoặc suy nghĩ sâu sắc.', 'showing care and consideration for the needs of other people or deep in mind.', 'Our supervisor left a thoughtful note wishing everyone a relaxing weekend after the busy project.', 'Người giám sát của chúng tôi đã để lại một ghi chú chu đáo chúc mọi người có một cuối tuần thư giãn sau dự án bận rộn.', '{\"en\": \"The executive written feedback was very thoughtful and helped improve the proposal significantly.\", \"vi\": \"Phản hồi bằng văn bản của người quản lý rất chu đáo và giúp cải thiện đề xuất đáng kể.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtful-ljspeech-b492d144.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtful-cori-b492d144.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/thoughtful-eac125d9.webp', '[\"considerate\", \"attentive\"]', '[\"thoughtless\", \"inconsiderate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"thoughtful gesture\", \"meaning\": \"cử chỉ chu đáo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"thoughtful expression\", \"meaning\": \"nét mặt trầm tư\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"thoughtless\", \"note_vi\": \"thoughtful là chu đáo/ân cần, thoughtless là vô tâm/không suy nghĩ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"thought\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"thoughtfully\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"thoughtfulness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtful-cori-b492d144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtful-aru0-b492d144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtful-aru5-b492d144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtful-aru6-b492d144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtful-aru10-b492d144.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtful-aru9-b492d144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtful-aru3-b492d144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtful-aru7-b492d144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtful-aru8-b492d144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtful-aru2-b492d144.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtful-ljspeech-b492d144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtful-lt408-b492d144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtful-lt138-b492d144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtful-lt624-b492d144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtful-lt396-b492d144.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtful-lt498-b492d144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtful-lt132-b492d144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtful-lt288-b492d144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtful-lt42-b492d144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtful-lt90-b492d144.mp3\"]}}', 'Thoughtful vừa có nghĩa là chu đáo, ân cần (với người khác), vừa mang nghĩa trầm tư, suy nghĩ.', 'office', 1, 13),
('0612ba44-c72c-59c4-bfb7-a8020456fc3c', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '1aae1a92-dcee-520d-88b3-43b345ff611f', '0eba3904-7194-5f16-b32f-92511d414a9c', 'weigh', 'UK: /weɪ/ | US: /weɪ/', 'A2', 'verb', 'cân nặng', 'to measure how heavy someone or something is using a scale.', 'The package weighs about two pounds.', 'Gói hàng nặng khoảng hai pound.', '{\"en\": \"The shipping department weighs each outgoing package before applying the postage label.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận vận chuyển cân từng kiện hàng gửi đi trước khi dán nhãn cước phí.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weigh-ljspeech-1ea8af94.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weigh-cori-1ea8af94.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/weigh-02c1dd1f.webp', '[\"measure\", \"evaluate\", \"consider\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"weigh the options\", \"meaning\": \"cân nhắc các lựa chọn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"weigh the pros and cons\", \"meaning\": \"cân nhắc ưu và nhược điểm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"way\", \"note_vi\": \"Đồng âm /weɪ/ nhưng có nghĩa là con đường hoặc cách thức.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"weight\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weigh-cori-1ea8af94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weigh-aru0-1ea8af94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weigh-aru5-1ea8af94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weigh-aru6-1ea8af94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weigh-aru10-1ea8af94.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weigh-aru9-1ea8af94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weigh-aru3-1ea8af94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weigh-aru7-1ea8af94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weigh-aru8-1ea8af94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weigh-aru2-1ea8af94.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weigh-ljspeech-1ea8af94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weigh-lt408-1ea8af94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weigh-lt138-1ea8af94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weigh-lt624-1ea8af94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weigh-lt396-1ea8af94.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weigh-lt498-1ea8af94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weigh-lt132-1ea8af94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weigh-lt288-1ea8af94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weigh-lt42-1ea8af94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weigh-lt90-1ea8af94.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài nghĩa cân trọng lượng, weigh còn có nghĩa bóng như \'weigh options / pros and cons\' (cân nhắc các lựa chọn / ưu nhược điểm).', 'shipping', 1, 14),
('5a21933d-dcb8-5c13-b9e2-3d4b32d8af2c', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '1aae1a92-dcee-520d-88b3-43b345ff611f', '0eba3904-7194-5f16-b32f-92511d414a9c', 'trolley', '/ˈtrɒli/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Xe đẩy có bánh dùng để vận chuyển đồ đạc, hành lý.', 'a metal frame with wheels used for carrying heavy goods in a supermarket or an airport.', 'We used a trolley to carry all our groceries from the car to the house.', 'Chúng tôi đã dùng xe đẩy để mang tất cả đồ tạp hóa từ xe vào nhà.', '{\"en\": \"Please leave your shopping trolley in the designated area after you finish your grocery shopping.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng để xe đẩy hàng của bạn vào khu vực quy định sau khi bạn mua sắm xong.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trolley-ljspeech-64f836f6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trolley-cori-64f836f6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/trolley-264d2a6d.webp', '[\"cart\", \"buggy\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"shopping trolley\", \"meaning\": \"xe đẩy siêu thị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"push a trolley\", \"meaning\": \"đẩy xe hàng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cart\", \"note_vi\": \"trolley phổ biến ở Anh, cart phổ biến ở Mỹ.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trolley-cori-64f836f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trolley-aru0-64f836f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trolley-aru5-64f836f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trolley-aru6-64f836f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trolley-aru10-64f836f6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trolley-aru9-64f836f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trolley-aru3-64f836f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trolley-aru7-64f836f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trolley-aru8-64f836f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trolley-aru2-64f836f6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trolley-ljspeech-64f836f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trolley-lt408-64f836f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trolley-lt138-64f836f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trolley-lt624-64f836f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trolley-lt396-64f836f6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trolley-lt498-64f836f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trolley-lt132-64f836f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trolley-lt288-64f836f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trolley-lt42-64f836f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trolley-lt90-64f836f6.mp3\"]}}', 'Phổ biến trong các bài nghe về mua sắm hoặc tại sân bay.', 'shopping', 1, 15),
('1cd7344a-ef15-5010-8fd2-19b6a39084f6', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '1aae1a92-dcee-520d-88b3-43b345ff611f', '0eba3904-7194-5f16-b32f-92511d414a9c', 'tourism', '/ˈtʊərɪzəm/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Ngành công nghiệp liên quan đến việc cung cấp dịch vụ cho du khách.', 'the business of providing services for people who are visiting a place for pleasure.', 'The local economy relies heavily on tourism, especially during the peak season.', 'Nền kinh tế địa phương phụ thuộc rất nhiều vào du lịch, đặc biệt là trong mùa cao điểm.', '{\"en\": \"The local government invested in new hotels to promote international tourism in the coastal city.\", \"vi\": \"Chính quyền địa phương đã đầu tư vào các khách sạn mới để thúc đẩy du lịch quốc tế tại thành phố ven biển.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-ljspeech-7d8710ce.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-cori-7d8710ce.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tourism-7f01fc3a.webp', '[\"travel\", \"sightseeing\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"mass tourism\", \"meaning\": \"du lịch đại chúng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tourism industry\", \"meaning\": \"ngành công nghiệp du lịch\"}, {\"phrase\": \"promote tourism\", \"meaning\": \"thúc đẩy du lịch\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tourist\", \"note_vi\": \"tourist là khách du lịch (người), tourism là ngành du lịch.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"tour\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"tourist\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"touristic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-cori-7d8710ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-aru0-7d8710ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-aru5-7d8710ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-aru6-7d8710ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-aru10-7d8710ce.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-aru9-7