('f4d1d252-8c36-5ed1-9a22-2481a4a53c5d', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '1aae1a92-dcee-520d-88b3-43b345ff611f', '0eba3904-7194-5f16-b32f-92511d414a9c', 'weekday', '', 'B1', 'adverb', 'mỗi ngày trong tuần', 'occurring or done during the standard working days of the week.', 'The meeting will be held every weekday morning next week.', 'Cuộc họp sẽ được tổ chức vào mỗi sáng các ngày trong tuần tới.', '{\"en\": \"The commuter train service operates every weekday between 6:00 AM and 10:00 PM.\", \"vi\": \"Dịch vụ tàu điện đi lại hoạt động vào mỗi ngày trong tuần từ 6:00 sáng đến 10:00 tối.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weekday-ljspeech-4a4b1ab4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weekday-cori-4a4b1ab4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/weekday-ad90e55f.webp', '[\"workday\"]', '[\"weekend\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"every weekday\", \"meaning\": \"mỗi ngày trong tuần (T2-T6)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"weekday afternoon\", \"meaning\": \"buổi chiều các ngày trong tuần\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"weekend\", \"note_vi\": \"Các ngày cuối tuần (thứ 7 và Chủ nhật).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"weekday\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weekday-cori-4a4b1ab4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weekday-aru0-4a4b1ab4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weekday-aru5-4a4b1ab4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weekday-aru6-4a4b1ab4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weekday-aru10-4a4b1ab4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weekday-aru9-4a4b1ab4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weekday-aru3-4a4b1ab4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weekday-aru7-4a4b1ab4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weekday-aru8-4a4b1ab4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weekday-aru2-4a4b1ab4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weekday-ljspeech-4a4b1ab4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weekday-lt408-4a4b1ab4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weekday-lt138-4a4b1ab4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weekday-lt624-4a4b1ab4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weekday-lt396-4a4b1ab4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weekday-lt498-4a4b1ab4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weekday-lt132-4a4b1ab4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weekday-lt288-4a4b1ab4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weekday-lt42-4a4b1ab4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weekday-lt90-4a4b1ab4.mp3\"]}}', 'Chỉ các ngày làm việc trong tuần từ thứ 2 đến thứ 6 (trừ thứ 7 và Chủ Nhật).', 'travel', 1, 25),
('008269db-1db5-5714-9715-8a95135f2ed0', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '1aae1a92-dcee-520d-88b3-43b345ff611f', '0eba3904-7194-5f16-b32f-92511d414a9c', 'put your feet up', '/pʊt jə fiːt ʌp/', 'B1', 'idiom', 'Nghỉ ngơi, thư giãn sau khi làm việc.', 'to sit back and relax, especially after a long period of hard work.', 'After a long day at work, all I want to do is go home and put my feet up.', 'Sau một ngày dài làm việc, tất cả những gì tôi muốn làm là về nhà và thư giãn.', '{\"en\": \"After completing the major project, the manager told the team to put their feet up.\", \"vi\": \"Sau khi hoàn thành dự án lớn, người quản lý bảo cả đội hãy nghỉ ngơi thư giãn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-your-feet-up-ljspeech-2a2ab38d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-your-feet-up-cori-2a2ab38d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/put-your-feet-up-a1fbc311.webp', '[\"relax\", \"unwind\", \"rest\"]', '[\"work hard\", \"toil\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-your-feet-up-cori-2a2ab38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-your-feet-up-aru0-2a2ab38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-your-feet-up-aru5-2a2ab38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-your-feet-up-aru6-2a2ab38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-your-feet-up-aru10-2a2ab38d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-your-feet-up-aru9-2a2ab38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-your-feet-up-aru3-2a2ab38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-your-feet-up-aru7-2a2ab38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-your-feet-up-aru8-2a2ab38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-your-feet-up-aru2-2a2ab38d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-your-feet-up-ljspeech-2a2ab38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-your-feet-up-lt408-2a2ab38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-your-feet-up-lt138-2a2ab38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-your-feet-up-lt624-2a2ab38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-your-feet-up-lt396-2a2ab38d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-your-feet-up-lt498-2a2ab38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-your-feet-up-lt132-2a2ab38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-your-feet-up-lt288-2a2ab38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-your-feet-up-lt42-2a2ab38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-your-feet-up-lt90-2a2ab38d.mp3\"]}}', 'Thành ngữ này mang nghĩa đen là gác chân lên, nghĩa bóng là nghỉ ngơi, thư giãn.', 'office', 1, 26),
('32b118c9-c452-5dad-8ace-4a88ae73a85c', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '1aae1a92-dcee-520d-88b3-43b345ff611f', '0eba3904-7194-5f16-b32f-92511d414a9c', 'tense', '/tɛns/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy lo lắng, hồi hộp hoặc không thoải mái; tình hình căng thẳng.', 'feeling nervous, worried, and not able to relax because of what might happen.', 'Negotiations between the two companies remained tense throughout the entire afternoon session.', 'Các cuộc đàm phán giữa hai công ty vẫn căng thẳng trong suốt phiên họp chiều.', '{\"en\": \"The negotiations between the two companies became very tense when discussing the final contract price.\", \"vi\": \"Các cuộc đàm phán giữa hai công ty trở nên rất căng thẳng khi thảo luận về giá hợp đồng cuối cùng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-ljspeech-5d8798fd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-cori-5d8798fd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tense-f76ff1bd.webp', '[\"nervous\", \"anxious\", \"stressed\"]', '[\"relaxed\", \"calm\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"tense atmosphere\", \"meaning\": \"bầu không khí căng thẳng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tense situation\", \"meaning\": \"tình huống căng thẳng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"intense\", \"note_vi\": \"intense là mãnh liệt/dữ dội, tense là căng thẳng/lo âu.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"tension\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"tensely\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-cori-5d8798fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-aru0-5d8798fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-aru5-5d8798fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-aru6-5d8798fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-aru10-5d8798fd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-aru9-5d8798fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-aru3-5d8798fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obje