('33c27d86-3f59-5123-8aaa-ee15e893ebc9', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '49a0f496-645a-5b44-94da-1264c7d8dbdb', '84b5e1b4-e6e0-5c15-88d9-0e751febd332', 'shopping center', '/ˈʃɒpɪŋ ˈsentə/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Khu phức hợp lớn có nhiều cửa hàng, nhà hàng.', 'a complex featuring numerous retail establishments and restaurants connected by shared walkways.', 'We spent the whole afternoon at the new shopping center looking for clothes.', 'Chúng tôi đã dành cả buổi chiều ở trung tâm mua sắm mới để tìm quần áo.', '{\"en\": \"The new shopping center will open next month with many international fashion brands inside.\", \"vi\": \"Trung tâm mua sắm mới sẽ mở cửa vào tháng tới với nhiều thương hiệu thời trang quốc tế bên trong.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-center-ljspeech-cd3ffbdb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-center-cori-cd3ffbdb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shopping-center-b268f3df.webp', '[\"mall\", \"plaza\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"visit a shopping center\", \"meaning\": \"ghé thăm trung tâm mua sắm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"shopping center parking\", \"meaning\": \"bãi đỗ xe trung tâm mua sắm\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-center-cori-cd3ffbdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-center-aru0-cd3ffbdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-center-aru5-cd3ffbdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-center-aru6-cd3ffbdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-center-aru10-cd3ffbdb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-center-aru9-cd3ffbdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-center-aru3-cd3ffbdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-center-aru7-cd3ffbdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-center-aru8-cd3ffbdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-center-aru2-cd3ffbdb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-center-ljspeech-cd3ffbdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-center-lt408-cd3ffbdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-center-lt138-cd3ffbdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-center-lt624-cd3ffbdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-center-lt396-cd3ffbdb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-center-lt498-cd3ffbdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-center-lt132-cd3ffbdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-center-lt288-cd3ffbdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-center-lt42-cd3ffbdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-center-lt90-cd3ffbdb.mp3\"]}}', 'Center (Mỹ) và Centre (Anh) đều đúng, nhưng Center phổ biến hơn trong TOEIC.', 'shopping', 1, 15),
('f017a618-bd79-5383-9e91-759efb005908', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '49a0f496-645a-5b44-94da-1264c7d8dbdb', '84b5e1b4-e6e0-5c15-88d9-0e751febd332', 'a few', '/ə fjuː/', 'A1', 'determiner', 'Một số lượng nhỏ, không nhiều.', 'a small number of people or things, used with countable nouns.', 'There are only a few apples left in the basket, so we should buy more.', 'Chỉ còn lại vài quả táo trong giỏ, nên chúng ta nên mua thêm.', '{\"en\": \"The supervisor asked for a few volunteers to help set up the presentation equipment.\", \"vi\": \"Người giám sát đã xin một vài tình nguyện viên giúp lắp đặt thiết bị thuyết trình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-few-ljspeech-58455a44.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-few-cori-58455a44.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/a-few-b7e7ac23.webp', '[\"several\", \"some\"]', '[\"many\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"quite a few\", \"meaning\": \"khá nhiều\"}, {\"phrase\": \"a few more\", \"meaning\": \"thêm một vài\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"few\", \"note_vi\": \"a few mang nghĩa tích cực (có một ít); few mang nghĩa tiêu cực (gần như không có).\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-few-cori-58455a44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-few-aru0-58455a44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-few-aru5-58455a44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-few-aru6-58455a44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-few-aru10-58455a44.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-few-aru9-58455a44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-few-aru3-58455a44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-few-aru7-58455a44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-few-aru8-58455a44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-few-aru2-58455a44.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunci