('322ff532-dd13-57f3-8f44-4019735e93c2', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '4f6427ef-ae34-52d6-b80e-0d5b2c3d5ff4', 'b5de1ce9-2347-5f1b-98c7-612b8eae7123', 'vacation', 'UK: /vəˈkeɪʃn/ | US: /veɪˈkeɪʃn/', 'A2', 'noun', 'kỳ nghỉ', 'a period spent away from home or work in order to relax or travel.', 'I am planning my summer vacation to the beach.', 'Tôi đang lên kế hoạch cho kỳ nghỉ hè ở bãi biển.', '{\"en\": \"Employees must submit their vacation requests to human resources at least two weeks in advance.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phải nộp yêu cầu nghỉ phép cho bộ phận nhân sự trước ít nhất hai tuần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacation-ljspeech-18c0f103.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacation-cori-18c0f103.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/vacation-8faeb882.webp', '[\"holiday\", \"leave\", \"break\"]', '[\"workday\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"paid vacation\", \"meaning\": \"kỳ nghỉ hưởng lương\"}, {\"phrase\": \"vacation policy\", \"meaning\": \"chính sách nghỉ phép\"}, {\"phrase\": \"take a vacation\", \"meaning\": \"đi nghỉ mát\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"vocation\", \"note_vi\": \"\'vocation\' là nghề nghiệp/thiên chức, dễ nhầm chính tả với \'vacation\' (kỳ nghỉ).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"vacation\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"vacationer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacation-cori-18c0f103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacation-aru0-18c0f103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacation-aru5-18c0f103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacation-aru6-18c0f103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacation-aru10-18c0f103.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacation-aru9-18c0f103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacation-aru3-18c0f103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacation-aru7-18c0f103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacation-aru8-18c0f103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacation-aru2-18c0f103.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacation-ljspeech-18c0f103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacation-lt408-18c0f103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacation-lt138-18c0f103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacation-lt624-18c0f103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacation-lt396-18c0f103.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacation-lt498-18c0f103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacation-lt132-18c0f103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacation-lt288-18c0f103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacation-lt42-18c0f103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacation-lt90-18c0f103.mp3\"]}}', 'Tiếng Anh Mỹ dùng \'vacation\', tiếng Anh Anh hay dùng \'holiday\'. Cụm \'take a vacation\' nghĩa là đi nghỉ mát.', 'personnel', 1, 12),
('db382578-f0d8-5ae5-86e9-3fa126585b82', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '4f6427ef-ae34-52d6-b80e-0d5b2c3d5ff4', 'b5de1ce9-2347-5f1b-98c7-612b8eae7123', 'snowflake', '/ˈsnəʊfleɪk/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một tinh thể băng nhỏ có hình dạng độc đáo, rơi từ trên trời xuống.', 'a small soft white piece of frozen water that falls from the sky.', 'The child landed a single delicate snowflake on her dark winter glove.', 'Đứa trẻ đã hứng được một bông tuyết tinh xảo duy nhất trên chiếc găng tay mùa đông sẫm màu của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The winter resort expects a heavy snowfall, but not a single snowflake has fallen yet.\", \"vi\": \"Khu nghỉ dưỡng mùa đông mong đợi tuyết rơi dày, nhưng chưa có một bông tuyết nào rơi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snowflake-ljspeech-b0c5516f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snowflake-cori-b0c5516f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/snowflake-feb18681.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"individual snowflake\", \"meaning\": \"từng bông tuyết riêng lẻ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"snowflake pattern\", \"meaning\": \"họa tiết bông tuyết\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snowflake-cori-b0c5516f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snowflake-aru0-b0c5516f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snowflake-aru5-b0c5516f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snowflake-aru6-b0c5516f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snowflake-aru10-b0c5516f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snowflake-aru9-b0c5516f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snowflake-aru3-b0c5516f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snowflake-aru7-b0c5516f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snowflake-aru8-b0c5516f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snowflake-aru2-b0c5516f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storag