('f7911a91-8bdf-5f14-b146-2573cf40fc9e', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '65d9365f-51b8-5126-a5aa-7c25b22abc72', '27e9097a-97e5-5ba2-a361-99cbacde842f', 'tanned', '/tænd/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có làn da sẫm màu hơn do tiếp xúc với ánh nắng mặt trời.', 'having brown skin because of spending a lot of time in the bright sunlight.', 'The construction worker returned from his summer break with noticeably tanned arms.', 'Người công nhân xây dựng trở lại sau kỳ nghỉ hè với cánh tay rám nắng thấy rõ.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel staff looked healthy and tanned after working outdoors during the summer season.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên khách sạn trông khỏe mạnh và có làn da rám nắng sau khi làm việc ngoài trời suốt mùa hè.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tanned-ljspeech-77e27f52.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tanned-cori-77e27f52.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tanned-eaac9b74.webp', '[\"bronzed\", \"sunburnt\"]', '[\"pale\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"deeply tanned\", \"meaning\": \"da rám nắng đậm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"get tanned\", \"meaning\": \"trở nên rám nắng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sunburnt\", \"note_vi\": \"Sunburnt là bị cháy nắng (đau rát), tanned là rám nắng (khỏe mạnh).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"tan\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tanned-cori-77e27f52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tanned-aru0-77e27f52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tanned-aru5-77e27f52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tanned-aru6-77e27f52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tanned-aru10-77e27f52.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tanned-aru9-77e27f52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tanned-aru3-77e27f52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tanned-aru7-77e27f52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tanned-aru8-77e27f52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tanned-aru2-77e27f52.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tanned-ljspeech-77e27f52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tanned-lt408-77e27f52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tanned-lt138-77e27f52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tanned-lt624-77e27f52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tanned-lt396-77e27f52.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tanned-lt498-77e27f52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tanned-lt132-77e27f52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tanned-lt288-77e27f52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tanned-lt42-77e27f52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tanned-lt90-77e27f52.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để mô tả ngoại hình sau kỳ nghỉ.', 'daily', 1, 5),
('70d56aa5-a365-58e2-8078-1140740b48df', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '65d9365f-51b8-5126-a5aa-7c25b22abc72', '27e9097a-97e5-5ba2-a361-99cbacde842f', 'apprehensive', '/ˌæprɪˈhɛnsɪv/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy lo lắng hoặc sợ hãi về điều gì đó sắp xảy ra.', 'feeling worried or nervous about something that you are going to do in the future.', 'Employees were apprehensive about adopting the new management software across all departments.', 'Nhân viên cảm thấy lo lắng về việc áp dụng phần mềm quản lý mới trên tất cả các phòng ban.', '{\"en\": \"Many candidates felt apprehensive before the final round of the difficult management recruitment process.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiều ứng viên cảm thấy lo lắng trước vòng cuối của quy trình tuyển dụng quản lý khó khăn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apprehensive-ljspeech-b3d43e4a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apprehensive-cori-b3d43e4a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/apprehensive-b686de3c.webp', '[\"anxious\", \"worried\"]', '[\"confident\", \"calm\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel apprehensive\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy e sợ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"apprehensive about\", \"meaning\": \"lo lắng về\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"apprehension\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apprehensive-cori-b3d43e4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apprehensive-aru0-b3d43e4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apprehensive-aru5-b3d43e4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apprehensive-aru6-b3d43e4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apprehensive-aru10-b3d43e4a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apprehensive-aru9-b3d43e4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apprehensive-aru3-b3d43e4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apprehensive-aru7-b3d43e4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apprehensive-aru8-b3d43e4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apprehensive-aru2-b3d43e4a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apprehensive-ljspeech-b3d43e4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apprehensive-lt408-b3d43e4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apprehensive-lt138-b3d43e4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apprehensive-lt624-b3d43e4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apprehensive-lt396-b3d43e4a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apprehensive-lt498-b3d43e4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apprehensive-lt132-b3d43e4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apprehensive-lt288-b3d43e4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apprehensive-lt42-b3d43e4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apprehensive-lt90-b3d43e4a.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để chỉ sự lo lắng về một sự kiện sắp tới.', 'hr', 1, 6),
('5651e0b4-0cda-54f8-9476-730138bc20b7', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '65d9365f-51b8-5126-a5aa-7c25b22abc72', '27e9097a-97e5-5ba2-a361-99cbacde842f', 'have breakfast', '/hæv ˈbrekfəst/', 'A1', 'phrase', 'Ăn bữa ăn đầu tiên trong ngày.', 'To consume food during the morning hours shortly after waking up.', 'I usually have breakfast at 7 AM before going to work.', 'Tôi thường ăn sáng lúc 7 giờ sáng trước khi đi làm.', '{\"en\": \"Guests at the hotel can have breakfast in the dining room from six to ten every morning.\", \"vi\": \"Khách tại khách sạn có thể ăn sáng tại phòng ăn từ sáu đến mười giờ mỗi ngày.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-ljspeech-0d53ea02.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-cori-0d53ea02.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/have-breakfast-480b1a40.webp', '[\"eat breakfast\", \"grab breakfast\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"have breakfast at\", \"meaning\": \"ăn sáng tại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"have breakfast together\", \"meaning\": \"ăn sáng cùng nhau\"}, {\"phrase\": \"have a working breakfast\", \"meaning\": \"ăn sáng kết hợp làm việc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"have lunch / have dinner\", \"note_vi\": \"Cấu trúc tương tự: \'have lunch\' (ăn trưa), \'have dinner\' (ăn tối), không dùng \'eat a breakfast\'.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-cori-0d53ea02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-aru0-0d53ea02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-aru5-0d53ea02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-aru6-0d53ea02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-aru10-0d53ea02.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-aru9-0d53ea02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-aru3-0d53ea02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-aru7-0d53ea02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-aru8-0d53ea02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-aru2-0d53ea02.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-ljspeech-0d53ea02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-lt408-0d53ea02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-lt138-0d53ea02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-lt624-0d53ea02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-lt396-0d53ea02.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-lt498-0d53ea02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-lt132-0d53ea02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-lt288-0d53ea02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-lt42-0d53ea02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-lt90-0d53ea02.mp3\"]}}', 'Không dùng mạo từ \'a\' trước breakfast trong cụm này: \'have breakfast\', không phải \'have a breakfast\'.', 'dining', 1, 7),
('ab9799cf-4532-527e-97a4-d19d6e4c6d49', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '65d9365f-51b8-5126-a5aa-7c25b22abc72', '27e9097a-97e5-5ba2-a361-99cbacde842f', 'nervous', '/ˈnɜːvəs/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy lo lắng, căng thẳng hoặc sợ hãi về điều gì đó.', 'Being apprehensive or uneasy about an upcoming situation or potential event.', 'The young manager felt nervous right before giving his first quarterly presentation.', 'Vị quản lý trẻ cảm thấy lo lắng ngay trước khi thực hiện bài thuyết trình quý đầu tiên của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The job applicant felt nervous right before entering the interview room to meet executives.\", \"vi\": \"Ứng viên xin việc cảm thấy hồi hộp ngay trước khi vào phòng phỏng vấn để gặp các quản lý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nervous-ljspeech-e159bc52.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nervous-cori-e159bc52.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/nervous-21d5c82b.webp', '[\"anxious\", \"apprehensive\", \"uneasy\"]', '[\"calm\", \"confident\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel nervous\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy lo lắng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"nervous system\", \"meaning\": \"hệ thần kinh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"anxious\", \"note_vi\": \"anxious thể hiện mức độ lo lắng mạnh hơn nervous.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"nerve\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"nervously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nervous-cori-e159bc52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nervous-aru0-e159bc52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nervous-aru5-e159bc52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nervous-aru6-e159bc52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nervous-aru10-e159bc52.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nervous-aru9-e159bc52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nervous-aru3-e159bc52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/