('9c9bf8b4-9f97-5db3-acfd-a7b46c02a867', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '65d9365f-51b8-5126-a5aa-7c25b22abc72', '27e9097a-97e5-5ba2-a361-99cbacde842f', 'trash', 'UK: /træʃ/ | US: /træʃ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'rác, đồ bỏ đi', 'waste material or things that are no longer wanted and have been thrown away.', 'Please put all the trash in the bin.', 'Vui lòng bỏ tất cả rác vào thùng.', '{\"en\": \"Please ensure all office trash is disposed of in the recycling bins provided on each floor.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đảm bảo toàn bộ rác văn phòng được vứt đúng vào các thùng tái chế có sẵn ở mỗi tầng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trash-ljspeech-6aa46034.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trash-cori-6aa46034.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/trash-40976722.webp', '[\"garbage\", \"rubbish\", \"waste\", \"litter\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"trash can\", \"meaning\": \"thùng rác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dispose of trash\", \"meaning\": \"vứt rác / xử lý rác\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"thrash\", \"note_vi\": \"Thrash nghĩa là đánh đập hoặc đập xối xả, khác với trash (rác).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"trash\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trash-cori-6aa46034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trash-aru0-6aa46034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trash-aru5-6aa46034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trash-aru6-6aa46034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trash-aru10-6aa46034.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trash-aru9-6aa46034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trash-aru3-6aa46034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trash-aru7-6aa46034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trash-aru8-6aa46034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trash-aru2-6aa46034.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trash-ljspeech-6aa46034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trash-lt408-6aa46034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trash-lt138-6aa46034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trash-lt624-6aa46034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trash-lt396-6aa46034.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trash-lt498-6aa46034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trash-lt132-6aa46034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trash-lt288-6aa46034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trash-lt42-6aa46034.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trash-lt90-6aa46034.mp3\"]}}', '\'Trash\' thường dùng trong Anh-Mỹ (US), tương đương với \'rubbish\' hoặc \'litter\' trong Anh-Anh.', 'office', 1, 18),
('2fe1bb8d-89ce-5dc1-bed6-73242b15b52a', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '65d9365f-51b8-5126-a5aa-7c25b22abc72', '27e9097a-97e5-5ba2-a361-99cbacde842f', 'freckle', '/ˈfrekl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Đốm nhỏ màu nâu trên da, thường do nắng.', 'a small brown spot on the skin, often from sun.', 'Sun exposure caused a small freckle to appear near his left eye.', 'Việc tiếp xúc với ánh nắng khiến một nốt tàn nhang nhỏ xuất hiện gần mắt trái của anh ấy.', '{\"en\": \"The model\'s freckle was highlighted in the skincare product ad.\", \"vi\": \"Tàn nhang của người mẫu được làm nổi bật trong quảng cáo mỹ phẩm da.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-ljspeech-c2307d67.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-cori-c2307d67.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/freckle-93f9e35f.webp', '[\"spot\", \"speckle\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"have a freckle\", \"meaning\": \"có tàn nhang\"}, {\"phrase\": \"freckle face\", \"meaning\": \"mặt tàn nhang\"}, {\"phrase\": \"remove freckle\", \"meaning\": \"tẩy tàn nhang\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"wrinkle\", \"note_vi\": \"wrinkle là nếp nhăn, freckle là đốm nâu trên da\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"freckled\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-cori-c2307d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-aru0-c2307d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-aru5-c2307d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-aru6-c2307d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-aru10-c2307d67.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-aru9-c2307d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-aru3-c2307d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-aru7-c2307d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-aru8-c2307d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-aru2-c2307d67.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-ljspeech-c2307d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-lt408-c2307d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-lt138-c2307d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-lt624-c2307d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-lt396-c2307d67.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-lt498-c2307d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-lt132-c2307d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-lt288-c2307d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-lt42-c2307d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-lt90-c2307d67.mp3\"]}}', 'Người Việt hay gọi freckle là tàn nhang, không phải nốt ruồi.', 'health', 1, 19),
('57c074d4-f3fb-5438-977f-b4b570f8ec75', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '65d9365f-51b8-5126-a5aa-7c25b22abc72', '27e9097a-97e5-5ba2-a361-99cbacde842f', 'roller skate', '/rəʊlə skeɪt/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Di chuyển bằng giày trượt có bánh xe.', 'to move on shoes with small wheels attached to the bottom.', 'My sister loves to roller skate in the park on weekends.', 'Chị gái tôi rất thích trượt pa tin trong công viên vào cuối tuần.', '{\"en\": \"The company organized a team-building event where employees could roller skate together.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã tổ chức một sự kiện xây dựng đội ngũ nơi các nhân viên có thể cùng nhau trượt pa tin.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roller-skate-ljspeech-fe14d199.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roller-skate-cori-fe14d199.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/roller-skate-333efbf0.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"roller skate rink\", \"meaning\": \"sân trượt pa tin\"}, {\"phrase\": \"go roller skating\", \"meaning\": \"đi trượt pa tin\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"ice skate\", \"note_vi\": \"trượt băng bằng giày có lưỡi kim loại\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"roller skates\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roller-skate-cori-fe14d199.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roller-skate-aru0-fe14d199.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roller-skate-aru5-fe14d199.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roller-skate-aru6-fe14d199.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roller-skate-aru10-fe14d199.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roller-skate-aru9-fe14d199.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roller-skate-aru3-fe14d199.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roller-skate-aru7-fe14d199.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roller-skate-aru8-fe14d199.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pub