('401500a2-00cc-522c-a7ec-a747de2845aa', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '97163e18-b665-54bb-8433-2f7425766c66', '773d8804-4ab3-5754-ba3f-fa1378ae626a', 'rain', '/reɪn/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Nước rơi từ mây xuống mặt đất dưới dạng giọt.', 'water that falls from the sky in small drops during wet weather conditions.', 'We had to cancel our picnic because of the heavy rain all afternoon.', 'Chúng tôi phải hủy buổi dã ngoại vì trời mưa lớn suốt buổi chiều.', '{\"en\": \"Heavy rain caused a delay in the delivery of our office supplies this morning.\", \"vi\": \"Cơn mưa lớn đã gây ra sự chậm trễ trong việc giao văn phòng phẩm sáng nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rain-ljspeech-fbec17cb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rain-cori-fbec17cb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rain-2d6a44e9.webp', '[\"downpour\", \"precipitation\"]', '[\"drought\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"heavy rain\", \"meaning\": \"mưa lớn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rain shower\", \"meaning\": \"trận mưa rào\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"reign\", \"note_vi\": \"reign là trị vì, rain là mưa.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"rainy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rain-cori-fbec17cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rain-aru0-fbec17cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rain-aru5-fbec17cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rain-aru6-fbec17cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rain-aru10-fbec17cb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rain-aru9-fbec17cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rain-aru3-fbec17cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rain-aru7-fbec17cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rain-aru8-fbec17cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rain-aru2-fbec17cb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronuncia