('2cded861-f00e-5db2-ab7b-13a09fb2052d', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '97163e18-b665-54bb-8433-2f7425766c66', '773d8804-4ab3-5754-ba3f-fa1378ae626a', 'ringtone', '/ˈrɪŋtəʊn/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Âm thanh phát ra từ điện thoại khi có cuộc gọi đến.', 'the sound that a telephone makes when someone is calling it.', 'I changed my phone\'s ringtone to my favorite song.', 'Tôi đã đổi nhạc chuông điện thoại thành bài hát yêu thích của mình.', '{\"en\": \"Please turn off your mobile phone ringtone before entering the conference room.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng tắt nhạc chuông điện thoại di động trước khi vào phòng hội nghị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ringtone-ljspeech-bd504e9a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ringtone-cori-bd504e9a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ringtone-8cdd2eba.webp', '[\"ring\", \"call tone\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"default ringtone\", \"meaning\": \"nhạc chuông mặc định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"set a ringtone\", \"meaning\": \"cài đặt nhạc chuông\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"alarm\", \"note_vi\": \"alarm là chuông báo thức hoặc chuông cảnh báo\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ringtone-cori-bd504e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ringtone-aru0-bd504e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ringtone-aru5-bd504e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ringtone-aru6-bd504e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ringtone-aru10-bd504e9a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ringtone-aru9-bd504e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ringtone-aru3-bd504e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ringtone-aru7-bd504e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ringtone-aru8-bd504e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ringtone-aru2-bd504e9a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ringtone-ljspeech-bd504e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ringtone-lt408-bd504e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ringtone-lt138-bd504e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ringtone-lt624-bd504e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ringtone-lt396-bd504e9a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ringtone-lt498-bd504e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ringtone-lt132-bd504e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ringtone-lt288-bd504e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ringtone-lt42-bd504e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ringtone-lt90-bd504e9a.mp3\"]}}', 'Ringtone là danh từ ghép viết liền, chỉ âm thanh báo cuộc gọi đến.', 'office', 1, 5),
('0e142786-87c4-5284-ad8c-01372a66e2c2', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '97163e18-b665-54bb-8433-2f7425766c66', '773d8804-4ab3-5754-ba3f-fa1378ae626a', 'happy', '/ˈhæpɪ/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy vui vẻ, hài lòng hoặc hạnh phúc.', 'feeling or showing pleasure, contentment, or joy about something good.', 'The clients were very happy with the final outcome of the project.', 'Các khách hàng đã rất vui mừng với kết quả cuối cùng của dự án.', '{\"en\": \"The clients were very happy with the prompt service provided by our support team.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng rất hài lòng và vui vẻ với dịch vụ nhanh chóng do đội ngũ hỗ trợ của chúng tôi cung cấp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-ljspeech-3978d009.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-cori-3978d009.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/happy-28ec22f7.webp', '[\"glad\", \"cheerful\", \"delighted\"]', '[\"sad\", \"unhappy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"happy to help\", \"meaning\": \"sẵn lòng giúp đỡ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"feel happy\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy hạnh phúc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pleased\", \"note_vi\": \"pleased mang nghĩa hài lòng với một kết quả cụ thể hơn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"happiness\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"happily\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-cori-3978d009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-aru0-3978d009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-aru5-3978d009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-aru6-3978d009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-aru10-3978d009.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-aru9-3978d009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-aru3-3978d009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-aru7-3978d009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-aru8-3978d009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-aru2-3978d009.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-ljspeech-3978d009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-lt408-3978d009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-lt138-3978d009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-lt624-3978d009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-lt396-3978d009.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-lt498-3978d009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-lt132-3978d009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-lt288-3978d009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-lt42-3978d009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-lt90-3978d009.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong văn phong công sở, happy thường đi với cấu trúc \'happy to do something\'.', 'office', 1, 6)
