('b02a7282-ac27-5387-9378-d7986aa3cb35', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '97163e18-b665-54bb-8433-2f7425766c66', '773d8804-4ab3-5754-ba3f-fa1378ae626a', 'shower', '/ʃaʊə/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một trận mưa nhỏ và ngắn.', 'a short period of rain or snow that is usually light and quick.', 'The outdoor afternoon concert was postponed temporarily because of an unexpected rain shower.', 'Buổi hòa nhạc ngoài trời vào chiều đã bị hoãn tạm thời vì một trận mưa rào bất ngờ.', '{\"en\": \"The outdoor corporate event was moved inside because of a sudden heavy rain shower.\", \"vi\": \"Sự kiện ngoài trời của công ty đã được chuyển vào trong vì một trận mưa rào lớn bất ngờ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shower-ljspeech-80136de8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shower-cori-80136de8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shower-ec71b038.webp', '[\"rain\", \"downpour\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"light shower\", \"meaning\": \"mưa rào nhẹ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"heavy shower\", \"meaning\": \"mưa rào nặng hạt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"storm\", \"note_vi\": \"bão, có gió mạnh và sấm sét, dữ dội hơn shower\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"shower\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shower-cori-80136de8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shower-aru0-80136de8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shower-aru5-80136de8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shower-aru6-80136de8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shower-aru10-80136de8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shower-aru9-80136de8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shower-aru3-80136de8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shower-aru7-80136de8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shower-aru8-80136de8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shower-aru2-80136de8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shower-ljspeech-80136de8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shower-lt408-80136de8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shower-lt138-80136de8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shower-lt624-80136de8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shower-lt396-80136de8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shower-lt498-80136de8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shower-lt132-80136de8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shower-lt288-80136de8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shower-lt42-80136de8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shower-lt90-80136de8.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài nghĩa mưa rào, nó còn có nghĩa là vòi hoa sen hoặc việc tắm rửa.', 'nature', 1, 7),
('2138e171-2099-559c-8e73-d00fe64491cb', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '97163e18-b665-54bb-8433-2f7425766c66', '773d8804-4ab3-5754-ba3f-fa1378ae626a', 'wage', 'UK: /weɪdʒ/ | US: /weɪdʒ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'tiền lương (thường trả theo giờ hoặc ngày)', 'a regular payment earned for work performed, typically calculated on an hourly or daily basis.', 'The company offered competitive wages to attract skilled workers.', 'Công ty đã đưa ra mức lương cạnh tranh để thu hút lao động lành nghề.', '{\"en\": \"The logistics firm agreed to raise the hourly wage for all warehouse operatives starting next month.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty hậu cần đã đồng ý tăng lương theo giờ cho tất cả nhân viên kho bắt đầu từ tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wage-ljspeech-2bf5eebc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wage-cori-2bf5eebc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/wage-f9c97bee.webp', '[\"pay\", \"earnings\", \"remuneration\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"hourly wage\", \"meaning\": \"tiền lương theo giờ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"minimum wage\", \"meaning\": \"mức lương tối thiểu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"salary\", \"note_vi\": \"Wage là lương trả theo giờ hoặc ngày cho lao động chân tay/ngắn hạn, còn salary là lương cố định hàng tháng cho nhân viên văn phòng.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wage-cori-2bf5eebc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wage-aru0-2bf5eebc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wage-aru5-2bf5eebc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wage-aru6-2bf5eebc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wage-aru10-2bf5eebc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wage-aru9-2bf5eebc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wage-aru3-2bf5eebc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wage-aru7-2bf5eebc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wage-aru8-2bf5eebc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wage-aru2-2bf5eebc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wage-ljspeech-2bf5eebc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wage-lt408-2bf5eebc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wage-lt138-2bf5eebc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wage-lt624-2bf5eebc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wage-lt396-2bf5eebc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wage-lt498-2bf5eebc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wage-lt132-2bf5eebc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wage-lt288-2bf5eebc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wage-lt42-2bf5eebc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wage-lt90-2bf5eebc.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt với \'salary\': \'wage\' là lương tính theo giờ/ngày/tuần (cho công nhân, lao động thời vụ), \'salary\' là lương cố định hàng tháng/năm.', 'finance', 1, 8),
('2ea3016f-664f-56a2-bfc1-541c27e44f3b', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '97163e18-b665-54bb-8433-2f7425766c66', '773d8804-4ab3-5754-ba3f-fa1378ae626a', 'fishing', '/ˈfɪʃɪŋ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Hoạt động bắt cá bằng cần câu hoặc lưới.', 'the activity of catching fish for food, sport, or as a commercial business.', 'They spent the whole afternoon fishing near the old wooden pier.', 'Họ đã dành cả buổi chiều để câu cá gần cầu cảng gỗ cũ.', '{\"en\": \"The local fishing industry has grown significantly due to the new export regulations this year.\", \"vi\": \"Ngành công nghiệp đánh bắt cá địa phương đã tăng trưởng đáng kể nhờ các quy định xuất khẩu mới năm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fishing-ljspeech-eab0f0d6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fishing-cori-eab0f0d6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fishing-cd3df8fd.webp', '[\"angling\", \"fishery\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fishing industry\", \"meaning\": \"ngành công nghiệp đánh bắt cá\"}, {\"phrase\": \"go fishing\", \"meaning\": \"đi câu cá\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"fish\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fisherman\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fishing-cori-eab0f0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fishing-aru0-eab0f0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fishing-aru5-eab0f0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fishing-aru6-eab0f0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fishing-aru10-eab0f0d6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fishing-aru9-eab0f0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fishing-aru3-eab0f0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fishing-aru7-eab0f0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fishing-aru8-eab0f0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fishing-aru2-eab0f0d6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fishing-ljspeech-eab0f0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fishing-lt408-eab0f0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fishing-lt138-eab0f0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fishing-lt624-eab0f0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fishing-lt396-eab0f0d6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fishing-lt498-eab0f0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fishing-lt132-eab0f0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fishing-lt288-eab0f0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fishing-lt42-eab0f0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fishing-lt90-eab0f0d6.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, thường xuất hiện trong ngữ cảnh ngành công nghiệp hoặc xuất khẩu.', 'business', 1, 9),
('2ded2b37-eed9-5be7-a9ab-2bd9e3d37e03', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '97163e18-b665-54bb-8433-2f7425766c66', '773d8804-4ab3-5754-ba3f-fa1378ae626a', 'football', '/ˈfʊtbɔːl/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Môn thể thao dùng chân đá bóng vào khung thành.', 'a game played by two teams who try to kick a ball into a goal.', 'Millions of people around the world enjoy watching football.', 'Hàng triệu người trên thế giới thích xem bóng đá.', '{\"en\": \"The company sponsored a local football match to promote team building among the staff members.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã tài trợ một trận bóng đá địa phương để thúc đẩy tinh thần đồng đội giữa các nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/football-ljspeech-2d27b62c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/football-cori-2d27b62c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/football-4010a0ef.webp', '[\"soccer\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"play football\", \"meaning\": \"chơi bóng đá\"}, {\"phrase\": \"football match\", \"meaning\": \"trận bóng đá\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/football-cori-2d27b62c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/football-aru0-2d27b62c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/football-aru5-2d27b62c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/football-aru6-2d27b62c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/football-aru10-2d27b62c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/football-aru9-2d27b62c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/football-aru3-2d27b62c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/football-aru7-2d27b62c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/football-aru8-2d27b62c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/football-aru2-2d27b62c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/football-ljspeech-2d27b62c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/football-lt408-2d27b62c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/football-lt138-2d27b62c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/football-lt624-2d27b62c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/football-lt396-2d27b62c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/football-lt498-2d27b62c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/football-lt132-2d27b62c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/football-lt288-2d27b62c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/football-lt42-2d27b62c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/football-lt90-2d27b62c.mp3\"]}}', 'ở Mỹ gọi là soccer, ở Anh và quốc tế gọi là football.', 'daily', 1, 10),
('eaf8c805-31ca-54cc-b040-881c777ada39', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '97163e18-b665-54bb-8433-2f7425766c66', '773d8804-4ab3-5754-ba3f-fa1378ae626a', 'blustery', '/ˈblʌstəri/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có gió mạnh và thổi từng cơn.', 'characterized by strong wind and noisy blowing of air outside.', 'It was a blustery day, so we decided to stay indoors.', 'Đó là một ngày gió dữ dội, vì vậy chúng tôi quyết định ở trong nhà.', '{\"en\": \"The blustery conditions delayed the outdoor product delivery at our warehouse today.\", \"vi\": \"Tình trạng gió dữ dội đã làm chậm việc giao hàng ngoài trời tại kho của chúng tôi hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blustery-ljspeech-55250fd0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blustery-cori-55250fd0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/blustery-dced5198.webp', '[\"windy\", \"gusty\"]', '[\"calm\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"blustery day\", \"meaning\": \"ngày gió dữ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"blustery weather\", \"meaning\": \"thời tiết gió dữ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"blustery wind\", \"meaning\": \"gió dữ dội\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bluster\", \"note_vi\": \"blustery là tính từ gió dữ, bluster là gắt gỏng hoặc gió.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"bluster\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"bluster\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blustery-cori-55250fd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blustery-aru0-55250fd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blustery-aru5-55250fd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blustery-aru6-55250fd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blustery-aru10-55250fd0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blustery-aru9-55250fd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blustery-aru3-55250fd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blustery-aru7-55250fd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blustery-aru8-55250fd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blustery-aru2-55250fd0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blustery-ljspeech-55250fd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blustery-lt408-55250fd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blustery-lt138-55250fd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blustery-lt624-55250fd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blustery-lt396-55250fd0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blustery-lt498-55250fd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blustery-lt132-55250fd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blustery-lt288-55250fd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blustery-lt42-55250fd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blustery-lt90-55250fd0.mp3\"]}}', 'Blustery chỉ thời tiết nhiều gió, không dùng cho người.', 'travel', 1, 11),
('4ded77b3-c41c-5b92-afa6-08d64aa55a16', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '97163e18-b665-54bb-8433-2f7425766c66', '773d8804-4ab3-5754-ba3f-fa1378ae626a', 'several', '/ˈsev.rəl/', 'A2', 'determiner', 'Một số lượng không xác định, nhưng nhiều hơn hai hoặc ba.', 'more than two or three but not very many in number.', 'I have several books on that topic if you\'d like to borrow them.', 'Tôi có vài cuốn sách về chủ đề đó nếu bạn muốn mượn.', '{\"en\": \"Several delegates asked questions after the keynote speaker finished her presentation on financial trends.\", \"vi\": \"Một vài đại biểu đã đặt câu hỏi sau khi diễn giả chính kết thúc bài thuyết trình về xu hướng tài chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/several-ljspeech-b2eea5ed.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/several-cori-b2eea5ed.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/several-34ee2c3b.webp', '[\"some\", \"a few\", \"a number of\"]', '[\"many\", \"few\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"several times\", \"meaning\": \"vài lần\"}, {\"phrase\": \"several options\", \"meaning\": \"vài sự lựa chọn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"a few\", \"note_vi\": \"several thường chỉ số lượng lớn hơn a few một chút (khoảng từ 3-5 trở lên).\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/several-cori-b2eea5ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/several-aru0-b2eea5ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/several-aru5-b2eea5ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/several-aru6-b2eea5ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/several-aru10-b2eea5ed.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/several-aru9-b2eea5ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/several-aru3-b2eea5ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/several-aru7-b2eea5ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/several-aru8-b2eea5ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/