('6849c68b-f622-5fb6-b333-e6a38090b2d5', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '97163e18-b665-54bb-8433-2f7425766c66', '773d8804-4ab3-5754-ba3f-fa1378ae626a', 'muscular', '/ˈmʌskjələ(r)/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có cơ bắp phát triển, khỏe mạnh.', 'having strong and well-developed body parts because of regular physical exercise or hard work.', 'The personal trainer demonstrated the exercise using his muscular arms.', 'Huấn luyện viên cá nhân đã thực hiện mẫu bài tập bằng đôi tay vạm vỡ của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The fitness trainer has a muscular physique, which inspires all the members at the gym.\", \"vi\": \"Huấn luyện viên thể hình có vóc dáng vạm vỡ, điều đó truyền cảm hứng cho các thành viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-ljspeech-fdec1044.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-cori-fdec1044.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/muscular-32cf80fd.webp', '[\"strong\", \"athletic\"]', '[\"weak\", \"frail\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"muscular build\", \"meaning\": \"cơ thể vạm vỡ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"muscular pain\", \"meaning\": \"đau cơ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"muscle\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-cori-fdec1044.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-aru0-fdec1044.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-aru5-fdec1044.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-aru6-fdec1044.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-aru10-fdec1044.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-aru9-fdec1044.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-aru3-fdec1044.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-aru7-fdec1044.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-aru8-fdec1044.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-aru2-fdec1044.mp3\"]}, \"us\":