('11c545dd-3040-5696-8583-7e8f15818d1a', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '97163e18-b665-54bb-8433-2f7425766c66', '773d8804-4ab3-5754-ba3f-fa1378ae626a', 'schedule', 'UK: /ˈʃedjuːl/ | US: /ˈskedʒuːl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'lịch trình, thời gian biểu', 'a plan that lists expected events, activities, or tasks along with their intended times.', 'Please check the meeting schedule.', 'Vui lòng kiểm tra lịch họp.', '{\"en\": \"The construction project is currently ahead of schedule thanks to favorable weather.\", \"vi\": \"Dự án xây dựng hiện đang vượt tiến độ nhờ thời tiết thuận lợi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-ljspeech-11e9ba26.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-cori-11e9ba26.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/schedule-b619bdcd.webp', '[\"timetable\", \"agenda\", \"itinerary\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"ahead of schedule\", \"meaning\": \"trước thời hạn / trước tiến độ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tight schedule\", \"meaning\": \"lịch trình dày đặc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"work schedule\", \"meaning\": \"lịch làm việc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"scheme\", \"note_vi\": \"scheme là kế hoạch/mưu đồ, trong khi schedule là lịch trình/thời gian biểu.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"schedule\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"scheduled\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-cori-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-aru0-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-aru5-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-aru6-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-aru10-11e9ba26.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-aru9-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-aru3-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-aru7-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-aru8-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-aru2-11e9ba26.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-ljspeech-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-lt408-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-lt138-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-lt624-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-lt396-11e9ba26.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-lt498-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-lt132-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-lt288-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-lt42-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-lt90-11e9ba26.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm TOEIC kinh điển với schedule: \'ahead of schedule\' (trước tiến độ), \'behind schedule\' (trễ tiến độ), \'on schedule\' (đúng tiến độ).', 'business management', 1, 22),
('137353a7-2d94-58fb-b347-942787832f31', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', '97163e18-b665-54bb-8433-2f7425766c66', '773d8804-4ab3-5754-ba3f-fa1378ae626a', 'get up', '/ɡɛt ʌp/', 'A1', 'phrasal verb', 'Ngủ dậy và rời khỏi giường.', 'to wake up and get out of bed in the morning to start your day.', 'The sales manager had to get up before dawn to catch his flight.', 'Giám đốc kinh doanh đã phải thức dậy trước khi bình minh để kịp chuyến bay.', '{\"en\": \"The factory supervisor has to get up very early to prepare for the morning production shift.\", \"vi\": \"Người giám sát nhà máy phải thức dậy rất sớm để chuẩn bị cho ca sản xuất buổi sáng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-up-ljspeech-3f2d515e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-up-cori-3f2d515e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/get-up-e9df008a.webp', '[\"wake up\", \"arise\"]', '[\"go to bed\", \"sleep\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"get up early\", \"meaning\": \"dậy sớm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"get up late\", \"meaning\": \"dậy muộn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"wake up\", \"note_vi\": \"wake up là mở mắt tỉnh giấc, get up là rời khỏi giường\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-up-cori-3f2d515e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-up-aru0-3f2d515e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-up-aru5-3f2d515e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-up-aru6-3f2d515e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-up-aru10-3f2d515e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-up-aru9-3f2d515e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-up-aru3-3f2d515e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-up-aru7-3f2d515e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-up-aru8-3f2d515e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-up-aru2-3f2d515e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/ob