('090774f0-dfb4-5f68-a2f0-e0bcfec06321', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'ab98a801-8c4c-58d1-81f0-96a238d4c90d', '814bb030-c3ef-5811-8a06-f86a37b3f3e3', 'skiing', '/ˈskiːɪŋ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Môn thể thao trượt trên tuyết bằng ván trượt.', 'the sport or activity of moving over snow on long flat pieces of wood or plastic.', 'We\'re planning a trip to the mountains for a week of skiing this winter.', 'Chúng tôi đang lên kế hoạch đi núi để trượt tuyết một tuần vào mùa đông này.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency offers special discounts on skiing packages during the winter season.\", \"vi\": \"Đại lý du lịch cung cấp các chương trình giảm giá đặc biệt cho các gói trượt tuyết vào mùa đông.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skiing-ljspeech-5ba72730.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skiing-cori-5ba72730.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/skiing-2c233bb1.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"go skiing\", \"meaning\": \"đi trượt tuyết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"skiing resort\", \"meaning\": \"khu nghỉ dưỡng trượt tuyết\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"ski\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"ski\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skiing-cori-5ba72730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skiing-aru0-5ba72730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skiing-aru5-5ba72730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skiing-aru6-5ba72730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skiing-aru10-5ba72730.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skiing-aru9-5ba72730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skiing-aru3-5ba72730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skiing-aru7-5ba72730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skiing-aru8-5ba72730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skiing-aru2-5ba72730.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storag