('b743778e-c460-507b-ae34-05f24afa79be', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'ab98a801-8c4c-58d1-81f0-96a238d4c90d', '814bb030-c3ef-5811-8a06-f86a37b3f3e3', 'windy', '/ˈwɪndi/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Có nhiều gió, gió thổi mạnh.', 'having a lot of strong moving air outside.', 'It was a very windy day, so we decided to fly a kite.', 'Đó là một ngày rất nhiều gió, nên chúng tôi quyết định thả diều.', '{\"en\": \"The outdoor corporate event was canceled because the weather became too cold and windy.\", \"vi\": \"Sự kiện ngoài trời của công ty đã bị hủy vì thời tiết trở nên quá lạnh và có gió lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/windy-ljspeech-45bf01a8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/windy-cori-45bf01a8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/windy-ea22e53e.webp', '[\"breezy\", \"gusty\"]', '[\"calm\", \"still\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"windy day\", \"meaning\": \"ngày lộng gió\"}, {\"phrase\": \"windy weather\", \"meaning\": \"thời tiết nhiều gió\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"wind\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"wind\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/windy-cori-45bf01a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/windy-aru0-45bf01a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/windy-aru5-45bf01a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/windy-aru6-45bf01a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/windy-aru10-45bf01a8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/windy-aru9-45bf01a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/windy-aru3-45bf01a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/windy-aru7-45bf01a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/windy-aru8-45bf01a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/windy-aru2-45bf01a8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/windy-ljspeech-45bf01a8.mp3\", \"/stora