('b3cb3f30-46df-570a-8e02-18ec174b2f8a', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'ab98a801-8c4c-58d1-81f0-96a238d4c90d', '814bb030-c3ef-5811-8a06-f86a37b3f3e3', 'tour guide', '/tɔː ɡaɪd/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Người dẫn dắt và cung cấp thông tin cho du khách.', 'a person whose job is to show tourists around places of interest.', 'An experienced tour guide led the group of tourists through the local museum.', 'Một hướng dẫn viên du lịch giàu kinh nghiệm đã dẫn đoàn khách tham quan qua bảo tàng địa phương.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency hired an experienced tour guide for the international corporate group.\", \"vi\": \"Đại lý du lịch đã thuê một hướng dẫn viên du lịch giàu kinh nghiệm cho đoàn doanh nghiệp quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-guide-ljspeech-3115689b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-guide-cori-3115689b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tour-guide-e27f2f23.webp', '[\"courier\", \"guide\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"local tour guide\", \"meaning\": \"hướng dẫn viên địa phương\"}, {\"phrase\": \"experienced tour guide\", \"meaning\": \"hướng dẫn viên giàu kinh nghiệm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tourist\", \"note_vi\": \"khách du lịch, còn tour guide là người dẫn đường\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"tour\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"guide\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-guide-cori-3115689b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-guide-aru0-3115689b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-guide-aru5-3115689b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-guide-aru6-3115689b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-guide-aru10-3115689b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-guide-aru9-3115689b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-guide-aru3-3115689b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-guide-aru7-3115689b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-guide-aru8-3115689b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-guide-aru2-3115689b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-guide-ljspeech-3115689b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-guide-lt408-3115689b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-guide-lt138-3115689b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-guide-lt624-3115689b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-guide-lt396-3115689b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-guide-lt498-3115689b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-guide-lt132-3115689b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-guide-lt288-3115689b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-guide-lt42-3115689b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-guide-lt90-3115689b.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn giữa \'tourist\' (khách du lịch) và \'tour guide\' (hướng dẫn viên).', 'travel', 1, 20),
('3f05c533-df3a-57f5-b786-aaf17d4f4667', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'ab98a801-8c4c-58d1-81f0-96a238d4c90d', '814bb030-c3ef-5811-8a06-f86a37b3f3e3', 'scowl', '/skaʊl/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Nhăn mặt, nhìn một cách giận dữ hoặc khó chịu.', 'to look at someone or something with an angry or annoyed expression on your face.', 'The teacher would often scowl at students who weren\'t paying attention.', 'Giáo viên thường cau có nhìn những học sinh không chú ý.', '{\"en\": \"The manager began to scowl when he noticed the serious error in the financial report.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý bắt đầu cau có khi ông nhận ra lỗi nghiêm trọng trong báo cáo tài chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scowl-ljspeech-78efb1f7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scowl-cori-78efb1f7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/scowl-0f9c5e57.webp', '[\"frown\", \"glare\"]', '[\"smile\", \"grin\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"scowl at someone\", \"meaning\": \"nhìn cau có ai đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"scowl angrily\", \"meaning\": \"quắc mắt giận dữ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"scold\", \"note_vi\": \"scowl là nhìn cau có, scold là mắng mỏ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"scowl\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scowl-cori-78efb1f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scowl-aru0-78efb1f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scowl-aru5-78efb1f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scowl-aru6-78efb1f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scowl-aru10-78efb1f7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scowl-aru9-78efb1f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scowl-aru3-78efb1f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scowl-aru7-78efb1f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scowl-aru8-78efb1f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scowl-aru2-78efb1f7.mp3\"]}, \