('dd2cbeb7-5436-52cd-88c3-857f742e9f78', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'ab98a801-8c4c-58d1-81f0-96a238d4c90d', '814bb030-c3ef-5811-8a06-f86a37b3f3e3', 'save', 'UK: /seɪv/ | US: /seɪv/', 'A2', 'verb', 'lưu, cất giữ', 'to keep data or information stored on a computer or digital device for future use.', 'Please save the document before closing the program.', 'Vui lòng lưu tài liệu trước khi đóng chương trình.', '{\"en\": \"Please save all your changes to the document before closing the application.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng lưu tất cả các thay đổi của bạn vào tài liệu trước khi đóng ứng dụng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/save-ljspeech-13a4a113.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/save-cori-13a4a113.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/save-b3f535ad.webp', '[\"store\", \"keep\", \"preserve\", \"record\"]', '[\"delete\", \"erase\", \"discard\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"save a file\", \"meaning\": \"lưu một tập tin\"}, {\"phrase\": \"save data\", \"meaning\": \"lưu dữ liệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"save automatically\", \"meaning\": \"tự động lưu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"safe\", \"note_vi\": \"safe là tính từ (an toàn) hoặc danh từ (két sắt), còn save là động từ (lưu, cất giữ/cứu).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"saver\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"saving\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/save-cori-13a4a113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/save-aru0-13a4a113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/save-aru5-13a4a113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/save-aru6-13a4a113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/save-aru10-13a4a113.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/save-aru9-13a4a113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/save-aru3-13a4a113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/save-aru7-13a4a113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/save-aru8-13a4a113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/save-aru2-13a4a113.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/save-ljspeech-13a4a113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/save-lt408-13a4a113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/save-lt138-13a4a113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/save-lt624-13a4a113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/save-lt396-13a4a113.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/save-lt498-13a4a113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/save-lt132-13a4a113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/save-lt288-13a4a113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/save-lt42-13a4a113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/save-lt90-13a4a113.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhớ phím tắt Ctrl+S trên máy tính: \'S\' chính là viết tắt của \'save\' (lưu dữ liệu).', 'office technology', 1, 23),
('4bf95d51-3532-5838-b041-45abccefdcc8', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'ab98a801-8c4c-58d1-81f0-96a238d4c90d', '814bb030-c3ef-5811-8a06-f86a37b3f3e3', 'agility', '/əˈdʒɪləti/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Khả năng di chuyển nhanh chóng và dễ dàng.', 'the ability to move quickly and easily, or to think and understand rapidly.', 'The gymnast showed incredible agility as she performed her routine on the balance beam.', 'Nữ vận động viên thể dục dụng cụ đã thể hiện sự nhanh nhẹn đáng kinh ngạc khi thực hiện bài tập trên xà thăng bằng.', '{\"en\": \"In today\'s fast market, business agility is essential for companies to survive and grow.\", \"vi\": \"Trong thị trường nhanh chóng ngày nay, sự nhanh nhạy trong kinh doanh là điều cần thiết để các công ty tồn tại và phát triển.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agility-ljspeech-d44177dd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agility-cori-d44177dd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/agility-5c1f4af6.webp', '[\"nimbleness\", \"quickness\", \"flexibility\"]', '[\"clumsiness\", \"sluggishness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"mental agility\", \"meaning\": \"sự nhanh nhạy về trí óc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"business agility\", \"meaning\": \"sự linh hoạt trong kinh doanh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"ability\", \"note_vi\": \"ability là khả năng nói chung, agility là sự nhanh nhẹn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"agile\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"agilely\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agility-cori-d44177dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agility-aru0-d44177dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agility-aru5-d44177dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agility-aru6-d44177dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agility-aru10-d44177dd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agility-aru9-d44177dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agility-aru3-d44177dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agility-aru7-d44177dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agility-aru8-d44177dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agility-aru2-d44177dd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agility-ljspeech-d44177dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agility-lt408-d44177dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agility-lt138-d44177dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agility-lt624-d44177dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agility-lt396-d44177dd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agility-lt498-d44177dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agility-lt132-d44177dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agility-lt288-d44177dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agility-lt42-d44177dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agility-lt90-d44177dd.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ cảnh doanh nghiệp, agility thường chỉ khả năng thích ứng nhanh với thay đổi.', 'business', 1, 24),
('fa1adb5d-0fb1-5fed-b2a7-91b184c9a89b', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'ab98a801-8c4c-58d1-81f0-96a238d4c90d', '814bb030-c3ef-5811-8a06-f86a37b3f3e3', 'getting on a bit', '/ɡetɪŋ ɒn ə bɪt/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Trở nên già hơn một chút.', 'growing older or reaching a relatively advanced age in life.', 'My grandmother is getting on a bit, but she still loves to travel.', 'Bà tôi đã hơi có tuổi rồi, nhưng bà vẫn thích đi du lịch.', '{\"en\": \"Our office printer is getting on a bit and needs to be replaced soon.\", \"vi\": \"Máy in văn phòng của chúng tôi đang cũ dần và cần sớm được thay thế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/getting-on-a-bit-ljspeech-55286e73.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/getting-on-a-bit-cori-55286e73.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/getting-on-a-bit-b70f3479.webp', '[\"aging\", \"growing old\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/getting-on-a-bit-cori-55286e73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/getting-on-a-bit-aru0-55286e73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/getting-on-a-bit-aru5-55286e73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/getting-on-a-bit-aru6-55286e73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/getting-on-a-bit-aru10-55286e73.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/getting-on-a-bit-aru9-55286e73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/getting-on-a-bit-aru3-55286e73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/getting-on-a-bit-aru7-55286e73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/getting-on-a-bit-aru8-55286e73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/getting-on-a-bit-aru2-55286e73.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/getting-on-a-bit-ljspeech-55286e73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/getting-on-a-bit-lt408-55286e73.