('d81ab2b0-bad4-547c-aab8-451640d4358d', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'b87d2bb8-ef71-511b-923b-6e1609bd1548', '7f8d6cb5-1f18-5d90-b1d7-5859d87a0ec3', 'damp', '/dæmp/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Hơi ẩm ướt, không hoàn toàn khô ráo.', 'slightly wet, often in a way that is unpleasant or cold.', 'The towel was still a bit damp even after being in the dryer.', 'Chiếc khăn vẫn còn hơi ẩm ngay cả sau khi đã cho vào máy sấy.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance crew repaired the wall because the office basement felt damp and cold.\", \"vi\": \"Đội bảo trì đã sửa bức tường vì tầng hầm văn phòng có cảm giác ẩm ướt và lạnh lẽo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damp-ljspeech-f5e2e360.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damp-cori-f5e2e360.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/damp-d66b058c.webp', '[\"moist\", \"humid\", \"wet\"]', '[\"dry\", \"arid\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"damp cloth\", \"meaning\": \"khăn ẩm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"damp walls\", \"meaning\": \"bức tường ẩm ướt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"humid\", \"note_vi\": \"ẩm ướt (thường nói về thời tiết, không khí)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"dampness\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"dampen\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damp-cori-f5e2e360.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damp-aru0-f5e2e360.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damp-aru5-f5e2e360.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damp-aru6-f5e2e360.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damp-aru10-f5e2e360.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damp-aru9-f5e2e360.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damp-aru3-f5e2e360.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damp-aru7-f5e2e360.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damp-aru8-f5e2e360.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damp-aru2-f5e2e360.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"