('1c493cfb-bfbe-5e3d-a3e2-1729a069432d', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'b87d2bb8-ef71-511b-923b-6e1609bd1548', '7f8d6cb5-1f18-5d90-b1d7-5859d87a0ec3', 'hungry', '/ˈhʌŋɡri/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy muốn ăn vì cơ thể cần thức ăn.', 'feeling a need or desire for food because you have not eaten for a while.', 'After the long hike, I was so hungry I could eat a horse.', 'Sau chuyến đi bộ dài, tôi đói đến mức có thể ăn cả con ngựa.', '{\"en\": \"The client was feeling quite hungry, so we decided to continue the meeting after lunch.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng cảm thấy khá đói, vì vậy chúng tôi quyết định tiếp tục cuộc họp sau bữa trưa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-ljspeech-eff2146b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-cori-eff2146b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hungry-2ad9a180.webp', '[\"starving\", \"famished\"]', '[\"full\", \"satisfied\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel hungry\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy đói\"}, {\"phrase\": \"get hungry\", \"meaning\": \"trở nên đói\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"hunger\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-cori-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-aru0-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-aru5-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-aru6-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-aru10-eff2146b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-aru9-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-aru3-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-aru7-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-aru8-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-aru2-eff2146b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-ljspeech-eff