('7505f02b-866a-5ab8-a4f8-93953a5d947c', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'b87d2bb8-ef71-511b-923b-6e1609bd1548', '7f8d6cb5-1f18-5d90-b1d7-5859d87a0ec3', 'review', 'UK: /rɪˈvjuː/ | US: /rɪˈvjuː/', 'A2', 'noun', 'bài đánh giá, xem xét', 'a formal evaluation or assessment of something to examine its performance, quality, or condition.', 'The manager asked for a review of the new project.', 'Người quản lý yêu cầu xem xét dự án mới.', '{\"en\": \"Every employee will meet with their supervisor next week for an annual performance review.\", \"vi\": \"Mỗi nhân viên sẽ gặp người giám sát của họ vào tuần tới để đánh giá hiệu suất làm việc hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-ljspeech-61e62b21.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-cori-61e62b21.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/review-55735555.webp', '[\"evaluation\", \"assessment\", \"appraisal\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"performance review\", \"meaning\": \"đánh giá hiệu suất làm việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"conduct a review\", \"meaning\": \"tiến hành xem xét/đánh giá\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"review\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"reviewer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-cori-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-aru0-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-aru5-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-aru6-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-aru10-61e62b21.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-aru9-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-aru3-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-aru7-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-aru8-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-aru2-61e62b21.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-ljspeech-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-lt408-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-lt138-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-lt624-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-lt396-61e62b21.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-lt498-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-lt132-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-lt288-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-lt42-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-lt90-61e62b21.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong môi trường công sở, \'performance review\' là buổi đánh giá hiệu suất làm việc định kỳ của nhân viên.', 'human resources', 1, 7),
('eba5eb5a-963f-5676-a632-8a984d4caaf3', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'b87d2bb8-ef71-511b-923b-6e1609bd1548', '7f8d6cb5-1f18-5d90-b1d7-5859d87a0ec3', 'no reception', '/nəʊ rɪˈsɛpʃən/', 'A2', 'phrase', 'Không có sóng điện thoại hoặc internet.', 'a lack of phone or internet signal in a certain area.', 'I couldn\'t make a call because there was no reception in the mountains.', 'Tôi không thể gọi điện vì không có tín hiệu trên núi.', '{\"en\": \"Guests complained about no reception in the remote mountain resort rooms.\", \"vi\": \"Khách phàn nàn về việc không có tín hiệu trong phòng resort trên núi hẻo lánh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/no-reception-ljspeech-cf38eb1a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/no-reception-cori-cf38eb1a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/no-reception-d74e146d.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"no reception signal\", \"meaning\": \"không có tín hiệu sóng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"find no reception\", \"meaning\": \"không tìm thấy sóng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"no mobile reception\", \"meaning\": \"không có sóng di động\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"reception desk\", \"note_vi\": \"reception desk là quầy lễ tân, không phải sóng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"reception\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"receive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/no-reception-cori-cf38eb1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/no-reception-aru0-cf38eb1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/no-reception-aru5-cf38eb1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/no-reception-aru6-cf38eb1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/no-reception-aru10-cf38eb1a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/no-reception-aru9-cf38eb1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/no-reception-aru3-cf38eb1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/no-reception-aru7-cf