('03918452-e189-5b28-8ff8-1113bfb0a9df', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'b87d2bb8-ef71-511b-923b-6e1609bd1548', '7f8d6cb5-1f18-5d90-b1d7-5859d87a0ec3', 'extracurricular activities', '/ˌɛkstrəkəˈrɪkjʊlə ækˈtɪvɪtiz/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Các hoạt động không nằm trong chương trình học chính thức của trường.', 'school or college events held outside the normal class schedule.', 'Joining extracurricular activities can help students develop new skills and make friends.', 'Tham gia các hoạt động ngoại khóa có thể giúp học sinh phát triển kỹ năng mới và kết bạn.', '{\"en\": \"The student listed her extracurricular activities on the scholarship application form.\", \"vi\": \"Nữ sinh viên đã liệt kê các hoạt động ngoại khóa vào đơn xin học bổng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-activities-ljspeech-abde2537.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-activities-cori-abde2537.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/extracurricular-activities-84f88cac.webp', '[\"after-school activities\", \"out-of-class activities\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"join extracurricular activities\", \"meaning\": \"tham gia hoạt động ngoại khóa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"extracurricular activity club\", \"meaning\": \"câu lạc bộ ngoại khóa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"school extracurricular activities\", \"meaning\": \"hoạt động ngoại khóa trường học\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"curricular activities\", \"note_vi\": \"hoạt động trong chương trình chính khóa, không phải ngoại khóa\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-activities-cori-abde2537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-activities-aru0-abde2537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-activities-aru5-abde2537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-activities-aru6-abde2537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-activities-aru10-abde2537.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-activities-aru9-abde2537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-activities-aru3-abde2537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-activities-aru7-abde2537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-activities-aru8-abde2537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-activities-aru2-abde2537.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-activities-ljspeech-abde2537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-activities-lt408-abde2537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-activities-lt138-abde2537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-activities-lt624-abde2537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-activities-lt396-abde2537.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-activities-lt498-abde2537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-activities-lt132-abde2537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-activities-lt288-abde2537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-activities-lt42-abde2537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-activities-lt90-abde2537.mp3\"]}}', 'Viết liền không dấu gạch: extracurricular, thường đi với activities.', 'education', 1, 10),
('21bd40e4-60bf-5268-ac91-289cd677357b', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'b87d2bb8-ef71-511b-923b-6e1609bd1548', '7f8d6cb5-1f18-5d90-b1d7-5859d87a0ec3', 'thunder', '/ˈθʌndə/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Âm thanh lớn, ầm ầm thường đi kèm với chớp.', 'the loud noise that comes after a flash of lightning during a storm.', 'We heard a loud clap of thunder right after the lightning flashed.', 'Chúng tôi nghe thấy một tiếng sấm lớn ngay sau khi tia chớp lóe lên.', '{\"en\": \"Due to heavy rain and loud thunder, the outdoor product launch had to be postponed.\", \"vi\": \"Do mưa lớn và tiếng sấm to, lễ ra mắt sản phẩm ngoài trời đã phải hoãn lại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunder-ljspeech-badcfa3c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunder-cori-badcfa3c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/thunder-25e51323.webp', '[\"rumble\", \"peal\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"clap of thunder\", \"meaning\": \"tiếng sấm nổ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"roll of thunder\", \"meaning\": \"tiếng sấm ầm ầm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"lightning\", \"note_vi\": \"thunder là tiếng sấm (âm thanh), lightning là tia chớp (ánh sáng).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"thunder\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"thunderous\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunder-cori-badcfa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunder-aru0-badcfa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunder-aru5-badcfa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunder-aru6-badcfa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunder-aru10-badcfa3c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunder-aru9-badcfa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunder-aru3-badcfa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunder-aru7-badcfa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunder-aru8-badcfa3c.mp3\", \"/s