('9d5ae3ee-e659-5b02-b873-5d4483884579', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'b87d2bb8-ef71-511b-923b-6e1609bd1548', '7f8d6cb5-1f18-5d90-b1d7-5859d87a0ec3', 'tablet', 'UK: /ˈtæblɪt/ | US: /ˈtæblɪt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'máy tính bảng', 'A portable flat touch-screen electronic device used for browsing, reading, or running applications.', 'My new tablet is very light and portable.', 'Máy tính bảng mới của tôi rất nhẹ và dễ mang theo.', '{\"en\": \"Sales reps were equipped with tablets so they could easily present product catalogs to clients.\", \"vi\": \"Đại diện bán hàng được trang bị máy tính bảng để dễ dàng trình chiếu danh mục sản phẩm cho khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-ljspeech-6f4d3f36.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-cori-6f4d3f36.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tablet-73cfde5a.webp', '[\"pad\", \"device\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"tablet computer\", \"meaning\": \"máy tính bảng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"take a tablet\", \"meaning\": \"uống một viên thuốc\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-cori-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-aru0-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-aru5-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-aru6-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-aru10-6f4d3f36.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-aru9-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-aru3-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-aru7-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-aru8-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-aru2-6f4d3f36.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-ljspeech-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-lt408-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-lt138-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-lt624-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-lt396-6f4d3f36.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-lt498-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-lt132-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-lt288-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-lt42-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-lt90-6f4d3f36.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ cảnh văn phòng/công nghệ mang nghĩa máy tính bảng; trong y tế/dược phẩm mang nghĩa viên thuốc nén.', 'technology', 1, 14),
('2ebbc212-05ee-554a-8e7c-9b78b9c85a29', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'b87d2bb8-ef71-511b-923b-6e1609bd1548', '7f8d6cb5-1f18-5d90-b1d7-5859d87a0ec3', 'take a holiday', '/teɪk ə ˈhɒlɪdeɪ/', 'A2', 'collocation', 'Đi nghỉ dưỡng hoặc du lịch trong một khoảng thời gian.', 'to spend time away from work or home resting and relaxing.', 'We decided to take a holiday to the beach next month.', 'Chúng tôi quyết định đi nghỉ mát ở biển vào tháng tới.', '{\"en\": \"The senior executive plans to take a holiday right after finishing the contract negotiations.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc cấp cao dự định đi nghỉ mát ngay sau khi hoàn tất đàm phán hợp đồng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-holiday-ljspeech-02c8d028.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-holiday-cori-02c8d028.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/take-a-holiday-b5b4954f.webp', '[\"go on vacation\", \"take a break\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"take a holiday abroad\", \"meaning\": \"đi nghỉ mát ở nước ngoài\"}, {\"phrase\": \"take a well-deserved holiday\", \"meaning\": \"đi nghỉ mát xứng đáng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"go on vacation\", \"note_vi\": \"take a holiday phổ biến hơn trong tiếng Anh Anh, vacation trong tiếng Anh Mỹ.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-holiday-cori-02c8d028.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-holiday-aru0-02c8d028.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-holiday-aru5-02c8d028.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-holiday-aru6-02c8d028.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-holiday-aru10-02c8d028.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-holiday-aru9-02c8d028.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-holiday-aru3-02c8d028.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-holiday-aru7-02c8d028.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obj