('d59a99d8-db7b-50ac-8ff0-c5083cfff74e', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'b87d2bb8-ef71-511b-923b-6e1609bd1548', '7f8d6cb5-1f18-5d90-b1d7-5859d87a0ec3', 'skillful', '/ˈskɪlfl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có kỹ năng tốt, thực hiện công việc một cách thành thạo, khéo léo.', 'having the ability to do something very well and easily.', 'The chef was very skillful at decorating the intricate cake.', 'Đầu bếp rất khéo léo trong việc trang trí chiếc bánh phức tạp.', '{\"en\": \"The skillful technician fixed the office printer before the meeting started.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên khéo léo đã sửa máy in văn phòng trước khi cuộc họp bắt đầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skillful-ljspeech-cb921db1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skillful-cori-cb921db1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/skillful-62f0f3d2.webp', '[\"adept\", \"expert\", \"talented\"]', '[\"clumsy\", \"unskilled\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"skillful worker\", \"meaning\": \"công nhân khéo léo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"skillful at painting\", \"meaning\": \"khéo léo trong việc vẽ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"skillful negotiation\", \"meaning\": \"đàm phán tài tình\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"skilled\", \"note_vi\": \"skilled là có kỹ năng qua học, skillful thiên về khéo léo bẩm sinh\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"skill\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"skillfully\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skillful-cori-cb921db1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skillful-aru0-cb921db1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skillful-aru5-cb921db1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skillful-aru6-cb921db1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skillful-aru10-cb921db1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skillful-aru9-cb921db1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skillful-aru3-cb921db1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obj