('9530ee38-fd08-5d4c-a2bb-11ef4cd74654', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'b87d2bb8-ef71-511b-923b-6e1609bd1548', '7f8d6cb5-1f18-5d90-b1d7-5859d87a0ec3', 'appalled', '/əˈpɔːld/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'cảm thấy sốc và kinh hãi tột độ trước điều gì đó.', 'feeling very shocked and upset by something bad or wrong.', 'She was utterly appalled by the cruelty of the animal abuse video.', 'Cô ấy hoàn toàn kinh hoàng trước sự tàn ác trong video bạo hành động vật.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was appalled by the poor quality of the delivered products.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý rất kinh hoàng trước chất lượng kém của các sản phẩm được giao.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appalled-ljspeech-ce5b38a4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appalled-cori-ce5b38a4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/appalled-2db551a6.webp', '[\"horrified\", \"shocked\", \"dismayed\"]', '[\"pleased\", \"delighted\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"appalled by\", \"meaning\": \"kinh hoàng trước điều gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"absolutely appalled\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn toàn bị sốc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"appalled at the situation\", \"meaning\": \"kinh hoàng trước tình huống\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"appalling\", \"note_vi\": \"appalled là cảm xúc của người, appalling mô tả thứ gây ra cảm xúc đó\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"appall\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"appalling\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"appallingly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appalled-cori-ce5b38a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appalled-aru0-ce5b38a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appalled-aru5-ce5b38a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appalled-aru6-ce5b38a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appalled-aru10-ce5b38a4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appalled-aru9-ce5b38a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appalled-aru3-ce5b38a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appalled-aru7-ce5b38a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appalled-aru8-ce5b38a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appalled-aru2-ce5b38a4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appalled-ljspeech-ce5b38a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appalled-lt408-ce5b38a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appalled-lt138-ce5b38a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appalled-lt624-ce5b38a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appalled-lt396-ce5b38a4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appalled-lt498-ce5b38a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appalled-lt132-ce5b38a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appalled-lt288-ce5b38a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appalled-lt42-ce5b38a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appalled-lt90-ce5b38a4.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhớ: appalled = bị sốc nặng, mạnh hơn \'surprised\' hay \'shocked\' thông thường.', 'other', 1, 27),
('a124d007-131e-5bf5-a1c7-1953204f1cc6', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'b87d2bb8-ef71-511b-923b-6e1609bd1548', '7f8d6cb5-1f18-5d90-b1d7-5859d87a0ec3', 'ice skating', '/ˌaɪs ˈskeɪtɪŋ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Môn thể thao hoặc hoạt động giải trí trượt trên băng bằng giày có lưỡi.', 'the activity of moving across a frozen surface while wearing special shoes with metal blades.', 'My sister loves ice skating, especially during winter.', 'Em gái tôi rất thích trượt băng, đặc biệt là vào mùa đông.', '{\"en\": \"Our team building event includes ice skating at the local rink to improve staff morale.\", \"vi\": \"Sự kiện xây dựng đội ngũ của chúng tôi bao gồm hoạt động trượt băng tại sân băng địa phương để nâng cao tinh thần nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ice-skating-ljspeech-cbfe32d0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ice-skating-cori-cbfe32d0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ice-skating-41cb4456.webp', '[\"skating\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"go ice skating\", \"meaning\": \"đi trượt băng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ice skating rink\", \"meaning\": \"sân trượt băng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"ice skater\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ice-skating-cori-cbfe32d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ice-skating-aru0-cbfe32d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ice-skating-aru5-cbfe32d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ice-skating-aru6-cbfe32d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ice-skating-aru10-cbfe32d0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ice-skating-aru9-cbfe32d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ice-skating-aru3-cbfe32d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ice-skating-aru7-cbfe32d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ice-skating-aru8-cbfe32d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/p