('430a59ae-5c83-5c65-88d9-966e8d52c546', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'ba4e89e9-ccbc-5ec1-8290-1d7189d2ee2a', '98359ed4-4c79-548e-9b36-170b56348c84', 'worried', '/ˈwʌrɪd/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy bất an, lo sợ về điều gì đó.', 'thinking about bad things that might happen, causing fear or unhappiness.', 'Staff members were worried about potential job cuts following the recent corporate merger.', 'Các nhân viên đã lo lắng về khả năng cắt giảm nhân sự sau vụ sáp nhập doanh nghiệp gần đây.', '{\"en\": \"The project manager was worried about missing the final delivery deadline for the client.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý dự án cảm thấy lo lắng về việc trễ thời hạn giao hàng cuối cùng cho khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-ljspeech-7c3dc388.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-cori-7c3dc388.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/worried-0a27c451.webp', '[\"anxious\", \"concerned\", \"apprehensive\"]', '[\"calm\", \"relaxed\", \"unconcerned\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"worried about\", \"meaning\": \"lo lắng về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"look worried\", \"meaning\": \"trông có vẻ lo lắng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"anxious\", \"note_vi\": \"worried mang nghĩa lo lắng chung, anxious thể hiện sự bất an hoặc háo hức.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"worry\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"worry\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"worrisomely\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-cori-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-aru0-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-aru5-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-aru6-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-aru10-7c3dc388.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-aru9-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-aru3-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-aru7-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-aru8-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-aru2-7c3dc388.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-ljspeech-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-lt408-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-lt138-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-lt624-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-lt396-7c3dc388.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-lt498-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-lt132-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-lt288-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-lt42-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-lt90-7c3dc388.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc phổ biến là \'worried about something\' hoặc \'worried that + mệnh đề\'.', 'office', 1, 8),
('70d321c4-b0bc-57b4-8dce-5d6868feaea8', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'ba4e89e9-ccbc-5ec1-8290-1d7189d2ee2a', '98359ed4-4c79-548e-9b36-170b56348c84', 'careless', '/ˈkeələs/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Không cẩn thận, thiếu chú ý, dẫn đến lỗi lầm hoặc tai nạn.', 'Lacking proper thought or attention, which frequently causes avoidable errors or accidents.', 'It was careless of him to leave his wallet on the park bench.', 'Anh ấy thật bất cẩn khi để quên ví trên ghế đá công viên.', '{\"en\": \"The accountant made a careless error in the financial report, which caused a budget discrepancy.\", \"vi\": \"Kế toán đã mắc một lỗi bất cẩn trong báo cáo tài chính, gây ra sự chênh lệch ngân sách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-ljspeech-eeaae8b6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-cori-eeaae8b6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/careless-fbaafad3.webp', '[\"thoughtless\", \"negligent\"]', '[\"careful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"careless mistake\", \"meaning\": \"lỗi bất cẩn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"be careless with\", \"meaning\": \"bất cẩn với cái gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"carefree\", \"note_vi\": \"Carefree là vô tư, không lo nghĩ, không phải bất cẩn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"care\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"carefully\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-cori-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-aru0-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-aru5-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-aru6-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-aru10-eeaae8b6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-aru9-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-aru3-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-aru7-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storag