('f86ed0aa-b9cf-5c01-b341-638844b8fbce', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'ba4e89e9-ccbc-5ec1-8290-1d7189d2ee2a', '98359ed4-4c79-548e-9b36-170b56348c84', 'drizzle', '/ˈdrɪzl̩/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Mưa nhẹ, hạt nhỏ và rơi chậm.', 'a continuous mist-like precipitation consisting of extremely minute droplets of liquid water.', 'A light drizzle began to fall, making the leaves glisten.', 'Một cơn mưa phùn nhẹ bắt đầu rơi, làm cho những chiếc lá lấp lánh.', '{\"en\": \"The outdoor corporate event was delayed for an hour due to light drizzle.\", \"vi\": \"Sự kiện ngoài trời của công ty đã bị hoãn một giờ do mưa phùn nhẹ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drizzle-ljspeech-e5b43dc7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drizzle-cori-e5b43dc7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/drizzle-bed55094.webp', '[\"sprinkle\"]', '[\"downpour\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"light drizzle\", \"meaning\": \"mưa phùn nhẹ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"constant drizzle\", \"meaning\": \"mưa bụi liên tục\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"drizzle\", \"note_vi\": \"drizzle dạng động từ còn có nghĩa là rưới nhẹ nước sốt lên thức ăn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"drizzle\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drizzle-cori-e5b43dc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drizzle-aru0-e5b43dc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drizzle-aru5-e5b43dc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drizzle-aru6-e5b43dc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drizzle-aru10-e5b43dc7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drizzle-aru9-e5b43dc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drizzle-aru3-e5b43dc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drizzle-aru7-e5b43dc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drizzle-aru8-e5b43dc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drizzle-aru2-e5b43dc7.mp3\"