('aa26acfc-ffa0-5807-bc89-c92098f0f1d4', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'ba4e89e9-ccbc-5ec1-8290-1d7189d2ee2a', '98359ed4-4c79-548e-9b36-170b56348c84', 'flood', '/flʌd/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Tình trạng nước dâng cao tràn ngập một khu vực khô cạn.', 'an overflow of an expanse of water that submerges land which normally remains dry.', 'Local authorities issued an urgent warning after rising river levels created a major flood.', 'Chính quyền địa phương đã phát đi cảnh báo khẩn cấp sau khi mực nước sông dâng cao tạo ra một trận lũ lụt lớn.', '{\"en\": \"The warehouse sustained minor damage due to the unexpected flood after the storm.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà kho bị hư hại nhẹ do trận lũ lụt bất ngờ sau cơn bão.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-ljspeech-ff0db992.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-cori-ff0db992.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/flood-fbada72b.webp', '[\"inundation\", \"deluge\"]', '[\"drought\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"flash flood\", \"meaning\": \"lũ quét\"}, {\"phrase\": \"flood damage\", \"meaning\": \"thiệt hại do lũ lụt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"flood\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-cori-ff0db992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-aru0-ff0db992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-aru5-ff0db992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-aru6-ff0db992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-aru10-ff0db992.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-aru9-ff0db992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-aru3-ff0db992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-aru7-ff0db992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-aru8-ff0db992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-aru2-ff0db992.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/p