('05c366a7-c8b4-50b1-bf30-d4d87d2d5715', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'ba4e89e9-ccbc-5ec1-8290-1d7189d2ee2a', '98359ed4-4c79-548e-9b36-170b56348c84', 'shopping list', '/ʃɒpɪŋ lɪst/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Danh sách các mặt hàng cần mua sắm.', 'a written record of things that a person intends to buy when they go to a store.', 'Don\'t forget to check your shopping list before you leave the house for the supermarket.', 'Đừng quên kiểm tra danh sách mua sắm của bạn trước khi bạn rời nhà đi siêu thị.', '{\"en\": \"Please write down the office supplies we need on the shopping list before going to the store.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng ghi lại các văn phòng phẩm chúng ta cần vào danh sách mua sắm trước khi đến cửa hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-list-ljspeech-9c24114b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-list-cori-9c24114b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shopping-list-0423308b.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"make a shopping list\", \"meaning\": \"lập danh sách mua sắm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"grocery shopping list\", \"meaning\": \"danh sách mua thực phẩm\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-list-cori-9c24114b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-list-aru0-9c24114b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-list-aru5-9c24114b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-list-aru6-9c24114b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-list-aru10-9c24114b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-list-aru9-9c24114b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-list-aru3-9c24114b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-list-aru7-9c24114b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-list-aru8-9c24114b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-list-aru2-9c24114b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-list-ljspeech-9c24114b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-list-lt408-9c24114b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-list-lt138-9c24114b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-list-lt624-9c24114b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-list-lt396-9c24114b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-list-lt498-9c24114b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-list-lt132-9c24114b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-list-lt288-9c24114b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-list-lt42-9c24114b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shopping-list-lt90-9c24114b.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm từ này thường đi với động từ make hoặc write để chỉ việc lập danh sách.', 'shopping', 1, 27),
('c4675d3a-ce1e-575e-9a33-bc898dfa52b8', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'ba4e89e9-ccbc-5ec1-8290-1d7189d2ee2a', '98359ed4-4c79-548e-9b36-170b56348c84', 'excited', '/ɪkˈsaɪtɪd/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy rất vui và háo hức về điều gì đó sắp xảy ra.', 'State of experiencing intense emotional eagerness or excitement regarding an upcoming event.', 'The entire staff felt excited about launching the innovative software product.', 'Toàn bộ nhân viên cảm thấy hào hứng về việc ra mắt sản phẩm phần mềm đổi mới.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team is excited about the launch of the new product line next month.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm tiếp thị rất hào hứng về việc ra mắt dòng sản phẩm mới vào tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-ljspeech-f529c0de.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-cori-f529c0de.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/excited-2c8c6568.webp', '[\"thrilled\", \"enthusiastic\", \"eager\"]', '[\"bored\", \"indifferent\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"excited about\", \"meaning\": \"hào hứng về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"excited to do\", \"meaning\": \"háo hức làm gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"exciting\", \"note_vi\": \"gây phấn khích (vật), còn excited là bị phấn khích (người)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"excite\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"excitement\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"exciting\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-cori-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-aru0-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-aru5-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-aru6-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-aru10-f529c0de.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-aru9-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-aru3-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-aru7-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-aru8-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-aru2-f529c0de.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-ljspeech-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-lt408-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-lt138-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-lt624-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-lt396-f529c0de.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-lt498-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-lt132-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-lt288-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-lt42-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-lt90-f529c0de.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng giới từ \'about\' hoặc \'at\' sau \'excited\'. Tránh nhầm với \'exciting\'.', 'marketing', 1, 28),
('258bc680-0443-54bf-af82-34f7418d2623', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'ba4e89e9-ccbc-5ec1-8290-1d7189d2ee2a', '98359ed4-4c79-548e-9b36-170b56348c84', 'bald', '/bɔːld/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Không có tóc trên đầu, hoặc có rất ít tóc.', 'having little or no hair on the top of the head.', 'My grandfather started to go bald in his forties.', 'Ông tôi bắt đầu bị hói vào những năm bốn mươi tuổi.', '{\"en\": \"The bald manager was easy to recognize at the company networking event.\", \"vi\": \"Vị quản lý hói đầu rất dễ nhận ra tại sự kiện kết nối của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bald-ljspeech-4675f60d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bald-cori-4675f60d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bald-51c06cf8.webp', '[\"hairless\", \"shaven-headed\"]', '[\"hairy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"go bald\", \"meaning\": \"bị hói đầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bald patch\", \"meaning\": \"mảng hói\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bald head\", \"meaning\": \"đầu hói\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bold\", \"note_vi\": \"\'bald\' nghĩa là hói; \'bold\' nghĩa là đậm nét hoặc dũng cảm, đừng nhầm.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"baldness\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"baldly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bald-cori-4675f60d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bald-aru0-4675f60d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bald-aru5-4675f60d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bald-aru6-4675f60d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bald-aru10-4675f60d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bald-aru9-4675f60d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bald-aru3-4675f60d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bald-aru7-4675f60d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bald-aru8-4675f60d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bald-aru2-4675f60d.m