('fce86e1b-25b5-5a3a-860b-832b759f3f5f', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'c3aa8182-b913-5d48-9a61-0dbeec8e6d7b', 'af189e6e-ff9d-5cdc-ae19-c87974834e37', 'plastic bag', '/plæstɪk bæɡ/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Túi làm từ nhựa dùng để đựng đồ.', 'a thin container made of artificial material used for carrying goods from a shop.', 'Don\'t forget to bring a reusable shopping bag instead of using a plastic bag.', 'Đừng quên mang theo túi mua sắm tái sử dụng thay vì dùng túi ni lông.', '{\"en\": \"The supermarket will charge an extra fee if you request a plastic bag for your groceries.\", \"vi\": \"Siêu thị sẽ tính thêm phí nếu bạn yêu cầu túi ni lông cho hàng hóa của mình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-bag-ljspeech-8e639308.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-bag-cori-8e639308.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/plastic-bag-9a66617d.webp', '[\"carrier bag\", \"polybag\"]', '[\"paper bag\", \"cloth bag\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"reusable plastic bag\", \"meaning\": \"túi ni lông tái sử dụng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clear plastic bag\", \"meaning\": \"túi ni lông trong suốt\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-bag-cori-8e639308.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-bag-aru0-8e639308.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-bag-aru5-8e639308.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-bag-aru6-8e639308.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-bag-aru10-8e639308.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-bag-aru9-8e639308.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-bag-aru3-8e639308.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-bag-aru7-8e639308.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-bag-aru8-8e639308.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-bag-aru2-8e639308.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-bag-ljspeech-8e639308.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-bag-lt408-8e639308.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-bag-lt138-8e639308.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-bag-lt624-8e639308.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-bag-lt396-8e639308.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-bag-lt498-8e639308.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-bag-lt132-8e639308.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-bag-lt288-8e639308.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-bag-lt42-8e639308.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-bag-lt90-8e639308.mp3\"]}}', 'Ở Anh thường gọi là carrier bag, ở Mỹ gọi là plastic bag.', 'shopping', 1, 1),
('23e6479d-819c-5bac-af45-b67eaec69770', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'c3aa8182-b913-5d48-9a61-0dbeec8e6d7b', 'af189e6e-ff9d-5cdc-ae19-c87974834e37', 'lose figure', '/luːz ˈfɪɡə/', 'B2', 'phrase', 'Mất đi vóc dáng thon gọn (thường do tăng cân).', 'to become less attractive in physical shape, often by gaining weight over time.', 'She was worried she might lose her figure after having children.', 'Cô ấy lo lắng có thể mất dáng sau khi sinh con.', '{\"en\": \"The fitness instructor warned that sitting at a desk all day can make you lose figure.\", \"vi\": \"Huấn luyện viên thể hình cảnh báo rằng việc ngồi ở bàn làm việc cả ngày có thể khiến bạn mất dáng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-figure-ljspeech-8f04cc8c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-figure-cori-8f04cc8c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lose-figure-f756b20a.webp', '[\"gain weight\", \"get out of shape\"]', '[\"keep in shape\", \"stay fit\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"lose one\'s figure\", \"meaning\": \"đánh mất vóc dáng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"lose face\", \"note_vi\": \"lose face là mất mặt, lose figure là mất dáng.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-figure-cori-8f04cc8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-figure-aru0-8f04cc8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-figure-aru5-8f04cc8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-figure-aru6-8f04cc8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-figure-aru10-8f04cc8c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-figure-aru9-8f04cc8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-figure-aru3-8f04cc8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-figure-aru7-8f04cc8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-figure-aru8-8f04cc8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-figure-aru2-8f04cc8c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-figure-ljspeech-8f04cc8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-figure-lt408-8f04cc8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-figure-lt138-8f04cc8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-figure-lt624-8f04cc8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-figure-lt396-8f04cc8c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-figure-lt498-8f04cc8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-figure-lt132-8f04cc8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-figure-lt288-8f04cc8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-figure-lt42-8f04cc8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lose-figure-lt90-8f04cc8c.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng với tính từ sở hữu: lose one\'s figure (mất đi vóc dáng của ai đó).', 'health', 1, 2),
('3770df0b-3643-5256-8297-4895e94a4563', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'c3aa8182-b913-5d48-9a61-0dbeec8e6d7b', 'af189e6e-ff9d-5cdc-ae19-c87974834e37', 'thirsty', '/ˈθɜːsti/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy cần uống nước.', 'feeling a need to drink liquid due to lack of water.', 'After running a marathon, he was extremely thirsty.', 'Sau khi chạy marathon, anh ấy cực kỳ khát nước.', '{\"en\": \"The thirsty customer ordered a cold drink at the restaurant.\", \"vi\": \"Vị khách khát đã gọi một đồ uống lạnh tại nhà hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thirsty-ljspeech-31a02cf9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thirsty-cori-31a02cf9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/thirsty-9d68c008.webp', '[\"dry\", \"parched\"]', '[\"full\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel thirsty\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy khát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"thirsty work\", \"meaning\": \"công việc khiến khát nước\"}, {\"phrase\": \"get thirsty\", \"meaning\": \"trở nên khát\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hungry\", \"note_vi\": \"hungry là đói, thirsty là khát nước\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"thirst\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thirsty-cori-31a02cf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thirsty-aru0-31a02cf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thirsty-aru5-31a02cf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thirsty-aru6-31a02cf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thirsty-aru10-31a02cf9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thirsty-aru9-31a02cf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thirsty-aru3-31a02cf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thirsty-aru7-31a02cf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thirsty-aru8-31a02cf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thirsty-aru2-31a02cf9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunc