('940cac96-b30b-5ef1-8927-d9892ef18b09', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'c3aa8182-b913-5d48-9a61-0dbeec8e6d7b', 'af189e6e-ff9d-5cdc-ae19-c87974834e37', 'guilty', '/ˈɡɪlti/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy có lỗi hoặc đã phạm tội.', 'feeling sad or responsible because you have done something wrong or broken a rule.', 'He felt guilty for forgetting his mother\'s birthday.', 'Anh ấy cảm thấy có lỗi vì đã quên sinh nhật mẹ mình.', '{\"en\": \"The employee felt guilty after he accidentally deleted the important client database files yesterday.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên cảm thấy tội lỗi sau khi anh ta vô tình xóa các tệp cơ sở dữ liệu khách hàng quan trọng hôm qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-ljspeech-5149c0a0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-cori-5149c0a0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/guilty-02547277.webp', '[\"remorseful\", \"ashamed\"]', '[\"innocent\", \"blameless\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel guilty about\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy tội lỗi về điều gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"guilty conscience\", \"meaning\": \"lương tâm cắn rứt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"guilt\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-cori-5149c0a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-aru0-5149c0a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-aru5-5149c0a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-aru6-5149c0a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-aru10-5149c0a0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-aru9-5149c0a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-aru3-5149c0a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-aru7-5149c0a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-aru8-5149c0a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-aru2-5149c0a0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/s