('6428483f-3048-5d38-853c-7031f1d7ba62', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'c3aa8182-b913-5d48-9a61-0dbeec8e6d7b', 'af189e6e-ff9d-5cdc-ae19-c87974834e37', 'cold', '/kəʊld/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Có nhiệt độ thấp, không ấm.', 'characterized by an uncomfortably low temperature or a noticeable absence of warmth.', 'It\'s very cold outside, so remember to wear a warm jacket.', 'Ngoài trời rất lạnh, nên nhớ mặc áo khoác ấm.', '{\"en\": \"The technician fixed the air conditioner because the office was getting too cold for staff.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên đã sửa máy điều hòa vì văn phòng đang trở nên quá lạnh đối với nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-ljspeech-424fa439.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-cori-424fa439.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cold-7fab123d.webp', '[\"chilly\", \"freezing\"]', '[\"hot\", \"warm\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"cold weather\", \"meaning\": \"thời tiết lạnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cold water\", \"meaning\": \"nước lạnh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cool\", \"note_vi\": \"cold là lạnh, cool là mát mẻ hoặc tuyệt vời.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"coldness\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"coldly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-cori-424fa439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-aru0-424fa439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-aru5-424fa439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-aru6-424fa439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-aru10-424fa439.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-aru9-424fa439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-aru3-424fa439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-aru7-424fa439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-aru8-424fa439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-aru2-424fa439.mp3\"]}, 