('e211d88e-a3d9-5f02-be74-ff05a83ea860', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'c3aa8182-b913-5d48-9a61-0dbeec8e6d7b', 'af189e6e-ff9d-5cdc-ae19-c87974834e37', 'bargain', '/ˈbɑːɡən/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Đàm phán giá cả để mua rẻ hơn.', 'to discuss the conditions of a sale, agreement, or price to get better terms.', 'She tried to bargain with the street vendor for a better price on the souvenir.', 'Cô ấy cố gắng mặc cả với người bán hàng rong để có giá tốt hơn cho món quà lưu niệm.', '{\"en\": \"The purchasing agent tried to bargain with the supplier to lower the delivery cost.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên thu mua đã cố gắng mặc cả với nhà cung cấp để giảm chi phí giao hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-ljspeech-a5e12c16.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-cori-a5e12c16.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bargain-fc6d6614.webp', '[\"negotiate\", \"haggle\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"bargain for a price\", \"meaning\": \"mặc cả giá\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bargain with someone\", \"meaning\": \"thương lượng với ai\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"bargain\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-cori-a5e12c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-aru0-a5e12c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-aru5-a5e12c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-aru6-a5e12c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-aru10-a5e12c16.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-aru9-a5e12c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-aru3-a5e12c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-aru7-a5e12c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-aru8-a5e12c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-aru2-a5e12c16.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-ljspeech-a5e12c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-lt408-a5e12c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-lt138-a5e12c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-lt624-a5e12c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-lt396-a5e12c16.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-lt498-a5e12c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-lt132-a5e12c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-lt288-a5e12c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-lt42-a5e12c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-lt90-a5e12c16.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'bargain for\' có nghĩa là mặc cả giá, hoặc kỳ vọng điều gì (\'didn\'t bargain for this\').', 'shopping', 1, 25),
('90714c59-0786-567e-a193-d6d1f57e0c71', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'c3aa8182-b913-5d48-9a61-0dbeec8e6d7b', 'af189e6e-ff9d-5cdc-ae19-c87974834e37', 'would you mind', '', 'A2', 'phrase', 'Bạn có phiền không...?', 'Used as a polite phrase to ask someone for permission or help.', 'Would you mind closing the door?', 'Bạn có phiền đóng cửa lại không?', '{\"en\": \"Would you mind reviewing the draft proposal before sending it to the client?\", \"vi\": \"Bạn có phiền xem lại bản thảo đề xuất trước khi gửi cho khách hàng không?\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/would-you-mind-ljspeech-a4a24b88.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/would-you-mind-cori-a4a24b88.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/would-you-mind-42459d1a.webp', '[\"could you please\", \"do you mind\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"would you mind doing sth\", \"meaning\": \"bạn có phiền làm gì đó không\"}, {\"phrase\": \"would you mind if I...\", \"meaning\": \"bạn có phiền nếu tôi...\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"do you mind\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa tương tự nhưng \'would you mind\' mang sắc thái trang trọng và lịch sự hơn trong công sở\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/would-you-mind-cori-a4a24b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/would-you-mind-aru0-a4a24b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/would-you-mind-aru5-a4a24b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/would-you-mind-aru6-a4a24b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/would-you-mind-aru10-a4a24b88.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/would-you-mind-aru9-a4a24b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/would-you-mind-aru3-a4a24b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/would-you-mind-aru7-a4a24b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/would-you-mind-aru8-a4a24b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/would-you-mind-aru2-a4a24b88.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/would-you-mind-ljspeech-a4a24b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/would-you-mind-lt408-a4a24b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/would-you-mind-lt138-a4a24b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/would-you-mind-lt624-a4a24b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/would-you-mind-lt396-a4a24b88.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/would-you-mind-lt498-a4a24b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/would-you-mind-lt132-a4a24b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/would-you-mind-lt288-a4a24b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/would-you-mind-lt42-a4a24b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/would-you-mind-lt90-a4a24b88.mp3\"]}}', 'Mẫu câu nhờ vả lịch sự: \'Would you mind + V-ing...?\'. Nếu người nghe đồng ý giúp đỡ sẽ trả lời \'No, not at all\' hoặc \'Of course not\'.', 'office', 1, 26),
('e5621015-ad32-51f7-b459-69b312460a31', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'c3aa8182-b913-5d48-9a61-0dbeec8e6d7b', 'af189e6e-ff9d-5cdc-ae19-c87974834e37', 'home phone', '/həʊm fəʊn/', 'A2', 'phrase', 'Điện thoại cố định đặt tại nhà, không phải điện thoại di động.', 'a telephone that is connected to the wall and kept in a house for personal use.', 'My grandparents still prefer to use their home phone instead of a mobile.', 'Ông bà tôi vẫn thích dùng điện thoại bàn hơn là điện thoại di động.', '{\"en\": \"Please update your contact information, including your mobile number and your home phone, in our database.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng cập nhật thông tin liên lạc của bạn, bao gồm số di động và điện thoại bàn, trong cơ sở dữ liệu của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-phone-ljspeech-62c50b4b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-phone-cori-62c50b4b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/home-phone-fdbb359b.webp', '[\"landline\", \"fixed-line phone\"]', '[\"mobile phone\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"landline\", \"meaning\": \"điện thoại cố định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"contact number\", \"meaning\": \"số liên lạc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"landline\", \"note_vi\": \"Landline là thuật ngữ kỹ thuật, home phone là cách gọi thông dụng.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-phone-cori-62c50b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-phone-aru0-62c50b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-phone-aru5-62c50b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-phone-aru6-62c50b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-phone-aru10-62c50b4b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-phone-aru9-62c50b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-phone-aru3-62c50b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-phone-aru7-62c50b4b.mp3\", \"/sto