('3d32dfa7-1170-5d41-97cb-b4ea9298de6b', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'c77ac043-a59a-571c-9272-04627abd26ae', '68fb604f-b1b7-59d8-a889-396a04b093df', 'fault', '/fɔːlt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Trách nhiệm về một sai lầm hoặc điều gì đó không đúng.', 'Blame or culpability assigned to a person for an unfavorable outcome or error.', 'The manager admitted that the delay in production was entirely his fault.', 'Quản lý đã thừa nhận rằng sự chậm trễ trong sản xuất hoàn toàn là lỗi của ông ấy.', '{\"en\": \"It was the supplier\'s fault that the shipment arrived late to our warehouse last week.\", \"vi\": \"Đó là lỗi của nhà cung cấp khi lô hàng đến kho của chúng tôi trễ vào tuần trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fault-ljspeech-586cbf6a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fault-cori-586cbf6a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fault-e1459bea.webp', '[\"mistake\", \"error\"]', '[\"perfection\", \"virtue\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"find fault with\", \"meaning\": \"tìm lỗi/chê bai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"be at fault\", \"meaning\": \"có lỗi/chịu trách nhiệm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"faulty\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fault-cori-586cbf6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fault-aru0-586cbf6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fault-aru5-586cbf6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fault-aru6-586cbf6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fault-aru10-586cbf6a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fault-aru9-586cbf6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fault-aru3-586cbf6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fault-aru7-586cbf6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fault-aru8-586cbf6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fault-aru2-586cbf6a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v