('9ffdb7e6-be5b-5445-89a9-07fb33402dfc', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'c77ac043-a59a-571c-9272-04627abd26ae', '68fb604f-b1b7-59d8-a889-396a04b093df', 'hang the clothes', '/hæŋ ðə kləʊðz/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Hành động treo quần áo lên dây hoặc giá để làm khô.', 'to put wet garments on a line or rack to dry.', 'After washing, she always helps her mom hang the clothes outside.', 'Sau khi giặt xong, cô bé luôn giúp mẹ phơi quần áo bên ngoài.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel staff will hang the clothes in the laundry room after washing them.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên khách sạn sẽ treo quần áo trong phòng giặt sau khi giặt xong.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hang-the-clothes-ljspeech-e759c737.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hang-the-clothes-cori-e759c737.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hang-the-clothes-ae5f850c.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"hang the clothes out\", \"meaning\": \"mang quần áo ra phơi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hang the clothes to dry\", \"meaning\": \"treo quần áo để phơi khô\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hang\", \"note_vi\": \"động từ bất quy tắc quá khứ là hung, nhưng treo cổ là hanged\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hang-the-clothes-cori-e759c737.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hang-the-clothes-aru0-e759c737.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hang-the-clothes-aru5-e759c737.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hang-the-clothes-aru6-e759c737.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hang-the-clothes-aru10-e759c737.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hang-the-clothes-aru9-e759c737.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hang-the-clothes-aru3-e759c737.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hang-the-clothes-aru7-e759c737.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hang-the-clothes-aru8-e759c737.mp3\", \"/stora