('51052110-7959-510f-9a46-6145cbe0e997', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'c77ac043-a59a-571c-9272-04627abd26ae', '68fb604f-b1b7-59d8-a889-396a04b093df', 'guide book', '/ɡaɪd bʊk/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Sách cung cấp thông tin về một địa điểm du lịch.', 'a printed or digital manual giving information for visitors or users.', 'We bought a guide book to help us explore the city.', 'Chúng tôi đã mua một cuốn sách hướng dẫn để giúp chúng tôi khám phá thành phố.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel offers a free guide book with local restaurant listings.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn cung cấp sách hướng dẫn miễn phí có danh sách nhà hàng địa phương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-book-ljspeech-e1710f75.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-book-cori-e1710f75.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/guide-book-896cd8a3.webp', '[\"manual\", \"handbook\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"travel guide book\", \"meaning\": \"sách hướng dẫn du lịch\"}, {\"phrase\": \"buy a guide book\", \"meaning\": \"mua sách hướng dẫn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"guide\", \"note_vi\": \"guide là người hướng dẫn, guide book là sách.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-book-cori-e1710f75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-book-aru0-e1710f75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-book-aru5-e1710f75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-book-aru6-e1710f75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-book-aru10-e1710f75.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-book-aru9-e1710f75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-book-aru3-e1710f75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-book-aru7-e1710f75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-book-aru8-e1710f75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-book-aru2-e1710f75.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-book-ljspeech-e1710f75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-book-lt408-e1710f75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-book-lt138-e1710f75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-book-lt624-e1710f75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-book-lt396-e1710f75.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-book-lt498-e1710f75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-book-lt132-e1710f75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-book-lt288-e1710f75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-book-lt42-e1710f75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-book-lt90-e1710f75.mp3\"]}}', 'Guide book viết liền hoặc cách nhau, đều đúng.', 'travel', 1, 4),
('5a67adfc-ff0a-5d7d-aa44-8f0c77306ee1', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'c77ac043-a59a-571c-9272-04627abd26ae', '68fb604f-b1b7-59d8-a889-396a04b093df', 'choice', '/tʃɔɪs/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Hành động hoặc khả năng chọn một thứ từ nhiều thứ khác.', 'an act of selecting between two or more possibilities or the right to select.', 'You have a choice between two different desserts for tonight\'s dinner.', 'Bạn có một sự lựa chọn giữa hai món tráng miệng khác nhau cho bữa tối nay.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors had to make a difficult choice between two major software suppliers.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị đã phải đưa ra một lựa chọn khó khăn giữa hai nhà cung cấp phần mềm lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choice-ljspeech-630af549.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choice-cori-630af549.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/choice-8c918020.webp', '[\"option\", \"selection\", \"preference\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"make a choice\", \"meaning\": \"đưa ra lựa chọn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wide choice\", \"meaning\": \"sự lựa chọn đa dạng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"choose\", \"note_vi\": \"choose là động từ, choice là danh từ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"choose\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"choosy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choice-cori-630af549.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choice-aru0-630af549.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choice-aru5-630af549.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choice-aru6-630af549.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choice-aru10-630af549.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choice-aru9-630af549.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choice-aru3-630af549.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choice-aru7-630af549.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choice-aru8-630af549.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choice-aru2-630af549.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choice-ljspeech-630af549.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choice-lt408-630af549.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choice-lt138-630af549.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choice-lt624-630af549.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choice-lt396-630af549.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choice-lt498-630af549.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choice-lt132-630af549.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choice-lt288-630af549.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choice-lt42-630af549.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choice-lt90-630af549.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với động từ \'make\' (make a choice), không dùng \'do\'.', 'business', 1, 5),
('f85ded67-3580-5439-a00d-a3a404b7a9a4', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'c77ac043-a59a-571c-9272-04627abd26ae', '68fb604f-b1b7-59d8-a889-396a04b093df', 'public phone', '/ˈpʌblɪk fəʊn/', 'A2', 'phrase', 'Điện thoại đặt ở nơi công cộng để mọi người sử dụng.', 'a piece of equipment in a street or building that anyone can use to make calls.', 'I needed to make an urgent call but couldn\'t find a public phone nearby.', 'Tôi cần gọi gấp nhưng không tìm thấy điện thoại công cộng nào gần đó.', '{\"en\": \"The traveler looked for a public phone to call the hotel because his mobile died.\", \"vi\": \"Người du khách tìm một chiếc điện thoại công cộng để gọi khách sạn vì điện thoại di động của anh ấy hết pin.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-phone-ljspeech-c6c4b3eb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-phone-cori-c6c4b3eb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/public-phone-c03a63bd.webp', '[\"payphone\", \"telephone booth\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"use a public phone\", \"meaning\": \"sử dụng điện thoại công cộng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"find a public phone\", \"meaning\": \"tìm điện thoại công cộng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-phone-cori-c6c4b3eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-phone-aru0-c6c4b3eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-phone-aru5-c6c4b3eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-phone-aru6-c6c4b3eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-phone-aru10-c6c4b3eb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-phone-aru9-c6c4b3eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-phone-aru3-c6c4b3eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-phone-aru7-c6c4b3eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-phone-aru8-c6c4b3eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-phone-aru2-c6c4b3eb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-phone-ljspeech-c6c4b3eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-phone-lt408-c6c4b3eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-phone-lt138-c6c4b3eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-phone-lt624-c6c4b3eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-phone-lt396-c6c4b3eb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-phone-lt498-c6c4b3eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-phone-lt132-c6c4b3eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-phone-lt288-c6c4b3eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-phone-lt42-c6c4b3eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/public-phone-lt90-c6c4b3eb.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngày nay ít phổ biến do sự phát triển của điện thoại di động.', 'travel', 1, 6)
INSERT INTO system_vocabulary_words (id, set_id, topic_id, part_id, word, ipa, cefr, part_of_speech, meaning_vi, definition_en, example_en, example_vi, example_toeic, audio_us, audio_uk, image_url, synonyms, antonyms, phrases, confusables, word_family, audio_voices, note_vi, toeic_topic, difficulty_level, order_index) VALUES
('7909ecb1-f406-5fad-b3da-2a0b6b12b46e', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'c77ac043-a59a-571c-9272-04627abd26ae', '68fb604f-b1b7-59d8-a889-396a04b093df', 'cashier', '/kæˈʃɪə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Người làm việc tại cửa hàng, siêu thị để nhận tiền thanh toán.', 'a person whose job is to receive and pay out money in a shop or bank.', 'The cashier quickly scanned all the items and told me the total.', 'Người thu ngân nhanh chóng quét tất cả các mặt hàng và báo tổng số tiền cho tôi.', '{\"en\": \"The cashier processed the customer\'s refund and printed a new receipt for the transaction.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên thu ngân đã xử lý khoản hoàn tiền của khách hàng và in biên lai mới cho giao dịch.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-ljspeech-a5b42198.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-cori-a5b42198.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cashier-1cd1db27.webp', '[\"teller\", \"clerk\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"supermarket cashier\", \"meaning\": \"thu ngân siêu thị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cashier desk\", \"meaning\": \"quầy thu ngân\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"teller\", \"note_vi\": \"giao dịch viên ở ngân hàng, còn cashier thường ở cửa hàng\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-cori-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-aru0-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-aru5-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-aru6-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-aru10-a5b42198.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-aru9-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-aru3-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-aru7-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-aru8-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-aru2-a5b42198.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-ljspeech-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-lt408-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-lt138-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-lt624-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-lt396-a5b42198.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-lt498-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-lt132-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-lt288-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-lt42-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-lt90-a5b42198.mp3\"]}}', 'Ở ngân hàng, người ta thường dùng từ \'teller\' thay vì \'cashier\'.', 'shopping', 1, 7),
('5828dcf2-5c79-5b5d-b37a-c9dbe6ba370b', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'c77ac043-a59a-571c-9272-04627abd26ae', '68fb604f-b1b7-59d8-a889-396a04b093df', 'uniform', 'UK: /ˈjuːnɪˌfɔːm/ | US: /ˈjuːnɪˌfɔrm/', 'A2', 'noun', 'đồng phục', 'a matching set of clothing worn by members of a specific organization or workplace.', 'All employees must wear a company uniform.', 'Tất cả nhân viên phải mặc đồng phục công ty.', '{\"en\": \"All security personnel are required to wear a formal uniform while on duty.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả nhân viên bảo vệ được yêu cầu mặc đồng phục chỉnh tề khi đang làm nhiệm vụ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-ljspeech-8146160c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-cori-8146160c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/uniform-39262441.webp', '[\"outfit\", \"attire\", \"costume\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"wear a uniform\", \"meaning\": \"mặc đồng phục\"}, {\"phrase\": \"company uniform\", \"meaning\": \"đồng phục công ty\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"costume\", \"note_vi\": \"trang phục hóa trang hoặc biểu diễn sân khấu, không dùng cho đồng phục làm việc\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"uniform\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"uniformly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-cori-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-aru0-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-aru5-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-aru6-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-aru10-8146160c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-aru9-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-aru3-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-aru7-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-aru8-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-aru2-8146160c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-ljspeech-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-lt408-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-lt138-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-lt624-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-lt396-8146160c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-lt498-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-lt132-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-lt288-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-lt42-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-lt90-8146160c.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng mạo từ \'a\' (a uniform) thay vì \'an\' vì từ này bắt đầu bằng nguyên âm /juː/. Thường đi với động từ \'wear\' hoặc \'require\'.', 'office', 1, 8),
('34f7cebf-0345-5bf7-bcd3-e4dd14413bb4', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'c77ac043-a59a-571c-9272-04627abd26ae', '68fb604f-b1b7-59d8-a889-396a04b093df', 'choose', '/tʃuːz/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Lựa chọn một cái gì đó từ nhiều khả năng.', 'to pick one or more things from a group of different available options.', 'Applicants must choose their preferred interview time slot from the online system.', 'Thí sinh phải chọn khung giờ phỏng vấn yêu thích của mình từ hệ thống trực tuyến.', '{\"en\": \"Clients can choose from several payment plans that best suit their current financial budget requirements.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng có thể chọn từ một vài kế hoạch thanh toán phù hợp nhất với yêu cầu ngân sách tài chính hiện tại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choose-ljspeech-9477fdc8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choose-cori-9477fdc8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/choose-0a699419.webp', '[\"select\", \"pick\"]', '[\"reject\", \"refuse\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"choose between\", \"meaning\": \"lựa chọn giữa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"choose from\", \"meaning\": \"lựa chọn từ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"choice\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"choosy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choose-cori-9477fdc8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choose-aru0-9477fdc8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choose-aru5-9477fdc8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choose-aru6-9477fdc8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choose-aru10-9477fdc8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choose-aru9-9477fdc8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choose-aru3-9477fdc8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choose-aru7-9477fdc8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choose-aru8-9477fdc8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choose-aru2-9477fdc8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choose-ljspeech-9477fdc8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choose-lt408-9477fdc8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choose-lt138-9477fdc8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choose-lt624-9477fdc8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choose-lt396-9477fdc8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choose-lt498-9477fdc8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choose-lt132-9477fdc8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choose-lt288-9477fdc8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choose-lt42-9477fdc8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/choose-lt90-9477fdc8.mp3\"]}}', 'cần phân biệt với \'choice\' là danh từ.', 'business', 1, 9),
('31fb4861-18f2-5733-9c72-7aece527f772', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'c77ac043-a59a-571c-9272-04627abd26ae', '68fb604f-b1b7-59d8-a889-396a04b093df', 'check in', '/tʃɛk ɪn/', 'A2', 'phrasal verb', 'Đăng ký khi đến một nơi như khách sạn hoặc sân bay.', 'To register upon arrival at a place like hotel.', 'Please remember to check in at least two hours before your flight.', 'Xin hãy nhớ làm thủ tục ít nhất hai giờ trước chuyến bay của bạn.', '{\"en\": \"Guests must check in before noon to secure their room.\", \"vi\": \"Khách phải làm thủ tục trước buổi trưa để giữ phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-in-ljspeech-a0ba606b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-in-cori-a0ba606b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/check-in-8ae73c95.webp', '[\"register\", \"sign in\"]', '[\"check out\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"check in online\", \"meaning\": \"làm thủ tục trực tuyến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"check in early\", \"meaning\": \"làm thủ tục sớm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"check up\", \"note_vi\": \"check up là kiểm tra sức khỏe\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"check-in\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-in-cori-a0ba606b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-in-aru0-a0ba606b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-in-aru5-a0ba606b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-in-aru6-a0ba606b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-in-aru10-a0ba606b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-in-aru9-a0ba606b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-in-aru3-a0ba606b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-in-aru7-a0ba606b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-in-aru8-a0ba606b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-in-aru2-a0ba606b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/obj