('0cc79745-b715-52fc-b213-af69676756c1', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'c77ac043-a59a-571c-9272-04627abd26ae', '68fb604f-b1b7-59d8-a889-396a04b093df', 'surprising', '/səˈpraɪzɪŋ/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Gây bất ngờ hoặc không ngờ tới.', 'causing a feeling of wonder or disbelief because of being unexpected.', 'It was quite surprising to see him at the party, as he rarely goes out.', 'Khá bất ngờ khi thấy anh ấy ở bữa tiệc, vì anh ấy hiếm khi ra ngoài.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team reported a surprising increase in online sales during the holiday season.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm tiếp thị đã báo cáo một sự gia tăng đáng ngạc nhiên về doanh số bán hàng trực tuyến trong mùa lễ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprising-ljspeech-50b8de2e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprising-cori-50b8de2e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/surprising-2bb4f85e.webp', '[\"unexpected\", \"astonishing\", \"amazing\"]', '[\"predictable\", \"expected\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"surprising result\", \"meaning\": \"kết quả đáng ngạc nhiên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"surprising turn of events\", \"meaning\": \"bước ngoặt đáng ngạc nhiên\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"surprised\", \"note_vi\": \"surprised dùng cho cảm xúc của người, surprising cho tính chất sự vật\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"surprise\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"surprise\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"surprised\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"surprisingly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprising-cori-50b8de2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprising-aru0-50b8de2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprising-aru5-50b8de2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprising-aru6-50b8de2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprising-aru10-50b8de2e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprising-aru9-50b8de2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprising-aru3-50b8de2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprising-aru7-50b8de2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprising-aru8-50b8de2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprising-aru2-50b8de2e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprising-ljspeech-50b8de2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprising-lt408-50b8de2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprising-lt138-50b8de2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprising-lt624-50b8de2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprising-lt396-50b8de2e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprising-lt498-50b8de2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprising-lt132-50b8de2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprising-lt288-50b8de2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprising-lt42-50b8de2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprising-lt90-50b8de2e.mp3\"]}}', 'Đuôi -ing dùng để tả tính chất của sự vật, sự việc gây ra sự ngạc nhiên.', 'marketing', 1, 19),
('170ce700-b430-5550-914c-3a1adf15a263', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'c77ac043-a59a-571c-9272-04627abd26ae', '68fb604f-b1b7-59d8-a889-396a04b093df', 'sick', '/sɪk/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Không khỏe, bị bệnh.', 'not feeling well because of a physical illness or a health problem in the body.', 'He felt sick after eating too much ice cream.', 'Anh ấy cảm thấy ốm sau khi ăn quá nhiều kem.', '{\"en\": \"Please notify your supervisor immediately if you feel too sick to attend the morning briefing.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng thông báo cho cấp trên ngay lập tức nếu bạn cảm thấy quá ốm để tham dự buổi họp sáng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sick-ljspeech-6de7382d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sick-cori-6de7382d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sick-c5aaf061.webp', '[\"ill\", \"unwell\"]', '[\"healthy\", \"well\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel sick\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy ốm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sick leave\", \"meaning\": \"nghỉ ốm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"sickness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sick-cori-6de7382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sick-aru0-6de7382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sick-aru5-6de7382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sick-aru6-6de7382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sick-aru10-6de7382d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sick-aru9-6de7382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sick-aru3-6de7382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sick-aru7-6de7382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sick-aru8-6de7382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sick-aru2-6de7382d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sick-ljspeech-6de7382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sick-lt408-6de7382