('cef891d6-986f-5e97-a547-b06a547805dd', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'd5d755d8-5736-5814-a977-fb77ddf85f5f', '03d5c54c-74e0-522d-a082-470e551b62ae', 'wet', '/wet/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Ướt, ẩm ướt; có mưa.', 'covered with liquid or having a lot of rain during a period of time.', 'Don\'t sit on the grass; it\'s still wet from the morning dew.', 'Đừng ngồi lên cỏ; nó vẫn còn ướt vì sương buổi sáng.', '{\"en\": \"Commuters are advised to drive carefully because the roads are wet after the heavy rain.\", \"vi\": \"Người đi làm được khuyên nên lái xe cẩn thận vì đường xá đang ẩm ướt sau cơn mưa lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wet-ljspeech-c8e275e6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wet-cori-c8e275e6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/wet-5e95d3b0.webp', '[\"damp\", \"moist\"]', '[\"dry\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"wet weather\", \"meaning\": \"thời tiết ẩm ướt/có mưa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"soaking wet\", \"meaning\": \"ướt sũng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"whet\", \"note_vi\": \"whet có nghĩa là mài sắc hoặc kích thích sự thèm muốn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"wetness\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"wet\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wet-cori-c8e275e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wet-aru0-c8e275e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wet-aru5-c8e275e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wet-aru6-c8e275e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wet-aru10-c8e275e6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wet-aru9-c8e275e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wet-aru3-c8e275e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wet-aru7-c8e275e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wet-aru8-c8e275e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wet-aru2-c8e275e6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wet-ljspeech-c8e275e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wet-lt408-c8e275e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wet-lt138-c8e275e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wet-lt624-c8e275e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wet-lt396-c8e275e6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wet-lt498-c8e275e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wet-lt132-c8e275e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wet-lt288-c8e275e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wet-lt42-c8e275e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wet-lt90-c8e275e6.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm \'wet\' (ẩm ướt) với \'whet\' trong cụm \'whet your appetite\' (kích thích sự thèm ăn).', 'nature', 1, 11),
('1aefd0d1-0c10-5654-96e4-89e97ef02170', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'd5d755d8-5736-5814-a977-fb77ddf85f5f', '03d5c54c-74e0-522d-a082-470e551b62ae', 'swimming', '/ˈswɪmɪŋ/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Hoạt động di chuyển trong nước bằng cách dùng tay và chân.', 'the sport or activity of moving through water by moving your body parts.', 'Many children take regular swimming lessons at the community pool during vacation.', 'Nhiều trẻ em tham gia các buổi học bơi đều đặn tại hồ bơi cộng đồng trong kỳ nghỉ.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel offers various recreational facilities including a large outdoor swimming pool for guests.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn cung cấp nhiều cơ sở giải trí bao gồm một hồ bơi ngoài trời lớn cho khách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swimming-ljspeech-bb500fce.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swimming-cori-bb500fce.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/swimming-0b5d3186.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"go swimming\", \"meaning\": \"đi bơi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"swimming pool\", \"meaning\": \"hồ bơi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"swim\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"swimmer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swimming-cori-bb500fce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swimming-aru0-bb500fce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swimming-aru5-bb500fce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swimming-aru6-bb500fce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swimming-aru10-bb500fce.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swimming-aru9-bb500fce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swimming-aru3-bb500fce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swimming-aru7-bb500fce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swimming-aru8-bb500fce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swimming-aru2-bb500fce.mp3\"]}, 