('a44bc69e-4d7a-5657-8e9b-d7ab8d395f93', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'd5d755d8-5736-5814-a977-fb77ddf85f5f', '03d5c54c-74e0-522d-a082-470e551b62ae', 'patient', 'UK: /ˈpeɪʃnt/ | US: /ˈpeɪʃnt/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'kiên nhẫn', 'Able to remain calm and accept delays or difficulties without becoming annoyed or angry.', 'The manager is always patient with new employees.', 'Người quản lý luôn kiên nhẫn với nhân viên mới.', '{\"en\": \"Customer service representatives must remain patient when dealing with angry clients.\", \"vi\": \"Đại diện chăm sóc khách hàng phải luôn kiên nhẫn khi làm việc với những khách hàng đang tức giận.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-ljspeech-b1b0b8de.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-cori-b1b0b8de.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/patient-b930295d.webp', '[\"tolerant\", \"enduring\", \"calm\", \"understanding\"]', '[\"impatient\", \"irritable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"be patient with\", \"meaning\": \"kiên nhẫn với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"patient customer service\", \"meaning\": \"dịch vụ chăm sóc khách hàng kiên nhẫn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"patience\", \"note_vi\": \"Patience là danh từ (sự kiên nhẫn), trong khi patient là tính từ (kiên nhẫn) hoặc danh từ (bệnh nhân).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"patience\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"patiently\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-cori-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-aru0-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-aru5-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-aru6-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-aru10-b1b0b8de.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-aru9-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-aru3-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-aru7-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-aru8-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-aru2-b1b0b8de.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-ljspeech-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-lt408-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-lt138-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-lt624-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-lt396-b1b0b8de.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-lt498-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-lt132-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-lt288-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-lt42-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-lt90-b1b0b8de.mp3\"]}}', 'Cần phân biệt tính từ \'patient\' (kiên nhẫn - thường đi với \'with\') và danh từ \'patient\' (bệnh nhân).', 'customer service', 1, 13),
('6d4e6a86-e2cd-5a2e-b75e-a849b9f9aad2', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'd5d755d8-5736-5814-a977-fb77ddf85f5f', '03d5c54c-74e0-522d-a082-470e551b62ae', 'free time', '/friː taɪm/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Khoảng thời gian không phải làm việc hoặc học tập.', 'period when one is not working or busy with duties.', 'What do you usually do in your free time?', 'Bạn thường làm gì vào thời gian rảnh rỗi của mình?', '{\"en\": \"Employees can learn new skills in their free time after work.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên có thể học kỹ năng mới trong thời gian rảnh rỗi sau giờ làm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-time-ljspeech-c6871ef6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-time-cori-c6871ef6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/free-time-58fbd418.webp', '[\"leisure time\", \"spare time\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"free time activity\", \"meaning\": \"hoạt động rảnh rỗi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"spend free time\", \"meaning\": \"dành thời gian rảnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"free time hobby\", \"meaning\": \"sở thích lúc rảnh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"free period\", \"note_vi\": \"free time là thời gian rảnh chung, free period thường chỉ tiết trống.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-time-cori-c6871ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-time-aru0-c6871ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-time-aru5-c6871ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-time-aru6-c6871ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-time-aru10-c6871ef6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-time-aru9-c6871ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-time-aru3-c6871ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-time-aru7-c6871ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-time-aru8-c6871ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-time-aru2-c6871ef6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-time-ljspeech-c6871ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-time-lt408-c6871ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-time-lt138-c6871ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-time-lt624-c6871ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-time-lt396-c6871ef6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-time-lt498-c6871ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-time-lt132-c6871ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-time-lt288-c6871ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-time-lt42-c6871ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/free-time-lt90-c6871ef6.mp3\"]}}', 'Free time là danh từ không viết dính free-time.', 'daily', 1, 14),
('c9480cb1-d55e-57ec-bd4a-0179e3cea438', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'd5d755d8-5736-5814-a977-fb77ddf85f5f', '03d5c54c-74e0-522d-a082-470e551b62ae', 'telephone directory', '/ˈtɛlɪfəʊn dɪˈrɛktəri/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Cuốn sách liệt kê tên, địa chỉ và số điện thoại của người hoặc tổ chức.', 'a book that lists the names, addresses, and phone numbers of people or local businesses.', 'Before smartphones, people often looked up phone numbers in a large telephone directory.', 'Trước khi có điện thoại thông minh, mọi người thường tra cứu số điện thoại trong một cuốn danh bạ điện thoại lớn.', '{\"en\": \"Please check the telephone directory to find the contact number for our new supplier today.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng kiểm tra danh bạ điện thoại để tìm số liên lạc của nhà cung cấp mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/telephone-directory-ljspeech-c71d8032.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/telephone-directory-cori-c71d8032.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/telephone-directory-71b31584.webp', '[\"phone book\", \"directory\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"look up in the telephone directory\", \"meaning\": \"tra cứu trong danh bạ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"update the telephone directory\", \"meaning\": \"cập nhật danh bạ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/telephone-directory-cori-c71d8032.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/telephone-directory-aru0-c71d8032.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/telephone-directory-aru5-c71d8032.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/telephone-directory-aru6-c71d8032.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/telephone-directory-aru10-c71d8032.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/telephone-directory-aru9-c71d8032.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/telephone-directory-aru3-c71d8032.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/telephone-directory-aru7-c71d8032.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/telephone-directory-aru8-c71d8032.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/telephone-directory-aru2-c71d8032.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/telephone-directory-ljspeech-c71d8032.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/telephone-directory-lt408-c71d8032.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/telephone-directory-lt138-c71d8032.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/telephone-directory-lt624-c71d8032.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/telephone-directory-lt396-c71d8032.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/telephone-directory-lt498-c71d8032.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/telephone-directory-lt132-c71d8032.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/telephone-directory-lt288-c71d8032.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/telephone-directory-lt42-c71d8032.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/telephone-directory-lt90-c71d8032.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngày nay thường được thay thế bằng danh bạ kỹ thuật số.', 'office', 1, 15),
('52bda224-ec66-5a49-b974-65c38abb1c3c', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'd5d755d8-5736-5814-a977-fb77ddf85f5f', '03d5c54c-74e0-522d-a082-470e551b62ae', 'round trip', '/raʊnd trɪp/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Chuyến đi đến một địa điểm và quay trở lại điểm xuất phát.', 'a journey to a place and back again to the starting point.', 'A round trip fare is often cheaper than buying two separate one-way tickets.', 'Giá vé khứ hồi thường rẻ hơn so với việc mua hai vé một chiều riêng biệt.', '{\"en\": \"The company will reimburse all expenses for your round trip flight to Tokyo.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty sẽ hoàn trả mọi chi phí cho chuyến bay khứ hồi của bạn tới Tokyo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-ljspeech-1f401922.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-cori-1f401922.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/round-trip-895bd2b6.webp', '[\"return trip\"]', '[\"one-way trip\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"round trip ticket\", \"meaning\": \"vé khứ hồi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"round trip flight\", \"meaning\": \"chuyến bay khứ hồi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"one-way trip\", \"note_vi\": \"one-way trip là chuyến đi một chiều, trái ngược với round trip\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-cori-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-aru0-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-aru5-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-aru6-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-aru10-1f401922.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-aru9-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-aru3-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-aru7-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-aru8-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-aru2-1f401922.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-ljspeech-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-lt408-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-lt138-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-lt624-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-lt396-1f401922.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-lt498-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-lt132-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-lt288-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-lt42-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-lt90-1f401922.mp3\"]}}', 'Anh-Mỹ dùng round trip, Anh-Anh thường dùng return journey.', 'travel', 1, 16),
('8353a011-3074-5a8b-b02f-571520d2ac4f', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'd5d755d8-5736-5814-a977-fb77ddf85f5f', '03d5c54c-74e0-522d-a082-470e551b62ae', 'get dressed', '/ɡɛt drɛst/', 'A1', 'phrase', 'Mặc quần áo vào người.', 'to put clothes on your body before going out or starting the day.', 'She needs to get dressed before we leave for the party.', 'Cô ấy cần mặc đồ trước khi chúng ta đi dự tiệc.', '{\"en\": \"Hotel staff must get dressed in their official uniforms before their shifts begin.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên khách sạn phải mặc đồng phục chính thức trước khi ca làm việc của họ bắt đầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-dressed-ljspeech-30ad52a9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-dressed-cori-30ad52a9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/get-dressed-a1a2db7a.webp', '[\"dress\", \"clothe\"]', '[\"undress\", \"get undressed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"get dressed quickly\", \"meaning\": \"mặc đồ nhanh chóng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"get dressed up\", \"meaning\": \"diện đồ đẹp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dress\", \"note_vi\": \"dress vừa là động từ vừa là danh từ (váy)\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-dressed-cori-30ad52a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-dressed-aru0-30ad52a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-dressed-aru5-30ad52a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-dressed-aru6-30ad52a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-dressed-aru10-30ad52a9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-dressed-aru9-30ad52a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-dressed-aru3-30ad52a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-dressed-aru7-30ad52a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-dressed-aru8-30ad52a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-dressed-aru2-30ad52a9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-dressed-ljspeech-30ad52a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-dressed-lt408-30ad52a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-dressed-lt138-30ad52a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-dressed-lt624-30ad52a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-dressed-lt396-30ad52a9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-dressed-lt498-30ad52a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-dressed-lt132-30ad52a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-dressed-lt288-30ad52a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-dressed-lt42-30ad52a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-dressed-lt90-30ad52a9.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm từ này có nghĩa là mặc quần áo vào người, trái nghĩa là get undressed.', 'daily', 1, 17),
('3bdfd414-e5f9-5048-8dd6-87971b286bdf', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'd5d755d8-5736-5814-a977-fb77ddf85f5f', '03d5c54c-74e0-522d-a082-470e551b62ae', 'thunderstorm', '/ˈθʌndəstɔːm/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Cơn bão kèm theo sấm sét, mưa lớn và gió mạnh.', 'a storm with thunder and lightning and usually heavy rain falling from the sky.', 'The weather forecast predicted a severe thunderstorm for tonight.', 'Dự báo thời tiết đã dự đoán một cơn bão lớn có sấm sét vào tối nay.', '{\"en\": \"The flight was delayed for two hours because of a severe thunderstorm near the airport.\", \"vi\": \"Chuyến bay đã bị hoãn hai giờ đồng hồ vì một cơn bão có sấm sét gần sân bay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunderstorm-ljspeech-f35ce8f0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunderstorm-cori-f35ce8f0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/thunderstorm-1f1a6fef.webp', '[\"storm\", \"tempest\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"severe thunderstorm\", \"meaning\": \"cơn bão sấm sét dữ dội\"}, {\"phrase\": \"during a thunderstorm\", \"meaning\": \"trong suốt cơn bão\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunderstorm-cori-f35ce8f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunderstorm-aru0-f35ce8f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunderstorm-aru5-f35ce8f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunderstorm-aru6-f35ce8f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunderstorm-aru10-f35ce8f0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunderstorm-aru9-f35ce8f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunderstorm-aru3-f35ce8f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunderstorm-aru7-f35ce8f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunderstorm-aru8-f35ce8f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunderstorm-aru2-f35ce8f0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunderstorm-ljspeech-f35ce8f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunderstorm-lt408-f35ce8f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunderstorm-lt138-f35ce8f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunderstorm-lt624-f35ce8f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunderstorm-lt396-f35ce8f0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunderstorm-lt498-f35ce8f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunderstorm-lt132-f35ce8f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunderstorm-lt288-f35ce8f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunderstorm-lt42-f35ce8f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunderstorm-lt90-f35ce8f0.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường gây ảnh hưởng đến lịch trình di chuyển hoặc vận chuyển hàng hóa.', 'travel', 1, 18),
('41875e08-4325-5cd4-8f15-d95ff4a3b16c', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'd5d755d8-5736-5814-a977-fb77ddf85f5f', '03d5c54c-74e0-522d-a082-470e551b62ae', 'straight', 'UK: /streɪt/ | US: /streɪt/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'trực tiếp, thẳng', 'in a direct line or manner without turning, stopping, or detouring along the way.', 'Let\'s go straight to the meeting room.', 'Hãy đi thẳng đến phòng họp.', '{\"en\": \"After the conference ended, Mr. Tanaka went straight to the airport.\", \"vi\": \"Sau khi hội nghị kết thúc, ông Tanaka đã đi thẳng ra sân bay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-ljspeech-6ec09feb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-cori-6ec09feb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/straight-6ca7648d.webp', '[\"directly\", \"forthwith\", \"immediately\"]', '[\"indirectly\", \"circuitously\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"go straight to\", \"meaning\": \"đi thẳng tới\"}, {\"phrase\": \"get straight to the point\", \"meaning\": \"đi thẳng vào vấn đề\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"strait\", \"note_vi\": \"\'Strait\' (danh từ) có nghĩa là eo biển, đồng âm với \'straight\'.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"straight\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"straighten\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-cori-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-aru0-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-aru5-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-aru6-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-aru10-6ec09feb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-aru9-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-aru3-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-aru7-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-aru8-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-aru2-6ec09feb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-ljspeech-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-lt408-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-lt138-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-lt624-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-lt396-6ec09feb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-lt498-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-lt132-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-lt288-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-lt42-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-lt90-6ec09feb.mp3\"]}}', 'Khi làm trạng từ, \'straight\' có nghĩa là đi thẳng tới đâu mà không ghé lại (\'go straight to the airport\'). Tránh viết nhầm thành \'straightly\' (rất ít dùng).', 'travel', 1, 19),
('686ff887-051a-55bf-b502-eb2336615866', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'd5d755d8-5736-5814-a977-fb77ddf85f5f', '03d5c54c-74e0-522d-a082-470e551b62ae', 'experience', 'UK: /ɪkˈspɪəriəns/ | US: /ɪkˈspɪriəns/', 'B1', 'verb', 'trải qua, gặp phải', 'to undergo or feel a particular situation, event, or change directly yourself.', 'Customers experience delays due to high demand.', 'Khách hàng gặp phải sự chậm trễ do nhu cầu cao.', '{\"en\": \"Our online system experienced technical difficulties during peak hours.\", \"vi\": \"Hệ thống trực tuyến của chúng tôi đã gặp phải sự cố kỹ thuật trong giờ cao điểm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-ljspeech-f96da029.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-cori-f96da029.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/experience-33f448f8.webp', '[\"undergo\", \"encounter\", \"face\", \"go through\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"experience delays\", \"meaning\": \"bị chậm trễ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"experience growth\", \"meaning\": \"trải qua sự tăng trưởng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"experience\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"experienced\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-cori-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru0-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru5-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru6-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru10-f96da029.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru9-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru3-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru7-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru8-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru2-f96da029.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-ljspeech-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-lt408-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-lt138-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-lt624-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-lt396-f96da029.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-lt498-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-lt132-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-lt288-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-lt42-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-lt90-f96da029.mp3\"]}}', 'Khi là động từ, \'experience\' thường đi với các danh từ như \'delays\' (sự hoãn), \'difficulties\' (khó khăn), \'growth\' (sự tăng trưởng).', 'office', 1, 20),
('dfa4acf8-5062-5f3f-828a-0866c221484f', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'd5d755d8-5736-5814-a977-fb77ddf85f5f', '03d5c54c-74e0-522d-a082-470e551b62ae', 'do homework', '/duː həʊmwɜːk/', 'A1', 'phrase', 'Hoàn thành bài tập về nhà được giao.', 'to complete school work that is given to students to be done at home.', 'My sister always does her homework right after school.', 'Chị tôi luôn làm bài tập về nhà ngay sau giờ học.', '{\"en\": \"Before signing the merger contract, the executive board had to do homework on the competitor.\", \"vi\": \"Trước khi ký hợp đồng sáp nhập, ban điều hành phải tìm hiểu kỹ thông tin về đối thủ cạnh tranh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-homework-ljspeech-f95d4e56.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-homework-cori-f95d4e56.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/do-homework-018c66e6.webp', '[\"prepare\", \"study\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"do one\'s homework\", \"meaning\": \"chuẩn bị bài/tìm hiểu kỹ thông tin trước\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"make homework\", \"note_vi\": \"sai kết hợp từ, phải dùng động từ \'do\'\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-homework-cori-f95d4e56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-homework-aru0-f95d4e56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-homework-aru5-f95d4e56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-homework-aru6-f95d4e56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-homework-aru10-f95d4e56.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-homework-aru9-f95d4e56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-homework-aru3-f95d4e56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-homework-aru7-f95d4e56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-homework-aru8-f95d4e56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-homework-aru2-f95d4e56.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/st