('41a381cb-8446-513a-a603-a84153a21a68', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'e2e618fb-f3a3-5db6-a6f5-879c27cf5acc', '3c9857bf-417d-539a-83db-ad2b8151f876', 'ability', 'UK: /əˈbɪləti/ | US: /əˈbɪləti/', 'A2', 'noun', 'khả năng', 'the mental or physical capacity and skill required to perform a specific task successfully.', 'Her ability to adapt to new situations is impressive.', 'Khả năng thích ứng với các tình huống mới của cô ấy thật ấn tượng.', '{\"en\": \"Her ability to handle complex negotiations makes her an invaluable asset to the team.\", \"vi\": \"Khả năng xử lý các cuộc đàm phán phức tạp của cô ấy khiến cô trở thành tài sản vô giá đối với nhóm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-ljspeech-083dbabe.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-cori-083dbabe.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ability-e268772d.webp', '[\"capability\", \"capacity\", \"competence\", \"skill\"]', '[\"inability\", \"incompetence\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"demonstrate ability\", \"meaning\": \"thể hiện năng lực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ability to multitask\", \"meaning\": \"khả năng làm nhiều việc cùng lúc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"capacity\", \"note_vi\": \"sức chứa tối đa hoặc công suất làm việc, trong khi ability thiên về kỹ năng cá nhân\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"able\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"enable\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"unable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-cori-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-aru0-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-aru5-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-aru6-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-aru10-083dbabe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-aru9-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-aru3-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-aru7-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-aru8-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-aru2-083dbabe.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-ljspeech-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-lt408-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-lt138-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-lt624-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-lt396-083dbabe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-lt498-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-lt132-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-lt288-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-lt42-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-lt90-083dbabe.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc hay gặp: \'ability to do something\' (khả năng làm gì). Khác với capacity (sức chứa/khả năng tối đa).', 'human resources', 1, 8),
('a98d667d-4cbf-57f1-89ab-56ea3747ea54', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'e2e618fb-f3a3-5db6-a6f5-879c27cf5acc', '3c9857bf-417d-539a-83db-ad2b8151f876', 'make dinner', '/meɪk ˈdɪnə/', 'A1', 'collocation', 'Chuẩn bị hoặc nấu bữa ăn tối.', 'to prepare and cook food for the final meal of the day.', 'I\'m too tired to make dinner tonight; let\'s order pizza.', 'Tối nay tôi quá mệt để nấu bữa tối; chúng ta gọi pizza đi.', '{\"en\": \"Our team decided to make dinner at the office to celebrate finishing the project early.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm chúng tôi quyết định nấu bữa tối tại văn phòng để ăn mừng việc hoàn thành dự án sớm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-dinner-ljspeech-a40973ab.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-dinner-cori-a40973ab.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/make-dinner-4a21eb3f.webp', '[\"cook dinner\", \"prepare supper\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"make a meal\", \"meaning\": \"nấu một bữa ăn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prepare dinner\", \"meaning\": \"chuẩn bị bữa tối\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-dinner-cori-a40973ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-dinner-aru0-a40973ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-dinner-aru5-a40973ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-dinner-aru6-a40973ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-dinner-aru10-a40973ab.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-dinner-aru9-a40973ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-dinner-aru3-a40973ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-dinner-aru7-a40973ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-dinner-aru8-a40973ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-dinner-aru2-a40973ab.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-dinner-ljsp