('1bbfb370-cb50-519c-a9ef-8ec56c319c6e', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'fcc3cf59-4114-5e7c-adae-9c14da65935a', 'f2e37a94-f1ed-595b-bdad-5afc24e50b34', 'geographic feature', '/ˌdʒiːəˈɡræfɪk ˈfiːtʃə/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Đặc điểm tự nhiên của bề mặt Trái Đất, như núi, sông.', 'a natural part of the earth\'s surface such as a mountain, river, or valley.', 'Mountains, rivers, and lakes are common geographic features found in many countries.', 'Núi, sông và hồ là những đặc điểm địa lí phổ biến được tìm thấy ở nhiều quốc gia.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency highlighted every major geographic feature of the region in their new brochure.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty du lịch đã làm nổi bật mọi đặc điểm địa lý chính của khu vực trong tập quảng cáo mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geographic-feature-ljspeech-51a0df2d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geographic-feature-cori-51a0df2d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/geographic-feature-61b8a0a8.webp', '[\"landform\", \"terrain\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"natural geographic feature\", \"meaning\": \"đặc điểm địa lý tự nhiên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unique geographic feature\", \"meaning\": \"đặc điểm địa lý độc đáo\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geographic-feature-cori-51a0df2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geographic-feature-aru0-51a0df2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geographic-feature-aru5-51a0df2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geographic-feature-aru6-51a0df2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geographic-feature-aru10-51a0df2d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geographic-feature-aru9-51a0df2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geographic-feature-aru3-51a0df2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geographic-feature-aru7-51a0df2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geographic-feature-aru8-51a0df2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geographic-feature-aru2-51a0df2d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geographic-feature-ljspeech-51a0df2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geographic-feature-lt408-51a0df2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geographic-feature-lt138-51a0df2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geographic-feature-lt624-51a0df2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geographic-feature-lt396-51a0df2d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geographic-feature-lt498-51a0df2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geographic-feature-lt132-51a0df2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geographic-feature-lt288-51a0df2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geographic-feature-lt42-51a0df2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geographic-feature-lt90-51a0df2d.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường gặp trong các bài đọc về du lịch hoặc địa lý.', 'travel', 1, 5),
('658a4b90-7964-5e0c-9166-e9d1f8225418', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'fcc3cf59-4114-5e7c-adae-9c14da65935a', 'f2e37a94-f1ed-595b-bdad-5afc24e50b34', 'bored', '/bɔːd/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy không có gì thú vị để làm.', 'feeling tired and unhappy because something is not interesting or has no excitement.', 'Passengers grew bored while waiting three hours for their delayed flight to depart.', 'Hành khách trở nên chán nản khi phải chờ ba tiếng đồng hồ để chuyến bay bị hoãn của họ khởi hành.', '{\"en\": \"The audience looked bored during the long presentation about the company\'s annual financial report.\", \"vi\": \"Khán giả trông có vẻ chán nản trong suốt bài thuyết trình dài về báo cáo tài chính hàng năm của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-ljspeech-aa6897a9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-cori-aa6897a9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bored-e08d15ec.webp', '[\"uninterested\", \"weary\"]', '[\"interested\", \"excited\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel bored\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy chán\"}, {\"phrase\": \"get bored\", \"meaning\": \"trở nên chán\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"boring\", \"note_vi\": \"Bored là cảm giác của người, boring là tính chất của sự vật.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"bore\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"boring\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-cori-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-aru0-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-aru5-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-aru6-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-aru10-aa6897a9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-aru9-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-aru3-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-aru7-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-aru8-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-aru2-aa6897a9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-ljspeech-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-lt408-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-lt138-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-lt624-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-lt396-aa6897a9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-lt498-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-lt132-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-lt288-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-lt42-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-lt90-aa6897a9.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhầm lẫn kinh điển: I am bored (tôi thấy chán) vs The meeting is boring (cuộc họp gây chán).', 'office', 1, 6),
('e533d888-8d16-54de-8d45-334785622d97', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'fcc3cf59-4114-5e7c-adae-9c14da65935a', 'f2e37a94-f1ed-595b-bdad-5afc24e50b34', 'cash', '/kæʃ/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Tiền dưới dạng tiền giấy hoặc tiền xu.', 'money in the form of notes and coins rather than checks or credit cards.', 'Most small stores in this town accept cash only for minor purchases.', 'Hầu hết các cửa hàng nhỏ ở thị trấn này chỉ nhận tiền mặt cho các khoản mua sắm nhỏ.', '{\"en\": \"Small businesses often offer a discount to customers who pay for their orders in cash.\", \"vi\": \"Các doanh nghiệp nhỏ thường giảm giá cho những khách hàng thanh toán đơn hàng bằng tiền mặt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cash-ljspeech-a34c860a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cash-cori-a34c860a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cash-6662ac68.webp', '[\"currency\", \"money\"]', '[\"credit\", \"check\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"pay in cash\", \"meaning\": \"trả bằng tiền mặt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cash flow\", \"meaning\": \"dòng tiền\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cache\", \"note_vi\": \"phát âm giống nhưng nghĩa là bộ nhớ đệm hoặc nơi cất giấu\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"cash\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cash-cori-a34c860a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cash-aru0-a34c860a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cash-aru5-a34c860a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cash-aru6-a34c860a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cash-aru10-a34c860a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cash-aru9-a34c860a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cash-aru3-a34c860a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cash-aru7-a34c860a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cash-aru8-a34c860a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cash-aru2-a34c860a.