('e2b7b09b-e8ee-5198-99e5-c975b3701556', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'fcc3cf59-4114-5e7c-adae-9c14da65935a', 'f2e37a94-f1ed-595b-bdad-5afc24e50b34', 'afraid', '/əˈfreɪd/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy sợ hãi hoặc lo lắng về điều gì đó.', 'feeling worried or frightened because you think that something bad or dangerous might happen to you.', 'She was afraid of speaking in front of a large audience.', 'Cô ấy sợ phải nói chuyện trước một lượng lớn khán giả.', '{\"en\": \"The candidate was afraid that he would not pass the final interview for the position.\", \"vi\": \"Ứng viên sợ rằng anh ấy sẽ không vượt qua vòng phỏng vấn cuối cùng cho vị trí này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afraid-ljspeech-2ae38709.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afraid-cori-2ae38709.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/afraid-a2366e82.webp', '[\"scared\", \"frightened\"]', '[\"brave\", \"confident\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"afraid of\", \"meaning\": \"sợ cái gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"be afraid that\", \"meaning\": \"e rằng/sợ rằng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fear\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afraid-cori-2ae38709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afraid-aru0-2ae38709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afraid-aru5-2ae38709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afraid-aru6-2ae38709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afraid-aru10-2ae38709.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afraid-aru9-2ae38709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afraid-aru3-2ae38709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afraid-aru7-2ae38709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afraid-aru8-2ae38709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afraid-aru2-2ae38709.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afraid-ljspeech-2ae38709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afraid-lt408-2ae38709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afraid-lt138-2ae38709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afraid-lt624-2ae38709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afraid-lt396-2ae38709.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afraid-lt498-2ae38709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afraid-lt132-2ae38709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afraid-lt288-2ae38709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afraid-lt42-2ae38709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afraid-lt90-2ae38709.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để diễn đạt sự e ngại lịch sự trong công việc.', 'hr', 1, 8),
('662a3ebd-20ef-56d9-8d92-1f42b6712e3e', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'fcc3cf59-4114-5e7c-adae-9c14da65935a', 'f2e37a94-f1ed-595b-bdad-5afc24e50b34', 'answer the phone', '/ɑːnsə ðə fəʊn/', 'A1', 'phrase', 'Nhấc máy hoặc trả lời khi điện thoại reo.', 'to pick up the receiver or press a button to speak to a caller.', 'The receptionist was too busy typing documents to answer the phone immediately.', 'Nhân viên lễ tân quá bận gõ văn bản nên không thể nghe điện thoại ngay lập tức.', '{\"en\": \"Please answer the phone if it rings while I am in the meeting room today.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng nghe điện thoại nếu nó đổ chuông khi tôi đang ở trong phòng họp hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-the-phone-ljspeech-277543fb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-the-phone-cori-277543fb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/answer-the-phone-7e3c2ee8.webp', '[\"pick up\", \"take a call\"]', '[\"ignore a call\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"answer a call\", \"meaning\": \"trả lời một cuộc gọi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pick up the phone\", \"meaning\": \"nhấc máy điện thoại\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"return a call\", \"note_vi\": \"Là gọi lại cho người đã gọi nhỡ trước đó.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-the-phone-cori-277543fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-the-phone-aru0-277543fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-the-phone-aru5-277543fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-the-phone-aru6-277543fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-the-phone-aru10-277543fb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-the-phone-aru9-277543fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-the-phone-aru3-277543fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-the-phone-aru7-277543fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-the-phone-aru8-277543fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-the-phone-aru2-277543fb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-the-phone-ljspeech-277543fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-the-phone-lt408-277543fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-the-phone-lt138-277543fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-the-phone-lt624-277543fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-the-phone-lt396-277543fb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-the-phone-lt498-277543fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-the-phone-lt132-277543fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-the-phone-lt288-277543fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-the-phone-lt42-277543fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/answer-the-phone-lt90-277543fb.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng trong bối cảnh văn phòng khi có cuộc gọi đến.', 'office', 1, 9),
('149d7386-9259-503f-afd5-b79ccc552f6a', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'fcc3cf59-4114-5e7c-adae-9c14da65935a', 'f2e37a94-f1ed-595b-bdad-5afc24e50b34', 'dimple', '/ˈdɪmpl/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Một vết lõm nhỏ tự nhiên trên má hoặc cằm, thường xuất hiện khi cười.', 'a small hollow place on the skin, especially on the cheek.', 'Her smile was even more charming because of the cute dimple on her left cheek.', 'Nụ cười của cô ấy càng duyên dáng hơn nhờ chiếc lúm đồng tiền đáng yêu trên má trái.', '{\"en\": \"The new receptionist has a friendly smile with a small dimple on her left cheek.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên lễ tân mới có nụ cười thân thiện với một lúm đồng tiền nhỏ trên má trái.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimple-ljspeech-2517a00e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimple-cori-2517a00e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dimple-b28b93c5.webp', '[\"indentation\", \"hollow\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cheek dimple\", \"meaning\": \"lúm đồng tiền trên má\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cute dimple\", \"meaning\": \"lúm đồng tiền dễ thương\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pimple\", \"note_vi\": \"pimple là mụn trứng cá, tránh nhầm với lúm đồng tiền.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"dimpled\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimple-cori-2517a00e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimple-aru0-2517a00e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimple-aru5-2517a00e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimple-aru6-2517a00e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimple-aru10-2517a00e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimple-aru9-2517a00e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimple-aru3-2517a00e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimple-aru7-2517a00e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimple-aru8-2517a00e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/o