('7274429e-80c3-5a5d-b012-f818c8f440aa', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'fcc3cf59-4114-5e7c-adae-9c14da65935a', 'f2e37a94-f1ed-595b-bdad-5afc24e50b34', 'tennis', '/ˈtenɪs/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Môn thể thao dùng vợt đánh bóng qua lưới.', 'a sport in which opponents use rackets to strike a small rubber ball across a central barrier', 'They play tennis every Saturday morning at the local park.', 'Họ chơi quần vợt vào mỗi sáng thứ Bảy tại công viên địa phương.', '{\"en\": \"The company organizes an annual tennis tournament to encourage physical activity among employees.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty tổ chức một giải đấu quần vợt thường niên để khuyến khích hoạt động thể chất của nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tennis-ljspeech-9c881bdb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tennis-cori-9c881bdb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tennis-3ccfe2d3.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"tennis court\", \"meaning\": \"sân quần vợt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tennis racket\", \"meaning\": \"vợt tennis\"}, {\"phrase\": \"play tennis\", \"meaning\": \"chơi quần vợt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"table tennis\", \"note_vi\": \"table tennis là bóng bàn, chơi trên bàn nhỏ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"tennis player\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tennis-cori-9c881bdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tennis-aru0-9c881bdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tennis-aru5-9c881bdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tennis-aru6-9c881bdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tennis-aru10-9c881bdb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tennis-aru9-9c881bdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tennis-aru3-9c881bdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tennis-aru7-9c881bdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tennis-aru8-9c881bdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tennis-aru2-9c881bdb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tennis-ljspeech-9c881bdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tennis-lt408-9c881bdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tennis-lt138-9c881bdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tennis-lt624-9c881bdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tennis-lt396-9c881bdb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tennis-lt498-9c881bdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tennis-lt132-9c881bdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tennis-lt288-9c881bdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tennis-lt42-9c881bdb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tennis-lt90-9c881bdb.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn cách viết hai chữ \'n\' trong từ \'tennis\'.', 'daily', 1, 15),
('03fd0501-c7fa-5575-a550-f72177fcb1e4', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'fcc3cf59-4114-5e7c-adae-9c14da65935a', 'f2e37a94-f1ed-595b-bdad-5afc24e50b34', 'whiteboard', 'UK: /ˈwaɪtbɔːd/ | US: /ˈwaɪtbɔrd/', 'A2', 'noun', 'bảng trắng', 'a smooth glossy surface designed for writing on with dry-erase markers.', 'Please write the agenda on the whiteboard for everyone to see.', 'Xin hãy viết chương trình nghị sự lên bảng trắng để mọi người cùng xem.', '{\"en\": \"The manager wrote the strategic key metrics on the whiteboard during the meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã viết các chỉ số chiến lược chính lên bảng trắng trong suốt cuộc họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-ljspeech-d70ea575.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-cori-d70ea575.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/whiteboard-17f40238.webp', '[\"dry-erase board\", \"writing board\"]', '[\"blackboard\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"interactive whiteboard\", \"meaning\": \"bảng tương tác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"write on the whiteboard\", \"meaning\": \"viết lên bảng trắng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-cori-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-aru0-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-aru5-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-aru6-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-aru10-d70ea575.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-aru9-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-aru3-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-aru7-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-aru8-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-aru2-d70ea575.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-ljspeech-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-lt408-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-lt138-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-lt624-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-lt396-d70ea575.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-lt498-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-lt132-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-lt288-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-lt42-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-lt90-d70ea575.mp3\"]}}', 'Viết liền thành một từ duy nhất (\'whiteboard\'), hay đi cùng động từ \'write on\' hoặc \'erase\'.', 'office', 1, 16),
('faa89561-2e72-588c-a484-e7ef41a6d940', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'fcc3cf59-4114-5e7c-adae-9c14da65935a', 'f2e37a94-f1ed-595b-bdad-5afc24e50b34', 'e-commerce', '/iːˈkɒmɜːs/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Việc mua bán hàng hóa và dịch vụ qua internet.', 'the activity of buying and selling goods or services through the use of the internet.', 'The rise of e-commerce has transformed the retail industry.', 'Sự phát triển của thương mại điện tử đã thay đổi ngành bán lẻ.', '{\"en\": \"Our company is expanding its e-commerce platform to reach more international customers this fiscal year.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi đang mở rộng nền tảng thương mại điện tử để tiếp cận khách hàng quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/e-commerce-ljspeech-91973952.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/e-commerce-cori-91973952.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/e-commerce-ac95320a.webp', '[\"online shopping\", \"online retail\"]', '[\"brick-and-mortar\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"e-commerce platform\", \"meaning\": \"nền tảng thương mại điện tử\"}, {\"phrase\": \"e-commerce business\", \"meaning\": \"kinh doanh trực tuyến\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/e-commerce-cori-91973952.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/e-commerce-aru0-91973952.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/e-commerce-aru5-91973952.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/e-commerce-aru6-91973952.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/e-commerce-aru10-91973952.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/e-commerce-aru9-91973952.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/e-commerce-aru3-91973952.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/e-commerce-aru7-91973952.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/e-commerce-aru8-91973952.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/e-commerce-aru2-91973952.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/e-commerce-ljspeech-91973952.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/e-commerce-lt408-91973952.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/e-commerce-lt138-91973952.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/e-commerce-lt624-91973952.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/e-commerce-lt396-91973952.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/e-commerce-lt498-91973952.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/e-commerce-lt132-91973952.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/e-commerce-lt288-91973952.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/e-commerce-lt42-91973952.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/e-commerce-lt90-91973952.mp3\"]}}', 'Viết tắt của electronic commerce.', 'business', 1, 17),
('12463abf-f442-5159-8003-b6610cbd2a66', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'fcc3cf59-4114-5e7c-adae-9c14da65935a', 'f2e37a94-f1ed-595b-bdad-5afc24e50b34', 'little', '/ˈlɪtl̩/', 'A2', 'determiner', 'Một lượng nhỏ, không đáng kể.', 'a very small amount of something, which is not enough to be useful or satisfactory.', 'There was little hope of finding the lost keys.', 'Có rất ít hy vọng tìm thấy những chiếc chìa khóa bị mất.', '{\"en\": \"There was little time left to finish the report before the deadline this afternoon.\", \"vi\": \"Hầu như không còn thời gian để hoàn thành bản báo cáo trước hạn chót chiều nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-ljspeech-45022297.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-cori-45022297.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/little-c89237fa.webp', '[\"hardly any\", \"scarcely any\"]', '[\"much\", \"plenty\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"little time\", \"meaning\": \"ít thời gian\"}, {\"phrase\": \"little chance\", \"meaning\": \"ít cơ hội\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"a little\", \"note_vi\": \"a little mang nghĩa tích cực (có một chút), little mang nghĩa phủ định (gần như không).\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-cori-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-aru0-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-aru5-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-aru6-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-aru10-45022297.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-aru9-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-aru3-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-aru7-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-aru8-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-aru2-45022297.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-ljspeech-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-lt408-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-lt138-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-lt624-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-lt396-45022297.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-lt498-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-lt132-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-lt288-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-lt42-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-lt90-45022297.mp3\"]}}', 'Mang sắc thái phủ định, nhấn mạnh sự thiếu hụt.', 'business', 1, 18),
('9c5f4c43-7dd1-58ef-9b82-c4fc954db8d7', '306b49d3-4d3a-5fda-97a7-d5790b808339', 'fcc3cf59-4114-5e7c-adae-9c14da65935a', 'f2e37a94-f1ed-595b-bdad-5afc24e50b34', 'stressed', '/strɛst/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy lo lắng, áp lực hoặc căng thẳng về tinh thần.', 'feeling worried and unable to relax because of too many problems or demands.', 'The accounting team was extremely stressed while preparing the annual tax report.', 'Đội ngũ kế toán đã cực kỳ căng thẳng khi chuẩn bị báo cáo thuế hàng năm.', '{\"en\": \"The manager looked stressed after handling several complaints from clients.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý trông có vẻ căng thẳng sau khi xử lý nhiều khiếu nại từ khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stressed-ljspeech-8bba0d48.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stressed-cori-8bba0d48.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stressed-dc4ece88.webp', '[\"anxious\", \"overwhelmed\", \"tense\"]', '[\"relaxed\", \"calm\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel stressed\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy căng thẳng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stressed out\", \"meaning\": \"kiệt sức vì áp lực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stressed about\", \"meaning\": \"căng thẳng về điều gì đó\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"stressful\", \"note_vi\": \"stressful mô tả tình huống gây áp lực, stressed mô tả người cảm thấy áp lực\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"stress\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"stress\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"stressful\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"stressfully\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stressed-cori-8bba0d48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stressed-aru0-8bba0d48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stressed-aru5-8bba0d48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stressed-aru6-8bba0d48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stressed-aru10-8bba0d48.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/