('077e2add-8456-5afa-8b09-d7581316fc9f', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '119c124a-72bb-519e-bd8d-540b0a7b393b', 'bae9b29a-3df4-5bc5-809a-a4e06ae01343', 'recruiter', 'UK: /rɪˈkruːtər/ | US: /rɪˈkruːtər/', 'B2', 'noun', 'người tuyển dụng', 'A person whose job is to find and attract qualified candidates for employment.', 'The recruiter will contact selected candidates next week.', 'Người tuyển dụng sẽ liên hệ với các ứng viên được chọn vào tuần tới.', '{\"en\": \"An executive recruiter contacted Ms. Garcia to discuss an opening for a regional sales director position.\", \"vi\": \"Một chuyên viên tuyển dụng nhân sự cao cấp đã liên hệ với cô Garcia để thảo luận về một vị trí Giám đốc Bán hàng Khu vực đang trống.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recruiter-ljspeech-93d225ea.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recruiter-cori-93d225ea.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/recruiter-1079b81e.webp', '[\"headhunter\", \"hiring officer\", \"employment specialist\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"executive recruiter\", \"meaning\": \"chuyên viên tuyển dụng nhân sự cấp cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"corporate recruiter\", \"meaning\": \"nhà tuyển dụng nội bộ của doanh nghiệp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"recruit\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"recruitment\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recruiter-cori-93d225ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recruiter-aru0-93d225ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recruiter-aru5-93d225ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recruiter-aru6-93d225ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recruiter-aru10-93d225ea.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recruiter-aru9-93d225ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recruiter-aru3-93d225ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recruiter-aru7-93d225ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recruiter-aru8-93d225ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recruiter-aru2-93d225ea.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recruiter-ljspeech-93d225ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recruiter-lt408-93d225ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recruiter-lt138-93d225ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recruiter-lt624-93d225ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recruiter-lt396-93d225ea.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recruiter-lt498-93d225ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recruiter-lt132-93d225ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recruiter-lt288-93d225ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recruiter-lt42-93d225ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recruiter-lt90-93d225ea.mp3\"]}}', '\'Recruiter\' là chuyên viên/nhà tuyển dụng (người), phân biệt với \'recruitment\' (quá trình tuyển dụng).', 'human resources', 1, 17),
('b2daa02d-c066-56d9-a891-019dfb4c83f1', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '119c124a-72bb-519e-bd8d-540b0a7b393b', 'bae9b29a-3df4-5bc5-809a-a4e06ae01343', 'warrant', '/ˈwɒrənt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một tài liệu hợp pháp cho phép thực hiện một hành động.', 'an official paper that gives legal permission to do something.', 'The police obtained a search warrant before entering the suspect\'s apartment.', 'Cảnh sát đã có lệnh khám xét trước khi vào căn hộ của nghi phạm.', '{\"en\": \"The auditor requested an official warrant before inspecting the confidential accounting documents.\", \"vi\": \"Kiểm toán viên yêu cầu một giấy phép chính thức trước khi kiểm tra các chứng từ kế toán bảo mật.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warrant-ljspeech-e11ed3af.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warrant-cori-e11ed3af.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/warrant-17bb0a20.webp', '[\"authorization\", \"permit\", \"license\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"search warrant\", \"meaning\": \"lệnh khám xét\"}, {\"phrase\": \"issue a warrant\", \"meaning\": \"ban hành lệnh hoặc giấy phép\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"guarantee\", \"note_vi\": \"guarantee là bảo hành hay cam kết, warrant trong kinh doanh/luật là giấy phép/lệnh.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"warrant\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"warranted\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warrant-cori-e11ed3af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warrant-aru0-e11ed3af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warrant-aru5-e11ed3af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warrant-aru6-e11ed3af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warrant-aru10-e11ed3af.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warrant-aru9-e11ed3af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warrant-aru3-e11ed3af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warrant-aru7-e11ed3af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warrant-aru8-e11ed3af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warrant-aru2-e11ed3af.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warrant-ljspeech-e11ed3af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warrant-lt408-e11ed3af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warrant-lt138-e11ed3af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warrant-lt624-e11ed3af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warrant-lt396-e11ed3af.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warrant-lt498-e11ed3af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warrant-lt132-e11ed3af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warrant-lt288-e11ed3af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warrant-lt42-e11ed3af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warrant-lt90-e11ed3af.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC và văn bản pháp lý, warrant thường mang nghĩa giấy phép hoặc văn bản ủy quyền.', 'law', 1, 18),
('ad9356b0-4033-5906-a952-da9c6b431ff1', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '119c124a-72bb-519e-bd8d-540b0a7b393b', 'bae9b29a-3df4-5bc5-809a-a4e06ae01343', 'yield', '/jiːld/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Lượng sản phẩm, lợi nhuận hoặc kết quả được tạo ra.', 'the total amount of profit or products produced by a business or activity.', 'The new farming techniques significantly increased the crop yield this season.', 'Các kỹ thuật canh tác mới đã làm tăng đáng kể sản lượng cây trồng trong mùa này.', '{\"en\": \"The factory increased its daily yield by upgrading the old machinery in the production line.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà máy đã tăng sản lượng hàng ngày bằng cách nâng cấp máy móc cũ trong dây chuyền sản xuất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-ljspeech-f12e1e8f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-cori-f12e1e8f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/yield-cfbddf2f.webp', '[\"output\", \"production\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"crop yield\", \"meaning\": \"sản lượng mùa màng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"high yield\", \"meaning\": \"lợi nhuận cao\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"yield\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-cori-f12e1e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-aru0-f12e1e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-aru5-f12e1e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-aru6-f12e1e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-aru10-f12e1e8f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-aru9-f12e1e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-aru3-f12e1e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-aru7-f12e1e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-aru8-f12e1e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-aru2-f12e1e8f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-ljspeech-f12e1e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-lt408-f12e1e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-lt138-f12e1e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-lt624-f12e1e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-lt396-f12e1e8f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-lt498-f12e1e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-lt132-f12e1e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-lt288-f12e1e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-lt42-f12e1e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-lt90-f12e1e8f.mp3\"]}}', 'Yield vừa là danh từ (sản lượng) vừa là động từ (sinh ra/nhượng bộ).', 'manufacturing', 1, 19),
('242d3725-fade-57b4-b97d-0b94a0c29291', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '119c124a-72bb-519e-bd8d-540b0a7b393b', 'bae9b29a-3df4-5bc5-809a-a4e06ae01343', 'contentious', '/kənˈtenʃəs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Gây ra nhiều tranh luận, bất đồng hoặc xung đột.', 'causing or likely to cause a lot of disagreement and argument between people.', 'The new policy proved to be highly contentious among employees.', 'Chính sách mới đã chứng tỏ là gây tranh cãi gay gắt giữa các nhân viên.', '{\"en\": \"The board members had a contentious meeting regarding the new budget plan.\", \"vi\": \"Các thành viên ban giám đốc đã có một cuộc họp gây nhiều tranh cãi về kế hoạch ngân sách mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentious-ljspeech-cf4ed100.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentious-cori-cf4ed100.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/contentious-474d735e.webp', '[\"controversial\", \"disputable\", \"arguable\"]', '[\"uncontroversial\", \"agreeable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"contentious issue\", \"meaning\": \"vấn đề gây tranh cãi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly contentious\", \"meaning\": \"rất dễ gây tranh cãi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"content\", \"note_vi\": \"content nghĩa là hài lòng hoặc nội dung, không phải tranh cãi.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"contention\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"contend\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentious-cori-cf4ed100.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentious-aru0-cf4ed100.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentious-aru5-cf4ed100.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentious-aru6-cf4ed100.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentious-aru10-cf4ed100.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentious-aru9-cf4ed100.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentious-aru3-cf4ed100.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentious-aru7-cf4ed100.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentious-aru8-cf4ed100.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentious-aru2-cf4ed100.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentious-ljspeech-cf4ed100.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentious-lt408-cf4ed100.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentious-lt138-cf4ed100.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentious-lt624-cf4ed100.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentious-lt396-cf4ed100.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentious-lt498-cf4ed100.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentious-lt132-cf4ed100.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentious-lt288-cf4ed100.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentious-lt42-cf4ed100.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentious-lt90-cf4ed100.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với \'content\' (nội dung/hài lòng). Từ này mang nghĩa tiêu cực, gây tranh cãi.', 'business', 1, 20),
('add563e7-594c-5daf-b6e6-4caf428a8db9', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '119c124a-72bb-519e-bd8d-540b0a7b393b', 'bae9b29a-3df4-5bc5-809a-a4e06ae01343', 'characterize', '/ˈkærəktəraɪz/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Mô tả đặc điểm nổi bật của ai đó hoặc cái gì đó.', 'to describe the qualities or features of someone or something in a particular way.', 'Rapid innovation and fierce competition characterize the modern smartphone market.', 'Sự đổi mới nhanh chóng và sự cạnh tranh khốc liệt đặc trưng cho thị trường điện thoại thông minh hiện đại.', '{\"en\": \"The new software is characterized by its user-friendly interface and fast processing speed.\", \"vi\": \"Phần mềm mới được đặc trưng bởi giao diện thân thiện với người dùng và tốc độ xử lý nhanh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/characterize-ljspeech-a04111d7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/characterize-cori-a04111d7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/characterize-a0d61b07.webp', '[\"describe\", \"portray\", \"distinguish\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"be characterized by\", \"meaning\": \"được đặc trưng bởi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"character\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"characteristic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/characterize-cori-a04111d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/characterize-aru0-a04111d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/characterize-aru5-a04111d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/characterize-aru6-a04111d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/characterize-aru10-a04111d7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/characterize-aru9-a04111d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/characterize-aru3-a04111d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/characterize-aru7-a04111d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/characterize-aru8-a04111d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/characterize-aru2-a04111d7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/characterize-ljspeech-a04111d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/characterize-lt408-a04111d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/characterize-lt138-a04111d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/characterize-lt624-a04111d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/characterize-lt396-a04111d7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/characterize-lt498-a04111d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/characterize-lt132-a04111d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/characterize-lt288-a04111d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/characterize-lt42-a04111d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/characterize-lt90-a04111d7.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng ở dạng bị động \'be characterized by\' để mô tả tính năng sản phẩm.', 'technology', 1, 21),
('7fecafd2-28e1-550a-82c4-012304a9c007', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '119c124a-72bb-519e-bd8d-540b0a7b393b', 'bae9b29a-3df4-5bc5-809a-a4e06ae01343', 'eloquent', '/ˈeləkwənt/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'hùng hồn, có khả năng diễn đạt lưu loát và thuyết phục.', 'able to express ideas or feelings clearly and effectively in a convincing way.', 'The attorney presented an eloquent argument that convinced the jury of his client\'s innocence.', 'Luật sư đã đưa ra một lập luận hùng hồn thuyết phục bồi thẩm đoàn về sự vô tội của thân chủ.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO gave an eloquent speech during the annual meeting to inspire the new employees.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc điều hành đã có bài phát biểu hùng hồn trong cuộc họp thường niên để truyền cảm hứng cho nhân viên mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eloquent-ljspeech-d2c26414.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eloquent-cori-d2c26414.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/eloquent-fda6e2c6.webp', '[\"articulate\", \"persuasive\"]', '[\"inarticulate\", \"vague\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"eloquent speaker\", \"meaning\": \"người diễn thuyết hùng hồn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"eloquent silence\", \"meaning\": \"sự im lặng đầy ý nghĩa\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"eloquence\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eloquent-cori-d2c26414.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eloquent-aru0-d2c26414.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eloquent-aru5-d2c26414.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eloquent-aru6-d2c26414.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eloquent-aru10-d2c26414.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eloquent-aru9-d2c26414.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eloquent-aru3-d2c26414.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eloquent-aru7-d2c26414.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eloquent-aru8-d2c26414.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eloquent-aru2-d2c26414.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eloquent-ljspeech-d2c26414.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eloquent-lt408-d2c26414.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eloquent-lt138-d2c26414.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eloquent-lt624-d2c26414.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eloquent-lt396-d2c26414.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eloquent-lt498-d2c26414.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eloquent-lt132-d2c26414.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eloquent-lt288-d2c26414.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eloquent-lt42-d2c26414.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eloquent-lt90-d2c26414.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để khen ngợi khả năng thuyết trình hoặc viết lách xuất sắc.', 'office', 1, 22),
('1f065e77-e053-5123-b020-de18cd0a7e7b', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '119c124a-72bb-519e-bd8d-540b0a7b393b', 'bae9b29a-3df4-5bc5-809a-a4e06ae01343', 'recyclable', 'UK: /ˌriːˈsaɪkləbl/ | US: /ˌriːˈsaɪkləbl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'có thể tái chế', 'Capable of being processed and treated so that it can be used again.', 'We only use recyclable materials for all our products.', 'Chúng tôi chỉ sử dụng vật liệu có thể tái chế cho tất cả sản phẩm của mình.', '{\"en\": \"All packaging materials used by our shipping department are 100% recyclable.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả các vật liệu đóng gói được bộ phận vận chuyển của chúng tôi sử dụng đều có thể tái chế 100%.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recyclable-ljspeech-c571b29a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recyclable-cori-c571b29a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/recyclable-b54eeba4.webp', '[\"reusable\", \"reprocessable\"]', '[\"non-recyclable\", \"disposable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"recyclable material\", \"meaning\": \"vật liệu có thể tái chế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"recyclable packaging\", \"meaning\": \"bao bì có thể tái chế\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"recycle\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"recycling\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recyclable-cori-c571b29a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recyclable-aru0-c571b29a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recyclable-aru5-c571b29a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recyclable-aru6-c571b29a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recyclable-aru10-c571b29a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recyclable-aru9-c571b29a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recyclable-aru3-c571b29a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recyclable-aru7-c571b29a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recyclable-aru8-c571b29a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recyclable-aru2-c571b29a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recyclable-ljspeech-c571b29a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recyclable-lt408-c571b29a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recyclable-lt138-c571b29a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recyclable-lt624-c571b29a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recyclable-lt396-c571b29a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recyclable-lt498-c571b29a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recyclable-lt132-c571b29a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recyclable-lt288-c571b29a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recyclable-lt42-c571b29a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recyclable-lt90-c571b29a.mp3\"]}}', 'Hậu tố \'-able\' thể hiện tính khả thi. \'Recyclable materials\' = vật liệu có thể tái chế được.', 'environment', 1, 23),
('a48c0648-b740-5a9f-bd47-0da35e80ad6f', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '119c124a-72bb-519e-bd8d-540b0a7b393b', 'bae9b29a-3df4-5bc5-809a-a4e06ae01343', 'curtail', '/kɜːˈteɪl/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Cắt giảm hoặc hạn chế một cái gì đó.', 'to reduce or limit something, especially spending, time, or activity.', 'The company decided to curtail its advertising budget due to low sales.', 'Công ty quyết định cắt giảm ngân sách quảng cáo do doanh số bán hàng thấp.', '{\"en\": \"We must curtail travel expenses this quarter to maintain profitability.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta phải cắt giảm chi phí đi lại trong quý này để duy trì lợi nhuận.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curtail-ljspeech-9fffc7bd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curtail-cori-9fffc7bd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/curtail-342bdd21.webp', '[\"reduce\", \"shorten\", \"restrict\"]', '[\"extend\", \"expand\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"curtail spending\", \"meaning\": \"cắt giảm chi tiêu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"curtail production\", \"meaning\": \"cắt giảm sản xuất\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"entail\", \"note_vi\": \"đòi hỏi hoặc kéo theo điều gì\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"curtailment\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curtail-cori-9fffc7bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curtail-aru0-9fffc7bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curtail-aru5-9fffc7bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curtail-aru6-9fffc7bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curtail-aru10-9fffc7bd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curtail-aru9-9fffc7bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curtail-aru3-9fffc7bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curtail-aru7-9fffc7bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curtail-aru8-9fffc7bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curtail-aru2-9fffc7bd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curtail-ljspeech-9fffc7bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curtail-lt408-9fffc7bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curtail-lt138-9fffc7bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curtail-lt624-9fffc7bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curtail-lt396-9fffc7bd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curtail-lt498-9fffc7bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curtail-lt132-9fffc7bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curtail-lt288-9fffc7bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curtail-lt42-9fffc7bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curtail-lt90-9fffc7bd.mp3\"]}}', 'Curtail hay đi với ngân sách (budget), chi phí (expenses), hoạt động.', 'finance', 1, 24),
('bfa781ba-97ec-549d-8c13-d592da10a426', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '119c124a-72bb-519e-bd8d-540b0a7b393b', 'bae9b29a-3df4-5bc5-809a-a4e06ae01343', 'supremacy', '/suˈpreməsi/', 'C1', 'noun', 'vị trí có quyền lực hoặc quyền hạn cao nhất, vượt trội hơn tất cả.', 'the position of having the most power, authority, or success in a group.', 'The team fought hard to maintain their supremacy in the league for another season.', 'Đội đã chiến đấu hết mình để duy trì quyền tối cao của mình trong giải đấu thêm một mùa giải nữa.', '{\"en\": \"The tech giant established its market supremacy by launching the innovative smartphone series.\", \"vi\": \"Gã khổng lồ công nghệ đã thiết lập vị thế thống trị thị trường bằng cách ra mắt dòng điện thoại thông minh sáng tạo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supremacy-ljspeech-2af3e512.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supremacy-cori-2af3e512.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/supremacy-84747a75.webp', '[\"dominance\", \"superiority\", \"mastery\"]', '[\"inferiority\", \"weakness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"market supremacy\", \"meaning\": \"sự thống trị thị trường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"establish supremacy\", \"meaning\": \"thiết lập vị thế thống trị\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sovereignty\", \"note_vi\": \"sovereignty là chủ quyền quốc gia; supremacy là sự tối cao, vượt trội\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"supreme\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"supremely\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supremacy-cori-2af3e512.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supremacy-aru0-2af3e512.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supremacy-aru5-2af3e512.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supremacy-aru6-2af3e512.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supremacy-aru10-2af3e512.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supremacy-aru9-2af3e512.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supremacy-aru3-2af3e512.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supremacy-aru7-2af3e512.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supremacy-aru8-2af3e512.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supremacy-aru2-2af3e512.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supremacy-ljspeech-2af3e512.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supremacy-lt408-2af3e512.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supremacy-lt138-2af3e512.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supremacy-lt624-2af3e512.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supremacy-lt396-2af3e512.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supremacy-lt498-2af3e512.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supremacy-lt132-2af3e512.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supremacy-lt288-2af3e512.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supremacy-lt42-2af3e512.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supremacy-lt90-2af3e512.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này bắt nguồn từ tính từ \'supreme\' (tối cao, cao nhất).', 'business', 1, 25),
('fddaeeaf-41cf-5e93-a0c7-9820cd2ac4a2', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '119c124a-72bb-519e-bd8d-540b0a7b393b', 'bae9b29a-3df4-5bc5-809a-a4e06ae01343', 'vitality', '/vaɪˈtæləti/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Năng lượng, sức sống và khả năng phát triển.', 'the state of having energy, strength, and enthusiasm to live or grow successfully.', 'Regular exercise can significantly boost your overall vitality and well-being.', 'Tập thể dục thường xuyên có thể tăng cường đáng kể sức sống và sự khỏe mạnh tổng thể của bạn.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO brought fresh energy and vitality to the aging retail business.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc điều hành đã mang lại năng lượng và sức sống mới cho doanh nghiệp bán lẻ đang già cỗi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitality-ljspeech-b5bdfc75.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitality-cori-b5bdfc75.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/vitality-e34405e9.webp', '[\"vigor\", \"energy\", \"liveliness\"]', '[\"lethargy\", \"weakness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"economic vitality\", \"meaning\": \"sức sống/sự phát triển kinh tế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"full of vitality\", \"meaning\": \"tràn đầy sức sống\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"vital\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"vitalize\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"vitally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitality-cori-b5bdfc75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitality-aru0-b5bdfc75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitality-aru5-b5bdfc75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitality-aru6-b5bdfc75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitality-aru10-b5bdfc75.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitality-aru9-b5bdfc75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitality-aru3-b5bdfc75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitality-aru7-b5bdfc75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitality-aru8-b5bdfc75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitality-aru2-b5bdfc75.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitality-ljspeech-b5bdfc75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitality-lt408-b5bdfc75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitality-lt138-b5bdfc75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitality-lt624-b5bdfc75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitality-lt396-b5bdfc75.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitality-lt498-b5bdfc75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitality-lt132-b5bdfc75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitality-lt288-b5bdfc75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitality-lt42-b5bdfc75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vitality-lt90-b5bdfc75.mp3\"]}}', 'Gốc từ \'vita\' nghĩa là sự sống (tương tự vitamin, vital).', 'business', 1, 26),
('82a59f8e-c16f-57cb-b7a9-081ebcca7418', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '119c124a-72bb-519e-bd8d-540b0a7b393b', 'bae9b29a-3df4-5bc5-809a-a4e06ae01343', 'arcane', '/ɑːˈkeɪn/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Bí mật, chỉ ít người biết hoặc hiểu.', 'secret or mysterious and understood by only a small number of people.', 'The ancient text was filled with arcane symbols and forgotten languages.', 'Văn bản cổ xưa chứa đầy những biểu tượng bí ẩn và ngôn ngữ bị lãng quên.', '{\"en\": \"The financial report contained arcane tax calculations that required an expert to explain.\", \"vi\": \"Báo cáo tài chính chứa các phép tính thuế bí ẩn đòi hỏi một chuyên gia giải thích.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arcane-ljspeech-e7cbd6b1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arcane-cori-e7cbd6b1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/arcane-a190d860.webp', '[\"mysterious\", \"obscure\", \"esoteric\"]', '[\"well-known\", \"common\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"arcane rules\", \"meaning\": \"các quy tắc bí ẩn/khó hiểu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"arcane knowledge\", \"meaning\": \"kiến thức thâm sâu ít người biết\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"archaic\", \"note_vi\": \"archaic nghĩa là cổ xưa hay lạc hậu, arcane nghĩa là bí ẩn và khó hiểu.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arcane-cori-e7cbd6b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arcane-aru0-e7cbd6b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arcane-aru5-e7cbd6b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arcane-aru6-e7cbd6b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arcane-aru10-e7cbd6b1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arcane-aru9-e7cbd6b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arcane-aru3-e7cbd6b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arcane-aru7-e7cbd6b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arcane-aru8-e7cbd6b1.mp3\", \"/stora