('e1efee97-2c1a-5bd2-9885-902585219554', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '1f2b487e-efbd-508a-8ce1-6c344ff4089b', 'a98f0c17-143b-52f0-af09-b3d1e59372c5', 'naive', '/naɪˈiːv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Thiếu kinh nghiệm, dễ tin, ngây thơ.', 'lacking experience of life and trusting people too easily.', 'It would be naive to think that solving this complex problem will be easy.', 'Sẽ thật ngây thơ nếu nghĩ rằng giải quyết vấn đề phức tạp này sẽ dễ dàng.', '{\"en\": \"It was naive of the new employee to trust the unofficial email without verifying.\", \"vi\": \"Thật ngây thơ khi nhân viên mới tin vào email không chính thức mà không xác minh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-ljspeech-0bc5b86f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-cori-0bc5b86f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/naive-9efa7600.webp', '[\"innocent\", \"gullible\", \"inexperienced\"]', '[\"sophisticated\", \"experienced\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"naive belief\", \"meaning\": \"niềm tin ngây thơ/dễ tin\"}, {\"phrase\": \"politically naive\", \"meaning\": \"thiếu kinh nghiệm chính trị\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"naivety\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"naively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-cori-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-aru0-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-aru5-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-aru6-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-aru10-0bc5b86f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-aru9-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-aru3-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-aru7-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-aru8-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-aru2-0bc5b86f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-ljspeech-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-lt408-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-lt138-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-lt624-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-lt396-0bc5b86f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-lt498-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-lt132-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-lt288-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-lt42-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-lt90-0bc5b86f.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng chỉ sự thiếu trải đời, quá dễ tin người khác trong công việc.', 'office', 1, 7),
('87002cd6-d98e-5cc8-9e9b-ed01a04fe948', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '1f2b487e-efbd-508a-8ce1-6c344ff4089b', 'a98f0c17-143b-52f0-af09-b3d1e59372c5', 'renounce', '/rɪˈnaʊns/', 'C1', 'verb', 'chính thức tuyên bố từ bỏ một quyền lợi, niềm tin, hoặc yêu sách.', 'to state publicly that you no longer own, support, or believe in something.', 'The leader publicly asked both sides to renounce violence and begin diplomatic talks.', 'Nhà lãnh đạo đã công khai yêu cầu cả hai bên từ bỏ bạo lực và bắt đầu các cuộc đàm phán ngoại giao.', '{\"en\": \"The former director decided to renounce his shares in the company after the scandal.\", \"vi\": \"Cựu giám đốc đã quyết định từ bỏ cổ phần của mình trong công ty sau vụ bê bối.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renounce-ljspeech-27154558.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renounce-cori-27154558.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/renounce-db839c25.webp', '[\"give up\", \"reject\", \"relinquish\"]', '[\"claim\", \"accept\", \"keep\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"renounce a claim\", \"meaning\": \"từ bỏ một yêu sách/quyền đòi hỏi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"renounce citizenship\", \"meaning\": \"từ bỏ quốc tịch\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"denounce\", \"note_vi\": \"denounce là tố cáo, lên án; renounce là tự nguyện từ bỏ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"renunciation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renounce-cori-27154558.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renounce-aru0-27154558.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renounce-aru5-27154558.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renounce-aru6-27154558.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renounce-aru10-27154558.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renounce-aru9-27154558.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renounce-aru3-27154558.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renounce-aru7-27154558.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renounce-aru8-27154558.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renounce-aru2-27154558.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renounce-ljspeech-27154558.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renounce-lt408-27154558.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renounce-lt138-27154558.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renounce-lt624-27154558.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renounce-lt396-27154558.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renounce-lt498-27154558.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renounce-lt132-27154558.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renounce-lt288-27154558.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renounce-lt42-27154558.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renounce-lt90-27154558.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với \'denounce\' (lên án). Renounce là từ bỏ quyền lợi hoặc danh hiệu.', 'law', 1, 8),
('831029ea-2f77-5a20-9d76-efde81de38f4', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '1f2b487e-efbd-508a-8ce1-6c344ff4089b', 'a98f0c17-143b-52f0-af09-b3d1e59372c5', 'magnanimous', '/mæɡˈnænɪməs/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'rộng lượng, cao thượng, đặc biệt khi đối xử với người thua cuộc.', 'kind and generous, especially towards an enemy or someone you have defeated.', 'Despite the defeat, the team captain was magnanimous in congratulating their opponents.', 'Mặc dù thua cuộc, đội trưởng vẫn rộng lượng chúc mừng đối thủ của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO was magnanimous after winning the contract, praising the competing company.\", \"vi\": \"Vị CEO đã rất rộng lượng sau khi thắng hợp đồng, ông khen ngợi cả công ty đối thủ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magnanimous-ljspeech-2ca5762f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magnanimous-cori-2ca5762f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/magnanimous-c3c17bfd.webp', '[\"generous\", \"forgiving\", \"noble\"]', '[\"mean\", \"petty\", \"vindictive\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"magnanimous gesture\", \"meaning\": \"cử chỉ cao thượng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"magnanimous offer\", \"meaning\": \"lời đề nghị rộng lượng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"magnificent\", \"note_vi\": \"magnanimous là rộng lượng cao thượng, magnificent là lộng lẫy tráng lệ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"magnanimity\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"magnanimously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magnanimous-cori-2ca5762f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magnanimous-aru0-2ca5762f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magnanimous-aru5-2ca5762f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magnanimous-aru6-2ca5762f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magnanimous-aru10-2ca5762f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magnanimous-aru9-2ca5762f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magnanimous-aru3-2ca5762f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magnanimous-aru7-2ca5762f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magnanimous-aru8-2ca5762f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magnanimous-aru2-2ca5762f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magnanimous-ljspeech-2ca5762f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magnanimous-lt408-2ca5762f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magnanimous-lt138-2ca5762f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magnanimous-lt624-2ca5762f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magnanimous-lt396-2ca5762f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magnanimous-lt498-2ca5762f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magnanimous-lt132-2ca5762f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magnanimous-lt288-2ca5762f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magnanimous-lt42-2ca5762f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/magnanimous-lt90-2ca5762f.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để miêu tả sự hào phóng, rộng lượng đặc biệt là với đối thủ cạnh tranh.', 'business', 1, 9),
('464b32e5-d39b-575c-8abd-698ee44c48c5', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '1f2b487e-efbd-508a-8ce1-6c344ff4089b', 'a98f0c17-143b-52f0-af09-b3d1e59372c5', 'refrigeration', 'UK: /rɪˌfrɪdʒ.əˈreɪ.ʃən/ | US: /rɪˌfrɪdʒ.əˈreɪ.ʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự làm lạnh, sự ướp lạnh', 'the process or act of keeping food, drinks, or items cool or frozen.', 'Some medicines require constant refrigeration.', 'Một số loại thuốc yêu cầu bảo quản lạnh liên tục.', '{\"en\": \"The shipment arrived in poor condition due to a malfunction in the container\'s refrigeration system.\", \"vi\": \"Lô hàng đến nơi trong tình trạng kém do hệ thống làm lạnh của container bị hỏng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refrigeration-ljspeech-4bfd2de6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refrigeration-cori-4bfd2de6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/refrigeration-fa0e3f4a.webp', '[\"cooling\", \"chilling\", \"freezing\"]', '[\"heating\", \"warming\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"refrigeration system\", \"meaning\": \"hệ thống làm lạnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"refrigeration unit\", \"meaning\": \"thiết bị làm lạnh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"evaporation\", \"note_vi\": \"Evaporation là sự bay hơi, trái ngược với quá trình ướp lạnh bảo quản.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"refrigerate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"refrigerator\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refrigeration-cori-4bfd2de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refrigeration-aru0-4bfd2de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refrigeration-aru5-4bfd2de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refrigeration-aru6-4bfd2de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refrigeration-aru10-4bfd2de6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refrigeration-aru9-4bfd2de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refrigeration-aru3-4bfd2de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refrigeration-aru7-4bfd2de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refrigeration-aru8-4bfd2de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refrigeration-aru2-4bfd2de6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refrigeration-ljspeech-4bfd2de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refrigeration-lt408-4bfd2de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refrigeration-lt138-4bfd2de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refrigeration-lt624-4bfd2de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refrigeration-lt396-4bfd2de6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refrigeration-lt498-4bfd2de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refrigeration-lt132-4bfd2de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refrigeration-lt288-4bfd2de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refrigeration-lt42-4bfd2de6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refrigeration-lt90-4bfd2de6.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ chỉ quá trình làm lạnh, hay gặp trong vận tải chuỗi cung ứng (\'refrigeration system\').', 'logistics', 1, 10),
('7fdfa51f-d074-5a16-9c95-b27f3b04a238', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '2a465073-41a1-520d-993c-428fde46196f', '67d9118b-0f50-5716-95ae-93734b645ec2', 'selfless', '/ˈselfləs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Luôn nghĩ đến người khác, không vì lợi ích bản thân.', 'caring more about the needs and happiness of other people than your own.', 'Her selfless dedication to helping the poor inspired everyone around her.', 'Sự cống hiến quên mình của cô ấy để giúp đỡ người nghèo đã truyền cảm hứng cho mọi người xung quanh.', '{\"en\": \"The selfless volunteer spent her weekend organizing charity events for the local community center.\", \"vi\": \"Người tình nguyện tận tụy đã dành cuối tuần để tổ chức các sự kiện từ thiện cho trung tâm cộng đồng địa phương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selfless-ljspeech-7fed21ff.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selfless-cori-7fed21ff.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/selfless-0ae36a6d.webp', '[\"altruistic\", \"generous\"]', '[\"selfish\", \"egotistic\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"selfless act\", \"meaning\": \"hành động vị tha\"}, {\"phrase\": \"selfless service\", \"meaning\": \"sự phục vụ tận tụy\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"selflessness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selfless-cori-7fed21ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selfless-aru0-7fed21ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selfless-aru5-7fed21ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selfless-aru6-7fed21ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selfless-aru10-7fed21ff.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selfless-aru9-7fed21ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selfless-aru3-7fed21ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selfless-aru7-7fed21ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selfless-aru8-7fed21ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selfless-aru2-7fed21ff.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selfless-ljspeech-7fed21ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selfless-lt408-7fed21ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selfless-lt138-7fed21ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selfless-lt624-7fed21ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selfless-lt396-7fed21ff.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selfless-lt498-7fed21ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selfless-lt132-7fed21ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selfless-lt288-7fed21ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selfless-lt42-7fed21ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selfless-lt90-7fed21ff.mp3\"]}}', 'Selfless là người không ích kỷ, trái ngược hoàn toàn với selfish.', 'other', 1, 0),
('c7dab29d-7d3b-5815-86a2-0569df8afbe2', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '2a465073-41a1-520d-993c-428fde46196f', '67d9118b-0f50-5716-95ae-93734b645ec2', 'begrudge', '/bɪˈɡrʌdʒ/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Ghen tị với ai đó về điều gì đó, hoặc miễn cưỡng cho phép.', 'to feel unhappy because someone else has something that you think they do not deserve.', 'Nobody can begrudge Thomas his promotion after he saved the project.', 'Không ai có thể ghen tị với sự thăng tiến của Thomas sau khi anh ấy cứu vãn dự án.', '{\"en\": \"I do not begrudge my colleague the promotion because she has worked very hard lately.\", \"vi\": \"Tôi không ghen tị với đồng nghiệp về việc thăng chức vì cô ấy đã làm việc rất chăm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-ljspeech-d87010d6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-cori-d87010d6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/begrudge-801f4355.webp', '[\"envy\", \"resent\"]', '[\"support\", \"encourage\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"begrudge someone\", \"meaning\": \"ghen tị với ai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"begrudge doing something\", \"meaning\": \"miễn cưỡng làm gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"grudge\", \"note_vi\": \"Begrudge là động từ, grudge là danh từ chỉ mối thù.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"begrudgingly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-cori-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-aru0-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-aru5-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-aru6-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-aru10-d87010d6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-aru9-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-aru3-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-aru7-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-aru8-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-aru2-d87010d6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-ljspeech-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-lt408-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-lt138-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-lt624-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-lt396-d87010d6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-lt498-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-lt132-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-lt288-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-lt42-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-lt90-d87010d6.mp3\"]}}', 'Begrudge là động từ, grudge là danh từ chỉ mối thù.', 'office', 1, 1),
('7ea25b29-cd46-5673-96d0-950e9ea41b4e', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '2a465073-41a1-520d-993c-428fde46196f', '67d9118b-0f50-5716-95ae-93734b645ec2', 'profuse', '/prəˈfjuːs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rất nhiều, dồi dào, phong phú.', 'produced or given in large amounts or great quantity.', 'She offered her profuse thanks for all the help she received.', 'Cô ấy đã gửi lời cảm ơn dồi dào cho tất cả sự giúp đỡ mà cô nhận được.', '{\"en\": \"The client gave profuse apologies for the late payment delay.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng đã đưa lời xin lỗi rất nhiều vì sự chậm trễ thanh toán.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profuse-ljspeech-088f7ab9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profuse-cori-088f7ab9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/profuse-3beb7318.webp', '[\"abundant\", \"copious\", \"plentiful\"]', '[\"scarce\", \"sparse\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"profuse thanks\", \"meaning\": \"lời cảm ơn chân thành\"}, {\"phrase\": \"profuse apologies\", \"meaning\": \"lời xin lỗi liên tục\"}, {\"phrase\": \"profuse sweating\", \"meaning\": \"đổ mồ hôi nhiều\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"profound\", \"note_vi\": \"profound nghĩa là sâu sắc, không phải nhiều\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"profusely\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"profusion\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profuse-cori-088f7ab9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profuse-aru0-088f7ab9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profuse-aru5-088f7ab9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profuse-aru6-088f7ab9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profuse-aru10-088f7ab9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profuse-aru9-088f7ab9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profuse-aru3-088f7ab9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profuse-aru7-088f7ab9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profuse-aru8-088f7ab9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profuse-aru2-088f7ab9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profuse-ljspeech-088f7ab9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profuse-lt408-088f7ab9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profuse-lt138-088f7ab9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profuse-lt624-088f7ab9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profuse-lt396-088f7ab9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profuse-lt498-088f7ab9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profuse-lt132-088f7ab9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profuse-lt288-088f7ab9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profuse-lt42-088f7ab9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profuse-lt90-088f7ab9.mp3\"]}}', 'Profuse thường đi với thanks/apologies, nghĩa là rất nhiều.', 'business', 1, 2),
('41f324bc-27ca-5c47-aa74-d4892c82f934', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '2a465073-41a1-520d-993c-428fde46196f', '67d9118b-0f50-5716-95ae-93734b645ec2', 'qualification', 'UK: /ˌkwɒl.ɪ.fɪˈkeɪ.ʃən/ | US: /ˌkwɑː.lɪ.fɪˈkeɪ.ʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'phẩm chất, bằng cấp', 'An official record or skill that shows a person is suited for a job.', 'Relevant qualifications are essential for this advanced role.', 'Các bằng cấp liên quan là cần thiết cho vai trò nâng cao này.', '{\"en\": \"Applicants should highlight their academic qualifications and relevant work experience in the cover letter.\", \"vi\": \"Ứng viên nên làm nổi bật bằng cấp chuyên môn và kinh nghiệm làm việc liên quan trong thư xin việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-ljspeech-006442b3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-cori-006442b3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/qualification-1fd0e6f1.webp', '[\"certificate\", \"credentials\", \"requirement\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"academic qualification\", \"meaning\": \"trình độ/bằng cấp học vấn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"meet qualifications\", \"meaning\": \"đáp ứng các tiêu chuẩn/bằng cấp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"qualify\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"qualified\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-cori-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-aru0-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-aru5-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-aru6-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-aru10-006442b3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-aru9-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-aru3-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-aru7-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-aru8-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-aru2-006442b3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-ljspeech-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-lt408-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-lt138-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-lt624-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-lt396-006442b3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-lt498-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-lt132-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-lt288-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-lt42-006442b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualification-lt90-006442b3.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường được dùng ở dạng số nhiều \'qualifications\' để chỉ tập hợp bằng cấp, chứng chỉ và năng lực chuyên môn.', 'recruitment', 1, 3),
('b5a3c281-39c1-52dd-b90f-4dccf2b872e0', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '2a465073-41a1-520d-993c-428fde46196f', '67d9118b-0f50-5716-95ae-93734b645ec2', 'hypothetical', '/ˌhaɪpəˈθetɪkl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Dựa trên một giả định hoặc tình huống không có thật để suy luận.', 'based on a situation that is not real but is imagined for discussion.', 'The interviewer presented a hypothetical scenario to test my problem-solving skills.', 'Người phỏng vấn đã đưa ra một kịch bản giả định để kiểm tra kỹ năng giải quyết vấn đề của tôi.', '{\"en\": \"The team discussed a hypothetical scenario where our main supplier suddenly stops all deliveries.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm đã thảo luận về một kịch bản giả định nơi nhà cung cấp chính của chúng ta đột ngột dừng mọi giao hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothetical-ljspeech-a9693078.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothetical-cori-a9693078.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hypothetical-f97b8765.webp', '[\"theoretical\", \"imaginary\"]', '[\"actual\", \"real\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"hypothetical situation\", \"meaning\": \"tình huống giả định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hypothetical question\", \"meaning\": \"câu hỏi giả định\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"hypothesis\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothetical-cori-a9693078.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothetical-aru0-a9693078.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothetical-aru5-a9693078.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothetical-aru6-a9693078.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothetical-aru10-a9693078.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothetical-aru9-a9693078.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothetical-aru3-a9693078.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothetical-aru7-a9693078.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothetical-aru8-a9693078.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothetical-aru2-a9693078.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothetical-ljspeech-a9693078.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothetical-lt408-a9693078.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothetical-lt138-a9693078.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothetical-lt624-a9693078.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothetical-lt396-a9693078.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothetical-lt498-a9693078.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothetical-lt132-a9693078.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothetical-lt288-a9693078.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothetical-lt42-a9693078.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothetical-lt90-a9693078.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng khi muốn đặt ra các tình huống \'nếu như\' trong công việc.', 'academic', 1, 4),
('534cd20c-b3bc-567d-a827-a2ba081153b2', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '2a465073-41a1-520d-993c-428fde46196f', '67d9118b-0f50-5716-95ae-93734b645ec2', 'venerable', '/ˈvenərəbl/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Đáng được tôn kính vì tuổi tác, trí tuệ hoặc phẩm chất tốt.', 'deserving respect because of age, high position, or historical importance.', 'The venerable old professor shared his wisdom with the young students.', 'Vị giáo sư già đáng kính đã chia sẻ sự uyên bác của mình với các sinh viên trẻ.', '{\"en\": \"The venerable founder of the corporation will deliver a speech at the annual shareholder meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà sáng lập đáng kính của tập đoàn sẽ phát biểu tại cuộc họp cổ đông thường niên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerable-ljspeech-02ff6963.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerable-cori-02ff6963.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/venerable-3df60f60.webp', '[\"respected\", \"esteemed\", \"revered\"]', '[\"disreputable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"venerable institution\", \"meaning\": \"tổ chức lâu đời đáng kính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"venerable tradition\", \"meaning\": \"truyền thống lâu đời\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"vulnerable\", \"note_vi\": \"vulnerable là dễ bị tổn thương, venerable là đáng tôn kính.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"venerate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"veneration\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerable-cori-02ff6963.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerable-aru0-02ff6963.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerable-aru5-02ff6963.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerable-aru6-02ff6963.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerable-aru10-02ff6963.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerable-aru9-02ff6963.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerable-aru3-02ff6963.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerable-aru7-02ff6963.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerable-aru8-02ff6963.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerable-aru2-02ff6963.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerable-ljspeech-02ff6963.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerable-lt408-02ff6963.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerable-lt138-02ff6963.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerable-lt624-02ff6963.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerable-lt396-02ff6963.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerable-lt498-02ff6963.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerable-lt132-02ff6963.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerable-lt288-02ff6963.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerable-lt42-02ff6963.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerable-lt90-02ff6963.mp3\"]}}', 'Dễ nhầm với \'vulnerable\' (dễ bị tổn thương) do cách viết và phát âm gần giống.', 'business', 1, 5),
('b2b18f7a-dc6f-57d4-9d3a-fa7d2b30c98a', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '2a465073-41a1-520d-993c-428fde46196f', '67d9118b-0f50-5716-95ae-93734b645ec2', 'enigmatic', '/ˌenɪɡˈmætɪk/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Khó hiểu, bí ẩn, khó giải thích.', 'impossible to understand or explain clearly because it is mysterious.', 'The artist\'s enigmatic smile in the painting has fascinated viewers for centuries.', 'Nụ cười bí ẩn của nghệ sĩ trong bức tranh đã mê hoặc người xem hàng thế kỷ.', '{\"en\": \"The company\'s decision to cancel the profitable project remains enigmatic to all the investors.\", \"vi\": \"Quyết định hủy bỏ dự án có lợi nhuận của công ty vẫn là một điều khó hiểu đối với tất cả các nhà đầu tư.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enigmatic-ljspeech-66455ba0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enigmatic-cori-66455ba0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/enigmatic-1dbbb2eb.webp', '[\"mysterious\", \"puzzling\"]', '[\"clear\", \"obvious\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"enigmatic behavior\", \"meaning\": \"hành vi khó hiểu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"remain enigmatic\", \"meaning\": \"vẫn còn bí ẩn\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enigmatic-cori-66455ba0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enigmatic-aru0-66455ba0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enigmatic-aru5-66455ba0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enigmatic-aru6-66455ba0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enigmatic-aru10-66455ba0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enigmatic-aru9-66455ba0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enigmatic-aru3-66455ba0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enigmatic-aru7-66455ba0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enigmatic-aru8-66455ba0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enigmatic-aru2-66455ba0.mp3\"]}, \"