('58a52109-19e2-5dc9-814e-c90891fba6e7', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '2a465073-41a1-520d-993c-428fde46196f', '67d9118b-0f50-5716-95ae-93734b645ec2', 'imperative', '/ɪmˈperətɪv/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'rất quan trọng, cấp bách, bắt buộc.', 'extremely important and needing to be done or dealt with immediately by everyone.', 'It is imperative that we find a solution to this problem quickly.', 'Điều cấp bách là chúng ta phải tìm ra giải pháp cho vấn đề này một cách nhanh chóng.', '{\"en\": \"It is imperative that all staff members submit their travel expense reports before the deadline.\", \"vi\": \"Việc tất cả nhân viên nộp báo cáo chi phí công tác trước thời hạn là điều bắt buộc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-ljspeech-d4c6e564.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-cori-d4c6e564.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/imperative-cc00545f.webp', '[\"crucial\", \"urgent\"]', '[\"unimportant\", \"optional\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"absolutely imperative\", \"meaning\": \"cực kỳ cấp bách\"}, {\"phrase\": \"moral imperative\", \"meaning\": \"nghĩa vụ đạo đức\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"imperial\", \"note_vi\": \"Liên quan đến đế chế, không phải sự cấp bách.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"imperatively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-cori-d4c6e564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-aru0-d4c6e564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-aru5-d4c6e564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-aru6-d4c6e564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-aru10-d4c6e564.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-aru9-d4c6e564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-aru3-d4c6e564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-aru7-d4c6e564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-aru8-d4c6e564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-aru2-d4c6e564.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-ljspeech-d4c6e564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-lt408-d4c6e564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-lt138-d4c6e564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-lt624-d4c6e564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-lt396-d4c6e564.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-lt498-d4c6e564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-lt132-d4c6e564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-lt288-d4c6e564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-lt42-d4c6e564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-lt90-d4c6e564.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc hay gặp: It is imperative that + S + (should) + V-nguyên thể.', 'office', 1, 16),
('d5ec8964-b7ec-59f4-bd7d-a55ff50ddc23', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '2a465073-41a1-520d-993c-428fde46196f', '67d9118b-0f50-5716-95ae-93734b645ec2', 'verbose', '/vɜːˈbəʊs/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Sử dụng quá nhiều từ ngữ, khiến bài nói hoặc viết trở nên dài dòng.', 'using more words than are needed, which makes the speech or writing hard to follow.', 'His verbose explanation made it difficult to understand the main point.', 'Lời giải thích dài dòng của anh ấy khiến việc nắm bắt ý chính trở nên khó khăn.', '{\"en\": \"The report was too verbose, making it difficult for the board to find key information.\", \"vi\": \"Báo cáo quá dài dòng, khiến hội đồng quản trị khó tìm ra thông tin quan trọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbose-ljspeech-3f73a838.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbose-cori-3f73a838.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/verbose-1f0da1a4.webp', '[\"wordy\", \"long-winded\"]', '[\"concise\", \"brief\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"verbose report\", \"meaning\": \"báo cáo dài dòng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"verbose explanation\", \"meaning\": \"lời giải thích dài dòng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"wordy\", \"note_vi\": \"Verbose mang nghĩa trang trọng hơn từ wordy.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"verbosity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbose-cori-3f73a838.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbose-aru0-3f73a838.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbose-aru5-3f73a838.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbose-aru6-3f73a838.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbose-aru10-3f73a838.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbose-aru9-3f73a838.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbose-aru3-3f73a838.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbose-aru7-3f73a838.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbose-aru8-3f73a838.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbose-aru2-3f73a838.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbose-ljspeech-3f73a838.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbose-lt408-3f73a838.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbose-lt138-3f73a838.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbose-lt624-3f73a838.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbose-lt396-3f73a838.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbose-lt498-3f73a838.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbose-lt132-3f73a838.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbose-lt288-3f73a838.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbose-lt42-3f73a838.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbose-lt90-3f73a838.mp3\"]}}', 'Verbose mang nghĩa trang trọng hơn từ wordy.', 'business', 1, 17),
('3cc44dbd-6e84-5035-8bbf-347f3fd3d640', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '2a465073-41a1-520d-993c-428fde46196f', '67d9118b-0f50-5716-95ae-93734b645ec2', 'gregarious', '/ɡrɪˈɡeəriəs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'thích giao du, hòa đồng, thích ở cùng người khác.', 'liking to be with other people and enjoying talking to them.', 'As a gregarious sales representative, Arthur easily builds rapport with international clients.', 'Là một đại diện kinh doanh hòa đồng, Arthur dễ dàng tạo dựng mối quan hệ với các khách hàng quốc tế.', '{\"en\": \"Our sales manager is gregarious and easily builds strong relationships with clients.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý kinh doanh của chúng tôi rất hòa đồng và dễ dàng xây dựng mối quan hệ tốt với khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-ljspeech-713a031e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-cori-713a031e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gregarious-f1d0c51b.webp', '[\"sociable\", \"outgoing\", \"friendly\"]', '[\"unsociable\", \"reserved\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"gregarious personality\", \"meaning\": \"tính cách hòa đồng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"gregarious nature\", \"meaning\": \"bản tính thích giao du\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"garrulous\", \"note_vi\": \"gregarious là hòa đồng, còn garrulous là nói nhiều luyên thuyên.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"gregariousness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-cori-713a031e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-aru0-713a031e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-aru5-713a031e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-aru6-713a031e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-aru10-713a031e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-aru9-713a031e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-aru3-713a031e.mp3\", \"/st