('2e40e69e-3d29-5ad0-babc-b55f2f0d7a12', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '8725c478-984b-529a-b658-60921d5c44c6', '8b1f136e-8650-541c-9118-9da92e68e74b', 'conventional', '/kənˈvenʃənl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Theo truyền thống, quy ước, không có gì khác biệt hay mới mẻ.', 'following the usual ways of doing things instead of being new or different.', 'Solar energy is becoming cheaper than conventional power sources in many countries.', 'Năng lượng mặt trời đang trở nên rẻ hơn so với các nguồn điện truyền thống ở nhiều quốc gia.', '{\"en\": \"The company decided to use conventional marketing strategies to reach their target audience this year.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã quyết định sử dụng các chiến lược tiếp thị truyền thống để tiếp cận đối tượng khách hàng mục tiêu trong năm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conventional-ljspeech-5062a63a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conventional-cori-5062a63a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/conventional-5549ecd1.webp', '[\"traditional\", \"standard\"]', '[\"unconventional\", \"innovative\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"conventional wisdom\", \"meaning\": \"quan điểm chung được nhiều người chấp nhận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"conventional method\", \"meaning\": \"phương pháp thông thường\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"convenient\", \"note_vi\": \"convenient là thuận tiện, conventional là theo quy ước.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"convention\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"conventionally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conventional-cori-5062a63a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conventional-aru0-5062a63a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conventional-aru5-5062a63a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conventional-aru6-5062a63a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conventional-aru10-5062a63a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conventional-aru9-5062a63a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conventional-aru3-5062a63a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conventional-aru7-5062a63a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conventional-aru8-5062a63a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conventional-aru2-5062a63a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conventional-ljspeech-5062a63a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conventional-lt408-5062a63a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conventional-lt138-5062a63a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conventional-lt624-5062a63a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conventional-lt396-5062a63a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conventional-lt498-5062a63a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conventional-lt132-5062a63a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conventional-lt288-5062a63a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conventional-lt42-5062a63a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conventional-lt90-5062a63a.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm với convenient (thuận tiện). Conventional nhấn mạnh sự tuân thủ quy tắc cũ.', 'business', 1, 4),
('e9bd9eaa-254e-59e9-bb3a-72ef4d411f57', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '8725c478-984b-529a-b658-60921d5c44c6', '8b1f136e-8650-541c-9118-9da92e68e74b', 'reinforce', '/ˌriːɪnˈfɔːs/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Củng cố, làm cho mạnh mẽ hơn hoặc hỗ trợ thêm.', 'to make an idea, belief, or structure stronger or more effective.', 'The new evidence helped to reinforce the lawyer\'s argument.', 'Bằng chứng mới đã giúp củng cố lập luận của luật sư.', '{\"en\": \"The company will reinforce its customer service team by hiring twenty new representatives this month.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty sẽ củng cố đội ngũ dịch vụ khách hàng của mình bằng cách thuê hai mươi đại diện mới trong tháng này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reinforce-ljspeech-9191c944.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reinforce-cori-9191c944.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reinforce-3dfb34e4.webp', '[\"strengthen\", \"support\", \"bolster\"]', '[\"weaken\", \"undermine\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"reinforce a message\", \"meaning\": \"củng cố thông điệp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reinforce a structure\", \"meaning\": \"gia cố cấu trúc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"force\", \"note_vi\": \"force là ép buộc, reinforce là củng cố hoặc tăng cường.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"reinforcement\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reinforce-cori-9191c944.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reinforce-aru0-9191c944.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reinforce-aru5-9191c944.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reinforce-aru6-9191c944.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reinforce-aru10-9191c944.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reinforce-aru9-9191c944.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reinforce-aru3-9191c944.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reinforce-aru7-9191c944.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reinforce-aru8-9191c944.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reinforce-aru2-9191c944.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reinforce-ljspeech-9191c944.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reinforce-lt408-9191c944.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reinforce-lt138-9191c944.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reinforce-lt624-9191c944.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reinforce-lt396-9191c944.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reinforce-lt498-9191c944.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reinforce-lt132-9191c944.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reinforce-lt288-9191c944.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reinforce-lt42-9191c944.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reinforce-lt90-9191c944.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng được cho cả vật lý (gia cố tòa nhà) và trừu tượng (củng cố quan điểm, đội ngũ).', 'hr', 1, 5),
('f9841f1f-be33-538e-9855-09eb7519f2d8', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '8725c478-984b-529a-b658-60921d5c44c6', '8b1f136e-8650-541c-9118-9da92e68e74b', 'rehearsal', 'UK: /rɪˈhɜːsl/ | US: /rɪˈhɜːrsl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'buổi diễn tập', 'a practice session of a play, concert, or performance before public presentation.', 'The final rehearsal is scheduled for tomorrow morning.', 'Buổi diễn tập cuối cùng được lên lịch vào sáng mai.', '{\"en\": \"The keynote speaker arrived early for the final rehearsal before the conference.\", \"vi\": \"Diễn giả chính đã đến sớm để tham gia buổi tổng duyệt cuối cùng trước hội nghị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-ljspeech-d6cb3ba3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-cori-d6cb3ba3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rehearsal-b6310daa.webp', '[\"practice\", \"run-through\", \"dry run\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"dress rehearsal\", \"meaning\": \"buổi tổng duyệt trang phục / tổng duyệt cuối\"}, {\"phrase\": \"final rehearsal\", \"meaning\": \"buổi diễn tập cuối cùng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"rehearse\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-cori-d6cb3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-aru0-d6cb3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-aru5-d6cb3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-aru6-d6cb3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-aru10-d6cb3ba3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-aru9-d6cb3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-aru3-d6cb3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-aru7-d6cb3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-aru8-d6cb3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-aru2-d6cb3ba3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"