('84a18dfc-fd60-50e6-b481-194ddd9dddcd', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '8725c478-984b-529a-b658-60921d5c44c6', '8b1f136e-8650-541c-9118-9da92e68e74b', 'dismay', '/dɪsˈmeɪ/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Sự thất vọng, sự kinh hoàng khi đối mặt với điều không mong muốn.', 'Distress or sudden disappointment caused by an unexpected and troubling event.', 'To her dismay, the flight was delayed for several hours.', 'Cô ấy thất vọng khi chuyến bay bị hoãn vài giờ.', '{\"en\": \"To our great dismay, the shipment arrived late and many of the items were damaged.\", \"vi\": \"Thật thất vọng, lô hàng đã đến muộn và nhiều mặt hàng đã bị hư hỏng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dismay-ljspeech-89c2c2e9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dismay-cori-89c2c2e9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dismay-5a43f0fb.webp', '[\"disappointment\", \"distress\"]', '[\"delight\", \"joy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"to one\'s dismay\", \"meaning\": \"đến nỗi thất vọng của ai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"great dismay\", \"meaning\": \"sự thất vọng lớn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"disarray\", \"note_vi\": \"Dismay là sự thất vọng, disarray là sự lộn xộn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"dismaying\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dismay-cori-89c2c2e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dismay-aru0-89c2c2e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dismay-aru5-89c2c2e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dismay-aru6-89c2c2e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dismay-aru10-89c2c2e9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dismay-aru9-89c2c2e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dismay-aru3-89c2c2e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dismay-aru7-89c2c2e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dismay-aru8-89c2c2e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/