('94bb216f-be6b-5eb5-88bb-db197b2187ad', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '8725c478-984b-529a-b658-60921d5c44c6', '8b1f136e-8650-541c-9118-9da92e68e74b', 'pending', '/ˈpendɪŋ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Đang chờ đợi để được quyết định hoặc hoàn thành.', 'waiting to be decided, finished, or officially announced soon.', 'The new policy is still pending approval from the board of directors.', 'Chính sách mới vẫn đang chờ sự chấp thuận từ hội đồng quản trị.', '{\"en\": \"The travel expense reimbursement request is currently pending review by accounting.\", \"vi\": \"Yêu cầu hoàn trả chi phí đi lại hiện đang chờ kế toán xét duyệt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pending-ljspeech-e2258693.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pending-cori-e2258693.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pending-48fb0ddc.webp', '[\"undecided\", \"unresolved\", \"impending\"]', '[\"settled\", \"decided\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"pending approval\", \"meaning\": \"chờ phê duyệt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pending investigation\", \"meaning\": \"chờ điều tra\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"impending\", \"note_vi\": \"sắp xảy ra (thường chỉ sự việc lo ngại)\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pending-cori-e2258693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pending-aru0-e2258693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pending-aru5-e2258693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pending-aru6-e2258693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pending-aru10-e2258693.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pending-aru9-e2258693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pending-aru3-e2258693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pending-aru7-e2258693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pending-aru8-e2258693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pending-aru2-e2258693.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pending-ljspeech-e2258693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pending-lt408-e2258693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pending-lt138-e2258693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pending-lt624-e2258693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pending-lt396-e2258693.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pending-lt498-e2258693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pending-lt132-e2258693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pending-lt288-e2258693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pending-lt42-e2258693.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pending-lt90-e2258693.mp3\"]}}', 'Pending cũng có thể dùng làm giới từ với nghĩa \'trong khi chờ\'.', 'finance', 1, 14),
('a5dfd5f6-85b8-52d8-9601-8d77cf47c1be', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '8725c478-984b-529a-b658-60921d5c44c6', '8b1f136e-8650-541c-9118-9da92e68e74b', 'corrupt', '/kəˈrʌpt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Tham nhũng, không trung thực, dùng quyền lực vì lợi ích cá nhân.', 'acting in a dishonest or illegal way to gain money or personal advantage.', 'The investigation revealed a corrupt official who was taking bribes.', 'Cuộc điều tra đã vạch trần một quan chức tham nhũng nhận hối lộ.', '{\"en\": \"The company fired the corrupt executive who was stealing funds from the corporate account.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã sa thải vị giám đốc tham nhũng, người đã đánh cắp tiền từ tài khoản doanh nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrupt-ljspeech-a1ce829a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrupt-cori-a1ce829a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/corrupt-a51b4cad.webp', '[\"dishonest\", \"unethical\"]', '[\"honest\", \"ethical\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"corrupt official\", \"meaning\": \"quan chức tham nhũng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"corrupt practice\", \"meaning\": \"hành vi tham nhũng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"corruption\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"corruptly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrupt-cori-a1ce829a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrupt-aru0-a1ce829a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrupt-aru5-a1ce829a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrupt-aru6-a1ce829a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrupt-aru10-a1ce829a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrupt-aru9-a1ce829a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrupt-aru3-a1ce829a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrupt-aru7-a1ce829a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrupt-aru8-a1ce829a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obj