('1e14215e-fb3f-59fc-a2e3-ef36a2ab5288', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '8725c478-984b-529a-b658-60921d5c44c6', '8b1f136e-8650-541c-9118-9da92e68e74b', 'bias', '/ˈbaɪəs/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự thiên vị, định kiến không công bằng.', 'a strong feeling in favor of or against one group of people or ideas unfairly.', 'The journalist was accused of showing a clear bias in his reporting.', 'Nhà báo bị buộc tội thể hiện sự thiên vị rõ ràng trong bài viết của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The hiring manager was trained to avoid any personal bias during the recruitment process today.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý tuyển dụng đã được đào tạo để tránh mọi định kiến cá nhân trong quá trình tuyển.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bias-ljspeech-e1e8289a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bias-cori-e1e8289a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bias-13bbf27e.webp', '[\"prejudice\", \"partiality\"]', '[\"fairness\", \"impartiality\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"personal bias\", \"meaning\": \"định kiến cá nhân\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unconscious bias\", \"meaning\": \"định kiến vô thức\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"prejudice\", \"note_vi\": \"Bias thường về thiên vị, prejudice về định kiến tiêu cực.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"biased\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bias-cori-e1e8289a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bias-aru0-e1e8289a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bias-aru5-e1e8289a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bias-aru6-e1e8289a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bias-aru10-e1e8289a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bias-aru9-e1e8289a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bias-aru3-e1e8289a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bias-aru7-e1e8289a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bias-aru8-e1e8289a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bias-aru2-e1e8289a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bias-ljspeech-e1e8289a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bias-lt408-e1e8289a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bias-lt138-e1e8289a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bias-lt624-e1e8289a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bias-lt396-e1e8289a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bias-lt498-e1e8289a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bias-lt132-e1e8289a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bias-lt288-e1e8289a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bias-lt42-e1e8289a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bias-lt90-e1e8289a.mp3\"]}}', 'Bias thường về thiên vị, prejudice về định kiến tiêu cực.', 'hr', 1, 18),
('5763f07b-1d4c-5b5f-87bd-c3795170e3ac', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '8725c478-984b-529a-b658-60921d5c44c6', '8b1f136e-8650-541c-9118-9da92e68e74b', 'null', '/nʌl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Không có giá trị pháp lý, không tồn tại hoặc không có hiệu lực.', 'having no legal force or not being valid in a formal agreement.', 'If neither party signs the agreement, all previous negotiations become null.', 'Nếu không bên nào ký vào thỏa thuận, mọi cuộc đàm phán trước đó sẽ trở nên vô hiệu.', '{\"en\": \"The contract became null after the legal department found several errors in the terms.\", \"vi\": \"Hợp đồng trở nên vô hiệu sau khi phòng pháp lý tìm thấy một vài lỗi trong các điều khoản.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/null-ljspeech-2be88ca4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/null-cori-2be88ca4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/null-966e6f8a.webp', '[\"invalid\", \"void\"]', '[\"valid\", \"binding\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"null and void\", \"meaning\": \"vô hiệu lực\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"nullify\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/null-cori-2be88ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/null-aru0-2be88ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/null-aru5-2be88ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/null-aru6-2be88ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/null-aru10-2be88ca4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/null-aru9-2be88ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/null-aru3-2be88ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/null-aru7-2be88ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/null-aru8-2be88ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/null-aru2-2be88ca4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/null-ljspeech-2be88ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/null-lt408-2be88ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/null-lt138-2be88ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/null-lt624-2be88ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/null-lt396-2be88ca4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/null-lt498-2be88ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/null-lt132-2be88ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/null-lt288-2be88ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/null-lt42-2be88ca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/null-lt90-2be88ca4.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm với \'and void\' để nhấn mạnh sự vô hiệu.', 'law', 1, 19),
('a014f835-c8e9-54e1-bf66-900f3963c14a', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '8725c478-984b-529a-b658-60921d5c44c6', '8b1f136e-8650-541c-9118-9da92e68e74b', 'menacing', '/ˈmenəsɪŋ/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Có vẻ đe dọa hoặc gợi ý nguy hiểm.', 'suggesting that someone or something is dangerous and likely to cause harm or trouble.', 'The dark, menacing clouds suggested a severe storm was approaching.', 'Những đám mây đen, đầy đe dọa báo hiệu một cơn bão lớn đang đến gần.', '{\"en\": \"The manager gave a menacing look when the employee failed to meet the project deadline.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã có cái nhìn đe dọa khi nhân viên không hoàn thành hạn chót dự án.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menacing-ljspeech-d2b2fa3a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menacing-cori-d2b2fa3a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/menacing-179fdd55.webp', '[\"threatening\", \"alarming\"]', '[\"friendly\", \"harmless\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"menacing look\", \"meaning\": \"cái nhìn đe dọa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"menacing tone\", \"meaning\": \"giọng điệu đe dọa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"menace\", \"note_vi\": \"Menacing là tính từ, menace là danh từ hoặc động từ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"menace\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menacing-cori-d2b2fa3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menacing-aru0-d2b2fa3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menacing-aru5-d2b2fa3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menacing-aru6-d2b2fa3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menacing-aru10-d2b2fa3a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menacing-aru9-d2b2fa3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menacing-aru3-d2b2fa3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menacing-aru7-d2b2fa3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menacing-aru8-d2b2fa3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menacing-aru2-d2b2fa3a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menacing-ljspeech-d2b2fa3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menacing-lt408-d2b2fa3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menacing-lt138-d2b2fa3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menacing-lt624-d2b2fa3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menacing-lt396-d2b2fa3a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menacing-lt498-d2b2fa3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menacing-lt132-d2b2fa3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menacing-lt288-d2b2fa3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menacing-lt42-d2b2fa3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/menacing-lt90-d2b2fa3a.mp3\"]}}', 'Menacing là tính từ, menace là danh từ hoặc động từ.', 'office', 1, 20),
('7ab6d4fd-8ec4-579a-9bac-27136b68b34f', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '8725c478-984b-529a-b658-60921d5c44c6', '8b1f136e-8650-541c-9118-9da92e68e74b', 'reticent', '/ˈretɪsnt/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Không muốn tiết lộ suy nghĩ hoặc cảm xúc, thường im lặng.', 'unwilling to speak or reveal your thoughts and feelings to other people.', 'He was very reticent about his past, rarely sharing personal details.', 'Anh ấy rất kín đáo về quá khứ của mình, hiếm khi chia sẻ chi tiết cá nhân.', '{\"en\": \"The manager remained reticent during the meeting about the proposed budget cuts.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý vẫn kín tiếng trong suốt cuộc họp về việc cắt giảm ngân sách được đề xuất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reticent-ljspeech-8ea488a6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reticent-cori-8ea488a6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reticent-53c43592.webp', '[\"reserved\", \"uncommunicative\", \"taciturn\"]', '[\"talkative\", \"candid\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"reticent about\", \"meaning\": \"kín tiếng về cái gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"remain reticent\", \"meaning\": \"tiếp tục giữ im lặng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"reluctant\", \"note_vi\": \"ngần ngại làm gì, không phải im lặng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"reticence\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reticent-cori-8ea488a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reticent-aru0-8ea488a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reticent-aru5-8ea488a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reticent-aru6-8ea488a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reticent-aru10-8ea488a6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reticent-aru9-8ea488a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reticent-aru3-8ea488a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reticent-aru7-8ea488a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reticent-aru8-8ea488a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reticent-aru2-8ea488a6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reticent-ljspeech-8ea488a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reticent-lt408-8ea488a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reticent-lt138-8ea488a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reticent-lt624-8ea488a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reticent-lt396-8ea488a6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reticent-lt498-8ea488a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reticent-lt132-8ea488a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reticent-lt288-8ea488a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reticent-lt42-8ea488a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reticent-lt90-8ea488a6.mp3\"]}}', 'Reticent là ít nói/kín tiếng, khác reluctant là ngần ngại hành động.', 'office', 1, 21),
('847fc03b-0dd7-56a4-b787-6310f5adcf17', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '8725c478-984b-529a-b658-60921d5c44c6', '8b1f136e-8650-541c-9118-9da92e68e74b', 'esoteric', '/ˌiːsəˈterɪk/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'chỉ dành cho một nhóm nhỏ người có kiến thức đặc biệt, khó hiểu với người ngoài.', 'known or understood by only a small number of people who have special knowledge.', 'The professor\'s lecture on quantum physics was too esoteric for most of the general audience.', 'Bài giảng của giáo sư về vật lý lượng tử quá bí truyền đối với hầu hết khán giả phổ thông.', '{\"en\": \"The software manual contained esoteric terms that only the senior developers could fully understand.\", \"vi\": \"Sách hướng dẫn phần mềm chứa các thuật ngữ chuyên môn sâu mà chỉ các nhà phát triển cấp cao mới có thể hiểu hết.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esoteric-ljspeech-c9ff86d6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esoteric-cori-c9ff86d6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/esoteric-b0455626.webp', '[\"obscure\", \"mysterious\", \"abstruse\"]', '[\"common\", \"public\", \"familiar\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"esoteric knowledge\", \"meaning\": \"kiến thức chuyên sâu/bí truyền\"}, {\"phrase\": \"esoteric subject\", \"meaning\": \"chủ đề khó hiểu/chuyên biệt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"exotic\", \"note_vi\": \"exotic nghĩa là ngoại lai, kỳ lạ; esoteric là khó hiểu, chuyên sâu\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"esoterically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esoteric-cori-c9ff86d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esoteric-aru0-c9ff86d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esoteric-aru5-c9ff86d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esoteric-aru6-c9ff86d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esoteric-aru10-c9ff86d6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esoteric-aru9-c9ff86d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esoteric-aru3-c9ff86d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esoteric-aru7-c9ff86d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esoteric-aru8-c9ff86d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esoteric-aru2-c9ff86d6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esoteric-ljspeech-c9ff86d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esoteric-lt408-c9ff86d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esoteric-lt138-c9ff86d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esoteric-lt624-c9ff86d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esoteric-lt396-c9ff86d6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esoteric-lt498-c9ff86d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esoteric-lt132-c9ff86d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esoteric-lt288-c9ff86d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esoteric-lt42-c9ff86d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esoteric-lt90-c9ff86d6.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này dùng để mô tả kiến thức mang tính hàn lâm, chuyên sâu, ít người biết.', 'technology', 1, 22),
('876ef2d7-6899-5b64-83e2-108ee64d2446', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '8725c478-984b-529a-b658-60921d5c44c6', '8b1f136e-8650-541c-9118-9da92e68e74b', 'prescription', 'UK: /prɪˈskrɪp.ʃən/ | US: /prɪˈskrɪp.ʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'đơn thuốc', 'An official written note from a doctor authorizing medicine for a patient.', 'The doctor wrote a prescription for my cough medicine.', 'Bác sĩ đã viết đơn thuốc cho thuốc trị ho của tôi.', '{\"en\": \"You can pick up your prescription medication at the pharmacy on the ground floor.\", \"vi\": \"Bạn có thể lấy thuốc theo đơn của mình tại nhà thuốc ở tầng trệt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-ljspeech-9fd01ae4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-cori-9fd01ae4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/prescription-f20cc915.webp', '[\"medication order\", \"instruction\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fill a prescription\", \"meaning\": \"lấy thuốc theo đơn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prescription medicine\", \"meaning\": \"thuốc kê đơn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"description\", \"note_vi\": \"description là sự bản mô tả chi tiết, còn prescription là toa/đơn thuốc bác sĩ kê.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"prescribe\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-cori-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru0-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru5-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru6-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru10-9fd01ae4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru9-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru3-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru7-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru8-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru2-9fd01ae4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-ljspeech-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-lt408-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-lt138-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-lt624-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-lt396-9fd01ae4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-lt498-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-lt132-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-lt288-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-lt42-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-lt90-9fd01ae4.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm hay gặp trong TOEIC Part 3/4 chủ đề sức khỏe: \'fill a prescription\' nghĩa là lấy thuốc/bốc thuốc theo đơn.', 'health', 1, 23),
('3fcaba6f-8ff9-583a-86e7-0f5e6a40c345', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '8725c478-984b-529a-b658-60921d5c44c6', '8b1f136e-8650-541c-9118-9da92e68e74b', 'fastidious', '/fæˈstɪdiəs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'rất cẩn thận và tỉ mỉ, khó tính trong việc làm hài lòng.', 'paying great attention to small details and wanting everything to be correct and perfect.', 'He was a fastidious eater, always checking the ingredients and preparation of his food.', 'Anh ấy là một người ăn uống kỹ tính, luôn kiểm tra nguyên liệu và cách chế biến món ăn.', '{\"en\": \"The fastidious manager inspected every detail of the report before submitting it to the director.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý kỹ tính đã kiểm tra từng chi tiết của báo cáo trước khi trình lên giám đốc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fastidious-ljspeech-f76577c2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fastidious-cori-f76577c2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fastidious-719c80d4.webp', '[\"meticulous\", \"demanding\", \"particular\"]', '[\"careless\", \"easygoing\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fastidious attention to detail\", \"meaning\": \"sự chú ý tỉ mỉ đến từng chi tiết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fastidious customer\", \"meaning\": \"khách hàng khó tính\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"particular\", \"note_vi\": \"particular chỉ là kỹ tính, fastidious là cực kỳ tỉ mỉ, khó chiều\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fastidiousness\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"fastidiously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fastidious-cori-f76577c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fastidious-aru0-f76577c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fastidious-aru5-f76577c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fastidious-aru6-f76577c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fastidious-aru10-f76577c2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fastidious-aru9-f