('ad02a85b-73a5-5070-a49b-aba3830724d3', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '8725c478-984b-529a-b658-60921d5c44c6', '8b1f136e-8650-541c-9118-9da92e68e74b', 'poll', 'UK: /pəʊl/ | US: /poʊl/', 'B2', 'verb', 'thăm dò ý kiến', 'to ask a group of people for their opinions on a specific subject.', 'The company decided to poll employees about new office policies.', 'Công ty quyết định thăm dò ý kiến nhân viên về các chính sách văn phòng mới.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing department polled registered users to assess satisfaction with the new software update.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng tiếp thị đã khảo sát những người dùng đã đăng ký để đánh giá mức độ hài lòng với bản cập nhật phần mềm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poll-ljspeech-4b687891.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poll-cori-4b687891.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/poll-ca37bb45.webp', '[\"survey\", \"interview\", \"canvass\", \"question\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"poll respondents\", \"meaning\": \"người trả lời khảo sát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"poll members on\", \"meaning\": \"thăm dò ý kiến thành viên về\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pole\", \"note_vi\": \"danh từ có nghĩa là cái cột hoặc cực (Bắc/Nam cực).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"poll\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"pollster\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poll-cori-4b687891.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poll-aru0-4b687891.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poll-aru5-4b687891.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poll-aru6-4b687891.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poll-aru10-4b687891.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poll-aru9-4b687891.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poll-aru3-4b687891.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poll-aru7-4b687891.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poll-aru8-4b687891.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poll-aru2-4b687891.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poll-ljspeech-4b687891.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poll-lt408-4b687891.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poll-lt138-4b687891.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poll-lt624-4b687891.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poll-lt396-4b687891.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poll-lt498-4b687891.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poll-lt132-4b687891.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poll-lt288-4b687891.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poll-lt42-4b687891.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poll-lt90-4b687891.mp3\"]}}', 'Cần phân biệt \'poll\' (v: khảo sát, thăm dò) và \'pole\' (n: cái cột).', 'marketing', 1, 25),
('ac267946-0860-58ed-a09c-6b34148f0541', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '8725c478-984b-529a-b658-60921d5c44c6', '8b1f136e-8650-541c-9118-9da92e68e74b', 'undermine', '/ˌʌndəˈmaɪn/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Làm suy yếu, phá hoại dần dần.', 'to gradually make something weaker or less effective.', 'Lack of trust can seriously undermine a relationship.', 'Thiếu tin tưởng có thể làm suy yếu nghiêm trọng một mối quan hệ.', '{\"en\": \"Frequent delays will undermine the client confidence in our service.\", \"vi\": \"Sự chậm trễ thường xuyên sẽ làm suy yếu lòng tin của khách hàng vào dịch vụ của chúng ta.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undermine-ljspeech-7ecd02fc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undermine-cori-7ecd02fc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/undermine-936b342d.webp', '[\"weaken\", \"sabotage\", \"erode\"]', '[\"strengthen\", \"support\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"undermine confidence\", \"meaning\": \"làm suy yếu lòng tin\"}, {\"phrase\": \"undermine authority\", \"meaning\": \"làm suy yếu quyền lực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"undermine efforts\", \"meaning\": \"phá hoại nỗ lực\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"underline\", \"note_vi\": \"underline là gạch chân, không phải làm suy yếu\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"undermining\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undermine-cori-7ecd02fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undermine-aru0-7ecd02fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undermine-aru5-7ecd02fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undermine-aru6-7ecd02fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undermine-aru10-7ecd02fc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undermine-aru9-7ecd02fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undermine-aru3-7ecd02fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undermine-aru7-7ecd02fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undermine-aru8-7ecd02fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undermine-aru2-7ecd02fc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undermine-ljspeech-7ecd02fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undermine-lt408-7ecd02fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undermine-lt138-7ecd02fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undermine-lt624-7ecd02fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undermine-lt396-7ecd02fc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undermine-lt498-7ecd02fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undermine-lt132-7ecd02fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undermine-lt288-7ecd02fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undermine-lt42-7ecd02fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undermine-lt90-7ecd02fc.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhầm underline (gạch chân) với undermine (làm suy yếu).', 'business', 1, 26),
('99e14e4c-433b-5aff-9d3d-0547f0b7bc6a', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', '8725c478-984b-529a-b658-60921d5c44c6', '8b1f136e-8650-541c-9118-9da92e68e74b', 'refundable', 'UK: /rɪˈfʌndəbl/ | US: /rɪˈfʌndəbl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'có thể hoàn lại', 'able to be returned to a person who paid money for a product or service.', 'The deposit is fully refundable if you cancel early.', 'Tiền đặt cọc được hoàn trả toàn bộ nếu bạn hủy sớm.', '{\"en\": \"The security deposit is fully refundable after the landlord inspects the apartment.\", \"vi\": \"Tiền đặt cọc bảo đảm sẽ được hoàn lại toàn bộ sau khi chủ nhà kiểm tra căn hộ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refundable-ljspeech-dc63db45.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refundable-cori-dc63db45.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/refundable-2b87121c.webp', '[\"reimbursable\", \"returnable\", \"repayable\"]', '[\"non-refundable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fully refundable\", \"meaning\": \"được hoàn tiền toàn bộ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"non-refundable deposit\", \"meaning\": \"tiền cọc không hoàn lại\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"renewable\", \"note_vi\": \"renewable nghĩa là có thể gia hạn hoặc tái tạo, khác với refundable là có thể hoàn tiền.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"refund\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"refund\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refundable-cori-dc63db45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refundable-aru0-dc63db45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refundable-aru5-dc63db45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refundable-aru6-dc63db45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refundable-aru10-dc63db45.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refundable-aru9-dc63db45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refundable-aru3-dc63db45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refundable-