('dfb4958f-03c3-588d-ae27-d265db9e3392', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', 'ca619a71-55d1-51b2-93e6-31bc29b4e194', '4ee7d933-a125-5828-8d55-5a5f6dd69ab3', 'keen', '/kiːn/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Rất nhiệt tình, hăng hái hoặc sắc bén.', 'very interested, eager, or wanting to do something very much.', 'She\'s very keen to learn new skills for her career.', 'Cô ấy rất hăng hái học các kỹ năng mới cho sự nghiệp của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing director is very keen on launching the new advertising campaign before the holidays.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc tiếp thị rất hào hứng với việc ra mắt chiến dịch quảng cáo mới trước kỳ nghỉ lễ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-ljspeech-ec00cfc2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-cori-ec00cfc2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/keen-72d5ba27.webp', '[\"eager\", \"enthusiastic\", \"sharp\"]', '[\"reluctant\", \"indifferent\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"keen on\", \"meaning\": \"hứng thú với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"keen interest\", \"meaning\": \"sự quan tâm sâu sắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"keen competition\", \"meaning\": \"cạnh tranh khốc liệt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"keenly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"keenness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-cori-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-aru0-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-aru5-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-aru6-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-aru10-ec00cfc2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-aru9-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-aru3-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-aru7-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-aru8-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-aru2-ec00cfc2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-ljspeech-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-lt408-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-lt138-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-lt624-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-lt396-ec00cfc2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-lt498-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-lt132-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-lt288-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-lt42-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-lt90-ec00cfc2.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với giới từ \'on\' (keen on doing something).', 'hr', 1, 19),
('a97bece5-0520-592e-8ab9-be982418000f', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', 'ca619a71-55d1-51b2-93e6-31bc29b4e194', '4ee7d933-a125-5828-8d55-5a5f6dd69ab3', 'ambivalent', '/æmˈbɪvələnt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'cảm thấy vừa thích vừa không thích, mâu thuẫn trong cảm xúc.', 'having mixed or opposing feelings about something or someone at the same time.', 'She felt ambivalent about moving to a new city, excited for the change but sad to leave her friends.', 'Cô ấy cảm thấy mâu thuẫn về việc chuyển đến một thành phố mới, vừa háo hức thay đổi nhưng cũng buồn khi phải rời xa bạn bè.', '{\"en\": \"The board members were ambivalent about the proposed merger due to potential financial risks.\", \"vi\": \"Các thành viên ban quản trị đã có cảm xúc lẫn lộn về vụ sáp nhập được đề xuất do các rủi ro tài chính tiềm ẩn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambivalent-ljspeech-ea585e63.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambivalent-cori-ea585e63.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ambivalent-0a19f509.webp', '[\"uncertain\", \"undecided\", \"conflicted\"]', '[\"certain\", \"decided\", \"unequivocal\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel ambivalent about\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy mâu thuẫn về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ambivalent attitude\", \"meaning\": \"thái độ nước đôi/lẫn lộn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"ambiguous\", \"note_vi\": \"ambiguous là mơ hồ, khó hiểu; ambivalent là mâu thuẫn trong thái độ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"ambivalence\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"ambivalently\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambivalent-cori-ea585e63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambivalent-aru0-ea585e63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambivalent-aru5-ea585e63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambivalent-aru6-ea585e63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambivalent-aru10-ea585e63.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambivalent-aru9-ea585e63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambivalent-aru3-ea585e63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambivalent-aru7-ea585e63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambivalent-aru8-ea585e63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambivalent-aru2-ea585e63.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambivalent-ljspeech-ea585e63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambivalent-lt408-ea585e63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambivalent-lt138-ea585e63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambivalent-lt624-ea585e63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambivalent-lt396-ea585e63.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambivalent-lt498-ea585e63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambivalent-lt132-ea585e63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambivalent-lt288-ea585e63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambivalent-lt42-ea585e63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambivalent-lt90-ea585e63.mp3\"]}}', 'Tiền tố \'ambi-\' nghĩa là cả hai. Ambivalent là có cả hai luồng cảm xúc trái ngược.', 'business', 1, 20),
('7c8013cf-d393-5f77-a93d-3af21255da88', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', 'ca619a71-55d1-51b2-93e6-31bc29b4e194', '4ee7d933-a125-5828-8d55-5a5f6dd69ab3', 'malevolence', '/məˈlevələns/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Sự ác ý, lòng thù hằn, mong muốn làm hại người khác.', 'a feeling of wanting to harm or hurt someone else.', 'The villain\'s smile was full of malevolence and dark intentions.', 'Nụ cười của kẻ phản diện đầy ác ý và những ý định đen tối.', '{\"en\": \"The HR manager detected malevolence in the anonymous complaint letter.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý nhân sự đã phát hiện ác ý trong bức thư khiếu nại ẩn danh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/malevolence-ljspeech-e1b5efe3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/malevolence-cori-e1b5efe3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/malevolence-29826121.webp', '[\"malice\", \"spite\", \"ill will\"]', '[\"benevolence\", \"goodwill\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"full of malevolence\", \"meaning\": \"đầy ác ý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"show malevolence\", \"meaning\": \"thể hiện ác ý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pure malevolence\", \"meaning\": \"ác ý thuần túy\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"benevolence\", \"note_vi\": \"trái nghĩa nhưng gần giống chính tả, nghĩa là thiện ý\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"malevolent\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"malevolently\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/malevolence-cori-e1b5efe3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/malevolence-aru0-e1b5efe3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/malevolence-aru5-e1b5efe3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/malevolence-aru6-e1b5efe3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/malevolence-aru10-e1b5efe3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/malevolence-aru9-e1b5efe3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/malevolence-aru3-e1b5efe3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/malevolence-aru7-e1b5efe3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/malevolence-aru8-e1b5efe3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/malevolence-aru2-e1b5efe3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/malevolence-ljspeech-e1b5efe3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/malevolence-lt408-e1b5efe3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/malevolence-lt138-e1b5efe3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/malevolence-lt624-e1b5efe3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/malevolence-lt396-e1b5efe3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/malevolence-lt498-e1b5efe3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/malevolence-lt132-e1b5efe3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/malevolence-lt288-e1b5efe3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/malevolence-lt42-e1b5efe3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/malevolence-lt90-e1b5efe3.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm malevolence (ác ý) với benevolence (thiện ý).', 'office', 1, 21),
('01969d65-50f7-5382-92c8-b63e56c3bb8f', '4b7cd0c9-3be0-5af8-9e5b-33c6dba6466a', 'ca619a71-55d1-51b2-93e6-31bc29b4e194', '4ee7d933-a125-5828-8d55-5a5f6dd69ab3', 'exhilarating', '/ɪɡˈzɪləreɪtɪŋ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'làm phấn khởi, hứng khởi và vui vẻ.', 'making you feel very happy, excited, and full of energy and life.', 'Winning the national championship was an exhilarating moment for the entire team.', 'Giành chức vô địch quốc gia là một khoảnh khắc phấn khởi đối với toàn bộ đội bóng.', '{\"en\": \"The company\'s rapid growth in the global market has been an exhilarating journey for us.\", \"vi\": \"Sự tăng trưởng nhanh chóng của công ty trên thị trường toàn cầu là một hành trình đầy phấn khởi đối với chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarating-ljspeech-6f7cd8d0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarating-cori-6f7cd8d0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/exhilarating-6b5a05ce.webp', '[\"thrilling\", \"exciting\"]', '[\"boring\", \"dull\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"exhilarating experience\", \"meaning\": \"trải nghiệm thú vị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"exhilarating pace\", \"meaning\": \"nhịp độ sôi động\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"exhilaration\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarating-cori-6f7cd8d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarating-aru0-6f7cd8d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarating-aru5-6f7cd8d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarating-aru6-6f7cd8d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarating-aru10-6f7cd8d0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarating-aru9-6f7cd8d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarating-aru3-6f7cd8d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarating-aru7-6f7cd8d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilaratin