('d4ac84de-7dc1-5cfc-b782-2607bfa4b0da', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '04d109ea-6f45-57ec-b456-cb7b7902f986', '9dacbe20-c457-584e-ad0d-585fc7cde270', 'snow', '/snəʊ/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Lớp tinh thể băng trắng rơi từ trên trời.', 'atmospheric moisture frozen into ice crystals that descend to the ground as white flakes.', 'The children were excited to play in the fresh snow that fell overnight.', 'Bọn trẻ rất háo hức được chơi trong lớp tuyết mới rơi qua đêm.', '{\"en\": \"Heavy snow has delayed several delivery trucks, so the shipment will arrive late this afternoon.\", \"vi\": \"Tuyết rơi dày đã làm trễ một số xe tải giao hàng, vì vậy lô hàng sẽ đến muộn vào chiều nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snow-ljspeech-b94e9f3d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snow-cori-b94e9f3d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/snow-59f76a1c.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"heavy snow\", \"meaning\": \"tuyết rơi dày\"}, {\"phrase\": \"melting snow\", \"meaning\": \"tuyết tan\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"snow\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"snowy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snow-cori-b94e9f3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snow-aru0-b94e9f3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snow-aru5-b94e9f3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snow-aru6-b94e9f3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snow-aru10-b94e9f3d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snow-aru9-b94e9f3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snow-aru3-b94e9f3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snow-aru7-b94e9f3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snow-aru8-b94e9f3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snow-aru2-b94e9f3d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snow-ljspeec