('3460dc52-b3da-5d81-adc4-ac46adc24edc', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '04d109ea-6f45-57ec-b456-cb7b7902f986', '9dacbe20-c457-584e-ad0d-585fc7cde270', 'heartbroken', '/ˌhɑːtˈbrəʊkən/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy vô cùng buồn bã hoặc thất vọng.', 'feeling extremely sad because something very unpleasant or disappointing has happened.', 'The founder was heartbroken to see the family business close down after thirty years.', 'Người sáng lập đã rất đau lòng khi thấy doanh nghiệp gia đình phải đóng cửa sau ba mươi năm.', '{\"en\": \"The store manager was heartbroken when the company decided to close the branch.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý cửa hàng rất đau lòng khi công ty quyết định đóng cửa chi nhánh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartbroken-ljspeech-9f912a61.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartbroken-cori-9f912a61.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/heartbroken-1395d75b.webp', '[\"devastated\", \"grief-stricken\"]', '[\"overjoyed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel heartbroken\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy đau lòng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"heartbreak\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartbroken-cori-9f912a61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartbroken-aru0-9f912a61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartbroken-aru5-9f912a61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartbroken-aru6-9f912a61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartbroken-aru10-9f912a61.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartbroken-aru9-9f912a61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartbroken-aru3-9f912a61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartbroken-aru7-9f912a61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartbroken-aru8-9f912a61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartbroken-aru2-9f912a61.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartbroken-ljspeech-9f912a61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartbroken-lt408-9f912a61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartbroken-lt138-9f912a61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartbroken-lt624-9f912a61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartbroken-lt396-9f912a61.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartbroken-lt498-9f912a61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartbroken-lt132-9f912a61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartbroken-lt288-9f912a61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartbroken-lt42-9f912a61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartbroken-lt90-9f912a61.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để mô tả cảm xúc đau buồn sâu sắc khi gặp mất mát.', 'daily', 1, 8),
('c7986115-375f-5813-b11c-6f845ff3ca99', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '04d109ea-6f45-57ec-b456-cb7b7902f986', '9dacbe20-c457-584e-ad0d-585fc7cde270', 'sunset', '/ˈsʌnset/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Thời điểm mặt trời lặn vào buổi tối.', 'the time in the evening when the sun disappears below the horizon.', 'We watched the beautiful sunset over the ocean from our hotel balcony.', 'Chúng tôi ngắm hoàng hôn tuyệt đẹp trên biển từ ban công khách sạn.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel offers a dinner cruise that departs daily right before sunset.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn cung cấp một chuyến du thuyền ăn tối khởi hành hàng ngày ngay trước hoàng hôn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sunset-ljspeech-a812ce79.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sunset-cori-a812ce79.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sunset-074e93f3.webp', '[\"dusk\", \"twilight\", \"sundown\"]', '[\"sunrise\", \"dawn\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"beautiful sunset\", \"meaning\": \"hoàng hôn đẹp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"at sunset\", \"meaning\": \"vào lúc hoàng hôn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sunrise\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa là bình minh, lúc mặt trời mọc\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sunset-cori-a812ce79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sunset-aru0-a812ce79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sunset-aru5-a812ce79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sunset-aru6-a812ce79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sunset-aru10-a812ce79.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sunset-aru9-a812ce79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sunset-aru3-a812ce79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sunset-aru7-a812ce79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sunset-aru8-a812ce79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sunset-aru2-a812ce79.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/objec