('d3db0857-35e2-5dd2-824d-dc123c29f224', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '077e7afe-c832-5200-9411-955324bf1b49', 'a9cfa19e-2927-5645-a176-ca5f2090d69d', 'crocodile', '/ˈkrɒkədaɪl/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Loài bò sát lớn, sống dưới nước, có hàm răng sắc nhọn.', 'a large reptile with a long body that lives in rivers and lakes.', 'We saw a large crocodile basking in the sun by the river.', 'Chúng tôi thấy một con cá sấu lớn đang phơi nắng bên bờ sông.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency warned tourists about the wild crocodile population near the river resort.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty du lịch đã cảnh báo du khách về số lượng cá sấu hoang dã gần khu nghỉ dưỡng ven sông.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crocodile-ljspeech-c1673dca.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crocodile-cori-c1673dca.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/crocodile-89769657.webp', '[\"alligator\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crocodile-cori-c1673dca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crocodile-aru0-c1673dca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crocodile-aru5-c1673dca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crocodile-aru6-c1673dca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crocodile-aru10-c1673dca.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crocodile-aru9-c1673dca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crocodile-aru3-c1673dca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crocodile-aru7-c1673dca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crocodile-aru8-c1673dca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crocodile-aru2-c1673dca.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crocodile-ljspeech-c1673dca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crocodile-lt408-c1673dca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cr