('2d9eff5e-60ac-56a5-bbc0-46851c55201f', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '077e7afe-c832-5200-9411-955324bf1b49', 'a9cfa19e-2927-5645-a176-ca5f2090d69d', 'planet', '/ˈplænɪt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Thiên thể lớn quay quanh một ngôi sao; hành tinh.', 'a massive celestial body orbiting a central star, which does not emit its own light.', 'Mars is often called the \"Red Planet\" due to its distinctive color.', 'Sao Hỏa thường được gọi là \"Hành tinh Đỏ\" vì màu sắc đặc trưng của nó.', '{\"en\": \"Our company is committed to developing green technologies to protect the planet.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi cam kết phát triển các công nghệ xanh để bảo vệ hành tinh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/planet-ljspeech-c8fb554a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/planet-cori-c8fb554a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/planet-bd1b3271.webp', '[\"globe\", \"world\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"protect the planet\", \"meaning\": \"bảo vệ hành tinh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"red planet\", \"meaning\": \"hành tinh đỏ (sao Hỏa)\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"plant\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa là thực vật hoặc nhà máy, viết gần giống\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"planetary\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/planet-cori-c8fb554a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/planet-aru0-c8fb554a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/planet-aru5-c8fb554a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/planet-aru6-c8fb554a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/planet-aru10-c8fb554a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/planet-aru9-c8fb554a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/planet-aru3-c8fb554a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/planet-aru7-c8fb554a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/planet-aru8-c8fb554a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plan