('3407df33-7086-5c27-88a3-d43c992b3273', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '077e7afe-c832-5200-9411-955324bf1b49', 'a9cfa19e-2927-5645-a176-ca5f2090d69d', 'rectangle', '/ˈrektæŋɡl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Hình học phẳng có bốn cạnh, bốn góc vuông, với các cặp cạnh đối diện bằng nhau.', 'a shape with four straight sides and four right angles, two sides being longer.', 'The computer screen usually has the shape of a rectangle.', 'Màn hình máy tính thường có hình dạng là một hình chữ nhật.', '{\"en\": \"Please draw a rectangle on the floor plan to mark the new office space.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng vẽ một hình chữ nhật trên sơ đồ mặt bằng để đánh dấu không gian văn phòng mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rectangle-ljspeech-bf945223.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rectangle-cori-bf945223.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rectangle-7fbe25bd.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"draw a rectangle\", \"meaning\": \"vẽ hình chữ nhật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"perfect rectangle\", \"meaning\": \"hình chữ nhật hoàn hảo\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rectangle-cori-bf945223.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rectangle-aru0-bf945223.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rectangle-aru5-bf945223.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rectangle-aru6-bf945223.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rectangle-aru10-bf945223.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rectangle-aru9-bf945223.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rectangle-aru3-bf945223.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rectangle-aru7-bf945223.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rectangle-aru8-bf945223.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rectangle-aru2-bf945223.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rectangle-ljspeech-bf945223.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rectangle-lt408-bf945223.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rectangle-lt138-bf945223.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rectangle-lt624-bf945223.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rectangle-lt396-bf945223.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rectangle-lt498-bf945223.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rectangle-lt132-bf945223.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rectangle-lt288-bf945223.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rectangle-lt42-bf945223.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rectangle-lt90-bf945223.mp3\"]}}', '', 'office', 1, 22),
('3add8f22-61c1-5287-943a-8dbc2802afc1', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '077e7afe-c832-5200-9411-955324bf1b49', 'a9cfa19e-2927-5645-a176-ca5f2090d69d', 'hand', '/hænd/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Bộ phận cơ thể ở cuối cánh tay, dùng để cầm nắm.', 'the part of the body at the end of your arm including fingers.', 'He reached out his hand to shake mine warmly.', 'Anh ấy đưa bàn tay ra để bắt tay tôi một cách nồng nhiệt.', '{\"en\": \"The manager shook every new staff member\'s hand to welcome them to the office.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã bắt tay từng nhân viên mới để chào mừng họ đến văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-ljspeech-9621a244.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-cori-9621a244.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hand-eda99268.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"shake hands\", \"meaning\": \"bắt tay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"by hand\", \"meaning\": \"bằng tay (thủ công)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in hand\", \"meaning\": \"trong tay / đang xử lý\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"hand\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"handy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-cori-9621a244.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-aru0-9621a244.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-aru5-9621a244.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-aru6-9621a244.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-aru10-9621a244.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-aru9-9621a244.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-aru3-9621a244.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-aru7-9621a244.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-aru8-9621a244.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-aru2-9621a244.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-ljspeech-9621a244.mp3\", \"/sto