('0656c4e4-39c6-5482-9210-a4dc98a55464', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '077e7afe-c832-5200-9411-955324bf1b49', 'a9cfa19e-2927-5645-a176-ca5f2090d69d', 'truck', 'UK: /trʌk/ | US: /trʌk/', 'A2', 'noun', 'xe tải', 'a large, heavy motor vehicle used for transporting goods by road.', 'The delivery truck arrived early this morning.', 'Xe tải giao hàng đã đến sớm sáng nay.', '{\"en\": \"The delivery truck arrived early this morning to unload the shipment at the warehouse.\", \"vi\": \"Xe tải giao hàng đã đến sớm vào sáng nay để bốc dỡ lô hàng tại kho.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-ljspeech-7a4d63b1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-cori-7a4d63b1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/truck-c2b47e6d.webp', '[\"lorry\", \"van\", \"vehicle\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"delivery truck\", \"meaning\": \"xe tải giao hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"truck driver\", \"meaning\": \"tài xế xe tải\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"truck\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"trucking\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-cori-7a4d63b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-aru0-7a4d63b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-aru5-7a4d63b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-aru6-7a4d63b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-aru10-7a4d63b1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-aru9-7a4d63b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-aru3-7a4d63b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-aru7-7a4d63b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-aru8-7a4d63b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-aru2-7a4d63b1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-ljspeech-7a4d63b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-lt408-7a4d63b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-lt138-7a4d63b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-lt624-7a4d63b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-lt396-7a4d63b1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-lt498-7a4d63b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-lt132-7a4d63b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-lt288-7a4d63b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-lt42-7a4d63b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/truck-lt90-7a4d63b1.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong tiếng Anh-Anh thường dùng \'lorry\', còn \'truck\' phổ biến hơn trong tiếng Anh-Mỹ.', 'shipping', 1, 24),
('c58c805a-1423-55ff-94fc-24d90d54a0e8', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '077e7afe-c832-5200-9411-955324bf1b49', 'a9cfa19e-2927-5645-a176-ca5f2090d69d', 'weather', '/ˈweðə(r)/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Tình trạng khí quyển tại một thời điểm và địa điểm cụ thể.', 'the conditions in the air at a certain time, such as rain, wind, or sun.', 'The weather forecast predicts sunshine for the whole weekend.', 'Dự báo thời tiết cho biết trời sẽ nắng suốt cuối tuần.', '{\"en\": \"Due to bad weather, the outdoor corporate event has been postponed until next Friday.\", \"vi\": \"Do thời tiết xấu, sự kiện ngoài trời của công ty đã bị hoãn lại cho đến thứ Sáu tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weather-ljspeech-f98669cc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weather-cori-f98669cc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/weather-b87d0b2f.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"weather forecast\", \"meaning\": \"dự báo thời tiết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"severe weather\", \"meaning\": \"thời tiết khắc nghiệt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"whether\", \"note_vi\": \"Từ nối nghĩa là liệu có... hay không, phát âm giống hệt.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weather-cori-f98669cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weather-aru0-f98669cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weather-aru5-f98669cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weather-aru6-f98669cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weather-aru10-f98669cc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weather-aru9-f98669cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weather-aru3-f98669cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weather-aru7-f98669cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weather-aru8-f98669cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weather-aru2-f98669cc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weather-ljspeech-f98669cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weather-lt408-f98669cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weather-lt138-f98669cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weather-lt624-f98669cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weather-lt396-f98669cc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weather-lt498-f98669cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weather-lt132-f98669cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weather-lt288-f98669cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weather-lt42-f98669cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weather-lt90-f98669cc.mp3\"]}}', 'Cần phân biệt phát âm và cách viết giữa weather và whether.', 'travel', 1, 25)
