('cb985d07-5bc2-5f5a-8dda-7101005e68f6', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '089824df-2c43-5d97-b0e4-5cd1bc0078db', '250d379c-1766-51ee-b529-5df60c4170ff', 'cover', 'UK: /ˈkʌvə/ | US: /ˈkʌvər/', 'B1', 'verb', 'che phủ', 'To put something on top of or over a surface to protect, hide, or enclose it completely.', 'Snow covered the ground overnight.', 'Tuyết bao phủ mặt đất qua đêm.', '{\"en\": \"The corporate travel policy covers all reasonable meal expenses during business trips.\", \"vi\": \"Chính sách công tác của công ty chi trả toàn bộ chi phí ăn uống hợp lý trong các chuyến công tác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cover-ljspeech-a28100fa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cover-cori-a28100fa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cover-b85e7672.webp', '[\"include\", \"insure\", \"handle\", \"conceal\"]', '[\"uncover\", \"expose\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"cover the cost\", \"meaning\": \"chi trả chi phí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cover a topic\", \"meaning\": \"đề cập đến một chủ đề\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"recover\", \"note_vi\": \"Phục hồi sức khỏe hoặc lấy lại tài sản đã mất.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"coverage\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"covered\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cover-cori-a28100fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cover-aru0-a28100fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cover-aru5-a28100fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cover-aru6-a28100fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cover-aru10-a28100fa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cover-aru9-a28100fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cover-aru3-a28100fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cover-aru7-a28100fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cover-aru8-a28100fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciatio