('75bff8c4-1410-5a84-9552-e383bd1cd6b7', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '089824df-2c43-5d97-b0e4-5cd1bc0078db', '250d379c-1766-51ee-b529-5df60c4170ff', 'cheese', '/tʃiːz/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Thực phẩm làm từ sữa đông, có nhiều loại và hương vị.', 'a solid food made from the milk of cows, goats, or sheep.', 'I like to put some grated cheese on my pasta.', 'Tôi thích rắc một ít phô mai bào lên mì ống của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The catering service provided a variety of imported cheese for the international conference.\", \"vi\": \"Dịch vụ ăn uống đã cung cấp nhiều loại phô mai nhập khẩu cho hội nghị quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheese-ljspeech-bcef7a04.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheese-cori-bcef7a04.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cheese-3e080dc6.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cream cheese\", \"meaning\": \"kem phô mai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cheese platter\", \"meaning\": \"khay phô mai\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"cheesy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheese-cori-bcef7a04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheese-aru0-bcef7a04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheese-aru5-bcef7a04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheese-aru6-bcef7a04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheese-aru10-bcef7a04.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheese-aru9-bcef7a04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheese-aru3-bcef7a04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheese-aru7-bcef7a04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheese-aru8-bcef7a04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheese-aru2-bcef7a04.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheese-ljspeech-bcef7a04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheese-lt408-b