('8e445178-7a8a-5f30-887b-7b2840f447b0', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '089824df-2c43-5d97-b0e4-5cd1bc0078db', '250d379c-1766-51ee-b529-5df60c4170ff', 'infection', '/ɪnˈfekʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng bị vi khuẩn hoặc virus tấn công, gây bệnh.', 'an illness caused by bacteria or viruses entering the body.', 'Washing minor wounds carefully helps stop bacteria from causing a painful skin infection.', 'Rửa kỹ các vết thương nhỏ giúp ngăn chặn vi khuẩn gây ra tình trạng nhiễm trùng da đau đớn.', '{\"en\": \"Employees must wash their hands regularly to prevent the spread of bacterial infection.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phải rửa tay thường xuyên để ngăn ngừa sự lây lan của nhiễm trùng vi khuẩn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-ljspeech-afb56160.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-cori-afb56160.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/infection-e03ead4f.webp', '[\"contamination\", \"disease\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"prevent infection\", \"meaning\": \"ngăn ngừa nhiễm trùng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bacterial infection\", \"meaning\": \"nhiễm trùng do vi khuẩn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"affection\", \"note_vi\": \"affection là lòng yêu thương, dễ nhầm vì viết gần giống\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"infect\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"infectious\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-cori-afb56160.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-aru0-afb56160.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-aru5-afb56160.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-aru6-afb56160.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-aru10-afb56160.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-aru9-afb56160.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-aru3-afb56160.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/i