('c6cf273b-4f29-50ca-88ba-28f48c8e5c07', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '089824df-2c43-5d97-b0e4-5cd1bc0078db', '250d379c-1766-51ee-b529-5df60c4170ff', 'carpet', '/ˈkɑːpɪt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Tấm vải dày dùng để trải sàn nhà.', 'a thick material made of wool or hair, used for covering floors.', 'We just bought a new carpet for the living room.', 'Chúng tôi vừa mua một tấm thảm mới cho phòng khách.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance crew will clean the office carpet during the weekend to avoid disruption.\", \"vi\": \"Đội bảo trì sẽ giặt thảm văn phòng vào cuối tuần để tránh gây gián đoạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-ljspeech-be207b77.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-cori-be207b77.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/carpet-0968d49e.webp', '[\"rug\", \"mat\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"red carpet\", \"meaning\": \"thảm đỏ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"carpet cleaning\", \"meaning\": \"việc giặt thảm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"rug\", \"note_vi\": \"thảm nhỏ hơn, không che phủ toàn bộ sàn nhà như carpet\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"carpet\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-cori-be207b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-aru0-be207b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-aru5-be207b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-aru6-be207b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-aru10-be207b77.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-aru9-be207b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-aru3-be207b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-aru7-be207b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-aru8-be207b77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-aru2-be207b77.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carpet-ljs