('2ae94ca7-b09e-51b7-a5c9-2172435703e1', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '089824df-2c43-5d97-b0e4-5cd1bc0078db', '250d379c-1766-51ee-b529-5df60c4170ff', 'jaw', '/dʒɔː/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Phần xương cấu tạo nên miệng, bao gồm cả răng.', 'either of the two bony structures in the head that hold the teeth.', 'He clenched his jaw in frustration after hearing the bad news.', 'Anh ấy nghiến chặt hàm vì thất vọng sau khi nghe tin xấu.', '{\"en\": \"The factory worker wore protective gear to prevent any injuries to his jaw.\", \"vi\": \"Công nhân nhà máy đã đeo đồ bảo hộ để tránh bị thương ở hàm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jaw-ljspeech-0ee2993d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jaw-cori-0ee2993d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/jaw-89d1449f.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"upper jaw\", \"meaning\": \"hàm trên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lower jaw\", \"meaning\": \"hàm dưới\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jaw-cori-0ee2993d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jaw-aru0-0ee2993d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jaw-aru5-0ee2993d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jaw-aru6-0ee2993d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jaw-aru10-0ee2993d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jaw-aru9-0ee2993d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jaw-aru3-0ee2993d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jaw-aru7-0ee2993d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jaw-aru8-0ee2993d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jaw-aru2-0ee2993d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jaw-ljspeech-0ee2993d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jaw-lt408-0ee2993d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jaw-lt138-0ee2993d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jaw-lt624-0ee2993d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jaw-lt396-0ee2993d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jaw-lt498-0ee2993d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jaw-lt132-0ee2993d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jaw-lt288-0ee2993d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jaw-lt42-0ee2993d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jaw-lt90-0ee2993d.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với \'jawbone\' (xương hàm) hoặc \'chin\' (cằm).', 'health', 1, 29),
('ea514c9c-41c1-50e0-8432-491e06570d7f', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '148572bc-795c-5fde-a79c-b7232a9bc500', '9ccc6733-3ead-56ce-bf37-3c62bef5135f', 'cloud', '/klaʊd/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hệ thống máy chủ từ xa dùng để lưu trữ và xử lý dữ liệu qua internet.', 'a computer network where files and programs can be stored and accessed over the internet.', 'Many companies are moving their data to the cloud for better accessibility and security.', 'Nhiều công ty đang chuyển dữ liệu của họ lên đám mây để dễ truy cập và bảo mật hơn.', '{\"en\": \"All employee records are now stored securely in the cloud to prevent data loss.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả hồ sơ nhân viên hiện được lưu trữ an toàn trên đám mây để tránh mất dữ liệu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloud-ljspeech-000e793d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloud-cori-000e793d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cloud-1ffcde03.webp', '[\"network\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cloud computing\", \"meaning\": \"điện toán đám mây\"}, {\"phrase\": \"upload to the cloud\", \"meaning\": \"tải lên đám mây\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloud-cori-000e793d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloud-aru0-000e793d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloud-aru5-000e793d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloud-aru6-000e793d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloud-aru10-000e793d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloud-aru9-000e793d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloud-aru3-000e793d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloud-aru7-000e793d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloud-aru8-000e793d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloud-aru2-000e793d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloud-ljspeech-000e793d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloud-lt408-000e793d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloud-lt138-000e793d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloud-lt624-000e793d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloud-lt396-000e793d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloud-lt498-000e793d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloud-lt132-000e793d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloud-lt288-000e793d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloud-lt42-000e793d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloud-lt90-000e793d.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng với mạo từ \'the\' (the cloud) khi nói về công nghệ.', 'technology', 1, 0),
('c5d8659b-ac4a-578d-8202-202a6cf308aa', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '148572bc-795c-5fde-a79c-b7232a9bc500', '9ccc6733-3ead-56ce-bf37-3c62bef5135f', 'self-employed', '/ˌsɛlfɪmˈplɔɪd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Tự làm chủ công việc kinh doanh của mình, không làm thuê cho ai.', 'working independently for oneself rather than receiving a fixed salary from a company.', 'Many artists choose to be self-employed to have more creative freedom.', 'Nhiều nghệ sĩ chọn tự kinh doanh để có nhiều tự do sáng tạo hơn.', '{\"en\": \"Many self-employed consultants submit their invoices to clients at the end of each month.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiều cố vấn tự kinh doanh gửi hóa đơn cho khách hàng vào cuối mỗi tháng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-employed-ljspeech-229d05ad.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-employed-cori-229d05ad.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/self-employed-af16eaa8.webp', '[\"freelance\", \"independent\"]', '[\"employed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"self-employed worker\", \"meaning\": \"người lao động tự do\"}, {\"phrase\": \"become self-employed\", \"meaning\": \"trở thành người tự kinh doanh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"unemployed\", \"note_vi\": \"unemployed là thất nghiệp, self-employed là tự làm chủ/kinh doanh\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"self-employment\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-employed-cori-229d05ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-employed-aru0-229d05ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-employed-aru5-229d05ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-employed-aru6-229d05ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-employed-aru10-229d05ad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-employed-aru9-229d05ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-employed-aru3-229d05ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/