('7a8066f2-0304-519b-a354-e87bc1a19260', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '148572bc-795c-5fde-a79c-b7232a9bc500', '9ccc6733-3ead-56ce-bf37-3c62bef5135f', 'anxious', '/ˈæŋkʃəs/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy lo lắng hoặc bồn chồn về điều gì đó.', 'feeling worried or nervous about something that might happen in the future.', 'Investors became anxious after hearing rumors of a potential financial deficit.', 'Các nhà đầu tư trở nên lo lắng sau khi nghe đồn về khả năng thâm hụt tài chính.', '{\"en\": \"The investors were anxious about the sudden drop in the company\'s quarterly sales figures.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhà đầu tư lo âu về sự sụt giảm đột ngột trong doanh số hàng quý của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-ljspeech-3d58dabf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-cori-3d58dabf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/anxious-5ebf0d83.webp', '[\"worried\", \"nervous\", \"concerned\"]', '[\"calm\", \"relaxed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"anxious about\", \"meaning\": \"lo lắng về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"feel anxious\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy lo âu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"eager\", \"note_vi\": \"eager là háo hức (tích cực), anxious là lo âu (tiêu cực)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"anxiety\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"anxiously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-cori-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru0-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru5-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru6-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru10-3d58dabf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru9-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru3-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru7-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/