('a4e77c1d-be2b-5ee8-b034-4643940ed40b', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '148572bc-795c-5fde-a79c-b7232a9bc500', '9ccc6733-3ead-56ce-bf37-3c62bef5135f', 'fork', '/fɔːk/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Dụng cụ ăn có răng dùng để xiên thức ăn.', 'a small tool with three or four points, used for picking up and eating food.', 'Please pass me a fork so I can eat my salad.', 'Làm ơn đưa cho tôi một cái nĩa để tôi ăn món salad.', '{\"en\": \"The waiter quickly replaced the dirty fork that had fallen under the dining table.\", \"vi\": \"Người phục vụ đã nhanh chóng thay chiếc nĩa bẩn bị rơi dưới bàn ăn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fork-ljspeech-3f673f2a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fork-cori-3f673f2a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fork-6d18ecac.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"knife and fork\", \"meaning\": \"dao và nĩa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"plastic fork\", \"meaning\": \"nĩa nhựa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"spoon\", \"note_vi\": \"thìa, dùng để múc chất lỏng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"fork\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fork-cori-3f673f2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fork-aru0-3f673f2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fork-aru5-3f673f2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fork-aru6-3f673f2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fork-aru10-3f673f2a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fork-aru9-3f673f2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fork-aru3-3f673f2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fork-aru7-3f673f2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fork-aru8-3f673f2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fork-aru2-3f673f2a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fork-ljspeech-3f673f2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fork-lt4