('4af4fdee-8c89-5c0e-9764-fc84e7672ec9', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '148572bc-795c-5fde-a79c-b7232a9bc500', '9ccc6733-3ead-56ce-bf37-3c62bef5135f', 'orange', '/ˈɔːrɪndʒ/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Màu sắc giữa đỏ và vàng, giống màu quả cam.', 'a bright color that is made by mixing red and yellow together.', 'All staff members wore bright orange safety vests during the construction site tour.', 'Tất cả các nhân viên đều mặc áo phản quang màu cam tươi trong chuyến tham quan công trường.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team chose bright orange for the new product packaging to attract young customers.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã chọn màu cam sáng cho bao bì sản phẩm mới để thu hút khách hàng trẻ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/orange-ljspeech-ef0ebbb7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/orange-cori-ef0ebbb7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/orange-310e6b67.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"bright orange\", \"meaning\": \"màu cam sáng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"shade of orange\", \"meaning\": \"sắc độ màu cam\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"orange\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/orange-cori-ef0ebbb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/orange-aru0-ef0ebbb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/orange-aru5-ef0ebbb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/orange-aru6-ef0ebbb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/orange-aru10-ef0ebbb7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/orange-aru9-ef0ebbb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/orange-aru3-ef0ebbb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/orange-aru7-ef0ebbb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/orange-aru8-ef0ebbb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/orange-aru2-ef0ebbb7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/