('9eb901f5-4287-5b45-9315-4986989073f5', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '148572bc-795c-5fde-a79c-b7232a9bc500', '9ccc6733-3ead-56ce-bf37-3c62bef5135f', 'shark', '/ʃɑːk/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Loài cá biển lớn, ăn thịt, có hàm răng sắc nhọn.', 'a large sea creature with a skeleton made of cartilage and sharp teeth for eating.', 'Divers often see different types of shark in tropical waters.', 'Thợ lặn thường thấy nhiều loại cá mập khác nhau ở vùng biển nhiệt đới.', '{\"en\": \"The documentary about the shark population was shown during the international environmental conference last week.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phim tài liệu về quần thể cá mập đã được chiếu trong hội nghị môi trường quốc tế tuần trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shark-ljspeech-4f90af66.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shark-cori-4f90af66.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shark-dd21932c.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"shark attack\", \"meaning\": \"cá mập tấn công\"}, {\"phrase\": \"great white shark\", \"meaning\": \"cá mập trắng lớn\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shark-cori-4f90af66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shark-aru0-4f90af66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shark-aru5-4f90af66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shark-aru6-4f90af66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shark-aru10-4f90af66.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shark-aru9-4f90af66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shark-aru3-4f90af66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shark-aru7-4f90af66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shark-aru8-4f90af66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shark-aru2-4f90af66.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shark-ljspeech-4f90af66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/objec