('66162839-94c2-501d-91f1-8dc4dc28376d', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '148572bc-795c-5fde-a79c-b7232a9bc500', '9ccc6733-3ead-56ce-bf37-3c62bef5135f', 'frog', '/frɒɡ/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Động vật lưỡng cư nhỏ, có da trơn, sống gần nước và nhảy.', 'a small green animal that lives in water and on land.', 'After the heavy rainfall, several frogs croaked loudly from the edge of the lake.', 'Sau trận mưa lớn, vài con ếch kêu râm ran từ phía bờ hồ.', '{\"en\": \"The pond near the hotel had a loud frog singing at night.\", \"vi\": \"Cái ao gần khách sạn có một con ếch kêu to vào ban đêm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-ljspeech-b3e0f62f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-cori-b3e0f62f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/frog-87276890.webp', '[\"toad\", \"bullfrog\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"green frog\", \"meaning\": \"ếch xanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"frog legs\", \"meaning\": \"đùi ếch\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tree frog\", \"meaning\": \"ếch cây\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fog\", \"note_vi\": \"sương mù, phát âm gần giống\"}, {\"word\": \"frock\", \"note_vi\": \"áo ngắn, dễ nhầm chính tả\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"froggy\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"froglet\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-cori-b3e0f62f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-aru0-b3e0f62f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-aru5-b3e0f62f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-aru6-b3e0f62f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-aru10-b3e0f62f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-aru9-b3e0f62f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-aru3-b3e0f62f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-aru7-b3e0f62f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frog-aru8-b3e0f62f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronuncia