('e9acbb79-5283-58ba-aae9-bfdfcf9a5310', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '1557ad08-68b6-56cd-a988-130c6875527e', 'ae9e1ee2-ec88-5c73-a181-8e0302a3b9ad', 'miss', 'UK: /mɪs/ | US: /mɪs/', 'A1', 'verb', 'bỏ lỡ', 'To fail to catch, hit, reach, or attend something desirable.', 'I hope you don\'t miss your flight.', 'Tôi hy vọng bạn không bỏ lỡ chuyến bay của mình.', '{\"en\": \"If we miss the project deadline, we may lose the contract with our primary client.\", \"vi\": \"Nếu chúng ta bỏ lỡ thời hạn dự án, chúng ta có thể mất hợp đồng với khách hàng chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miss-ljspeech-f749d76f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miss-cori-f749d76f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/miss-fefe4fe6.webp', '[\"skip\", \"fail to attend\", \"overlook\"]', '[\"attend\", \"catch\", \"meet\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"miss a deadline\", \"meaning\": \"bỏ lỡ/trễ thời hạn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"miss a flight\", \"meaning\": \"lỡ chuyến bay\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"lose\", \"note_vi\": \"Miss a train/deadline = lỡ chuyến/hạn; Lose something = đánh mất đồ đạc/tài sản.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"missing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miss-cori-f749d76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miss-aru0-f749d76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miss-aru5-f749d76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miss-aru6-f749d76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miss-aru10-f749d76f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miss-aru9-f749d76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miss-aru3-f749d76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miss-aru7-f749d76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miss-aru8-f749d76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miss-aru2-f749d76f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miss-ljspeech-f749d76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miss-lt408-f749d76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miss-lt138-f749d76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miss-lt624-f749d76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miss-lt396-f749d76f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miss-lt498-f749d76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miss-lt132-f749d76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miss-lt288-f749d76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miss-lt42-f749d76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miss-lt90-f749d76f.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với deadline (trễ hạn), meeting (vắng mặt cuộc họp), flight/train (lỡ chuyến).', 'office', 1, 12),
('0aeb3194-0e51-54b1-8907-adfdee6812bf', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '1557ad08-68b6-56cd-a988-130c6875527e', 'ae9e1ee2-ec88-5c73-a181-8e0302a3b9ad', 'ride', '/raɪd/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Đi xe hoặc phương tiện, hoặc chở ai đó đi.', 'to travel in a vehicle that someone else is driving.', 'Can you ride me to the station? I\'m running late.', 'Bạn có thể chở tôi ra ga được không? Tôi đang bị muộn.', '{\"en\": \"I usually ride to the office with my colleague to save on fuel costs.\", \"vi\": \"Tôi thường đi nhờ xe đến văn phòng với đồng nghiệp để tiết kiệm chi phí nhiên liệu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-ljspeech-320ef6a3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-cori-320ef6a3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ride-0a606a35.webp', '[\"travel\", \"journey\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"ride a bicycle\", \"meaning\": \"đi xe đạp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ride in a car\", \"meaning\": \"đi xe ô tô\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"drive\", \"note_vi\": \"drive là tự lái xe, ride là đi nhờ hoặc lái xe hai bánh\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"rider\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"ride\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-cori-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-aru0-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-aru5-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-aru6-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-aru10-320ef6a3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-aru9-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-aru3-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-aru7-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-aru8-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-aru2-320ef6a3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-ljspeech-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-lt408-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-lt138-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-lt624-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-lt396-320ef6a3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-lt498-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-lt132-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-lt288-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-lt42-320ef6a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ride-lt90-320ef6a3.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng \'drive\' khi bạn tự lái ô tô, dùng \'ride\' khi bạn đi nhờ xe hoặc lái xe máy/xe đạp.', 'travel', 1, 13),
('20cb6da6-c290-5bf9-b10d-67595b2952a2', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '1557ad08-68b6-56cd-a988-130c6875527e', 'ae9e1ee2-ec88-5c73-a181-8e0302a3b9ad', 'bat', '/bæt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Loài động vật có vú biết bay, hoạt động về đêm.', 'a small flying animal with leather wings that usually flies at night.', 'We saw a bat flying around the old church tower at dusk.', 'Chúng tôi thấy một con dơi bay quanh tháp nhà thờ cũ vào lúc hoàng hôn.', '{\"en\": \"Pest control officers were hired to remove a bat colony from the warehouse.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên kiểm soát dịch hại đã được thuê để di dời một đàn dơi khỏi nhà kho.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-ljspeech-9b64d4ad.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-cori-9b64d4ad.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bat-2ae62950.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fruit bat\", \"meaning\": \"dơi ăn quả\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bat cave\", \"meaning\": \"hang dơi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bat\", \"note_vi\": \"Bat cũng có nghĩa là gậy đánh bóng trong môn bóng chày hoặc cricket.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-cori-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-aru0-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-aru5-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-aru6-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-aru10-9b64d4ad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-aru9-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-aru3-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-aru7-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-aru8-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-aru2-9b64d4ad.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-ljspeech-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-lt408-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-lt138-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-lt624-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-lt396-9b64d4ad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-lt498-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-lt132-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-lt288-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-lt42-9b64d4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bat-lt90-9b64d4ad.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý bat là từ đa nghĩa, vừa là con dơi vừa là gậy bóng chày.', 'nature', 1, 14),
('ad4ffffa-b940-52f0-b101-83f570883484', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '1557ad08-68b6-56cd-a988-130c6875527e', 'ae9e1ee2-ec88-5c73-a181-8e0302a3b9ad', 'straight', '/streɪt/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Không cong, không gập, theo một đường nhất định.', 'not bending or curving and continuing in only one direction.', 'After walking along the winding path, we reached a straight road leading downtown.', 'Sau khi đi dọc theo con đường ngoằn ngoèo, chúng tôi đã đến một con đường thẳng dẫn vào trung tâm thành phố.', '{\"en\": \"Please ensure that the company logo is placed in a straight line on the banner.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đảm bảo rằng logo công ty được đặt trên một đường thẳng trên biểu ngữ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-ljspeech-6ec09feb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-cori-6ec09feb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/straight-6ca7648d.webp', '[\"direct\", \"linear\", \"unbending\"]', '[\"curved\", \"crooked\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"straight line\", \"meaning\": \"đường thẳng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"straight answer\", \"meaning\": \"câu trả lời thẳng thắn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"strait\", \"note_vi\": \"đồng âm nhưng nghĩa là eo biển hoặc tình cảnh khó khăn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"straighten\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"straightforward\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-cori-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-aru0-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-aru5-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-aru6-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-aru10-6ec09feb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-aru9-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-aru3-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-aru7-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-aru8-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-aru2-6ec09feb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-ljspeech-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-lt408-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-lt138-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-lt624-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-lt396-6ec09feb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-lt498-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-lt132-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-lt288-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-lt42-6ec09feb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straight-lt90-6ec09feb.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với \'strait\' (eo biển) dù phát âm giống nhau.', 'office', 1, 15),
('2ab51696-9acd-55ca-8a01-a7b35ee4994a', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '1557ad08-68b6-56cd-a988-130c6875527e', 'ae9e1ee2-ec88-5c73-a181-8e0302a3b9ad', 'desk', '/desk/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Bàn có ngăn kéo, dùng để làm việc hoặc học tập.', 'An item of office or home furniture designed for reading, writing, or operating computers.', 'She keeps her books and laptop neatly organized on her study desk.', 'Cô ấy giữ sách vở và máy tính xách tay gọn gàng trên bàn học của mình.', '{\"en\": \"Please clear your desk before you leave the office at the end of the day.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng dọn dẹp bàn làm việc trước khi bạn rời văn phòng vào cuối ngày.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desk-ljspeech-46e7cfa0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desk-cori-46e7cfa0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/desk-cbb58719.webp', '[\"table\", \"workstation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"at your desk\", \"meaning\": \"tại bàn làm việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clear your desk\", \"meaning\": \"dọn dẹp bàn làm việc\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desk-cori-46e7cfa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desk-aru0-46e7cfa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desk-aru5-46e7cfa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desk-aru6-46e7cfa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desk-aru10-46e7cfa0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desk-aru9-46e7cfa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desk-aru3-46e7cfa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desk-aru7-46e7cfa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desk-aru8-46e7cfa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desk-aru2-46e7cfa0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desk-ljspeech-46e7cfa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desk-lt408-