('6eca2278-fc87-55ae-84e2-7f7bcbe93897', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '1557ad08-68b6-56cd-a988-130c6875527e', 'ae9e1ee2-ec88-5c73-a181-8e0302a3b9ad', 'sale', '/seɪl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Sự kiện bán hàng với giá thấp hơn bình thường.', 'a period when a store sells goods at lower prices than usual.', 'I bought this jacket during the summer sale and saved a lot of money.', 'Tôi đã mua chiếc áo khoác này trong đợt giảm giá mùa hè và tiết kiệm được rất nhiều tiền.', '{\"en\": \"The department store announced a massive summer sale starting next Monday for all clothing items.\", \"vi\": \"Cửa hàng bách hóa thông báo đợt giảm giá mùa hè lớn bắt đầu từ thứ Hai tới cho tất cả mặt hàng quần áo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-ljspeech-5b8a763b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-cori-5b8a763b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sale-a7716eb8.webp', '[\"discount\", \"clearance\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"on sale\", \"meaning\": \"đang giảm giá\"}, {\"phrase\": \"annual sale\", \"meaning\": \"đợt giảm giá hàng năm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sail\", \"note_vi\": \"Sail là đi thuyền, sale là giảm giá.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"sell\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-cori-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru0-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru5-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru6-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru10-5b8a763b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru9-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru3-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru7-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru8-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru2-5b8a763b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-ljspeech-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-lt408-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-lt138-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-lt624-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-lt396-5b8a763b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-lt498-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-lt132-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-lt288-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-lt42-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-lt90-5b8a763b.mp3\"]}}', 'Cẩn thận: \'on sale\' nghĩa là giảm giá, nhưng \'for sale\' nghĩa là đang được rao bán.', 'shopping', 1, 17),
('f2e5c1b2-0c7d-5c29-aeb0-07b7fe538be5', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '1557ad08-68b6-56cd-a988-130c6875527e', 'ae9e1ee2-ec88-5c73-a181-8e0302a3b9ad', 'chair', '/tʃeə(r)/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Đồ nội thất có lưng tựa và bốn chân, dùng để ngồi.', 'a piece of furniture with a back and four legs for one person to sit on.', 'The assistant brought an extra ergonomic chair into the conference room.', 'Trợ lý đã mang thêm một chiếc ghế công thái học vào phòng họp.', '{\"en\": \"Please ensure there is an extra chair available for the guest arriving at two o\'clock.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đảm bảo có sẵn một chiếc ghế phụ cho vị khách sẽ đến lúc hai giờ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chair-ljspeech-851e13a6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chair-cori-851e13a6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/chair-c9090cf0.webp', '[\"seat\", \"stool\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"office chair\", \"meaning\": \"ghế văn phòng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"take a chair\", \"meaning\": \"ngồi xuống\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chair-cori-851e13a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chair-aru0-851e13a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chair-aru5-851e13a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chair-aru6-851e13a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chair-aru10-851e13a6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chair-aru9-851e13a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chair-aru3-851e13a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chair-aru7-851e13a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chair-aru8-851e13a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chair-aru2-851e13a6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chair-ljspeech-851e13a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chair-lt408-851e13a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chair-lt138-851e13a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chair-lt624-851e13a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chair-lt396-851e13a6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chair-lt498-851e13a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chair-lt132-851e13a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chair-lt288-851e13a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chair-lt42-851e13a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chair-lt90-851e13a6.mp3\"]}}', 'Ghế có lưng tựa gọi là \'chair\', ghế đẩu không lưng gọi là \'stool\'.', 'office', 1, 18),
('d5ad3b7d-4874-53b6-afb5-28703f1cbfe2', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '1557ad08-68b6-56cd-a988-130c6875527e', 'ae9e1ee2-ec88-5c73-a181-8e0302a3b9ad', 'disappointed', '/ˌdɪsəˈpɔɪntɪd/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy buồn hoặc không hài lòng vì điều gì đó không như mong đợi.', 'upset or unhappy due to unmet expectations or an unsuccessful outcome.', 'Our manager was disappointed when the client canceled the important contract unexpectedly.', 'Quản lý của chúng tôi đã thất vọng khi khách hàng bất ngờ hủy hợp đồng quan trọng.', '{\"en\": \"The client was disappointed with the delayed shipment this quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng đã thất vọng với lô hàng bị trễ trong quý này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-ljspeech-74699616.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-cori-74699616.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/disappointed-dae90b3b.webp', '[\"upset\", \"dissatisfied\"]', '[\"pleased\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel disappointed\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy thất vọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"disappointed customer\", \"meaning\": \"khách hàng thất vọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deeply disappointed\", \"meaning\": \"rất thất vọng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"disappointing\", \"note_vi\": \"disappointing nói về việc gây thất vọng, disappointed nói về người\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"disappoint\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"disappointment\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-cori-74699616.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-aru0-74699616.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-aru5-74699616.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-aru6-74699616.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-aru10-74699616.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-aru9-74699616.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-aru3-74699616.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-aru7-74699616.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-aru8-74699616.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-aru2-74699616.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-ljspeech-74699616.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-lt408-74699616.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-lt138-74699616.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-lt624-74699616.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-lt396-74699616.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-lt498-74699616.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-lt132-74699616.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-lt288-74699616.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-lt42-74699616.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disappointed-lt90-74699616.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt disappointed (người) và disappointing (việc) khi dùng tính từ.', 'business', 1, 19),
('c4af5ff6-3817-52e1-b7d4-77c6dddde2d5', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '1557ad08-68b6-56cd-a988-130c6875527e', 'ae9e1ee2-ec88-5c73-a181-8e0302a3b9ad', 'household', '/ˈhaʊshəʊld/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một nhóm người sống cùng nhau trong một nhà, thường là một gia đình.', 'all the people living together in one house or home.', 'Our household tries to reduce waste by recycling everything possible.', 'Hộ gia đình chúng tôi cố gắng giảm rác thải bằng cách tái chế mọi thứ có thể.', '{\"en\": \"The market research survey standardly collects detailed income data from each target household.\", \"vi\": \"Cuộc khảo sát nghiên cứu thị trường thu thập dữ liệu thu nhập chi tiết từ mỗi hộ gia đình mục tiêu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/household-ljspeech-6a7855ea.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/household-cori-6a7855ea.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/household-e9678204.webp', '[\"family\", \"menage\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"household income\", \"meaning\": \"thu nhập hộ gia đình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"household appliances\", \"meaning\": \"thiết bị gia dụng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"household expense\", \"meaning\": \"chi phí sinh hoạt gia đình\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"housing\", \"note_vi\": \"Housing là việc cung cấp nhà ở hoặc hệ thống nhà ở nói chung.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/household-cori-6a7855ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/household-aru0-6a7855ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/household-aru5-6a7855ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/household-aru6-6a7855ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/household-aru10-6a7855ea.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/household-aru9-6a7855ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/household-aru3-6a7855ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/household-aru7-6a7855ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/household-aru8-6a7855ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/household-aru2-6a7855ea.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/household-ljspeech-6a7855ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/household-lt408-6a7855ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/household-lt138-6a7855ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/household-lt624-6a7855ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/household-lt396-6a7855ea.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/household-lt498-6a7855ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/household-lt132-6a7855ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/household-lt288-6a7855ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/household-lt42-6a7855ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/household-lt90-6a7855ea.mp3\"]}}', 'Household chỉ một nhóm người sống chung một mái nhà và sinh hoạt chung.', 'housing', 1, 20),
('4b9e0512-0665-59b8-97a0-2aeed22840f3', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '1557ad08-68b6-56cd-a988-130c6875527e', 'ae9e1ee2-ec88-5c73-a181-8e0302a3b9ad', 'suspect', 'UK: /səˈspɛkt/ | US: /səˈspɛkt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'nghi ngờ', 'To believe or feel that something is likely true without having firm evidence.', 'I suspect he knows the truth.', 'Tôi nghi ngờ anh ấy biết sự thật.', '{\"en\": \"We suspect that the technical glitch was caused by an outdated software update.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi nghi ngờ rằng sự cố kỹ thuật là do bản cập nhật phần mềm đã cũ gây ra.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-ljspeech-358bf3e5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-cori-358bf3e5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/suspect-39225095.webp', '[\"assume\", \"surmise\", \"distrust\"]', '[\"trust\", \"believe\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"suspect that\", \"meaning\": \"nghi ngờ rằng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"have reason to suspect\", \"meaning\": \"có lý do để nghi ngờ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"doubt\", \"note_vi\": \"Doubt là nghi ngờ không tin điều đó đúng/xảy ra, còn suspect nghi thiên về khả năng điều đó có thật.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"suspect\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"suspicious\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"suspicion\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-cori-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-aru0-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-aru5-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-aru6-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-aru10-358bf3e5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-aru9-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-aru3-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-aru7-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-aru8-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-aru2-358bf3e5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-ljspeech-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-lt408-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-lt138-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-lt624-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-lt396-358bf3e5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-lt498-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-lt132-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-lt288-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-lt42-358bf3e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suspect-lt90-358bf3e5.mp3\"]}}', 'Động từ \'suspect\' nghi ngờ điều gì là ĐÚNG (nghi là có), còn \'doubt\' nghi ngờ điều gì là SAI (nghi là không xảy ra).', 'office', 1, 21),
('17a7b160-586b-59b0-8303-c3d8b5cc9c29', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '1557ad08-68b6-56cd-a988-130c6875527e', 'ae9e1ee2-ec88-5c73-a181-8e0302a3b9ad', 'greet', 'UK: /ɡriːt/ | US: /ɡriːt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'chào hỏi, đón tiếp', 'to welcome someone upon arrival with friendly words or specific formal gestures', 'She will greet the guests warmly at the entrance.', 'Cô ấy sẽ chào đón khách nồng nhiệt ở lối vào.', '{\"en\": \"The receptionist will greet all visitors and issue them temporary security passes.\", \"vi\": \"Lễ tân sẽ chào đón tất cả khách ghé thăm và cấp thẻ an ninh tạm thời cho họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greet-ljspeech-35ff7178.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greet-cori-35ff7178.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/greet-9a2a358b.webp', '[\"welcome\", \"receive\", \"salute\"]', '[\"ignore\", \"dismiss\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"greet someone warmly\", \"meaning\": \"chào đón ai đó nồng nhiệt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"greet visitors\", \"meaning\": \"chào đón khách ghé thăm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"greeting\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greet-cori-35ff7178.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greet-aru0-35ff7178.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greet-aru5-35ff7178.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greet-aru6-35ff7178.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greet-aru10-35ff7178.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greet-aru9-35ff7178.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greet-aru3-35ff7178.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greet-aru7-35ff7178.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greet-aru8-35ff7178.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greet-aru2-35ff7178.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greet-ljspeech-35ff7178.mp3