('def3f843-6d31-5466-9cf2-463851d3b7b7', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '1557ad08-68b6-56cd-a988-130c6875527e', 'ae9e1ee2-ec88-5c73-a181-8e0302a3b9ad', 'lunch', '/lʌntʃ/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Bữa ăn giữa buổi sáng và buổi chiều.', 'a meal that people usually eat in the middle of the day.', 'We usually have lunch at 12:30 PM in the office cafeteria.', 'Chúng tôi thường ăn trưa lúc 12 giờ 30 phút chiều tại căng tin văn phòng.', '{\"en\": \"The manager invited the new clients to a business lunch at a nearby Italian restaurant.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã mời các khách hàng mới đi ăn trưa bàn công việc tại một nhà hàng Ý gần đó.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunch-ljspeech-09453054.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunch-cori-09453054.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lunch-366628c3.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"lunch break\", \"meaning\": \"giờ nghỉ trưa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"business lunch\", \"meaning\": \"bữa trưa bàn công việc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"luncheon\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunch-cori-09453054.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunch-aru0-09453054.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunch-aru5-09453054.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunch-aru6-09453054.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunch-aru10-09453054.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunch-aru9-09453054.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunch-aru3-09453054.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunch-aru7-09453054.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunch-aru8-09453054.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunch-aru2-09453054.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunch-ljspeech-09453054.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunc