('c86fb5aa-9345-5a63-ad32-da03671a8a62', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '2200c8de-118a-5f87-8fe1-b2a69625cb17', '0276126b-af61-5d26-8f25-2ce9526881ca', 'snowy', '/ˈsnəʊi/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có nhiều tuyết hoặc được bao phủ bởi tuyết.', 'having a lot of white frozen water falling from the sky or covering the ground.', 'We hope for a snowy Christmas this year so we can go sledding.', 'Chúng tôi hy vọng có một Giáng sinh có tuyết năm nay để chúng tôi có thể trượt xe trượt tuyết.', '{\"en\": \"Delivery services were delayed due to the extremely snowy weather conditions across the region.\", \"vi\": \"Dịch vụ giao hàng bị trì hoãn do điều kiện thời tiết có tuyết khắc nghiệt trên toàn khu vực.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snowy-ljspeech-50de10bb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snowy-cori-50de10bb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/snowy-8e412c58.webp', '[\"wintry\", \"cold\"]', '[\"sunny\", \"warm\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"snowy day\", \"meaning\": \"ngày có tuyết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"snowy weather\", \"meaning\": \"thời tiết có tuyết\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"snow\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snowy-cori-50de10bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snowy-aru0-50de10bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snowy-aru5-50de10bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snowy-aru6-50de10bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snowy-aru10-50de10bb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snowy-aru9-50de10bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snowy-aru3-50de10bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snowy-aru7-50de10bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snowy-aru8-50de10bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snowy-aru2-50de10bb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/