('71e1f372-dae7-5df4-9812-7b7bcce5e507', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '2200c8de-118a-5f87-8fe1-b2a69625cb17', '0276126b-af61-5d26-8f25-2ce9526881ca', 'message', '/ˈmesɪdʒ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một thông tin ngắn được gửi hoặc nhận, thường qua điện thoại hoặc internet.', 'a piece of information sent from one person to another.', 'Did you get my message about changing the appointment time?', 'Bạn đã nhận được tin nhắn của tôi về việc thay đổi thời gian cuộc hẹn chưa?', '{\"en\": \"The client left a voice message about the delayed shipment today.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng để lại tin nhắn thoại về lô hàng bị trễ hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-ljspeech-6f9b9af3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-cori-6f9b9af3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/message-da7f1a95.webp', '[\"text\", \"note\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"send a message\", \"meaning\": \"gửi tin nhắn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"voice message\", \"meaning\": \"tin nhắn thoại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"text message\", \"meaning\": \"tin nhắn văn bản\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"massage\", \"note_vi\": \"massage là xoa bóp, phát âm khác\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-cori-6f9b9af3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-aru0-6f9b9af3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-aru5-6f9b9af3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-aru6-6f9b9af3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-aru10-6f9b9af3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-aru9-6f9b9af3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-aru3-6f9b9af3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-aru7-6f9b9af3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-aru8-6f9b9af3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-aru2-6f9b9af3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-ljspeech-6f9b9af3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-lt408-6f9b9af3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-lt138-6f9b9af3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-lt624-6f9b9af3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-lt396-6f9b9af3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-lt498-6f9b9af3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-lt132-6f9b9af3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-lt288-6f9b9af3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-lt42-6f9b9af3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/message-lt90-6f9b9af3.mp3\"]}}', 'Message là tin nhắn, cẩn thận viết đúng chính tả với massage.', 'office', 1, 1),
('98ef3e80-7301-5dfa-ab49-ff71517f547f', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '2200c8de-118a-5f87-8fe1-b2a69625cb17', '0276126b-af61-5d26-8f25-2ce9526881ca', 'forget', 'UK: /fəˈɡɛt/ | US: /fərˈɡɛt/', 'A1', 'verb', 'quên', 'To fail to remember or keep something in one\'s mind.', 'Please don\'t forget to submit the report.', 'Xin đừng quên nộp báo cáo.', '{\"en\": \"Please do not forget to submit your monthly expense reports by Friday afternoon.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đừng quên nộp báo cáo chi phí hàng tháng trước chiều thứ Sáu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-ljspeech-b96cfac5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-cori-b96cfac5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/forget-e8547b0b.webp', '[\"overlook\", \"neglect\", \"omit\"]', '[\"remember\", \"recall\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"forget to do something\", \"meaning\": \"quên phải làm việc gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"easily forgotten\", \"meaning\": \"dễ bị lãng quên\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"leave\", \"note_vi\": \"Khi đề cập đến việc bỏ quên đồ vật tại một nơi cụ thể, dùng \'leave\' (e.g., I left my umbrella at the office), không dùng \'forget\'.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"forgetful\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"unforgettable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-cori-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-aru0-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-aru5-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-aru6-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-aru10-b96cfac5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-aru9-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-aru3-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-aru7-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-aru8-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-aru2-b96cfac5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-ljspeech-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-lt408-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-lt138-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-lt624-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-lt396-b96cfac5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-lt498-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-lt132-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-lt288-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-lt42-b96cfac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forget-lt90-b96cfac5.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý cấu trúc: \'forget to do\' (quên phải làm gì) khác với \'forget doing\' (quên đã làm gì trong quá khứ).', 'office', 1, 2),
('a57ae638-d64c-5118-aa28-4d80c98b33d8', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '2200c8de-118a-5f87-8fe1-b2a69625cb17', '0276126b-af61-5d26-8f25-2ce9526881ca', 'helmet', '/ˈhelmɪt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Mũ cứng dùng để bảo vệ đầu khỏi chấn thương.', 'A rigid piece of headwear designed for safety against physical impacts or head injuries.', 'All construction workers must wear a sturdy helmet while working at the building site.', 'Tất cả công nhân xây dựng phải đội mũ bảo hiểm chắc chắn khi làm việc tại công trường.', '{\"en\": \"All workers must wear a safety helmet before entering the factory production area today.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả công nhân phải đội mũ bảo hộ trước khi vào khu vực sản xuất của nhà máy hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/helmet-ljspeech-749440ec.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/helmet-cori-749440ec.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/helmet-3b741ece.webp', '[\"hard hat\", \"headgear\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"safety helmet\", \"meaning\": \"mũ bảo hộ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wear a helmet\", \"meaning\": \"đội mũ bảo hiểm\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/helmet-cori-749440ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/helmet-aru0-749440ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/helmet-aru5-749440ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/helmet-aru6-749440ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/helmet-aru10-749440ec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/helmet-aru9-749440ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/helmet-aru3-749440ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/helmet-aru7-749440ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/helmet-aru8-749440ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/helmet-aru2-749440ec.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/helmet-