('5ba7a385-abe1-5e40-96e2-841ed851eea9', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '2200c8de-118a-5f87-8fe1-b2a69625cb17', '0276126b-af61-5d26-8f25-2ce9526881ca', 'twenty', 'UK: /ˈtwenti/ | US: /ˈtwenti/', 'A1', 'number', 'hai mươi', 'The cardinal number that is equal to two times ten or one more than nineteen.', 'The venue is twenty meters from the station.', 'Địa điểm cách ga hai mươi mét.', '{\"en\": \"The committee consists of twenty members from various corporate departments.\", \"vi\": \"Ủy ban bao gồm hai mươi thành viên đến từ các phòng ban công ty khác nhau.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twenty-ljspeech-fc955a19.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twenty-cori-fc955a19.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/twenty-130f210c.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"twenty percent discount\", \"meaning\": \"giảm giá 20%\"}, {\"phrase\": \"twenty-page document\", \"meaning\": \"tài liệu dài 20 trang\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"twelve\", \"note_vi\": \"Twelve là 12, còn twenty là 20.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"twentieth\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twenty-cori-fc955a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twenty-aru0-fc955a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twenty-aru5-fc955a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twenty-aru6-fc955a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twenty-aru10-fc955a19.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twenty-aru9-fc955a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twenty-aru3-fc955a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twenty-aru7-fc955a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twenty-aru8-fc955a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twenty-aru2-fc955a19.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twenty-ljspeech-fc955a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twenty-lt408-fc955a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twenty-lt138-fc955a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twenty-lt624-fc955a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twenty-lt396-fc955a19.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twenty-lt498-fc955a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twenty-lt132-fc955a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twenty-lt288-fc955a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twenty-lt42-fc955a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twenty-lt90-fc955a19.mp3\"]}}', 'Số 20 trong tiếng Anh. Chú ý tính từ ghép \'a twenty-page report\' (không thêm \'s\' ở page).', 'general', 1, 23),
('f3a3f9ef-0398-57a1-b6b4-97954bf3bd0c', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '2200c8de-118a-5f87-8fe1-b2a69625cb17', '0276126b-af61-5d26-8f25-2ce9526881ca', 'butterfly', '/ˈbʌtəflaɪ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'loài côn trùng có cánh nhiều màu sắc, thường bay lượn trên hoa.', 'an insect with large, often brightly colored wings that flies during the day.', 'Children observed a bright butterfly fluttering near the bushes during their outdoor science class.', 'Trẻ em đã quan sát một con bướm rực rỡ đang vỗ cánh gần các bụi cây trong giờ học khoa học ngoài trời.', '{\"en\": \"The company logo features a butterfly to symbolize growth and transformation in our business.\", \"vi\": \"Logo công ty có hình một con bướm để tượng trưng cho sự phát triển và chuyển đổi trong kinh doanh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/butterfly-ljspeech-ba856797.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/butterfly-cori-ba856797.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/butterfly-c7231634.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"butterfly effect\", \"meaning\": \"hiệu ứng cánh bướm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"colorful butterfly\", \"meaning\": \"con bướm đầy màu sắc\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/butterfly-cori-ba856797.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/butterfly-aru0-ba856797.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/butterfly-aru5-ba856797.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/butterfly-aru6-ba856797.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/butterfly-aru10-ba856797.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/butterfly-aru9-ba856797.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/butterfly-aru3-ba856797.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/butterfly-aru7-ba856797.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/butterfly-aru8-ba856797.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/butterfly-aru2-ba856797.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/butterfly-ljspeech-ba856797.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/butterfly-lt408-ba856797.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/butterfly-lt138-ba856797.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/butterfly-lt624-ba856797.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/butterfly-lt396-ba856797.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/butterfly-lt498-ba856797.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/butterfly-lt132-ba856797.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/butterfly-lt288-ba856797.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/butterfly-lt42-ba856797.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/butterfly-lt90-ba856797.mp3\"]}}', '', 'nature', 1, 24),
('fa607d2f-54e9-5ddd-a378-53d38f1ff8d8', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '2200c8de-118a-5f87-8fe1-b2a69625cb17', '0276126b-af61-5d26-8f25-2ce9526881ca', 'white', '/waɪt/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Màu sắc của tuyết hoặc sữa.', 'the color of snow or milk, which is the opposite of black in appearance.', 'All candidates are required to wear a formal white shirt for the interview.', 'Tất cả các ứng viên được yêu cầu mặc áo sơ mi trắng trang trọng cho buổi phỏng vấn.', '{\"en\": \"Please print the contract on standard white paper for the official signing ceremony tomorrow.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng in hợp đồng trên giấy trắng tiêu chuẩn cho buổi lễ ký kết chính thức vào ngày mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/white-ljspeech-528cef87.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/white-cori-528cef87.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/white-6875214e.webp', '[\"colorless\", \"pale\"]', '[\"black\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"white paper\", \"meaning\": \"giấy trắng/báo cáo chính sách\"}, {\"phrase\": \"white board\", \"meaning\": \"bảng trắng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/white-cori-528cef87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/white-aru0-528cef87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/white-aru5-528cef87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/white-aru6-528cef87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/white-aru10-528cef87.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/white-aru9-528cef87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/white-aru3-528cef87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/white-aru7-528cef87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/white-aru8-528cef87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/white-aru2-528cef87.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/white-ljspeech-528cef87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/white-lt408-528cef87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/white-lt138-528cef87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/white-lt624-528cef87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/white-lt396-528cef87.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/white-lt498-528cef87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/white-lt132-528cef87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/white-lt288-528cef87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/white-lt42-528cef87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/white-lt90-528cef87.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong kinh doanh, \'white paper\' thường là tài liệu báo cáo chuyên sâu.', 'office', 1, 25)
