('79dbcee4-60ba-56c2-b047-e31021c954a4', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '2200c8de-118a-5f87-8fe1-b2a69625cb17', '0276126b-af61-5d26-8f25-2ce9526881ca', 'data', '/ˈdeɪtə/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Thông tin hoặc sự kiện được thu thập, lưu trữ và xử lý.', 'Raw facts, figures, or electronic information stored and processed for evaluation or computational use.', 'The company collects customer data to improve its services.', 'Công ty thu thập dữ liệu khách hàng để cải thiện dịch vụ của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The research team is currently analyzing the customer feedback data to improve our services.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm nghiên cứu hiện đang phân tích dữ liệu phản hồi của khách hàng để cải thiện dịch vụ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/data-ljspeech-a17c9aaa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/data-cori-a17c9aaa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/data-02b9bec9.webp', '[\"information\", \"statistics\", \"facts\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"data analysis\", \"meaning\": \"phân tích dữ liệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"collect data\", \"meaning\": \"thu thập dữ liệu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"database\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/data-cori-a17c9aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/data-aru0-a17c9aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/data-aru5-a17c9aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/data-aru6-a17c9aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/data-aru10-a17c9aaa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/data-aru9-a17c9aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/data-aru3-a17c9aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/data-aru7-a17c9aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/data-aru8-a17c9aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/data-aru2-a17c9aaa.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/data-ljspeech-a17c9aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/data-lt408-a17c9aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/data-lt138-a17c9aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/data-lt624-a17c9aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/data-lt396-a17c9aaa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/data-lt498-a17c9aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/data-lt132-a17c9aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/data-lt288-a17c9aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/data-lt42-a17c9aaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/data-lt90-a17c9aaa.mp3\"]}}', 'Data có thể dùng với động từ số ít hoặc số nhiều tùy ngữ cảnh.', 'business', 1, 26),
('f812d690-d2ac-5e7d-a82d-1a74dc100c48', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '2200c8de-118a-5f87-8fe1-b2a69625cb17', '0276126b-af61-5d26-8f25-2ce9526881ca', 'thankful', '/ˈθæŋkfl/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy biết ơn, trân trọng điều gì đó.', 'feeling or showing that you are grateful for something good that has happened.', 'The team was thankful for the bonus received after completing the project on time.', 'Cả đội rất biết ơn vì khoản tiền thưởng nhận được sau khi hoàn thành dự án đúng hạn.', '{\"en\": \"We are thankful for your prompt response to our inquiry about the shipping delay.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi rất biết ơn vì sự phản hồi nhanh chóng của bạn đối với yêu cầu của chúng tôi về việc chậm trễ vận chuyển.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thankful-ljspeech-1d13fb68.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thankful-cori-1d13fb68.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/thankful-c34cb2ae.webp', '[\"grateful\", \"appreciative\"]', '[\"unthankful\", \"ungrateful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"thankful for\", \"meaning\": \"biết ơn vì điều gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"thankful to\", \"meaning\": \"biết ơn ai\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"grateful\", \"note_vi\": \"grateful trang trọng hơn và thường dùng trong thư từ công việc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"thank\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"thankfully\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"thanks\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thankful-cori-1d13fb68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thankful-aru0-1d13fb68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thankful-aru5-1d13fb68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thankful-aru6-1d13fb68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thankful-aru10-1d13fb68.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thankful-aru9-1d13fb68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thankful-aru3-1d13fb68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thankful-aru7-1d13fb68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thankful-aru8-1d13fb68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thankful-aru2-1d13fb68.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thankful-ljspeech-1d13fb68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thankful-lt408-1d13fb68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thankful-lt138-1d13fb68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thankful-lt624-1d13fb68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thankful-lt396-1d13fb68.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thankful-lt498-1d13fb68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thankful-lt132-1d13fb68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thankful-lt288-1d13fb68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thankful-lt42-1d13fb68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thankful-lt90-1d13fb68.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với giới từ \"for\" (thankful for something) hoặc \"to\" (thankful to someone).', 'business', 1, 27),
('ce07a3a6-d571-51ba-ae53-3beeaf9f7b06', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '2200c8de-118a-5f87-8fe1-b2a69625cb17', '0276126b-af61-5d26-8f25-2ce9526881ca', 'take a bath', '/teɪk ə bɑːθ/', 'A1', 'phrase', 'Ngâm mình và rửa sạch cơ thể trong bồn nước.', 'to wash your body while sitting in a large container filled with warm water.', 'After a long day, I love to take a relaxing bath.', 'Sau một ngày dài, tôi thích ngâm mình thư giãn trong bồn tắm.', '{\"en\": \"After a long business trip, the executive decided to take a bath at the hotel.\", \"vi\": \"Sau một chuyến công tác dài, vị giám đốc điều hành quyết định tắm bồn tại khách sạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-bath-ljspeech-892a20ba.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-bath-cori-892a20ba.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/take-a-bath-0da045f0.webp', '[\"bathe\"]', '[\"take a shower\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"take a hot bath\", \"meaning\": \"tắm bồn nước nóng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"take a relaxing bath\", \"meaning\": \"tắm bồn thư giãn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"take a shower\", \"note_vi\": \"Take a bath là tắm bồn, take a shower là tắm vòi hoa sen.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-bath-cori-892a20ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-bath-aru0-892a20ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-bath-aru5-892a20ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-bath-aru6-892a20ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-bath-aru10-892a20ba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-bath-aru9-892a20ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-bath-aru3-892a20ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-bath-aru7-892a20ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-bath-aru8-892a20ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-bath-aru2-892a20ba.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-bath-ljspeech-892a20ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-bath-lt408-892a20ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-bath-lt138-892a20ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-bath-lt624-892a20ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-bath-lt396-892a20ba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-bath-lt498-892a20ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-bath-lt132-892a20ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-bath-lt288-892a20ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-bath-lt42-892a20ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-bath-lt90-892a20ba.mp3\"]}}', 'Người Anh thường dùng \'have a bath\', người Mỹ hay dùng \'take a bath\'.', 'travel', 1, 28),
('a6388b6b-047e-5691-85c5-d545c612cd39', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '2200c8de-118a-5f87-8fe1-b2a69625cb17', '0276126b-af61-5d26-8f25-2ce9526881ca', 'go to bed', '/ɡəʊ tə bɛd/', 'A1', 'phrase', 'Đi ngủ, lên giường để ngủ.', 'to lie down in a place for sleeping at night.', 'Shift workers often go to bed late after completing their night duties.', 'Công nhân làm ca thường đi ngủ muộn sau khi hoàn thành nhiệm vụ ca đêm.', '{\"en\": \"After working late at the office, the manager decided to go to bed early.\", \"vi\": \"Sau khi làm việc muộn tại văn phòng, người quản lý quyết định đi ngủ sớm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-to-bed-ljspeech-9a3de76f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-to-bed-cori-9a3de76f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/go-to-bed-351a3641.webp', '[\"retire\", \"sleep\"]', '[\"wake up\", \"get up\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"go to bed early\", \"meaning\": \"đi ngủ sớm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"go to bed late\", \"meaning\": \"đi ngủ muộn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"go to sleep\", \"note_vi\": \"go to bed là chui vào giường (hành động); go to sleep là chìm vào giấc ngủ.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-to-bed-cori-9a3de76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-to-bed-aru0-9a3de76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-to-bed-aru5-9a3de76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-to-bed-aru6-9a3de76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-to-bed-aru10-9a3de76f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-to-bed-aru9-9a3de76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-to-bed-aru3-9a3de76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-to-bed-aru7-9a3de76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-to-bed-aru8-9a3de76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-to-bed-aru2-9a3de76f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-to-bed-ljspeech-9a3de76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-to-bed-lt408-9a3de76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-to-bed-lt138-9a3de76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-to-bed-lt624-9a3de76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-to-bed-lt396-9a3de76f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-to-bed-lt498-9a3de76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-to-bed-lt132-9a3de76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-to-bed-lt288-9a3de76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-to-bed-lt42-9a3de76f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-to-bed-lt90-9a3de76f.mp3\"]}}', 'Go to bed không có mạo từ \'the\' đứng trước \'bed\'.', 'daily', 1, 29),
('478ac377-84e5-5f7c-9366-27c673fd1f99', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '23f31915-9951-5e83-a44e-eee26d3c2be9', 'd5b52854-970a-5a2c-a107-7b10283f1d5f', 'vacuum', 'UK: /ˈvækjʊəm/ | US: /ˈvækjuːm/', 'B1', 'noun', 'máy hút bụi', 'an electrical appliance used for cleaning floors and carpets by sucking up dirt.', 'He will use a vacuum cleaner to clean the room.', 'Anh ấy sẽ sử dụng máy hút bụi để dọn dẹp căn phòng.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance staff uses an industrial vacuum cleaner to clean the conference room carpets every evening.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên bảo trì sử dụng máy hút bụi công nghiệp để dọn thảm phòng hội nghị mỗi tối.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuum-ljspeech-aac366da.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuum-cori-aac366da.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/vacuum-73d9143d.webp', '[\"sweeper\", \"hoover\", \"suction cleaner\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"vacuum cleaner\", \"meaning\": \"máy hút bụi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"vacuum package\", \"meaning\": \"đóng gói chân không\"}, {\"phrase\": \"vacuum the rug\", \"meaning\": \"hút bụi thảm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"vacant\", \"note_vi\": \"\'vacuum\' là máy hút bụi/chân không, còn \'vacant\' là trống (chưa có người dùng).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"vacuum\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuum-cori-aac366da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuum-aru0-aac366da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuum-aru5-aac366da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuum-aru6-aac366da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuum-aru10-aac366da.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuum-aru9-aac366da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuum-aru3-aac366da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuum-aru7-aac366da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuum-aru8-aac366da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuum-aru2-aac366da.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuum-ljspeech-aac366da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuum-lt408-aac366da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuum-lt138-aac366da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuum-lt624-aac366da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuum-lt396-aac366da.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuum-lt498-aac366da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuum-lt132-aac366da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuum-lt288-aac366da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuum-lt42-aac366da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuum-lt90-aac366da.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý chính tả: 1 chữ \'c\' và 2 chữ \'u\' (v-a-c-u-u-m). Có thể dùng dạng động từ \'to vacuum\' (hút bụi).', 'maintenance', 1, 0),
('adba7b76-271d-56a0-bf36-dfddbbea23c9', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '23f31915-9951-5e83-a44e-eee26d3c2be9', 'd5b52854-970a-5a2c-a107-7b10283f1d5f', 'warm', '/wɔːm/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Có nhiệt độ dễ chịu, không lạnh.', 'having a comfortably high temperature, not cold or hot.', 'The weather was surprisingly warm for November.', 'Thời tiết ấm áp một cách đáng ngạc nhiên vào tháng Mười Một.', '{\"en\": \"The reception area is kept warm for guests during the winter months.\", \"vi\": \"Khu vực lễ tân được giữ ấm cho khách trong những tháng mùa đông.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warm-ljspeech-d83fc386.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warm-cori-d83fc386.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/warm-57d28637.webp', '[\"heated\", \"toasty\"]', '[\"cold\", \"cool\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"warm welcome\", \"meaning\": \"sự chào đón nồng nhiệt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"keep warm\", \"meaning\": \"giữ ấm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"warm weather\", \"meaning\": \"thời tiết ấm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"warn\", \"note_vi\": \"warn phát âm khác, nghĩa là cảnh báo.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"warm\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"warmth\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"warmly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warm-cori-d83fc386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warm-aru0-d83fc386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warm-aru5-d83fc386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warm-aru6-d83fc386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warm-aru10-d83fc386.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warm-aru9-d83fc386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warm-aru3-d83fc386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warm-aru7-d83fc386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warm-aru8-d83fc386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v