('412bcfba-c535-5b0f-8307-e02341e0fba3', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '23f31915-9951-5e83-a44e-eee26d3c2be9', 'd5b52854-970a-5a2c-a107-7b10283f1d5f', 'raise', 'UK: /reɪz/ | US: /reɪz/', 'B1', 'verb', 'gây, quyên góp', 'to collect or gather money or financial resources for a specific purpose or cause.', 'The charity hopes to raise enough funds for the new hospital wing.', 'Tổ chức từ thiện hy vọng quyên góp đủ tiền cho cánh mới của bệnh viện.', '{\"en\": \"The non-profit organization hopes to raise $50,000 for the community health center.\", \"vi\": \"Tổ chức phi lợi nhuận hy vọng sẽ quyên góp được 50.000 đô la cho trung tâm y tế cộng đồng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raise-ljspeech-657db1e0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raise-cori-657db1e0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/raise-c11f03f3.webp', '[\"collect\", \"gather\", \"generate\", \"mobilize\"]', '[\"spend\", \"disperse\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"raise funds\", \"meaning\": \"gây quỹ / quyên góp tiền\"}, {\"phrase\": \"raise capital\", \"meaning\": \"huy động vốn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"rise\", \"note_vi\": \"Tự gia tăng (nội động từ, không có tân ngữ trực tiếp).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"raise\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raise-cori-657db1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raise-aru0-657db1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raise-aru5-657db1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raise-aru6-657db1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raise-aru10-657db1e0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raise-aru9-657db1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raise-aru3-657db1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raise-aru7-657db1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raise-aru8-657db1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raise-aru2-657db1e0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raise-ljspeech-657db1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raise-lt408-657db1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raise-lt138-657db1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raise-lt624-657db1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raise-lt396-657db1e0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raise-lt498-657db1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raise-lt132-657db1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raise-lt288-657db1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raise-lt42-657db1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raise-lt90-657db1e0.mp3\"]}}', '\'Raise\' là ngoại động từ (phải có tân ngữ theo sau, như raise funds). Đừng nhầm với \'rise\' (nội động từ, không tân ngữ).', 'finance', 1, 9),
('467cb9a1-b4dc-5d7c-a55a-66d13b9eaf39', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '23f31915-9951-5e83-a44e-eee26d3c2be9', 'd5b52854-970a-5a2c-a107-7b10283f1d5f', 'airport', '/ˈeəpɔːt/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Nơi máy bay cất cánh và hạ cánh, có các dịch vụ cho hành khách.', 'a place where aircraft land and take off, with buildings for passengers to wait.', 'A shuttle bus connects the downtown hotel directly to the international airport.', 'Một chiếc xe buýt đưa đón kết nối khách sạn trung tâm thành phố trực tiếp với sân bay quốc tế.', '{\"en\": \"The shuttle bus provides direct transportation between the hotel and the international airport.\", \"vi\": \"Xe buýt đưa đón cung cấp dịch vụ vận chuyển trực tiếp giữa khách sạn và sân bay quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airport-ljspeech-6b5465bf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airport-cori-6b5465bf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/airport-78cc5f9a.webp', '[\"airfield\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"airport terminal\", \"meaning\": \"nhà ga sân bay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"international airport\", \"meaning\": \"sân bay quốc tế\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airport-cori-6b5465bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airport-aru0-6b5465bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airport-aru5-6b5465bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airport-aru6-6b5465bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airport-aru10-6b5465bf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airport-aru9-6b5465bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airport-aru3-6b5465bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airport-aru7-6b5465bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airport-aru8-6b5465bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airport-aru2-6b5465bf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airport-ljspeech-6b5465bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airport-lt408-6b5465bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airport-lt138-6b5465bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airport-lt624-6b5465bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airport-lt396-6b5465bf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airport-lt498-6b5465bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airport-lt132-6b5465bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airport-lt288-6b5465bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airport-lt42-6b5465bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airport-lt90-6b5465bf.mp3\"]}}', 'Đi với giới từ \'at\' (at the airport) khi nói về địa điểm có mặt.', 'travel', 1, 10),
('60d28403-e052-5c3c-995c-9a05ee7ce8a7', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '23f31915-9951-5e83-a44e-eee26d3c2be9', 'd5b52854-970a-5a2c-a107-7b10283f1d5f', 'eyelash', '/ˈaɪlæʃ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sợi lông mọc ở rìa mí mắt.', 'one of the short hairs that grow along the edge of your eyelid.', 'She has long, dark eyelashes that frame her beautiful eyes.', 'Cô ấy có hàng lông mi dài, sẫm màu làm nổi bật đôi mắt đẹp của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The beauty salon offers professional eyelash extension services for corporate clients preparing for events.\", \"vi\": \"Thẩm mỹ viện cung cấp dịch vụ nối mi chuyên nghiệp cho các khách hàng doanh nghiệp chuẩn bị cho các sự kiện.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eyelash-ljspeech-a20181a8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eyelash-cori-a20181a8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/eyelash-21033915.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"long eyelashes\", \"meaning\": \"lông mi dài\"}, {\"phrase\": \"eyelash extensions\", \"meaning\": \"nối mi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"false eyelashes\", \"meaning\": \"lông mi giả\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"eyebrow\", \"note_vi\": \"eyebrow là lông mày, còn eyelash là lông mi.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eyelash-cori-a20181a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eyelash-aru0-a20181a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eyelash-aru5-a20181a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eyelash-aru6-a20181a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eyelash-aru10-a20181a8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eyelash-aru9-a20181a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eyelash-aru3-a20181a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eyelash-aru7-a20181a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eyelash-aru8-a20181a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eyelash-aru2