('75e69c04-a127-5f2d-bf60-d5d0209dc74e', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '23f31915-9951-5e83-a44e-eee26d3c2be9', 'd5b52854-970a-5a2c-a107-7b10283f1d5f', 'song', '/sɒŋ/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một tác phẩm âm nhạc có lời ca để hát.', 'a short piece of music with words that you sing.', 'She sang a beautiful song at the talent show.', 'Cô ấy đã hát một bài hát tuyệt đẹp tại buổi biểu diễn tài năng.', '{\"en\": \"The background song played during the commercial was very catchy and helped increase sales.\", \"vi\": \"Bài hát nền được phát trong quảng cáo rất bắt tai và giúp tăng doanh số bán hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/song-ljspeech-eac923ff.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/song-cori-eac923ff.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/song-b5bc1a50.webp', '[\"track\", \"melody\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"favorite song\", \"meaning\": \"bài hát yêu thích\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sing a song\", \"meaning\": \"hát một bài hát\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"sing\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"singer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/song-cori-eac923ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/song-aru0-eac923ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/song-aru5-eac923ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/song-aru6-eac923ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/song-aru10-eac923ff.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/song-aru9-eac923ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/song-aru3-eac923ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/song-aru7-eac923ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/song-aru8-eac923ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/song-aru2-eac923ff.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/song-ljspeech-eac923ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciati