('31c23f9a-2918-52e8-9ed4-4b6ff672ca48', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '23f31915-9951-5e83-a44e-eee26d3c2be9', 'd5b52854-970a-5a2c-a107-7b10283f1d5f', 'score', '/skɔː(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Số điểm đạt được trong trò chơi hoặc bài kiểm tra.', 'the number of points that someone or a team achieves in a game, competition, or test result.', 'Our team managed to score three goals in the second half.', 'Đội của chúng tôi đã ghi được ba bàn thắng trong hiệp hai.', '{\"en\": \"The final score of the customer satisfaction survey was much higher than we had originally expected.\", \"vi\": \"Điểm số cuối cùng của cuộc khảo sát mức độ hài lòng của khách hàng cao hơn nhiều so với dự kiến ban đầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/score-ljspeech-75ebcb36.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/score-cori-75ebcb36.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/score-62ebd449.webp', '[\"result\", \"mark\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"final score\", \"meaning\": \"điểm số cuối cùng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"high score\", \"meaning\": \"điểm số cao\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"scorer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/score-cori-75ebcb36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/score-aru0-75ebcb36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/score-aru5-75ebcb36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/score-aru6-75ebcb36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/score-aru10-75ebcb36.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/score-aru9-75ebcb36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/score-aru3-75ebcb36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/score-aru7-75ebcb36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/score-aru8-75ebcb36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/score-aru2-75ebcb36.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/score-ljspeech-75ebcb36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/score-lt408-75ebcb36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/score-lt138-75ebcb36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/score-lt624-75ebcb36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/score-lt396-75ebcb36.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/score-lt498-75ebcb36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/score-lt132-75ebcb36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/score-lt288-75ebcb36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/score-lt42-75ebcb36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/score-lt90-75ebcb36.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng cho cả điểm số thi cử và tỉ số trận đấu.', 'business', 1, 19),
('6a42bb4d-e10a-5449-a990-f905f493a829', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '23f31915-9951-5e83-a44e-eee26d3c2be9', 'd5b52854-970a-5a2c-a107-7b10283f1d5f', 'red', '/red/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Màu sắc của máu hoặc quả dâu tây chín.', 'the color of fresh blood or a ripe tomato, often used to show danger.', 'The manager marked the urgent deadline with a red pen on the calendar.', 'Người quản lý đã đánh dấu thời hạn gấp bằng một cây bút màu đỏ trên lịch.', '{\"en\": \"The company logo features a bright red circle to attract the attention of potential customers.\", \"vi\": \"Logo công ty có hình tròn màu đỏ tươi để thu hút sự chú ý của khách hàng tiềm năng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-ljspeech-78988010.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-cori-78988010.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/red-717f2128.webp', '[\"scarlet\", \"crimson\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"bright red\", \"meaning\": \"đỏ tươi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in the red\", \"meaning\": \"bị lỗ vốn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"redden\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-cori-78988010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-aru0-78988010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-aru5-78988010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-aru6-78988010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-aru10-78988010.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-aru9-78988010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-aru3-78988010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-aru7-78988010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-aru8-78988010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-aru2-78988010.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-ljspeech-78988010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-lt408-78988010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-lt138-78988010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-lt624-78988010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-lt396-78988010.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-lt498-78988010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-lt132-78988010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-lt288-78988010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-lt42-78988010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-lt90-78988010.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong tài chính, \'in the red\' nghĩa là đang thua lỗ.', 'marketing', 1, 20),
('26108ae1-5377-53bd-8883-9df3c866ac8d', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '23f31915-9951-5e83-a44e-eee26d3c2be9', 'd5b52854-970a-5a2c-a107-7b10283f1d5f', 'pack a bag', '/pæk ə bæɡ/', 'A2', 'phrase', 'Chuẩn bị hành lý, đồ dùng cá nhân vào túi hoặc vali.', 'to put clothes and other necessary items into a suitcase or backpack.', 'Before leaving for the trip, don\'t forget to pack a bag with all your essentials.', 'Trước khi đi du lịch, đừng quên đóng gói túi với tất cả những đồ dùng cần thiết của bạn.', '{\"en\": \"Business travelers should pack a bag with essential documents before heading to the airport.\", \"vi\": \"Những người đi công tác nên chuẩn bị túi xách với các tài liệu thiết yếu trước khi đến sân bay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-a-bag-ljspeech-ccab6dd2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-a-bag-cori-ccab6dd2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pack-a-bag-f41a11e8.webp', '[\"pack up\", \"get ready\"]', '[\"unpack\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"pack a suitcase\", \"meaning\": \"xếp hành lý vào vali\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pack light\", \"meaning\": \"mang đồ nhẹ nhàng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-a-bag-cori-ccab6dd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-a-bag-aru0-ccab6dd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-a-bag-aru5-ccab6dd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-a-bag-aru6-ccab6dd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-a-bag-aru10-ccab6dd2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-a-bag-aru9-ccab6dd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-a-bag-aru3-ccab6dd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-a-bag-aru7-ccab6dd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-a-bag-aru8-ccab6dd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-a-bag-aru2-ccab6dd