('5ee20bdb-5301-5fd5-a39d-1ed7f9b23da7', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '23f31915-9951-5e83-a44e-eee26d3c2be9', 'd5b52854-970a-5a2c-a107-7b10283f1d5f', 'mosquito', '/məˈskiːtəʊ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Loài côn trùng nhỏ, cái đốt và hút máu, thường gây ngứa.', 'a small flying insect that bites people and animals to drink blood.', 'Don\'t forget to use insect repellent to protect yourself from mosquitoes.', 'Đừng quên dùng thuốc chống côn trùng để bảo vệ bản thân khỏi muỗi.', '{\"en\": \"The resort sprayed the outdoor dining area to protect guests from mosquito bites.\", \"vi\": \"Khu nghỉ dưỡng đã phun thuốc khu vực ăn uống ngoài trời để bảo vệ du khách khỏi bị muỗi đốt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mosquito-ljspeech-a0d889b9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mosquito-cori-a0d889b9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mosquito-a59325ec.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"mosquito net\", \"meaning\": \"màn chống muỗi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mosquito bite\", \"meaning\": \"vết muỗi đốt\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mosquito-cori-a0d889b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mosquito-aru0-a0d889b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mosquito-aru5-a0d889b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mosquito-aru6-a0d889b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mosquito-aru10-a0d889b9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mosquito-aru9-a0d889b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mosquito-aru3-a0d889b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mosquito-aru7-a0d889b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mosquito-aru8-a0d889b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mosquito-aru2-a0d889b9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mosquito-ljspeech-a0d889b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mosquito-lt408-a0d889b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mosquito-lt138-a0d889b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mosquito-lt624-a0d889b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mosquito-lt396-a0d889b9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mosquito-lt498-a0d889b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mosquito-lt132-a0d889b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mosquito-lt288-a0d889b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mosquito-lt42-a0d889b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mosquito-lt90-a0d889b9.mp3\"]}}', 'Số nhiều của \'mosquito\' thường là \'mosquitoes\' (thêm -es).', 'health', 1, 24),
('5d9333d1-5aeb-5fb7-856a-fac4940263c6', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '23f31915-9951-5e83-a44e-eee26d3c2be9', 'd5b52854-970a-5a2c-a107-7b10283f1d5f', 'draw', '/drɔː/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Tạo hình ảnh hoặc bức tranh bằng bút chì, bút mực.', 'to make a picture using a pen, pencil, or crayon on paper.', 'My daughter loves to draw animals and flowers in her sketchbook.', 'Con gái tôi rất thích vẽ động vật và hoa vào cuốn sổ phác thảo của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The architect will draw a detailed floor plan for the new office building today.\", \"vi\": \"Kiến trúc sư sẽ vẽ một bản kế hoạch chi tiết mặt bằng cho tòa nhà văn phòng mới hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draw-ljspeech-76a4e12c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draw-cori-76a4e12c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/draw-d2fbe1dd.webp', '[\"sketch\", \"depict\", \"illustrate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"draw a conclusion\", \"meaning\": \"rút ra kết luận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"draw attention\", \"meaning\": \"thu hút sự chú ý\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"paint\", \"note_vi\": \"draw là vẽ bằng bút/phấn, paint là vẽ bằng màu sơn/cọ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"drawing\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"drawer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draw-cori-76a4e12c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draw-aru0-76a4e12c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draw-aru5-76a4e12c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draw-aru6-76a4e12c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draw-aru10-76a4e12c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draw-aru9-76a4e12c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draw-aru3-76a4e12c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draw-aru7-76a4e12c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draw-aru8-76a4e12c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciati