('a9e3b9cd-a78b-5df2-92c3-5845693a2440', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '2e3e6bf8-1dd3-5bea-951f-4d47b22421b7', '8f737c07-390f-5e04-a4ca-b60b5b6d9850', 'queue', '/kjuː/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hàng người hoặc vật xếp nối đuôi nhau chờ đợi.', 'A row of individuals or vehicles remaining in sequence while awaiting service.', 'We had to wait in a long queue to buy tickets for the concert.', 'Chúng tôi phải xếp hàng dài để mua vé xem hòa nhạc.', '{\"en\": \"Customers formed a long queue outside the service center before it opened.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng xếp thành hàng dài bên ngoài trung tâm dịch vụ trước khi mở cửa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-ljspeech-1038345e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-cori-1038345e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/queue-99279138.webp', '[\"line\", \"waiting line\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"join the queue\", \"meaning\": \"vào xếp hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"long queue\", \"meaning\": \"hàng dài\"}, {\"phrase\": \"queue up\", \"meaning\": \"xếp hàng chờ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"line\", \"note_vi\": \"line (Mỹ) và queue (Anh) cùng nghĩa hàng chờ; TOEIC dùng cả hai\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"queue\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-cori-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-aru0-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-aru5-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-aru6-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-aru10-1038345e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-aru9-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-aru3-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-aru7-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-aru8-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-aru2-1038345e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-ljspeech-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-lt408-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-lt138-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-lt624-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-lt396-1038345e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-lt498-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-lt132-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-lt288-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-lt42-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-lt90-1038345e.mp3\"]}}', 'Queue là tiếng Anh-Anh; người Mỹ thường nói \'line\' — cả hai đều xuất hiện trong đề TOEIC.', 'daily', 1, 12),
('c80be6dd-d312-5b67-98eb-d50e8370e039', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '2e3e6bf8-1dd3-5bea-951f-4d47b22421b7', '8f737c07-390f-5e04-a4ca-b60b5b6d9850', 'classmate', '/ˈklɑːsmeɪt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Người học cùng lớp với bạn.', 'a person who studies in the same group or educational institution as you.', 'I met up with an old classmate from high school last week.', 'Tuần trước tôi đã gặp lại một người bạn học cũ từ thời cấp ba.', '{\"en\": \"My classmate from the business seminar suggested that we collaborate on the upcoming marketing project.\", \"vi\": \"Bạn cùng lớp của tôi từ buổi hội thảo kinh doanh đã đề nghị chúng tôi hợp tác trong dự án tiếp thị sắp tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classmate-ljspeech-4d4dde8a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classmate-cori-4d4dde8a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/classmate-2e21d497.webp', '[\"peer\", \"fellow student\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"former classmate\", \"meaning\": \"bạn học cũ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"meet a classmate\", \"meaning\": \"gặp bạn học\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classmate-cori-4d4dde8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classmate-aru0-4d4dde8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classmate-aru5-4d4dde8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classmate-aru6-4d4dde8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classmate-aru10-4d4dde8a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classmate-aru9-4d4dde8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classmate-aru3-4d4dde8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classmate-aru7-4d4dde8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classmate-aru8-4d4dde8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classmate-aru2-4d4dde8a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classmate-ljspeech-4d4dde8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classmate-lt408-4d4dde8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classmate-lt138-4d4dde8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classmate-lt624-4d4dde8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classmate-lt396-4d4dde8a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classmate-lt498-4d4dde8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classmate-lt132-4d4dde8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classmate-lt288-4d4dde8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classmate-lt42-4d4dde8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classmate-lt90-4d4dde8a.mp3\"]}}', 'Chỉ dùng trong môi trường học tập, không dùng cho đồng nghiệp làm cùng công ty.', 'education', 1, 13),
('511cd0ff-0f92-5330-a725-048ddaaeee8e', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '2e3e6bf8-1dd3-5bea-951f-4d47b22421b7', '8f737c07-390f-5e04-a4ca-b60b5b6d9850', 'password', '/ˈpɑːswɜːd/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một chuỗi ký tự bí mật để xác minh danh tính người dùng.', 'a secret word or phrase used to gain access to something.', 'You should choose a strong password that is difficult for others to guess.', 'Bạn nên chọn một mật khẩu mạnh, khó đoán đối với người khác.', '{\"en\": \"The new employee forgot the password for the company email system.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên mới quên mật khẩu của hệ thống email công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/password-ljspeech-5baa61e4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/password-cori-5baa61e4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/password-e1369f01.webp', '[\"passcode\", \"access code\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"strong password\", \"meaning\": \"mật khẩu mạnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"enter a password\", \"meaning\": \"nhập mật khẩu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"change password\", \"meaning\": \"đổi mật khẩu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"passport\", \"note_vi\": \"passport là hộ chiếu, không phải mật khẩu\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/password-cori-5baa61e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/password-aru0-5baa61e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/password-aru5-5baa61e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/password-aru6-5baa61e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/password-aru10-5baa61e4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/password-aru9-5baa61e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/password-aru3-5baa61e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/password-aru7-5baa61e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/password-aru8-5baa61e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/password-aru2-5baa61e4.