('f2cf4501-a4df-5d01-afa8-c1a9be5c4c05', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '2e3e6bf8-1dd3-5bea-951f-4d47b22421b7', '8f737c07-390f-5e04-a4ca-b60b5b6d9850', 'sketch', '/sketʃ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một bức vẽ nhanh, đơn giản, thường là bản nháp ban đầu.', 'a simple picture that is drawn quickly and does not have many details.', 'The artist quickly made a sketch of the landscape before starting his painting.', 'Người họa sĩ nhanh chóng phác họa phong cảnh trước khi bắt đầu bức tranh của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The architect presented a rough sketch of the new office building during the preliminary meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Kiến trúc sư đã trình bày một bản phác thảo sơ bộ về tòa nhà văn phòng mới trong cuộc họp sơ bộ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sketch-ljspeech-3e862665.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sketch-cori-3e862665.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sketch-d9d892a6.webp', '[\"drawing\", \"outline\", \"draft\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"rough sketch\", \"meaning\": \"bản phác thảo thô\"}, {\"phrase\": \"thumbnail sketch\", \"meaning\": \"bản mô tả ngắn gọn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"sketchy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sketch-cori-3e862665.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sketch-aru0-3e862665.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sketch-aru5-3e862665.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sketch-aru6-3e862665.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sketch-aru10-3e862665.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sketch-aru9-3e862665.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sketch-aru3-3e862665.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sketch-aru7-3e862665.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sketch-aru8-3e862665.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sketch-aru2-3e862665.mp3\"]}, \"u