('dbe369ad-29d0-5cef-8134-1d6b9ff1982b', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '2e3e6bf8-1dd3-5bea-951f-4d47b22421b7', '8f737c07-390f-5e04-a4ca-b60b5b6d9850', 'librarian', '/laɪˈbreəriən/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Người làm việc quản lý và sắp xếp sách trong thư viện.', 'a person whose job is to manage and help people use a library and its books.', 'The friendly librarian organized all the new research journals on the top shelf.', 'Người thủ thư thân thiện đã sắp xếp tất cả các tạp chí nghiên cứu mới lên kệ trên cùng.', '{\"en\": \"The librarian organized a training session on how to use the new digital catalog system.\", \"vi\": \"Thủ thư tổ chức một buổi đào tạo về cách sử dụng hệ thống danh mục kỹ thuật số mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/librarian-ljspeech-93c768d0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/librarian-cori-93c768d0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/librarian-584511c1.webp', '[\"archivist\", \"information specialist\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"school librarian\", \"meaning\": \"thủ thư trường học\"}, {\"phrase\": \"head librarian\", \"meaning\": \"trưởng thư viện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reference librarian\", \"meaning\": \"thủ thư tham khảo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"library\", \"note_vi\": \"library là nơi chứa sách, librarian là người làm việc ở đó\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"library\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"librarianship\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/librarian-cori-93c768d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/librarian-aru0-93c768d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/librarian-aru5-93c768d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/librarian-aru6-93c768d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/librarian-aru10-93c768d0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/librarian-aru9-93c768d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/librarian-aru3-93c768d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/librarian-aru7-93c768d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/librarian-aru8-93c768d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/librarian-aru2-93c768d0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/librarian-ljspeech-93c768d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/librarian-lt408-93c768d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/librarian-lt138-93c768d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/librarian-lt624-93c768d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/librarian-lt396-93c768d0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/librarian-lt498-93c768d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/librarian-lt132-93c768d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/librarian-lt288-93c768d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/librarian-lt42-93c768d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/librarian-lt90-93c768d0.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm librarian với library — thêm hậu tố -ian để chỉ người làm nghề đó.', 'education', 1, 28),
('eef0cb68-09c5-574b-a92a-8459021ecd41', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '2e3e6bf8-1dd3-5bea-951f-4d47b22421b7', '8f737c07-390f-5e04-a4ca-b60b5b6d9850', 'have breakfast', '/hæv ˈbrekfəst/', 'A1', 'phrase', 'Ăn bữa ăn đầu tiên trong ngày vào buổi sáng.', 'To consume food in the morning as the initial meal following sleep.', 'I usually have breakfast with my family before going to work.', 'Tôi thường ăn sáng cùng gia đình trước khi đi làm.', '{\"en\": \"Hotel guests can have breakfast in the main dining hall from six to nine.\", \"vi\": \"Khách lưu trú tại khách sạn có thể ăn sáng tại sảnh ăn chính từ sáu giờ đến chín giờ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-ljspeech-0d53ea02.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-cori-0d53ea02.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/have-breakfast-480b1a40.webp', '[\"eat breakfast\"]', '[\"fast\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"have a quick breakfast\", \"meaning\": \"ăn sáng nhanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"have a hearty breakfast\", \"meaning\": \"ăn sáng no nê\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"have lunch\", \"note_vi\": \"have breakfast là ăn sáng, have lunch là ăn trưa.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-cori-0d53ea02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-aru0-0d53ea02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-aru5-0d53ea02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-aru6-0d53ea02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-aru10-0d53ea02.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-aru9-0d53ea02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-aru3-0d53ea02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-aru7-0d53ea02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-breakfast-aru8-0d53ea02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obje