('93031483-335e-5cd0-97df-40ea00584dfc', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '325c167b-65ed-5734-aea3-93f039092cc3', '631cfd4d-9239-5471-9392-6bd0b88828a8', 'guilty', '/ˈɡɪlti/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy có lỗi hoặc phạm tội.', 'feeling bad because you have done something wrong or made a mistake.', 'The manager felt guilty after blaming her assistant for the project delay.', 'Người quản lý cảm thấy có lỗi sau khi đổ lỗi cho trợ lý về sự chậm trễ của dự án.', '{\"en\": \"The company was found guilty of violating safety regulations and received a heavy fine.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty bị tuyên bố có tội vì vi phạm các quy định an toàn và nhận mức phạt nặng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-ljspeech-5149c0a0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-cori-5149c0a0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/guilty-02547277.webp', '[\"culpable\", \"blameworthy\"]', '[\"innocent\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel guilty\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy tội lỗi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"plead guilty\", \"meaning\": \"nhận tội\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"guilt\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"guiltily\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-cori-5149c0a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-aru0-5149c0a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-aru5-5149c0a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-aru6-5149c0a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-aru10-5149c0a0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-aru9-5149c0a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-aru3-5149c0a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-aru7-5149c0a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-aru8-5149c0a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-aru2-5149c0a0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-ljspeech-5149c0a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-lt408-5149c0a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-lt138-5149c0a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-lt624-5149c0a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-lt396-5149c0a0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-lt498-5149c0a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-lt132-5149c0a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-lt288-5149c0a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-lt42-5149c0a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guilty-lt90-5149c0a0.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ cảnh pháp lý/TOEIC, guilty thường đi với giới từ \'of\' (có tội về việc gì).', 'law', 1, 0),
('bc172858-f840-5f48-86c6-d087bb9f95af', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '325c167b-65ed-5734-aea3-93f039092cc3', '631cfd4d-9239-5471-9392-6bd0b88828a8', 'insecure', '/ˌɪnsɪˈkjʊə(r)/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy không an toàn, thiếu tự tin.', 'not feeling confident about yourself or your abilities, and often worrying about what other people think.', 'Many new employees feel insecure during their first few weeks at the company.', 'Nhiều nhân viên mới cảm thấy thiếu tự tin trong vài tuần đầu làm việc tại công ty.', '{\"en\": \"The new employee felt insecure about his ability to meet the strict project deadlines.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên mới cảm thấy thiếu tự tin về khả năng đáp ứng các hạn chót nghiêm ngặt của dự án.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecure-ljspeech-a2337e8e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecure-cori-a2337e8e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/insecure-daf566b3.webp', '[\"unconfident\", \"anxious\", \"uncertain\"]', '[\"confident\", \"secure\", \"assured\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel insecure\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy thiếu tự tin\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deeply insecure\", \"meaning\": \"vô cùng thiếu tự tin\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"unsecured\", \"note_vi\": \"unsecured là không được bảo vệ/thế chấp, insecure là thiếu tự tin.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"insecurity\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"secure\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecure-cori-a2337e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecure-aru0-a2337e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecure-aru5-a2337e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecure-aru6-a2337e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecure-aru10-a2337e8e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecure-aru9-a2337e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecure-aru3-a2337e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecure-aru7-a2337e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecure-aru8-a2337e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecure-aru2-a2337e8e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecure-ljspeech-a2337e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecure-lt408-a2337e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecure-lt138-a2337e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecure-lt624-a2337e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecure-lt396-a2337e8e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecure-lt498-a2337e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecure-lt132-a2337e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecure-lt288-a2337e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecure-lt42-a2337e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecure-lt90-a2337e8e.mp3\"]}}', 'Insecure đi với giới từ \'about\' khi nói về sự thiếu tự tin về điều gì đó.', 'hr', 1, 1),
('618c4733-68dd-5b97-ab89-f61ba3cbd800', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '325c167b-65ed-5734-aea3-93f039092cc3', '631cfd4d-9239-5471-9392-6bd0b88828a8', 'generation', '/ˌdʒenəˈreɪʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một nhóm người sinh ra và sống trong cùng một khoảng thời gian.', 'all the people of about the same age within a society or family.', 'The younger generation is very adept at using new technology.', 'Thế hệ trẻ rất thành thạo trong việc sử dụng công nghệ mới.', '{\"en\": \"The new generation of smartphones has significantly improved battery life and processing speed.\", \"vi\": \"Thế hệ điện thoại thông minh mới đã cải thiện đáng kể thời lượng pin và tốc độ xử lý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-ljspeech-cd738ebd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-cori-cd738ebd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/generation-2b1f0c95.webp', '[\"age group\", \"peer group\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"younger generation\", \"meaning\": \"thế hệ trẻ hơn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"generation gap\", \"meaning\": \"khoảng cách thế hệ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"generate\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"generational\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-cori-cd738ebd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-aru0-cd738ebd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-aru5-cd738ebd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-aru6-cd738ebd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-aru10-cd738ebd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-aru9-cd738ebd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-aru3-cd738ebd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-aru7-cd738ebd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-aru8-cd738ebd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/publi