('4f99c773-9829-5e02-a356-0bf150807e3d', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '325c167b-65ed-5734-aea3-93f039092cc3', '631cfd4d-9239-5471-9392-6bd0b88828a8', 'quickly', 'UK: /ˈkwɪkli/ | US: /ˈkwɪkli/', 'A1', 'adverb', 'nhanh chóng', 'At a fast speed or within a very short amount of time.', 'The team responded quickly to customer inquiries.', 'Đội ngũ đã phản ứng nhanh chóng với các câu hỏi của khách hàng.', '{\"en\": \"The support team acted quickly to restore system access after the server breakdown.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ hỗ trợ đã hành động nhanh chóng để phục hồi quyền truy cập hệ thống sau sự cố máy chủ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quickly-ljspeech-0b35c19a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quickly-cori-0b35c19a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/quickly-3a69a8ba.webp', '[\"rapidly\", \"swiftly\", \"promptly\"]', '[\"slowly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"respond quickly\", \"meaning\": \"phản hồi nhanh chóng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"adapt quickly\", \"meaning\": \"thích ứng nhanh chóng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"quick\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quickly-cori-0b35c19a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quickly-aru0-0b35c19a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quickly-aru5-0b35c19a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quickly-aru6-0b35c19a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quickly-aru10-0b35c19a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quickly-aru9-0b35c19a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quickly-aru3-0b35c19a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quickly-aru7-0b35c19a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quickly-aru8-0b35c19a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quickly-aru2-0b35c19a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quickly-ljspeech-0b35c19a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quickly-lt408-0b35c19a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quickly-lt138-0b35c19a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quickly-lt624-0b35c19a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quickly-lt396-0b35c19a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quickly-lt498-0b35c19a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quickly-lt132-0b35c19a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quickly-lt288-0b35c19a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quickly-lt42-0b35c19a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quickly-lt90-0b35c19a.mp3\"]}}', 'Trạng từ bổ nghĩa cho động từ hành động, thường gặp trong cụm \'respond quickly\' hoặc \'adapt quickly\'.', 'customer service', 1, 17),
('1d030a97-a55c-5704-9719-7c2f0afb16f1', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '325c167b-65ed-5734-aea3-93f039092cc3', '631cfd4d-9239-5471-9392-6bd0b88828a8', 'earphones', '/ˈɪəfəʊnz/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Thiết bị nhỏ đeo vào tai để nghe âm thanh riêng tư.', 'a small piece of equipment that you wear in or over your ears to listen to music.', 'I always use my earphones on the bus to listen to music.', 'Tôi luôn dùng tai nghe khi đi xe buýt để nghe nhạc.', '{\"en\": \"All customer service representatives must wear their earphones during their shifts to handle calls.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả đại diện dịch vụ khách hàng phải đeo tai nghe trong ca làm việc để xử lý các cuộc gọi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/earphones-ljspeech-52dcdc26.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/earphones-cori-52dcdc26.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/earphones-88c35e24.webp', '[\"headphones\", \"earbuds\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"a pair of earphones\", \"meaning\": \"một cặp tai nghe\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wireless earphones\", \"meaning\": \"tai nghe không dây\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"headphones\", \"note_vi\": \"Tai nghe chụp tai cỡ lớn, còn earphones nhỏ nhét tai.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/earphones-cori-52dcdc26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/earphones-aru0-52dcdc26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/earphones-aru5-52dcdc26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/earphones-aru6-52dcdc26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/earphones-aru10-52dcdc26.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/earphones-aru9-52dcdc26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/earphones-aru3-52dcdc26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/earphones-aru7-52dcdc26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/earphones-aru8-52dcdc26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronu