('318ee675-04a4-5273-931c-a93a94cd95fb', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '325c167b-65ed-5734-aea3-93f039092cc3', '631cfd4d-9239-5471-9392-6bd0b88828a8', 'excited', '/ɪkˈsaɪtɪd/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy rất vui, phấn khích hoặc mong chờ điều gì đó.', 'Enthusiastic and energized due to an anticipation of positive forthcoming events.', 'The sales staff were excited to introduce their new product line to potential buyers.', 'Đội ngũ bán hàng rất háo hức giới thiệu dòng sản phẩm mới của họ cho các người mua tiềm năng.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team is excited to launch the new product line early next month.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị rất háo hức ra mắt dòng sản phẩm mới vào đầu tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-ljspeech-f529c0de.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-cori-f529c0de.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/excited-2c8c6568.webp', '[\"enthusiastic\", \"thrilled\"]', '[\"bored\", \"indifferent\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"be excited about\", \"meaning\": \"háo hức về việc gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"get excited\", \"meaning\": \"trở nên phấn khích\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"excitement\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"excite\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-cori-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-aru0-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-aru5-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-aru6-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-aru10-f529c0de.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-aru9-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-aru3-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-aru7-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-aru8-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-aru2-f529c0de.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-ljspeech-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-lt408-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-lt138-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-lt624-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-lt396-f529c0de.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-lt498-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-lt132-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-lt288-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-lt42-f529c0de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excited-lt90-f529c0de.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng \'excited\' cho người, \'exciting\' cho sự vật/sự việc.', 'marketing', 1, 27),
('a5df0109-f022-5c32-b116-e22457a9f0e4', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '325c167b-65ed-5734-aea3-93f039092cc3', '631cfd4d-9239-5471-9392-6bd0b88828a8', 'strict', '/strɪkt/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'nghiêm ngặt, tuân thủ chặt chẽ quy tắc', 'demanding that rules are obeyed and not allowing any behavior that is not permitted.', 'The new supervisor is extremely strict regarding safety protocols in the laboratory.', 'Giám sát viên mới cực kỳ nghiêm khắc về các quy tắc an toàn trong phòng thí nghiệm.', '{\"en\": \"The supervisor is very strict about following safety regulations in the manufacturing plant at all times.\", \"vi\": \"Người giám sát rất nghiêm khắc về việc tuân thủ các quy định an toàn tại nhà máy sản xuất mọi lúc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strict-ljspeech-41eaab87.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strict-cori-41eaab87.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/strict-49ab3a38.webp', '[\"firm\", \"severe\"]', '[\"lenient\", \"relaxed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"strict rules\", \"meaning\": \"quy định nghiêm ngặt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"strict deadline\", \"meaning\": \"hạn chót nghiêm ngặt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"strictly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strict-cori-41eaab87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strict-aru0-41eaab87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strict-aru5-41eaab87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strict-aru6-41eaab87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strict-aru10-41eaab87.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strict-aru9-41eaab87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strict-aru3-41eaab87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strict-aru7-41eaab87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strict-aru8-41eaab87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strict-aru2-41eaab87.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strict-ljspeech-41eaab87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strict-lt408-41eaab87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strict-lt138-41eaab87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strict-lt624-41eaab87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strict-lt396-41eaab87.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strict-lt498-41eaab87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strict-lt132-41eaab87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strict-lt288-41eaab87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strict-lt42-41eaab87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strict-lt90-41eaab87.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để mô tả phong cách quản lý hoặc các quy định công ty.', 'office', 1, 28),
('a276b6f9-2e8b-5f48-ba30-3a97dc349dd1', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '325c167b-65ed-5734-aea3-93f039092cc3', '631cfd4d-9239-5471-9392-6bd0b88828a8', 'kidney', '/ˈkɪdni/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cơ quan nội tạng giúp lọc máu và tạo nước tiểu.', 'one of the two organs in the body that clean the blood.', 'Eating a healthy diet is important for maintaining healthy kidneys.', 'Ăn uống lành mạnh rất quan trọng để duy trì thận khỏe mạnh.', '{\"en\": \"The pharmaceutical company is testing a new drug for patients with kidney disease.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty dược phẩm đang thử nghiệm một loại thuốc mới cho bệnh nhân mắc bệnh thận.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kidney-ljspeech-621076bd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kidney-cori-621076bd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/kidney-899bc0f3.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"kidney failure\", \"meaning\": \"suy thận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"kidney transplant\", \"meaning\": \"ghép thận\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"liver\", \"note_vi\": \"gan, cơ quan lọc độc tố khác trong cơ thể\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kidney-cori-621076bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kidney-aru0-621076bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kidney-aru5-621076bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kidney-aru6-621076bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kidney-aru10-621076bd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kidney-aru9-621076bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kidney-aru3-621076bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kidney-aru7-621076bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kidney-aru8-621076bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kidney-aru2-621076bd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kidney-ljspeech-621076bd.mp3\", \"/storage/