('ac0ef742-ce2c-5a28-bf38-858ab3ca36ea', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '32795d14-c59f-53c4-9d0e-c6abc0b0e4eb', 'e9cf7252-554e-5b75-b5e1-cf14bb5e7891', 'check the time', '/tʃɛk ðə taɪm/', 'A2', 'phrase', 'Nhìn đồng hồ hoặc hỏi để biết bây giờ là mấy giờ.', 'to look at a clock or watch to see what hour it is.', 'I need to check the time; I don\'t want to be late for my appointment.', 'Tôi cần xem giờ; tôi không muốn đến muộn cuộc hẹn.', '{\"en\": \"The manager had to check the time repeatedly during the long budget meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã phải xem giờ liên tục trong suốt cuộc họp ngân sách kéo dài.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-the-time-ljspeech-356b6b4b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-the-time-cori-356b6b4b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/check-the-time-a66a3fd1.webp', '[\"look at the clock\", \"tell the time\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"constantly check the time\", \"meaning\": \"liên tục xem giờ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-the-time-cori-356b6b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-the-time-aru0-356b6b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-the-time-aru5-356b6b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-the-time-aru6-356b6b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-the-time-aru10-356b6b4b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-the-time-aru9-356b6b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-the-time-aru3-356b6b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-the-time-aru7-356b6b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-the-time-aru8-356b6b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-the-time-aru2-356b6b4b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-the-time-ljspeech-356b