('415572c0-256c-54db-a25a-9116a3109ade', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '388d7962-c46a-53ee-ade0-051bdb364cce', 'e847b580-ac01-5522-aa10-536eddaa31b7', 'chicken', '/ˈtʃɪkɪn/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một loài gia cầm phổ biến, thường được nuôi để lấy thịt và trứng.', 'a common farm bird kept for its eggs and meat.', 'For dinner tonight, we\'re having roasted chicken with vegetables.', 'Bữa tối nay, chúng tôi sẽ ăn gà quay với rau củ.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant manager added a new grilled chicken dish to the lunch menu.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý nhà hàng đã thêm một món gà nướng mới vào thực đơn bữa trưa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chicken-ljspeech-cef7e592.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chicken-cori-cef7e592.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/chicken-28558ef0.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fried chicken\", \"meaning\": \"gà rán\"}, {\"phrase\": \"grilled chicken\", \"meaning\": \"gà nướng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"kitchen\", \"note_vi\": \"kitchen (/ˈkɪtʃ.ən/) là nhà bếp, chicken (/ˈtʃɪk.ɪn/) là con gà.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chicken-cori-cef7e592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chicken-aru0-cef7e592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chicken-aru5-cef7e592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chicken-aru6-cef7e592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chicken-aru10-cef7e592.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chicken-aru9-cef7e592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chicken-aru3-cef7e592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chicken-aru7-cef7e592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chicken-aru8-cef7e592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chicken-aru2-cef7e592.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chicken-ljspeech-cef7e592.mp3\", 