('1d22fad2-80b2-5a0b-9054-9639fd319ab1', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '388d7962-c46a-53ee-ade0-051bdb364cce', 'e847b580-ac01-5522-aa10-536eddaa31b7', 'sell', 'UK: /sɛl/ | US: /sɛl/', 'A1', 'verb', 'bán', 'To hand over goods or services to a buyer in exchange for a specified payment.', 'We sell office supplies to local businesses.', 'Chúng tôi bán vật tư văn phòng cho các doanh nghiệp địa phương.', '{\"en\": \"Tickets for the annual charity gala sold out within less than an hour.\", \"vi\": \"Vé cho buổi dạ tiệc từ thiện hàng năm đã bán hết sạch trong vòng chưa đầy một giờ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sell-ljspeech-dee2dd34.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sell-cori-dee2dd34.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sell-88b26704.webp', '[\"vend\", \"retail\", \"market\"]', '[\"buy\", \"purchase\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sell out\", \"meaning\": \"bán hết sạch hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sell well\", \"meaning\": \"bán chạy\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"seller\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"sale\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sell-cori-dee2dd34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sell-aru0-dee2dd34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sell-aru5-dee2dd34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sell-aru6-dee2dd34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sell-aru10-dee2dd34.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sell-aru9-dee2dd34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sell-aru3-dee2dd34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sell-aru7-dee2dd34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sell-aru8-dee2dd34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sell-aru2-dee2dd34.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sell-ljspeech-dee2dd34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sell-lt408-dee2dd34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sell-lt138-dee2dd34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sell-lt624-dee2dd34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sell-lt396-dee2dd34.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sell-lt498-dee2dd34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sell-lt132-dee2dd34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sell-lt288-dee2dd34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sell-lt42-dee2dd34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sell-lt90-dee2dd34.mp3\"]}}', 'Dạng quá khứ và phân từ II là \'sold\'. Cụm \'sell out\' mang nghĩa là bán hết hàng.', 'sales', 1, 24),
('c279c1bb-825c-5853-bfad-217b5fb2c4ea', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '388d7962-c46a-53ee-ade0-051bdb364cce', 'e847b580-ac01-5522-aa10-536eddaa31b7', 'unhappy', 'UK: /ʌnˈhæpi/ | US: /ʌnˈhæpi/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'không hài lòng', 'Feeling dissatisfied, displeased, or sad about a particular situation or outcome.', 'Customers who are unhappy with the service can file a complaint.', 'Khách hàng không hài lòng với dịch vụ có thể nộp đơn khiếu nại.', '{\"en\": \"If you are unhappy with the quality of our service, please contact customer support immediately.\", \"vi\": \"Nếu bạn không hài lòng với chất lượng dịch vụ của chúng tôi, vui lòng liên hệ bộ phận hỗ trợ khách hàng ngay lập tức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unhappy-ljspeech-8c643cce.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unhappy-cori-8c643cce.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unhappy-36a010d1.webp', '[\"dissatisfied\", \"displeased\", \"disappointed\", \"discontented\"]', '[\"happy\", \"satisfied\", \"pleased\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"unhappy with the service\", \"meaning\": \"không hài lòng với dịch vụ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unhappy customer\", \"meaning\": \"khách hàng bất mãn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"unhelpful\", \"note_vi\": \"\'Unhappy\' là không hài lòng, còn \'unhelpful\' là không nhiệt tình giúp đỡ / không hữu ích.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"unhappiness\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"unhappily\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"happy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unhappy-cori-8c643cce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unhappy-aru0-8c643cce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unhappy-aru5-8c643cce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unhappy-aru6-8c643cce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unhappy-aru10-8c643cce.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unhappy-aru9-8c643cce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unhappy-aru3-8c643cce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unhappy-aru7-8c643cce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unhappy-aru8-8c643cce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unhappy-aru2-8c643cce.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unhappy-ljspeech-8c643cce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unhappy-lt408-8c643cce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unhappy-lt138-8c643cce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unhappy-lt624-8c643cce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unhappy-lt396-8c643cce.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unhappy-lt498-8c643cce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unhappy-lt132-8c643cce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unhappy-lt288-8c643cce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unhappy-lt42-8c643cce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unhappy-lt90-8c643cce.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với giới từ \'with\' hoặc \'about\' để thể hiện thái độ thất vọng về chất lượng hàng hóa/dịch vụ.', 'customer service', 1, 25)
