('e5d8dde9-ce7e-5624-89e5-672644a01d1f', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '388d7962-c46a-53ee-ade0-051bdb364cce', 'e847b580-ac01-5522-aa10-536eddaa31b7', 'sweep the floor', '/swiːp ðə flɔː/', 'A2', 'phrase', 'Dùng chổi để làm sạch sàn nhà.', 'to clean the ground inside a room or building using a broom.', 'Every morning, I sweep the floor in the kitchen after breakfast.', 'Mỗi sáng, tôi quét sàn nhà bếp sau bữa sáng.', '{\"en\": \"The office cleaner was asked to sweep the floor before the morning staff meeting started.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên vệ sinh văn phòng được yêu cầu quét nhà trước khi cuộc họp nhân viên buổi sáng bắt đầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweep-the-floor-ljspeech-6b73c611.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweep-the-floor-cori-6b73c611.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sweep-the-floor-7617e6df.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sweep the floor clean\", \"meaning\": \"quét sạch sàn nhà\"}, {\"phrase\": \"thoroughly sweep the floor\", \"meaning\": \"quét kỹ sàn nhà\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweep-the-floor-cori-6b73c611.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweep-the-floor-aru0-6b73c611.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweep-the-floor-aru5-6b73c611.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweep-the-floor-aru6-6b73c611.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweep-the-floor-aru10-6b73c611.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweep-the-floor-aru9-6b73c611.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweep-the-floor-aru3-6b73c611.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweep-the-floor-aru7-6b73c611.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweep-the-floor-aru8-6b73c611.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweep-the-floor-aru2-6b73c611.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweep-the-floor-ljspeech-6b73c611.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweep-the-floor-lt408-6b73c611.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweep-the-floor-lt138-6b73c611.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweep-the-floor-lt624-6b73c611.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweep-the-floor-lt396-6b73c611.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweep-the-floor-lt498-6b73c611.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweep-the-floor-lt132-6b73c611.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweep-the-floor-lt288-6b73c611.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweep-the-floor-lt42-6b73c611.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweep-the-floor-lt90-6b73c611.mp3\"]}}', 'Cần phân biệt sweep the floor (quét nhà bằng chổi) với mop the floor (lau nhà bằng giẻ/cây lau).', 'office', 1, 27),
('bafa3d6e-4167-5576-9e97-6c46086d6418', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '388d7962-c46a-53ee-ade0-051bdb364cce', 'e847b580-ac01-5522-aa10-536eddaa31b7', 'leg', '/leɡ/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Bộ phận cơ thể dùng để đi lại, hoặc phần đỡ của đồ vật.', 'one of the long parts of the body that is used for standing or walking.', 'My dog hurt its front leg while playing in the park.', 'Con chó của tôi bị thương ở chân trước khi chơi trong công viên.', '{\"en\": \"The ergonomic chair helps support your back and leg while you work at the desk.\", \"vi\": \"Chiếc ghế công thái học giúp hỗ trợ lưng và chân của bạn khi bạn làm việc tại bàn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leg-ljspeech-321d6cc5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leg-cori-321d6cc5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/leg-315a583d.webp', '[\"limb\", \"appendage\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"broken leg\", \"meaning\": \"gãy chân\"}, {\"phrase\": \"leg pain\", \"meaning\": \"đau chân\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leg-cori-321d6cc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leg-aru0-321d6cc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leg-aru5-321d6cc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leg-aru6-321d6cc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leg-aru10-321d6cc5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leg-aru9-321d6cc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leg-aru3-321d6cc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leg-aru7-321d6cc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leg-aru8-321d6cc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leg-aru2-321d6cc5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leg-ljspeech-321d6cc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leg-lt408-321d6cc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leg