('e58f4a67-138f-5d2c-8987-01dba2428448', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '3f77f443-9bf4-59ac-9b04-c5b3e28ec05a', '9dc9b6b0-1675-57d5-817f-49796b6ebc89', 'pollution', '/pəˈluːʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Tình trạng môi trường bị bẩn bởi chất độc hại.', 'damage caused to water, air, or land by harmful substances or waste.', 'The factory was fined heavily for dumping toxic waste and causing water pollution.', 'Nhà máy đã bị phạt nặng vì xả chất thải độc hại và gây ô nhiễm nguồn nước.', '{\"en\": \"The manufacturing factory installed new filters to reduce air pollution in the local area.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà máy sản xuất đã lắp đặt các bộ lọc mới để giảm ô nhiễm không khí ở khu vực địa phương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pollution-ljspeech-233471ef.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pollution-cori-233471ef.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pollution-73c91909.webp', '[\"contamination\"]', '[\"purity\", \"cleanliness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"air pollution\", \"meaning\": \"ô nhiễm không khí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"environmental pollution\", \"meaning\": \"ô nhiễm môi trường\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"pollute\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"pollutant\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"polluted\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pollution-cori-233471ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pollution-aru0-233471ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pollution-aru5-233471ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pollution-aru6-233471ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pollution-aru10-233471ef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pollution-aru9-233471ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pollution-aru3-233471ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pollution-aru7-233471ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronu