('ea78af7a-10ee-5891-8a9b-5bcaca9c0c14', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '3f77f443-9bf4-59ac-9b04-c5b3e28ec05a', '9dc9b6b0-1675-57d5-817f-49796b6ebc89', 'survey', 'UK: /ˈsɜːveɪ/ | US: /ˈsɜːrveɪ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'khảo sát', 'An investigation of opinions or behaviors of a group of people via collected questions.', 'The employee survey showed high job satisfaction.', 'Khảo sát nhân viên cho thấy mức độ hài lòng cao trong công việc.', '{\"en\": \"According to a recent customer survey, user satisfaction has increased by 15 percent.\", \"vi\": \"Theo một khảo sát khách hàng gần đây, mức độ hài lòng của người dùng đã tăng 15%.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survey-ljspeech-62380fcb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survey-cori-62380fcb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/survey-2793731f.webp', '[\"questionnaire\", \"study\", \"poll\", \"investigation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"conduct a survey\", \"meaning\": \"tiến hành một cuộc khảo sát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"survey results\", \"meaning\": \"kết quả khảo sát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"customer satisfaction survey\", \"meaning\": \"khảo sát mức độ hài lòng của khách hàng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"survey\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"surveyor\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survey-cori-62380fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survey-aru0-62380fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survey-aru5-62380fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survey-aru6-62380fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survey-aru10-62380fcb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survey-aru9-62380fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survey-aru3-62380fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survey-aru7-62380fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survey-aru8-62380fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survey-aru2-62380fcb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survey-ljspeech-62380fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survey-lt408-62380fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survey-lt138-62380fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survey-lt624-62380fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survey-lt396-62380fcb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survey-lt498-62380fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survey-lt132-62380fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survey-lt288-62380fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survey-lt42-62380fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/survey-lt90-62380fcb.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với các động từ như conduct, carry out, complete, take. Phân biệt với \'poll\' (thăm dò ý kiến ngắn).', 'marketing', 1, 19),
('b7e2c214-44f3-5d48-baf1-19c786764560', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '3f77f443-9bf4-59ac-9b04-c5b3e28ec05a', '9dc9b6b0-1675-57d5-817f-49796b6ebc89', 'dinner', '/ˈdɪnə(r)/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Bữa ăn chính vào buổi tối.', 'The primary repast of a day typically served during the late afternoon or evening.', 'We usually have dinner together as a family around 7 PM.', 'Chúng tôi thường ăn bữa tối cùng nhau như một gia đình vào khoảng 7 giờ tối.', '{\"en\": \"The company invited all new clients to a formal dinner at the hotel.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã mời tất cả khách hàng mới đến dự một bữa tối trang trọng tại khách sạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dinner-ljspeech-78cbc77f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dinner-cori-78cbc77f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dinner-af94d9af.webp', '[\"supper\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"business dinner\", \"meaning\": \"bữa tối bàn công việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"have dinner\", \"meaning\": \"ăn tối\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"diner\", \"note_vi\": \"diner là thực khách hoặc quán ăn nhỏ, dinner là bữa tối.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dinner-cori-78cbc77f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dinner-aru0-78cbc77f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dinner-aru5-78cbc77f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dinner-aru6-78cbc77f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dinner-aru10-78cbc77f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dinner-aru9-78cbc77f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dinner-aru3-78cbc77f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dinner-aru7-78cbc77f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dinner-aru8-78cbc77f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dinner-aru2-78cbc77f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dinner-ljspe