('adcd0bfa-4d2b-51c2-b485-9ca4856a5d2a', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '437a9ddd-d1a4-5389-884d-c4ab0842c935', '8865dbab-1a57-5eed-8612-8d58a1f34a82', 'hurricane', '/ˈhʌrɪkən/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Cơn bão nhiệt đới lớn với gió rất mạnh và mưa to.', 'a violent storm with very strong winds that forms over warm ocean waters.', 'The coastal town was severely damaged by the hurricane.', 'Thị trấn ven biển bị hư hại nặng nề bởi cơn bão lớn.', '{\"en\": \"The shipment was delayed because a powerful hurricane affected major shipping routes in the ocean.\", \"vi\": \"Lô hàng đã bị chậm trễ vì một cơn bão lớn ảnh hưởng đến các tuyến đường vận tải chính trên đại dương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurricane-ljspeech-38382655.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurricane-cori-38382655.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hurricane-c778808e.webp', '[\"typhoon\", \"cyclone\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"severe hurricane\", \"meaning\": \"cơn bão dữ dội\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hurricane warning\", \"meaning\": \"cảnh báo bão lớn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"typhoon\", \"note_vi\": \"Hurricane hình thành ở Đại Tây Dương; typhoon hình thành ở Thái Bình Dương.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurricane-cori-38382655.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurricane-aru0-38382655.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurricane-aru5-38382655.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurricane-aru6-38382655.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurricane-aru10-38382655.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurricane-aru9-38382655.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurricane-aru3-38382655.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurricane-aru7-38382655.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurricane-aru8-38382655.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurricane-aru2-38382655.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurricane-ljspeech-38382655.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurricane-lt408-38382655.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurricane-lt138-38382655.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurricane-lt624-38382655.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurricane-lt396-38382655.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurricane-lt498-38382655.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurricane-lt132-38382655.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurricane-lt288-38382655.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurricane-lt42-38382655.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurricane-lt90-38382655.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt: Hurricane (Đại Tây Dương/Đông Thái Bình Dương), Typhoon (Tây Thái Bình Dương).', 'nature', 1, 6),
('712a9517-2b76-5bb5-bd10-29d493ff84c7', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '437a9ddd-d1a4-5389-884d-c4ab0842c935', '8865dbab-1a57-5eed-8612-8d58a1f34a82', 'jam', '/dʒæm/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng giao thông bị tắc nghẽn, xe cộ không thể di chuyển.', 'a situation in which a large number of vehicles cannot move or move very slowly.', 'Leaving early helped the sales representative avoid the morning rush-hour traffic jam.', 'Đi sớm đã giúp đại diện kinh doanh tránh được tình trạng kẹt xe vào giờ cao điểm buổi sáng.', '{\"en\": \"The delivery truck was delayed for two hours because of a major traffic jam.\", \"vi\": \"Xe tải giao hàng đã bị trễ hai tiếng đồng hồ vì kẹt xe nghiêm trọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jam-ljspeech-da3dd5c2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jam-cori-da3dd5c2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/jam-4b2a6e34.webp', '[\"congestion\", \"gridlock\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"traffic jam\", \"meaning\": \"sự kẹt xe\"}, {\"phrase\": \"paper jam\", \"meaning\": \"kẹt giấy (máy in)\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"jar\", \"note_vi\": \"jar là cái lọ, hũ thủy tinh\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"jam\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jam-cori-da3dd5c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jam-aru0-da3dd5c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jam-aru5-da3dd5c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jam-aru6-da3dd5c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jam-aru10-da3dd5c2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jam-aru9-da3dd5c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jam-aru3-da3dd5c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jam-aru7-da3dd5c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jam-aru8-da3dd5c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jam-aru2-da3dd5c2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jam-ljspeech-da3dd5c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jam-lt408-da3dd5c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jam-lt138-da3dd5c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jam-lt624-da3dd5c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jam-lt396-da3dd5c2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jam-lt498-da3dd5c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jam-lt132-da3dd5c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jam-lt288-da3dd5c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jam-lt42-da3dd5c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jam-lt90-da3dd5c2.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài nghĩa kẹt xe, jam còn có nghĩa là mứt hoa quả hoặc kẹt giấy (paper jam).', 'travel', 1, 7),
('4fc80879-4438-55ec-bba7-53dd00ec9283', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '437a9ddd-d1a4-5389-884d-c4ab0842c935', '8865dbab-1a57-5eed-8612-8d58a1f34a82', 'pill', '/pɪl/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một viên thuốc nhỏ dùng để chữa bệnh hoặc bổ sung.', 'a small solid form of medicine taken by mouth.', 'Remember to take your medicine, one pill after each meal.', 'Hãy nhớ uống thuốc của bạn, mỗi bữa ăn một viên.', '{\"en\": \"The manager takes a vitamin pill during the long business meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý uống một viên vitamin trong cuộc họp kinh doanh dài.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-ljspeech-93720caa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-cori-93720caa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pill-ee713779.webp', '[\"tablet\", \"capsule\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"take a pill\", \"meaning\": \"uống viên thuốc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sleeping pill\", \"meaning\": \"thuốc ngủ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pain pill\", \"meaning\": \"thuốc giảm đau\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pillow\", \"note_vi\": \"pillow là gối, khác viên thuốc\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-cori-93720caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-aru0-93720caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-aru5-93720caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-aru6-93720caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-aru10-93720caa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-aru9-93720caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-aru3-93720caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-aru7-93720caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-aru8-93720caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-aru2-93720caa.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-ljspeech-93720caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-lt408-93720caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-lt138-93720caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-lt624-93720caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-lt396-93720caa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-lt498-93720caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-lt132-93720caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-lt288-93720caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-lt42-93720caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-lt90-93720caa.mp3\"]}}', 'Không nhầm pill (thuốc) với pillow (gối).', 'health', 1, 8),
('eff0caf6-74bd-58de-aace-bd16f086a6d7', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '437a9ddd-d1a4-5389-884d-c4ab0842c935', '8865dbab-1a57-5eed-8612-8d58a1f34a82', 'keep', 'UK: /kiːp/ | US: /kiːp/', 'A1', 'verb', 'giữ (thông tin) bí mật', 'To maintain private information or prevent details from being disclosed to others.', 'Participants must keep the project details confidential.', 'Những người tham gia phải giữ bí mật các chi tiết dự án.', '{\"en\": \"All employees must keep client data confidential to ensure compliance with privacy laws.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả nhân viên phải giữ bảo mật dữ liệu khách hàng để đảm bảo tuân thủ luật riêng tư.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-ljspeech-1264bdfe.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-cori-1264bdfe.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/keep-1e7b63e8.webp', '[\"maintain\", \"retain\", \"withhold\", \"preserve\"]', '[\"reveal\", \"disclose\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"keep confidential\", \"meaning\": \"giữ bảo mật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"keep a secret\", \"meaning\": \"giữ bí mật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"store\", \"note_vi\": \"Store là cất giữ/lưu trữ dữ liệu hay vật dụng, còn keep thiên về giữ bí mật hoặc duy trì trạng thái.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"keeper\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-cori-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-aru0-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-aru5-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-aru6-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-aru10-1264bdfe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-aru9-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-aru3-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-aru7-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-aru8-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-aru2-1264bdfe.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-ljspeech-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-lt408-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-lt138-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-lt624-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-lt396-1264bdfe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-lt498-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-lt132-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-lt288-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-lt42-1264bdfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-lt90-1264bdfe.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ cảnh công sở, \'keep confidential\' hoặc \'keep a secret\' mang nghĩa bảo mật thông tin nội bộ.', 'office', 1, 9),
('e6d90601-ffd6-50a7-92d4-6d491fe47805', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '437a9ddd-d1a4-5389-884d-c4ab0842c935', '8865dbab-1a57-5eed-8612-8d58a1f34a82', 'monitor', '/ˈmɒnɪtə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Thiết bị hiển thị hình ảnh hoặc thông tin từ máy tính.', 'An electronic visual display unit connected to a computing system for output viewing.', 'The technician adjusted the monitor settings to improve text clarity during the presentation.', 'Kỹ thuật viên đã điều chỉnh các cài đặt màn hình để nâng cao độ rõ nét của chữ trong buổi thuyết trình.', '{\"en\": \"The IT department replaced the old monitor with a high-resolution screen for better graphic design.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng CNTT đã thay thế màn hình cũ bằng một màn hình độ phân giải cao để thiết kế đồ họa tốt hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-ljspeech-9796809f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-cori-9796809f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/monitor-87856ddd.webp', '[\"screen\", \"display\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"computer monitor\", \"meaning\": \"màn hình máy tính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"large monitor\", \"meaning\": \"màn hình lớn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"monitor\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-cori-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-aru0-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-aru5-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-aru6-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-aru10-9796809f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-aru9-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-aru3-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-aru7-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-aru8-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-aru2-9796809f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-ljspeech-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-lt408-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-lt138-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-lt624-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-lt396-9796809f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-lt498-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-lt132-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-lt288-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-lt42-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-lt90-9796809f.mp3\"]}}', 'Động từ \'monitor\' có nghĩa là giám sát, theo dõi tiến độ công việc.', 'technology', 1, 10),
('12677b8c-8bd6-5de0-9369-61ceb74716a8', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '437a9ddd-d1a4-5389-884d-c4ab0842c935', '8865dbab-1a57-5eed-8612-8d58a1f34a82', 'global warming', '/ɡləʊbəl wɔːmɪŋ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sự tăng nhiệt độ trung bình của khí quyển Trái Đất, gây ra bởi hiệu ứng nhà kính.', 'the long-term rise of atmospheric temperatures worldwide caused mainly by human industrial activities.', 'Scientists are increasingly concerned about the long-term effects of global warming on our planet.', 'Các nhà khoa học ngày càng lo ngại về những tác động lâu dài của hiện tượng nóng lên toàn cầu đối với hành tinh của chúng ta.', '{\"en\": \"The company is implementing green policies to reduce its contribution to global warming.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đang thực hiện các chính sách xanh để giảm bớt sự đóng góp vào hiện tượng nóng lên toàn cầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/global-warming-ljspeech-246910c6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/global-warming-cori-246910c6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/global-warming-ac5a633e.webp', '[\"climate change\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"combat global warming\", \"meaning\": \"chống lại sự nóng lên toàn cầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"effects of global warming\", \"meaning\": \"tác động của sự nóng lên toàn cầu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"greenhouse effect\", \"note_vi\": \"hiệu ứng nhà kính là nguyên nhân gây ra global warming\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/global-warming-cori-246910c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/global-warming-aru0-246910c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/global-warming-aru5-246910c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/global-warming-aru6-246910c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/global-warming-aru10-246910c6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/global-warming-aru9-246910c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/global-warming-aru3-246910c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/global-warming-aru7-246910c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/global-warming-aru8-246910c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/global-warming-aru2-246910c6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/global-warming-ljspeech-246910c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/global-warming-lt408-246910c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/global-warming-lt138-246910c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/global-warming-lt624-246910c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/global-warming-lt396-246910c6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/global-warming-lt498-246910c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/global-warming-lt132-246910c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/global-warming-lt288-246910c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/global-warming-lt42-246910c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/global-warming-lt90-246910c6.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường xuất hiện trong các bài đọc về trách nhiệm xã hội của doanh nghiệp.', 'nature', 1, 11),
('f5066da9-cfbf-5109-9be8-03510ef823c1', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '437a9ddd-d1a4-5389-884d-c4ab0842c935', '8865dbab-1a57-5eed-8612-8d58a1f34a82', 'swim', '/swɪm/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Di chuyển trong nước bằng cách dùng tay và chân.', 'to move through water by moving parts of the body such as arms and legs.', 'My little brother is learning to swim in the community pool.', 'Em trai tôi đang học bơi ở bể bơi cộng đồng.', '{\"en\": \"Guests staying at the resort can swim in the outdoor pool during opening hours.\", \"vi\": \"Khách lưu trú tại khu nghỉ dưỡng có thể bơi ở hồ bơi ngoài trời trong giờ mở cửa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swim-ljspeech-b89f90f3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swim-cori-b89f90f3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/swim-7b224293.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"go for a swim\", \"meaning\": \"đi bơi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"swim laps\", \"meaning\": \"bơi theo vòng/làn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"swimmer\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"swimming\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swim-cori-b89f90f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swim-aru0-b89f90f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swim-aru5-b89f90f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swim-aru6-b89f90f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swim-aru10-b89f90f3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swim-aru9-b89f90f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swim-aru3-b89f90f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swim-aru7-b89f90f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swim-aru8-b89f90f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swim-aru2-b89f90f3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swim-ljspeech-b89f90f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swim-lt408-b89f90f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swim-lt138-b89f90f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swim-lt624-b89f90f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swim-lt396-b89f90f3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swim-lt498-b89f90f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swim-lt132-b89f90f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swim-lt288-b89f90f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swim-lt42-b89f90f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swim-lt90-b89f90f3.mp3\"]}}', 'Động từ bất quy tắc: quá khứ đơn là swam và quá khứ phân từ là swum.', 'daily', 1, 12),
('dcf37c59-a08d-56b4-94ba-cde0a744403d', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '437a9ddd-d1a4-5389-884d-c4ab0842c935', '8865dbab-1a57-5eed-8612-8d58a1f34a82', 'performance', '/pəˈfɔːməns/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hiệu suất, kết quả làm việc hoặc thể hiện.', 'how well a person, machine, or organization does a piece of work or an activity.', 'The manager evaluated the employee\'s yearly performance during the annual review meeting.', 'Quản lý đã đánh giá hiệu suất hàng năm của nhân viên trong cuộc họp đánh giá thường niên.', '{\"en\": \"The manager will evaluate your overall work performance during the annual review meeting next week.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý sẽ đánh giá hiệu suất làm việc tổng thể của bạn trong cuộc họp đánh giá thường niên vào tuần tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/performance-ljspeech-476ee0f6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/performance-cori-476ee0f6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/performance-b6c68323.webp', '[\"efficiency\", \"effectiveness\", \"execution\"]', '[\"inefficiency\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"high performance\", \"meaning\": \"hiệu suất cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"performance review\", \"meaning\": \"đánh giá hiệu suất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"poor performance\", \"meaning\": \"hiệu suất kém\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"performance\", \"note_vi\": \"Ngoài hiệu suất, từ này còn có nghĩa là buổi biểu diễn nghệ thuật.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"perform\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"performer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/performance-cori-476ee0f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/performance-aru0-476ee0f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/performance-aru5-476ee0f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/performance-aru6-476ee0f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/performance-aru10-476ee0f6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/performance-aru9-476ee0f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/performance-aru3-476ee0f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/performance-aru7-476ee0f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/performance-aru8-476ee0f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/performance-aru2-476ee0f6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/performance-ljspeech-476ee0f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/performance-lt408-476ee0f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/performance-lt138-476ee0f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/performance-lt624-476ee0f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/performance-lt396-476ee0f6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/performance-lt498-476ee0f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/performance-lt132-476ee0f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/performance-lt288-476ee0f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/performance-lt42-476ee0f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/performance-lt90-476ee0f6.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'performance review\' (đánh giá năng lực) là một từ vựng cực kỳ phổ biến trong TOEIC.', 'hr', 1, 13),
('e14c5db8-0705-5163-83b6-384d6c12e72e', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '437a9ddd-d1a4-5389-884d-c4ab0842c935', '8865dbab-1a57-5eed-8612-8d58a1f34a82', 'relax', '/rɪˈlæks/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Nghỉ ngơi, làm cho cơ thể và tinh thần thoải mái.', 'to become calm and free from stress after effort or work.', 'After a busy week, I like to relax by reading a book in the garden.', 'Sau một tuần bận rộn, tôi thích thư giãn bằng cách đọc sách trong vườn.', '{\"en\": \"Employees can relax in the lounge after finishing the busy morning meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên có thể thư giãn ở phòng chờ sau khi kết thúc cuộc họp sáng bận rộn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-ljspeech-63bb094c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-cori-63bb094c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/relax-cc2aa74b.webp', '[\"rest\", \"unwind\", \"chill\"]', '[\"tense\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"relax muscles\", \"meaning\": \"thư giãn cơ bắp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"relax rules\", \"meaning\": \"nới lỏng quy định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"relax at home\", \"meaning\": \"thư giãn ở nhà\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"release\", \"note_vi\": \"phát hành, thả ra; không phải thư giãn\"}, {\"word\": \"relay\", \"note_vi\": \"tiếp sức, truyền tin; dễ nhầm chính tả\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"relaxation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"relaxed\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"relaxing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-cori-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-aru0-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-aru5-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-aru6-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-aru10-63bb094c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-aru9-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-aru3-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-aru7-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-aru8-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-aru2-63bb094c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-ljspeech-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-lt408-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-lt138-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-lt624-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-lt396-63bb094c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-lt498-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-lt132-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-lt288-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-lt42-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-lt90-63bb094c.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhớ relax là động từ, tính từ là relaxed/relaxing.', 'office', 1, 14),
('2ed94466-3bef-524f-9d37-7690692e4ed4', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '437a9ddd-d1a4-5389-884d-c4ab0842c935', '8865dbab-1a57-5eed-8612-8d58a1f34a82', 'drink', '/drɪŋk/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Chất lỏng dùng để uống.', 'a liquid that you can swallow to satisfy your thirst or for enjoyment.', 'Guests were offered a refreshing fruit drink upon arriving at the hotel.', 'Khách hàng được mời một đồ uống trái cây giải khát khi đến khách sạn.', '{\"en\": \"The catering service will provide a variety of cold drinks during the afternoon conference break.\", \"vi\": \"Dịch vụ ăn uống sẽ cung cấp nhiều loại đồ uống lạnh trong giờ nghỉ giải lao của hội nghị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drink-ljspeech-7ca7a4ab.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drink-cori-7ca7a4ab.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/drink-31b5b45f.webp', '[\"beverage\", \"liquid\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"soft drink\", \"meaning\": \"nước ngọt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hot drink\", \"meaning\": \"đồ uống nóng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"drink\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drink-cori-7ca7a4ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drink-aru0-7ca7a4ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drink-aru5-7ca7a4ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drink-aru6-7ca7a4ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drink-aru10-7ca7a4ab.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drink-aru9-7ca7a4ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drink-aru3-7ca7a4ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drink-aru7-7ca7a4ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drink-aru8-7ca7a4ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drink-aru2-7ca7a4ab.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drink-ljspeech-7ca7a4ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pu