('f9fd0d6c-0f0e-58cc-b10f-a49dff840e3a', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '437a9ddd-d1a4-5389-884d-c4ab0842c935', '8865dbab-1a57-5eed-8612-8d58a1f34a82', 'uniform', '/ˈjuːnɪfɔːm/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Trang phục giống nhau được mặc bởi các thành viên của một nhóm.', 'standardized clothing prescribed for members of a specific group, company, or institution.', 'All security guards on duty are expected to wear a clean uniform.', 'Tất cả nhân viên bảo vệ đang làm nhiệm vụ được yêu cầu phải mặc đồng phục sạch sẽ.', '{\"en\": \"All security guards must wear a professional uniform while on duty at the building.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả bảo vệ phải mặc đồng phục chuyên nghiệp khi làm nhiệm vụ tại tòa nhà.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-ljspeech-8146160c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-cori-8146160c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/uniform-39262441.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"wear a uniform\", \"meaning\": \"mặc đồng phục\"}, {\"phrase\": \"school uniform\", \"meaning\": \"đồng phục trường học\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"uniformed\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"uniformly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-cori-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-aru0-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-aru5-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-aru6-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-aru10-8146160c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-aru9-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-aru3-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-aru7-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-aru8-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-aru2-8146160c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-ljspeech-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-lt408-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-lt138-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-lt624-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-lt396-8146160c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-lt498-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-lt132-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-lt288-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-lt42-8146160c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniform-lt90-8146160c.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ đếm được, dùng \'a uniform\' vì phát âm bắt đầu bằng nguyên âm /j/.', 'office', 1, 27),
('4683224e-773f-5a91-a8dd-c87dafe45da7', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '437a9ddd-d1a4-5389-884d-c4ab0842c935', '8865dbab-1a57-5eed-8612-8d58a1f34a82', 'water plants', '/wɔːtə plɑːnts/', 'A1', 'phrase', 'Cung cấp nước cho cây để chúng phát triển.', 'to pour liquid onto living green things growing in soil to keep them alive.', 'Office workers take turns to water plants located in the reception area.', 'Các nhân viên văn phòng luân phiên tưới cây ở khu vực lễ tân.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance staff will water plants in the office lobby every Monday morning.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên bảo trì sẽ tưới cây ở sảnh văn phòng vào mỗi sáng thứ Hai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-plants-ljspeech-175aad3c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-plants-cori-175aad3c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/water-plants-880c976a.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"water plants regularly\", \"meaning\": \"tưới cây thường xuyên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"water indoor plants\", \"meaning\": \"tưới cây trong nhà\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-plants-cori-175aad3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-plants-aru0-175aad3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-plants-aru5-175aad3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-plants-aru6-175aad3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-plants-aru10-175aad3c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-plants-aru9-175aad3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-plants-aru3-175aad3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-plants-aru7-175aad3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-plants-aru8-175aad3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-plants-aru2-175aad3c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunci