('4e896580-06c2-5531-9995-5740f3863ea4', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '525e0ba3-72cc-5cf4-b739-ed4dc3d95c97', '5cdde0d4-72b0-5e76-8bba-86300a4775cf', 'watch TV', '/wɒtʃ tiː viː/', 'A1', 'phrase', 'Xem các chương trình trên tivi.', 'to look at moving pictures and programs on an electronic screen.', 'After dinner, we usually watch TV together as a family.', 'Sau bữa tối, chúng tôi thường xem TV cùng nhau như một gia đình.', '{\"en\": \"Hotel guests can watch TV free of charge in the executive lounge.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng của khách sạn có thể xem TV miễn phí tại sảnh chờ thương gia.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-tv-ljspeech-9d2a9d6b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-tv-cori-9d2a9d6b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/watch-tv-ee3a2fa4.webp', '[\"watch television\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"watch TV live\", \"meaning\": \"xem truyền hình trực tiếp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sit and watch TV\", \"meaning\": \"ngồi xem TV\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"see TV\", \"note_vi\": \"Không dùng \'see TV\' để nói về hành động xem chương trình TV.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-tv-cori-9d2a9d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-tv-aru0-9d2a9d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-tv-aru5-9d2a9d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-tv-aru6-9d2a9d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-tv-aru10-9d2a9d6b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-tv-aru9-9d2a9d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-tv-aru3-9d2a9d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-tv-aru7-9d2a9d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-tv-aru8-9d2a9d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-tv-aru2-9d2a9d6b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-tv-ljspeech-9d2a9d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-tv-lt408-9d2a9d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-tv-lt138-9d2a9d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-tv-lt624-9d2a9d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-tv-lt396-9d2a9d6b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-tv-lt498-9d2a9d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-tv-lt132-9d2a9d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-tv-lt288-9d2a9d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-tv-lt42-9d2a9d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-tv-lt90-9d2a9d6b.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng động từ \'watch\' cho TV/phim ảnh, không dùng \'see\' hay \'look\'.', 'daily', 1, 2),
('a3108e1c-c543-5c10-a8a0-6dd1eeba602b', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '525e0ba3-72cc-5cf4-b739-ed4dc3d95c97', '5cdde0d4-72b0-5e76-8bba-86300a4775cf', 'edit', '/ˈedɪt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Sửa đổi, cắt ghép hoặc điều chỉnh nội dung để cải thiện.', 'to make changes to a piece of writing, image, or video to improve or correct it.', 'She spent hours to edit her travel video before uploading it online.', 'Cô ấy đã dành hàng giờ để chỉnh sửa video du lịch của mình trước khi đăng lên mạng.', '{\"en\": \"Please edit the promotional video before sending it to the marketing team.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng chỉnh sửa video quảng cáo trước khi gửi cho nhóm marketing.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-ljspeech-9ead47a8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-cori-9ead47a8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/edit-a3a52503.webp', '[\"revise\", \"modify\", \"correct\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"edit a document\", \"meaning\": \"chỉnh sửa tài liệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"edit a video\", \"meaning\": \"chỉnh sửa video\"}, {\"phrase\": \"edit for errors\", \"meaning\": \"chỉnh sửa để sửa lỗi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"revise\", \"note_vi\": \"revise thường dùng cho văn bản; edit dùng rộng hơn cho cả ảnh, video, văn bản\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"editor\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"edition\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"editorial\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-cori-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-aru0-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-aru5-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-aru6-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-aru10-9ead47a8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-aru9-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-aru3-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-aru7-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-aru8-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-aru2-9ead47a8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-ljspeech-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-lt408-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-lt138-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-lt624-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-lt396-9ead47a8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-lt498-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-lt132-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-lt288-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-lt42-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-lt90-9ead47a8.mp3\"]}}', 'Edit dùng cho cả văn bản lẫn ảnh/video; đừng nhầm với \'correct\' chỉ sửa lỗi đơn thuần.', 'office', 1, 3),
('ea889d67-304d-5969-ac61-5966d15206b0', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '525e0ba3-72cc-5cf4-b739-ed4dc3d95c97', '5cdde0d4-72b0-5e76-8bba-86300a4775cf', 'various', 'UK: /ˈveəriəs/ | US: /ˈvɛriəs/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'đa dạng, nhiều', 'referring to several different kinds or types of items within a particular group.', 'Our company offers various services to meet client needs.', 'Công ty chúng tôi cung cấp nhiều dịch vụ đa dạng để đáp ứng nhu cầu của khách hàng.', '{\"en\": \"Representatives from various departments attended the emergency planning meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Đại diện từ nhiều phòng ban khác nhau đã tham dự cuộc họp hoạch định khẩn cấp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/various-ljspeech-7942c90e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/various-cori-7942c90e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/various-89f9f758.webp', '[\"several\", \"numerous\", \"diverse\"]', '[\"identical\", \"same\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"for various reasons\", \"meaning\": \"vì nhiều lý do khác nhau\"}, {\"phrase\": \"various types of\", \"meaning\": \"nhiều loại khác nhau\"}, {\"phrase\": \"various options\", \"meaning\": \"nhiều lựa chọn khác nhau\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"variable\", \"note_vi\": \"\'various\' có nghĩa là nhiều/khác nhau, còn \'variable\' có nghĩa là dễ biến đổi/thay đổi.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"variety\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"vary\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/various-cori-7942c90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/various-aru0-7942c90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/various-aru5-7942c90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/various-aru6-7942c90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/various-aru10-7942c90e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/various-aru9-7942c90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/various-aru3-7942c90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/various-aru7-7942c90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/various-aru8-7942c90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/various-aru2-7942c90e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/various-ljspeech-7942c90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/various-lt408-7942c90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/various-lt138-7942c90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/various-lt624-7942c90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/various-lt396-7942c90e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/various-lt498-7942c90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/various-lt132-7942c90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/various-lt288-7942c90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/various-lt42-7942c90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/various-lt90-7942c90e.mp3\"]}}', 'Sau \'various\' luôn là danh từ số nhiều (ví dụ: various reasons, various departments).', 'office', 1, 4),
('b40dc3cb-7bb4-5795-a9f1-1003480fce3b', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '525e0ba3-72cc-5cf4-b739-ed4dc3d95c97', '5cdde0d4-72b0-5e76-8bba-86300a4775cf', 'zebra', '/ˈzebrə/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Loài động vật có vú thuộc họ ngựa, có sọc đen trắng.', 'a wild animal that looks like a horse and has black and white lines.', 'We saw a herd of zebras grazing peacefully on the African savanna.', 'Chúng tôi đã thấy một đàn ngựa vằn đang gặm cỏ thanh bình trên thảo nguyên châu Phi.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency organized a safari tour to see the zebra herds in Africa.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty du lịch đã tổ chức một chuyến tham quan safari để ngắm nhìn những đàn ngựa vằn ở châu Phi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zebra-ljspeech-38aa53de.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zebra-cori-38aa53de.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/zebra-e420e6f2.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"zebra crossing\", \"meaning\": \"vạch kẻ đường cho người đi bộ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zebra-cori-38aa53de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zebra-aru0-38aa53de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zebra-aru5-38aa53de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zebra-aru6-38aa53de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zebra-aru10-38aa53de.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zebra-aru9-38aa53de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zebra-aru3-38aa53de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zebra-aru7-38aa53de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zebra-aru8-38aa53de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zebra-aru2-38aa53de.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zebra-ljspeech-38aa53de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zebra-lt408-38aa53de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zebra-lt138-38aa53de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zebra-lt624-38aa53de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zebra-lt396-38aa53de.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zebra-lt498-38aa53de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zebra-lt132-38aa53de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zebra-lt288-38aa53de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zebra-lt42-38aa53de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zebra-lt90-38aa53de.mp3\"]}}', 'Gợi nhớ đến vạch kẻ đường (zebra crossing) có màu đen trắng.', 'travel', 1, 5),
('cf48a88b-92f9-5530-9bf7-4f792c531470', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '525e0ba3-72cc-5cf4-b739-ed4dc3d95c97', '5cdde0d4-72b0-5e76-8bba-86300a4775cf', 'salad', '/ˈsæləd/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Món ăn gồm rau sống, trái cây, thịt hoặc hải sản trộn với nước sốt.', 'a cold dish made of mixed raw vegetables, sometimes with other ingredients added.', 'For lunch, I usually have a fresh green salad with grilled chicken.', 'Vào bữa trưa, tôi thường ăn một đĩa salad rau xanh tươi với gà nướng.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel restaurant offers a fresh garden salad as a starter for business lunches.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng khách sạn cung cấp món salad vườn tươi như món khai vị cho các bữa trưa công tác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-ljspeech-f41c041b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-cori-f41c041b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/salad-db6a33c7.webp', '[\"greens\", \"mixed salad\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"green salad\", \"meaning\": \"salad rau xanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"Caesar salad\", \"meaning\": \"salad Caesar\"}, {\"phrase\": \"side salad\", \"meaning\": \"salad ăn kèm\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-cori-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-aru0-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-aru5-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-aru6-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-aru10-f41c041b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-aru9-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-aru3-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-aru7-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-aru8-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-aru2-f41c041b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/