('f79fa663-0339-5306-a298-72bf63065d21', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '525e0ba3-72cc-5cf4-b739-ed4dc3d95c97', '5cdde0d4-72b0-5e76-8bba-86300a4775cf', 'scooter', '/ˈskuːtə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Loại xe máy nhỏ, có sàn để chân phẳng.', 'a small two-wheeled vehicle with a motor, often used for traveling short distances in busy city traffic.', 'Many people in Southeast Asia use a scooter to get around the city.', 'Nhiều người ở Đông Nam Á dùng xe tay ga để đi lại trong thành phố.', '{\"en\": \"The delivery staff uses a small scooter to transport documents quickly through the busy city streets.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên giao hàng sử dụng một chiếc xe tay ga nhỏ để vận chuyển tài liệu nhanh chóng qua các con phố đông đúc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scooter-ljspeech-26f3cd23.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scooter-cori-26f3cd23.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/scooter-fdc3493c.webp', '[\"moped\", \"motorbike\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"electric scooter\", \"meaning\": \"xe tay ga điện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ride a scooter\", \"meaning\": \"lái xe tay ga\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scooter-cori-26f3cd23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scooter-aru0-26f3cd23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scooter-aru5-26f3cd23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scooter-aru6-26f3cd23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scooter-aru10-26f3cd23.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scooter-aru9-26f3cd23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scooter-aru3-26f3cd23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scooter-aru7-26f3cd23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scooter-aru8-26f3cd23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scooter-aru2-26f3cd23.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scooter-ljspeech-26f3cd23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scooter-lt408-26f3cd23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scooter-lt138-26f3cd23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scooter-lt624-26f3cd23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scooter-lt396-26f3cd23.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scooter-lt498-26f3cd23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scooter-lt132-26f3cd23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scooter-lt288-26f3cd23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scooter-lt42-26f3cd23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scooter-lt90-26f3cd23.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng cho xe máy tay ga hoặc xe trượt.', 'travel', 1, 7),
('5b1186cc-69a3-5480-9889-efbb0b55919d', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '525e0ba3-72cc-5cf4-b739-ed4dc3d95c97', '5cdde0d4-72b0-5e76-8bba-86300a4775cf', 'driver', '/ˈdraɪvə(r)/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Người điều khiển phương tiện giao thông.', 'a person who operates a car, bus, or other vehicle as their job.', 'A delivery driver parked the truck outside the office to unload corporate packages.', 'Một tài xế giao hàng đã đỗ xe tải bên ngoài văn phòng để dỡ các kiện hàng của công ty.', '{\"en\": \"The delivery driver will arrive at the main office before noon with the packages.\", \"vi\": \"Tài xế giao hàng sẽ đến văn phòng chính trước buổi trưa cùng với các kiện hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-ljspeech-fdda0c46.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-cori-fdda0c46.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/driver-3ce831f9.webp', '[\"chauffeur\", \"motorist\", \"operator\"]', '[\"passenger\", \"pedestrian\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"delivery driver\", \"meaning\": \"tài xế giao hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"designated driver\", \"meaning\": \"người lái xe được chỉ định (không uống rượu)\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"rider\", \"note_vi\": \"người đi xe máy/xe đạp hoặc cưỡi ngựa, không điều khiển ô tô\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"drive\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"driving\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-cori-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-aru0-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-aru5-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-aru6-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-aru10-fdda0c46.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-aru9-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-aru3-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-aru7-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-aru8-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-aru2-fdda0c46.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-ljspeech-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-lt408-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-lt138-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-lt624-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-lt396-fdda0c46.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-lt498-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-lt132-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-lt288-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-lt42-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-lt90-fdda0c46.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý phân biệt \'driver\' (người lái xe) và \'passenger\' (hành khách đi cùng).', 'travel', 1, 8),
('cd245ac7-2bff-520e-a794-c307450c1261', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '525e0ba3-72cc-5cf4-b739-ed4dc3d95c97', '5cdde0d4-72b0-5e76-8bba-86300a4775cf', 'clipboard', '/ˈklɪpbɔːd/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một tấm bảng cứng có kẹp để giữ giấy tờ.', 'a small board with a spring clip at the top for holding papers.', 'The doctor carried a clipboard with all the patient\'s records.', 'Bác sĩ mang theo một bìa kẹp giấy với tất cả hồ sơ bệnh án của bệnh nhân.', '{\"en\": \"The warehouse supervisor carried a clipboard to check the inventory list.\", \"vi\": \"Giám sát kho hàng mang theo một bìa kẹp giấy để kiểm tra danh sách hàng tồn kho.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-ljspeech-e2ab8561.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-cori-e2ab8561.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/clipboard-c1439222.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"hold a clipboard\", \"meaning\": \"cầm bìa kẹp giấy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wooden clipboard\", \"meaning\": \"bìa kẹp giấy bằng gỗ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"board\", \"note_vi\": \"bảng viết hoặc ban giám đốc, nghĩa rộng hơn\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-cori-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-aru0-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-aru5-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-aru6-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-aru10-e2ab8561.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-aru9-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-aru3-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-aru7-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-aru8-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-aru2-e2ab8561.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-ljspeech-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-lt408-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-lt138-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-lt624-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-lt396-e2ab8561.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-lt498-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-lt132-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-lt288-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-lt42-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-lt90-e2ab8561.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong tin học, clipboard còn có nghĩa là bộ nhớ tạm để lưu dữ liệu copy.', 'office', 1, 9),
('90d0fb59-b9d0-5e47-b905-9487a59f3085', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '525e0ba3-72cc-5cf4-b739-ed4dc3d95c97', '5cdde0d4-72b0-5e76-8bba-86300a4775cf', 'screen time', '/skriːn taɪm/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Tổng thời gian một người dành để nhìn vào màn hình thiết bị điện tử.', 'the amount of hours someone spends looking at electronic displays or phone devices.', 'Parents often try to limit their children\'s screen time to encourage outdoor activities.', 'Các bậc cha mẹ thường cố gắng hạn chế thời gian dùng màn hình của con cái để khuyến khích các hoạt động ngoài trời.', '{\"en\": \"Employees are advised to reduce screen time to avoid eye strain during long hours.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên được khuyên nên giảm thời gian dùng màn hình để tránh mỏi mắt khi làm việc lâu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screen-time-ljspeech-9e61bc8f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screen-time-cori-9e61bc8f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/screen-time-b27e47f0.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"limit screen time\", \"meaning\": \"giới hạn thời gian dùng màn hình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"excessive screen time\", \"meaning\": \"thời gian dùng màn hình quá nhiều\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screen-time-cori-9e61bc8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screen-time-aru0-9e61bc8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screen-time-aru5-9e61bc8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screen-time-aru6-9e61bc8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screen-time-aru10-9e61bc8f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screen-time-aru9-9e61bc8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screen-time-aru3-9e61bc8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screen-time-aru7-9e61bc8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screen-time-aru8-9e61bc8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screen-time-aru2-9e61bc8f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screen-time-ljspeech-9e61bc8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screen-time-lt408-9e61bc8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screen-time-lt138-9e61bc8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screen-time-lt624-9e61bc8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screen-time-lt396-9e61bc8f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screen-time-lt498-9e61bc8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screen-time-lt132-9e61bc8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screen-time-lt288-9e61bc8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screen-time-lt42-9e61bc8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screen-time-lt90-9e61bc8f.mp3\"]}}', 'Là danh từ ghép viết tách rời, dùng phổ biến trong ngữ cảnh sức khỏe và công nghệ.', 'health', 1, 10),
('fa836bb1-8bf2-5641-82e6-8643dd82de8c', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '525e0ba3-72cc-5cf4-b739-ed4dc3d95c97', '5cdde0d4-72b0-5e76-8bba-86300a4775cf', 'pain', '/peɪn/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Cảm giác khó chịu, đau đớn về thể chất hoặc tinh thần.', 'an uncomfortable feeling in your body caused by illness or injury.', 'Taking this medication helped reduce the chronic pain in his back.', 'Uống loại thuốc này đã giúp giảm bớt cơn đau mãn tính ở lưng của anh ấy.', '{\"en\": \"The worker felt severe back pain after moving heavy boxes all day.\", \"vi\": \"Người công nhân cảm thấy đau lưng dữ dội sau khi chuyển thùng hàng nặng cả ngày.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pain-ljspeech-4582cd02.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pain-cori-4582cd02.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pain-1b0536e6.webp', '[\"ache\", \"soreness\", \"discomfort\"]', '[\"pleasure\", \"relief\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"severe pain\", \"meaning\": \"cơn đau dữ dội\"}, {\"phrase\": \"relieve pain\", \"meaning\": \"giảm đau\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pane\", \"note_vi\": \"pane nghĩa là ô cửa kính, phát âm giống pain.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"painful\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"painfully\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"painless\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pain-cori-4582cd02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pain-aru0-4582cd02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pain-aru5-4582cd02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pain-aru6-4582cd02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pain-aru10-4582cd02.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pain-aru9-4582cd02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pain-aru3-4582cd02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pain-aru7-4582cd02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pain-aru8-4582c