('2dba41f7-89ba-565b-9e31-444f08339eef', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '525e0ba3-72cc-5cf4-b739-ed4dc3d95c97', '5cdde0d4-72b0-5e76-8bba-86300a4775cf', 'successful', 'UK: /səkˈsɛsfəl/ | US: /səkˈsɛsfəl/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'thành công', 'achieving the desired results or having gained prosperity and positive recognition', 'The company launched a successful marketing campaign.', 'Công ty đã phát động một chiến dịch tiếp thị thành công.', '{\"en\": \"The successful candidate will be responsible for overseeing international marketing campaigns.\", \"vi\": \"Ứng viên thành công (trúng tuyển) sẽ chịu trách nhiệm giám sát các chiến dịch tiếp thị quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-ljspeech-33375351.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-cori-33375351.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/successful-2af29fee.webp', '[\"prosperous\", \"triumphant\", \"effective\"]', '[\"unsuccessful\", \"failed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"successful candidate\", \"meaning\": \"ứng viên trúng tuyển\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly successful\", \"meaning\": \"rất thành công\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"successive\", \"note_vi\": \"successive nghĩa là liên tiếp (ví dụ: for 3 successive days), khác với successful là thành công\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"success\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"successfully\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"succeed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-cori-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-aru0-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-aru5-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-aru6-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-aru10-33375351.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-aru9-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-aru3-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-aru7-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-aru8-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-aru2-33375351.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-ljspeech-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-lt408-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-lt138-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-lt624-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-lt396-33375351.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-lt498-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-lt132-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-lt288-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-lt42-33375351.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/successful-lt90-33375351.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm giới từ \'in\' (be successful in doing something). Cụm \'successful candidate\' rất hay gặp trong đề thi TOEIC tuyển dụng.', 'human resources', 1, 18),
('e870165f-e186-590c-9970-8dd56cd5ea6f', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '525e0ba3-72cc-5cf4-b739-ed4dc3d95c97', '5cdde0d4-72b0-5e76-8bba-86300a4775cf', 'hail', '/heɪl/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Những viên băng nhỏ rơi từ bầu trời như mưa.', 'small balls of ice that fall from the sky during a cold storm.', 'The sudden hail storm damaged many cars parked outside.', 'Trận mưa đá bất ngờ đã làm hư hại nhiều chiếc ô tô đỗ bên ngoài.', '{\"en\": \"The sudden heavy hail damaged the roof of our company warehouse yesterday afternoon.\", \"vi\": \"Trận mưa đá bất ngờ đã làm hỏng mái nhà kho của công ty chúng tôi vào chiều qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-ljspeech-71cd3baa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-cori-71cd3baa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hail-385d5da2.webp', '[\"sleet\", \"ice pellets\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"heavy hail\", \"meaning\": \"mưa đá lớn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hail storm\", \"meaning\": \"trận mưa đá\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"heal\", \"note_vi\": \"heal là chữa lành, hail là mưa đá.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"hail\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-cori-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-aru0-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-aru5-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-aru6-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-aru10-71cd3baa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-aru9-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-aru3-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-aru7-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-aru8-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-aru2-71cd3baa.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-ljspeech-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-lt408-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-lt138-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-lt624-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-lt396-71cd3baa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-lt498-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-lt132-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-lt288-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-lt42-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-lt90-71cd3baa.mp3\"]}}', 'hail là mưa đá, đừng nhầm với \'hell\' (địa ngục) hay \'heal\' (chữa lành).', 'nature', 1, 19),
('2d524dd4-f262-53cc-b2a7-baffddca40e7', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '525e0ba3-72cc-5cf4-b739-ed4dc3d95c97', '5cdde0d4-72b0-5e76-8bba-86300a4775cf', 'travel agency', '/ˈtræv.əl ˈeɪ.dʒən.si/', 'A2', 'phrase', 'Công ty chuyên tổ chức và bán các chuyến đi du lịch.', 'a company that plans and arranges trips, flights, and hotels for people who want to go on holiday.', 'The company hired a travel agency to arrange transport for the conference attendees.', 'Công ty đã thuê một công ty du lịch để sắp xếp việc đi lại cho các đại biểu tham dự hội nghị.', '{\"en\": \"Our corporate travel agency managed to book the last-minute flights to Tokyo for the sales team.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty du lịch của doanh nghiệp chúng tôi đã đặt được vé máy bay giờ chót đi Tokyo cho đội ngũ bán hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-ljspeech-5cc328cb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-cori-5cc328cb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/travel-agency-e06a2c5e.webp', '[\"travel bureau\", \"tour operator\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"local travel agency\", \"meaning\": \"đại lý du lịch địa phương\"}, {\"phrase\": \"online travel agency\", \"meaning\": \"đại lý du lịch trực tuyến\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tourist information center\", \"note_vi\": \"nơi cung cấp thông tin miễn phí cho du khách, không bán tour\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-cori-5cc328cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-aru0-5cc328cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-aru5-5cc328cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-aru6-5cc328cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-aru10-5cc328cb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-aru9-5cc328cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-aru3-5cc328cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-aru7-5cc328cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-aru8-5cc328cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-aru2-5cc328cb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-ljspeech-5cc328cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-lt408-5cc328cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-lt138-5cc328cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-lt624-5cc328cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-lt396-5cc328cb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-lt498-5cc328cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-lt132-5cc328cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-lt288-5cc328cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-lt42-5cc328cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-lt90-5cc328cb.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn với \'tour operator\' là đơn vị trực tiếp tổ chức và điều hành tour.', 'travel', 1, 20),
('f21a7886-ccba-5957-bdca-2f5f7f5faff5', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '525e0ba3-72cc-5cf4-b739-ed4dc3d95c97', '5cdde0d4-72b0-5e76-8bba-86300a4775cf', 'coach', '/kəʊtʃ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Người hướng dẫn hoặc đào tạo một đội thể thao hoặc một cá nhân.', 'a person who trains a person or team in a sport or a skill.', 'The football coach called a quick timeout to revise the tactics.', 'Huấn luyện viên bóng đá đã gọi hội ý nhanh để thay đổi chiến thuật.', '{\"en\": \"The executive hired a professional coach to improve her public speaking and leadership skills.\", \"vi\": \"Vị điều hành đã thuê một huấn luyện viên chuyên nghiệp để cải thiện kỹ năng nói trước công chúng và lãnh đạo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-ljspeech-c63c8ec7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-cori-c63c8ec7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/coach-4354a99d.webp', '[\"trainer\", \"instructor\"]', '[\"trainee\", \"student\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"head coach\", \"meaning\": \"huấn luyện viên trưởng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"career coach\", \"meaning\": \"huấn luyện viên nghề nghiệp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"couch\", \"note_vi\": \"couch là ghế sofa, coach là huấn luyện viên hoặc xe khách\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"coaching\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-cori-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-aru0-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-aru5-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-aru6-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-aru10-c63c8ec7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-aru9-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-aru3-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-aru7-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-aru8-c63c8ec7.mp3\