('35b73f69-327f-501e-ad31-01912064c088', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '525e0ba3-72cc-5cf4-b739-ed4dc3d95c97', '5cdde0d4-72b0-5e76-8bba-86300a4775cf', 'square', '/skweə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Hình có bốn cạnh bằng nhau và bốn góc vuông.', 'a flat shape with four straight sides of equal length and four angles of ninety degrees.', 'The children drew a perfect square on the blackboard.', 'Bọn trẻ đã vẽ một hình vuông hoàn hảo trên bảng đen.', '{\"en\": \"The architect designed a public square in front of the new corporate headquarters.\", \"vi\": \"Kiến trúc sư đã thiết kế một quảng trường hình vuông phía trước trụ sở công ty mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-ljspeech-bfed89e8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-cori-bfed89e8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/square-933b0be4.webp', '[\"plaza\", \"piazza\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"town square\", \"meaning\": \"quảng trường thị trấn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"perfect square\", \"meaning\": \"hình vuông hoàn hảo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"rectangle\", \"note_vi\": \"square có 4 cạnh bằng nhau, rectangle có 2 cặp cạnh bằng nhau\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"square\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-cori-bfed89e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-aru0-bfed89e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-aru5-bfed89e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-aru6-bfed89e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-aru10-bfed89e8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-aru9-bfed89e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-aru3-bfed89e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-aru7-bfed89e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-aru8-bfed89e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-aru2-bfed89e8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-ljspeech-bfed89e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-lt408-bfed89e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-lt138-bfed89e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-lt624-bfed89e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-lt396-bfed89e8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-lt498-bfed89e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-lt132-bfed89e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-lt288-bfed89e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-lt42-bfed89e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-lt90-bfed89e8.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài nghĩa hình vuông, từ này còn có nghĩa là quảng trường.', 'housing', 1, 27),
('f7328f2e-7fe2-5805-bf4c-d03dfe5d71ae', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '525e0ba3-72cc-5cf4-b739-ed4dc3d95c97', '5cdde0d4-72b0-5e76-8bba-86300a4775cf', 'homesick', '/ˈhəʊmsɪk/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Cảm giác buồn bã, nhớ nhung khi ở xa nhà.', 'feeling sad because you are away from your home and family for a long time.', 'After a month studying abroad, she started to feel really homesick.', 'Sau một tháng du học, cô ấy bắt đầu cảm thấy rất nhớ nhà.', '{\"en\": \"The new intern felt homesick during his first month working at the overseas branch office.\", \"vi\": \"Thực tập sinh mới cảm thấy nhớ nhà trong tháng đầu tiên làm việc tại văn phòng chi nhánh nước ngoài.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/homesick-ljspeech-d478dc82.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/homesick-cori-d478dc82.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/homesick-392c6d3b.webp', '[\"lonely\", \"nostalgic\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"home\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/homesick-cori-d478dc82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/homesick-aru0-d478dc82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/homesick-aru5-d478dc82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/homesick-aru6-d478dc82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/homesick-aru10-d478dc82.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/homesick-aru9-d478dc82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/homesick-aru3-d478dc82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/homesick-aru7-d478dc82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/homesick-aru8-d478dc82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/homesick-aru2-d478dc82.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/homesick-ljspeech-d478dc82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/homesick-lt408-d478dc82.mp3\", 