('a64b88c1-f24e-5c0f-a1d3-f1170c8238a4', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '55668ffe-ff69-5ff2-86bc-541193d97a8c', '32d9b0c4-2b93-51b0-be30-1e2595b88afe', 'worried', '/ˈwʌrid/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy không yên tâm, bồn chồn về điều gì đó.', 'feeling unhappy and afraid because you are thinking about problems or bad things happening.', 'Investors were worried about the sudden drop in stock prices this morning.', 'Các nhà đầu tư đã lo lắng về sự sụt giảm đột ngột của giá cổ phiếu sáng nay.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was worried about the declining sales figures reported in the quarterly financial statement.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý lo lắng về số liệu doanh số sụt giảm được báo cáo trong báo cáo tài chính hàng quý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-ljspeech-7c3dc388.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-cori-7c3dc388.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/worried-0a27c451.webp', '[\"anxious\", \"concerned\"]', '[\"calm\", \"relaxed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"deeply worried\", \"meaning\": \"rất lo lắng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"worried about\", \"meaning\": \"lo lắng về\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"worry\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-cori-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-aru0-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-aru5-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-aru6-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-aru10-7c3dc388.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-aru9-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-aru3-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-aru7-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-aru8-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-aru2-7