('88fc9721-1a1f-5308-a416-5de02d385df7', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '55668ffe-ff69-5ff2-86bc-541193d97a8c', '32d9b0c4-2b93-51b0-be30-1e2595b88afe', 'marker', '/ˈmɑːkə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Bút có đầu dạ, dùng để viết hoặc vẽ trên các bề mặt.', 'a pen with a thick tip used for writing on boards or paper.', 'Please use a permanent marker to label the boxes clearly.', 'Xin hãy dùng bút lông không phai để ghi nhãn các hộp rõ ràng.', '{\"en\": \"The trainer used a red marker to highlight key points on the presentation board.\", \"vi\": \"Người đào tạo đã dùng bút lông đỏ để làm nổi bật các điểm chính trên bảng thuyết trình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marker-ljspeech-af764f98.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marker-cori-af764f98.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/marker-47be9cce.webp', '[\"felt-tip pen\", \"highlighter\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"permanent marker\", \"meaning\": \"bút lông dầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"whiteboard marker\", \"meaning\": \"bút lông viết bảng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marker-cori-af764f98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marker-aru0-af764f98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marker-aru5-af764f98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marker-aru6-af764f98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marker-aru10-af764f98.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marker-aru9-af764f98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marker-aru3-af764f98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marker-aru7-af764f98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marker-aru8-af764f98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marker-aru2-af764f98.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marker-ljspeech-af764f98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marker-lt408-af764f98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marker-lt138-af764f98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marker-lt624-af764f98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marker-lt396-af764f98.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marker-lt498-af764f98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marker-lt132-af764f98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marker-lt288-af764f98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marker-lt42-af764f98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marker-lt90-af764f98.mp3\"]}}', 'phân biệt marker (bút lông) và highlighter (bút dạ quang).', 'office', 1, 24),
('fdf8a614-b6d3-52d3-b933-a29bb6b9138d', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '55668ffe-ff69-5ff2-86bc-541193d97a8c', '32d9b0c4-2b93-51b0-be30-1e2595b88afe', 'play games', '/pleɪ ɡeɪmz/', 'A1', 'phrase', 'tham gia các trò chơi giải trí, thường là trên máy tính hoặc điện thoại.', 'to take part in activities for fun or competition.', 'My brother loves to play games on his new console every evening.', 'Anh trai tôi thích chơi game trên máy chơi game mới của anh ấy mỗi tối.', '{\"en\": \"Employees are not allowed to play games on office computers during working hours.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên không được phép chơi game trên máy tính văn phòng trong giờ làm việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/play-games-ljspeech-0cafbc7e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/play-games-cori-0cafbc7e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/play-games-3a1949e5.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"play online games\", \"meaning\": \"chơi game trực tuyến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"play board games\", \"meaning\": \"chơi cờ/trò chơi bàn cờ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/play-games-cori-0cafbc7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/play-games-aru0-0cafbc7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/play-games-aru5-0cafbc7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/play-games-aru6-0cafbc7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/play-games-aru10-0cafbc7e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/play-games-aru9-0cafbc7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/play-games-aru3-0cafbc7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/play-games-aru7-0cafbc7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/play-games-aru8-0cafbc7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/play-games-aru2-0cafbc7e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/play-games-ljspeech-0cafbc7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/play-games-lt408-0cafbc7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/play-games-lt138-0cafbc7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/play-games-lt624-0cafbc7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/play-games-lt396-0cafbc7e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/play-games-lt498-0cafbc7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/play-games-lt132-0cafbc7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/play-games-lt288-0cafbc7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/play-games-lt42-0cafbc7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/play-games-lt90-0cafbc7e.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm từ này cũng có nghĩa bóng là cư xử không trung thực hoặc lấp liếm.', 'office', 1, 25),
('53a5ece4-703d-528d-a208-59b055b7f3fa', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '55668ffe-ff69-5ff2-86bc-541193d97a8c', '32d9b0c4-2b93-51b0-be30-1e2595b88afe', 'sick', '/sɪk/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Không khỏe, bị bệnh.', 'suffering from a disease, ailment, or general physical indisposition affecting health.', 'She felt sick after eating too much candy.', 'Cô ấy cảm thấy không khỏe sau khi ăn quá nhiều kẹo.', '{\"en\": \"Three employees called in sick on the day of the annual performance review.\", \"vi\": \"Ba nhân viên đã gọi điện báo ốm vào ngày đánh giá hiệu suất hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sick-ljspeech-6de7382d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sick-cori-6de7382d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sick-c5aaf061.webp', '[\"ill\", \"unwell\"]', '[\"healthy\", \"well\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"call in sick\", \"meaning\": \"gọi điện báo nghỉ ốm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"feel sick\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy không khỏe\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sick leave\", \"meaning\": \"nghỉ phép ốm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"ill\", \"note_vi\": \"ill trang trọng hơn sick; sick đôi khi còn có nghĩa buồn nôn cụ thể\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"sickness\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"sicken\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sick-cori-6de7382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sick-aru0-6de7382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sick-aru5-6de7382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sick-aru6-6de7382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sick-aru10-6de7382d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sick-aru9-6de7382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sick-aru3-6de7382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sick-aru7-6de7382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sick-aru8-6de7382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pr