('8c05706c-f92e-55b0-859e-8104ed2c64fa', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '567904c1-c219-59dd-be24-c2fc6f985012', '008b5307-bd76-5e9a-bf8c-b6b470ca87a9', 'season', '/ˈsiːzn/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một trong bốn khoảng thời gian chính trong năm, có đặc điểm khí hậu riêng.', 'one of the four main periods of time into which a year is divided.', 'My favorite season is autumn because of the beautiful colors of the leaves.', 'Mùa yêu thích của tôi là mùa thu vì màu sắc tuyệt đẹp của lá cây.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel chain expects a high number of bookings during the upcoming holiday season.\", \"vi\": \"Chuỗi khách sạn kỳ vọng số lượng đặt phòng cao trong mùa nghỉ lễ sắp tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/season-ljspeech-76f5e403.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/season-cori-76f5e403.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/season-22c3ef36.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"peak season\", \"meaning\": \"mùa cao điểm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"holiday season\", \"meaning\": \"mùa nghỉ lễ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rainy season\", \"meaning\": \"mùa mưa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"session\", \"note_vi\": \"Phiên họp, buổi làm việc hoặc kỳ học.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"seasonal\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"seasonally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/season-cori-76f5e403.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/season-aru0-76f5e403.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/season-aru5-76f5e403.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/season-aru6-76f5e403.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/season-aru10-76f5e403.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/season-aru9-76f5e403.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/season-aru3-76f5e403.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/season-aru7-76f5e403.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/season-ar