('703e0929-19c0-531e-9465-5bb902c84ba2', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '56831789-43d9-5f90-beae-280928961cf2', '39b70097-0463-5a8e-b71d-3e637403e8e2', 'pink', '/pɪŋk/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Màu sắc pha trộn giữa đỏ và trắng.', 'a light red color that is made by mixing red and white.', 'Her favorite color is pink, so her room is decorated in that shade.', 'Màu yêu thích của cô ấy là màu hồng, vì vậy phòng cô ấy được trang trí bằng tông màu đó.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team chose a soft pink color for the new product packaging design.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã chọn màu hồng nhạt cho thiết kế bao bì sản phẩm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-ljspeech-b0f7f128.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-cori-b0f7f128.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pink-6f2cef6e.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"light pink\", \"meaning\": \"màu hồng nhạt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bright pink\", \"meaning\": \"màu hồng sáng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"pinkish\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-cori-b0f7f128.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-aru0-b0f7f128.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-aru5-b0f7f128.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-aru6-b0f7f128.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-aru10-b0f7f128.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-aru9-b0f7f128.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-aru3-b0f7f128.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-aru7-b0f7f128.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-aru8-b0f7f128.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-aru2-b0f7f128.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-ljspeech-b0f7f128.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pink-lt408-b0f7f128.mp3\", \