('c1cd3edc-74e1-5dc8-a786-b3ce78202be9', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '56831789-43d9-5f90-beae-280928961cf2', '39b70097-0463-5a8e-b71d-3e637403e8e2', 'elbow', '/ˈelbəʊ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Khớp nối giữa cánh tay trên và cẳng tay.', 'the part of your arm where it bends in the middle.', 'He accidentally hit his elbow on the table and cried out in pain.', 'Anh ấy vô tình đập khuỷu tay vào bàn và kêu lên vì đau.', '{\"en\": \"The ergonomic chair helps support your elbow and prevents pain during long hours of work.\", \"vi\": \"Chiếc ghế công thái học giúp hỗ trợ khuỷu tay của bạn và ngăn ngừa đau nhức khi làm việc nhiều giờ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elbow-ljspeech-3b102812.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elbow-cori-3b102812.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/elbow-dbfa7cff.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"rest your elbow\", \"meaning\": \"đặt khuỷu tay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"elbow joint\", \"meaning\": \"khớp khuỷu tay\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elbow-cori-3b102812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elbow-aru0-3b102812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elbow-aru5-3b102812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elbow-aru6-3b102812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elbow-aru10-3b102812.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elbow-aru9-3b102812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elbow-aru3-3b102812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elbow-aru7-3b102812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elbow-aru8-3b102812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elbow-aru2-3b102812.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elbow-ljspeech-3b102812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elbow-lt408-3b102812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elbow-lt138-3b102812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elbow-lt624-3b102812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elbow-lt396-3b102812.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elbow-lt498-3b102812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elbow-lt132-3b102812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elbow-lt288-3b102812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elbow-lt42-3b102812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elbow-lt90-3b102812.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này hay xuất hiện trong các bài đọc về sức khỏe văn phòng hoặc thiết bị công thái học.', 'health', 1, 4),
('8f2af71a-42b3-50d7-a58a-e40a594610e9', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '56831789-43d9-5f90-beae-280928961cf2', '39b70097-0463-5a8e-b71d-3e637403e8e2', 'congestion', '/kənˈdʒestʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'tình trạng bị tắc, ứ đọng, thường là giao thông hoặc mũi.', 'the state of being crowded and full of traffic or people.', 'The morning traffic congestion makes my commute much longer than usual.', 'Tình trạng tắc nghẽn giao thông buổi sáng khiến chuyến đi làm của tôi dài hơn nhiều so với bình thường.', '{\"en\": \"The city council plans to build new roads to reduce traffic congestion during rush hours.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng thành phố có kế hoạch xây dựng các con đường mới để giảm tắc nghẽn giao thông vào giờ cao điểm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congestion-ljspeech-7211a145.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congestion-cori-7211a145.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/congestion-58a10781.webp', '[\"jam\", \"blockage\", \"overcrowding\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"traffic congestion\", \"meaning\": \"tắc nghẽn giao thông\"}, {\"phrase\": \"relieve congestion\", \"meaning\": \"giảm thiểu tắc nghẽn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"congest\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"congested\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congestion-cori-7211a145.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congestion-aru0-7211a145.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congestion-aru5-7211a145.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congestion-aru6-7211a145.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congestion-aru10-7211a145.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congestion-aru9-7211a145.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congestion-aru3-7211a145.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congestion-aru7-7211a145.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congestion-aru8-7211a145.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congestion-aru2-7211a145.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congestion-ljspeech-7211a145.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congestion-lt408-7211a145.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congestion-lt138-7211a145.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congestion-lt624-7211a145.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congestion-lt396-7211a145.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congestion-lt498-7211a145.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congestion-lt132-7211a145.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congestion-lt288-7211a145.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congestion-lt42-7211a145.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/congestion-lt90-7211a145.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng nhiều nhất trong cụm \'traffic congestion\' (tắc nghẽn giao thông).', 'travel', 1, 5),
('f7350269-8025-5a46-9f03-b7bb0bb134b9', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '56831789-43d9-5f90-beae-280928961cf2', '39b70097-0463-5a8e-b71d-3e637403e8e2', 'hungry', 'UK: /ˈhʌŋɡri/ | US: /ˈhʌŋɡri/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'đói', 'Feeling a strong physical desire or need to eat some food.', 'Are you hungry for lunch yet?', 'Bạn đã đói bụng để ăn trưa chưa?', '{\"en\": \"The startup company is hungry for expansion into foreign retail markets.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty khởi nghiệp này đang rất khao khát mở rộng sang các thị trường bán lẻ nước ngoài.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-ljspeech-eff2146b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-cori-eff2146b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hungry-2ad9a180.webp', '[\"eager\", \"ambitious\", \"famished\"]', '[\"full\", \"satiated\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"hungry for success\", \"meaning\": \"khao khát thành công\"}, {\"phrase\": \"feel hungry\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy đói\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"hunger\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"hungrily\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-cori-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-aru0-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-aru5-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-aru6-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-aru10-eff2146b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-aru9-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-aru3-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-aru7-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-aru8-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-aru2-eff2146b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-ljspeech-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-lt408-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-lt138-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-lt624-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-lt396-eff2146b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-lt498-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-lt132-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-lt288-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-lt42-eff2146b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hungry-lt90-eff2146b.mp3\"]}}', 'Nghĩa đen là đói bụng, nhưng trong kinh doanh còn dùng nghĩa bóng là khao khát cơ hội/thành công (\'hungry for success\').', 'general business', 1, 6),
('1d83e364-de20-5289-93eb-cb4d6df4c009', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '56831789-43d9-5f90-beae-280928961cf2', '39b70097-0463-5a8e-b71d-3e637403e8e2', 'purse', '/pɜːs/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Túi nhỏ dùng để đựng tiền, thẻ và vật dụng cá nhân của phụ nữ.', 'a small bag used by women for carrying money, keys, and personal things.', 'She reached into her purse to find her keys.', 'Cô ấy thò tay vào ví để tìm chìa khóa.', '{\"en\": \"The customer realized she had left her leather purse at the checkout counter.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng nhận ra cô ấy đã để quên chiếc ví da của mình tại quầy thanh toán.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-ljspeech-a7e54671.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-cori-a7e54671.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/purse-47ad9d63.webp', '[\"handbag\", \"pocketbook\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"open a purse\", \"meaning\": \"mở ví\"}, {\"phrase\": \"leather purse\", \"meaning\": \"ví da\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"wallet\", \"note_vi\": \"wallet thường là ví gập nhỏ của nam, purse là ví của nữ\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-cori-a7e54671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-aru0-a7e54671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-aru5-a7e54671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-aru6-a7e54671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-aru10-a7e54671.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-aru9-a7e54671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-aru3-a7e54671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-aru7-a7e54671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-aru8-a7e54671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-aru2-a7e54671.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-ljspeech-a7e54671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object