('5b95182c-12f2-556e-9faa-e6ffd5b6a450', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '56831789-43d9-5f90-beae-280928961cf2', '39b70097-0463-5a8e-b71d-3e637403e8e2', 'diet', '/ˈdaɪət/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Chế độ ăn uống hàng ngày của một người hoặc nhóm người.', 'the food and drink that a person regularly consumes.', 'The nutritionist recommended adding more fresh vegetables to my daily diet.', 'Chuyên gia dinh dưỡng đã khuyên tôi nên thêm nhiều rau tươi vào chế độ ăn hằng ngày.', '{\"en\": \"The cafeteria now offers healthy meal options for employees on a strict diet.\", \"vi\": \"Căng tin hiện cung cấp các lựa chọn bữa ăn lành mạnh cho nhân viên đang ăn kiêng nghiêm ngặt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diet-ljspeech-0a96963b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diet-cori-0a96963b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/diet-620c7ff6.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"balanced diet\", \"meaning\": \"chế độ ăn cân bằng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"go on a diet\", \"meaning\": \"ăn kiêng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"dietary\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"dietitian\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diet-cori-0a96963b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diet-aru0-0a96963b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diet-aru5-0a96963b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diet-aru6-0a96963b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diet-aru10-0a96963b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diet-aru9-0a96963b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diet-aru3-0a96963b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diet-aru7-0a96963b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diet-aru8-0a96963b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diet-aru2-0a96963b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diet-ljspee