('1b7bf33f-b521-5c43-9fe4-203d7a766092', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '56831789-43d9-5f90-beae-280928961cf2', '39b70097-0463-5a8e-b71d-3e637403e8e2', 'hot', '/hɒt/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Có nhiệt độ cao; gây cảm giác nóng.', 'Producing or giving off a high degree of warmth or elevated physical thermal energy.', 'Working inside the factory without air conditioning became extremely uncomfortable during hot summer afternoons.', 'Làm việc bên trong nhà máy mà không có điều hòa đã trở nên cực kỳ khó chịu vào những buổi chiều hè nóng nực.', '{\"en\": \"The office kitchen provides a hot beverage machine for all employees during their morning break.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà bếp văn phòng cung cấp máy pha đồ uống nóng cho tất cả nhân viên trong giờ nghỉ sáng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-ljspeech-4bd8edda.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-cori-4bd8edda.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hot-0ded91e9.webp', '[\"warm\", \"burning\"]', '[\"cold\", \"cool\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"hot weather\", \"meaning\": \"thời tiết nóng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hot drink\", \"meaning\": \"đồ uống nóng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hat\", \"note_vi\": \"Hat là cái mũ, hot là nóng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"heat\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-cori-4bd8edda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-aru0-4bd8edda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-aru5-4bd8edda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-aru6-4bd8edda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-aru10-4bd8edda.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-aru9-4bd8edda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-aru3-4bd8edda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-aru7-4bd8edda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-aru8-4bd8edda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/publ