('8a832928-e3f5-58e3-85c6-9ca6bfd4e4a4', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '56831789-43d9-5f90-beae-280928961cf2', '39b70097-0463-5a8e-b71d-3e637403e8e2', 'foggy', '/ˈfɒɡi/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có nhiều sương mù, làm giảm tầm nhìn.', 'having a lot of thick cloud close to the ground that makes it hard to see.', 'The flight was delayed for hours because the runway conditions were extremely foggy.', 'Chuyến bay đã bị hoãn lại nhiều giờ vì điều kiện đường băng rất nhiều sương mù.', '{\"en\": \"The delivery truck was delayed because of the foggy weather conditions on the highway.\", \"vi\": \"Xe tải giao hàng đã bị chậm trễ do điều kiện thời tiết sương mù trên đường cao tốc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foggy-ljspeech-bda9d8b6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foggy-cori-bda9d8b6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/foggy-76dd3e30.webp', '[\"misty\", \"hazy\"]', '[\"clear\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"foggy weather\", \"meaning\": \"thời tiết sương mù\"}, {\"phrase\": \"foggy morning\", \"meaning\": \"buổi sáng sương mù\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"misty\", \"note_vi\": \"Sương mù nhẹ hơn, thường là sương buổi sáng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fog\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foggy-cori-bda9d8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foggy-aru0-bda9d8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foggy-aru5-bda9d8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foggy-aru6-bda9d8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foggy-aru10-bda9d8b6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foggy-aru9-bda9d8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foggy-aru3-bda9d8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foggy-aru7-bda9d8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foggy-aru8-bda9d8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foggy-aru2