('52049672-5188-5a98-ae90-5fc0244de470', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '5a8bee78-1abc-5ae1-a45b-a23cc57beee0', 'f335d80d-0aaa-5c27-af98-a42fdc3cdf76', 'furniture', '/ˈfɜːnɪtʃə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Đồ vật lớn như bàn, ghế, giường dùng trong nhà.', 'large objects such as chairs, tables, or beds that are used to make a room comfortable.', 'We bought some new furniture for our living room, including a sofa and a coffee table.', 'Chúng tôi đã mua một số đồ nội thất mới cho phòng khách, bao gồm một chiếc ghế sofa và một bàn cà phê.', '{\"en\": \"The company ordered new office furniture to improve the working environment for all staff members.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã đặt mua nội thất văn phòng mới để cải thiện môi trường làm việc cho tất cả nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furniture-ljspeech-7b6e7a25.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furniture-cori-7b6e7a25.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/furniture-01980253.webp', '[\"furnishings\", \"equipment\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"office furniture\", \"meaning\": \"nội thất văn phòng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"piece of furniture\", \"meaning\": \"một món đồ nội thất\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"furnish\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furniture-cori-7b6e7a25.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furniture-aru0-7b6e7a25.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furniture-aru5-7b6e7a25.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furniture-aru6-7b6e7a25.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furniture-aru10-7b6e7a25.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furniture-aru9-7b6e7a25.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furniture-aru3-7b6e7a25.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furniture-aru7-7b6e7a25.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/furniture-aru8-7b6e7a25.mp3\