('9168c1b9-786f-5824-951b-2af0f648ad26', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '5a8bee78-1abc-5ae1-a45b-a23cc57beee0', 'f335d80d-0aaa-5c27-af98-a42fdc3cdf76', 'thin', '/θɪn/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Có độ dày nhỏ; không dày.', 'Describing an object whose opposite boundaries or faces are positioned close together.', 'The ice on the pond was too thin to skate on safely.', 'Lớp băng trên ao quá mỏng để trượt băng an toàn.', '{\"en\": \"The company uses thin plastic sheets to package the electronic components safely.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty sử dụng các tấm nhựa mỏng để đóng gói các linh kiện điện tử một cách an toàn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thin-ljspeech-6ca0fa26.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thin-cori-6ca0fa26.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/thin-5f4a8eda.webp', '[\"slender\", \"slim\"]', '[\"thick\", \"fat\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"thin layer\", \"meaning\": \"lớp mỏng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"thin paper\", \"meaning\": \"giấy mỏng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"skinny\", \"note_vi\": \"gầy gò, thường mang nghĩa tiêu cực hơn thin\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"thinness\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"thinly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thin-cori-6ca0fa26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thin-aru0-6ca0fa26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thin-aru5-6ca0fa26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thin-aru6-6ca0fa26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thin-aru10-6ca0fa26.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thin-aru9-6ca0fa26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thin-aru3-6ca0fa26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thin-aru7-6ca0fa26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thin-aru8-6ca0fa26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thin-aru2-6ca0fa26.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storag