('6fafebb4-99a0-5615-aeb8-c8b023a44b2c', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '5a8bee78-1abc-5ae1-a45b-a23cc57beee0', 'f335d80d-0aaa-5c27-af98-a42fdc3cdf76', 'triangle', '/ˈtraɪæŋɡl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Hình có ba cạnh và ba góc.', 'A geometric figure formed by three intersecting lines creating three inner angles.', 'Engineers used a steel triangle to reinforce the bridge frame.', 'Các kỹ sư đã sử dụng một khung thép hình tam giác để gia cố khung cầu.', '{\"en\": \"The new company logo is designed in the shape of a simple blue triangle.\", \"vi\": \"Logo công ty mới được thiết kế theo hình dạng của một hình tam giác màu xanh đơn giản.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/triangle-ljspeech-b7d045ce.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/triangle-cori-b7d045ce.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/triangle-2e1c387d.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"in a triangle\", \"meaning\": \"theo hình tam giác\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"triangular\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/triangle-cori-b7d045ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/triangle-aru0-b7d045ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/triangle-aru5-b7d045ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/triangle-aru6-b7d045ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/triangle-aru10-b7d045ce.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/triangle-aru9-b7d045ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/triangle-aru3-b7d045ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/triangle-aru7-b7d045ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/triangle-aru8-b7d045ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/triangle-aru2-b7d045ce.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/triangle-ljspeech-b7d045ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/triangle-lt408-b7d045ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/triangle-lt138-b7d045ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/triangle-lt624-b7d045ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/triangle-lt396-b7d045ce.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/triangle-lt498-b7d045ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/triangle-lt132-b7d045ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/triangle-lt288-b7d045ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/triangle-lt42-b7d045ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/triangle-lt90-b7d045ce.mp3\"]}}', 'từ vựng hình học cơ bản, ít dùng trong ngữ cảnh thương mại trừ thiết kế.', 'academic', 1, 26),
('60792607-76fa-56cd-8239-19eb0ce24a91', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '5a8bee78-1abc-5ae1-a45b-a23cc57beee0', 'f335d80d-0aaa-5c27-af98-a42fdc3cdf76', 'mouth', '/maʊθ/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Bộ phận trên mặt dùng để ăn, nói và hít thở.', 'the part of the face that you use for eating, speaking, and breathing.', 'Always cover your mouth when you sneeze to prevent spreading germs.', 'Luôn che miệng khi hắt hơi để tránh lây lan vi trùng.', '{\"en\": \"The dentist asked the patient to open their mouth wide during the routine dental examination.\", \"vi\": \"Nha sĩ yêu cầu bệnh nhân há to miệng trong suốt quá trình khám răng định kỳ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouth-ljspeech-87d17825.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouth-cori-87d17825.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mouth-6acb2fc9.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"open your mouth\", \"meaning\": \"há miệng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mouth wash\", \"meaning\": \"nước súc miệng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"mouth\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"mouthful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouth-cori-87d17825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouth-aru0-87d17825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouth-aru5-87d17825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouth-aru6-87d17825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouth-aru10-87d17825.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouth-aru9-87d17825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouth-aru3-87d17825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouth-aru7-87d17825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouth-aru8-87d17825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouth-aru2-87d17825.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouth-ljspeech-87d17825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouth-lt408-87d17825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouth-lt138-87d17825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouth-lt624-87d17825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouth-lt396-87d17825.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouth-lt498-87d17825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouth-lt132-87d17825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouth-lt288-87d17825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouth-lt42-87d17825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mouth-lt90-87d17825.mp3\"]}}', 'Thành ngữ \'word of mouth\' rất hay gặp trong TOEIC phần Marketing.', 'health', 1, 27),
('795130da-dbca-5fe1-87b9-274603b14a47', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '5a8bee78-1abc-5ae1-a45b-a23cc57beee0', 'f335d80d-0aaa-5c27-af98-a42fdc3cdf76', 'nature', '/ˈneɪtʃə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Thế giới tự nhiên, bao gồm cây cối, động vật, cảnh quan.', 'the physical world including plants, animals, and landscapes, not made by humans.', 'I love spending time in nature, especially hiking in the mountains.', 'Tôi thích dành thời gian hòa mình vào thiên nhiên, đặc biệt là đi bộ đường dài trên núi.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel is located in the middle of nature, offering guests a peaceful environment.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn nằm giữa thiên nhiên, mang đến cho khách hàng một môi trường yên bình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nature-ljspeech-a5197f10.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nature-cori-a5197f10.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/nature-405d7882.webp', '[\"environment\", \"outdoors\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"in nature\", \"meaning\": \"trong tự nhiên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mother nature\", \"meaning\": \"mẹ thiên nhiên\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"natural\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nature-cori-a5197f10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nature-aru0-a5197f10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nature-aru5-a5197f10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nature-aru6-a5197f10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nature-aru10-a5197f10.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nature-aru9-a5197f10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nature-aru3-a5197f10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nature-aru7-a5197f10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nature-aru8-a5197f10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nature-aru2-a5197f10.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/