('d3649c7e-aaf1-5092-8d09-e9bc3679c4b4', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '67a55005-9225-58bd-8a46-d8386cd4922b', '42fb3a28-0014-5808-955d-165372ca63b2', 'flower', 'UK: /ˈflaʊə/ | US: /ˈflaʊər/', 'A1', 'noun', 'hoa', 'The bright part of a plant that produces seeds or fruit.', 'The garden is full of colorful flowers.', 'Khu vườn đầy hoa sặc sỡ.', '{\"en\": \"The groundskeeping team planted fresh flowers along the walkway to enhance the office exterior.\", \"vi\": \"Đội bảo trì khuôn viên đã trồng hoa tươi dọc theo lối đi để làm đẹp thêm phía ngoài văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flower-ljspeech-5a46b825.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flower-cori-5a46b825.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/flower-7d8cbd83.webp', '[\"bloom\", \"blossom\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fresh flowers\", \"meaning\": \"hoa tươi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"flower arrangement\", \"meaning\": \"lẵng hoa / việc cắm hoa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"flour\", \"note_vi\": \"bột mì (phát âm giống hệt flower)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"florist\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"flowerbed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flower-cori-5a46b825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flower-aru0-5a46b825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flower-aru5-5a46b825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flower-aru6-5a46b825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flower-aru10-5a46b825.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flower-aru9-5a46b825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flower-aru3-5a46b825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flower-aru7-5a46b825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flower-aru8-5a46b825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flower-aru2-5a46b825.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flower-ljspeech-5a46b825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flower-lt408-5a46b825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flower-lt138-5a46b825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flower-lt624-5a46b825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flower-lt396-5a46b825.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flower-lt498-5a46b825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flower-lt132-5a46b825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flower-lt288-5a46b825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flower-lt42-5a46b825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flower-lt90-5a46b825.mp3\"]}}', '\'Flower\' phát âm đồng âm với \'flour\' (bột mì). Trong TOEIC Part 1, hình ảnh trồng hoa/chăm sóc hoa xuất hiện khá phổ biến.', 'general', 1, 0),
('47ba5152-9ba7-5323-af86-5ccbe4e88598', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '67a55005-9225-58bd-8a46-d8386cd4922b', '42fb3a28-0014-5808-955d-165372ca63b2', 'coach', '/kəʊtʃ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Xe buýt lớn đường dài, xe khách.', 'a large, comfortable vehicle used for transporting groups of people over long distances by road.', 'We decided to take the coach to the coast because it was cheaper than the train.', 'Chúng tôi quyết định đi xe khách ra bờ biển vì nó rẻ hơn tàu hỏa.', '{\"en\": \"The tour operator arranged a private coach to transport the delegates to the conference center.\", \"vi\": \"Đơn vị điều hành tour đã sắp xếp một chiếc xe khách riêng để đưa các đại biểu đến trung tâm hội nghị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-ljspeech-c63c8ec7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-cori-c63c8ec7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/coach-4354a99d.webp', '[\"bus\", \"motorcoach\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"take a coach\", \"meaning\": \"đi xe khách\"}, {\"phrase\": \"coach station\", \"meaning\": \"bến xe khách\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"couch\", \"note_vi\": \"couch là ghế sofa, coach là xe khách.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-cori-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-aru0-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-aru5-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-aru6-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-aru10-c63c8ec7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-aru9-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-aru3-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-aru7-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-aru8-c63c8ec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coach-aru2-c63c8ec7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/sto