('87d9696f-fc61-5b0b-b091-c31c0b8e4b8f', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '67a55005-9225-58bd-8a46-d8386cd4922b', '42fb3a28-0014-5808-955d-165372ca63b2', 'fall asleep', '/fɔːl əˈsliːp/', 'B1', 'phrase', 'Bắt đầu ngủ, chìm vào giấc ngủ.', 'to start resting in a state where your eyes are closed and your body is quiet.', 'He was so tired that he managed to fall asleep on the bus.', 'Anh ấy mệt đến nỗi đã ngủ gật trên xe buýt.', '{\"en\": \"The exhausted manager began to fall asleep during the long afternoon budget planning meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý kiệt sức bắt đầu chìm vào giấc ngủ trong suốt cuộc họp lập kế hoạch ngân sách dài vào buổi chiều.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fall-asleep-ljspeech-a96986bd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fall-asleep-cori-a96986bd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fall-asleep-18adabd6.webp', '[\"doze off\", \"nod off\"]', '[\"wake up\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fall fast asleep\", \"meaning\": \"ngủ thiếp đi rất nhanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"nearly fall asleep\", \"meaning\": \"suýt ngủ gật\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fall-asleep-cori-a96986bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fall-asleep-aru0-a96986bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fall-asleep-aru5-a96986bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fall-asleep-aru6-a96986bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fall-asleep-aru10-a96986bd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fall-asleep-aru9-a96986bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fall-asleep-aru3-a96986bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fall-asleep-aru7-a96986bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fall-asleep-aru8-a96986bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fall-asleep-aru2-a96986bd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fall-asleep-ljspeech-a96986bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fall-asleep-lt408-a96986bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fall-asleep-lt138-a96986bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fall-asleep-lt624-a96986bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fall-asleep-lt396-a96986bd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fall-asleep-lt498-a96986bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fall-asleep-lt132-a96986bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fall-asleep-lt288-a96986bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fall-asleep-lt42-a96986bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fall-asleep-lt90-a96986bd.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm từ này diễn tả quá trình bắt đầu đi vào giấc ngủ, không phải trạng thái đang ngủ.', 'office', 1, 2),
('5fa0f64f-c809-51f7-8bef-7bd741c89638', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '67a55005-9225-58bd-8a46-d8386cd4922b', '42fb3a28-0014-5808-955d-165372ca63b2', 'whiteout', '/ˈwaɪtˌaʊt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Chất lỏng màu trắng dùng để che đi lỗi sai khi viết.', 'a liquid or tape used for covering up mistakes made in written or typed text.', 'I accidentally made a mistake on the form and had to use whiteout to correct it.', 'Tôi vô tình mắc lỗi trên mẫu đơn và phải dùng bút xóa để sửa.', '{\"en\": \"You should retype the contract instead of using whiteout to cover your typos on it.\", \"vi\": \"Bạn nên đánh máy lại hợp đồng thay vì dùng bút xóa để che các lỗi chính tả trên đó.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteout-ljspeech-a576b896.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteout-cori-a576b896.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/whiteout-0aa411bd.webp', '[\"correction fluid\", \"correction tape\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"apply whiteout\", \"meaning\": \"dùng bút xóa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bottle of whiteout\", \"meaning\": \"lọ bút xóa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"eraser\", \"note_vi\": \"Eraser là tẩy/gôm dùng cho bút chì, whiteout là bút xóa dùng cho mực.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteout-cori-a576b896.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteout-aru0-a576b896.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteout-aru5-a576b896.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteout-aru6-a576b896.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteout-aru10-a576b896.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteout-aru9-a576b896.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteout-aru3-a576b896.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteout-aru7-a576b896.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteout-aru8-a576b896.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteout-aru2-a576b896.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteout-ljspeech-a576b896.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteout-lt408-a576b896.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteout-lt138-a576b896.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteout-lt624-a576b896.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteout-lt396-a576b896.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteout-lt498-a576b896.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteout-lt132-a576b896.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteout-lt288-a576b896.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteout-lt42-a576b896.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteout-lt90-a576b896.mp3\"]}}', 'Whiteout là từ tiếng Anh Mỹ phổ biến cho bút xóa hoặc băng xóa văn phòng.', 'office', 1, 3),
('78db2338-346f-5d8c-ab30-fc33e0085357', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '67a55005-9225-58bd-8a46-d8386cd4922b', '42fb3a28-0014-5808-955d-165372ca63b2', 'builder', '/ˈbɪldə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Người chuyên xây dựng nhà cửa hoặc các công trình khác.', 'a person whose job is to construct or repair houses and other physical structures.', 'We hired a local builder to construct our new garage.', 'Chúng tôi đã thuê một thợ xây địa phương để xây nhà để xe mới của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The project manager hired an experienced builder to renovate the downtown office space.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý dự án đã thuê một thợ xây có kinh nghiệm để cải tạo văn phòng ở trung tâm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/builder-ljspeech-f52318a0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/builder-cori-f52318a0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/builder-40fa56f5.webp', '[\"constructor\", \"contractor\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"master builder\", \"meaning\": \"thợ xây tay nghề cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"local builder\", \"meaning\": \"thợ xây địa phương\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"architect\", \"note_vi\": \"Kiến trúc sư thiết kế, còn builder là thợ trực tiếp thi công\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"build\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"building\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/builder-cori-f52318a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/builder-aru0-f52318a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/builder-aru5-f52318a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/builder-aru6-f52318a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/builder-aru10-f52318a0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/builder-aru9-f52318a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/builder-aru3-f52318a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/builder-aru7-f52318a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/builder-aru8-f52318a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/builder-aru2-f52318a0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/builder-ljspeech-f52318a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/builder-lt408-f52318a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/builder-lt138-f52318a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/builder-lt624-f52318a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/builder-lt396-f52318a0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/builder-lt498-f52318a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/builder-lt132-f52318a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/builder-lt288-f52318a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/builder-lt42-f52318a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/builder-lt90-f52318a0.mp3\"]}}', '', 'housing', 1, 4),
('5a3595d5-6880-556a-a7b7-343b41622c75', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '67a55005-9225-58bd-8a46-d8386cd4922b', '42fb3a28-0014-5808-955d-165372ca63b2', 'offer', 'UK: /ˈɒfər/ | US: /ˈɔfər/', 'A2', 'verb', 'cung cấp, đề xuất', 'To present something for someone to accept, reject, or consider using.', 'The hotel offers excellent services to its guests.', 'Khách sạn cung cấp các dịch vụ xuất sắc cho khách hàng.', '{\"en\": \"The company decided to offer a 15% discount to clients who renew their subscriptions early.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty quyết định giảm giá 15% cho những khách hàng gia hạn đăng ký sớm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offer-ljspeech-98362e3f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offer-cori-98362e3f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/offer-024c11f5.webp', '[\"provide\", \"propose\", \"present\"]', '[\"withhold\", \"refuse\", \"reject\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"offer a discount\", \"meaning\": \"đưa ra mức giảm giá\"}, {\"phrase\": \"job offer\", \"meaning\": \"lời mời nhận việc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"provide\", \"note_vi\": \"Provide thường dùng với \'provide somebody with something\', còn offer đi với \'offer somebody something\'.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"offer\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"offering\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offer-cori-98362e3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offer-aru0-98362e3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offer-aru5-98362e3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offer-aru6-98362e3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offer-aru10-98362e3f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offer-aru9-98362e3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offer-aru3-98362e3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offer-aru7-98362e3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offer-aru8-98362e3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offer-aru2-98362e3f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offer-ljspeech-98362e3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offer-lt408-98362e3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offer-lt138-98362e3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offer-lt624-98362e3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offer-lt396-98362e3f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offer-lt498-98362e3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offer-lt132-98362e3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offer-lt288-98362e3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offer-lt42-98362e3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offer-lt90-98362e3f.mp3\"]}}', 'Động từ \'offer\' đi với cấu trúc \'offer to do something\' hoặc \'offer somebody something\'. Khi làm danh từ có thể mang nghĩa là \'lời mời làm việc\' (job offer).', 'business', 1, 5),
('e905aade-3940-528d-8599-0570ca5283c3', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '67a55005-9225-58bd-8a46-d8386cd4922b', '42fb3a28-0014-5808-955d-165372ca63b2', 'strawberry', '/ˈstrɔːbəri/', 'A2', 'noun', 'loại quả nhỏ, màu đỏ, ngọt, thường dùng làm tráng miệng.', 'A juicy heart-shaped red fruit cultivated worldwide, featuring tiny seeds embedded across its flesh.', 'My favorite fruit is the strawberry, especially when it\'s fresh.', 'Loại quả yêu thích của tôi là dâu tây, đặc biệt là khi nó tươi.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel breakfast buffet now includes fresh strawberry jam for all our valued guests.\", \"vi\": \"Bữa sáng tự chọn tại khách sạn hiện bao gồm mứt dâu tươi cho tất cả các vị khách quý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strawberry-ljspeech-c0b51c46.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strawberry-cori-c0b51c46.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/strawberry-9ef7605b.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"strawberry jam\", \"meaning\": \"mứt dâu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fresh strawberry\", \"meaning\": \"dâu tươi\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strawberry-cori-c0b51c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strawberry-aru0-c0b51c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strawberry-aru5-c0b51c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strawberry-aru6-c0b51c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strawberry-aru10-c0b51c46.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strawberry-aru9-c0b51c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strawberry-aru3-c0b51c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strawberry-aru7-c0b51c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strawberry-aru8-c0b51c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strawberry-aru2-c0b51c46.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/st