('b78f987e-30b3-56c1-8abf-38edb48bd54a', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '67a55005-9225-58bd-8a46-d8386cd4922b', '42fb3a28-0014-5808-955d-165372ca63b2', 'ice', '/aɪs/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Nước ở thể rắn, đông cứng lại.', 'solid water formed when liquid becomes frozen at low temperature.', 'The roads were covered in black ice, making driving very dangerous.', 'Đường phố bị phủ băng đen, khiến việc lái xe trở nên rất nguy hiểm.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel provided ice for our drinks during the conference.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn đã cung cấp đá băng cho đồ uống của chúng tôi trong hội nghị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ice-ljspeech-d53b257b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ice-cori-d53b257b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ice-9588cb66.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"ice cube\", \"meaning\": \"viên đá lạnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ice skating\", \"meaning\": \"trượt băng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"eyes\", \"note_vi\": \"eyes là mắt, phát âm gần ice.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"icy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ice-cori-d53b257b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ice-aru0-d53b257b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ice-aru5-d53b257b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ice-aru6-d53b257b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ice-aru10-d53b257b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ice-aru9-d53b257b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ice-aru3-d53b257b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ice-aru7-d53b257b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ice-aru8-d53b257b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ice-aru2-d53b257b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ice-ljspeech-d53b257b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ice-lt408-d53b257b.mp3