('da86cdf4-b168-5943-ae0a-56172d63631e', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '67a55005-9225-58bd-8a46-d8386cd4922b', '42fb3a28-0014-5808-955d-165372ca63b2', 'yellow', '/ˈjeləʊ/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Màu sắc của nắng, chanh hoặc hoa hướng dương.', 'the color of things like lemons, bananas, or the sun on a clear day.', 'The bright yellow flowers brought a lot of cheer to the garden.', 'Những bông hoa màu vàng tươi đã mang lại rất nhiều niềm vui cho khu vườn.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance crew painted the safety lines in bright yellow to ensure they are visible.\", \"vi\": \"Đội bảo trì đã sơn các vạch an toàn bằng màu vàng tươi để đảm bảo chúng dễ nhìn thấy.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yellow-ljspeech-96de5543.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yellow-cori-96de5543.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/yellow-55b964e8.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"bright yellow\", \"meaning\": \"màu vàng tươi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pale yellow\", \"meaning\": \"màu vàng nhạt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"yellowish\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yellow-cori-96de5543.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yellow-aru0-96de5543.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yellow-aru5-96de5543.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yellow-aru6-96de5543.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yellow-aru10-96de5543.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yellow-aru9-96de5543.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yellow-aru3-96de5543.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yellow-aru7-96de5543.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yellow-aru8-96de5543.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yellow-aru2-96de5543.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yellow-ljspeech-96de5543.mp3\", \"/stora