('733f942c-6ae0-5e43-9b4b-4fe47c5771d9', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '67a55005-9225-58bd-8a46-d8386cd4922b', '42fb3a28-0014-5808-955d-165372ca63b2', 'tired', '/ˈtaɪəd/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy cần được nghỉ ngơi sau khi làm việc hoặc hoạt động.', 'In a state of physical or mental exhaustion requiring rest or relaxation.', 'Working extra overtime hours every night left the entire accounting team feeling tired.', 'Làm việc thêm giờ mỗi đêm đã khiến toàn bộ đội ngũ kế toán cảm thấy mệt mỏi.', '{\"en\": \"The long flight left the business travelers feeling very tired before the important morning meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Chuyến bay dài khiến các doanh nhân cảm thấy rất mệt mỏi trước cuộc họp quan trọng vào buổi sáng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tired-ljspeech-511e9911.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tired-cori-511e9911.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tired-783f73ee.webp', '[\"exhausted\", \"weary\"]', '[\"energetic\", \"refreshed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel tired\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy mệt mỏi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tired from work\", \"meaning\": \"mệt mỏi vì công việc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tyre\", \"note_vi\": \"Tyre là lốp xe, tired là mệt mỏi.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"tire\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tired-cori-511e9911.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tired-aru0-511e9911.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tired-aru5-511e9911.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tired-aru6-511e9911.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tired-aru10-511e9911.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tired-aru9-511e9911.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tired-aru3-511e9911.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tired-aru7-511e9911.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tired-aru8-511e9911