('eb22fb2c-409e-52a1-8e38-eda7165e89ad', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '67a55005-9225-58bd-8a46-d8386cd4922b', '42fb3a28-0014-5808-955d-165372ca63b2', 'fever', '/ˈfiːvə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng nhiệt độ cơ thể cao hơn bình thường do bệnh.', 'a medical condition in which the body temperature is higher than normal.', 'He stayed home from work today because he developed a sudden fever.', 'Hôm nay anh ấy ở nhà không đi làm vì đột ngột bị sốt.', '{\"en\": \"The employee called in sick because she had a high fever and a headache.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên đã gọi điện xin nghỉ ốm vì bị sốt cao và đau đầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-ljspeech-e2f347fb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-cori-e2f347fb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fever-f24117e9.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"high fever\", \"meaning\": \"sốt cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"run a fever\", \"meaning\": \"bị sốt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"favor\", \"note_vi\": \"Sự giúp đỡ hoặc ủng hộ, phát âm hơi giống.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"feverish\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-cori-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru0-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru5-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru6-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru10-e2f347fb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru9-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru3-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru7-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru8-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru2-e2f347fb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-ljspeech-e2f347fb.mp3\", \