('a51d23cb-7ff3-58ac-8ee8-1b9debb95900', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '6ae6adf2-843d-51bb-848d-a18850eb0e9c', '173a19c1-47ae-5ddb-b0f8-d617f9edd6bb', 'increase', 'UK: /ɪnˈkriːs/ | US: /ɪnˈkriːs/', 'B1', 'verb', 'tăng lên', 'to become greater in size, amount, degree, or total quantity over time.', 'The company expects sales to increase next quarter.', 'Công ty mong đợi doanh số sẽ tăng vào quý tới.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team aims to increase sales revenue by fifteen percent next quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị mục tiêu tăng doanh thu bán hàng thêm 15% vào quý tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-ljspeech-f9c9758a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-cori-f9c9758a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/increase-d321e0a5.webp', '[\"raise\", \"expand\", \"boost\", \"grow\"]', '[\"decrease\", \"reduce\", \"decline\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"increase rapidly\", \"meaning\": \"tăng nhanh chóng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"increase productivity\", \"meaning\": \"tăng năng suất\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"raise\", \"note_vi\": \"raise là ngoại động từ bắt buộc có tân ngữ (raise prices), còn increase vừa là nội vừa là ngoại động từ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"increase\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"increasing\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"increasingly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-cori-f9c9758a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-aru0-f9c9758a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-aru5-f9c9758a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-aru6-f9c9758a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-aru10-f9c9758a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-aru9-f9c9758a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-aru3-f9c9758a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-aru7-f9c9758a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-aru8-f9c9758a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-aru2-f9c9758a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-ljspeech-f9c9758a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-lt408-f9c9758a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-lt138-f9c9758a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-lt624-f9c9758a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-lt396-f9c9758a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-lt498-f9c9758a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-lt132-f9c9758a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-lt288-f9c9758a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-lt42-f9c9758a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-lt90-f9c9758a.mp3\"]}}', 'Khi làm động từ, đi với \'by\' để chỉ lượng tăng (increase by 10%) và đi với \'to\' để chỉ mức đạt được (increase to $500).', 'finance', 1, 4),
('decd3b95-fbc0-5754-89cb-4091ca131430', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '6ae6adf2-843d-51bb-848d-a18850eb0e9c', '173a19c1-47ae-5ddb-b0f8-d617f9edd6bb', 'body', '/ˈbɒdi/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Toàn bộ cấu trúc vật lý của người hoặc động vật.', 'the physical structure of a person or an animal including bones and skin.', 'Drinking enough water throughout the workday keeps your body hydrated and energized.', 'Uống đủ nước trong suốt ngày làm việc giúp cơ thể bạn luôn đủ nước và giàu năng lượng.', '{\"en\": \"Ergonomic chairs help support your body while you work at the office all day.\", \"vi\": \"Ghế công thái học giúp hỗ trợ cơ thể bạn trong khi làm việc tại văn phòng cả ngày.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/body-ljspeech-02083f45.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/body-cori-02083f45.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/body-30c6e170.webp', '[\"physique\", \"figure\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"human body\", \"meaning\": \"cơ thể con người\"}, {\"phrase\": \"body language\", \"meaning\": \"ngôn ngữ cơ thể\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"bodily\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/body-cori-02083f45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/body-aru0-02083f45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/body-aru5-02083f45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/body-aru6-02083f45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/body-aru10-02083f45.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/body-aru9-02083f45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/body-aru3-02083f45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/body-aru7-02083f45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/body-aru8-02083f45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/body-aru2-02083f45.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/body-ljspeech-0208