('927c44c5-5bdf-57bb-aa63-7ac8e2cd828f', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '6ae6adf2-843d-51bb-848d-a18850eb0e9c', '173a19c1-47ae-5ddb-b0f8-d617f9edd6bb', 'forehead', '/ˈfɔːhed/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Phần mặt nằm giữa lông mày và chân tóc.', 'The front portion of the head located directly above the brow area.', 'The mother gently placed her hand on the child\'s hot forehead to check his temperature.', 'Người mẹ nhẹ nhàng đặt tay lên chiếc trán nóng của đứa trẻ để kiểm tra nhiệt độ.', '{\"en\": \"The safety helmet must cover your forehead completely while working at the construction site.\", \"vi\": \"Mũ bảo hộ lao động phải che hoàn toàn trán của bạn khi làm việc tại công trường.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forehead-ljspeech-8c119eb9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forehead-cori-8c119eb9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/forehead-84e99124.webp', '[\"brow\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"broad forehead\", \"meaning\": \"trán rộng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wipe one\'s forehead\", \"meaning\": \"lau trán\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forehead-cori-8c119eb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forehead-aru0-8c119eb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forehead-aru5-8c119eb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forehead-aru6-8c119eb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forehead-aru10-8c119eb9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forehead-aru9-8c119eb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forehead-aru3-8c119eb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forehead-aru7-8c119eb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forehead-aru8-8c119eb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forehead-aru2-8c119eb9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forehead-ljspeech-8c119eb9.m