('33222b51-bb5d-51d3-aa94-7ec6ad06971e', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '6ae6adf2-843d-51bb-848d-a18850eb0e9c', '173a19c1-47ae-5ddb-b0f8-d617f9edd6bb', 'cool', '/kuːl/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Có nhiệt độ thấp dễ chịu, không nóng.', 'slightly cold in a pleasant way, not feeling too hot or too warm.', 'The evening breeze felt wonderfully cool after a hot day.', 'Làn gió buổi tối thật mát lành sau một ngày nóng bức.', '{\"en\": \"The server room must be kept at a cool temperature to prevent computers from overheating.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng máy chủ phải được giữ ở nhiệt độ mát mẻ để tránh máy tính bị quá nhiệt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-ljspeech-85d8d76b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-cori-85d8d76b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cool-a6c7e015.webp', '[\"chilly\", \"refreshing\"]', '[\"warm\", \"hot\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"cool breeze\", \"meaning\": \"cơn gió mát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"keep cool\", \"meaning\": \"giữ mát hoặc giữ bình tĩnh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cold\", \"note_vi\": \"\'cold\' là lạnh (thường gây khó chịu), \'cool\' là mát mẻ (thường dễ chịu).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"coolness\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"coolly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-cori-85d8d76b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-aru0-85d8d76b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-aru5-85d8d76b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-aru6-85d8d76b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-aru10-85d8d76b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-aru9-85d8d76b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-aru3-85d8d76b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-aru7-85d8d76b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cool-aru8-85d8d76b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v