('4f62fe67-49e7-594b-a347-fce4c27024f9', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '6ae6adf2-843d-51bb-848d-a18850eb0e9c', '173a19c1-47ae-5ddb-b0f8-d617f9edd6bb', 'toe', '/təʊ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một trong năm phần cuối của bàn chân.', 'one of the five separate parts at the end of the human foot.', 'The dancer gracefully balanced her entire weight on the tip of her big toe.', 'Vũ công nhẹ nhàng giữ thăng bằng toàn bộ trọng lượng cơ thể trên đầu ngón chân cái.', '{\"en\": \"The safety shoes are designed with a steel cap to protect the wearer\'s toe area.\", \"vi\": \"Giày bảo hộ được thiết kế với mũi thép để bảo vệ vùng ngón chân của người mang.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toe-ljspeech-d756976b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toe-cori-d756976b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/toe-83045327.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"big toe\", \"meaning\": \"ngón cái\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stub one\'s toe\", \"meaning\": \"vấp ngón chân\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toe-cori-d756976b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toe-aru0-d756976b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toe-aru5-d756976b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toe-aru6-d756976b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toe-aru10-d756976b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toe-aru9-d756976b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toe-aru3-d756976b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toe-aru7-d756976b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toe-aru8-d756976b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toe-aru2-d756976b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toe-ljspeech-d756976b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toe-lt408-d756976b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toe-l