('0141c8d0-ddb8-5da4-96e6-63e4b9b1b05a', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '6ae6adf2-843d-51bb-848d-a18850eb0e9c', '173a19c1-47ae-5ddb-b0f8-d617f9edd6bb', 'nutrition', '/njuˈtrɪʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Quá trình cơ thể hấp thụ và sử dụng thức ăn để phát triển và duy trì sự sống.', 'the process of taking in food and using it for health.', 'The company hired a specialist to advise employees on proper workplace nutrition.', 'Công ty đã thuê một chuyên gia để tư vấn cho nhân viên về dinh dưỡng hợp lý tại nơi làm việc.', '{\"en\": \"The company offers free nutrition workshops to improve employee well-being.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty cung cấp các hội thảo dinh dưỡng miễn phí để cải thiện sức khỏe nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nutrition-ljspeech-5adf741a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nutrition-cori-5adf741a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/nutrition-aa6b332b.webp', '[\"nourishment\", \"sustenance\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"good nutrition\", \"meaning\": \"dinh dưỡng tốt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"nutrition facts\", \"meaning\": \"thông tin dinh dưỡng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"nutrition label\", \"meaning\": \"nhãn dinh dưỡng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"nutrient\", \"note_vi\": \"chất dinh dưỡng, là bộ phận của nutrition\"}, {\"word\": \"nutritionist\", \"note_vi\": \"chuyên gia dinh dưỡng, người hành nghề\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"nutritious\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"nutrient\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nutrition-cori-5adf741a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nutrition-aru0-5adf741a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nutrition-aru5-5adf741a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nutrition-aru6-5adf741a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nutrition-aru10-5adf741a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nutrition-aru9-5adf741a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nutrition-aru3-5adf741a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nutrition-aru7-5adf741a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nutrition-aru8-5adf741a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nutrition-aru2-5adf741a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nutrition-ljspeech-5adf741a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nutrition-lt408-5adf741a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nutrition-lt138-5adf741a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nutrition-lt624-5adf741a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nutrition-lt396-5adf741a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nutrition-lt498-5adf741a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nutrition-lt132-5adf741a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nutrition-lt288-5adf741a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nutrition-lt42-5adf741a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nutrition-lt90-5adf741a.mp3\"]}}', 'Nutrition là danh từ; tính từ là nutritious, không phải nutritionable.', 'health', 1, 21),
('9d7714b4-67fe-53a1-b897-d8fd8b04dd75', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '6ae6adf2-843d-51bb-848d-a18850eb0e9c', '173a19c1-47ae-5ddb-b0f8-d617f9edd6bb', 'outside', 'UK: /ˈaʊtˈsaɪd/ | US: /ˈaʊtˈsaɪd/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'bên ngoài', 'in or to the open air or exterior part of a building or container', 'The package was left just outside the door.', 'Gói hàng đã được để ngay bên ngoài cửa.', '{\"en\": \"Clients are kindly requested to wait outside while the meeting room is being prepared.\", \"vi\": \"Quý khách hàng vui lòng đợi ở bên ngoài trong khi phòng họp đang được chuẩn bị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outside-ljspeech-45e18dad.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outside-cori-45e18dad.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/outside-eb9498d7.webp', '[\"outdoors\", \"externally\"]', '[\"inside\", \"indoors\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"wait outside\", \"meaning\": \"chờ ở bên ngoài\"}, {\"phrase\": \"step outside\", \"meaning\": \"bước ra ngoài\"}, {\"phrase\": \"located outside\", \"meaning\": \"nằm ở phía bên ngoài\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"outdated\", \"note_vi\": \"Outdated nghĩa là lỗi thời, lạc hậu, không còn dùng được.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"outside\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"outside\"}, {\"pos\": \"preposition\", \"word\": \"outside\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outside-cori-45e18dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outside-aru0-45e18dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outside-aru5-45e18dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outside-aru6-45e18dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outside-aru10-45e18dad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outside-aru9-45e18dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outside-aru3-45e18dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outside-aru7-45e18dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outside-aru8-45e18dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outside-aru2-45e18dad.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outside-ljspeech-45e18dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outside-lt408-45e18dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outside-lt138-45e18dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outside-lt624-45e18dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outside-lt396-45e18dad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outside-lt498-45e18dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outside-lt132-45e18dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outside-lt288-45e18dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outside-lt42-45e18dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outside-lt90-45e18dad.mp3\"]}}', '\'Outside\' làm trạng từ có nghĩa là ở ngoài trời/ngoại thất. Khi làm giới từ thường đi kèm tân ngữ (outside the building).', 'office', 1, 22),
('1628952e-35da-5374-bce8-2c848d4df587', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '6ae6adf2-843d-51bb-848d-a18850eb0e9c', '173a19c1-47ae-5ddb-b0f8-d617f9edd6bb', 'pizza', '/ˈpiːtsə/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Món ăn có đế bánh tròn, phủ sốt cà chua, phô mai và các loại nhân.', 'a flat, round bread base topped with tomato sauce, cheese, and other food.', 'Our team decided to share two delicious pizzas during the late-night meeting.', 'Nhóm chúng tôi quyết định cùng ăn hai chiếc pizza thơm ngon trong cuộc họp muộn.', '{\"en\": \"The department ordered several boxes of pizza for the staff lunch meeting today.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng ban đã đặt vài hộp bánh pizza cho buổi họp ăn trưa của nhân viên hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pizza-ljspeech-1f6ccd2b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pizza-cori-1f6ccd2b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pizza-2790e71d.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pizza delivery\", \"meaning\": \"giao bánh pizza\"}, {\"phrase\": \"slice of pizza\", \"meaning\": \"lát bánh pizza\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pizza-cori-1f6ccd2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pizza-aru0-1f6ccd2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pizza-aru5-1f6ccd2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pizza-aru6-1f6ccd2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pizza-aru10-1f6ccd2b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pizza-aru9-1f6ccd2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pizza-aru3-1f6ccd2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pizza-aru7-1f6ccd2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pizza-aru8-1f6ccd2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pizza-aru2-1f6ccd2b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pizza-ljspeech-1f6ccd2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pron