('11428437-7078-5fef-8bd4-5734266c0590', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '6ae6adf2-843d-51bb-848d-a18850eb0e9c', '173a19c1-47ae-5ddb-b0f8-d617f9edd6bb', 'resort', '/rɪˈzɔːt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Nơi nghỉ mát, thường có nhiều tiện nghi giải trí.', 'a place where many people go for a holiday to relax or have fun.', 'They booked a luxurious resort for their honeymoon.', 'Họ đã đặt một khu nghỉ dưỡng sang trọng cho tuần trăng mật của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The luxury resort offers a special discount for corporate events booked during the winter season.\", \"vi\": \"Khu nghỉ dưỡng sang trọng cung cấp mức giảm giá đặc biệt cho các sự kiện doanh nghiệp được đặt trong mùa đông.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resort-ljspeech-0cc45987.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resort-cori-0cc45987.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/resort-c91cff57.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"seaside resort\", \"meaning\": \"khu nghỉ dưỡng ven biển\"}, {\"phrase\": \"luxury resort\", \"meaning\": \"khu nghỉ dưỡng sang trọng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resort-cori-0cc45987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resort-aru0-0cc45987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resort-aru5-0cc45987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resort-aru6-0cc45987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resort-aru10-0cc45987.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resort-aru9-0cc45987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resort-aru3-0cc45987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resort-aru7-0cc45987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resort-aru8-0cc45987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resort-aru2-0cc45987.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resort-ljspeech-0cc45987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/ob