('b90f8405-c085-5f1a-8a74-708695bb0e9b', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '745051e8-7d70-5c55-bd05-8cfc18420568', '9a1b344f-7d26-5d2f-ad06-02cf2901d58d', 'past', 'UK: /pɑːst/ | US: /pæst/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'trước đây, đã qua', 'belonging to a period of time that has already gone by or finished.', 'Her past experience makes her suitable for the role.', 'Kinh nghiệm trước đây của cô ấy khiến cô ấy phù hợp với vai trò này.', '{\"en\": \"Over the past five years, the company has expanded into three new overseas markets.\", \"vi\": \"Trong 5 năm qua, công ty đã mở rộng sang ba thị trường nước ngoài mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-ljspeech-dc52f279.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-cori-dc52f279.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/past-a5413f7a.webp', '[\"former\", \"previous\", \"prior\"]', '[\"present\", \"future\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"in the past few days\", \"meaning\": \"trong vài ngày qua\"}, {\"phrase\": \"past performance\", \"meaning\": \"kết quả làm việc trước đây\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"passed\", \"note_vi\": \"Passed là dạng quá khứ của động từ \'pass\'; còn past làm tính từ/danh từ/giới từ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"past\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-cori-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-aru0-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-aru5-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-aru6-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-aru10-dc52f279.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-aru9-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-aru3-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-aru7-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-aru8-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-aru2-dc52f279.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-ljspeech-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-lt408-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-lt138-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-lt624-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-lt396-dc52f279.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-lt498-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-lt132-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-lt288-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-lt42-dc52f279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/past-lt90-dc52f279.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay đứng trước các từ chỉ khoảng thời gian: \'in the past few years\' (trong vài năm qua).', 'general', 1, 2),
('befe86fb-f1aa-5328-9648-fb1a9bd3c3aa', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '745051e8-7d70-5c55-bd05-8cfc18420568', '9a1b344f-7d26-5d2f-ad06-02cf2901d58d', 'street', '/striːt/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Con đường có nhà cửa hai bên trong thành phố hoặc thị trấn.', 'a public road in a city or town with buildings.', 'Several food trucks parked along the main street to serve lunch to office workers.', 'Một số xe bán đồ ăn đỗ dọc theo đường phố chính để phục vụ bữa trưa cho dân văn phòng.', '{\"en\": \"The delivery truck parked on the street near our office building.\", \"vi\": \"Chiếc xe tải giao hàng đỗ trên đường phố gần tòa nhà văn phòng của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/street-ljspeech-d3a9fb07.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/street-cori-d3a9fb07.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/street-b137b33c.webp', '[\"road\", \"avenue\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"main street\", \"meaning\": \"đường phố chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"street light\", \"meaning\": \"đèn đường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"busy street\", \"meaning\": \"phố đông đúc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"strait\", \"note_vi\": \"strait là eo biển, street là đường phố\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/street-cori-d3a9fb07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/street-aru0-d3a9fb07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/street-aru5-d3a9fb07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/street-aru6-d3a9fb07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/street-aru10-d3a9fb07.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/street-aru9-d3a9fb07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/street-aru3-d3a9fb07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/street-aru7-d3a9fb07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/street-aru8-d3a9fb07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/street-aru2-d3a9fb07.mp3\"]}, \"