('d4b403da-04b1-56b3-b139-89a3eedd033b', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '745051e8-7d70-5c55-bd05-8cfc18420568', '9a1b344f-7d26-5d2f-ad06-02cf2901d58d', 'check-out', '/ˈtʃɛkˌaʊt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Hành động rời khỏi khách sạn sau khi thanh toán, hoặc quầy thanh toán ở siêu thị.', 'the act of leaving a hotel after paying the bill, or the place where you pay.', 'Please remember that hotel check-out time is at 12 PM.', 'Xin hãy nhớ rằng thời gian trả phòng khách sạn là 12 giờ trưa.', '{\"en\": \"Guests must complete their check-out at the front desk before noon to avoid extra charges.\", \"vi\": \"Khách phải hoàn tất thủ tục trả phòng tại quầy lễ tân trước buổi trưa để tránh phí phụ thu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-out-ljspeech-4142bde3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-out-cori-4142bde3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/check-out-a247e6e5.webp', NULL, '[\"check-in\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"check-out time\", \"meaning\": \"giờ trả phòng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"check-out counter\", \"meaning\": \"quầy thanh toán\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"check-in\", \"note_vi\": \"check-in là nhận phòng, check-out là trả phòng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"check out\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-out-cori-4142bde3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-out-aru0-4142bde3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-out-aru5-4142bde3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-out-aru6-4142bde3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-out-aru10-4142bde3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-out-aru9-4142bde3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-out-aru3-4142bde3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-out-aru7-4142bde3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-out-aru8-4142bde3.mp3\", 