('e347ddd9-a296-58d5-90d6-ba13ad844142', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '745051e8-7d70-5c55-bd05-8cfc18420568', '9a1b344f-7d26-5d2f-ad06-02cf2901d58d', 'dirty', '/ˈdɜːti/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Không sạch sẽ, có vết bẩn hoặc bụi bặm.', 'not clean and covered with dust, mud, or other unwanted substances.', 'His hands were dirty after working in the garden all day.', 'Tay anh ấy bẩn sau khi làm vườn cả ngày.', '{\"en\": \"The cleaning staff must remove all dirty dishes from the conference room after the meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên vệ sinh phải dọn sạch bát đĩa bẩn khỏi phòng họp sau khi cuộc họp kết thúc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dirty-ljspeech-33797be5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dirty-cori-33797be5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dirty-ab8c6fd7.webp', '[\"filthy\", \"soiled\"]', '[\"clean\", \"spotless\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"dirty laundry\", \"meaning\": \"đồ bẩn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dirty water\", \"meaning\": \"nước bẩn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"dirt\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dirty-cori-33797be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dirty-aru0-33797be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dirty-aru5-33797be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dirty-aru6-33797be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dirty-aru10-33797be5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dirty-aru9-33797be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dirty-aru3-33797be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dirty-aru7-33797be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dirty-aru8-33797be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dirty-aru2-33797be5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dirty-ljspeech-33797be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dirty-lt408-33797be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dirty-lt138-33797be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dirty-lt624-33797be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dirty-lt396-33797be5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dirty-lt498-33797be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dirty-lt132-33797be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dirty-lt288-33797be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dirty-lt42-33797be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dirty-lt90-33797be5.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm với \'dusty\' (bụi bặm), \'dirty\' là bẩn nói chung.', 'office', 1, 12),
('c615a6e2-b312-5dd7-b4bf-f8972fe1d3ef', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '745051e8-7d70-5c55-bd05-8cfc18420568', '9a1b344f-7d26-5d2f-ad06-02cf2901d58d', 'pepper', '/ˈpepə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'loại gia vị cay làm từ hạt cây tiêu, thường dùng để nêm nếm.', 'a hot-tasting powder made from dried berries, used to add flavor to food.', 'The chef sprinkled freshly ground black pepper over the salad before serving.', 'Đầu bếp đã rắc tiêu đen xay tươi lên món salad trước khi phục vụ.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant\'s new menu features dishes seasoned with freshly ground black pepper.\", \"vi\": \"Thực đơn mới của nhà hàng có các món được nêm tiêu đen xay tươi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-ljspeech-64356bcf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-cori-64356bcf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pepper-69a29364.webp', '[\"spice\", \"seasoning\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"black pepper\", \"meaning\": \"tiêu đen\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ground pepper\", \"meaning\": \"tiêu xay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"add pepper\", \"meaning\": \"thêm tiêu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"chili pepper\", \"note_vi\": \"chili pepper là ớt cay; pepper một mình thường chỉ tiêu đen hoặc ớt chuông\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"peppery\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"pepper\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-cori-64356bcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-aru0-64356bcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-aru5-64356bcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-aru6-64356bcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-aru10-64356bcf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-aru9-64356bcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-aru3-64356bcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepper-aru7-64356bcf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/