('2662abd4-674e-52b0-961d-4f0cc02eb017', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '745051e8-7d70-5c55-bd05-8cfc18420568', '9a1b344f-7d26-5d2f-ad06-02cf2901d58d', 'ant', '/ænt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một loài côn trùng nhỏ sống thành đàn, thường được tìm thấy trong đất.', 'a very small insect that lives in large groups and works very hard together.', 'We saw a long line of ants carrying food back to their nest.', 'Chúng tôi thấy một hàng dài kiến đang tha thức ăn về tổ của chúng.', '{\"en\": \"The office kitchen must be kept clean to prevent ants from entering the food area.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà bếp văn phòng phải được giữ sạch sẽ để ngăn kiến xâm nhập vào khu vực thực phẩm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ant-ljspeech-64bd05d8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ant-cori-64bd05d8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ant-be838e12.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"army of ants\", \"meaning\": \"đàn kiến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ant hill\", \"meaning\": \"tổ kiến\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ant-cori-64bd05d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ant-aru0-64bd05d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ant-aru5-64bd05d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ant-aru6-64bd05d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ant-aru10-64bd05d8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ant-aru9-64bd05d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ant-aru3-64bd05d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ant-aru7-64bd05d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ant-aru8-64bd05d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ant-aru2-64bd05d8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ant-ljspeech-64bd05d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ant-lt408-64bd05d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunc