('ebb48b17-ca57-5347-8bc7-d2e857829987', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '745051e8-7d70-5c55-bd05-8cfc18420568', '9a1b344f-7d26-5d2f-ad06-02cf2901d58d', 'stove', '/stəʊv/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Thiết bị dùng để nấu ăn hoặc sưởi ấm.', 'a piece of kitchen equipment used for heating food or cooking meals.', 'She put the pot of soup on the stove to simmer for an hour.', 'Cô ấy đặt nồi súp lên bếp lò để đun nhỏ lửa trong một giờ.', '{\"en\": \"Please ensure the gas stove is turned off before you leave the office kitchen.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đảm bảo bếp gas đã được tắt trước khi bạn rời khỏi bếp văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stove-ljspeech-9338aa5b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stove-cori-9338aa5b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stove-21e06bc1.webp', '[\"cooker\", \"range\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"gas stove\", \"meaning\": \"bếp gas\"}, {\"phrase\": \"electric stove\", \"meaning\": \"bếp điện\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stove-cori-9338aa5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stove-aru0-9338aa5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stove-aru5-9338aa5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stove-aru6-9338aa5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stove-aru10-9338aa5b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stove-aru9-9338aa5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stove-aru3-9338aa5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stove-aru7-9338aa5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stove-aru8-9338aa5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stove-aru2-9338aa5b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stove-ljspeech-9338aa5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stove-lt408-9338aa5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stove-lt138-9338aa5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stove-lt624-9338aa5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stove-lt396-9338aa5b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stove-lt498-9338aa5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stove-lt132-9338aa5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stove-lt288-9338aa5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stove-lt42-9338aa5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stove-lt90-9338aa5b.mp3\"]}}', 'stove là bếp lò, thường dùng cho bếp gas hoặc bếp điện.', 'daily', 1, 20),
('925ea80d-751a-57a6-8d44-14ba3510d43b', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '745051e8-7d70-5c55-bd05-8cfc18420568', '9a1b344f-7d26-5d2f-ad06-02cf2901d58d', 'goal', '/ɡəʊl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'mục đích, điều muốn đạt được', 'something that you want to achieve after planning and working hard for a long time.', 'Setting a clear professional goal will help you stay focused on your career.', 'Đặt ra một mục tiêu nghề nghiệp rõ ràng sẽ giúp bạn luôn tập trung vào sự nghiệp của mình.', '{\"en\": \"Our primary goal for this quarter is to increase total sales by ten percent globally.\", \"vi\": \"Mục tiêu chính của chúng ta trong quý này là tăng tổng doanh số bán hàng lên mười phần trăm trên toàn cầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goal-ljspeech-db9a022b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goal-cori-db9a022b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/goal-a7ed50eb.webp', '[\"objective\", \"target\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"achieve a goal\", \"meaning\": \"đạt được mục tiêu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"set a goal\", \"meaning\": \"đặt ra mục tiêu\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goal-cori-db9a022b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goal-aru0-db9a022b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goal-aru5-db9a022b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goal-aru6-db9a022b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goal-aru10-db9a022b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goal-aru9-db9a022b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goal-aru3-db9a022b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goal-aru7-db9a022b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goal-aru8-db9a022b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goal-aru2-db9a022b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/goal-ljspeech-db9a022b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/