('3a3eea36-3a69-559b-b2de-73e7aec0edbe', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '745051e8-7d70-5c55-bd05-8cfc18420568', '9a1b344f-7d26-5d2f-ad06-02cf2901d58d', 'staircase', 'UK: /ˈster.keɪs/ | US: /ˈster.keɪs/', 'B1', 'noun', 'cầu thang (có tay vịn)', 'A set of steps leading from one level of a building to another, including railings.', 'The grand staircase led to the ballroom.', 'Cầu thang lớn dẫn đến phòng khiêu vũ.', '{\"en\": \"The grand staircase leads directly from the reception area to the second-floor conference rooms.\", \"vi\": \"Cầu thang lớn dẫn trực tiếp từ khu vực lễ tân lên các phòng họp ở tầng hai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staircase-ljspeech-1edec902.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staircase-cori-1edec902.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/staircase-dbd4f13a.webp', '[\"stairway\", \"flight of stairs\", \"stairs\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"spiral staircase\", \"meaning\": \"cầu thang xoắn ốc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wooden staircase\", \"meaning\": \"cầu thang gỗ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"stair\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staircase-cori-1edec902.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staircase-aru0-1edec902.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staircase-aru5-1edec902.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staircase-aru6-1edec902.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staircase-aru10-1edec902.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staircase-aru9-1edec902.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staircase-aru3-1edec902.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staircase-aru7-1edec902.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staircase-aru8-1edec902.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staircase-aru2-1edec902.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staircase-ljspeech-1edec902.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staircase-lt408-1edec902.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staircase-lt138-1edec902.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staircase-lt624-1edec902.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staircase-lt396-1edec902.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staircase-lt498-1edec902.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staircase-lt132-1edec902.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staircase-lt288-1edec902.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staircase-lt42-1edec902.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staircase-lt90-1edec902.mp3\"]}}', 'Staircase nhấn mạnh toàn bộ cấu trúc cầu thang bao gồm bậc thang và tay vịn.', 'facilities', 1, 22),
('0acdbc71-35a9-54fe-beaf-3cbc12ce8f75', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '745051e8-7d70-5c55-bd05-8cfc18420568', '9a1b344f-7d26-5d2f-ad06-02cf2901d58d', 'battery', '/ˈbætri/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Thiết bị lưu trữ năng lượng hóa học và chuyển thành điện năng.', 'a device that produces electricity to provide power for radios, cars, or phones.', 'My laptop battery doesn\'t hold a charge for very long anymore.', 'Pin laptop của tôi không còn giữ được điện lâu nữa.', '{\"en\": \"The laptop battery drains very quickly when you run heavy software programs.\", \"vi\": \"Pin máy tính xách tay hao rất nhanh khi bạn chạy các chương trình phần mềm nặng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battery-ljspeech-3f3c58ae.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battery-cori-3f3c58ae.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/battery-30d2d596.webp', '[\"cell\", \"accumulator\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"rechargeable battery\", \"meaning\": \"pin sạc lại được\"}, {\"phrase\": \"battery life\", \"meaning\": \"tuổi thọ pin, thời lượng pin\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battery-cori-3f3c58ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battery-aru0-3f3c58ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battery-aru5-3f3c58ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battery-aru6-3f3c58ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battery-aru10-3f3c58ae.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battery-aru9-3f3c58ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battery-aru3-3f3c58ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battery-aru7-3f3c58ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battery-aru8-3f3c58ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battery-aru2-3f3c58ae.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battery-ljspeech-3f3c58ae.mp3\", \"/