('f5ff369f-d68a-5bda-8d32-465b420e467e', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', '745051e8-7d70-5c55-bd05-8cfc18420568', '9a1b344f-7d26-5d2f-ad06-02cf2901d58d', 'motivation', '/ˌməʊtɪˈveɪʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Lý do hoặc sự nhiệt tình thúc đẩy hành động.', 'the feeling of wanting to do something or achieve a goal with energy.', 'His strong motivation helped him overcome many challenges to achieve his goals.', 'Động lực mạnh mẽ đã giúp anh ấy vượt qua nhiều thử thách để đạt được mục tiêu.', '{\"en\": \"The manager offered a bonus to increase staff motivation during the busy holiday season.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã đưa ra tiền thưởng để tăng động lực cho nhân viên trong mùa lễ bận rộn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivation-ljspeech-5f191134.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivation-cori-5f191134.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/motivation-94be40cd.webp', '[\"incentive\", \"drive\"]', '[\"apathy\", \"indifference\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"high motivation\", \"meaning\": \"động lực cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lack of motivation\", \"meaning\": \"thiếu động lực\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"motivate\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"motivated\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivation-cori-5f191134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivation-aru0-5f191134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivation-aru5-5f191134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivation-aru6-5f191134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivation-aru10-5f191134.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivation-aru9-5f191134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivation-aru3-5f191134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivation-aru7-5f191134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivation-aru8-5f191134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivation-aru2-5f191134.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivation-ljspeech-5f191134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivation-lt408-5f191134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivation-lt138-5f191134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivation-lt624-5f191134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivation-lt396-5f191134.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivation-lt498-5f191134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivation-lt132-5f191134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivation-lt288-5f191134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivation-lt42-5f191134.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivation-lt90-5f191134.mp3\"]}}', 'motivation là danh từ, động từ là motivate, tính từ là motivated.', 'hr', 1, 29),
('8d3c0203-c160-54f8-b178-35fbef4571fa', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'a2b053bd-6f18-51e4-be69-a09f76bdf405', '2c48eca4-42b0-54e7-b144-fac19c1b737b', 'check-up', '/ˈtʃek.ʌp/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Buổi kiểm tra sức khỏe tổng quát định kỳ.', 'a general medical examination that a doctor gives you to make sure you are healthy.', 'It\'s important to have a regular medical check-up to stay healthy.', 'Điều quan trọng là phải khám sức khỏe định kỳ để giữ gìn sức khỏe.', '{\"en\": \"All factory employees are required to have an annual medical check-up at the company clinic.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả nhân viên nhà máy được yêu cầu khám sức khỏe định kỳ hàng năm tại phòng khám công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-up-ljspeech-8afac41d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-up-cori-8afac41d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/check-up-2a652db0.webp', '[\"examination\", \"assessment\", \"inspection\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"medical check-up\", \"meaning\": \"khám sức khỏe\"}, {\"phrase\": \"routine check-up\", \"meaning\": \"khám định kỳ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"go for a check-up\", \"meaning\": \"đi khám sức khỏe\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"checkup\", \"note_vi\": \"Có thể viết liền (checkup) hoặc có gạch nối (check-up).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"check up\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-up-cori-8afac41d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-up-aru0-8afac41d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-up-aru5-8afac41d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-up-aru6-8afac41d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-up-aru10-8afac41d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-up-aru9-8afac41d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-up-aru3-8afac41d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/check-up-aru7-8afac41