('4411019e-1389-5ef1-b5ae-cd509930971b', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'a2b053bd-6f18-51e4-be69-a09f76bdf405', '2c48eca4-42b0-54e7-b144-fac19c1b737b', 'recommend', 'UK: /ˌrɛkəˈmɛnd/ | US: /ˌrɛkəˈmɛnd/', 'B1', 'verb', 'giới thiệu, gợi ý', 'To suggest or advise something as a suitable, desirable, or beneficial choice.', 'I highly recommend this new software for project management.', 'Tôi rất khuyến khích phần mềm mới này cho việc quản lý dự án.', '{\"en\": \"The IT consultant recommended upgrading the existing database servers to enhance network security.\", \"vi\": \"Chuyên gia tư vấn CNTT đã đề xuất nâng cấp các máy chủ cơ sở dữ liệu hiện tại để tăng cường bảo mật mạng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-ljspeech-1fe94581.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-cori-1fe94581.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/recommend-9da98b39.webp', '[\"suggest\", \"advise\", \"propose\"]', '[\"discourage\", \"dissuade\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"strongly recommend\", \"meaning\": \"khuyến nghị / đề xuất nhiệt thành\"}, {\"phrase\": \"recommend that\", \"meaning\": \"khuyên / đề xuất rằng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"recommendation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"recommended\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-cori-1fe94581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-aru0-1fe94581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-aru5-1fe94581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-aru6-1fe94581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-aru10-1fe94581.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-aru9-1fe94581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-aru3-1fe94581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-aru7-1fe94581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-aru8-1fe94581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-aru2-1fe94581.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-ljspeech-1fe94581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-lt408-1fe94581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-lt138-1fe94581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-lt624-1fe94581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-lt396-1fe94581.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-lt498-1fe94581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-lt132-1fe94581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-lt288-1fe94581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-lt42-1fe94581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recommend-lt90-1fe94581.mp3\"]}}', 'Sau \'recommend\' dùng V-ing (\'recommend doing sth\') hoặc mệnh đề giả định (\'recommend that S + V_bare\'). Không dùng \'recommend sb to do sth\'.', 'office', 1, 2),
('ce50ea19-2f44-5996-b3a2-8609727d49bc', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'a2b053bd-6f18-51e4-be69-a09f76bdf405', '2c48eca4-42b0-54e7-b144-fac19c1b737b', 'whiteboard', '/ˈwaɪtbɔːd/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Bề mặt màu trắng dùng để viết hoặc vẽ bằng bút dạ.', 'a smooth light surface for writing on with special markers in offices or classrooms.', 'The project manager drew a detailed workflow diagram on the office whiteboard.', 'Quản lý dự án đã vẽ một sơ đồ quy trình làm việc chi tiết lên bảng trắng văn phòng.', '{\"en\": \"The project manager drew a timeline on the whiteboard during the team brainstorming session.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý dự án đã vẽ biểu đồ tiến độ lên bảng trắng trong buổi động não của nhóm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-ljspeech-d70ea575.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-cori-d70ea575.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/whiteboard-17f40238.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"whiteboard marker\", \"meaning\": \"bút viết bảng trắng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"interactive whiteboard\", \"meaning\": \"bảng tương tác\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"blackboard\", \"note_vi\": \"blackboard là bảng đen dùng phấn, whiteboard là bảng trắng dùng bút dạ\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-cori-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-aru0-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-aru5-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-aru6-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-aru10-d70ea575.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-aru9-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-aru3-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-aru7-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-aru8-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-aru2-d70ea575.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-ljspeech-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-lt408-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-lt138-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-lt624-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-lt396-d70ea575.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-lt498-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-lt132-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-lt288-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-lt42-d70ea575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whiteboard-lt90-d70ea575.mp3\"]}}', 'Whiteboard là bảng dùng bút dạ xóa được, rất phổ biến ở các văn phòng hiện đại.', 'office', 1, 3),
('f7e69edf-a4e9-5f8c-8e87-6af7eb13a4c6', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'a2b053bd-6f18-51e4-be69-a09f76bdf405', '2c48eca4-42b0-54e7-b144-fac19c1b737b', 'salary', '/ˈsæləri/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Tiền lương cố định trả cho nhân viên, thường theo tháng hoặc năm.', 'a fixed amount of money paid regularly to an employee for their work.', 'The company agreed to increase the monthly salary of all full-time workers.', 'Công ty đã đồng ý tăng lương hàng tháng cho tất cả công nhân làm việc toàn thời gian.', '{\"en\": \"The company offered her a competitive salary and excellent health benefits during the interview.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã đề nghị cô ấy mức lương cạnh tranh cùng phúc lợi y tế tuyệt vời trong buổi phỏng vấn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salary-ljspeech-47dfeb55.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salary-cori-47dfeb55.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/salary-23658b8e.webp', '[\"pay\", \"wage\", \"income\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"annual salary\", \"meaning\": \"lương hàng năm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"salary increase\", \"meaning\": \"sự tăng lương\"}, {\"phrase\": \"base salary\", \"meaning\": \"lương cơ bản\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"wage\", \"note_vi\": \"wage là lương trả theo giờ hoặc tuần, salary là lương tháng hoặc năm\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"salaried\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salary-cori-47dfeb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salary-aru0-47dfeb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salary-aru5-47dfeb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salary-aru6-47dfeb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salary-aru10-47dfeb55.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salary-aru9-47dfeb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salary-aru3-47dfeb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salary-aru7-47dfeb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salary-aru8-47dfeb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salary-aru2-47dfeb55.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salary-ljspeech-47dfeb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salary-lt408-47dfeb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salary-lt138-47dfeb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salary-lt624-47dfeb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salary-lt396-47dfeb55.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salary-lt498-47dfeb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salary-lt132-47dfeb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salary-lt288-47dfeb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salary-lt42-47dfeb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salary-lt90-47dfeb55.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt salary (lương cố định theo tháng/năm) và wage (lương theo giờ/ngày).', 'hr', 1, 4),
('3d84b7a1-6086-5736-9e57-3509aa3bae31', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'a2b053bd-6f18-51e4-be69-a09f76bdf405', '2c48eca4-42b0-54e7-b144-fac19c1b737b', 'office', '/ˈɒfɪs/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Phòng làm việc hoặc tòa nhà nơi mọi người làm việc.', 'a room or building where people work, usually doing business or administrative tasks.', 'I need to go to the office early tomorrow morning for a meeting.', 'Tôi cần đến văn phòng sớm vào sáng mai để họp.', '{\"en\": \"The head office will be relocated to a larger building downtown next quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Trụ sở chính sẽ được chuyển đến một tòa nhà lớn hơn ở trung tâm thành phố vào quý tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/office-ljspeech-e6427457.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/office-cori-e6427457.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/office-e1cd2e85.webp', '[\"workplace\", \"bureau\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"head office\", \"meaning\": \"trụ sở chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"office hours\", \"meaning\": \"giờ làm việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"office supplies\", \"meaning\": \"văn phòng phẩm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"officer\", \"note_vi\": \"officer là người giữ chức vụ hoặc sĩ quan, không phải nơi làm việc\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"officer\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"official\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"officially\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/office-cori-e6427457.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/office-aru0-e6427457.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/office-aru5-e6427457.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/office-aru6-e6427457.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/office-aru10-e6427457.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/office-aru9-e6427457.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/office-aru3-e6427457.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/office-aru7-e6427457.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/office-aru8-e6427457.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/office-aru2-e6427457.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/office-ljspeech-e6427457.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/office-lt408-e6427457.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/office-lt138-e6427457.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/office-lt624-e6427457.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/office-lt396-e6427457.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/office-lt498-e6427457.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/office-lt132-e6427457.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/office-lt288-e6427457.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/office-lt42-e6427457.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/office-lt90-e6427457.mp3\"]}}', 'Office supplies (văn phòng phẩm) là cụm rất hay gặp trong đề TOEIC Part 7.', 'office', 1, 5),
('3ee3519e-3903-5ab2-9476-f98b2847ada6', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'a2b053bd-6f18-51e4-be69-a09f76bdf405', '2c48eca4-42b0-54e7-b144-fac19c1b737b', 'taste', 'UK: /teɪst/ | US: /teɪst/', 'B1', 'noun', 'thị hiếu', 'A person\'s individual preference or liking for particular styles, choices, or consumer products.', 'Consumer tastes are constantly evolving.', 'Thị hiếu của người tiêu dùng không ngừng phát triển.', '{\"en\": \"The company modified its product design to match changing consumer tastes.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã điều chỉnh thiết kế sản phẩm để phù hợp với thị hiếu thay đổi của người tiêu dùng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taste-ljspeech-270fdbaa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taste-cori-270fdbaa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/taste-489cdb2a.webp', '[\"preference\", \"liking\", \"style\", \"inclination\"]', '[\"dislike\", \"aversion\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"consumer tastes\", \"meaning\": \"thị hiếu người tiêu dùng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"have good taste\", \"meaning\": \"có gu thẩm mỹ tốt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"test\", \"note_vi\": \"\'test\' nghĩa là bài kiểm tra hoặc thử nghiệm, không phải thị hiếu hay vị giác như \'taste\'.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"tasty\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"taste\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"tasteful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taste-cori-270fdbaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taste-aru0-270fdbaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taste-aru5-270fdbaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taste-aru6-270fdbaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taste-aru10-270fdbaa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taste-aru9-270fdbaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taste-aru3-270fdbaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taste-aru7-270fdbaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taste-aru8-270fdbaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taste-aru2-270fdbaa.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taste-ljspeech-270fdbaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taste-lt408-270fdbaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taste-lt138-270fdbaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taste-lt624-270fdbaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taste-lt396-270fdbaa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taste-lt498-270fdbaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taste-lt132-270fdbaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taste-lt288-270fdbaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taste-lt42-270fdbaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taste-lt90-270fdbaa.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ cảnh thương mại, \'taste\' thường mang nghĩa thị hiếu hoặc sở thích tiêu dùng (\'consumer tastes\').', 'marketing', 1, 6),
('24c34fa2-ac9b-5b2d-ad32-9ebda0dbb018', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'a2b053bd-6f18-51e4-be69-a09f76bdf405', '2c48eca4-42b0-54e7-b144-fac19c1b737b', 'janitor', '/ˈdʒænɪtə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Người chịu trách nhiệm dọn dẹp và bảo trì tòa nhà.', 'a person whose job is to clean and take care of a public building.', 'The janitor cleans the school hallways every evening.', 'Người lao công dọn dẹp hành lang trường học mỗi tối.', '{\"en\": \"Please ask the janitor to clean the main conference room before the clients arrive.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng yêu cầu lao công dọn dẹp phòng họp chính trước khi khách hàng đến.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/janitor-ljspeech-5a4a6798.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/janitor-cori-5a4a6798.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/janitor-1e4f418f.webp', '[\"cleaner\", \"caretaker\", \"custodian\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"school janitor\", \"meaning\": \"lao công trường học\"}, {\"phrase\": \"head janitor\", \"meaning\": \"tổ trưởng tổ lao công\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"security guard\", \"note_vi\": \"janitor thiên về dọn dẹp bảo trì, security guard chuyên về an ninh\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/janitor-cori-5a4a6798.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/janitor-aru0-5a4a6798.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/janitor-aru5-5a4a6798.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/janitor-aru6-5a4a6798.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/janitor-aru10-5a4a6798.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/janitor-aru9-5a4a6798.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/janitor-aru3-5a4a6798.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/janitor-aru7-5a4a6798.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/janitor-aru8-5a4a6798.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/janitor-aru2-5a4a6798.mp3\"]}, \"us\"