('adab1297-2b87-5358-8d22-44b99ce1eb2e', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'a2b053bd-6f18-51e4-be69-a09f76bdf405', '2c48eca4-42b0-54e7-b144-fac19c1b737b', 'doctor\'s office', '/ˈdɒktəz ˈɒfɪs/', 'A2', 'phrase', 'Nơi bác sĩ khám và điều trị bệnh nhân.', 'a place where a medical professional sees patients for checkups or treatment of illnesses.', 'I have an appointment at the doctor\'s office this afternoon.', 'Chiều nay tôi có cuộc hẹn ở phòng khám bác sĩ.', '{\"en\": \"I need to visit the doctor\'s office this afternoon for my annual health checkup appointment.\", \"vi\": \"Tôi cần đến phòng khám bác sĩ chiều nay cho cuộc hẹn kiểm tra sức khỏe hàng năm của mình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-s-office-ljspeech-132d8b6b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-s-office-cori-132d8b6b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/doctor-s-office-ca2d5ea9.webp', '[\"clinic\", \"medical center\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"visit the doctor\'s office\", \"meaning\": \"đến phòng khám\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wait at the doctor\'s office\", \"meaning\": \"chờ tại phòng khám\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-s-office-cori-132d8b6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-s-office-aru0-132d8b6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-s-office-aru5-132d8b6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-s-office-aru6-132d8b6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-s-office-aru10-132d8b6b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-s-office-aru9-132d8b6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-s-office-aru3-132d8b6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-s-office-aru7-132d8b6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-s-office-aru8-132d8b6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-s-office-aru2-132d8b6b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-s-office-ljspeech-132d8b6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-s-office-lt408-132d8b6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-s-office-lt138-132d8b6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-s-office-lt624-132d8b6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-s-office-lt396-132d8b6b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-s-office-lt498-132d8b6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-s-office-lt132-132d8b6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-s-office-lt288-132d8b6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-s-office-lt42-132d8b6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-s-office-lt90-132d8b6b.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để chỉ nơi làm việc của bác sĩ tư nhân.', 'health', 1, 10),
('f41f6494-6544-536a-8fbc-fac80f211b73', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'a2b053bd-6f18-51e4-be69-a09f76bdf405', '2c48eca4-42b0-54e7-b144-fac19c1b737b', 'time-off', 'UK: /ˌtaɪmˈɒf/ | US: /ˌtaɪmˈɔf/', 'B1', 'phrase', 'thời gian nghỉ phép', 'a period when a person is allowed to stop working or taking duty', 'I need to request some time-off next month for a family event.', 'Tôi cần xin nghỉ phép tháng tới vì có việc gia đình.', '{\"en\": \"Employees must submit request forms at least two weeks before taking time-off.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phải nộp đơn yêu cầu ít nhất hai tuần trước khi nghỉ phép.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-off-ljspeech-33bf0fcb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-off-cori-33bf0fcb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/time-off-d01d1bf4.webp', '[\"leave\", \"vacation\", \"break\"]', '[\"overtime\", \"worktime\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"paid time-off\", \"meaning\": \"nghỉ phép có hưởng lương\"}, {\"phrase\": \"request time-off\", \"meaning\": \"xin nghỉ phép\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"timeout\", \"note_vi\": \"Timeout là tạm dừng (trong thể thao/hội thoại), còn time-off là nghỉ phép khỏi công việc.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-off-cori-33bf0fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-off-aru0-33bf0fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-off-aru5-33bf0fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-off-aru6-33bf0fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-off-aru10-33bf0fcb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-off-aru9-33bf0fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-off-aru3-33bf0fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-off-aru7-33bf0fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-off-aru8-33bf0fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-off-aru2-33bf0fcb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-off-ljspeech-33bf0fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-off-lt408-33bf0fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-off-lt138-33bf0fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-off-lt624-33bf0fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-off-lt396-33bf0fcb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-off-lt498-33bf0fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-off-lt132-33bf0fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-off-lt288-33bf0fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-off-lt42-33bf0fcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-off-lt90-33bf0fcb.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ không đếm được chỉ khoảng thời gian được nghỉ làm việc (paid time-off = nghỉ phép có lương).', 'personnel', 1, 11),
('37bbb43c-e1dc-560c-99e4-0420bfb0b779', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'a2b053bd-6f18-51e4-be69-a09f76bdf405', '2c48eca4-42b0-54e7-b144-fac19c1b737b', 'hope', 'UK: /həʊp/ | US: /hoʊp/', 'A1', 'verb', 'hy vọng', 'To want something to happen and believe that it is truly possible.', 'I hope our project succeeds this quarter.', 'Tôi hy vọng dự án của chúng ta thành công trong quý này.', '{\"en\": \"We hope to complete the office renovation project before the end of this quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi hy vọng hoàn thành dự án cải tạo văn phòng trước khi kết thúc quý này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hope-ljspeech-4955742b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hope-cori-4955742b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hope-5b82b77c.webp', '[\"wish\", \"expect\", \"anticipate\"]', '[\"despair\", \"dread\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"hope for the best\", \"meaning\": \"hy vọng điều tốt đẹp nhất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"express hope\", \"meaning\": \"bày tỏ hy vọng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"wish\", \"note_vi\": \"wish thường dùng cho điều ước khó/không thể xảy ra, còn hope dùng cho khả năng thực tế\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"hopeful\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"hopeless\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"hopefully\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hope-cori-4955742b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hope-aru0-4955742b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hope-aru5-4955742b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hope-aru6-4955742b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hope-aru10-4955742b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hope-aru9-4955742b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hope-aru3-4955742b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hope-aru7-4955742b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hope-aru8-4955742b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hope-aru2-4955742b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hope-ljspeech-4955742b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hope-lt408-4955742b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hope-lt138-4955742b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hope-lt624-4955742b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hope-lt396-4955742b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hope-lt498-4955742b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hope-lt132-4955742b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hope-lt288-4955742b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hope-lt42-4955742b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hope-lt90-4955742b.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc: \'hope to do sth\' hoặc \'hope that + S + V\'. Không dùng \'hope someone to do sth\' (dùng \'expect\' hoặc \'want\').', 'general business', 1, 12),
('2e61fbb1-f627-5f09-9162-6af89738db68', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'a2b053bd-6f18-51e4-be69-a09f76bdf405', '2c48eca4-42b0-54e7-b144-fac19c1b737b', 'spread', 'UK: /sprɛd/ | US: /sprɛd/', 'B1', 'noun', 'sự lây lan, sự lan truyền', 'The growth or extension of something over a wider area or among more people.', 'The rapid spread of the virus caused global concern.', 'Sự lây lan nhanh chóng của virus đã gây lo ngại toàn cầu.', '{\"en\": \"The IT department implemented strict cybersecurity measures to prevent the spread of malware.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng CNTT đã triển khai các biện pháp an ninh mạng nghiêm ngặt để ngăn chặn sự lan truyền của mã độc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spread-ljspeech-ea118158.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spread-cori-ea118158.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/spread-856f8525.webp', '[\"expansion\", \"growth\", \"diffusion\", \"dispersion\"]', '[\"reduction\", \"containment\", \"suppression\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"prevent the spread of\", \"meaning\": \"ngăn chặn sự lây lan/lan rộng của\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rapid spread\", \"meaning\": \"sự lan rộng nhanh chóng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"speed\", \"note_vi\": \"Tốc độ (speed), khác với sự lan rộng (spread).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"spread\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spread-cori-ea118158.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spread-aru0-ea118158.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spread-aru5-ea118158.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spread-aru6-ea118158.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spread-aru10-ea118158.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spread-aru9-ea118158.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spread-aru3-ea118158.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spread-aru7-ea118158.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spread-aru8-ea118158.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spread-aru2-ea118158.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spread-ljspeech-ea118158.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spread-lt408-ea118158.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spread-lt138-ea118158.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spread-lt624-ea118158.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spread-lt396-ea118158.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spread-lt498-ea118158.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spread-lt132-ea118158.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spread-lt288-ea118158.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spread-lt42-ea118158.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spread-lt90-ea118158.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất hay đi với cấu trúc \'the spread of...\' (sự lan rộng/lây lan của thông tin, dịch bệnh, phần mềm độc hại).', 'office', 1, 13),
('799a7469-4ca5-5a5b-bd91-648162db5b3d', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'a2b053bd-6f18-51e4-be69-a09f76bdf405', '2c48eca4-42b0-54e7-b144-fac19c1b737b', 'cloudy', '/ˈklaʊdi/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Bầu trời có nhiều mây, không có nắng.', 'the sky is full of grey or white masses of condensed vapor.', 'It\'s going to be a cloudy day tomorrow, so don\'t forget your umbrella.', 'Ngày mai trời sẽ nhiều mây, vì vậy đừng quên mang ô nhé.', '{\"en\": \"The cloudy weather forced the hotel to move the staff meeting indoors.\", \"vi\": \"Thời tiết nhiều mây buộc khách sạn phải chuyển cuộc họp nhân viên vào trong nhà.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloudy-ljspeech-5a53260b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloudy-cori-5a53260b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cloudy-1fa2d7fd.webp', '[\"overcast\", \"grey\"]', '[\"clear\", \"sunny\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"cloudy sky\", \"meaning\": \"bầu trời nhiều mây\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cloudy weather\", \"meaning\": \"thời tiết nhiều mây\"}, {\"phrase\": \"partly cloudy\", \"meaning\": \"có mây rải rác\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"cloud\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"cloud\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloudy-cori-5a53260b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloudy-aru0-5a53260b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloudy-aru5-5a53260b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloudy-aru6-5a53260b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloudy-aru10-5a53260b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloudy-aru9-5a53260b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloudy-aru3-5a53260b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloudy-aru7-5a53260b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloudy-aru8-5a53260b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloudy-aru2-5a53260b.mp3\