('0923ecbd-f053-5fd5-a25c-ed6baf26fd34', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'a2b053bd-6f18-51e4-be69-a09f76bdf405', '2c48eca4-42b0-54e7-b144-fac19c1b737b', 'recycle', '/ˌriːˈsaɪkl/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Xử lý rác thải để biến chúng thành vật liệu mới có thể sử dụng lại.', 'to process used objects or materials so they can be used again.', 'We should always try to recycle plastic bottles and paper to help the environment.', 'Chúng ta nên luôn cố gắng tái chế chai nhựa và giấy để bảo vệ môi trường.', '{\"en\": \"Our company encourages all staff to recycle paper and plastic to protect the local environment.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi khuyến khích tất cả nhân viên tái chế giấy và nhựa để bảo vệ môi trường địa phương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-ljspeech-089f4e36.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-cori-089f4e36.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/recycle-5b7bb876.webp', '[\"reuse\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"recycle paper\", \"meaning\": \"tái chế giấy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"recycle waste\", \"meaning\": \"tái chế rác thải\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"recyclable\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"recycling\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-cori-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-aru0-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-aru5-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-aru6-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-aru10-089f4e36.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-aru9-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-aru3-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-aru7-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-aru8-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-aru2-089f4e36.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-ljspeech-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-lt408-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-lt138-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-lt624-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-lt396-089f4e36.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-lt498-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-lt132-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-lt288-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-lt42-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-lt90-089f4e36.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt với reuse (dùng lại trực tiếp mà không qua chế biến).', 'office', 1, 15),
('ec4a3271-fc19-5507-83ca-afd8fd140af5', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'a2b053bd-6f18-51e4-be69-a09f76bdf405', '2c48eca4-42b0-54e7-b144-fac19c1b737b', 'breakfast', '/ˈbrekfəst/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Bữa ăn đầu tiên trong ngày, thường vào buổi sáng.', 'An early morning food intake consumed shortly after rising from overnight sleep.', 'The executive team hosted a short morning meeting over breakfast in the main conference hall.', 'Ban điều hành đã tổ chức một cuộc họp ngắn buổi sáng trong bữa sáng tại hội trường chính.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel offers a free breakfast for guests before the seminar.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn cung cấp bữa sáng miễn phí cho khách trước buổi hội thảo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-ljspeech-9e3a8225.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-cori-9e3a8225.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/breakfast-ea09c203.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"have breakfast\", \"meaning\": \"ăn sáng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"breakfast meeting\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc họp trong bữa sáng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"continental breakfast\", \"meaning\": \"bữa sáng nhẹ kiểu Âu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"break\", \"note_vi\": \"break là nghỉ giải lao, breakfast là bữa sáng\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-cori-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-aru0-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-aru5-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-aru6-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-aru10-9e3a8225.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-aru9-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-aru3-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-aru7-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-aru8-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-aru2-9e3a8225.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-ljspeech-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-lt408-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-lt138-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-lt624-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-lt396-9e3a8225.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-lt498-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-lt132-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-lt288-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-lt42-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-lt90-9e3a8225.mp3\"]}}', 'Breakfast gồm \'break\' và \'fast\' (nhịn ăn sáng).', 'dining', 1, 16),
('93d3e1f2-6511-5569-84a5-fb51e133c436', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'a2b053bd-6f18-51e4-be69-a09f76bdf405', '2c48eca4-42b0-54e7-b144-fac19c1b737b', 'library', '/ˈlaɪbrəri/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Nơi lưu trữ sách và tài liệu để đọc hoặc mượn.', 'a building or room containing collections of books and other materials for people to read or borrow.', 'Students often go to the university library to study and do research.', 'Sinh viên thường đến thư viện trường đại học để học và nghiên cứu.', '{\"en\": \"The university library will extend its opening hours during the final examination period next week.\", \"vi\": \"Thư viện trường đại học sẽ kéo dài giờ mở cửa trong thời gian thi cử cuối kỳ vào tuần tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/library-ljspeech-00299a40.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/library-cori-00299a40.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/library-dfb6475c.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"public library\", \"meaning\": \"thư viện công cộng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"library card\", \"meaning\": \"thẻ thư viện\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bookstore\", \"note_vi\": \"nhà sách, nơi bán sách chứ không cho mượn miễn phí\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"librarian\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/library-cori-00299a40.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/library-aru0-00299a40.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/library-aru5-00299a40.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/library-aru6-00299a40.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/library-aru10-00299a40.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/library-aru9-00299a40.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/library-aru3-00299a40.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/library-aru7-00299a40.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/library-aru8-00299a40.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/