('e0e16cc1-e60c-5c67-846c-0b8e6bc2192e', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'a2b053bd-6f18-51e4-be69-a09f76bdf405', '2c48eca4-42b0-54e7-b144-fac19c1b737b', 'reduce', '/rɪˈdjuːs/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Làm cho cái gì đó nhỏ hơn về số lượng, kích thước hoặc mức độ.', 'to decrease the quantity, volume, degree, or intensity of a particular thing.', 'We should try to reduce our plastic waste to protect the environment.', 'Chúng ta nên cố gắng giảm thiểu rác thải nhựa để bảo vệ môi trường.', '{\"en\": \"We need to reduce operational costs to remain competitive in the market.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta cần giảm chi phí vận hành để duy trì khả năng cạnh tranh trên thị trường.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-ljspeech-48c3689f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-cori-48c3689f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reduce-ccd49741.webp', '[\"decrease\", \"diminish\", \"lower\"]', '[\"increase\", \"raise\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"reduce costs\", \"meaning\": \"giảm chi phí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reduce waste\", \"meaning\": \"giảm chất thải\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"deduct\", \"note_vi\": \"deduct là khấu trừ tiền, reduce là giảm kích thước/số lượng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"reduction\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"reducible\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-cori-48c3689f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-aru0-48c3689f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-aru5-48c3689f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-aru6-48c3689f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-aru10-48c3689f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-aru9-48c3689f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-aru3-48c3689f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-aru7-48c3689f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-aru8-48c3689f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-aru2-48c3689f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-ljspeech-48c3689f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-lt408-48c3689f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-lt138-48c3689f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-lt624-48c3689f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-lt396-48c3689f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-lt498-48c3689f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-lt132-48c3689f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-lt288-48c3689f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-lt42-48c3689f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-lt90-48c3689f.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với giới từ \'by\' (giảm bao nhiêu) hoặc \'to\' (giảm xuống còn bao nhiêu).', 'business', 1, 19),
('79b41272-7291-5ff0-96df-a1ace36fdb3f', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'a2b053bd-6f18-51e4-be69-a09f76bdf405', '2c48eca4-42b0-54e7-b144-fac19c1b737b', 'highway', '/ˈhaɪweɪ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Con đường lớn dành cho xe cộ đi nhanh giữa các thành phố.', 'a wide road that connects large towns and cities, designed for fast moving traffic.', 'The new highway significantly reduced travel time between the two cities.', 'Con đường cao tốc mới đã giảm đáng kể thời gian di chuyển giữa hai thành phố.', '{\"en\": \"The delivery truck broke down on the highway, causing a delay in our shipment schedule.\", \"vi\": \"Xe tải giao hàng bị hỏng trên đường cao tốc, gây ra sự chậm trễ trong lịch trình vận chuyển.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/highway-ljspeech-62156556.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/highway-cori-62156556.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/highway-e69127f7.webp', '[\"freeway\", \"expressway\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"busy highway\", \"meaning\": \"đường cao tốc đông đúc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"drive on the highway\", \"meaning\": \"lái xe trên đường cao tốc\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/highway-cori-62156556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/highway-aru0-62156556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/highway-aru5-62156556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/highway-aru6-62156556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/highway-aru10-62156556.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/highway-aru9-62156556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/highway-aru3-62156556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/highway-aru7-62156556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/highway-aru8-62156556.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/highway-aru2-62156556.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/obje