('da89e98f-1368-5564-b622-0a6833e9b37e', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'a2b053bd-6f18-51e4-be69-a09f76bdf405', '2c48eca4-42b0-54e7-b144-fac19c1b737b', 'fish', '/fɪʃ/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Loài động vật sống dưới nước có vảy và vây.', 'a creature that lives in water and breathes through gills.', 'We caught some fish for dinner by the lake.', 'Chúng tôi đã bắt được vài con cá để ăn tối bên hồ.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant serves fresh fish caught daily by local fishermen.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng phục vụ cá tươi do ngư dân địa phương đánh bắt hàng ngày.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-ljspeech-64875fcc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-cori-64875fcc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fish-a84e182b.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fresh fish\", \"meaning\": \"cá tươi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fish market\", \"meaning\": \"chợ cá\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"fish\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fishing\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"fishy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-cori-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-aru0-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-aru5-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-aru6-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-aru10-64875fcc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-aru9-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-aru3-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-aru7-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-aru8-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-aru2-64875fcc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-ljspeech-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-lt408-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-lt138-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-lt624-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-lt396-64875fcc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-lt498-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-lt132-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-lt288-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-lt42-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-lt90-64875fcc.mp3\"]}}', 'Số nhiều của fish vẫn là fish khi nói về cùng một loài.', 'dining', 1, 23),
('38639aca-5e45-5e4b-b1fa-086c4ca00ab6', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'a2b053bd-6f18-51e4-be69-a09f76bdf405', '2c48eca4-42b0-54e7-b144-fac19c1b737b', 'crosswalk', '/ˈkrɒswɔːk/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Khu vực được đánh dấu trên đường để người đi bộ băng qua.', 'a marked path where people can safely walk across a street or road.', 'Always look both ways before stepping onto the crosswalk.', 'Luôn nhìn cả hai phía trước khi bước lên vạch sang đường.', '{\"en\": \"Pedestrians should always use the designated crosswalk near the main entrance of the office building.\", \"vi\": \"Người đi bộ nên luôn sử dụng vạch sang đường được chỉ định gần lối vào chính của tòa nhà văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crosswalk-ljspeech-92920ac2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crosswalk-cori-92920ac2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/crosswalk-165c8596.webp', '[\"pedestrian crossing\", \"zebra crossing\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pedestrian crosswalk\", \"meaning\": \"vạch sang đường dành cho người đi bộ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"use the crosswalk\", \"meaning\": \"sử dụng vạch sang đường\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sidewalk\", \"note_vi\": \"vỉa hè dành cho người đi bộ, chạy dọc theo mép đường\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crosswalk-cori-92920ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crosswalk-aru0-92920ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crosswalk-aru5-92920ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crosswalk-aru6-92920ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crosswalk-aru10-92920ac2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crosswalk-aru9-92920ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crosswalk-aru3-92920ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crosswalk-aru7-92920ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crosswalk-aru8-92920ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crosswalk-aru2-92920ac2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crosswalk-ljspeech-92920ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crosswalk-lt408-92920ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crosswalk-lt138-92920ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crosswalk-lt624-92920ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crosswalk-lt396-92920ac2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crosswalk-lt498-92920ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crosswalk-lt132-92920ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crosswalk-lt288-92920ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crosswalk-lt42-92920ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crosswalk-lt90-92920ac2.mp3\"]}}', 'Người Anh thường dùng \'zebra crossing\' thay vì \'crosswalk\' của người Mỹ.', 'travel', 1, 24),
('8f83a1c2-45fe-556f-891d-9ec46851681a', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'a2b053bd-6f18-51e4-be69-a09f76bdf405', '2c48eca4-42b0-54e7-b144-fac19c1b737b', 'workout', '/ˈwɜːkaʊt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Buổi tập thể dục để giữ dáng hoặc tăng cường sức khỏe.', 'a period of physical exercise done to improve health or strength of the body.', 'I usually do a full-body workout three times a week.', 'Tôi thường tập toàn thân ba lần một tuần.', '{\"en\": \"Many staff members join the gym to finish a quick workout before the morning meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiều nhân viên tham gia phòng tập để hoàn thành buổi tập nhanh trước cuộc họp buổi sáng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workout-ljspeech-c8729250.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workout-cori-c8729250.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/workout-c0a35a3d.webp', '[\"exercise\", \"training\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"daily workout\", \"meaning\": \"buổi tập hàng ngày\"}, {\"phrase\": \"intense workout\", \"meaning\": \"buổi tập cường độ cao\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"work out\", \"note_vi\": \"Workout là danh từ (buổi tập), work out là cụm động từ (tập luyện).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"work out\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workout-cori-c8729250.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workout-aru0-c8729250.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workout-aru5-c8729250.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workout-aru6-c8729250.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workout-aru10-c8729250.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workout-aru9-c8729250.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workout-aru3-c8729250.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workout-aru7-c8729250.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workout-aru8-c8729250.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/