('b49535b9-11a7-58e2-a0de-16acec768db5', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'a48d147a-1a36-5e09-9aef-6e3ca4dc0ffc', '68c83442-2530-55b1-9414-e0184a2fabb7', 'driver', '/ˈdraɪvə(r)/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Người điều khiển phương tiện giao thông.', 'a person who controls and operates a road vehicle like a car or bus.', 'Our delivery driver carefully handed the fragile package directly to the receptionist.', 'Tài xế giao hàng của chúng tôi đã cẩn thận giao gói hàng dễ vỡ trực tiếp cho nhân viên lễ tân.', '{\"en\": \"The shuttle driver will pick up the clients from the airport at noon.\", \"vi\": \"Tài xế xe đưa đón sẽ đón khách hàng từ sân bay vào buổi trưa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-ljspeech-fdda0c46.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-cori-fdda0c46.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/driver-3ce831f9.webp', '[\"chauffeur\", \"motorist\"]', '[\"passenger\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"bus driver\", \"meaning\": \"tài xế xe buýt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"designated driver\", \"meaning\": \"tài xế được chỉ định (không uống rượu)\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"diver\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa là thợ lặn, viết thiếu chữ r\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"drive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-cori-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-aru0-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-aru5-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-aru6-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-aru10-fdda0c46.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-aru9-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-aru3-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-aru7-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-aru8-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/d