('162f9036-0921-5424-b20e-f3ad62b02bb7', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'ae99bef4-f684-521e-8ee0-51d3913ae609', '6c12be0b-07c5-554a-8d4e-6390d233789e', 'basketball', '/ˈbɑːskɪtbɔːl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Môn thể thao đồng đội chơi với một quả bóng và hai rổ.', 'a game played by two teams who try to throw a ball into a high net.', 'My brother loves playing basketball with his friends at the community center every weekend.', 'Anh trai tôi rất thích chơi bóng rổ với bạn bè ở trung tâm cộng đồng vào mỗi cuối tuần.', '{\"en\": \"Our company organized a basketball match to build team spirit among the new staff members.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi đã tổ chức một trận bóng rổ để xây dựng tinh thần đồng đội giữa các nhân viên mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basketball-ljspeech-468ee5cb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basketball-cori-468ee5cb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/basketball-c4334fc3.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"play basketball\", \"meaning\": \"chơi bóng rổ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"basketball court\", \"meaning\": \"sân bóng rổ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basketball-cori-468ee5cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basketball-aru0-468ee5cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basketball-aru5-468ee5cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basketball-aru6-468ee5cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basketball-aru10-468ee5cb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basketball-aru9-468ee5cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basketball-aru3-468ee5cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basketball-aru7-468ee5cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basketball-aru8-468ee5cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basketball-aru2-468ee5cb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/