('44ea04de-99d5-58b9-a6ef-47c6c532c68d', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'b130cef2-89ad-506b-a87d-587e513dbc25', 'b9a16e94-51db-5b34-a5c0-68721f304c28', 'sore throat', '/sɔː θrəʊt/', 'A2', 'phrase', 'Cảm giác đau hoặc khó chịu ở cổ họng.', 'a condition in which your neck hurts inside, usually because of a cold.', 'I woke up with a sore throat this morning, so I might have a cold.', 'Sáng nay tôi thức dậy với cổ họng bị đau, có lẽ tôi bị cảm lạnh.', '{\"en\": \"The receptionist called in sick today because she developed a severe sore throat.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên lễ tân đã xin nghỉ ốm hôm nay vì cô ấy bị đau họng nặng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sore-throat-ljspeech-852cec1c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sore-throat-cori-852cec1c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sore-throat-cbd5ac44.webp', '[\"throat infection\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"have a sore throat\", \"meaning\": \"bị đau họng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"soothe a sore throat\", \"meaning\": \"làm dịu cơn đau họng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sore-throat-cori-852cec1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sore-throat-aru0-852cec1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sore-throat-aru5-852cec1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sore-throat-aru6-852cec1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sore-throat-aru10-852cec1c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sore-throat-aru9-852cec1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sore-throat-aru3-852cec1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sore-throat-aru7-852cec1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sore-throat-aru8-852cec1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sore-throat-aru2-852cec1c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sore-throat-ljspeech-852cec1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sore-throat-lt408-852cec1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sore-throat-lt138-852cec1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sore-throat-lt624-852cec1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sore-throat-lt396-852cec1c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sore-throat-lt498-852cec1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sore-throat-lt132-852cec1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sore-throat-lt288-852cec1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sore-throat-lt42-852cec1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sore-throat-lt90-852cec1c.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ \'sore\' là tính từ chỉ sự đau nhức, thường đi kèm với các bộ phận cơ thể như \'sore eyes\', \'sore muscles\'.', 'health', 1, 17),
('a7893cc4-40c2-546a-93ac-acc26cbb1499', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'b130cef2-89ad-506b-a87d-587e513dbc25', 'b9a16e94-51db-5b34-a5c0-68721f304c28', 'meet', 'UK: /miːt/ | US: /miːt/', 'A1', 'verb', 'đáp ứng', 'to fulfill, satisfy, or comply with a set of requirements, expectations, or conditions.', 'We need to meet the project requirements.', 'Chúng ta cần đáp ứng các yêu cầu của dự án.', '{\"en\": \"The candidate easily met all the qualifications specified in the job posting.\", \"vi\": \"Ứng viên đã dễ dàng đáp ứng tất cả các tiêu chuẩn trình độ được nêu trong bản tuyển dụng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meet-ljspeech-392d7871.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meet-cori-392d7871.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/meet-aacb16b6.webp', '[\"fulfill\", \"satisfy\", \"comply with\", \"match\"]', '[\"fail\", \"miss\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"meet requirements\", \"meaning\": \"đáp ứng các yêu cầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"meet a deadline\", \"meaning\": \"kịp thời hạn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"meet expectations\", \"meaning\": \"đáp ứng kỳ vọng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"meeting\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meet-cori-392d7871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meet-aru0-392d7871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meet-aru5-392d7871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meet-aru6-392d7871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meet-aru10-392d7871.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meet-aru9-392d7871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meet-aru3-392d7871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meet-aru7-392d7871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meet-aru8-392d7871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meet-aru2-392d7871.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meet-ljspeech-392d7871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meet-lt408-392d7871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meet-lt138-392d7871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meet-lt624-392d7871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meet-lt396-392d7871.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meet-lt498-392d7871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meet-lt132-392d7871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meet-lt288-392d7871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meet-lt42-392d7871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meet-lt90-392d7871.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, \"meet\" rất hay dùng với nghĩa \"đáp ứng\" (đi cùng requirements, deadlines, standards, needs), không chỉ có nghĩa là \"gặp mặt\".', 'personnel', 1, 18),
('0295c9a9-07c6-5077-9c7f-d64b856ac2ff', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'b130cef2-89ad-506b-a87d-587e513dbc25', 'b9a16e94-51db-5b34-a5c0-68721f304c28', 'relaxed', '/rɪˈlækst/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy thoải mái, không căng thẳng.', 'feeling calm and comfortable because you are not worried or busy with any work.', 'After a long vacation, I feel completely relaxed and ready to work.', 'Sau một kỳ nghỉ dài, tôi cảm thấy hoàn toàn thư giãn và sẵn sàng làm việc.', '{\"en\": \"After the busy project deadline, the team felt relaxed during the company\'s weekend retreat event.\", \"vi\": \"Sau thời hạn dự án bận rộn, cả nhóm cảm thấy thư giãn trong sự kiện nghỉ dưỡng cuối tuần của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relaxed-ljspeech-00174a5c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relaxed-cori-00174a5c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/relaxed-9eb055b1.webp', '[\"calm\", \"rested\"]', '[\"stressed\", \"tense\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel relaxed\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy thư giãn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"relaxed atmosphere\", \"meaning\": \"bầu không khí thư giãn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"relaxing\", \"note_vi\": \"relaxing (làm cho thư giãn), relaxed (cảm thấy thư giãn).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"relax\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"relaxation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relaxed-cori-00174a5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relaxed-aru0-00174a5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relaxed-aru5-00174a5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relaxed-aru6-00174a5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relaxed-aru10-00174a5c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relaxed-aru9-00174a5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relaxed-aru3-00174a5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relaxed-aru7-00174a5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relaxed-aru8-00174a5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relaxed-aru2-00174a5c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relaxed-ljspeech-00174a5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relaxed-lt408-00174a5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relaxed-lt138-00174a5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relaxed-lt624-00174a5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relaxed-lt396-00174a5c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relaxed-lt498-00174a5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relaxed-lt132-00174a5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relaxed-lt288-00174a5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relaxed-lt42-00174a5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relaxed-lt90-00174a5c.mp3\"]}}', 'cẩn thận nhầm lẫn giữa đuôi -ed (cảm xúc) và -ing (tính chất).', 'daily', 1, 19),
('63e6bc74-618e-5857-a26a-04dff02881fd', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'b130cef2-89ad-506b-a87d-587e513dbc25', 'b9a16e94-51db-5b34-a5c0-68721f304c28', 'desert', '/ˈdezət/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Vùng đất khô cằn, ít mưa và có rất ít thực vật.', 'a large area of land with very little water and very few plants.', 'The Sahara Desert is the largest hot desert in the world.', 'Sa mạc Sahara là sa mạc nóng lớn nhất thế giới.', '{\"en\": \"The logistics company planned a new route across the desert to deliver supplies more efficiently.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty hậu cần đã lên kế hoạch cho một tuyến đường mới băng qua sa mạc để giao hàng hiệu quả hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-ljspeech-2d5128d7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-cori-2d5128d7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/desert-a8a540d4.webp', '[\"wasteland\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"desert climate\", \"meaning\": \"khí hậu sa mạc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"vast desert\", \"meaning\": \"sa mạc bao la\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dessert\", \"note_vi\": \"dessert (2 chữ s) là món tráng miệng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"deserted\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-cori-2d5128d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-aru0-2d5128d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-aru5-2d5128d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-aru6-2d5128d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-aru10-2d5128d7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-aru9-2d5128d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-aru3-2d5128d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-aru7-2d5128d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-aru8-2d5128d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desert-aru2-2d5128d7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/stor