('a9a33a77-41dd-55a2-a08a-d3c517b676b6', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'b130cef2-89ad-506b-a87d-587e513dbc25', 'b9a16e94-51db-5b34-a5c0-68721f304c28', 'oil', '/ɔɪl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Chất lỏng nhớt, không tan trong nước, dùng làm nhiên liệu, bôi trơn hoặc nấu ăn.', 'a thick liquid that comes from the ground and is used as fuel or for machines.', 'Crude oil prices have increased significantly this year.', 'Giá dầu thô đã tăng đáng kể trong năm nay.', '{\"en\": \"The mechanic recommended changing the engine oil every six months to keep the delivery truck running.\", \"vi\": \"Thợ máy khuyên nên thay dầu động cơ sáu tháng một lần để giữ cho xe tải giao hàng hoạt động.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-ljspeech-a5f58c39.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-cori-a5f58c39.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/oil-e899d6c3.webp', '[\"fuel\", \"petroleum\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"crude oil\", \"meaning\": \"dầu thô\"}, {\"phrase\": \"engine oil\", \"meaning\": \"dầu nhớt động cơ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"olive oil\", \"meaning\": \"dầu ô liu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"oily\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-cori-a5f58c39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-aru0-a5f58c39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-aru5-a5f58c39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-aru6-a5f58c39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-aru10-a5f58c39.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-aru9-a5f58c39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-aru3-a5f58c39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-aru7-a5f58c39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-aru8-a5f58c39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-aru2-a5f58c39.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciat