('d0264e26-8a70-5e30-9243-a243e13bbf37', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'b130cef2-89ad-506b-a87d-587e513dbc25', 'b9a16e94-51db-5b34-a5c0-68721f304c28', 'end', '', 'A1', 'preposition', 'cuối, tận cùng', 'Located at the furthest point, final limit, or conclusion of a space or time period.', 'At the end of the road, you will find the library.', 'Cuối con đường là thư viện.', '{\"en\": \"All department financial reports must be finalized by the end of the quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả báo cáo tài chính của phòng ban phải được hoàn tất trước cuối quý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-ljspeech-7a92f3d2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-cori-7a92f3d2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/end-4f65480c.webp', '[\"conclusion\", \"close\", \"termination\"]', '[\"beginning\", \"start\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"at the end of\", \"meaning\": \"vào cuối của\"}, {\"phrase\": \"by the end of\", \"meaning\": \"trước thời điểm cuối của\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"and\", \"note_vi\": \"\'and\' là liên từ có nghĩa là \'và\', tránh nhầm lẫn về mặt phát âm với \'end\'.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"end\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"endless\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"ending\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-cori-7a92f3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-aru0-7a92f3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-aru5-7a92f3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-aru6-7a92f3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-aru10-7a92f3d2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-aru9-7a92f3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-aru3-7a92f3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-aru7-7a92f3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-aru8-7a92f3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-aru2-7a92f3d2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-ljspeech-7a92f3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-lt408-7a92f3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-lt138-7a92f3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-lt624-7a92f3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-lt396-7a92f3d2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-lt498-7a92f3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-lt132-7a92f3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-lt288-7a92f3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-lt42-7a92f3d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/end-lt90-7a92f3d2.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ cảnh giới từ/thời gian, thường xuất hiện trong cụm \'at the end of\' (vào thời điểm cuối) hoặc \'by the end of\' (trước thời điểm cuối).', 'office', 1, 29),
('5907f3d5-f719-5fa7-9772-69392dbf4264', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'b17f39b3-f658-5533-a46c-58988bc4e5fd', '4898fbe9-4494-5439-9efb-ffc8274360de', 'online shopping', '/ɒnlaɪn ˈʃɒpɪŋ/', 'A2', 'phrase', 'Hoạt động mua hàng hóa hoặc dịch vụ qua internet.', 'the activity of buying goods or services over the internet using a computer or phone.', 'Many people prefer online shopping because it\'s convenient and they can compare prices easily.', 'Nhiều người thích mua sắm trực tuyến vì nó tiện lợi và họ có thể dễ dàng so sánh giá cả.', '{\"en\": \"Many retail businesses are expanding their online shopping platforms to reach more customers across the country.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiều doanh nghiệp bán lẻ đang mở rộng nền tảng mua sắm trực tuyến để tiếp cận nhiều khách hàng hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/online-shopping-ljspeech-b3890f82.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/online-shopping-cori-b3890f82.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/online-shopping-a5ad68a8.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"do online shopping\", \"meaning\": \"mua sắm trực tuyến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"online shopping cart\", \"meaning\": \"giỏ hàng trực tuyến\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/online-shopping-cori-b3890f82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/online-shopping-aru0-b3890f82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/online-shopping-aru5-b3890f82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/online-shopping-aru6-b3890f82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/online-shopping-aru10-b3890f82.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/online-shopping-aru9-b3890f82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/online-shopping-aru3-b3890f82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/online-shopping-aru7-b3890f82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/online-s