('04aa24c4-ef68-5c03-aa0b-c66ce5e21017', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'b17f39b3-f658-5533-a46c-58988bc4e5fd', '4898fbe9-4494-5439-9efb-ffc8274360de', 'cylinder', '/ˈsɪlɪndə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hình khối có hai đáy là hình tròn song song và một mặt cong.', 'a solid or hollow object with straight sides and two circular ends.', 'The engine of the car has four cylinders, which help power the vehicle.', 'Động cơ ô tô có bốn xi-lanh, giúp cung cấp năng lượng cho xe.', '{\"en\": \"The technician replaced the damaged metal cylinder in the printing machine this morning.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên đã thay thế ống trụ kim loại bị hỏng trong máy in sáng nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cylinder-ljspeech-24a1ee58.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cylinder-cori-24a1ee58.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cylinder-a427d54b.webp', '[\"tube\", \"barrel\", \"column\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"gas cylinder\", \"meaning\": \"bình ga\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hydraulic cylinder\", \"meaning\": \"xi lanh thủy lực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cylinder head\", \"meaning\": \"nắp xi lanh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sphere\", \"note_vi\": \"sphere là hình cầu, cylinder là hình trụ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"cylindrical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cylinder-cori-24a1ee58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cylinder-aru0-24a1ee58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cylinder-aru5-24a1ee58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cylinder-aru6-24a1ee58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cylinder-aru10-24a1ee58.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cylinder-aru9-24a1ee58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cylinder-aru3-24a1ee58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cylinder-aru7-24a1ee58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/