('4c709ce1-a8f8-5aa0-b1e5-9545c837a868', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'b17f39b3-f658-5533-a46c-58988bc4e5fd', '4898fbe9-4494-5439-9efb-ffc8274360de', 'scientist', '/ˈsaɪəntɪst/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Người nghiên cứu khoa học để khám phá kiến thức mới.', 'a person who studies or works in one of the natural or physical sciences.', 'The young scientist presented her groundbreaking research at the conference.', 'Nhà khoa học trẻ đã trình bày nghiên cứu đột phá của cô ấy tại hội nghị.', '{\"en\": \"The pharmaceutical company hired a famous scientist to lead the new research project.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty dược phẩm đã thuê một nhà khoa học nổi tiếng để dẫn dắt dự án nghiên cứu mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scientist-ljspeech-dd3fb353.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scientist-cori-dd3fb353.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/scientist-a6f369af.webp', '[\"researcher\", \"scholar\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"research scientist\", \"meaning\": \"nhà khoa học nghiên cứu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"political scientist\", \"meaning\": \"nhà khoa học chính trị\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"science\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"scientific\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"scientifically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scientist-cori-dd3fb353.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scientist-aru0-dd3fb353.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scientist-aru5-dd3fb353.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scientist-aru6-dd3fb353.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scientist-aru10-dd3fb353.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scientist-aru9-dd3fb353.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scientist-aru3-dd3fb353.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scientist-aru7-dd3fb353.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scientist-aru8-dd3fb353.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scientist-aru2-dd3fb353.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scientist-ljspeech-dd3fb353.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scientist-lt408-dd3fb353.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scientist-lt138-dd3fb353.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scientist-lt624-dd3fb353.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scientist-lt396-dd3fb353.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scientist-lt498-dd3fb353.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scientist-lt132-dd3fb353.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scientist-lt288-dd3fb353.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scientist-lt42-dd3fb353.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scientist-lt90-dd3fb353.mp3\"]}}', 'Đuôi -ist chỉ người, phân biệt với science (môn khoa học) và scientific (thuộc khoa học).', 'technology', 1, 24),
('032276d0-e46a-595e-8217-6f910603ff78', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'b17f39b3-f658-5533-a46c-58988bc4e5fd', '4898fbe9-4494-5439-9efb-ffc8274360de', 'soft', 'UK: /sɒft/ | US: /sɔft/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'nhẹ, mềm, không mạnh', 'gentle, quiet, or relating to personal qualities rather than technical knowledge', 'This position requires both technical expertise and soft skills for effective communication.', 'Vị trí này đòi hỏi cả chuyên môn kỹ thuật và kỹ năng mềm để giao tiếp hiệu quả.', '{\"en\": \"The hiring manager emphasized that candidates should possess strong soft skills alongside technical expertise.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý tuyển dụng nhấn mạnh rằng các ứng viên nên có kỹ năng mềm tốt bên cạnh chuyên môn kỹ thuật.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-ljspeech-eb74f2cb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-cori-eb74f2cb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/soft-39bbc5f1.webp', '[\"gentle\", \"mild\", \"slight\"]', '[\"hard\", \"firm\", \"harsh\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"soft skills\", \"meaning\": \"kỹ năng mềm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"soft copy\", \"meaning\": \"bản sao điện tử (tệp tin trên máy tính)\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"soften\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"softly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-cori-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-aru0-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-aru5-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-aru6-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-aru10-eb74f2cb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-aru9-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-aru3-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-aru7-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-aru8-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-aru2-eb74f2cb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-ljspeech-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-lt408-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-lt138-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-lt624-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-lt396-eb74f2cb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-lt498-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-lt132-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-lt288-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-lt42-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-lt90-eb74f2cb.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong môi trường công sở, \"soft skills\" (kỹ năng mềm) là cụm từ rất hay xuất hiện trong bài thi TOEIC.', 'personnel', 1, 25)
