('a0372c24-ecc7-5b19-a063-65d3258dd123', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'b59aadbe-f501-504e-95d2-1cb11c3220ef', '6687f425-d6c1-5b45-bcdb-22f80b173c8a', 'actor', '/ˈæktə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Nam diễn viên điện ảnh, sân khấu.', 'An individual who portrays characters in theatrical productions, motion pictures, or broadcast media.', 'The main actor delivered a powerful performance that moved the audience.', 'Nam diễn viên chính đã có một màn trình diễn mạnh mẽ khiến khán giả xúc động.', '{\"en\": \"The famous actor was hired to promote our new line of luxury office furniture.\", \"vi\": \"Nam diễn viên nổi tiếng đã được thuê để quảng bá dòng sản phẩm nội thất văn phòng cao cấp của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actor-ljspeech-4ed3655e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actor-cori-4ed3655e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/actor-9febaa9a.webp', '[\"performer\", \"star\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"famous actor\", \"meaning\": \"diễn viên nổi tiếng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lead actor\", \"meaning\": \"diễn viên chính\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"actress\", \"note_vi\": \"actor dùng cho nam, actress dùng cho nữ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"actress\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"acting\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actor-cori-4ed3655e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actor-aru0-4ed3655e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actor-aru5-4ed3655e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actor-aru6-4ed3655e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actor-aru10-4ed3655e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actor-aru9-4ed3655e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actor-aru3-4ed3655e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actor-aru7-4ed3655e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actor-aru8-4ed3655e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actor-aru2-4ed3655e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actor-ljspeech-4ed3655e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actor-lt408-4ed3655e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actor-lt138-4ed3655e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actor-lt624-4ed3655e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actor-lt396-4ed3655e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actor-lt498-4ed3655e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actor-lt132-4ed3655e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actor-lt288-4ed3655e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actor-lt42-4ed3655e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actor-lt90-4ed3655e.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngày nay actor có thể dùng cho cả nam và nữ.', 'media', 1, 5),
('96fff1b8-e117-55c7-87ae-f7055f3e3d3e', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'b59aadbe-f501-504e-95d2-1cb11c3220ef', '6687f425-d6c1-5b45-bcdb-22f80b173c8a', 'doctor', '/ˈdɒktə(r)/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Người có bằng cấp y khoa và khám chữa bệnh.', 'a professional person who is trained to treat people who are ill or injured.', 'The resident doctor carefully reviewed the medical report before prescribing the medication.', 'Bác sĩ nội trú đã cẩn thận xem xét báo cáo y tế trước khi kê đơn thuốc.', '{\"en\": \"The company doctor provides regular health check-ups for all employees at the office site.\", \"vi\": \"Bác sĩ của công ty cung cấp các buổi kiểm tra sức khỏe định kỳ cho tất cả nhân viên tại văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-ljspeech-1f016007.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-cori-1f016007.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/doctor-83c31124.webp', '[\"physician\", \"medical practitioner\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"company doctor\", \"meaning\": \"bác sĩ công ty\"}, {\"phrase\": \"see a doctor\", \"meaning\": \"đi khám bác sĩ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"medical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-cori-1f016007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-aru0-1f016007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-aru5-1f016007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-aru6-1f016007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-aru10-1f016007.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-aru9-1f016007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-aru3-1f016007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-aru7-1f016007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-aru8-1f016007.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctor-aru2-1f016007.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu