('f6fb1f73-acce-5948-8a28-d9e68c686603', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'b59aadbe-f501-504e-95d2-1cb11c3220ef', '6687f425-d6c1-5b45-bcdb-22f80b173c8a', 'food', '/fuːd/', '', 'noun', 'Thực phẩm dùng để ăn, nuôi sống cơ thể.', 'things that people or animals eat to stay alive and healthy.', 'I love trying different kinds of food when I travel to new countries.', 'Tôi thích thử các loại đồ ăn khác nhau khi đi du lịch đến các quốc gia mới.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel provides fresh food for all guests during the morning breakfast buffet service.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn cung cấp đồ ăn tươi cho tất cả khách trong suốt dịch vụ ăn sáng tự chọn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/food-ljspeech-39ccb32d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/food-cori-39ccb32d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/food-1849e209.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/food-cori-39ccb32d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/food-aru0-39ccb32d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/food-aru5-39ccb32d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/food-aru6-39ccb32d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/food-aru10-39ccb32d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/food-aru9-39ccb32d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/food-aru3-39ccb32d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/food-aru7-39ccb32d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/food-aru8-39ccb32d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/food-aru2-39ccb32d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/food-ljspeech-39ccb32d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/food-lt408-39ccb32d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/food-lt138-39ccb32d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/food-lt624-39ccb32d.mp3\", \"/storage/