('756ff3c6-74e9-5d0f-bc0d-77ec6854efe8', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'b59aadbe-f501-504e-95d2-1cb11c3220ef', '6687f425-d6c1-5b45-bcdb-22f80b173c8a', 'vaccine', '/ˈvæksiːn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'chế phẩm sinh học dùng để tạo miễn dịch chống bệnh', 'A biological preparation that stimulates body immunity against a particular infectious organism.', 'Scientists are working hard to develop new vaccines for various diseases.', 'Các nhà khoa học đang nỗ lực phát triển các loại vắc-xin mới cho nhiều bệnh khác nhau.', '{\"en\": \"The company is offering a free flu vaccine to all employees at the onsite clinic.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đang cung cấp vắc-xin cúm miễn phí cho tất cả nhân viên tại phòng khám tại chỗ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vaccine-ljspeech-7f5b51b6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vaccine-cori-7f5b51b6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/vaccine-71482be6.webp', '[\"immunization\", \"inoculation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"flu vaccine\", \"meaning\": \"vắc-xin cúm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"get a vaccine\", \"meaning\": \"tiêm vắc-xin\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"vaccinate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"vaccination\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vaccine-cori-7f5b51b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vaccine-aru0-7f5b51b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vaccine-aru5-7f5b51b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vaccine-aru6-7f5b51b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vaccine-aru10-7f5b51b6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vaccine-aru9-7f5b51b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vaccine-aru3-7f5b51b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vaccine-aru7-7f5b51b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vaccine-aru8-7f5b51b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vaccine-aru2-7f5b51b6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vaccine-ljspeech-7f5b51b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vaccine-lt408-7f5b51b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vaccine-lt138-7f5b51b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vaccine-lt624-7f5b51b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vaccine-lt396-7f5b51b6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vaccine-lt498-7f5b51b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vaccine-lt132-7f5b51b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vaccine-lt288-7f5b51b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vaccine-lt42-7f5b51b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vaccine-lt90-7f5b51b6.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này rất phổ biến trong các thông báo phúc lợi nhân viên của doanh nghiệp.', 'health', 1, 10),
('6cbe0c0a-bf19-54d8-9b90-78b55942f60a', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'b59aadbe-f501-504e-95d2-1cb11c3220ef', '6687f425-d6c1-5b45-bcdb-22f80b173c8a', 'stay', 'UK: /steɪ/ | US: /steɪ/', 'A1', 'verb', 'ở lại', 'to remain in a particular place or position rather than leaving or going elsewhere.', 'I need to stay in the office late to finish this report.', 'Tôi cần ở lại văn phòng muộn để hoàn thành báo cáo này.', '{\"en\": \"Most international representatives decided to stay at the hotel near the convention center.\", \"vi\": \"Hầu hết các đại biểu quốc tế đã quyết định ở lại khách sạn gần trung tâm hội nghị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-ljspeech-396f9974.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-cori-396f9974.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stay-0306b08e.webp', '[\"remain\", \"reside\", \"lodge\"]', '[\"leave\", \"depart\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"stay focused\", \"meaning\": \"giữ sự tập trung\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stay overnight\", \"meaning\": \"ở lại qua đêm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"stay\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-cori-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-aru0-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-aru5-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-aru6-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-aru10-396f9974.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-aru9-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-aru3-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-aru7-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-aru8-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-aru2-396f9974.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-ljspeech-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-lt408-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-lt138-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-lt624-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-lt396-396f9974.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-lt498-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-lt132-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-lt288-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-lt42-396f9974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stay-lt90-396f9974.mp3\"]}}', '\'Stay\' có thể đóng vai trò liên động từ (linking verb) đi với tính từ mang nghĩa \'giữ nguyên trạng thái\' (vd: stay focused, stay calm).', 'travel', 1, 11),
('e777501e-ad18-5d23-ba74-f70a1b01e539', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'b59aadbe-f501-504e-95d2-1cb11c3220ef', '6687f425-d6c1-5b45-bcdb-22f80b173c8a', 'hostel', '/ˈhɒstl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Nơi ở giá rẻ, thường dành cho sinh viên hoặc khách du lịch ba lô.', 'a cheap place where travelers, especially young people, can stay and eat.', 'During my trip to Europe, I stayed in a cozy hostel in Berlin.', 'Trong chuyến đi châu Âu, tôi đã ở một nhà nghỉ ấm cúng ở Berlin.', '{\"en\": \"The budget travel agency recommended a clean hostel near the central station for the students.\", \"vi\": \"Đại lý du lịch giá rẻ đã đề xuất một nhà nghỉ sạch sẽ gần ga trung tâm cho các sinh viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-ljspeech-028cd03a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-cori-028cd03a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hostel-763b2123.webp', '[\"dormitory\", \"inn\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"youth hostel\", \"meaning\": \"nhà nghỉ thanh niên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stay in a hostel\", \"meaning\": \"ở trong nhà nghỉ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hotel\", \"note_vi\": \"khách sạn, thường sang trọng và riêng tư hơn\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-cori-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-aru0-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-aru5-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-aru6-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-aru10-028cd03a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-aru9-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-aru3-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-aru7-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-aru8-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-aru2-028cd03a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\