('6f40e6f6-6026-565e-8c39-9628b84e6599', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'b59aadbe-f501-504e-95d2-1cb11c3220ef', '6687f425-d6c1-5b45-bcdb-22f80b173c8a', 'line', 'UK: /laɪn/ | US: /laɪn/', 'A1', 'noun', 'dòng sản phẩm', 'a series of similar commercial goods offered for sale by a manufacturer.', 'The company launched a new product line.', 'Công ty đã ra mắt một dòng sản phẩm mới.', '{\"en\": \"The company plans to launch a new line of eco-friendly office supplies next month.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty có kế hoạch ra mắt một dòng văn phòng phẩm thân thiện với môi trường mới vào tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/line-ljspeech-264f39ca.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/line-cori-264f39ca.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/line-3138809d.webp', '[\"range\", \"series\", \"selection\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"product line\", \"meaning\": \"dòng sản phẩm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"expand the line\", \"meaning\": \"mở rộng dòng sản phẩm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"line\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/line-cori-264f39ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/line-aru0-264f39ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/line-aru5-264f39ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/line-aru6-264f39ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/line-aru10-264f39ca.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/line-aru9-264f39ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/line-aru3-264f39ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/line-aru7-264f39ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/line-aru8-264f39ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/line-aru2-264f39ca.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/line-ljspeech-264f39ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/line-lt408-264f39ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/line-lt138-264f39ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/line-lt624-264f39ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/line-lt396-264f39ca.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/line-lt498-264f39ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/line-lt132-264f39ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/line-lt288-264f39ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/line-lt42-264f39ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/line-lt90-264f39ca.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ cảnh kinh doanh, \'line\' thường mang nghĩa dòng sản phẩm (\'product line\') của một công ty.', 'marketing', 1, 13),
('e87c5a25-21ea-521d-9f7e-f728cbbe1efc', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'b59aadbe-f501-504e-95d2-1cb11c3220ef', '6687f425-d6c1-5b45-bcdb-22f80b173c8a', 'chalkboard', '/ˈtʃɔːkbɔːd/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một bề mặt phẳng, thường màu đen hoặc xanh lá, dùng để viết bằng phấn.', 'a large board on a wall used by teachers for writing with special colored sticks.', 'An assistant erased the previous notes from the large chalkboard before class started.', 'Một trợ lý đã xóa các ghi chú trước đó khỏi chiếc bảng đen lớn trước khi lớp học bắt đầu.', '{\"en\": \"The instructor used the chalkboard to illustrate the new workflow process for the trainees.\", \"vi\": \"Người hướng dẫn đã dùng bảng để minh họa quy trình làm việc mới cho các thực tập sinh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chalkboard-ljspeech-fc6daa73.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chalkboard-cori-fc6daa73.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/chalkboard-19aff6aa.webp', '[\"blackboard\", \"whiteboard\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"write on the chalkboard\", \"meaning\": \"viết lên bảng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clean the chalkboard\", \"meaning\": \"lau bảng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"whiteboard\", \"note_vi\": \"Whiteboard dùng bút dạ, chalkboard dùng phấn.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chalkboard-cori-fc6daa73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chalkboard-aru0-fc6daa73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chalkboard-aru5-fc6daa73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chalkboard-aru6-fc6daa73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chalkboard-aru10-fc6daa73.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chalkboard-aru9-fc6daa73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chalkboard-aru3-fc6daa73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chalkboard-aru7-fc6daa73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chalkboard-aru8-fc6daa73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chalkboard-aru2-fc6daa73.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chalkboard-ljspeech-fc6daa73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chalkboard-lt408-fc6daa73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chalkboard-lt138-fc6daa73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chalkboard-lt624-fc6daa73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chalkboard-lt396-fc6daa73.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chalkboard-lt498-fc6daa73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chalkboard-lt132-fc6daa73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chalkboard-lt288-fc6daa73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chalkboard-lt42-fc6daa73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chalkboard-lt90-fc6daa73.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngày nay văn phòng thường dùng \'whiteboard\' hơn là \'chalkboard\'.', 'education', 1, 14),
('762cb374-9c0c-5579-8ba1-547eaaf281e1', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'b59aadbe-f501-504e-95d2-1cb11c3220ef', '6687f425-d6c1-5b45-bcdb-22f80b173c8a', 'cat', '/kæt/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Động vật nhỏ, có lông, thường được nuôi làm thú cưng.', 'a small animal with soft fur and whiskers kept as a pet.', 'My neighbor\'s cat loves to chase butterflies in the garden.', 'Con mèo của hàng xóm tôi thích đuổi bướm trong vườn.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel permits guests to bring a small pet cat into their private room.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn cho phép khách mang theo một con mèo nhỏ vào phòng riêng của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cat-ljspeech-9d989e8d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cat-cori-9d989e8d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cat-1b54ea0f.webp', '[\"feline\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"stray cat\", \"meaning\": \"mèo hoang\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pet cat\", \"meaning\": \"mèo cảnh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cap\", \"note_vi\": \"phát âm hơi giống nhưng cap nghĩa là mũ lưỡi trai\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cat-cori-9d989e8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cat-aru0-9d989e8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cat-aru5-9d989e8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cat-aru6-9d989e8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cat-aru10-9d989e8d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cat-aru9-9d989e8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cat-aru3-9d989e8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cat-aru7-9d989e8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cat-aru8-9d989e8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cat-aru2-9d989e8d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cat-ljspeech-9d989e8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cat-lt408-9d989e8d.mp3\", \"/storag