('7dfe88f6-6fbd-5628-93c8-c519d27a609f', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'b8d1a942-2cce-54d8-9ec9-44aa85d15573', '2ac1672d-6e56-566b-92be-4c44c149321d', 'rest', '/rest/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Dừng làm việc hoặc hoạt động để thư giãn, lấy lại sức.', 'to stop working or moving in order to relax and regain your energy.', 'After a long hike, we decided to rest by the river for an hour.', 'Sau một chuyến đi bộ dài, chúng tôi quyết định nghỉ ngơi bên sông một giờ.', '{\"en\": \"After completing the project, the team decided to rest for two days before starting again.\", \"vi\": \"Sau khi hoàn thành dự án, cả nhóm quyết định nghỉ ngơi hai ngày trước khi bắt đầu lại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-ljspeech-27ad1672.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-cori-27ad1672.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rest-9cd862b0.webp', '[\"relax\", \"pause\"]', '[\"work\", \"exert\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"rest period\", \"meaning\": \"thời gian nghỉ ngơi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"take a rest\", \"meaning\": \"nghỉ ngơi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"restful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-cori-27ad1672.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-aru0-27ad1672.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-aru5-27ad1672.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-aru6-27ad1672.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-aru10-27ad1672.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-aru9-27ad1672.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-aru3-27ad1672.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-aru7-27ad1672.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-aru8-27ad1672.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-aru2-27ad1672.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rest-ljspeech-27ad1672.