('a063303c-a6f0-5cc4-b257-11690d23b843', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'b8d1a942-2cce-54d8-9ec9-44aa85d15573', '2ac1672d-6e56-566b-92be-4c44c149321d', 'thick', '/θɪk/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Có độ dày lớn; không mỏng.', 'Characterized by a considerable distance separating opposite surfaces or outer edges.', 'The technician referred to a thick instruction manual before starting the repairs.', 'Kỹ thuật viên đã tham khảo một cuốn sách hướng dẫn dày trước khi bắt đầu sửa chữa.', '{\"en\": \"The manual is printed on thick paper to last longer.\", \"vi\": \"Quyển hướng dẫn được in trên giấy dày để bền hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-ljspeech-8fb4cd18.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-cori-8fb4cd18.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/thick-61bc929f.webp', NULL, '[\"thin\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"thick fog\", \"meaning\": \"sương mù dày đặc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"thick book\", \"meaning\": \"sách dày\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"thumb\", \"note_vi\": \"thumb là ngón cái, phát âm khác thick.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"thickness\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"thicken\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-cori-8fb4cd18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-aru0-8fb4cd18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-aru5-8fb4cd18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-aru6-8fb4cd18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-aru10-8fb4cd18.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-aru9-8fb4cd18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-aru3-8fb4cd18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-aru7-8fb4cd18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-aru8-8fb4cd18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-aru2-8fb4cd18.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-ljspeech-8fb4cd18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-lt408-8fb4cd18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-lt138-8fb4cd18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-lt624-8fb4cd18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-lt396-8fb4cd18.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-lt498-8fb4cd18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-lt132-8fb4cd18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-lt288-8fb4cd18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-lt42-8fb4cd18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thick-lt90-8fb4cd18.mp3\"]}}', 'Không dùng \'thick\' cho người béo, dùng \'fat\'.', 'manufacturing', 1, 5),
('3ab866a8-1dcc-5950-8b57-66ec051e5e77', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'b8d1a942-2cce-54d8-9ec9-44aa85d15573', '2ac1672d-6e56-566b-92be-4c44c149321d', 'plastic', '/ˈplæstɪk/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Vật liệu tổng hợp nhân tạo, thường nhẹ và bền, dùng làm nhiều đồ vật.', 'a light material made by chemical processes that is used to make many things.', 'Many single-use items, like straws and bags, are made of plastic.', 'Nhiều đồ dùng một lần, như ống hút và túi, được làm từ nhựa.', '{\"en\": \"Our company is replacing all plastic packaging with eco-friendly paper to protect the environment.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi đang thay thế tất cả bao bì nhựa bằng giấy thân thiện với môi trường.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-ljspeech-141a29d5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-cori-141a29d5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/plastic-e8beae01.webp', '[\"synthetic material\", \"polymer\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"plastic bottle\", \"meaning\": \"chai nhựa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"plastic waste\", \"meaning\": \"rác thải nhựa\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-cori-141a29d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-aru0-141a29d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-aru5-141a29d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-aru6-141a29d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-aru10-141a29d5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-aru9-141a29d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-aru3-141a29d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-aru7-141a29d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-aru8-141a29d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic-aru2-141a29d5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plastic