('6fe8c44f-6bfd-525a-9cb1-f9b9a260153d', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'b8d1a942-2cce-54d8-9ec9-44aa85d15573', '2ac1672d-6e56-566b-92be-4c44c149321d', 'doubtful', '/ˈdaʊtfl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Không chắc chắn, có sự nghi ngờ hoặc không có khả năng xảy ra.', 'Lacking conviction or certainty regarding the truth, success, or likelihood of an outcome.', 'It\'s doubtful that the project will be completed on time given the current delays.', 'Khó có khả năng dự án sẽ hoàn thành đúng hạn do những trì hoãn hiện tại.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was doubtful of the new supplier\'s product quality.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý nghi ngờ về chất lượng sản phẩm của nhà cung cấp mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doubtful-ljspeech-a66ad0d7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doubtful-cori-a66ad0d7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/doubtful-6d42fd57.webp', '[\"uncertain\", \"skeptical\"]', '[\"certain\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"doubtful about\", \"meaning\": \"nghi ngờ về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"doubtful of\", \"meaning\": \"nghi ngờ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"remain doubtful\", \"meaning\": \"vẫn nghi ngờ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"doubt\", \"note_vi\": \"doubt là nghi ngờ, doubtful là mang tính nghi ngờ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"doubt\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"doubt\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doubtful-cori-a66ad0d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doubtful-aru0-a66ad0d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doubtful-aru5-a66ad0d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doubtful-aru6-a66ad0d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doubtful-aru10-a66ad0d7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doubtful-aru9-a66ad0d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doubtful-aru3-a66ad0d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doubtful-aru7-a6