('f2aef283-66b3-5d9f-a0bf-36ac2bf7bb7f', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'b8d1a942-2cce-54d8-9ec9-44aa85d15573', '2ac1672d-6e56-566b-92be-4c44c149321d', 'beef', '/biːf/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Thịt từ con bò, dùng làm thực phẩm.', 'the meat from a cow that is eaten as food.', 'The upscale restaurant is famous for serving tender steaks made from high-quality imported beef.', 'Nhà hàng sang trọng này nổi tiếng với việc phục vụ các món bít tết mềm làm từ thịt bò nhập khẩu chất lượng cao.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant manager ordered twenty kilos of fresh beef for the event.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý nhà hàng đã đặt hai mươi ký thịt bò tươi cho sự kiện.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-ljspeech-1b57bbec.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-cori-1b57bbec.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/beef-ecc8741e.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"roast beef\", \"meaning\": \"thịt bò quay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"beef steak\", \"meaning\": \"bít tết thịt bò\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-cori-1b57bbec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-aru0-1b57bbec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-aru5-1b57bbec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-aru6-1b57bbec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-aru10-1b57bbec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-aru9-1b57bbec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-aru3-1b57bbec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-aru7-1b57bbec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-aru8-1b57bbec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-aru2-1b57bbec.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-ljspeech-1b57bbec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-lt408-1b57bbec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-lt138-1b57bbec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-lt624-1b57bbec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-lt396-1b57bbec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-lt498-1b57bbec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-lt132-1b57bbec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-lt288-1b57bbec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-lt42-1b57bbec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-lt90-1b57bbec.mp3\"]}}', 'Beef là danh từ không đếm được khi nói về thực phẩm thịt bò.', 'dining', 1, 19),
('568e756f-e140-5c32-97eb-0491c614308f', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'b8d1a942-2cce-54d8-9ec9-44aa85d15573', '2ac1672d-6e56-566b-92be-4c44c149321d', 'tray', 'UK: /treɪ/ | US: /treɪ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'cái khay', 'a flat container with raised edges used for carrying food, drinks, or small items.', 'The server carried a tray of drinks.', 'Người phục vụ mang một khay đồ uống.', '{\"en\": \"The cafeteria staff placed clean trays near the entrance for incoming patrons.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên quán ăn tự phục vụ đã đặt các khay sạch gần lối vào cho khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tray-ljspeech-a0868914.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tray-cori-a0868914.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tray-9c36d918.webp', '[\"platter\", \"salver\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"letter tray\", \"meaning\": \"khay đựng thư/hồ sơ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"serving tray\", \"meaning\": \"khay phục vụ đồ ăn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tread\", \"note_vi\": \"Tread là bước đi / dẫm lên, khác với tray (cái khay).\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tray-cori-a0868914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tray-aru0-a0868914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tray-aru5-a0868914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tray-aru6-a0868914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tray-aru10-a0868914.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tray-aru9-a0868914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tray-aru3-a0868914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tray-aru7-a0868914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tray-aru8-a0868914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tray-aru2-a0868914.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tray-ljspeech-a0868914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tray-lt408-a0868914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tray-lt138-a0868914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tray-lt624-a0868914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tray-lt396-a0868914.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tray-lt498-a0868914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tray-lt132-a0868914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tray-lt288-a0868914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tray-lt42-a0868914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tray-lt90-a0868914.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong văn phòng, \'in-tray / out-tray\' là khay đựng hồ sơ; trong nhà hàng/khách sạn, \'tray\' là khay bưng đồ ăn.', 'catering', 1, 20),
('be977c9c-b4d2-5798-8af4-c39dd666c356', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'b8d1a942-2cce-54d8-9ec9-44aa85d15573', '2ac1672d-6e56-566b-92be-4c44c149321d', 'extinct', '/ɪkˈstɪŋkt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Không còn tồn tại trên Trái Đất nữa.', 'no longer existing or living anywhere on the earth.', 'Without urgent conservation efforts, many endangered bird species could soon become extinct.', 'Nếu không có các nỗ lực bảo tồn cấp bách, nhiều loài chim đang bị đe dọa có thể sớm trở nên tuyệt chủng.', '{\"en\": \"The environmental agency warned that several local plant species might become extinct soon.\", \"vi\": \"Cơ quan môi trường cảnh báo rằng một số loài thực vật địa phương có thể sớm bị tuyệt chủng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extinct-ljspeech-9269bb4c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extinct-cori-9269bb4c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/extinct-3f921a9a.webp', '[\"vanished\", \"dead\"]', '[\"extant\", \"alive\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"become extinct\", \"meaning\": \"trở nên tuyệt chủng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"nearly extinct\", \"meaning\": \"gần như tuyệt chủng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"instinct\", \"note_vi\": \"bản năng, phát âm và viết gần giống\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"extinction\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extinct-cori-9269bb4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extinct-aru0-9269bb4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extinct-aru5-9269bb4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extinct-aru6-9269bb4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extinct-aru10-9269bb4c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extinct-aru9-9269bb4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extinct-aru3-9269bb4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extinct-aru7-9269bb4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extinct-aru8