('26d1af10-feea-5693-a005-c66f3123b836', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'ba963671-011e-554e-aa1d-019309ab7f2f', '44641aa5-2359-5380-8b9f-f09f937d9126', 'page', 'UK: /peɪdʒ/ | US: /peɪdʒ/', 'A1', 'noun', 'trang (sách, tài liệu)', 'one side of a leaf of paper forming part of a book, magazine, or document', 'Please turn to page ten for the detailed report.', 'Vui lòng lật đến trang mười để xem báo cáo chi tiết.', '{\"en\": \"Please sign your full name at the bottom of the last page of the contract.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng ký tên đầy đủ của bạn ở cuối trang cuối cùng của hợp đồng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/page-ljspeech-767013ce.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/page-cori-767013ce.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/page-3a840987.webp', '[\"sheet\", \"leaf\", \"side\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"front page\", \"meaning\": \"trang nhất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"web page\", \"meaning\": \"trang web\"}, {\"phrase\": \"turn the page\", \"meaning\": \"lật trang\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"page\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/page-cori-767013ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/page-aru0-767013ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/page-aru5-767013ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/page-aru6-767013ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/page-aru10-767013ce.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/page-aru9-767013ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/page-aru3-767013ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/page-aru7-767013ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/page-aru8-767013ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/page-aru2-767013ce.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/page-ljspeech-767013ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/page-lt408-767013ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/page-lt138-767013ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/page-lt624-767013ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/page-lt396-767013ce.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/page-lt498-767013ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/page-lt132-767013ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/page-lt288-767013ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/page-lt42-767013ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/page-lt90-767013ce.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong các thông báo/hợp đồng văn phòng: page number, front page, home page.', 'office', 1, 4),
('48ed3088-07e9-53f1-95ec-a1282299a907', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'ba963671-011e-554e-aa1d-019309ab7f2f', '44641aa5-2359-5380-8b9f-f09f937d9126', 'supportive', '/səˈpɔːtɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Luôn giúp đỡ, động viên và ủng hộ người khác.', 'giving help, encouragement, or sympathy to somebody who is in a difficult situation.', 'Our department manager is extremely supportive whenever employees face difficult workplace challenges.', 'Trưởng bộ phận của chúng tôi cực kỳ ủng hộ mỗi khi nhân viên đối mặt với những thử thách khó khăn tại nơi làm việc.', '{\"en\": \"The management team was very supportive of our proposal to implement flexible working hours.\", \"vi\": \"Ban quản lý đã rất ủng hộ đề xuất của chúng tôi về việc áp dụng giờ làm việc linh hoạt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-ljspeech-4ceafbc4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-cori-4ceafbc4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/supportive-e2318c1c.webp', '[\"helpful\", \"encouraging\", \"caring\"]', '[\"unsupportive\", \"hostile\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"supportive of\", \"meaning\": \"ủng hộ cái gì hoặc ai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"supportive environment\", \"meaning\": \"môi trường mang tính hỗ trợ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"supporting\", \"note_vi\": \"supporting thường bổ nghĩa cho danh từ (như vai diễn phụ), còn supportive chỉ tính cách.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"support\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"support\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"supporter\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-cori-4ceafbc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-aru0-4ceafbc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-aru5-4ceafbc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-aru6-4ceafbc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-aru10-4ceafbc4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-aru9-4ceafbc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-aru3-4ceafbc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-aru7-4ceafbc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-aru8-4ceafbc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-aru2-4ceafbc4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-ljspeech-4ceafbc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-lt408-4ceafbc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-lt138-4ceafbc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-lt624-4ceafbc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-lt396-4ceafbc4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-lt498-4ceafbc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-lt132-4ceafbc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-lt288-4ceafbc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-lt42-4ceafbc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supportive-lt90-4ceafbc4.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc phổ biến cần nhớ là \"be supportive of someone/something\".', 'hr', 1, 5),
('0e71c9c4-f7af-5af2-ae25-b4f9e09c7f26', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'ba963671-011e-554e-aa1d-019309ab7f2f', '44641aa5-2359-5380-8b9f-f09f937d9126', 'whale', '/weɪl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Loài động vật có vú lớn sống dưới biển.', 'a very large animal that lives in the sea and looks like a fish.', 'We were lucky enough to see a huge blue whale swimming gracefully in the ocean during our trip.', 'Chúng tôi đã may mắn được nhìn thấy một con cá voi xanh khổng lồ bơi lội duyên dáng trong đại dương trong chuyến đi của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency organized a whale watching tour for the corporate clients.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty du lịch đã tổ chức một chuyến đi ngắm cá voi cho các khách hàng doanh nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whale-ljspeech-1769e230.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whale-cori-1769e230.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/whale-9ab8aa70.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"whale watching\", \"meaning\": \"ngắm cá voi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"blue whale\", \"meaning\": \"cá voi xanh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"shark\", \"note_vi\": \"cá mập, loài cá săn mồi nguy hiểm\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whale-cori-1769e230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whale-aru0-1769e230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whale-aru5-1769e230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whale-aru6-1769e230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whale-aru10-1769e230.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whale-aru9-1769e230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whale-aru3-1769e230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whale-aru7-1769e230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whale-aru8-1769e230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whale-aru2-1769e230.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/