('264d7cf0-49ca-5e6d-ab9d-05b3ebb3897e', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'ba963671-011e-554e-aa1d-019309ab7f2f', '44641aa5-2359-5380-8b9f-f09f937d9126', 'teeth', '/tiːθ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Các cấu trúc xương cứng trong miệng dùng để cắn và nhai thức ăn.', 'hard white objects in the mouth used for biting and chewing food.', 'You should brush your teeth at least twice a day.', 'Bạn nên đánh răng ít nhất hai lần một ngày.', '{\"en\": \"The dental clinic offers a special discount on teeth whitening services for all new patients.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng khám nha khoa cung cấp ưu đãi đặc biệt cho dịch vụ làm trắng răng cho tất cả bệnh nhân mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeth-ljspeech-a81fecb0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeth-cori-a81fecb0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/teeth-b5c5cecd.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"brush teeth\", \"meaning\": \"đánh răng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"healthy teeth\", \"meaning\": \"răng khỏe mạnh\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"tooth\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeth-cori-a81fecb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeth-aru0-a81fecb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeth-aru5-a81fecb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeth-aru6-a81fecb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeth-aru10-a81fecb0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeth-aru9-a81fecb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeth-aru3-a81fecb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeth-aru7-a81fecb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeth-aru8-a81fecb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeth-aru2-a81fecb0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeth-ljspeech-a81fecb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeth-lt408-a81fecb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeth-lt138-a81fecb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeth-lt624-a81fecb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeth-lt396-a81fecb0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeth-lt498-a81fecb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeth-lt132-a81fecb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeth-lt288-a81fecb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeth-lt42-a81fecb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeth-lt90-a81fecb0.mp3\"]}}', 'Số nhiều của \'tooth\'. Đừng quên đổi \'oo\' thành \'ee\'.', 'health', 1, 9),
('f3d2cdb9-cd18-5904-a153-d0983542c466', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'ba963671-011e-554e-aa1d-019309ab7f2f', '44641aa5-2359-5380-8b9f-f09f937d9126', 'joyful', '/ˈdʒɔɪfl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy hoặc thể hiện niềm vui lớn, hạnh phúc.', 'very happy, or causing people to feel very happy.', 'The children\'s faces were joyful as they opened their Christmas presents.', 'Khuôn mặt của lũ trẻ rạng rỡ niềm vui khi chúng mở quà Giáng sinh.', '{\"en\": \"The annual company party was a joyful celebration of everyone\'s hard work this year.\", \"vi\": \"Bữa tiệc thường niên của công ty là một sự kiện ăn mừng vui vẻ cho sự làm việc chăm chỉ của mọi người trong năm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joyful-ljspeech-aed7c4d5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joyful-cori-aed7c4d5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/joyful-e8cfcfdb.webp', '[\"cheerful\", \"delighted\", \"glad\"]', '[\"sad\", \"sorrowful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"joyful occasion\", \"meaning\": \"dịp vui vẻ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"joyful news\", \"meaning\": \"tin vui\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"joy\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"joyfully\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joyful-cori-aed7c4d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joyful-aru0-aed7c4d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joyful-aru5-aed7c4d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joyful-aru6-aed7c4d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joyful-aru10-aed7c4d5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joyful-aru9-aed7c4d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joyful-aru3-aed7c4d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joyful-aru7-aed7c4d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joyful-aru8-aed7c4d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joyful-aru2-aed7c4d5.mp3\"