('61c43b38-be7b-5c56-bd49-cada957f4b73', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'ba963671-011e-554e-aa1d-019309ab7f2f', '44641aa5-2359-5380-8b9f-f09f937d9126', 'engineer', '/ˌendʒɪˈnɪə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Người thiết kế, xây dựng hoặc vận hành máy móc, cấu trúc.', 'a person whose job involves designing, building, or repairing machines and structures.', 'The chief engineer inspected the bridge structure before approving the construction project.', 'Kỹ sư trưởng đã kiểm tra cấu trúc cây cầu trước khi phê duyệt dự án xây dựng.', '{\"en\": \"The senior engineer inspected the new machinery to ensure safety compliance before operation.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ sư trưởng đã kiểm tra máy móc mới để đảm bảo tuân thủ an toàn trước khi vận hành.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engineer-ljspeech-8d7050ff.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engineer-cori-8d7050ff.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/engineer-d7588f3a.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"chief engineer\", \"meaning\": \"kỹ sư trưởng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"software engineer\", \"meaning\": \"kỹ sư phần mềm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"technician\", \"note_vi\": \"engineer thiết kế/nghiên cứu, technician là kỹ thuật viên thực hành\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"engineering\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"engineer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engineer-cori-8d7050ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engineer-aru0-8d7050ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engineer-aru5-8d7050ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engineer-aru6-8d7050ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engineer-aru10-8d7050ff.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engineer-aru9-8d7050ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engineer-aru3-8d7050ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engineer-aru7-8d7050ff.m