('f29ec9b7-24aa-57f7-8f95-7e5a9806e2e6', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'bc901e6c-7790-543d-b019-5efebc1c2092', 'e64b7afc-e8ba-56d8-9b87-819076e6e998', 'police officer', '/pəˈliːs ˈɒfɪsə/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Người thực thi pháp luật và giữ gìn trật tự công cộng.', 'a person who works for the government to keep order and enforce the law.', 'A police officer helped us find our way when we were lost in the city.', 'Một cảnh sát đã giúp chúng tôi tìm đường khi chúng tôi bị lạc trong thành phố.', '{\"en\": \"A police officer arrived at the office building to investigate the security alarm incident.\", \"vi\": \"Một cảnh sát đã đến tòa nhà văn phòng để điều tra vụ báo động an ninh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/police-officer-ljspeech-8f7cde31.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/police-officer-cori-8f7cde31.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/police-officer-7fbd78e5.webp', '[\"policeman\", \"policewoman\", \"cop\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"call a police officer\", \"meaning\": \"gọi cảnh sát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"police officer uniform\", \"meaning\": \"đồng phục cảnh sát\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"police\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/police-officer-cori-8f7cde31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/police-officer-aru0-8f7cde31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/police-officer-aru5-8f7cde31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/police-officer-aru6-8f7cde31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/police-officer-aru10-8f7cde31.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/police-officer-aru9-8f7cde31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/police-officer-aru3-8f7cde31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/police-officer-aru7-8f7cde31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/police-officer-aru8-8f7cde31.mp3\", \