('10bd86d2-63e1-5149-8a22-40157fa3952f', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'bc901e6c-7790-543d-b019-5efebc1c2092', 'e64b7afc-e8ba-56d8-9b87-819076e6e998', 'bird', '/bɜːd/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Loài động vật có cánh, lông vũ và thường biết bay.', 'a creature with wings and feathers that can usually fly.', 'Many colorful species of wild birds migrate south during the cold winter months.', 'Nhiều loài chim hoang dã đầy màu sắc di cư về phía nam trong những tháng mùa đông lạnh giá.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel garden attracted a rare bird during the business retreat.\", \"vi\": \"Khu vườn khách sạn đã thu hút một loài chim hiếm trong kỳ nghỉ công tác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-ljspeech-cd92815b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-cori-cd92815b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bird-27da85da.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"early bird\", \"meaning\": \"người đi sớm/đăng ký sớm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bird watching\", \"meaning\": \"ngắm chim\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pet bird\", \"meaning\": \"chim cảnh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"beard\", \"note_vi\": \"beard là râu, bird là chim\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-cori-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-aru0-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-aru5-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-aru6-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-aru10-cd92815b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-aru9-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-aru3-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-aru7-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-aru8-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-aru2-cd92815b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-ljspeech-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-lt408-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-lt138-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-lt624-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-lt396-cd92815b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-lt498-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-lt132-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-lt288-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-lt42-cd92815b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bird-lt90-cd92815b.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt \'bird\' (chim) và \'beard\' (râu).', 'nature', 1, 28),
('c990141d-c05e-5932-9226-7273ddda7d91', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'bc901e6c-7790-543d-b019-5efebc1c2092', 'e64b7afc-e8ba-56d8-9b87-819076e6e998', 'away', 'UK: /əˈweɪ/ | US: /əˈweɪ/', 'A1', 'adverb', 'xa, đi xa', 'at or to a specified distance from a particular person, place, or starting point', 'The office is a mile away from my home.', 'Văn phòng cách nhà tôi một dặm.', '{\"en\": \"Our IT support representative will assist you right away with the network connection.\", \"vi\": \"Đại diện hỗ trợ CNTT của chúng tôi sẽ hỗ trợ bạn ngay lập tức về kết nối mạng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/away-ljspeech-f416d44c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/away-cori-f416d44c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/away-e7330167.webp', '[\"off\", \"elsewhere\", \"aside\"]', '[\"near\", \"here\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"right away\", \"meaning\": \"ngay lập tức\"}, {\"phrase\": \"away from office\", \"meaning\": \"vắng mặt ở văn phòng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/away-cori-f416d44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/away-aru0-f416d44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/away-aru5-f416d44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/away-aru6-f416d44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/away-aru10-f416d44c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/away-aru9-f416d44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/away-aru3-f416d44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/away-aru7-f416d44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/away-aru8-f416d44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/away-aru2-f416d44c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/away-ljspeech-f416d44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/away-lt408-f416d44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciati