('68093043-2c33-5f57-a15c-d01301dab417', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'c0882538-a767-57e4-8896-aeaa777cb1d2', 'ab2e82a9-488d-50c4-a840-e9b7378fdb1b', 'home', '/həʊm/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Nơi ở, nơi một người sinh sống hoặc cảm thấy thuộc về.', 'the place where a person lives and feels comfortable with their family.', 'After a long trip, it\'s always nice to come back home.', 'Sau một chuyến đi dài, thật tuyệt khi luôn được trở về nhà.', '{\"en\": \"Many employees now prefer working from home to save time on their daily commute.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiều nhân viên hiện nay thích làm việc tại nhà để tiết kiệm thời gian đi lại hàng ngày.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-ljspeech-e83249bd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-cori-e83249bd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/home-fcea40f3.webp', '[\"residence\", \"house\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"work from home\", \"meaning\": \"làm việc tại nhà\"}, {\"phrase\": \"at home\", \"meaning\": \"ở nhà\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"house\", \"note_vi\": \"House là tòa nhà, home là nơi mình gắn bó, thuộc về.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"homely\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-cori-e83249bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-aru0-e83249bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-aru5-e83249bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-aru6-e83249bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-aru10-e83249bd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-aru9-e83249bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-aru3-e83249bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-aru7-e83249bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-aru8-e83249bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-aru2-e83249bd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-ljspeech-e83249bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-lt408-e83249bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-lt138-e83249bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-lt624-e83249bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-lt396-e83249bd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-lt498-e83249bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-lt132-e83249bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-lt288-e83249bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-lt42-e83249bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/home-lt90-e83249bd.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'work from home\' rất phổ biến trong môi trường làm việc hiện đại.', 'housing', 1, 0),
('effd9b4b-124a-5a12-b087-5e3f56eb0553', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'c0882538-a767-57e4-8896-aeaa777cb1d2', 'ab2e82a9-488d-50c4-a840-e9b7378fdb1b', 'tour', '/tʊə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Chuyến đi thăm nhiều địa điểm khác nhau, thường có hướng dẫn.', 'a planned visit to see interesting places with a guide.', 'New employees will take a brief tour of the headquarters building tomorrow morning.', 'Nhân viên mới sẽ đi tham quan một vòng ngắn tòa nhà trụ sở chính vào sáng mai.', '{\"en\": \"The company arranged a factory tour for the potential investors.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã sắp xếp một chuyến tham quan nhà máy cho các nhà đầu tư tiềm năng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-ljspeech-2c8bbd4e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-cori-2c8bbd4e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tour-9ee05f13.webp', '[\"excursion\", \"visit\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"guided tour\", \"meaning\": \"chuyến tham quan có hướng dẫn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"factory tour\", \"meaning\": \"tham quan nhà máy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tour guide\", \"meaning\": \"hướng dẫn viên du lịch\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tower\", \"note_vi\": \"tower là tháp, tour là chuyến tham quan\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"tour\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"tourist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-cori-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-aru0-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-aru5-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-aru6-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-aru10-2c8bbd4e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-aru9-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-aru3-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-aru7-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-aru8-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-aru2-2c8bbd4e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-ljspeech-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-lt408-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-lt138-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-lt624-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-lt396-2c8bbd4e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-lt498-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-lt132-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-lt288-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-lt42-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-lt90-2c8bbd4e.mp3\"]}}', 'Không nhầm \'tour\' (tham quan) với \'tower\' (tháp).', 'travel', 1, 1),
('c400bbff-1f98-5031-8556-a57044c9aeb7', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'c0882538-a767-57e4-8896-aeaa777cb1d2', 'ab2e82a9-488d-50c4-a840-e9b7378fdb1b', 'terminal', 'UK: /ˈtɜːmɪnl/ | US: /ˈtɜrmɪnl/', 'B1', 'noun', 'nhà ga (sân bay, bến xe)', 'a major building where passengers embark or disembark from public transport.', 'Passengers should proceed to Terminal 1 for international flights.', 'Hành khách nên đi đến Nhà ga số 1 cho các chuyến bay quốc tế.', '{\"en\": \"Passengers taking international flights should arrive at Terminal 3 at least three hours before departure.\", \"vi\": \"Hành khách đi các chuyến bay quốc tế nên đến Nhà ga số 3 ít nhất ba giờ trước khi cất cánh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terminal-ljspeech-46d551da.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terminal-cori-46d551da.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/terminal-4ebc4faa.webp', '[\"station\", \"depot\", \"concourse\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"airport terminal\", \"meaning\": \"nhà ga sân bay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bus terminal\", \"meaning\": \"bến xe buýt trung tâm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"passenger terminal\", \"meaning\": \"nhà ga hành khách\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"terminate\", \"note_vi\": \"chấm dứt (động từ)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"terminal\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"terminate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terminal-cori-46d551da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terminal-aru0-46d551da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terminal-aru5-46d551da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terminal-aru6-46d551da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terminal-aru10-46d551da.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terminal-aru9-46d551da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terminal-aru3-46d551da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ter