('83bf397d-9dfa-5979-ab52-2535951a9272', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'c0882538-a767-57e4-8896-aeaa777cb1d2', 'ab2e82a9-488d-50c4-a840-e9b7378fdb1b', 'amazed', '/əˈmeɪzd/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy rất ngạc nhiên hoặc sửng sốt.', 'feeling very surprised because something is unexpected or impressive.', 'She was amazed by the beautiful view from the top of the mountain.', 'Cô ấy kinh ngạc trước khung cảnh tuyệt đẹp từ đỉnh núi.', '{\"en\": \"The client was amazed by our fast and professional service.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng đã kinh ngạc trước dịch vụ nhanh chóng và chuyên nghiệp của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazed-ljspeech-f301793c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazed-cori-f301793c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/amazed-f81c8ba6.webp', '[\"astonished\", \"surprised\", \"stunned\"]', '[\"unimpressed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"amazed at\", \"meaning\": \"kinh ngạc về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"absolutely amazed\", \"meaning\": \"cực kỳ kinh ngạc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"amazed by\", \"meaning\": \"bị kinh ngạc bởi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"amusing\", \"note_vi\": \"amazed là kinh ngạc, amusing là thú vị, gây cười\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"amaze\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"amazement\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazed-cori-f301793c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazed-aru0-f301793c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazed-aru5-f301793c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazed-aru6-f301793c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazed-aru10-f301793c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazed-aru9-f301793c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazed-aru3-f301793c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazed-aru7-f301793c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazed-aru8-f301793c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazed-aru2-f301793c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazed-ljspeech-f301793c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazed-lt408-f301793c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazed-lt138-f301793c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazed-lt624-f301793c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazed-lt396-f301793c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazed-lt498-f301793c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazed-lt132-f301793c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazed-lt288-f301793c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazed-lt42-f301793c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazed-lt90-f301793c.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt amazed (bị kinh ngạc) và amazing (điều làm kinh ngạc).', 'business', 1, 5),
('0180072c-bdcb-5e01-9a10-be6f3cda3e0b', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'c0882538-a767-57e4-8896-aeaa777cb1d2', 'ab2e82a9-488d-50c4-a840-e9b7378fdb1b', 'driver', '/ˈdraɪvə(r)/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Người điều khiển phương tiện giao thông như ô tô, xe buýt.', 'a person who is employed to operate a vehicle, such as a bus or truck.', 'The bus driver safely navigated through the heavy traffic.', 'Người lái xe buýt đã lái xe an toàn qua dòng xe cộ đông đúc.', '{\"en\": \"The delivery driver arrived late because of heavy traffic on the main highway this morning.\", \"vi\": \"Tài xế giao hàng đến muộn vì tắc đường nghiêm trọng trên đường cao tốc sáng nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-ljspeech-fdda0c46.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-cori-fdda0c46.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/driver-3ce831f9.webp', '[\"chauffeur\", \"operator\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"bus driver\", \"meaning\": \"tài xế xe buýt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hire a driver\", \"meaning\": \"thuê tài xế\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"drive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-cori-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-aru0-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-aru5-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-aru6-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-aru10-fdda0c46.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-aru9-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-aru3-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-aru7-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-aru8-fdda0c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-aru2-fdda0c46.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/driver-ljspeech-fdda0c46.mp