('9bbebd98-7696-577d-8c4a-08180a464fae', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'c0882538-a767-57e4-8896-aeaa777cb1d2', 'ab2e82a9-488d-50c4-a840-e9b7378fdb1b', 'flood', '/flʌd/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hiện tượng nước dâng cao tràn ngập một khu vực khô cạn.', 'An overflow of an expansive body of water submerging land that normally remains dry.', 'After heavy rains, the river burst its banks, causing a severe flood in the town.', 'Sau những trận mưa lớn, con sông vỡ bờ, gây ra một trận lũ lụt nghiêm trọng trong thị trấn.', '{\"en\": \"Severe weather caused a sudden flood that damaged several warehouses in the industrial area.\", \"vi\": \"Thời tiết khắc nghiệt đã gây ra đợt lũ đột ngột làm hư hỏng nhiều kho hàng trong khu công nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-ljspeech-ff0db992.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-cori-ff0db992.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/flood-fbada72b.webp', '[\"inundation\", \"overflow\"]', '[\"drought\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"flash flood\", \"meaning\": \"lũ quét\"}, {\"phrase\": \"flood damage\", \"meaning\": \"thiệt hại do lũ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"flood\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-cori-ff0db992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-aru0-ff0db992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-aru5-ff0db992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-aru6-ff0db992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-aru10-ff0db992.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-aru9-ff0db992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-aru3-ff0db992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-aru7-ff0db992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-aru8-ff0db992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-aru2-ff0db992.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [