('f490561a-9d62-5d3b-9ffa-58f2c2f424b8', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'c51cebb3-7389-5e58-85dd-5836f75cc0c3', '9241a4a1-fabe-5c35-9b23-3c6ba2036acb', 'seatbelt', '/ˈsiːtbɛlt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Dây đai dùng để giữ người ngồi trên xe không bị văng ra.', 'a safety strap attached to a vehicle seat that holds a passenger securely during travel.', 'The flight attendant reminded all passengers to secure their seatbelt prior to takeoff.', 'Tiếp viên hàng không đã nhắc nhở tất cả hành khách thắt dây an toàn trước khi cất cánh.', '{\"en\": \"Flight attendants reminded passengers to keep their seatbelt fastened during the turbulent flight.\", \"vi\": \"Tiếp viên hàng không nhắc nhở hành khách thắt dây an toàn trong suốt chuyến bay bị rung lắc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seatbelt-ljspeech-35f404b2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seatbelt-cori-35f404b2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/seatbelt-d1678f22.webp', '[\"safety belt\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fasten a seatbelt\", \"meaning\": \"thắt dây an toàn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unfasten a seatbelt\", \"meaning\": \"mở dây an toàn\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seatbelt-cori-35f404b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seatbelt-aru0-35f404b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seatbelt-aru5-35f404b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seatbelt-aru6-35f404b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seatbelt-aru10-35f404b2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seatbelt-aru9-35f404b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seatbelt-aru3-35f404b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seatbelt-aru7-35f404b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seatbelt-aru8-35f404b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seatbelt-aru2-35f404b2.mp3\"]}, \"us\"