('fd06e844-b067-595b-8279-7a9904d5cbce', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'c6045a6d-600d-50b1-8370-7fc03649df8d', '88ff0552-8250-5911-98bd-19013ffbb134', 'Earth', '/ɜːθ/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Hành tinh chúng ta đang sống, hành tinh thứ ba tính từ Mặt Trời.', 'the terrestrial body orbiting third from the sun, which supports human life and vast ecosystems.', 'Scientists are constantly studying ways to protect Earth\'s environment.', 'Các nhà khoa học không ngừng nghiên cứu các cách để bảo vệ môi trường Trái Đất.', '{\"en\": \"Our company is committed to protecting the Earth by reducing plastic waste in all operations.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi cam kết bảo vệ Trái Đất bằng cách giảm thiểu rác thải nhựa trong mọi hoạt động.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/earth-ljspeech-44d47627.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/earth-cori-44d47627.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/earth-27f5100f.webp', '[\"the world\", \"the globe\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"protect the Earth\", \"meaning\": \"bảo vệ Trái Đất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"on Earth\", \"meaning\": \"trên thế giới\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/earth-cori-44d47627.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/earth-aru0-44d47627.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/earth-aru5-44d47627.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/earth-aru6-44d47627.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/earth-aru10-44d47627.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/earth-aru9-44d47627.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/earth-aru3-44d47627.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/earth-aru7-44d47627.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/earth-aru8-44d47627.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/earth-aru2-44d47627.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v