('8d49c5bd-9091-5874-8e65-7b29cb6b29b1', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'c6045a6d-600d-50b1-8370-7fc03649df8d', '88ff0552-8250-5911-98bd-19013ffbb134', 'stepmother', '/ˈstepmʌðə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Vợ của cha bạn nhưng không phải là mẹ ruột của bạn.', 'the woman who is married to your father but is not your real mother.', 'My stepmother is very kind and treats me like her own child.', 'Mẹ kế của tôi rất tốt bụng và đối xử với tôi như con ruột của bà.', '{\"en\": \"The manager invited his stepmother to the annual company dinner to celebrate his promotion.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng đã mời mẹ kế của mình đến bữa tối thường niên của công ty để ăn mừng sự thăng chức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepmother-ljspeech-a185f5d0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepmother-cori-a185f5d0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stepmother-c4529ad6.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"wicked stepmother\", \"meaning\": \"mẹ kế độc ác\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"mother-in-law\", \"note_vi\": \"mother-in-law là mẹ chồng/mẹ vợ, còn stepmother là mẹ kế.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"stepfather\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepmother-cori-a185f5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepmother-aru0-a185f5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepmother-aru5-a185f5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepmother-aru6-a185f5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepmother-aru10-a185f5d0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepmother-aru9-a185f5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepmother-aru3-a185f5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepmother-aru7-a185f5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepmother-aru8-a185f5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepmother-aru2-a185f5d0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepmother-ljspeech-a185f5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepmother-lt408-a185f5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepmother-lt138-a185f5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepmother-lt624-a185f5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepmother-lt396-a185f5d0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepmother-lt498-a185f5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepmother-lt132-a185f5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepmother-lt288-a185f5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepmother-lt42-a185f5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepmother-lt90-a185f5d0.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt với mother-in-law (mẹ chồng hoặc mẹ vợ).', 'daily', 1, 20),
('1fbb1a38-bf72-5c41-b133-f765b2e6531a', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'c6045a6d-600d-50b1-8370-7fc03649df8d', '88ff0552-8250-5911-98bd-19013ffbb134', 'compassionate', '/kəmˈpæʃənət/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có lòng thương người, thấu hiểu nỗi đau của người khác; giàu lòng trắc ẩn.', 'showing kindness and sympathy towards people who are suffering or in difficult situations.', 'A truly compassionate leader listens to their team and acts with kindness.', 'Một nhà lãnh đạo thực sự giàu lòng trắc ẩn sẽ lắng nghe đội ngũ của mình và hành động với lòng tốt.', '{\"en\": \"The manager is a compassionate person who supports staff members during their personal family crises.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý là một người giàu lòng trắc ẩn, luôn hỗ trợ các nhân viên trong những cuộc khủng hoảng gia đình cá nhân của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compassionate-ljspeech-ece75175.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compassionate-cori-ece75175.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/compassionate-38ceca72.webp', '[\"kind\", \"sympathetic\"]', '[\"cruel\", \"heartless\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"compassionate care\", \"meaning\": \"sự chăm sóc tận tình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deeply compassionate\", \"meaning\": \"vô cùng giàu lòng trắc ẩn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"compassion\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compassionate-cori-ece75175.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compassionate-aru0-ece75175.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compassionate-aru5-ece75175.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compassionate-aru6-ece75175.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compassionate-aru10-ece75175.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compassionate-aru9-ece75175.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compassionate-aru3-ece75175.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compassionate-aru7-ece75175.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compassionate-aru8-ece75175.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compassionate-aru2-ece75175.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compassionate-ljspeech-ece75175.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compassionate-lt408-ece75175.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compassionate-lt138-ece75175.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compassionate-lt624-ece75175.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compassionate-lt396-ece75175.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compassionate-lt498-ece75175.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compassionate-lt132-ece75175.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compassionate-lt288-ece75175.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compassionate-lt42-ece75175.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compassionate-lt90-ece75175.mp3\"]}}', 'Dễ nhầm với \'passion\' (đam mê), hãy nhớ \'com-\' là cùng nhau, cùng chia sẻ nỗi đau.', 'hr', 1, 21),
('d8837637-58e7-52f5-b7bd-86d7568ae1ab', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'c6045a6d-600d-50b1-8370-7fc03649df8d', '88ff0552-8250-5911-98bd-19013ffbb134', 'take a shower', '/teɪk ə ˈʃaʊə/', 'A1', 'phrase', 'Dùng vòi sen để tắm rửa cơ thể.', 'to wash one\'s body while standing under a spray of water.', 'After a long day, I like to take a hot shower to relax.', 'Sau một ngày dài, tôi thích tắm vòi sen nước nóng để thư giãn.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel gym provides clean towels for guests who wish to take a shower.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng tập thể dục của khách sạn cung cấp khăn tắm sạch cho khách muốn tắm vòi sen.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-shower-ljspeech-44d45572.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-shower-cori-44d45572.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/take-a-shower-d9fe5bbb.webp', '[\"shower\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"take a quick shower\", \"meaning\": \"tắm vòi sen nhanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"take a hot shower\", \"meaning\": \"tắm vòi sen nước nóng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"take a bath\", \"note_vi\": \"Take a bath là tắm bồn, còn take a shower là tắm vòi sen.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-shower-cori-44d45572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-shower-aru0-44d45572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-shower-aru5-44d45572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-shower-aru6-44d45572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-shower-aru10-44d45572.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-shower-aru9-44d45572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-shower-aru3-44d45572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-shower-aru7-44d45572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-shower-aru8-44d45572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-shower-aru2-44d45572.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-shower-ljspeech-44d45572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-shower-lt408-44d45572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-shower-lt138-44d45572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-shower-lt624-44d45572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-shower-lt396-44d45572.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-shower-lt498-44d45572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-shower-lt132-44d45572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-shower-lt288-44d45572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-shower-lt42-44d45572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-shower-lt90-44d45572.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng \'take a shower\' trong tiếng Anh Mỹ, người Anh hay dùng \'have a shower\'.', 'travel', 1, 22),
('4fb2b458-1e4d-5fa8-9a0c-64a2f0f016d1', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'c6045a6d-600d-50b1-8370-7fc03649df8d', '88ff0552-8250-5911-98bd-19013ffbb134', 'university', '/ˌjuːnɪˈvɜːsəti/', 'A2', 'noun', 'cơ sở giáo dục cao cấp, nơi sinh viên học lấy bằng.', 'a high-level institution of learning where students study for degrees.', 'She plans to study engineering at a prestigious university next year.', 'Cô ấy dự định học kỹ thuật tại một trường đại học danh tiếng vào năm tới.', '{\"en\": \"Our company regularly recruits talented graduates from the local university for internship programs.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi thường xuyên tuyển dụng sinh viên tốt nghiệp tài năng từ trường đại học địa phương cho các chương trình thực tập.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/university-ljspeech-f9f91406.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/university-cori-f9f91406.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/university-3ac01bc2.webp', '[\"college\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"attend university\", \"meaning\": \"học đại học\"}, {\"phrase\": \"university degree\", \"meaning\": \"bằng đại học\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"college\", \"note_vi\": \"college thường nhỏ hơn hoặc chỉ đào tạo hệ cao đẳng/đại học ngắn hạn.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/university-cori-f9f91406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/university-aru0-f9f91406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/university-aru5-f9f91406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/university-aru6-f9f91406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/university-aru10-f9f91406.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/university-aru9-f9f91406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/university-aru3-f9f91406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/university-aru7-f9f91406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/university-aru8-f9f91406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/university-aru2-f9f91406.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/university-ljspeech-f9f91406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/university-lt408-f9f91406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/university-lt138-f9f91406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/university-lt624-f9f91406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/university-lt396-f9f91406.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/university-lt498-f9f91406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/university-lt132-f9f91406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/university-lt288-f9f91406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/university-lt42-f9f91406.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/university-lt90-f9f91406.mp3\"]}}', 'Đi trước bằng mạo từ \'a\' chứ không phải \'an\' vì phát âm bắt đầu bằng âm /j/.', 'education', 1, 23),
('0ebcacd9-7f15-5787-adb3-b6262f83e58a', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'c6045a6d-600d-50b1-8370-7fc03649df8d', '88ff0552-8250-5911-98bd-19013ffbb134', 'forecast', '/ˈfɔːkɑːst/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Lời dự đoán về thời tiết trong tương lai.', 'a statement saying what conditions like rain or snow will be expected.', 'Market analysts updated their growth forecast after observing strong holiday sales figures.', 'Các chuyên gia phân tích thị trường đã cập nhật dự báo tăng trưởng sau khi quan sát số liệu bán hàng mạnh mẽ trong kỳ nghỉ.', '{\"en\": \"According to the daily forecast, heavy rain will delay the outdoor construction project.\", \"vi\": \"Theo dự báo hàng ngày, mưa lớn sẽ làm chậm tiến độ dự án xây dựng ngoài trời.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forecast-ljspeech-018c49f8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forecast-cori-018c49f8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/forecast-6dbdc128.webp', '[\"prediction\", \"projection\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"weather forecast\", \"meaning\": \"dự báo thời tiết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"accurate forecast\", \"meaning\": \"dự báo chính xác\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"foresee\", \"note_vi\": \"forecast là dự báo (thời tiết/kinh tế), foresee là nhìn thấy trước.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"forecast\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forecast-cori-018c49f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forecast-aru0-018c49f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forecast-aru5-018c49f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forecast-aru6-018c49f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forecast-aru10-018c49f8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forecast-aru9-018c49f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forecast-aru3-018c49f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forecast-aru7-018c49f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forecast-aru8-018c49f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forecast-aru2-018c49f8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forecast-ljspeech-018c49f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forecast-lt408-018c49f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forecast-lt138-018c49f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forecast-lt624-018c49f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forecast-lt396-018c49f8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forecast-lt498-018c49f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forecast-lt132-018c49f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forecast-lt288-018c49f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forecast-lt42-018c49f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forecast-lt90-018c49f8.mp3\"]}}', 'Forecast vừa là danh từ (bản dự báo) vừa là động từ (dự báo).', 'nature', 1, 24),
('7ec9a7c7-02d5-5d6c-9337-5d9168688563', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'c6045a6d-600d-50b1-8370-7fc03649df8d', '88ff0552-8250-5911-98bd-19013ffbb134', 'half-sister', '/ˌhɑːfˈsɪstə/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Chị hoặc em gái cùng cha khác mẹ, hoặc cùng mẹ khác cha.', 'a girl or woman who has only one parent in common with you.', 'My half-sister lives in another city, but we still keep in touch.', 'Chị gái cùng cha khác mẹ của tôi sống ở thành phố khác, nhưng chúng tôi vẫn giữ liên lạc.', '{\"en\": \"My half-sister works as a marketing manager at a large international firm.\", \"vi\": \"Chị gái cùng cha khác mẹ của tôi làm quản lý tiếp thị tại một công ty quốc tế lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-sister-ljspeech-2b75e0dc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-sister-cori-2b75e0dc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/half-sister-fee8a0d6.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"older half-sister\", \"meaning\": \"chị gái cùng cha/mẹ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"younger half-sister\", \"meaning\": \"em gái cùng cha/mẹ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"stepsister\", \"note_vi\": \"stepsister là con gái của bố dượng/mẹ kế, không chung huyết thống\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-sister-cori-2b75e0dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-sister-aru0-2b75e0dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-sister-aru5-2b75e0dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-sister-aru6-2b75e0dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-sister-aru10-2b75e0dc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-sister-aru9-2b75e0dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-sister-aru3-2b75e0dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-sister-aru7-2b75e0dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-sister-aru8-2b75e0dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pu