('2528b7ae-1cd0-5d20-977d-6d9db06c6c50', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd63293ee-a627-59f6-b277-d8604c1dd47a', '3c2b1d67-9026-500f-80e7-6d2ad3b37e57', 'water', '/ˈwɔːtə(r)/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Chất lỏng không màu, không mùi, cần thiết cho sự sống.', 'a clear liquid without color, smell, or taste that falls as rain and is necessary for life.', 'Please drink plenty of water to stay hydrated, especially in hot weather.', 'Hãy uống nhiều nước để giữ cơ thể đủ nước, đặc biệt trong thời tiết nóng.', '{\"en\": \"The office manager ordered several bottles of mineral water for the upcoming board meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng văn phòng đã đặt vài chai nước khoáng cho cuộc họp ban giám đốc sắp tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-ljspeech-6d5a4592.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-cori-6d5a4592.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/water-515e3b16.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"tap water\", \"meaning\": \"nước máy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bottled water\", \"meaning\": \"nước đóng chai\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"water\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"watery\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-cori-6d5a4592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-aru0-6d5a4592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-aru5-6d5a4592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-aru6-6d5a4592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-aru10-6d5a4592.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-aru9-6d5a4592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-aru3-6d5a4592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-aru7-6d5a4592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-aru8-6d5a4592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-aru2-6d5a4592.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-ljspeech-6d5a4592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-lt408-6d5a4592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-lt138-6d5a4592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-lt624-6d5a4592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-lt396-6d5a4592.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-lt498-6d5a4592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-lt132-6d5a4592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-lt288-6d5a4592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-lt42-6d5a4592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/water-lt90-6d5a4592.mp3\"]}}', '', 'dining', 1, 4),
('367c95a8-122e-54e4-9e6b-51c557d8df91', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd63293ee-a627-59f6-b277-d8604c1dd47a', '3c2b1d67-9026-500f-80e7-6d2ad3b37e57', 'roundabout', '/ˈraʊndəbaʊt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Vòng xuyến, một giao lộ tròn nơi các phương tiện đi lại.', 'a circular place where several roads meet and traffic must go around a central island.', 'You need to go around the roundabout and take the third exit.', 'Bạn cần đi quanh bùng binh và rẽ vào lối ra thứ ba.', '{\"en\": \"Drivers should take the second exit at the roundabout to reach the conference center.\", \"vi\": \"Người lái xe nên đi theo lối ra thứ hai tại bùng binh để đến trung tâm hội nghị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roundabout-ljspeech-6b705719.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roundabout-cori-6b705719.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/roundabout-15c344c4.webp', '[\"rotary\", \"traffic circle\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"traffic roundabout\", \"meaning\": \"vòng xoay giao thông\"}, {\"phrase\": \"enter a roundabout\", \"meaning\": \"đi vào bùng binh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"round\", \"note_vi\": \"roundabout là bùng binh, round là tính từ tròn hoặc trạng từ\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roundabout-cori-6b705719.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roundabout-aru0-6b705719.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roundabout-aru5-6b705719.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roundabout-aru6-6b705719.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roundabout-aru10-6b705719.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roundabout-aru9-6b705719.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roundabout-aru3-6b705719.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roundabout-aru7-6b705719.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roundabout-aru8-6b705719.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roundabout-aru2-6b705719.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roundabout-ljspeech-6b705719.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roundabout-lt408-6b705719.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roundabout-lt138-6b705719.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roundabout-lt624-6b705719.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roundabout-lt396-6b705719.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roundabout-lt498-6b705719.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roundabout-lt132-6b705719.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roundabout-lt288-6b705719.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roundabout-lt42-6b705719.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roundabout-lt90-6b705719.mp3\"]}}', 'Người Anh dùng roundabout, người Mỹ thường dùng traffic circle hoặc rotary.', 'travel', 1, 5),
('b182cfda-6459-590d-8284-3c58a1647146', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd63293ee-a627-59f6-b277-d8604c1dd47a', '3c2b1d67-9026-500f-80e7-6d2ad3b37e57', 'hiking', '/ˈhaɪkɪŋ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Hoạt động đi bộ đường dài, thường ở vùng núi hoặc thiên nhiên.', 'An outdoor recreation involving extended walking along trails, forests, or hills.', 'We spent the whole weekend hiking in the national park and saw some amazing views.', 'Chúng tôi đã dành cả cuối tuần để đi bộ đường dài trong công viên quốc gia và ngắm nhìn những cảnh quan tuyệt đẹp.', '{\"en\": \"The resort offers guided outdoor hiking trips for guests who enjoy active vacation experiences.\", \"vi\": \"Khu nghỉ dưỡng cung cấp các chuyến đi bộ đường dài ngoài trời có hướng dẫn cho khách thích kỳ nghỉ vận động.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hiking-ljspeech-f17dde3b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hiking-cori-f17dde3b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hiking-df2bfcb2.webp', '[\"trekking\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"go hiking\", \"meaning\": \"đi đi bộ đường dài\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hiking trail\", \"meaning\": \"tuyến đường đi bộ đường dài\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"walking\", \"note_vi\": \"Walking là đi bộ bình thường, hiking là đi bộ đường dài địa hình tự nhiên.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"hike\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"hiker\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hiking-cori-f17dde3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hiking-aru0-f17dde3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hiking-aru5-f17dde3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hiking-aru6-f17dde3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hiking-aru10-f17dde3b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hiking-aru9-f17dde3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hiking-aru3-f17dde3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hiking-aru7-f17dde3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hiking-aru8-f17dde3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hiking-aru2-f17dde3b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hiking-ljspeech-f17dde3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hiking-lt408-f17dde3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hiking-lt138-f17dde3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hiking-lt624-f17dde3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hiking-lt396-f17dde3b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hiking-lt498-f17dde3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hiking-lt132-f17dde3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hiking-lt288-f17dde3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hiking-lt42-f17dde3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hiking-lt90-f17dde3b.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với động từ \'go\' (go hiking) hoặc danh từ ghép \'hiking trail\' trong chủ đề du lịch.', 'travel', 1, 6),
('34b223db-6248-53b8-89af-1651df29d135', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd63293ee-a627-59f6-b277-d8604c1dd47a', '3c2b1d67-9026-500f-80e7-6d2ad3b37e57', 'laptop', '/ˈlæptɒp/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Máy tính cá nhân nhỏ gọn, có thể mang đi và sử dụng ở nhiều nơi.', 'a small, portable personal computer that you can carry and use anywhere.', 'I use my laptop for work and to watch movies.', 'Tôi dùng máy tính xách tay của mình để làm việc và xem phim.', '{\"en\": \"Please bring your laptop to the meeting so we can review the sales report together.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng mang máy tính xách tay đến cuộc họp để chúng ta có thể xem xét báo cáo doanh số cùng nhau.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laptop-ljspeech-e068381b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laptop-cori-e068381b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/laptop-502d710b.webp', '[\"notebook\", \"portable computer\"]', '[\"desktop\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"laptop computer\", \"meaning\": \"máy tính xách tay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"laptop battery\", \"meaning\": \"pin máy tính xách tay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"company laptop\", \"meaning\": \"máy tính xách tay của công ty\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tablet\", \"note_vi\": \"tablet là máy tính bảng, không có bàn phím vật lý như laptop\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laptop-cori-e068381b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laptop-aru0-e068381b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laptop-aru5-e068381b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laptop-aru6-e068381b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laptop-aru10-e068381b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laptop-aru9-e068381b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laptop-aru3-e068381b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laptop-aru7-e068381b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laptop-aru8-e068381b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laptop-aru2-e068381b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laptop-ljspeech-e068381b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laptop-lt408-e068381b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laptop-lt138-e068381b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laptop-lt624-e068381b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laptop-lt396-e068381b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laptop-lt498-e068381b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laptop-lt132-e068381b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laptop-lt288-e068381b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laptop-lt42-e068381b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laptop-lt90-e068381b.mp3\"]}}', 'Laptop và notebook thường dùng thay nhau; ở Việt Nam hay nói tắt là \'lap\'.', 'technology', 1, 7),
('cfd69451-8c09-5285-a48c-0247bb2949c1', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd63293ee-a627-59f6-b277-d8604c1dd47a', '3c2b1d67-9026-500f-80e7-6d2ad3b37e57', 'trend', 'UK: /trɛnd/ | US: /trɛnd/', 'B1', 'noun', 'xu hướng', 'a general direction in which something is developing, changing, or becoming popular.', 'The company is following the latest market trends.', 'Công ty đang theo dõi các xu hướng thị trường mới nhất.', '{\"en\": \"Recent market research indicates a growing trend toward online shopping among consumers.\", \"vi\": \"Nghiên cứu thị trường gần đây cho thấy một xu hướng gia tăng hướng tới mua sắm trực tuyến của người tiêu dùng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-ljspeech-48075864.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-cori-48075864.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/trend-fda76423.webp', '[\"tendency\", \"pattern\", \"direction\", \"drift\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"upward trend\", \"meaning\": \"xu hướng đi lên / tăng trưởng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"market trend\", \"meaning\": \"xu hướng thị trường\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"trendy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-cori-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-aru0-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-aru5-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-aru6-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-aru10-48075864.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-aru9-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-aru3-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-aru7-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-aru8-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-aru2-48075864.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-ljspeech-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-lt408-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-lt138-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-lt624-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-lt396-48075864.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-lt498-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-lt132-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-lt288-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-lt42-48075864.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trend-lt90-48075864.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm hay gặp trong bài đọc TOEIC: \'trend toward/in\' (xu hướng về mặt...) hoặc \'set a trend\' (tạo ra xu hướng).', 'marketing', 1, 8),
('adebe9eb-e0b6-5542-a5cc-976403e6b082', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd63293ee-a627-59f6-b277-d8604c1dd47a', '3c2b1d67-9026-500f-80e7-6d2ad3b37e57', 'do laundry', '/duː lɔːndri/', 'A2', 'phrase', 'Giặt quần áo bẩn.', 'to wash clothes, sheets, and towels using water and soap.', 'On weekends, I usually do laundry and clean the house.', 'Vào cuối tuần, tôi thường giặt đồ và dọn dẹp nhà cửa.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel offers a quick service for guests who need to do laundry during their stay.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn cung cấp dịch vụ nhanh chóng cho những khách cần giặt đồ trong thời gian lưu trú.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-laundry-ljspeech-60ebcc38.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-laundry-cori-60ebcc38.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/do-laundry-464d896b.webp', '[\"wash clothes\", \"do the washing\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"do laundry by hand\", \"meaning\": \"giặt đồ bằng tay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"do laundry weekly\", \"meaning\": \"giặt đồ hàng tuần\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"do dishes\", \"note_vi\": \"rửa bát đĩa, tránh nhầm với giặt quần áo (do laundry)\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-laundry-cori-60ebcc38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-laundry-aru0-60ebcc38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-laundry-aru5-60ebcc38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-laundry-aru6-60ebcc38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-laundry-aru10-60ebcc38.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-laundry-aru9-60ebcc38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-laundry-aru3-60ebcc38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-laundry-aru7-60ebcc38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-laundry-aru8-60ebcc38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-laundry-aru2-60ebcc38.mp3\"]}, \"us\