('903e0370-a133-541e-a84f-4f5ca85488e6', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd63293ee-a627-59f6-b277-d8604c1dd47a', '3c2b1d67-9026-500f-80e7-6d2ad3b37e57', 'drum', '/drʌm/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Nhạc cụ bộ gõ hình trụ, tạo âm thanh khi đánh.', 'a musical instrument made of skin stretched over a round frame, played by hitting.', 'She learned to play the drum in high school and joined a band.', 'Cô ấy học chơi trống ở trường cấp ba và tham gia một ban nhạc.', '{\"en\": \"The company hired a band with a loud drum for the annual party.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty thuê một ban nhạc với tiếng trống lớn cho bữa tiệc thường niên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drum-ljspeech-1804bfc9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drum-cori-1804bfc9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/drum-90db2a00.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"play the drum\", \"meaning\": \"chơi trống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"drum beat\", \"meaning\": \"nhịp trống\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dumb\", \"note_vi\": \"dumb nghĩa là câm, phát âm khác drum.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"drummer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drum-cori-1804bfc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drum-aru0-1804bfc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drum-aru5-1804bfc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drum-aru6-1804bfc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drum-aru10-1804bfc9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drum-aru9-1804bfc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drum-aru3-1804bfc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drum-aru7-1804bfc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drum-aru8-1804bfc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drum-aru2-1804bfc9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drum-ljspeech-1804bfc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obj