('01194906-fd04-579c-bf88-675f53a12bdd', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd63293ee-a627-59f6-b277-d8604c1dd47a', '3c2b1d67-9026-500f-80e7-6d2ad3b37e57', 'tablet', '/ˈtæblət/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Thiết bị điện tử di động có màn hình cảm ứng lớn, nhỏ hơn máy tính xách tay.', 'a small, flat computer that is controlled by touching the screen or by using a special pen.', 'My sister uses her tablet to read e-books and watch movies.', 'Chị gái tôi dùng máy tính bảng để đọc sách điện tử và xem phim.', '{\"en\": \"The sales representatives use a tablet to show product catalogs to potential clients.\", \"vi\": \"Các đại diện bán hàng sử dụng máy tính bảng để cho khách hàng tiềm năng xem danh mục sản phẩm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-ljspeech-6f4d3f36.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-cori-6f4d3f36.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tablet-73cfde5a.webp', '[\"pad\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"digital tablet\", \"meaning\": \"máy tính bảng kỹ thuật số\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tablet computer\", \"meaning\": \"máy tính bảng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pill\", \"note_vi\": \"tablet cũng có nghĩa là viên thuốc, dễ nhầm với pill.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-cori-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-aru0-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-aru5-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-aru6-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-aru10-6f4d3f36.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-aru9-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-aru3-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-aru7-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-aru8-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-aru2-6f4d3f36.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-ljspeech-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-lt408-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-lt138-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-lt624-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-lt396-6f4d3f36.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-lt498-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-lt132-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-lt288-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-lt42-6f4d3f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tablet-lt90-6f4d3f36.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ cảnh y tế, từ này còn có nghĩa là viên thuốc.', 'technology', 1, 16),
('fed0d672-75ca-5a72-8c3a-b18140f87df5', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd63293ee-a627-59f6-b277-d8604c1dd47a', '3c2b1d67-9026-500f-80e7-6d2ad3b37e57', 'kangaroo', '/ˌkæŋɡəˈruː/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một loài động vật có túi lớn, sống ở Úc, di chuyển bằng cách nhảy.', 'a large wild animal from australia that moves by jumping on its strong back legs.', 'We saw a mother kangaroo with her baby joey in its pouch at the wildlife park.', 'Chúng tôi đã thấy một con chuột túi mẹ với con non của nó trong túi ở công viên hoang dã.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency promoted a tour package that included watching kangaroos in the wild.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty du lịch quảng bá gói tour bao gồm việc ngắm chuột túi trong tự nhiên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kangaroo-ljspeech-7d94bcd8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kangaroo-cori-7d94bcd8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/kangaroo-5832e7c9.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"kangaroo court\", \"meaning\": \"tòa án bất hợp pháp/không công bằng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"baby kangaroo\", \"meaning\": \"chuột túi con\"}, {\"phrase\": \"kangaroo pouch\", \"meaning\": \"túi của chuột túi\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kangaroo-cori-7d94bcd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kangaroo-aru0-7d94bcd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kangaroo-aru5-7d94bcd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kangaroo-aru6-7d94bcd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kangaroo-aru10-7d94bcd8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kangaroo-aru9-7d94bcd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kangaroo-aru3-7d94bcd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kangaroo-aru7-7d94bcd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kangaroo-aru8-7d94bcd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kangaroo-aru2-7d94bcd8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kangaroo-ljspeech-7d94bcd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kangaroo-lt408-7d94bcd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kangaroo-lt138-7d94bcd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kangaroo-lt624-7d94bcd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kangaroo-lt396-7d94bcd8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kangaroo-lt498-7d94bcd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kangaroo-lt132-7d94bcd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kangaroo-lt288-7d94bcd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kangaroo-lt42-7d94bcd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kangaroo-lt90-7d94bcd8.mp3\"]}}', '\'Kangaroo\' là từ vay mượn từ tiếng thổ dân Úc — cứ nhớ đây là biểu tượng của nước Úc.', 'nature', 1, 17),
('6a7b6e70-aade-532d-be68-229322000345', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd63293ee-a627-59f6-b277-d8604c1dd47a', '3c2b1d67-9026-500f-80e7-6d2ad3b37e57', 'translator', '/trænzˈleɪtə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Người chuyển đổi văn bản hoặc lời nói từ ngôn ngữ này sang ngôn ngữ khác.', 'a person whose job is to change words from one language into another language accurately.', 'The company hired a professional translator to localize their software for the Vietnamese market.', 'Công ty đã thuê một phiên dịch viên chuyên nghiệp để bản địa hóa phần mềm của họ cho thị trường Việt Nam.', '{\"en\": \"We hired a professional translator to help us communicate effectively with our new international business partners.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi đã thuê một phiên dịch viên chuyên nghiệp để giúp giao tiếp hiệu quả với đối tác quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/translator-ljspeech-2e47fc71.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/translator-cori-2e47fc71.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/translator-4a8763fc.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"professional translator\", \"meaning\": \"phiên dịch viên chuyên nghiệp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hire a translator\", \"meaning\": \"thuê phiên dịch viên\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"interpreter\", \"note_vi\": \"\'Translator\' thường dịch văn bản, \'interpreter\' thường dịch nói trực tiếp.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"translate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"translation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/translator-cori-2e47fc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/translator-aru0-2e47fc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/translator-aru5-2e47fc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/translator-aru6-2e47fc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/translator-aru10-2e47fc71.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/translator-aru9-2e47fc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/translator-aru3-2e47fc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/translator-aru7-2e47fc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/translator-aru8-2e47fc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/translator-aru2-2e47fc71.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/translator-ljspeech-2e47fc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/translator-lt408-2e47fc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/translator-lt138-2e47fc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/translator-lt624-2e47fc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/translator-lt396-2e47fc71.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/translator-lt498-2e47fc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/translator-lt132-2e47fc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/translator-lt288-2e47fc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/translator-lt42-2e47fc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/translator-lt90-2e47fc71.mp3\"]}}', '\'Translator\' thường dịch văn bản, \'interpreter\' thường dịch nói trực tiếp.', 'business', 1, 18),
('a68f4cc3-fca8-5a91-8a62-e4c4004ba08d', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd63293ee-a627-59f6-b277-d8604c1dd47a', '3c2b1d67-9026-500f-80e7-6d2ad3b37e57', 'short', 'UK: /sɔːt/ | US: /sɔːrt/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'ngắn, vội vã, thiếu hụt', 'Measuring a small distance from end to end or lasting a brief time.', 'Please provide a short explanation for your absence.', 'Vui lòng đưa ra một lời giải thích ngắn gọn cho sự vắng mặt của bạn.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing department is currently short of staff to complete the campaign on time.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng tiếp thị hiện đang thiếu nhân sự để hoàn thành chiến dịch đúng hạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/short-ljspeech-a0f4ea7d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/short-cori-a0f4ea7d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/short-3e0437e6.webp', '[\"brief\", \"insufficient\", \"deficient\", \"limited\"]', '[\"long\", \"adequate\", \"sufficient\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"be short of staff\", \"meaning\": \"thiếu hụt nhân sự\"}, {\"phrase\": \"on short notice\", \"meaning\": \"trong thời gian ngắn / thông báo gấp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"short-term contract\", \"meaning\": \"hợp đồng ngắn hạn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"shortly\", \"note_vi\": \"Short là tính từ (ngắn/thiếu), còn shortly là trạng từ thời gian (sắp sửa/ngay lập tức).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"shorten\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"shortage\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"shortly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/short-cori-a0f4ea7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/short-aru0-a0f4ea7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/short-aru5-a0f4ea7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/short-aru6-a0f4ea7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/short-aru10-a0f4ea7d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/short-aru9-a0f4ea7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/short-aru3-a0f4ea7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/short-aru7-a0f4ea7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/short-aru8-a0f4ea7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/short-aru2-a0f4ea7d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/short-ljspeech-a0f4ea7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/short-lt408-a0f4ea7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/short-lt138-a0f4ea7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/short-lt624-a0f4ea7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/short-lt396-a0f4ea7d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/short-lt498-a0f4ea7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/short-lt132-a0f4ea7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/short-lt288-a0f4ea7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/short-lt42-a0f4ea7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/short-lt90-a0f4ea7d.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, cấu trúc \'be short of/on something\' rất hay xuất hiện với nghĩa là thiếu hụt (nhân sự, ngân sách, thời gian).', 'office', 1, 19),
('49893e3b-ec55-587c-9aa8-437dc0788760', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd63293ee-a627-59f6-b277-d8604c1dd47a', '3c2b1d67-9026-500f-80e7-6d2ad3b37e57', 'snake', '/sneɪk/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Loài bò sát không chân, thân dài, thường sống ở vùng nhiệt đới.', 'a reptile with a long, thin body and no legs.', 'Be careful when walking in the tall grass; there might be a snake.', 'Hãy cẩn thận khi đi bộ trong cỏ cao; có thể có một con rắn.', '{\"en\": \"The resort staff warned guests about a snake spotted near the garden path.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên khu nghỉ dưỡng đã cảnh báo du khách về một con rắn được nhìn thấy gần lối đi trong vườn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-ljspeech-14862708.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-cori-14862708.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/snake-af9d2443.webp', '[\"serpent\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"venomous snake\", \"meaning\": \"rắn độc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"snake bite\", \"meaning\": \"vết rắn cắn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"snack\", \"note_vi\": \"snack là món ăn nhẹ, snake là con rắn, viết gần giống nhau\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"snaky\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-cori-14862708.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-aru0-14862708.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-aru5-14862708.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-aru6-14862708.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-aru10-14862708.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-aru9-14862708.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-aru3-14862708.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-aru7-14862708.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-aru8-14862708.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-aru2-14862708.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-ljspeech-14862708.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-lt408-14862708.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-lt138-14862708.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-lt624-14862708.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-lt396-14862708.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-lt498-14862708.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-lt132-14862708.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-lt288-14862708.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-lt42-14862708.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snake-lt90-14862708.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn phát âm và chính tả giữa snake (con rắn) và snack (đồ ăn nhẹ).', 'nature', 1, 20),
('2265bbf9-8a79-5c82-89e2-cf89df644904', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd63293ee-a627-59f6-b277-d8604c1dd47a', '3c2b1d67-9026-500f-80e7-6d2ad3b37e57', 'upgrade', 'UK: /ˈʌpˌɡreɪd/ | US: /ˈʌpˌɡreɪd/', 'B1', 'verb', 'nâng cấp', 'to raise a system, machine, or service to a higher standard or quality.', 'We need to upgrade our software to the latest version.', 'Chúng ta cần nâng cấp phần mềm lên phiên bản mới nhất.', '{\"en\": \"The IT department decided to upgrade all office servers to improve network security.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận CNTT đã quyết định nâng cấp toàn bộ máy chủ văn phòng để cải thiện an ninh mạng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-ljspeech-7c5e83d7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-cori-7c5e83d7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/upgrade-f0dff446.webp', '[\"improve\", \"enhance\", \"promote\", \"modernize\"]', '[\"downgrade\", \"degrade\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"upgrade the system\", \"meaning\": \"nâng cấp hệ thống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"upgrade to business class\", \"meaning\": \"nâng cấp lên hạng thương gia\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"update\", \"note_vi\": \"cập nhật dữ liệu/thông tin, còn upgrade là cải tiến nâng cao chất lượng/phần cứng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"upgrade\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-cori-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-aru0-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-aru5-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-aru6-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-aru10-7c5e83d7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-aru9-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-aru3-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-aru7-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-aru8-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-aru2-7c5e83d7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-ljspeech-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-lt408-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-lt138-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-lt624-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-lt396-7c5e83d7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-lt498-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-lt132-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-lt288-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-lt42-7c5e83d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upgrade-lt90-7c5e83d7.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng cấu trúc \'upgrade A to B\' (nâng cấp A lên B) hoặc \'upgrade with\' (nâng cấp bằng cái gì).', 'technology', 1, 21),
('f97db2d2-ac66-5e58-a267-c83cbbf5a67c', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd63293ee-a627-59f6-b277-d8604c1dd47a', '3c2b1d67-9026-500f-80e7-6d2ad3b37e57', 'wind energy', '/wɪnd ˈenədʒi/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Năng lượng được tạo ra từ sức gió, dùng để sản xuất điện.', 'power obtained by harnessing the force of moving air, usually to generate electricity.', 'Many countries are investing in wind energy as a renewable power source.', 'Nhiều quốc gia đang đầu tư vào năng lượng gió như một nguồn điện tái tạo.', '{\"en\": \"The government is investing heavily in wind energy to reduce the country\'s dependence on fossil fuels.\", \"vi\": \"Chính phủ đang đầu tư mạnh vào năng lượng gió để giảm sự phụ thuộc của quốc gia vào nhiên liệu hóa thạch.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-energy-ljspeech-ce14c715.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-energy-cori-ce14c715.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/wind-energy-105cb5cb.webp', '[\"wind power\"]', '[\"fossil fuel\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"generate wind energy\", \"meaning\": \"tạo ra năng lượng gió\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wind energy project\", \"meaning\": \"dự án năng lượng gió\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"solar energy\", \"note_vi\": \"Wind energy là năng lượng gió, solar energy là năng lượng mặt trời.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-energy-cori-ce14c715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-energy-aru0-ce14c715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-energy-aru5-ce14c715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-energy-aru6-ce14c715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-energy-aru10-ce14c715.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-energy-aru9-ce14c715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-energy-aru3-ce14c715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-energy-aru7-ce14c715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-energy-aru8-ce14c715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-energy-aru2-ce14c715.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-energy-ljspeech-ce14c715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-energy-lt408-ce14c715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-energy-lt138-ce14c715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-energy-lt624-ce14c715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-energy-lt396-ce14c715.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-energy-lt498-ce14c715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-energy-lt132-ce14c715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-energy-lt288-ce14c715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-energy-lt42-ce14c715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wind-energy-lt90-ce14c715.mp3\"]}}', 'Đây là một dạng năng lượng tái tạo (renewable energy) rất phổ biến trong các bài đọc TOEIC.', 'nature', 1, 22),
('d552e15b-569a-5c70-964e-98c3d6faa589', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd63293ee-a627-59f6-b277-d8604c1dd47a', '3c2b1d67-9026-500f-80e7-6d2ad3b37e57', 'get up', '/ɡɛt ʌp/', 'A1', 'phrasal verb', 'Thức dậy và rời khỏi giường.', 'to stand up or rise from your bed after sleeping.', 'Most commuters get up early to avoid morning traffic jams.', 'Hầu hết người đi làm đều thức dậy sớm để tránh tắc đường buổi sáng.', '{\"en\": \"I have to get up early to attend the morning business conference.\", \"vi\": \"Tôi phải dậy sớm để tham dự hội nghị kinh doanh buổi sáng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-up-ljspeech-3f2d515e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-up-cori-3f2d515e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/get-up-e9df008a.webp', '[\"rise\", \"awaken\"]', '[\"go to bed\", \"lie down\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"get up early\", \"meaning\": \"thức dậy sớm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"get up late\", \"meaning\": \"thức dậy muộn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"wake up\", \"note_vi\": \"mở mắt tỉnh giấc, còn get up là thực sự bước ra khỏi giường\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-up-cori-3f2d515e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-up-aru0-3f2d515e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-up-aru5-3f2d515e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-up-aru6-3f2d515e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-up-aru10-3f2d515e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-up-aru9-3f2d515e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-up-aru3-3f2d515e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-up-aru7-3f2d515e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-up-aru8-3f2d515e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-up-aru2-3f2d515e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-up-ljspeech-3f2d515e.mp3\", \"