('a43e73a3-e39b-5653-9f4c-3e9724b56c30', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd67f6361-2669-5928-a283-9593777b0fea', '4f7e55f3-34b0-5684-a9c5-a779a2a2a5c0', 'cone', '/kəʊn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Vật thể hình nón, có đáy tròn và đỉnh nhọn.', 'a solid shape that has a round base and narrows to a point.', 'The worker placed an orange cone in front of the construction site.', 'Người công nhân đã đặt một chiếc cọc hình nón màu cam phía trước công trường.', '{\"en\": \"The traffic safety team placed a bright orange cone near the construction site entrance.\", \"vi\": \"Đội an toàn giao thông đã đặt một chiếc cọc tiêu màu cam sáng gần lối vào công trường.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-ljspeech-be60dc73.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-cori-be60dc73.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cone-85217bef.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"traffic cone\", \"meaning\": \"cọc tiêu giao thông\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ice cream cone\", \"meaning\": \"ốc quế kem\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-cori-be60dc73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-aru0-be60dc73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-aru5-be60dc73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-aru6-be60dc73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-aru10-be60dc73.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-aru9-be60dc73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-aru3-be60dc73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-aru7-be60dc73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-aru8-be60dc73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-aru2-be60dc73.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-ljspeech-be60dc73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-lt408-be60dc73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/ob