('d3b93aec-0c8c-5cd7-bddf-377f79ad1cad', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd865efe2-b198-5223-ae0f-990972862cb3', '2696178d-39c8-5fe7-afc1-b141af88f67c', 'understand', 'UK: /ˌʌndəˈstændɪŋ/ | US: /ˌʌndərˈstændɪŋ/', 'A1', 'noun', 'sự hiểu biết', 'The ability to comprehend the meaning, nature, or significance of something thoroughly.', 'A clear understanding of the market is crucial for success.', 'Am hiểu rõ ràng về thị trường là rất quan trọng để thành công.', '{\"en\": \"Management expects all team members to develop a clear understand of the compliance rules.\", \"vi\": \"Ban quản lý kỳ vọng tất cả thành viên trong đội đạt được sự hiểu biết rõ ràng về các quy tắc tuân thủ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-ljspeech-8e73840b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-cori-8e73840b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/understand-48165b96.webp', '[\"comprehension\", \"grasp\", \"insight\", \"knowledge\"]', '[\"misunderstanding\", \"ignorance\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"thorough understand\", \"meaning\": \"sự hiểu biết sâu sắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mutual understand\", \"meaning\": \"sự thấu hiểu lẫn nhau\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"understanding\", \"note_vi\": \"\'Understanding\' là danh từ chuẩn phổ biến hơn để chỉ sự thấu hiểu/thỏa thuận.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"understand\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"understandable\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"understanding\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-cori-8e73840b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-aru0-8e73840b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-aru5-8e73840b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-aru6-8e73840b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-aru10-8e73840b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-aru9-8e73840b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-aru3-8e73840b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-aru7-8e73840b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-aru8-8e73840b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-aru2-8e73840b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-ljspeech-8e73840b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-lt408-8e73840b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-lt138-8e73840b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-lt624-8e73840b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-lt396-8e73840b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-lt498-8e73840b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-lt132-8e73840b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-lt288-8e73840b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-lt42-8e73840b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understand-lt90-8e73840b.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong đề thi TOEIC, từ này thường gặp dưới dạng động từ \'understand\' hoặc danh từ \'understanding\'.', 'training', 1, 12),
