('a381a848-360d-584b-bf89-9d338f598096', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd865efe2-b198-5223-ae0f-990972862cb3', '2696178d-39c8-5fe7-afc1-b141af88f67c', 'method', 'UK: /ˈmɛθ.əd/ | US: /ˈmɛθ.əd/', 'A2', 'noun', 'phương pháp', 'a systematic procedure or way of doing something to achieve a specific result.', 'We need a new method for customer outreach.', 'Chúng ta cần một phương pháp mới để tiếp cận khách hàng.', '{\"en\": \"Online credit card payment is the most convenient method for customers purchasing products on our website.\", \"vi\": \"Thanh toán bằng thẻ tín dụng trực tuyến là phương thức thuận tiện nhất cho khách hàng mua sản phẩm trên trang web của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-ljspeech-bfbaf8b2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-cori-bfbaf8b2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/method-a5acef7e.webp', '[\"approach\", \"technique\", \"procedure\", \"system\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"payment method\", \"meaning\": \"phương thức thanh toán\"}, {\"phrase\": \"effective method\", \"meaning\": \"phương pháp hiệu quả\"}, {\"phrase\": \"research method\", \"meaning\": \"phương pháp nghiên cứu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"mode\", \"note_vi\": \"Mode là chế độ/dạng thức (VD: quiet mode, payment mode), còn method là quy trình/phương pháp thực hiện.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"methodical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-cori-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-aru0-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-aru5-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-aru6-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-aru10-bfbaf8b2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-aru9-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-aru3-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-aru7-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-aru8-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-aru2-bfbaf8b2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-ljspeech-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-lt408-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-lt138-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-lt624-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-lt396-bfbaf8b2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-lt498-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-lt132-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-lt288-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-lt42-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-lt90-bfbaf8b2.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm giới từ \'for + V-ing\' hoặc \'of + N\'. Thường gặp trong cụm \'payment method\' (phương thức thanh toán).', 'office', 1, 17),
('58c10c62-5f5e-5960-a953-48f5842935ff', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd865efe2-b198-5223-ae0f-990972862cb3', '2696178d-39c8-5fe7-afc1-b141af88f67c', 'close-knit', '/ˌkləʊsˈnɪt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Gắn bó chặt chẽ, khăng khít (về mối quan hệ).', 'describing a group of people who are very friendly and support each other.', 'Our small community is very close-knit, and everyone knows each other well.', 'Cộng đồng nhỏ của chúng tôi rất gắn bó, và mọi người đều biết rõ về nhau.', '{\"en\": \"Our close-knit sales team always supports each other to meet the monthly revenue targets.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ bán hàng gắn bó của chúng tôi luôn hỗ trợ lẫn nhau để đạt được mục tiêu doanh thu hàng tháng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/close-knit-ljspeech-3221397e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/close-knit-cori-3221397e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/close-knit-ac6a95c1.webp', '[\"tight-knit\", \"intimate\"]', '[\"distant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"close-knit family\", \"meaning\": \"gia đình gắn bó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"close-knit community\", \"meaning\": \"cộng đồng gắn bó\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/close-knit-cori-3221397e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/close-knit-aru0-3221397e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/close-knit-aru5-3221397e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/close-knit-aru6-3221397e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/close-knit-aru10-3221397e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/close-knit-aru9-3221397e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/close-knit-aru3-3221397e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/close-knit-aru7-3221397e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/close-knit-aru8-3221397e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/close-knit-aru2-3221397e.mp3\"]