('c4df7124-487e-5366-a669-4e10ceff8f1c', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd865efe2-b198-5223-ae0f-990972862cb3', '2696178d-39c8-5fe7-afc1-b141af88f67c', 'blue', '/bluː/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một màu cơ bản, giống màu bầu trời trong xanh hoặc biển.', 'the color of the sky without clouds on a bright day.', 'Her favorite color is blue, so she painted her room that shade.', 'Màu yêu thích của cô ấy là màu xanh dương, nên cô ấy đã sơn phòng mình màu đó.', '{\"en\": \"Please highlight the important figures in the financial report using a dark blue.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng làm nổi bật các số liệu quan trọng trong báo cáo tài chính bằng màu xanh dương đậm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-ljspeech-4c9a82ce.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-cori-4c9a82ce.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/blue-d3007dc8.webp', '[\"azure\", \"navy\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"light blue\", \"meaning\": \"xanh nhạt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dark blue\", \"meaning\": \"xanh đậm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"blue\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-cori-4c9a82ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-aru0-4c9a82ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-aru5-4c9a82ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-aru6-4c9a82ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-aru10-4c9a82ce.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-aru9-4c9a82ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-aru3-4c9a82ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-aru7-4c9a82ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-aru8-4c9a82ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-aru2-4c9a82ce.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-ljspeech-4c9a82ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/