('cf333a6f-ecb1-598a-878b-cd7680921f68', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd865efe2-b198-5223-ae0f-990972862cb3', '2696178d-39c8-5fe7-afc1-b141af88f67c', 'bone', '/bəʊn/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Phần cứng tạo thành bộ xương của người hoặc động vật.', 'any of the hard parts that form the frame inside the body of a human or animal.', 'The X-ray examination revealed a slight crack in the patient\'s arm bone.', 'Kết quả chụp X-quang cho thấy một vết nứt nhỏ ở xương tay của bệnh nhân.', '{\"en\": \"The safety inspector warned that a broken bone could result from not wearing proper boots.\", \"vi\": \"Thanh tra an toàn cảnh báo rằng việc không đi giày bảo hộ phù hợp có thể dẫn đến gãy xương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bone-ljspeech-ffdf4ccb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bone-cori-ffdf4ccb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bone-671412f1.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"broken bone\", \"meaning\": \"xương bị gãy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bone density\", \"meaning\": \"mật độ xương\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"bony\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bone-cori-ffdf4ccb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bone-aru0-ffdf4ccb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bone-aru5-ffdf4ccb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bone-aru6-ffdf4ccb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bone-aru10-ffdf4ccb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bone-aru9-ffdf4ccb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bone-aru3-ffdf4ccb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bone-aru7-ffdf4ccb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bone-aru8-ffdf4ccb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bone-aru2-ffdf4ccb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bone-ljspeech-ffdf4ccb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/