('eedaeb67-a437-5f0f-a1a2-1e5bad720e83', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd8d0f820-9005-509b-94c8-f5b5de96b602', 'f60586e2-631b-59c9-a670-890a5bbddaab', 'oval', '/ˈəʊvl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một hình dạng giống quả trứng, tròn nhưng dài hơn ở hai đầu.', 'having a round, elongated shape resembling the outline of a chicken egg.', 'The conference table in the meeting room is an oval shape.', 'Cái bàn hội nghị trong phòng họp có hình bầu dục.', '{\"en\": \"The main conference table in the executive boardroom was built in the shape of an oval.\", \"vi\": \"Bàn họp chính trong phòng họp quản trị được đóng theo hình bầu dục.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oval-ljspeech-181b45bd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oval-cori-181b45bd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/oval-88e1637d.webp', '[\"ellipse\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"in the shape of an oval\", \"meaning\": \"có hình bầu dục\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"ellipse\", \"note_vi\": \"ellipse là hình elip trong toán học, oval là hình bầu dục nói chung\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"oval\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oval-cori-181b45bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oval-aru0-181b45bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oval-aru5-181b45bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oval-aru6-181b45bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oval-aru10-181b45bd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oval-aru9-181b45bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oval-aru3-181b45bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oval-aru7-181b45bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oval-aru8-181b45bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oval-aru2-181b45bd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oval-ljspeech-181b45bd.mp3\", \"/sto