('8f5a9433-0125-546e-81fb-07498873ae4f', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd8d0f820-9005-509b-94c8-f5b5de96b602', 'f60586e2-631b-59c9-a670-890a5bbddaab', 'duck', '/dʌk/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một loài chim nước có cổ ngắn, chân có màng bơi.', 'a common water bird with short legs, webbed feet, and a broad flat beak.', 'Children were happily feeding small pieces of bread to a duck by the river bank.', 'Lũ trẻ đang vui vẻ cho một con vịt ăn những mẩu bánh mì nhỏ bên bờ sông.', '{\"en\": \"The lakeside restaurant serves roasted duck as their signature dish for business dinners.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng bên hồ phục vụ món vịt quay như món ăn đặc trưng cho các bữa tối kinh doanh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duck-ljspeech-5ece2400.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duck-cori-5ece2400.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/duck-be1d8908.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"wild duck\", \"meaning\": \"vịt hoang\"}, {\"phrase\": \"roast duck\", \"meaning\": \"vịt quay\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dock\", \"note_vi\": \"dock là bến tàu, duck là con vịt\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"duck\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duck-cori-5ece2400.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duck-aru0-5ece2400.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duck-aru5-5ece2400.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duck-aru6-5ece2400.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duck-aru10-5ece2400.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duck-aru9-5ece2400.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duck-aru3-5ece2400.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duck-aru7-5ece2400.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duck-aru8-5ece2400.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/duck-aru2-5ece2400.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/du