('38c9956d-4135-5963-b73e-eaf053bda8cf', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd8d0f820-9005-509b-94c8-f5b5de96b602', 'f60586e2-631b-59c9-a670-890a5bbddaab', 'storm', '/stɔːm/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Hiện tượng thời tiết khắc nghiệt với gió mạnh, mưa lớn hoặc tuyết.', 'a violent weather event with strong wind and rain.', 'The storm caused widespread power outages across the region.', 'Cơn bão đã gây mất điện trên diện rộng khắp khu vực.', '{\"en\": \"The storm delayed the shipment of goods to the store.\", \"vi\": \"Cơn bão đã làm chậm trễ lô hàng đến cửa hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storm-ljspeech-6ad3a947.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storm-cori-6ad3a947.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/storm-a4f53b99.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"severe storm\", \"meaning\": \"bão dữ dội\"}, {\"phrase\": \"storm warning\", \"meaning\": \"cảnh báo bão\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"store\", \"note_vi\": \"store là cửa hàng, phát âm gần storm\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"stormy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storm-cori-6ad3a947.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storm-aru0-6ad3a947.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storm-aru5-6ad3a947.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storm-aru6-6ad3a947.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storm-aru10-6ad3a947.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storm-aru9-6ad3a947.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storm-aru3-6ad3a947.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storm-aru7-6ad3a947.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storm-aru8-6ad3a947.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storm-aru2-6ad3a947.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storm-ljspeech-6ad3a947.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storm-l