('49dd3ea1-8719-5b86-9b48-f78d7fee050c', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd8d0f820-9005-509b-94c8-f5b5de96b602', 'f60586e2-631b-59c9-a670-890a5bbddaab', 'mechanic', '/məˈkænɪk/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Người sửa chữa hoặc bảo trì máy móc, đặc biệt là ô tô.', 'a person whose job is to repair machines, especially the engines of motor vehicles.', 'My car broke down, so I had to call a mechanic to fix it.', 'Xe của tôi bị hỏng, vì vậy tôi phải gọi thợ máy đến sửa.', '{\"en\": \"The company fleet manager hired a professional mechanic to perform maintenance on all delivery trucks.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đội xe của công ty đã thuê một thợ máy chuyên nghiệp để bảo trì tất cả xe tải giao hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mechanic-ljspeech-527072a5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mechanic-cori-527072a5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mechanic-8bfb3b15.webp', '[\"repairman\", \"technician\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"car mechanic\", \"meaning\": \"thợ sửa xe\"}, {\"phrase\": \"skilled mechanic\", \"meaning\": \"thợ máy lành nghề\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mechanic-cori-527072a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mechanic-aru0-527072a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mechanic-aru5-527072a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mechanic-aru6-527072a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mechanic-aru10-527072a5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mechanic-aru9-527072a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mechanic-aru3-527072a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mechanic-aru7-527072a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mechanic-aru8-527072a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mechanic-aru2-527072a5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/m