('0d631747-bc5e-58c5-960b-074d92ecf6e7', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd8d0f820-9005-509b-94c8-f5b5de96b602', 'f60586e2-631b-59c9-a670-890a5bbddaab', 'milk', '/mɪlk/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Chất lỏng màu trắng, thường lấy từ bò, dùng để uống hoặc làm thực phẩm.', 'a white liquid produced by female animals to feed their young, used as food.', 'I like to drink a glass of cold milk before bed.', 'Tôi thích uống một ly sữa lạnh trước khi đi ngủ.', '{\"en\": \"The cafe owner ordered extra milk to prepare lattes for the busy morning rush hour.\", \"vi\": \"Chủ quán cà phê đã đặt thêm sữa để chuẩn bị cà phê latte cho giờ cao điểm buổi sáng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milk-ljspeech-cf5dbf0e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milk-cori-cf5dbf0e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/milk-81287354.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fresh milk\", \"meaning\": \"sữa tươi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"skimmed milk\", \"meaning\": \"sữa tách béo\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milk-cori-cf5dbf0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milk-aru0-cf5dbf0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milk-aru5-cf5dbf0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milk-aru6-cf5dbf0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milk-aru10-cf5dbf0e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milk-aru9-cf5dbf0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milk-aru3-cf5dbf0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milk-aru7-cf5dbf0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milk-aru8-cf5dbf0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milk-aru2-cf5dbf0e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milk-ljspeech-cf5dbf0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milk-lt408-cf5dbf0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milk-lt138-cf5dbf0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milk-lt624-cf5dbf0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milk-lt396-cf5dbf0e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milk-lt498-cf5dbf0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milk-lt132-cf5dbf0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milk-lt288-cf5dbf0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milk-lt42-cf5dbf0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milk-lt90-cf5dbf0e.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ cơ bản trong lĩnh vực dịch vụ ăn uống.', 'dining', 1, 9),
('380a34ee-1a0c-5838-8333-eb513a0ae433', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd8d0f820-9005-509b-94c8-f5b5de96b602', 'f60586e2-631b-59c9-a670-890a5bbddaab', 'colleague', '/ˈkɒliːɡ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Người làm việc cùng một công ty hoặc tổ chức.', 'a person that you work with, especially in a professional job or office.', 'She asked a colleague to review her presentation slides before the client meeting.', 'Cô ấy đã nhờ một đồng nghiệp xem lại các trang trình trình bày của mình trước cuộc họp với khách hàng.', '{\"en\": \"I need to consult with my colleague before we submit the final marketing proposal.\", \"vi\": \"Tôi cần tham khảo ý kiến của đồng nghiệp trước khi chúng tôi nộp bản đề xuất tiếp thị cuối cùng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-ljspeech-ace6752b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-cori-ace6752b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/colleague-e90ea70e.webp', '[\"coworker\", \"teammate\", \"associate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"close colleague\", \"meaning\": \"đồng nghiệp thân thiết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"former colleague\", \"meaning\": \"đồng nghiệp cũ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"college\", \"note_vi\": \"colleague là đồng nghiệp, college là trường cao đẳng\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-cori-ace6752b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-aru0-ace6752b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-aru5-ace6752b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-aru6-ace6752b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-aru10-ace6752b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-aru9-ace6752b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-aru3-ace6752b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-aru7-ace6752b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-a