('9cab9586-adb6-51c3-b74f-92a03f1ded33', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd8d0f820-9005-509b-94c8-f5b5de96b602', 'f60586e2-631b-59c9-a670-890a5bbddaab', 'thunder', '/ˈθʌndə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Tiếng sấm rền vang sau tia chớp trong cơn bão.', 'the loud noise that you hear in the sky after a flash of light.', 'The loud thunder made the windows rattle during the intense storm.', 'Tiếng sấm lớn làm rung cửa sổ trong cơn bão dữ dội.', '{\"en\": \"The outdoor business conference was delayed because of the heavy rain and loud thunder.\", \"vi\": \"Hội nghị kinh doanh ngoài trời đã bị hoãn lại vì mưa lớn và tiếng sấm vang dội.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunder-ljspeech-badcfa3c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunder-cori-badcfa3c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/thunder-25e51323.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"loud thunder\", \"meaning\": \"tiếng sấm lớn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clap of thunder\", \"meaning\": \"một tiếng sấm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"thundering\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunder-cori-badcfa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunder-aru0-badcfa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunder-aru5-badcfa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunder-aru6-badcfa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunder-aru10-badcfa3c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunder-aru9-badcfa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunder-aru3-badcfa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunder-aru7-badcfa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunder-aru8-badcfa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunder-aru2-badcfa3c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thunder-ljspeech-badcfa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obje