('b96863b9-e88a-50d6-95b1-740de9e6b42e', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd8d0f820-9005-509b-94c8-f5b5de96b602', 'f60586e2-631b-59c9-a670-890a5bbddaab', 'violet', '/ˈvaɪələt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'một màu sắc nằm giữa xanh dương và đỏ, thường là tím nhạt.', 'a soft purple colour that looks like the small spring flower of the same name.', 'She chose a beautiful violet dress for the party.', 'Cô ấy đã chọn một chiếc váy màu tím nhạt rất đẹp cho bữa tiệc.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team decided to use a soft violet for the new product packaging design.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã quyết định sử dụng màu tím nhạt cho thiết kế bao bì sản phẩm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violet-ljspeech-13818a56.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violet-cori-13818a56.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/violet-408c5381.webp', '[\"purple\", \"lavender\", \"lilac\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pale violet\", \"meaning\": \"tím nhạt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deep violet\", \"meaning\": \"tím đậm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"purple\", \"note_vi\": \"màu tím chung chung, thường đậm hơn violet\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"violet\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violet-cori-13818a56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violet-aru0-13818a56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violet-aru5-13818a56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violet-aru6-13818a56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violet-aru10-13818a56.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violet-aru9-13818a56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violet-aru3-13818a56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violet-aru7-13818a56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violet-aru8-13818a56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violet-aru2-13818a56.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violet-ljspeech-13818a56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violet-lt408-13818a56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violet-lt138-13818a56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violet-lt624-13818a56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violet-lt396-13818a56.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violet-lt498-13818a56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violet-lt132-13818a56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violet-lt288-13818a56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violet-lt42-13818a56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/violet-lt90-13818a56.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này vừa chỉ màu sắc vừa chỉ tên một loài hoa (hoa violet).', 'marketing', 1, 25),
('0a4bcd04-8550-5b97-8cfd-3c6bd3e3dcbf', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd8d0f820-9005-509b-94c8-f5b5de96b602', 'f60586e2-631b-59c9-a670-890a5bbddaab', 'report', '/rɪˈpɔːt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một văn bản hoặc bài nói trình bày thông tin hoặc kết quả điều tra.', 'a written or spoken description of a situation, event, or official investigation.', 'The manager asked me to prepare a detailed report on the project\'s progress.', 'Người quản lý yêu cầu tôi chuẩn bị một báo cáo chi tiết về tiến độ dự án.', '{\"en\": \"Please submit your quarterly financial report to the board of directors by Friday.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng nộp báo cáo tài chính quý của bạn cho hội đồng quản trị trước thứ Sáu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-ljspeech-a27297bd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-cori-a27297bd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/report-6fb22477.webp', '[\"account\", \"statement\", \"record\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"annual report\", \"meaning\": \"báo cáo thường niên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"financial report\", \"meaning\": \"báo cáo tài chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"progress report\", \"meaning\": \"báo cáo tiến độ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"reporter\", \"note_vi\": \"reporter là phóng viên đưa tin, còn report là bản báo cáo\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"report\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"reporter\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-cori-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-aru0-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-aru5-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-aru6-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-aru10-a27297bd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-aru9-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-aru3-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-aru7-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-aru8-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-aru2-a27297bd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-ljspeech-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-lt408-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-lt138-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-lt624-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-lt396-a27297bd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-lt498-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-lt132-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-lt288-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-lt42-a27297bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/report-lt90-a27297bd.mp3\"]}}', 'Report vừa là danh từ (bản báo cáo) vừa là động từ (báo cáo, tường trình).', 'office', 1, 26),
('848b6bda-7c82-5c17-8a54-a22497e70ccf', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd8d0f820-9005-509b-94c8-f5b5de96b602', 'f60586e2-631b-59c9-a670-890a5bbddaab', 'apartment', '/əˈpɑːtmənt/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một đơn vị nhà ở riêng biệt trong một tòa nhà lớn hơn.', 'a set of rooms for living in, usually on one floor of a building.', 'The company rented a spacious modern apartment for the visiting foreign manager.', 'Công ty đã thuê một căn hộ hiện đại rộng rãi cho người quản lý nước ngoài đến thăm.', '{\"en\": \"The company provides a furnished apartment for employees who relocate to the new branch.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty cung cấp một căn hộ đầy đủ nội thất cho nhân viên chuyển đến chi nhánh mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apartment-ljspeech-2cdbffdc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apartment-cori-2cdbffdc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/apartment-034f27df.webp', '[\"flat\", \"condo\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"rent an apartment\", \"meaning\": \"thuê căn hộ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"furnished apartment\", \"meaning\": \"căn hộ có nội thất\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"flat\", \"note_vi\": \"flat dùng trong tiếng Anh-Anh, apartment dùng trong tiếng Anh-Mỹ.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apartment-cori-2cdbffdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apartment-aru0-2cdbffdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apartment-aru5-2cdbffdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apartment-aru6-2cdbffdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apartment-aru10-2cdbffdc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apartment-aru9-2cdbffdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apartment-aru3-2cdbffdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apartment-aru7-2cdbffdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apartment-aru8-2cdbffdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apartment-aru2-2cdbffdc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apartment-ljspeech-2cdbffdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apartment-lt408-2cdbffdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apartment-lt138-2cdbffdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apartment-lt624-2cdbffdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apartment-lt396-2cdbffdc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apartment-lt498-2cdbffdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apartment-lt132-2cdbffdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apartment-lt288-2cdbffdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apartment-lt42-2cdbffdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apartment-lt90-2cdbffdc.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC thường xuất hiện ở các bài đọc về bất động sản hoặc chuyển công tác.', 'housing', 1, 27),
('ca0f638d-077d-5453-9d05-cc0ea19c2211', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd8d0f820-9005-509b-94c8-f5b5de96b602', 'f60586e2-631b-59c9-a670-890a5bbddaab', 'sun', '/sʌn/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Ngôi sao trung tâm của hệ mặt trời, cung cấp ánh sáng và nhiệt.', 'the central star around which the earth and other solar system planets revolve.', 'The sun was shining brightly, making it a perfect day for the beach.', 'Mặt trời chiếu sáng rực rỡ, biến ngày hôm đó thành một ngày hoàn hảo để đi biển.', '{\"en\": \"The solar panels on the roof generate electricity by absorbing energy from the sun.\", \"vi\": \"Các tấm pin mặt trời trên mái nhà tạo ra điện bằng cách hấp thụ năng lượng từ mặt trời.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-ljspeech-22fa6121.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-cori-22fa6121.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sun-010adff8.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sun light\", \"meaning\": \"ánh sáng mặt trời\"}, {\"phrase\": \"under the sun\", \"meaning\": \"dưới ánh mặt trời\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"son\", \"note_vi\": \"son là con trai, sun là mặt trời.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"sunny\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-cori-22fa6121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-aru0-22fa6121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-aru5-22fa6121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-aru6-22fa6121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-aru10-22fa6121.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-aru9-22fa6121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-aru3-22fa6121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-aru7-22fa6121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-aru8-22fa6121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-aru2-22fa6121.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/