('2f419eff-b921-599e-9c60-00f54ca4190a', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'd8d0f820-9005-509b-94c8-f5b5de96b602', 'f60586e2-631b-59c9-a670-890a5bbddaab', 'subject', '/ˈsʌbdʒɪkt/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một lĩnh vực kiến thức được học ở trường.', 'an area of knowledge that is studied in a school, college, or university.', 'Mathematics is often considered a difficult subject by many university freshmen.', 'Toán học thường được coi là một môn học khó bởi nhiều sinh viên năm nhất đại học.', '{\"en\": \"The training program covers a difficult subject related to international trade laws and regulations.\", \"vi\": \"Chương trình đào tạo bao gồm một môn học khó liên quan đến luật và quy định thương mại quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subject-ljspeech-335ce16b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subject-cori-335ce16b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/subject-7b87b228.webp', '[\"course\", \"discipline\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"core subject\", \"meaning\": \"môn học cốt lõi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"compulsory subject\", \"meaning\": \"môn học bắt buộc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"object\", \"note_vi\": \"subject là chủ thể/môn học, object là vật thể/mục tiêu\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"subjective\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subject-cori-335ce16b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subject-aru0-335ce16b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subject-aru5-335ce16b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subject-aru6-335ce16b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subject-aru10-335ce16b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subject-aru9-335ce16b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subject-aru3-335ce16b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subject-aru7-335ce16b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subject-aru8-335ce16b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subject-aru2-335ce16b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subject-ljspeech-335ce16b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subject-lt408-335ce16b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subject-lt138-335ce16b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subject-lt624-335ce16b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subject-lt396-335ce16b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subject-lt498-335ce16b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subject-lt132-335ce16b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subject-lt288-335ce16b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subject-lt42-335ce16b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subject-lt90-335ce16b.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này còn có nghĩa là \'chủ đề\' thảo luận hoặc \'chủ ngữ\' trong ngữ pháp.', 'education', 1, 29),
('fb537913-4ca1-58ec-ab77-35d746b79694', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'e6086918-65c2-5f2e-b980-5ca994d3b513', 'f26cec59-51cb-5acc-b567-ff4e1ce12561', 'speaker', '/ˈspiːkə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Thiết bị phát ra âm thanh; loa.', 'An electronic apparatus designed to output sound by converting incoming audio signals into acoustic waves.', 'The sound quality from these new speakers is incredible.', 'Chất lượng âm thanh từ những chiếc loa mới này thật đáng kinh ngạc.', '{\"en\": \"Please connect the laptop to the speaker before starting the presentation for the board members.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng kết nối máy tính xách tay với loa trước khi bắt đầu bài thuyết trình cho các thành viên hội đồng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/speaker-ljspeech-9ee31843.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/speaker-cori-9ee31843.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/speaker-fed31e6c.webp', '[\"loudspeaker\", \"audio device\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"built-in speaker\", \"meaning\": \"loa tích hợp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sound speaker\", \"meaning\": \"loa âm thanh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"speech\", \"note_vi\": \"speech là bài phát biểu, speaker là người nói hoặc cái loa.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"speak\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/speaker-cori-9ee31843.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/speaker-aru0-9ee31843.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/speaker-aru5-9ee31843.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/speaker-aru6-9ee31843.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/speaker-aru10-9ee31843.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/speaker-aru9-9ee31843.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/speaker-aru3-9ee31843.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/speaker-aru7-9ee31843.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/speaker-aru8-9ee31843.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/speaker-aru2-9ee31843.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/speaker-ljspeech-9ee31843.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/speaker-lt408-9ee31843.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/speaker-lt138-9ee31843.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/speaker-lt624-9ee31843.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/speaker-lt396-9ee31843.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/speaker-lt498-9ee31843.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/speaker-lt132-9ee31843.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/speaker-lt288-9ee31843.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/speaker-lt42-9ee31843.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/speaker-lt90-9ee31843.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ cảnh hội họp, speaker còn có nghĩa là người diễn thuyết.', 'technology', 1, 0),
('34078b1f-2093-508d-a198-d8474893d968', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'e6086918-65c2-5f2e-b980-5ca994d3b513', 'f26cec59-51cb-5acc-b567-ff4e1ce12561', 'barcode', '/ˈbɑːkəʊd/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Mã gồm các vạch đen trắng dùng để nhận dạng sản phẩm.', 'a series of black and white lines on a product that a computer reads to identify it.', 'The warehouse worker used a handheld scanner to check the barcode on each box.', 'Nhân viên nhà kho đã dùng máy quét cầm tay để kiểm tra mã vạch trên mỗi thùng hàng.', '{\"en\": \"Please ensure that the barcode is clearly visible on the package for the inventory tracking system.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đảm bảo mã vạch hiển thị rõ ràng trên gói hàng cho hệ thống theo dõi hàng tồn kho.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barcode-ljspeech-006b53f0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barcode-cori-006b53f0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/barcode-c1995db8.webp', '[\"label\", \"code\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"scan a barcode\", \"meaning\": \"quét mã vạch\"}, {\"phrase\": \"barcode reader\", \"meaning\": \"máy đọc mã vạch\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barcode-cori-006b53f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barcode-aru0-006b53f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barcode-aru5-006b53f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barcode-aru6-006b53f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barcode-aru10-006b53f0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barcode-aru9-006b53f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barcode-aru3-006b53f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barcode-aru7-006b53f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barcode-aru8-006b53f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barcode-aru2-006b53f0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pr