('abafd367-24a8-50fc-a298-fa234bc60627', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'e6086918-65c2-5f2e-b980-5ca994d3b513', 'f26cec59-51cb-5acc-b567-ff4e1ce12561', 'cashier', '/kæˈʃɪə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Người làm công việc nhận và trả tiền trong cửa hàng hoặc ngân hàng.', 'a person whose job is to receive and pay out money in a shop or bank.', 'The cashier quickly scanned my groceries and processed the payment.', 'Cô thu ngân nhanh chóng quét các món đồ tạp hóa của tôi và xử lý thanh toán.', '{\"en\": \"The cashier processed the customer\'s credit card payment and handed over the receipt.\", \"vi\": \"Thu ngân đã xử lý thanh toán thẻ tín dụng của khách hàng và trao hóa đơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-ljspeech-a5b42198.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-cori-a5b42198.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cashier-1cd1db27.webp', '[\"teller\", \"clerk\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"bank cashier\", \"meaning\": \"thu ngân ngân hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"supermarket cashier\", \"meaning\": \"thu ngân siêu thị\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-cori-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-aru0-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-aru5-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-aru6-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-aru10-a5b42198.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-aru9-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-aru3-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-aru7-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-aru8-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-aru2-a5b42198.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-ljspeech-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-lt408-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-lt138-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-lt624-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-lt396-a5b42198.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-lt498-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-lt132-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-lt288-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-lt42-a5b42198.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cashier-lt90-a5b42198.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này chỉ người thu tiền tại quầy thanh toán.', 'shopping', 1, 2),
('ec836205-c486-550d-8deb-7f50fa23e708', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'e6086918-65c2-5f2e-b980-5ca994d3b513', 'f26cec59-51cb-5acc-b567-ff4e1ce12561', 'brand', '/brænd/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Tên, biểu tượng hoặc thiết kế dùng để nhận diện sản phẩm của một công ty.', 'a type of product made by a particular company under a specific name.', 'This new smartphone brand is quickly becoming very popular.', 'Thương hiệu điện thoại thông minh mới này đang nhanh chóng trở nên rất phổ biến.', '{\"en\": \"Our marketing team is working hard to improve the reputation of our new clothing brand.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị của chúng tôi đang nỗ lực cải thiện danh tiếng cho thương hiệu quần áo mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brand-ljspeech-63acf68c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brand-cori-63acf68c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/brand-a0f0f469.webp', '[\"make\", \"label\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"brand name\", \"meaning\": \"tên thương hiệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"leading brand\", \"meaning\": \"thương hiệu hàng đầu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"branding\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brand-cori-63acf68c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brand-aru0-63acf68c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brand-aru5-63acf68c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brand-aru6-63acf68c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brand-aru10-63acf68c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brand-aru9-63acf68c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brand-aru3-63acf68c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brand-aru7-63acf68c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brand-aru8-63acf68c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brand-aru2-63acf68c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v