('64593ea7-15d9-5b13-ab7f-e3a464b4519a', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'e6086918-65c2-5f2e-b980-5ca994d3b513', 'f26cec59-51cb-5acc-b567-ff4e1ce12561', 'Wi-Fi', '/ˈwaɪ.faɪ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Công nghệ cho phép các thiết bị kết nối internet hoặc mạng cục bộ không dây.', 'a system for connecting electronic devices to the internet without using wires.', 'The hotel provides high-speed Wi-Fi connection for all registered guests.', 'Khách sạn cung cấp kết nối Wi-Fi tốc độ cao cho tất cả khách đã đăng ký.', '{\"en\": \"Customers can access the free Wi-Fi network by entering the password printed on the receipt.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng có thể truy cập mạng Wi-Fi miễn phí bằng cách nhập mật khẩu in trên hóa đơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wi-fi-ljspeech-fcd50089.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wi-fi-cori-fcd50089.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/wi-fi-2d6d2a66.webp', '[\"wireless connection\", \"wireless network\"]', '[\"wired connection\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"Wi-Fi connection\", \"meaning\": \"kết nối Wi-Fi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"public Wi-Fi\", \"meaning\": \"Wi-Fi công cộng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hifi\", \"note_vi\": \"Thiết bị âm thanh độ trung thực cao, không phải mạng không dây.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wi-fi-cori-fcd50089.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wi-fi-aru0-fcd50089.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wi-fi-aru5-fcd50089.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wi-fi-aru6-fcd50089.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wi-fi-aru10-fcd50089.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wi-fi-aru9-fcd50089.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wi-fi-aru3-fcd50089.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wi-fi-aru7-fcd50089.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wi-fi-aru8-fcd50089.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wi-fi-aru2-fcd50089.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wi-fi-ljspeech-fcd50089.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wi-fi-lt408-fcd50089.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wi-fi-lt138-fcd50089.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wi-fi-lt624-fcd50089.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wi-fi-lt396-fcd50089.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wi-fi-lt498-fcd50089.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wi-fi-lt132-fcd50089.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wi-fi-lt288-fcd50089.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wi-fi-lt42-fcd50089.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wi-fi-lt90-fcd50089.mp3\"]}}', 'Wi-Fi viết tắt của Wireless Fidelity, dùng để kết nối mạng không dây.', 'technology', 1, 10),
('ad5b4984-5f75-5d82-ac1d-3ebe8e8e1bb8', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'e6086918-65c2-5f2e-b980-5ca994d3b513', 'f26cec59-51cb-5acc-b567-ff4e1ce12561', 'deer', '/dɪə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một loài động vật có vú, thường có sừng, sống ở rừng; hươu, nai.', 'a wild animal with long legs that can run fast and sometimes has horns.', 'We saw a family of deer grazing peacefully in the meadow.', 'Chúng tôi đã thấy một gia đình hươu đang gặm cỏ yên bình trên đồng cỏ.', '{\"en\": \"Drivers near the national park should slow down to avoid hitting deer on the road.\", \"vi\": \"Tài xế gần công viên quốc gia nên đi chậm lại để tránh đâm phải hươu trên đường.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deer-ljspeech-f6f4ab79.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deer-cori-f6f4ab79.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/deer-00f34ef3.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"herd of deer\", \"meaning\": \"bầy hươu/nai\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dear\", \"note_vi\": \"Dear (thân gửi / đắt đỏ) đồng âm với deer (hươu, nai).\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deer-cori-f6f4ab79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deer-aru0-f6f4ab79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deer-aru5-f6f4ab79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deer-aru6-f6f4ab79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deer-aru10-f6f4ab79.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deer-aru9-f6f4ab79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deer-aru3-f6f4ab79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deer-aru7-f6f4ab79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deer-aru8-f6f4ab79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deer-aru2-f6f4ab79.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deer-ljspeech-f6f4ab79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deer-lt408-f6f