('13af68aa-75b1-51fb-9305-979247c1c562', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'e6086918-65c2-5f2e-b980-5ca994d3b513', 'f26cec59-51cb-5acc-b567-ff4e1ce12561', 'mind', 'UK: /maɪnd/ | US: /maɪnd/', 'A2', 'verb', 'phiền, bận tâm', 'to feel annoyed, unhappy, or troubled by a particular action or situation.', 'Do you mind if I open the window?', 'Bạn có phiền không nếu tôi mở cửa sổ?', '{\"en\": \"Would you mind holding the elevator door while I fetch the documents from my desk?\", \"vi\": \"Bạn có phiền giữ cửa thang máy trong lúc tôi lấy tài liệu từ bàn làm việc không?\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-ljspeech-d42c0112.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-cori-d42c0112.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mind-d884bc26.webp', '[\"object to\", \"care about\", \"dislike\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"would you mind doing something\", \"meaning\": \"bạn có phiền làm việc gì không\"}, {\"phrase\": \"never mind\", \"meaning\": \"đừng bận tâm / không sao đâu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"mindful\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"mindless\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-cori-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-aru0-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-aru5-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-aru6-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-aru10-d42c0112.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-aru9-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-aru3-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-aru7-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-aru8-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-aru2-d42c0112.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-ljspeech-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-lt408-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-lt138-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-lt624-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-lt396-d42c0112.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-lt498-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-lt132-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-lt288-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-lt42-d42c0112.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mind-lt90-d42c0112.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc kinh điển trong TOEIC Part 2: \'Would you mind + V-ing...?\'. Trả lời \'Not at all\' hoặc \'No, go ahead\' nghĩa là không phiền (đồng ý).', 'office', 1, 14),
('d9dec101-e3a9-5327-b421-b63906f3c53f', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'e6086918-65c2-5f2e-b980-5ca994d3b513', 'f26cec59-51cb-5acc-b567-ff4e1ce12561', 'eye', '/aɪ/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Bộ phận trên mặt dùng để nhìn.', 'the part of the body that you use for seeing things around you.', 'She has beautiful blue eyes that sparkle when she smiles.', 'Cô ấy có đôi mắt xanh tuyệt đẹp lấp lánh khi cô ấy cười.', '{\"en\": \"The safety inspector told the workers to wear goggles to protect their eyes from dust.\", \"vi\": \"Thanh tra an toàn đã bảo công nhân đeo kính bảo hộ để bảo vệ mắt khỏi bụi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eye-ljspeech-79df4b17.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eye-cori-79df4b17.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/eye-07568a1e.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"keep an eye on\", \"meaning\": \"để mắt tới\"}, {\"phrase\": \"eye contact\", \"meaning\": \"giao tiếp bằng mắt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"eyewitness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eye-cori-79df4b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eye-aru0-79df4b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eye-aru5-79df4b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eye-aru6-79df4b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eye-aru10-79df4b17.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eye-aru9-79df4b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eye-aru3-79df4b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eye-aru7-79df4b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eye-aru8-79df4b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eye-aru2-79df4b17.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eye-ljspeech-79df4b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eye-lt408-79df4b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eye-lt138-79df4b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eye-lt624-79df4b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eye-lt396-79df4b17.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eye-lt498-79df4b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eye-lt132-79df4b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eye-lt288-79df4b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eye-lt42-79df4b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eye-lt90-79df4b17.mp3\"]}}', '\'Keep an eye on\' là cụm từ rất hay gặp trong TOEIC với nghĩa là giám sát.', 'health', 1, 15),
('cd2c81bc-32e3-5d15-8a76-87efb4edc815', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'e6086918-65c2-5f2e-b980-5ca994d3b513', 'f26cec59-51cb-5acc-b567-ff4e1ce12561', 'ticket', '/ˈtɪkɪt/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Mảnh giấy hoặc thẻ cho phép vào cửa, đi lại.', 'a small piece of paper showing that you have paid for a journey or event.', 'Don\'t forget to buy your concert ticket in advance, as they sell out quickly.', 'Đừng quên mua vé buổi hòa nhạc trước, vì chúng bán hết rất nhanh.', '{\"en\": \"Please present your train ticket to the inspector before boarding the carriage.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng trình vé tàu của bạn cho người kiểm tra trước khi lên toa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ticket-ljspeech-346d34a0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ticket-cori-346d34a0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ticket-91acf470.webp', '[\"pass\", \"voucher\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"plane ticket\", \"meaning\": \"vé máy bay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"parking ticket\", \"meaning\": \"vé phạt đỗ xe\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"ticket\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ticket-cori-346d34a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ticket-aru0-346d34a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ticket-aru5-346d34a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ticket-aru6-346d34a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ticket-aru10-346d34a0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ticket-aru9-346d34a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ticket-aru3-346d34a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ticket-aru7-346d34a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ticket-aru8-346d34a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ticket-aru2-346d34a0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ticket-ljspeech-346d34a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/