('351e05dd-75ab-5346-9a88-f78de8b795ce', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'e6086918-65c2-5f2e-b980-5ca994d3b513', 'f26cec59-51cb-5acc-b567-ff4e1ce12561', 'rather', 'UK: /ˈrɑːðər/ | US: /ˈræðər/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'thà, đúng hơn là', 'used to express a preference for one choice or option over another.', 'I\'d rather work from home today.', 'Hôm nay tôi thà làm việc ở nhà hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The executive board decided to invest in digital marketing rather than traditional print ads.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị quyết định đầu tư vào tiếp thị kỹ thuật số thay vì quảng cáo in truyền thống.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-ljspeech-7e8b7811.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-cori-7e8b7811.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rather-b5cdaeb1.webp', '[\"instead of\", \"preferably\", \"sooner\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"would rather\", \"meaning\": \"thà... còn hơn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rather than\", \"meaning\": \"thay vì / đúng hơn là\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"further\", \"note_vi\": \"Xa hơn, sâu hơn (về khoảng cách hoặc mức độ).\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-cori-7e8b7811.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-aru0-7e8b7811.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-aru5-7e8b7811.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-aru6-7e8b7811.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-aru10-7e8b7811.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-aru9-7e8b7811.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-aru3-7e8b7811.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-aru7-7e8b7811.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-aru8-7e8b7811.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-aru2-7e8b7811.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-ljspeech-7e8b7811.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-lt408-7e8b7811.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-lt138-7e8b7811.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-lt624-7e8b7811.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-lt396-7e8b7811.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-lt498-7e8b7811.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-lt132-7e8b7811.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-lt288-7e8b7811.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-lt42-7e8b7811.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-lt90-7e8b7811.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng trong các cụm từ phổ biến như \'would rather do A than do B\' (thà làm A còn hơn B) hoặc \'rather than\' (thay vì).', 'general business', 1, 23),
('c5a9608c-07cb-5744-a7ae-5b3cd5a1b259', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'e6086918-65c2-5f2e-b980-5ca994d3b513', 'f26cec59-51cb-5acc-b567-ff4e1ce12561', 'salt', '/sɔːlt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Gia vị trắng, mặn, dùng để nêm thức ăn.', 'a white mineral used to add flavor to food or preserve it for a long time.', 'Don\'t forget to add a pinch of salt to the soup.', 'Đừng quên thêm một nhúm muối vào súp.', '{\"en\": \"The chef added a pinch of salt to the soup before serving it to the guests.\", \"vi\": \"Đầu bếp thêm một chút muối vào món súp trước khi phục vụ cho khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-ljspeech-b295d117.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-cori-b295d117.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/salt-b9f4ba42.webp', '[\"sodium\", \"seasoning\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sea salt\", \"meaning\": \"muối biển\"}, {\"phrase\": \"add salt\", \"meaning\": \"thêm muối\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"salty\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-cori-b295d117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-aru0-b295d117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-aru5-b295d117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-aru6-b295d117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-aru10-b295d117.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-aru9-b295d117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-aru3-b295d117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-aru7-b295d117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-aru8-b295d117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-aru2-b295d117.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-ljspeech-b295d117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-lt408-b295d117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-lt138-b295d117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-lt624-b295d117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-lt396-b295d117.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-lt498-b295d117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-lt132-b295d117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-lt288-b295d117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-lt42-b295d117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salt-lt90-b295d117.mp3\"]}}', 'Thành ngữ \'worth one\'s salt\' rất hay gặp trong môi trường công sở.', 'dining', 1, 24),
('58f57362-dbd0-5bb8-9698-94d7cc23ecd0', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'e6086918-65c2-5f2e-b980-5ca994d3b513', 'f26cec59-51cb-5acc-b567-ff4e1ce12561', 'happy', '/ˈhæpi/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy hoặc thể hiện sự vui sướng, hài lòng.', 'Characterized by a state of well-being, contentment, and cheerful satisfaction.', 'She was very happy to receive a surprise gift from her friends.', 'Cô ấy rất vui khi nhận được món quà bất ngờ từ bạn bè.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was happy with the team\'s performance during the product launch.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng rất vui vẻ với hiệu suất của đội ngũ trong đợt ra mắt sản phẩm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-ljspeech-3978d009.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-cori-3978d009.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/happy-28ec22f7.webp', '[\"cheerful\", \"glad\", \"delighted\"]', '[\"sad\", \"unhappy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"happy customer\", \"meaning\": \"khách hàng hài lòng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"happy ending\", \"meaning\": \"kết thúc có hậu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"satisfied\", \"note_vi\": \"thể hiện sự thỏa mãn, hài lòng hơn là niềm vui đơn thuần\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"happiness\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"happily\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-cori-3978d009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-aru0-3978d009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-aru5-3978d009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-aru6-3978d009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-aru10-3978d009.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-aru9-3978d009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-aru3-3978d009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-aru7-3978d009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/happy-aru8-3978d009.mp3\", \"/stora