('80008c67-45cb-5b0c-90ea-30f9a6a13807', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'f66c25d5-6acd-5966-9f3f-bd2de181ea38', '4c662684-e43a-5f7c-99f6-785049106d12', 'team', '/tiːm/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một nhóm người cùng làm việc vì một mục tiêu chung.', 'an organized set of individuals collaborating to accomplish a shared objective.', 'The research team presented their findings at the annual conference.', 'Nhóm nghiên cứu đã trình bày các phát hiện của họ tại hội thảo hàng năm.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team will meet tomorrow to discuss the new advertising strategy for the upcoming product.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm tiếp thị sẽ họp vào ngày mai để thảo luận về chiến lược quảng cáo mới cho sản phẩm sắp tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/team-ljspeech-d25187dc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/team-cori-d25187dc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/team-cdc8706d.webp', '[\"group\", \"staff\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sales team\", \"meaning\": \"đội ngũ bán hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"work as a team\", \"meaning\": \"làm việc theo nhóm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"teamwork\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/team-cori-d25187dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/team-aru0-d25187dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/team-aru5-d25187dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/team-aru6-d25187dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/team-aru10-d25187dc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/team-aru9-d25187dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/team-aru3-d25187dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/team-aru7-d25187dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/team-aru8-d25187dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/team-aru2-d25187dc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/team-ljspeech-d25187dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/team-lt408-d25187dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/team-lt138-d25187dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/team-lt624-d25187dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/team-lt396-d25187dc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/team-lt498-d25187dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/team-lt132-d25187dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/team-lt288-d25187dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/team-lt42-d25187dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/team-lt90-d25187dc.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này thường đi với động từ số ít hoặc số nhiều tùy ngữ cảnh.', 'office', 1, 19),
('d3d57f48-fc09-5419-87af-bcbf54b21195', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'f66c25d5-6acd-5966-9f3f-bd2de181ea38', '4c662684-e43a-5f7c-99f6-785049106d12', 'bright', '/braɪt/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Chiếu sáng rực rỡ; thông minh hoặc đầy hứa hẹn.', 'full of light or having a lot of light shining on it.', 'The bright sunlight streamed through the window, waking me up.', 'Ánh nắng chói chang chiếu qua cửa sổ, đánh thức tôi dậy.', '{\"en\": \"The new office has large windows, making the workspace very bright and comfortable for staff.\", \"vi\": \"Văn phòng mới có cửa sổ lớn, làm cho không gian làm việc rất sáng và thoải mái cho nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bright-ljspeech-0570b92f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bright-cori-0570b92f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bright-b57315f9.webp', '[\"shiny\", \"luminous\"]', '[\"dark\", \"dim\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"bright light\", \"meaning\": \"ánh sáng rực rỡ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bright color\", \"meaning\": \"màu sắc tươi sáng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"brighten\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bright-cori-0570b92f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bright-aru0-0570b92f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bright-aru5-0570b92f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bright-aru6-0570b92f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bright-aru10-0570b92f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bright-aru9-0570b92f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bright-aru3-0570b92f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bright-aru7-0570b92f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bright-aru8-0570b92f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bright-aru2-0570b92f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bright-ljspeech-0570b92f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bright-lt408-0570b92f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bright-lt138-0570b92f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bright-lt624-0570b92f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bright-lt396-0570b92f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bright-lt498-0570b92f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bright-lt132-0570b92f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bright-lt288-0570b92f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bright-lt42-0570b92f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bright-lt90-0570b92f.mp3\"]}}', 'có thể dùng để chỉ người thông minh (a bright student).', 'office', 1, 20),
('1ec6e261-eea3-5a82-a7aa-57547e802351', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'f66c25d5-6acd-5966-9f3f-bd2de181ea38', '4c662684-e43a-5f7c-99f6-785049106d12', 'task', '/tɑːsk/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một công việc hoặc nhiệm vụ cụ thể cần phải làm.', 'a specific piece of work or duty that someone is required to do.', 'Assigning each task to the appropriate team member ensures maximum efficiency.', 'Phân công mỗi nhiệm vụ cho thành viên nhóm phù hợp giúp đảm bảo hiệu quả tối đa.', '{\"en\": \"Each employee was assigned a task to complete before the end of the quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Mỗi nhân viên được giao một nhiệm vụ cần hoàn thành trước cuối quý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-ljspeech-7fbb727d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-cori-7fbb727d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/task-05525111.webp', '[\"assignment\", \"duty\", \"job\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"assign a task\", \"meaning\": \"giao nhiệm vụ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"complete a task\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn thành nhiệm vụ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"task force\", \"meaning\": \"lực lượng đặc nhiệm, nhóm chuyên trách\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"duty\", \"note_vi\": \"duty thiên về trách nhiệm đạo đức hoặc pháp lý, task là công việc cụ thể được giao\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"task\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-cori-7fbb727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-aru0-7fbb727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-aru5-7fbb727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-aru6-7fbb727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-aru10-7fbb727d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-aru9-7fbb727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-aru3-7fbb727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-aru7-7fbb727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-aru8-7fbb727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-aru2-7fbb727d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-ljspeech-7fbb727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-lt408-7fbb727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-lt138-7fbb727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-lt624-7fbb727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-lt396-7fbb727d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-lt498-7fbb727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-lt132-7fbb727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-lt288-7fbb727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-lt42-7fbb727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-lt90-7fbb727d.mp3\"]}}', '\'Task force\' là nhóm chuyên trách giải quyết vấn đề cụ thể, hay xuất hiện trong TOEIC.', 'office', 1, 21),
('1ad9c9cc-fdbb-59d2-b288-7a27cb3993f0', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'f66c25d5-6acd-5966-9f3f-bd2de181ea38', '4c662684-e43a-5f7c-99f6-785049106d12', 'install', '/ɪnˈstɔːl/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Đặt một chương trình vào máy tính hoặc thiết bị để sử dụng.', 'to put a new piece of software or equipment onto a computer or in a place so it is ready to use.', 'You need to install the new operating system to get the latest features.', 'Bạn cần cài đặt hệ điều hành mới để có các tính năng mới nhất.', '{\"en\": \"The IT team will install the new firewall system on all office computers tomorrow.\", \"vi\": \"Đội IT sẽ cài đặt hệ thống tường lửa mới trên tất cả máy tính văn phòng vào ngày mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-ljspeech-89fb511f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-cori-89fb511f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/install-1dc3a5f6.webp', '[\"set up\", \"configure\"]', '[\"uninstall\", \"remove\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"install software\", \"meaning\": \"cài đặt phần mềm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"install a system\", \"meaning\": \"cài đặt hệ thống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"install an update\", \"meaning\": \"cài đặt bản cập nhật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"uninstall\", \"note_vi\": \"uninstall là gỡ bỏ phần mềm, ngược với install\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"installation\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"installer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-cori-89fb511f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-aru0-89fb511f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-aru5-89fb511f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-aru6-89fb511f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-aru10-89fb511f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-aru9-89fb511f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-aru3-89fb511f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-aru7-89fb511f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-aru8-89fb511f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-aru2-89fb511f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-ljspeech-89fb511f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-lt408-89fb511f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-lt138-89fb511f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-lt624-89fb511f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-lt396-89fb511f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-lt498-89fb511f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-lt132-89fb511f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-lt288-89fb511f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-lt42-89fb511f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-lt90-89fb511f.mp3\"]}}', '\'Install\' dùng cho cả phần mềm lẫn thiết bị vật lý như máy móc, điều hòa.', 'technology', 1, 22),
('8194d0d3-6228-5815-8f68-b8ed75195d39', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'f66c25d5-6acd-5966-9f3f-bd2de181ea38', '4c662684-e43a-5f7c-99f6-785049106d12', 'grateful', '/ˈɡreɪtfl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy biết ơn, trân trọng sự giúp đỡ của ai đó.', 'Expressing or feeling appreciation and thankfulness toward another person for assistance received.', 'I am truly grateful for your support during this difficult time.', 'Tôi thực sự biết ơn sự hỗ trợ của bạn trong thời điểm khó khăn này.', '{\"en\": \"We are very grateful for your professional support during the difficult transition period last month.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi rất biết ơn sự hỗ trợ chuyên nghiệp của bạn trong giai đoạn chuyển đổi khó khăn tháng trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-ljspeech-54bb9bd5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-cori-54bb9bd5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/grateful-b14fbfe2.webp', '[\"thankful\", \"appreciative\"]', '[\"ungrateful\", \"thankless\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"be grateful for\", \"meaning\": \"biết ơn vì điều gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deeply grateful\", \"meaning\": \"vô cùng biết ơn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"gratitude\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-cori-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-aru0-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-aru5-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-aru6-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-aru10-54bb9bd5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-aru9-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-aru3-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-aru7-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-aru8-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-aru2-54bb9bd5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-ljspeech-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-lt408-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-lt138-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-lt624-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-lt396-54bb9bd5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-lt498-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-lt132-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-lt288-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-lt42-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-lt90-54bb9bd5.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng trong email trang trọng để thể hiện sự cảm kích với đối tác hoặc đồng nghiệp.', 'office', 1, 23),
('d1feb51d-e087-5ff4-9528-0e942a4a6767', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'f66c25d5-6acd-5966-9f3f-bd2de181ea38', '4c662684-e43a-5f7c-99f6-785049106d12', 'busy', 'UK: /ˈbɪzi/ | US: /ˈbɪzi/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'bận rộn', 'actively involved in work or tasks and having little or no spare time', 'I will be busy with meetings all morning.', 'Tôi sẽ bận họp suốt buổi sáng.', '{\"en\": \"The representative is busy preparing the financial presentation for the board meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Người đại diện đang bận rộn chuẩn bị bản thuyết trình tài chính cho cuộc họp hội đồng quản trị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/busy-ljspeech-e18a89f9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/busy-cori-e18a89f9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/busy-3757d4b2.webp', '[\"occupied\", \"swamped\", \"engaged\"]', '[\"idle\", \"free\", \"available\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"busy schedule\", \"meaning\": \"lịch trình bận rộn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"busy season\", \"meaning\": \"mùa bận rộn / mùa cao điểm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"busiest\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"business\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"busily\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/busy-cori-e18a89f9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/busy-aru0-e18a89f9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/busy-aru5-e18a89f9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/busy-aru6-e18a89f9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/busy-aru10-e18a89f9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/busy-aru9-e18a89f9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/busy-aru3-e18a89f9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/busy-aru7-e18a89f9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/busy-aru8-e18a89f9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/busy-aru2-e18a89f9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage