('13c4f8a2-cf54-52f1-b768-68cb64c9a5be', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'f66c25d5-6acd-5966-9f3f-bd2de181ea38', '4c662684-e43a-5f7c-99f6-785049106d12', 'black', '/blæk/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Màu sắc tối nhất, không có ánh sáng.', 'the darkest color, like the sky at night when there is no moon.', 'My favorite color is black because it looks very elegant.', 'Màu yêu thích của tôi là màu đen vì nó trông rất thanh lịch.', '{\"en\": \"The company logo is printed in black on all official documents and business cards.\", \"vi\": \"Logo của công ty được in màu đen trên tất cả các tài liệu chính thức và danh thiếp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/black-ljspeech-466bc8ce.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/black-cori-466bc8ce.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/black-ceb0a211.webp', NULL, '[\"white\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"jet black\", \"meaning\": \"đen tuyền\"}, {\"phrase\": \"black ink\", \"meaning\": \"mực đen\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"blacken\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/black-cori-466bc8ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/black-aru0-466bc8ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/black-aru5-466bc8ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/black-aru6-466bc8ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/black-aru10-466bc8ce.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/black-aru9-466bc8ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/black-aru3-466bc8ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/black-aru7-466bc8ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/black-aru8-466bc8ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/black-aru2-466bc8ce.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/black-ljspeech-466bc8ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/black-lt408-466bc8ce.mp3\", \"/storag