('84147dcf-7d94-553d-9161-eb7d22f54b6c', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'f66c25d5-6acd-5966-9f3f-bd2de181ea38', '4c662684-e43a-5f7c-99f6-785049106d12', 'land', '/lænd/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Bề mặt khô của Trái Đất, không phải biển.', 'the solid surface of the earth that is not covered by water.', 'The firm recently acquired a parcel of agricultural land for commercial development.', 'Công ty gần đây đã mua một mảnh đất nông nghiệp để phát triển thương mại.', '{\"en\": \"The company purchased a large piece of land to build a new manufacturing facility.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã mua một mảnh đất lớn để xây dựng một cơ sở sản xuất mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/land-ljspeech-3d3b60b2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/land-cori-3d3b60b2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/land-6e7e3edb.webp', '[\"ground\", \"earth\"]', '[\"sea\", \"water\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"buy land\", \"meaning\": \"mua đất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"land development\", \"meaning\": \"phát triển đất đai\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"land\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/land-cori-3d3b60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/land-aru0-3d3b60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/land-aru5-3d3b60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/land-aru6-3d3b60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/land-aru10-3d3b60b2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/land-aru9-3d3b60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/land-aru3-3d3b60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/land-aru7-3d3b60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/land-aru8-3d3b60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/land-aru2-3d3b60b2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/land-ljspeech-3d3b60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/land-lt408-3d3b60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/land-lt138-3d3b60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/land-lt624-3d3b60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/land-lt396-3d3b60b2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/land-lt498-3d3b60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/land-lt132-3d3b60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/land-lt288-3d3b60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/land-lt42-3d3b60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/land-lt90-3d3b60b2.mp3\"]}}', 'Động từ \'land\' có nghĩa là hạ cánh (máy bay).', 'housing', 1, 29),
('bf73decf-0033-5931-8df2-b4082492cf4e', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'f9eaa297-33e4-5702-8403-3f88e6254a90', '3f657b9c-338d-553e-a09a-f6ed804ab859', 'athlete', '/ˈæθliːt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Người tập luyện và thi đấu thể thao.', 'a person who competes in sports or physical activities that require strength and speed.', 'The injured athlete worked closely with a physical therapist to recover quickly.', 'Vận động viên bị thương đã làm việc chặt chẽ với chuyên gia vật lý trị liệu để hồi phục nhanh chóng.', '{\"en\": \"The famous athlete signed a lucrative endorsement deal with our sportswear manufacturing company today.\", \"vi\": \"Vận động viên nổi tiếng đã ký một hợp đồng quảng cáo béo bở với công ty sản xuất đồ thể thao của chúng tôi hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/athlete-ljspeech-28225711.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/athlete-cori-28225711.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/athlete-6ee2aeb7.webp', '[\"sportsperson\", \"competitor\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"professional athlete\", \"meaning\": \"vận động viên chuyên nghiệp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"top athlete\", \"meaning\": \"vận động viên hàng đầu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"athletic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/athlete-cori-28225711.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/athlete-aru0-28225711.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/athlete-aru5-28225711.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/athlete-aru6-28225711.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/athlete-aru10-28225711.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/athlete-aru9-28225711.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/athlete-aru3-28225711.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/athlete-aru7-28225711.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/athlete-aru8-28225711.mp3\", \"/sto