('ddeaeed0-00f5-59e7-a152-e51e329c82c7', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'f9eaa297-33e4-5702-8403-3f88e6254a90', '3f657b9c-338d-553e-a09a-f6ed804ab859', 'ill', '/ɪl/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Không khỏe, bị ốm.', 'not feeling well and suffering from a physical or mental sickness.', 'My grandmother is feeling ill today, so she can\'t come.', 'Bà tôi hôm nay cảm thấy không khỏe, nên bà không thể đến được.', '{\"en\": \"The manager called in ill and missed the client meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý gọi báo bệnh và đã bỏ lỡ cuộc họp với khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ill-ljspeech-e233f084.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ill-cori-e233f084.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ill-838840d0.webp', '[\"sick\", \"unwell\"]', '[\"healthy\", \"well\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fall ill\", \"meaning\": \"đột ngột bị bệnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"seriously ill\", \"meaning\": \"bệnh rất nặng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ill health\", \"meaning\": \"tình trạng sức khỏe kém\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"evil\", \"note_vi\": \"evil là xấu ác, ill là bệnh hoặc tồi\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"illness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ill-cori-e233f084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ill-aru0-e233f084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ill-aru5-e233f084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ill-aru6-e233f084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ill-aru10-e233f084.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ill-aru9-e233f084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ill-aru3-e233f084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ill-aru7-e233f084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ill-aru8-e233f084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ill-aru2-e233f084.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ill-ljspeech-e233f084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ill-lt408-e233f084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ill-lt138-e233f084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ill-lt624-e233f084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ill-lt396-e233f084.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ill-lt498-e233f084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ill-lt132-e233f084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ill-lt288-e233f084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ill-lt42-e233f084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ill-lt90-e233f084.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong tiếng Anh-Mỹ thường dùng \'sick\' thay cho \'ill\'.', 'health', 1, 9),
('30243bfd-41b3-5805-966d-28722de69590', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'f9eaa297-33e4-5702-8403-3f88e6254a90', '3f657b9c-338d-553e-a09a-f6ed804ab859', 'generation gap', '/ˌdʒɛnəˈreɪʃən ɡæp/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự khác biệt về quan điểm, giá trị giữa các thế hệ.', 'a difference in attitude or behavior between older and younger groups of people.', 'The generation gap often leads to misunderstandings between parents and their children.', 'Khoảng cách thế hệ thường dẫn đến những hiểu lầm giữa cha mẹ và con cái.', '{\"en\": \"The corporate seminar addressed the generation gap between senior executives and young interns.\", \"vi\": \"Hội thảo doanh nghiệp đã giải quyết khoảng cách thế hệ giữa các lãnh đạo cấp cao và thực tập sinh trẻ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-gap-ljspeech-9d756a3b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-gap-cori-9d756a3b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/generation-gap-83aa9dfc.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"bridge the generation gap\", \"meaning\": \"thu hẹp khoảng cách thế hệ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wide generation gap\", \"meaning\": \"khoảng cách thế hệ lớn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"gender gap\", \"note_vi\": \"Gender gap là khoảng cách giới tính, generation gap là khoảng cách thế hệ.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-gap-cori-9d756a3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-gap-aru0-9d756a3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-gap-aru5-9d756a3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-gap-aru6-9d756a3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-gap-aru10-9d756a3b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-gap-aru9-9d756a3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-gap-aru3-9d756a3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-gap-aru7-9d756a3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-gap-aru8-9d756a3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-gap-aru2-9d756a3b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-gap-ljspeech-9d756a3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-gap-lt408-9d756a3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-gap-lt138-9d756a3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-gap-lt624-9d756a3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-gap-lt396-9d756a3b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-gap-lt498-9d756a3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-gap-lt132-9d756a3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-gap-lt288-9d756a3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-gap-lt42-9d756a3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generation-gap-lt90-9d756a3b.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với động từ bridge (thu hẹp) hoặc narrow (nới hẹp khoảng cách).', 'hr', 1, 10),
('459d25f2-f291-5f09-9981-20d038f2a146', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'f9eaa297-33e4-5702-8403-3f88e6254a90', '3f657b9c-338d-553e-a09a-f6ed804ab859', 'grape', '/ɡreɪp/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Loại quả nhỏ, mọng nước, thường mọc thành chùm.', 'a small round fruit that grows in bunches on a climbing plant called a vine.', 'She loves to eat fresh grapes as a healthy snack.', 'Cô ấy thích ăn nho tươi như một món ăn vặt lành mạnh.', '{\"en\": \"The catering service will provide fresh grapes and other seasonal fruits for the business lunch.\", \"vi\": \"Dịch vụ ăn uống sẽ cung cấp nho tươi và các loại trái cây theo mùa cho bữa trưa công việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grape-ljspeech-bc8a2f8c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grape-cori-bc8a2f8c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/grape-60b07000.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"bunch of grapes\", \"meaning\": \"chùm nho\"}, {\"phrase\": \"grape juice\", \"meaning\": \"nước ép nho\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grape-cori-bc8a2f8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grape-aru0-bc8a2f8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grape-aru5-bc8a2f8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grape-aru6-bc8a2f8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grape-aru10-bc8a2f8c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grape-aru9-bc8a2f8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grape-aru3-bc8a2f8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grape-aru7-bc8a2f8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grape-aru8-bc8a2f8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grape-aru2-bc8a2f8c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grape-ljspeech-bc8a2f8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grape-lt408-bc8a2f8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obje