('cc29e14e-d61a-50cd-a286-54926231cdba', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'f9eaa297-33e4-5702-8403-3f88e6254a90', '3f657b9c-338d-553e-a09a-f6ed804ab859', 'photographer', '/fəˈtɒɡrəfə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Người chụp ảnh chuyên nghiệp hoặc có sở thích.', 'a person who takes pictures as a job or a professional hobby.', 'The wedding photographer captured every beautiful moment of the ceremony.', 'Nhiếp ảnh gia đám cưới đã ghi lại mọi khoảnh khắc đẹp của buổi lễ.', '{\"en\": \"The company hired a professional photographer to take photos for the new marketing brochure.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã thuê một nhiếp ảnh gia chuyên nghiệp để chụp ảnh cho tập quảng cáo mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photographer-ljspeech-9ce9b6ec.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photographer-cori-9ce9b6ec.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/photographer-0f6549f6.webp', '[\"cameraman\", \"photojournalist\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"professional photographer\", \"meaning\": \"nhiếp ảnh gia chuyên nghiệp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hire a photographer\", \"meaning\": \"thuê nhiếp ảnh gia\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"photography\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photographer-cori-9ce9b6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photographer-aru0-9ce9b6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photographer-aru5-9ce9b6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photographer-aru6-9ce9b6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photographer-aru10-9ce9b6ec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photographer-aru9-9ce9b6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photographer-aru3-9ce9b6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photographer-aru7-9ce9b6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photographer-aru8-9ce9b6ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public