('38fe6471-0e0e-57d5-9faf-ad75c0b330b2', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'fd99e87f-6c35-5278-9a9a-cecc75adc626', '6be91ac3-840d-5453-b84d-f380cf6d1c9a', 'stepfather', '/ˈstepfɑːðə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Người chồng sau của mẹ, không phải cha ruột.', 'the man who is married to your mother but is not your real father.', 'My stepfather has always treated me like his own child.', 'Cha dượng của tôi luôn đối xử với tôi như con ruột của ông ấy.', '{\"en\": \"The executive invited his stepfather to attend the annual company celebration banquet last night.\", \"vi\": \"Vị điều hành đã mời cha dượng của mình tham dự buổi tiệc mừng hàng năm của công ty tối qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepfather-ljspeech-78d0c696.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepfather-cori-78d0c696.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stepfather-a5154527.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"loving stepfather\", \"meaning\": \"người cha dượng thương yêu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"godfather\", \"note_vi\": \"godfather là cha đỡ đầu, khác stepfather là cha dượng\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepfather-cori-78d0c696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepfather-aru0-78d0c696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepfather-aru5-78d0c696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepfather-aru6-78d0c696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepfather-aru10-78d0c696.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepfather-aru9-78d0c696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepfather-aru3-78d0c696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepfather-aru7-78d0c696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepfather-aru8-78d0c696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepfather-aru2-78d0c696.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepfather-ljspeech-78d0c696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepfather-lt408-78d0c696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepfather-lt138-78d0c696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepfather-lt624-78d0c696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepfather-lt396-78d0c696.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepfather-lt498-78d0c696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepfather-lt132-78d0c696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepfather-lt288-78d0c696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepfather-lt42-78d0c696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stepfather-lt90-78d0c696.mp3\"]}}', 'Người đàn ông kết hôn với mẹ bạn nhưng không phải cha ruột.', 'daily', 1, 6),
('9888a2a6-ecf4-5396-9da9-a2d3291f146a', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'fd99e87f-6c35-5278-9a9a-cecc75adc626', '6be91ac3-840d-5453-b84d-f380cf6d1c9a', 'half-brother', '/ˌhɑːfˈbrʌðə/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Người anh hoặc em trai chỉ chung cha hoặc chung mẹ.', 'a male person who shares only one parent with you instead of both parents.', 'My half-brother lives in another city, so we don\'t see each other often.', 'Anh cùng cha khác mẹ của tôi sống ở thành phố khác, nên chúng tôi không gặp nhau thường xuyên.', '{\"en\": \"My half-brother will join our marketing team as a new project manager next month.\", \"vi\": \"Anh trai cùng cha khác mẹ của tôi sẽ gia nhập đội ngũ tiếp thị với tư cách là quản lý dự án mới vào tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-brother-ljspeech-c2a209e6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-brother-cori-c2a209e6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/half-brother-820116b0.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"younger half-brother\", \"meaning\": \"em trai cùng cha hoặc mẹ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"older half-brother\", \"meaning\": \"anh trai cùng cha hoặc mẹ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"stepbrother\", \"note_vi\": \"không cùng huyết thống, là con riêng của cha hoặc mẹ kế.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-brother-cori-c2a209e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-brother-aru0-c2a209e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-brother-aru5-c2a209e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-brother-aru6-c2a209e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-brother-aru10-c2a209e6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-brother-aru9-c2a209e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-brother-aru3-c2a209e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-brother-aru7-c2a209e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-brother-aru8-c2a209e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-brother-aru2-c2a209e6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-brother-ljspeech-c2a209e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-brother-lt408-c2a209e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-brother-lt138-c2a209e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-brother-lt624-c2a209e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-brother-lt396-c2a209e6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-brother-lt498-c2a209e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-brother-lt132-c2a209e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-brother-lt288-c2a209e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-brother-lt42-c2a209e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-brother-lt90-c2a209e6.mp3\"]}}', 'Cần phân biệt rõ với stepbrother (không cùng huyết thống).', 'other', 1, 7),
('46bed780-1e03-50df-9496-c4b4642f7ffc', '916d709b-04e4-55ae-a9e0-a43b249586ee', 'fd99e87f-6c35-5278-9a9a-cecc75adc626', '6be91ac3-840d-5453-b84d-f380cf6d1c9a', 'pale', '/peɪl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có màu sắc yếu ớt, không tươi hoặc nhợt nhạt (da).', 'having a light color or skin tone that is less intense than usual or expected.', 'The painter selected a pale blue color for the office conference room walls.', 'Họa sĩ đã chọn một màu xanh nhạt cho các bức tường của phòng họp văn phòng.', '{\"en\": \"The walls were painted a pale blue color to make the small office look larger.\", \"vi\": \"Các bức tường được sơn màu xanh nhạt để làm cho văn phòng nhỏ trông rộng hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pale-ljspeech-c1df0ba9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pale-cori-c1df0ba9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pale-a3c34346.webp', '[\"light\", \"faint\"]', '[\"dark\", \"vivid\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"pale color\", \"meaning\": \"màu nhạt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"look pale\", \"meaning\": \"trông nhợt nhạt\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pale-cori-c1df0ba9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pale-aru0-c1df0ba9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pale-aru5-c1df0ba9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pale-aru6-c1df0ba9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pale-aru10-c1df0ba9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pale-aru9-c1df0ba9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pale-aru3-c1df0ba9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pale-aru7-c1df0ba9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pale-aru8-c1df0ba9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pale-aru2-c1df0ba9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pale-ljspeech-c1df0ba9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v