('056ea3be-432e-50a3-bbd9-c6927ab4fa20', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '0b5420a5-9178-5792-bafe-bd6b06eaccaf', '5a65df39-111c-5ee9-a103-7f28d6bad1e7', 'catch a flick', '/kætʃ ə flɪk/', 'B1', 'idiom', 'Đi xem một bộ phim.', 'to go to a cinema to watch a movie for entertainment.', 'After dinner, we decided to catch a flick at the local cinema.', 'Sau bữa tối, chúng tôi quyết định đi xem phim ở rạp chiếu phim địa phương.', '{\"en\": \"After the long conference, the team decided to catch a flick at the nearby theater.\", \"vi\": \"Sau hội nghị dài, cả nhóm quyết định đi xem phim tại rạp gần đó.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-a-flick-ljspeech-825a2e3a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-a-flick-cori-825a2e3a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/catch-a-flick-1c516dd6.webp', '[\"watch a movie\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"go to the movies\", \"meaning\": \"đi xem phim\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-a-flick-cori-825a2e3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-a-flick-aru0-825a2e3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-a-flick-aru5-825a2e3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-a-flick-aru6-825a2e3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-a-flick-aru10-825a2e3a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-a-flick-aru9-825a2e3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-a-flick-aru3-825a2e3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-a-flick-aru7-825a2e3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-a-flick-aru8-825a2e3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-a-flick-aru2-825a2e3a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-a-flick-ljspeech-825a2e3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-a-flick-l