('408216e4-e9d0-527f-95b6-93f4539a690f', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '13c40294-0bf1-5e79-a66a-49756a7bce9d', '343ac0dc-11e9-54f2-b9f6-c4f2f35dddc5', 'fish', '/fɪʃ/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Loài động vật sống dưới nước, có vây và mang.', 'an animal that lives in water, is covered with scales, and breathes through gills.', 'We caught a lot of fish during our fishing trip to the lake.', 'Chúng tôi đã bắt được rất nhiều cá trong chuyến đi câu ở hồ.', '{\"en\": \"The upscale restaurant near the office serves fresh fish delivered daily from the coast.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng cao cấp gần văn phòng phục vụ cá tươi được giao hàng ngày từ vùng biển.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-ljspeech-64875fcc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-cori-64875fcc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fish-a84e182b.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fresh fish\", \"meaning\": \"cá tươi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"catch fish\", \"meaning\": \"đánh bắt cá\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fishing\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fisherman\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-cori-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-aru0-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-aru5-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-aru6-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-aru10-64875fcc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-aru9-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-aru3-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-aru7-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-aru8-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-aru2-64875fcc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fish-ljspeech-64875fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pu