('6d8f870a-b287-5272-800f-de9d6485f1de', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '13c40294-0bf1-5e79-a66a-49756a7bce9d', '343ac0dc-11e9-54f2-b9f6-c4f2f35dddc5', 'hook', 'UK: /hʊk/ | US: /hʊk/', 'B2', 'noun', 'cái móc', 'A curved piece of metal or plastic used for hanging or catching objects.', 'Hang your coat on the hook.', 'Treo áo khoác của bạn lên móc.', '{\"en\": \"Please make sure to hang the safety harnesses on the wall hooks after work.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đảm bảo treo dây đai an toàn lên các móc trên tường sau khi làm việc xong.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-ljspeech-6bab147e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-cori-6bab147e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hook-fbf7107b.webp', '[\"hanger\", \"peg\", \"fastener\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"coat hook\", \"meaning\": \"móc treo áo khoác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"off the hook\", \"meaning\": \"thoát khỏi rắc rối / thoát trách nhiệm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"hooked\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-cori-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-aru0-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-aru5-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-aru6-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-aru10-6bab147e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-aru9-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-aru3-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-aru7-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-aru8-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-aru2-6bab147e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-ljspeech-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-lt408-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-lt138-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-lt624-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-lt396-6bab147e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-lt498-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-lt132-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-lt288-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-lt42-6bab147e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hook-lt90-6bab147e.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong bối cảnh văn phòng hoặc nhà xưởng, \'hook\' dùng để chỉ móc treo đồ. Thành ngữ \'off the hook\' có nghĩa là thoát trách nhiệm.', 'office', 1, 14),
('165f9bda-04fe-5623-99a1-c64ef89732db', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '13c40294-0bf1-5e79-a66a-49756a7bce9d', '343ac0dc-11e9-54f2-b9f6-c4f2f35dddc5', 'adapt', '/əˈdæpt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Thay đổi để phù hợp với hoàn cảnh hoặc môi trường mới.', 'to change your behavior or ideas so that you can deal with a new situation successfully.', 'It took him some time to adapt to the new working environment.', 'Anh ấy mất một thời gian để thích nghi với môi trường làm việc mới.', '{\"en\": \"The company had to quickly adapt its marketing strategy to meet changing customer demands effectively.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã phải nhanh chóng điều chỉnh chiến lược tiếp thị để đáp ứng hiệu quả nhu cầu khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adapt-ljspeech-40fe84e6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adapt-cori-40fe84e6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/adapt-422949b1.webp', '[\"adjust\", \"accommodate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"adapt to\", \"meaning\": \"thích nghi với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"easily adapt\", \"meaning\": \"dễ dàng thích nghi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"adopt\", \"note_vi\": \"adopt là nhận nuôi hoặc áp dụng (phương pháp), còn adapt là thay đổi để thích nghi.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"adaptation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"adaptable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adapt-cori-40fe84e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adapt-aru0-40fe84e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adapt-aru5-40fe84e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adapt-aru6-40fe84e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adapt-aru10-40fe84e6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adapt-aru9-40fe84e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adapt-aru3-40fe84e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adapt-aru7-40fe84e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adapt-aru8-40fe84e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adapt-aru2-40fe84e6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adapt-ljspeech-40fe84e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adapt-lt408-40fe84e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adapt-lt138-40fe84e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adapt-lt624-40fe84e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adapt-lt396-40fe84e6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adapt-lt498-40fe84e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adapt-lt132-40fe84e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adapt-lt288-40fe84e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adapt-lt42-40fe84e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adapt-lt90-40fe84e6.mp3\"]}}', 'Hãy nhớ \'adapt\' (thích nghi) khác với \'adopt\' (nhận nuôi/áp dụng) bằng cách nhớ chữ \'a\' trong \'adapt\' là \'adjust\'.', 'business', 1, 15),
('efe3b3ab-7056-5100-a6af-519ccad87b80', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '13c40294-0bf1-5e79-a66a-49756a7bce9d', '343ac0dc-11e9-54f2-b9f6-c4f2f35dddc5', 'mainstream', '/ˈmeɪnstriːm/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Quan điểm, hoạt động hoặc xu hướng được nhiều người chấp nhận.', 'the ideas, products, or activities that are accepted by most ordinary people.', 'His music was once considered alternative, but now it\'s part of the mainstream.', 'Âm nhạc của anh ấy từng được coi là khác biệt, nhưng giờ đây nó đã trở thành một phần của xu hướng chính thống.', '{\"en\": \"The company is trying to bring its innovative technology into the mainstream market to increase overall sales.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đang cố gắng đưa công nghệ tiên tiến của mình vào thị trường chính thống để tăng doanh số tổng thể.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-ljspeech-e3493be6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-cori-e3493be6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mainstream-7432935d.webp', '[\"conventional\", \"popular\"]', '[\"niche\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"mainstream market\", \"meaning\": \"thị trường chính thống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mainstream media\", \"meaning\": \"truyền thông chính thống\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"mainstream\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-cori-e3493be6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-aru0-e3493be6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-aru5-e3493be6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-aru6-e3493be6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-aru10-e3493be6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-aru9-e3493be6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-aru3-e3493be6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mainstream-aru7-e3493be6.mp3\", \"/stor