('c1940e49-d043-5974-9588-be09bd65ba1b', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '13c40294-0bf1-5e79-a66a-49756a7bce9d', '343ac0dc-11e9-54f2-b9f6-c4f2f35dddc5', 'permeate', '/ˈpɜːmieɪt/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Thấm qua, lan tỏa khắp, hoặc ảnh hưởng sâu rộng.', 'to spread throughout something and be present in every part of it.', 'A sense of optimism began to permeate the company after the successful merger.', 'Bầu không khí quan điểm lạc quan bắt đầu lan tỏa khắp công ty sau vụ sáp nhập thành công.', '{\"en\": \"The smell of fresh coffee began to permeate the office, waking up the tired staff.\", \"vi\": \"Mùi cà phê tươi bắt đầu lan tỏa khắp văn phòng, đánh thức các nhân viên đang mệt mỏi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permeate-ljspeech-7e5c1dac.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permeate-cori-7e5c1dac.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/permeate-9d538bfd.webp', '[\"spread\", \"pervade\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"permeation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permeate-cori-7e5c1dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permeate-aru0-7e5c1dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permeate-aru5-7e5c1dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permeate-aru6-7e5c1dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permeate-aru10-7e5c1dac.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permeate-aru9-7e5c1dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permeate-aru3-7e5c1dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permeate-aru7-7e5c1dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permeate-aru8-7e5c1dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permeate-aru2-7e5c1dac.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permeate-ljspeech-7e5c1dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/permeate-lt40