('babecc71-1a3f-5c41-8bb7-36262444ef06', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '13c40294-0bf1-5e79-a66a-49756a7bce9d', '343ac0dc-11e9-54f2-b9f6-c4f2f35dddc5', 'preservation', 'UK: /ˌprɛzəˈveɪʃən/ | US: /ˌprɛzərˈveɪʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự bảo quản, sự bảo tồn', 'The act of keeping something in its original condition or safe from damage.', 'Food preservation techniques have improved significantly.', 'Các kỹ thuật bảo quản thực phẩm đã cải thiện đáng kể.', '{\"en\": \"The committee dedicated additional funding for the preservation of historical landmarks in the city.\", \"vi\": \"Ủy ban đã dành thêm nguồn kinh phí cho việc bảo tồn các di tích lịch sử trong thành phố.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservation-ljspeech-f8abebc0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservation-cori-f8abebc0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/preservation-3ff122c4.webp', '[\"conservation\", \"protection\", \"maintenance\"]', '[\"destruction\", \"neglect\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"preservation of records\", \"meaning\": \"việc lưu trữ/bảo lưu hồ sơ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"historic preservation\", \"meaning\": \"việc bảo tồn di sản lịch sử\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"reservation\", \"note_vi\": \"reservation nghĩa là sự đặt chỗ trước (khách sạn/nhà hàng), còn preservation là sự bảo quản/bảo tồn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"preserve\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"preservative\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservation-cori-f8abebc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservation-aru0-f8abebc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservation-aru5-f8abebc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservation-aru6-f8abebc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservation-aru10-f8abebc0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservation-aru9-f8abebc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservation-aru3-f8abebc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservation-aru7-f8abebc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservation-aru8-f8abebc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservation-aru2-f8abebc0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservation-ljspeech-f8abebc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservation-lt408-f8abebc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservation-lt138-f8abebc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservation-lt624-f8abebc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservation-lt396-f8abebc0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservation-lt498-f8abebc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservation-lt132-f8abebc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservation-lt288-f8abebc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservation-lt42-f8abebc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservation-lt90-f8abebc0.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng cho bảo tồn lịch sử (preservation of historic sites), lưu trữ tài liệu (preservation of records) hoặc bảo quản thực phẩm.', 'general', 1, 23),
('f6e3a5cf-7b69-538d-81f5-7fc14466b769', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '13c40294-0bf1-5e79-a66a-49756a7bce9d', '343ac0dc-11e9-54f2-b9f6-c4f2f35dddc5', 'referee', '/ˌrefəˈriː/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Người điều khiển trận đấu hoặc cuộc thi, đảm bảo luật được tuân thủ.', 'a person who makes sure that the rules are followed during a sports game.', 'An experienced referee was appointed to manage the intense soccer tournament final.', 'Một trọng tài giàu kinh nghiệm đã được bổ nhiệm để điều hành trận chung kết giải bóng đá đầy kịch tính.', '{\"en\": \"The company sports event hired a professional referee to ensure fair play among teams.\", \"vi\": \"Sự kiện thể thao của công ty đã thuê một trọng tài chuyên nghiệp để đảm bảo sự công bằng giữa các đội.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/referee-ljspeech-9ea9bd33.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/referee-cori-9ea9bd33.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/referee-eb264bc2.webp', '[\"umpire\", \"official\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sports referee\", \"meaning\": \"trọng tài thể thao\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"reference\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa là tài liệu tham khảo hoặc thư giới thiệu.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"refer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/referee-cori-9ea9bd33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/referee-aru0-9ea9bd33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/referee-aru5-9ea9bd33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/referee-aru6-9ea9bd33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/referee-aru10-9ea9bd33.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/referee-aru9-9ea9bd33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/referee-aru3-9ea9bd33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/referee-aru7-9ea9bd33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/referee-aru8-9ea9bd33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/