('856f4c88-6fe6-5b67-9e89-4779f87d5402', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '19d782c7-3cc3-5116-81a2-8303bbb162d7', 'dbb4aa63-e147-5724-8b6c-cee3fa0fd223', 'eating disorder', '/ˈiːtɪŋ dɪˈsɔːdə/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng sức khỏe tâm thần ảnh hưởng đến hành vi ăn uống.', 'a severe mental health condition involving unhealthy thoughts and behaviors related to food.', 'It\'s important to seek professional help if you suspect someone has an eating disorder.', 'Điều quan trọng là phải tìm kiếm sự giúp đỡ chuyên nghiệp nếu bạn nghi ngờ ai đó mắc chứng rối loạn ăn uống.', '{\"en\": \"The corporate health insurance plan covers treatment for employees suffering from an eating disorder.\", \"vi\": \"Gói bảo hiểm y tế của công ty chi trả chi phí điều trị cho nhân viên bị rối loạn ăn uống.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eating-disorder-ljspeech-93405b35.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eating-disorder-cori-93405b35.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/eating-disorder-6da59675.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"severe eating disorder\", \"meaning\": \"rối loạn ăn uống nghiêm trọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"treat an eating disorder\", \"meaning\": \"điều trị rối loạn ăn uống\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eating-disorder-cori-93405b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eating-disorder-aru0-93405b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eating-disorder-aru5-93405b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eating-disorder-aru6-93405b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eating-disorder-aru10-93405b35.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eating-disorder-aru9-93405b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eating-disorder-aru3-93405b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eating-disorder-aru7-93405b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eating-disorder-aru8-93405b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eating-disorder-aru2-93405b35.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eating-disorder-ljspeech-93405b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eating-disorder-lt408-93405b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eating-disorder-lt138-93405b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eating-disorder-lt624-93405b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eating-disorder-lt396-93405b35.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eating-disorder-lt498-93405b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eating-disorder-lt132-93405b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eating-disorder-lt288-93405b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eating-disorder-lt42-93405b35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eating-disorder-lt90-93405b35.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm danh từ y khoa chỉ các hội chứng tâm lý về hành vi ăn uống.', 'health', 1, 6),
('0734e715-4382-519a-8b36-bd0a2a6fab84', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '19d782c7-3cc3-5116-81a2-8303bbb162d7', 'dbb4aa63-e147-5724-8b6c-cee3fa0fd223', 'flexibility', 'UK: /ˌflɛksəˈbɪləti/ | US: /ˌflɛksəˈbɪlɪti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự linh hoạt', 'The quality of being able to adapt easily to changing circumstances or situations.', 'The company offers employees great flexibility in working hours.', 'Công ty mang đến cho nhân viên sự linh hoạt lớn về giờ làm việc.', '{\"en\": \"Our company offers schedule flexibility to help employees maintain a healthy work-life balance.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi cung cấp sự linh hoạt về lịch làm việc để giúp nhân viên duy trì sự cân bằng hợp lý giữa công việc và cuộc sống.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-ljspeech-ca406905.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-cori-ca406905.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/flexibility-94d2e20b.webp', '[\"adaptability\", \"versatility\", \"elasticity\"]', '[\"rigidity\", \"inflexibility\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"workplace flexibility\", \"meaning\": \"sự linh hoạt tại nơi làm việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"maximum flexibility\", \"meaning\": \"sự linh hoạt tối đa\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"flexible\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"flexibly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-cori-ca406905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-aru0-ca406905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-aru5-ca406905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-aru6-ca406905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-aru10-ca406905.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-aru9-ca406905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-aru3-ca406905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-aru7-ca406905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-aru8-ca406905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-aru2-ca406905.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-ljspeech-ca406905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-lt408-ca406905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-lt138-ca406905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-lt624-ca406905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-lt396-ca406905.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-lt498-ca406905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-lt132-ca406905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-lt288-ca406905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-lt42-ca406905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexibility-lt90-ca406905.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ cảnh công sở TOEIC, \'flexibility\' thường ám chỉ sự linh hoạt về giờ giấc làm việc hoặc điều khoản hợp đồng.', 'human resources', 1, 7),
('39049100-8588-5091-95d6-311d975fa6a5', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '19d782c7-3cc3-5116-81a2-8303bbb162d7', 'dbb4aa63-e147-5724-8b6c-cee3fa0fd223', 'notify', 'UK: /nəʊtɪfaɪ/ | US: /ˈnoʊt̬əˌfaɪ/', 'B2', 'verb', 'thông báo', 'to inform someone officially about a fact, decision, or upcoming situation.', 'Please notify the manager of your absence.', 'Xin vui lòng thông báo cho người quản lý về việc bạn vắng mặt.', '{\"en\": \"Please notify the human resources department immediately if your contact details change.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng thông báo cho phòng nhân sự ngay lập tức nếu chi tiết liên lạc của bạn thay đổi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notify-ljspeech-4f08301d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notify-cori-4f08301d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/notify-7a863551.webp', '[\"inform\", \"apprise\", \"advise\", \"alert\"]', '[\"withhold\", \"conceal\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"notify somebody of something\", \"meaning\": \"thông báo cho ai về cái gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"promptly notify\", \"meaning\": \"thông báo kịp thời\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"notice\", \"note_vi\": \"Notify đòi hỏi tân ngữ chỉ người ngay phía sau (notify someone), còn notice đi trực tiếp với mệnh đề hoặc vật.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"notification\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notify-cori-4f08301d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notify-aru0-4f08301d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notify-aru5-4f08301d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notify-aru6-4f08301d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notify-aru10-4f08301d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notify-aru9-4f08301d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notify-aru3-4f08301d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notify-aru7-4f08301d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notify-aru8-4f08301d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notify-aru2-4f08301d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notify-ljspeech-4f08301d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notify-lt408-4f08301d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notify-lt138-4f08301d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notify-lt624-4f08301d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notify-lt396-4f08301d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notify-lt498-4f08301d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notify-lt132-4f08301d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notify-lt288-4f08301d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notify-lt42-4f08301d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notify-lt90-4f08301d.mp3\"]}}', 'Động từ bắt buộc có tân ngữ chỉ người đi kèm: \'notify somebody of something\' hoặc \'notify somebody that + clause\'.', 'personnel', 1, 8),
('95bc147f-bb0f-5464-afe8-c0c25225751e', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '19d782c7-3cc3-5116-81a2-8303bbb162d7', 'dbb4aa63-e147-5724-8b6c-cee3fa0fd223', 'pursue a career', '/pəˈsjuː ə kəˈrɪə/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Cố gắng đạt được một nghề nghiệp cụ thể.', 'to try to achieve success in a professional field over a long period.', 'After graduating, he decided to pursue a career in software development.', 'Sau khi tốt nghiệp, anh ấy quyết định theo đuổi sự nghiệp phát triển phần mềm.', '{\"en\": \"After graduating, he decided to pursue a career in marketing at a global firm.\", \"vi\": \"Sau khi tốt nghiệp, anh ấy quyết định theo đuổi sự nghiệp tiếp thị tại một công ty toàn cầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-a-career-ljspeech-706cf2c1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-a-career-cori-706cf2c1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pursue-a-career-65e009c3.webp', '[\"follow a career\", \"build a career\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pursue a career in\", \"meaning\": \"theo đuổi sự nghiệp trong lĩnh vực\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-a-career-cori-706cf2c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-a-career-aru0-706cf2c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-a-career-aru5-706cf2c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-a-career-aru6-706cf2c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-a-career-aru10-706cf2c1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-a-career-aru9-706cf2c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-a-career-aru3-706cf2c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-a-career-aru7-706cf2c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-a-career-aru8-706cf2c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pursue-a-career-aru2-706cf2c1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {