('ef78fd07-e50d-5ccd-bfd8-e91a52504edd', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '1a277703-3fad-5bee-baa4-7110fba55aaf', '53dd6a31-0b6b-5ce7-bd52-c2b1e1e9382e', 'training', '/ˈtreɪnɪŋ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Quá trình học hỏi hoặc dạy kỹ năng, kiến thức cho một công việc cụ thể.', 'the process of learning the skills that you need to do a job or activity.', 'The company provides extensive training for all new employees.', 'Công ty cung cấp chương trình đào tạo chuyên sâu cho tất cả nhân viên mới.', '{\"en\": \"New employees are required to complete two weeks of intensive training before they start their official duties.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên mới được yêu cầu hoàn thành hai tuần đào tạo chuyên sâu trước khi bắt đầu nhiệm vụ chính thức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/training-ljspeech-0a2b9827.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/training-cori-0a2b9827.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/training-bfa9855d.webp', '[\"instruction\", \"coaching\", \"tuition\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"on-the-job training\", \"meaning\": \"đào tạo tại chỗ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"vocational training\", \"meaning\": \"đào tạo nghề\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"train\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"trainer\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"trainee\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/training-cori-0a2b9827.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/training-aru0-0a2b9827.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/training-aru5-0a2b9827.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/training-aru6-0a2b9827.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/training-aru10-0a2b9827.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/training-aru9-0a2b9827.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/training-aru3-0a2b9827.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/training-aru7-0a2b9827.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obje