('f79bf3e0-2f3c-547a-951b-b5b535572e2d', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '1a277703-3fad-5bee-baa4-7110fba55aaf', '53dd6a31-0b6b-5ce7-bd52-c2b1e1e9382e', 'homogeneous', '/ˌhɒməˈdʒiːniəs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Có cùng tính chất hoặc cấu trúc, không có sự khác biệt.', 'consisting of things or people that are all the same type or kind.', 'The committee was surprisingly homogeneous in its opinions, with everyone agreeing on the proposal.', 'Ủy ban này có quan điểm đồng nhất đáng ngạc nhiên, mọi người đều đồng ý với đề xuất.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team is not homogeneous because it includes experts from many different professional backgrounds.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm tiếp thị không đồng nhất vì nó bao gồm các chuyên gia từ nhiều nền tảng chuyên môn khác nhau.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/homogeneous-ljspeech-4ea31783.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/homogeneous-cori-4ea31783.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/homogeneous-71534751.webp', '[\"uniform\", \"consistent\"]', '[\"heterogeneous\", \"diverse\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"homogeneous group\", \"meaning\": \"nhóm đồng nhất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly homogeneous\", \"meaning\": \"rất đồng nhất\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"heterogeneous\", \"note_vi\": \"heterogeneous nghĩa là hỗn hợp, đa dạng, trái ngược với homogeneous.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"homogeneity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/homogeneous-cori-4ea31783.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/homogeneous-aru0-4ea31783.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/homogeneous-aru5-4ea31783.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/homogeneous-aru6-4ea31783.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/homogeneous-aru10-4ea31783.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/homogeneous-aru9-4ea31783.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/homogeneous-aru3-4