('7f650a37-3c9c-5029-a8fe-430dd45ad9b8', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '1a277703-3fad-5bee-baa4-7110fba55aaf', '53dd6a31-0b6b-5ce7-bd52-c2b1e1e9382e', 'shot-put', '/ˈʃɒtˌpʊt/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Môn thể thao ném một quả tạ nặng.', 'an athletic sport where a person throws a heavy metal ball far.', 'During the university sports day, several students participated in the shot-put competition.', 'Trong ngày hội thể thao đại học, nhiều sinh viên đã tham gia cuộc thi ném tạ.', '{\"en\": \"The annual corporate sports festival included a shot-put event for all interested employees.\", \"vi\": \"Lễ hội thể thao hàng năm của công ty bao gồm một môn thi ném tạ cho tất cả nhân viên quan tâm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shot-put-ljspeech-5cadd1ab.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shot-put-cori-5cadd1ab.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shot-put-51de2a95.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"shot-put event\", \"meaning\": \"nội dung thi ném tạ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"shot-put champion\", \"meaning\": \"nhà vô địch ném tạ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"shot-putter\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shot-put-cori-5cadd1ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shot-put-aru0-5cadd1ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shot-put-aru5-5cadd1ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shot-put-aru6-5cadd1ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shot-put-aru10-5cadd1ab.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shot-put-aru9-5cadd1ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shot-put-aru3-5cadd1ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shot-put-aru7-5cadd1ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shot-put-aru8-5cadd1ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shot-put-aru2-5cadd1ab.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1