('b66ef2e3-8b8d-5368-8f92-71fdbc607ebd', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '20f0957e-0a11-5ba9-9d25-4b2358c0fcfb', '607a29ea-0dfb-5923-a037-e60ff317258f', 'quartz', 'UK: /kwɔːts/ | US: /kwɔrts/', 'B2', 'noun', 'thạch anh', 'A hard mineral composed of silica, often used in making precision timepieces.', 'The quartz watch is very durable and scratch-resistant.', 'Chiếc đồng hồ thạch anh rất bền và chống trầy xước.', '{\"en\": \"The manufacturer uses high-precision quartz components in its luxury watch line.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà sản xuất sử dụng linh kiện thạch anh có độ chính xác cao trong dòng đồng hồ cao cấp của mình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quartz-ljspeech-39ec5e1a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quartz-cori-39ec5e1a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/quartz-79bc0bb8.webp', '[\"silica\", \"crystal\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"quartz crystal\", \"meaning\": \"tinh thể thạch anh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"quartz movement\", \"meaning\": \"bộ máy thạch anh\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quartz-cori-39ec5e1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quartz-aru0-39ec5e1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quartz-aru5-39ec5e1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quartz-aru6-39ec5e1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quartz-aru10-39ec5e1a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quartz-aru9-39ec5e1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quartz-aru3-39ec5e1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quartz-aru7-39ec5e1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quartz-aru8-39ec5e1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quartz-aru2-39ec5e1a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quartz-ljspeech-39ec5e1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quartz-lt408-39ec5e1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quartz-lt138-39ec5e1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quartz-lt624-39ec5e1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quartz-lt396-39ec5e1a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quartz-lt498-39ec5e1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quartz-lt132-39ec5e1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quartz-lt288-39ec5e1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quartz-lt42-39ec5e1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quartz-lt90-39ec5e1a.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ chuyên ngành thiết bị/linh kiện, hay xuất hiện trong cụm \'quartz watch\' (đồng hồ thạch anh).', 'manufacturing', 1, 13),
('d371928d-c38d-55cd-bd69-c624d7fe03f7', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '20f0957e-0a11-5ba9-9d25-4b2358c0fcfb', '607a29ea-0dfb-5923-a037-e60ff317258f', 'pray', '/preɪ/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Nói chuyện với Chúa hoặc một vị thần để bày tỏ lòng biết ơn, xin điều gì đó.', 'to speak to a god to give thanks or ask for help.', 'Many people pray for peace and health every night before going to bed.', 'Nhiều người cầu nguyện cho hòa bình và sức khỏe mỗi đêm trước khi đi ngủ.', '{\"en\": \"Many local business owners pray for a successful tourist season this summer.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiều chủ doanh nghiệp địa phương cầu nguyện cho một mùa du lịch thành công vào mùa hè này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-ljspeech-77973d44.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-cori-77973d44.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pray-58b48e8f.webp', '[\"implore\", \"petition\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pray for peace\", \"meaning\": \"cầu nguyện cho hòa bình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pray to God\", \"meaning\": \"cầu nguyện với Chúa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"prey\", \"note_vi\": \"con mồi (phát âm giống pray nhưng viết khác)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"prayer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-cori-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-aru0-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-aru5-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-aru6-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-aru10-77973d44.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-aru9-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-aru3-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-aru7-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-aru8-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-aru2-77973d44.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-ljspeech-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-lt408-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-lt138-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-lt624-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-lt396-77973d44.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-lt498-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-lt132-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-lt288-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-lt42-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-lt90-77973d44.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt pray (cầu nguyện) và prey (con mồi, săn mồi).', 'daily', 1, 14),
('0a5d3824-7d17-5bcf-9894-5cc0dd3087f3', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '20f0957e-0a11-5ba9-9d25-4b2358c0fcfb', '607a29ea-0dfb-5923-a037-e60ff317258f', 'martial art', '/ˈmɑːʃəl ɑːt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hệ thống các kỹ thuật chiến đấu hoặc tự vệ.', 'a traditional style of fighting or self-defense that often involves physical exercise and mental discipline.', 'He practices a different martial art every day to stay fit.', 'Anh ấy luyện tập một môn võ thuật khác nhau mỗi ngày để giữ dáng.', '{\"en\": \"Our corporate wellness program now offers a weekly martial art class for all interested employees.\", \"vi\": \"Chương trình chăm sóc sức khỏe doanh nghiệp của chúng tôi hiện cung cấp một lớp võ thuật hàng tuần cho tất cả nhân viên quan tâm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/martial-art-ljspeech-8ca319da.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/martial-art-cori-8ca319da.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/martial-art-c1016e94.webp', '[\"combat sport\", \"fighting style\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"practice a martial art\", \"meaning\": \"tập luyện võ thuật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"martial art school\", \"meaning\": \"trường dạy võ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/martial-art-cori-8ca319da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/martial-art-aru0-8ca319da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/martial-art-aru5-8ca319da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/martial-art-aru6-8ca319da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/martial-art-aru10-8ca319da.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/martial-art-aru9-8ca319da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/martial-art-aru3-8ca319da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/martial-art-aru7-8ca319da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/martial-art-aru8-8ca319da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/martial-art-aru2-8ca319da.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/martial-art-ljspeech-8ca319da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/martial-art-lt408-8ca319da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/martial-art-lt138-8ca319da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/martial-art-lt624-8ca319da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/martial-art-lt396-8ca319da.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/martial-art-lt498-8ca319da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/martial-art-lt132-8ca319da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/martial-art-lt288-8ca319da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/martial-art-lt42-8ca319da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/martial-art-lt90-8ca319da.mp3\"]}}', 'thường dùng số ít để chỉ một môn cụ thể, số nhiều để chỉ chung các môn võ.', 'daily', 1, 15),
('aba1b413-bd59-5a4c-8d93-e2bb7e09bbf8', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '20f0957e-0a11-5ba9-9d25-4b2358c0fcfb', '607a29ea-0dfb-5923-a037-e60ff317258f', 'rake', 'UK: /reɪk/ | US: /reɪk/', 'B2', 'verb', 'cào (lá)', 'to gather, smooth, or clear ground by pulling a spiked long-handled tool across it.', 'He uses a rake to gather the fallen leaves.', 'Anh ấy dùng cái cào để gom lá rụng.', '{\"en\": \"The groundskeeper was hired to rake leaves and clean up the corporate campus lawn.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên chăm sóc khuôn viên được thuê để cào lá và dọn dẹp thảm cỏ của trụ sở công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rake-ljspeech-4e3f6808.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rake-cori-4e3f6808.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rake-72d5369e.webp', '[\"gather\", \"collect\", \"scrape\"]', '[\"scatter\", \"disperse\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"rake leaves\", \"meaning\": \"cào lá rơi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rake through\", \"meaning\": \"tìm kiếm kỹ lưỡng qua cái gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"lake\", \"note_vi\": \"Hồ nước.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"rake\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rake-cori-4e3f6808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rake-aru0-4e3f6808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rake-aru5-4e3f6808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rake-aru6-4e3f6808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rake-aru10-4e3f6808.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rake-aru9-4e3f6808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rake-aru3-4e3f6808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rake-aru7-4e3f6808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rake-aru8-4e3f6808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rake-aru2-4e3f6808.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rake-ljspeech-4e3f6808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rake-lt408-4e3f6808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rake-lt138-4e3f6808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rake-lt624-4e3f6808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rake-lt396-4e3f6808.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rake-lt498-4e3f6808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rake-lt132-4e3f6808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rake-lt288-4e3f6808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rake-lt42-4e3f6808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rake-lt90-4e3f6808.mp3\"]}}', '\'Rake\' vừa là động từ (cào lá/đất) vừa là danh từ (cái cào làm vườn).', 'facilities', 1, 16),
('b74eefdb-ed66-577b-81d2-3db27b7cc630', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '20f0957e-0a11-5ba9-9d25-4b2358c0fcfb', '607a29ea-0dfb-5923-a037-e60ff317258f', 'tour operator', '/tʊə ɒpəreɪtə/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Công ty hoặc người chuyên tổ chức các chuyến du lịch trọn gói.', 'a business or person that organizes and sells travel packages including transport and accommodation.', 'We booked our entire vacation package through a reputable tour operator.', 'Chúng tôi đã đặt toàn bộ gói kỳ nghỉ của mình thông qua một công ty tổ chức du lịch uy tín.', '{\"en\": \"We contacted a professional tour operator to organize our corporate retreat in the mountains.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi đã liên hệ với một hãng du lịch chuyên nghiệp để tổ chức chuyến nghỉ dưỡng công ty trên núi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-operator-ljspeech-64c3a0af.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-operator-cori-64c3a0af.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tour-operator-357acc92.webp', '[\"travel agent\", \"tour company\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"travel agency\", \"meaning\": \"đại lý du lịch\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-operator-cori-64c3a0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-operator-aru0-64c3a0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-operator-aru5-64c3a0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-operator-aru6-64c3a0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-operator-aru10-64c3a0af.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-operator-aru9-64c3a0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-operator-aru3-64c3a0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-operator-aru7-64c3a0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-operator-aru8-64c3a0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-operator-aru2-64c3a0af.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-operator-ljspeech-64c3a0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-operator-lt408-64c3a0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-operator-lt138-64c3a0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-operator-lt624-64c3a0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-operator-lt396-64c3a0af.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-operator-lt498-64c3a0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-operator-lt132-64c3a0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-operator-lt288-64c3a0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-operator-lt42-64c3a0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-operator-lt90-64c3a0af.mp3\"]}}', 'Khác với \'tour guide\' (hướng dẫn viên), đây là đơn vị tổ chức dịch vụ.', 'travel', 1, 17),
('6a651beb-9939-5b76-805c-f3ca7745043a', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '20f0957e-0a11-5ba9-9d25-4b2358c0fcfb', '607a29ea-0dfb-5923-a037-e60ff317258f', 'customs', '/ˈkʌstəmz/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Cơ quan chính phủ kiểm soát hàng hóa ra vào một quốc gia.', 'the place at a port or airport where officials check goods coming into a country.', 'We had to declare all our goods at customs when we arrived at the airport.', 'Chúng tôi phải khai báo tất cả hàng hóa tại hải quan khi đến sân bay.', '{\"en\": \"All imported electronics must pass through customs before they can be delivered to the local warehouse.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả các thiết bị điện tử nhập khẩu phải đi qua hải quan trước khi chúng có thể được giao đến kho hàng địa phương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customs-ljspeech-adee3537.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customs-cori-adee3537.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/customs-1795fbe9.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"customs officer\", \"meaning\": \"nhân viên hải quan\"}, {\"phrase\": \"customs declaration\", \"meaning\": \"tờ khai hải quan\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clear customs\", \"meaning\": \"thông quan\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"custom\", \"note_vi\": \"phong tục, tập quán (danh từ số ít)\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customs-cori-adee3537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customs-aru0-adee3537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customs-aru5-adee3537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customs-aru6-adee3537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customs-aru10-adee3537.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customs-aru9-adee3537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customs-aru3-adee3537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customs-aru7-adee3537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customs-aru8-adee3537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customs-aru2-adee3537.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customs-ljspeech-adee3537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customs-lt408-adee3537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customs-lt138-adee3537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customs-lt624-adee3537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customs-lt396-adee3537.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customs-lt498-adee3537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customs-lt132-adee3537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customs-lt288-adee3537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customs-lt42-adee3537.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customs-lt90-adee3537.mp3\"]}}', 'Luôn ở dạng số nhiều \"customs\" khi nói về cơ quan hải quan.', 'travel', 1, 18),
('18334529-b97b-50f0-8ae8-b3f03c0ce895', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '20f0957e-0a11-5ba9-9d25-4b2358c0fcfb', '607a29ea-0dfb-5923-a037-e60ff317258f', 'habitat', '/ˈhæbɪtæt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Nơi ở tự nhiên hoặc môi trường sống của một loài động vật hoặc thực vật.', 'An environment in which an organism typically exists, feeds, and reproduces naturally.', 'Urban expansion has severely damaged the native habitat of endangered bird species.', 'Sự mở rộng đô thị đã gây tổn hại nghiêm trọng đến môi trường sống bản địa của các loài chim có nguy cơ tuyệt chủng.', '{\"en\": \"The construction project must not destroy the natural habitat of local birds near the factory.\", \"vi\": \"Dự án xây dựng không được phá hủy môi trường sống tự nhiên của các loài chim địa phương gần nhà máy.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/habitat-ljspeech-1da0e9a6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/habitat-cori-1da0e9a6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/habitat-4677fdcc.webp', '[\"environment\", \"home\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"natural habitat\", \"meaning\": \"môi trường sống tự nhiên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"destroy a habitat\", \"meaning\": \"phá hủy môi trường sống\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"habit\", \"note_vi\": \"habit là thói quen cá nhân, habitat là môi trường sống của sinh vật.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"habitation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/habitat-cori-1da0e9a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/habitat-aru0-1da0e9a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/habitat-aru5-1da0e9a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/habitat-aru6-1da0e9a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/habitat-aru10-1da0e9a6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/habitat-aru9-1da0e9a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/habitat-aru3-1da0e9a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/habitat-aru7-1da0e9a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/habitat-aru8-1da0e9a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/habitat-aru2-1da0e9a6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/habitat-ljspeech-1da0e9a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/habitat-lt408-1da0e9a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/habitat-lt138-1da0e9a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/habitat-lt624-1da0e9a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/habitat-lt396-1da0e9a6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/habitat-lt498-1da0e9a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/habitat-lt132-1da0e9a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/habitat-lt288-1da0e9a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/habitat-lt42-1da0e9a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/habitat-lt90-1da0e9a6.mp3\"]}}', 'đừng nhầm lẫn với \'habit\' (thói quen).', 'nature', 1, 19),
('8d9be30d-85e7-5daf-91a3-f8128d128d1a', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '20f0957e-0a11-5ba9-9d25-4b2358c0fcfb', '607a29ea-0dfb-5923-a037-e60ff317258f', 'nuance', '/ˈnjuːɑːns/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Sự khác biệt rất nhỏ, tinh tế về ý nghĩa hoặc cảm xúc.', 'a very slight difference in appearance, meaning, sound, or quality that is subtle.', 'Translators need to understand every subtle nuance of tone in corporate contracts.', 'Các dịch thuật viên cần hiểu từng sắc thái tinh tế về giọng điệu trong hợp đồng doanh nghiệp.', '{\"en\": \"The translator paid attention to every subtle nuance in the contract during negotiation.\", \"vi\": \"Người dịch đã chú ý đến từng sắc thái nhỏ trong hợp đồng trong quá trình đàm phán.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuance-ljspeech-a959f8ba.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuance-cori-a959f8ba.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/nuance-12a15ab3.webp', '[\"subtlety\", \"shade\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"subtle nuance\", \"meaning\": \"sắc thái tinh tế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cultural nuance\", \"meaning\": \"sắc thái văn hóa\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"nuanced\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuance-cori-a959f8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuance-aru0-a959f8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuance-aru5-a959f8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuance-aru6-a959f8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuance-aru10-a959f8ba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuance-aru9-a959f8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuance-aru3-a959f8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuance-aru7-a959f8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuance-aru8-a959f8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuance-aru2-a959f8ba.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuance-ljspeech-a959f8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuance-lt408-a959f8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuance-lt138-a959f8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuance-lt624-a959f8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuance-lt396-a959f8ba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuance-lt498-a959f8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuance-lt132-a959f8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuance-lt288-a959f8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuance-lt42-a959f8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuance-lt90-a959f8ba.mp3\"]}}', 'Nuance chỉ sự khác biệt nhỏ nhưng rất quan trọng trong ý nghĩa.', 'business', 1, 20),
('b272f03b-d419-527f-a520-8720346a6b09', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '20f0957e-0a11-5ba9-9d25-4b2358c0fcfb', '607a29ea-0dfb-5923-a037-e60ff317258f', 'devil', '/ˈdevl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Ác quỷ, ma quỷ; người rất độc ác hoặc nghịch ngợm.', 'the most powerful evil spirit in some religions, or a very bad person.', 'According to old legends, the devil tries to tempt people into doing evil deeds.', 'Theo những truyền thuyết cổ, quỷ dữ cố gắng cám dỗ con người làm những việc xấu xa.', '{\"en\": \"The contract details were so complex that the manager said the devil is in the details.\", \"vi\": \"Các chi tiết trong hợp đồng phức tạp đến mức người quản lý nói rằng những chi tiết nhỏ mới là nơi dễ sai sót.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devil-ljspeech-49108eff.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devil-cori-49108eff.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/devil-bcf3e32f.webp', '[\"demon\", \"fiend\"]', '[\"angel\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"speak of the devil\", \"meaning\": \"vừa nhắc tào tháo là tào tháo đến\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"devilish\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devil-cori-49108eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devil-aru0-49108eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devil-aru5-49108eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devil-aru6-49108eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devil-aru10-49108eff.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devil-aru9-49108eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devil-aru3-49108eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devil-aru7-49108eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devil-aru8-49108eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devil-aru2-49108eff.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devil-ljspeech-49108eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devil-lt408-49108eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devil-lt138-49108eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devil-lt624-49108eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devil-lt396-49108eff.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devil-lt498-49108eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devil-lt132-49108eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devil-lt288-49108eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devil-lt42-49108eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devil-lt90-49108eff.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong thành ngữ \'the devil is in the detail\' trong bối cảnh công việc.', 'other', 1, 21),
('111adb57-aa9b-59f0-8b04-c338bf022f0c', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '20f0957e-0a11-5ba9-9d25-4b2358c0fcfb', '607a29ea-0dfb-5923-a037-e60ff317258f', 'run down', '/rʌn daʊn/', 'B1', 'phrasal verb', 'Trở nên yếu ớt, mệt mỏi hoặc suy giảm năng lượng.', 'feeling very tired and lacking energy, often due to too much work or stress.', 'After a long week of work, I often feel completely run down.', 'Sau một tuần làm việc dài, tôi thường cảm thấy hoàn toàn kiệt sức.', '{\"en\": \"After three consecutive business trips, the project manager felt completely run down and needed rest.\", \"vi\": \"Sau ba chuyến công tác liên tiếp, người quản lý dự án cảm thấy hoàn toàn kiệt sức và cần nghỉ ngơi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-down-ljspeech-64192b5a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-down-cori-64192b5a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/run-down-152cd78f.webp', '[\"exhausted\", \"worn out\", \"drained\"]', '[\"energetic\", \"refreshed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel run down\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy mệt mỏi, uể oải\"}, {\"phrase\": \"look run down\", \"meaning\": \"trông có vẻ kiệt sức\"}, {\"phrase\": \"completely run down\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn toàn kiệt sức\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"run out\", \"note_vi\": \"run out nghĩa là hết (hàng/thời gian), không phải mệt mỏi\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-down-cori-64192b5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-down-aru0-64192b5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-down-aru5-64192b5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-down-aru6-64192b5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-down-aru10-64192b5a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-down-aru9-64192b5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-down-aru3-64192b5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-down-aru7-64192b5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-down-aru8-64192b5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-down-aru2-64192b5a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-down-ljspeech-64192b5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-down-lt408-64192b5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-down-lt138-64192b5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-down-lt624-64192b5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-down-lt396-64192b5a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-down-lt498-64192b5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-down-lt132-64192b5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-down-lt288-64192b5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-down-lt42-64192b5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-down-lt90-64192b5a.mp3\"]}}', 'Run down là cụm từ, đừng nhầm với run out (cạn kiệt vật chất) hay run over (cán qua).', 'health', 1, 22),
('1644a0f7-9746-5770-b6c1-1e3898ad1461', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '20f0957e-0a11-5ba9-9d25-4b2358c0fcfb', '607a29ea-0dfb-5923-a037-e60ff317258f', 'interact', '/ˌɪntərˈækt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Tác động qua lại hoặc giao tiếp với nhau.', 'to communicate with or react to other people or things.', 'Customer service agents interact directly with clients to resolve billing issues quickly.', 'Nhân viên dịch vụ khách hàng tương tác trực tiếp với khách hàng để giải quyết các vấn đề hóa đơn một cách nhanh chóng.', '{\"en\": \"The new customer service training teaches employees how to interact professionally with difficult clients.\", \"vi\": \"Khóa đào tạo dịch vụ khách hàng mới dạy nhân viên cách tương tác chuyên nghiệp với những khách hàng khó tính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interact-ljspeech-c0af471b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interact-cori-c0af471b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/interact-fb13a3fe.webp', '[\"communicate\", \"connect\", \"engage\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"interact with\", \"meaning\": \"tương tác với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"interact socially\", \"meaning\": \"tương tác xã hội\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"interaction\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"interactive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interact-cori-c0af471b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interact-aru0-c0af471b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interact-aru5-c0af471b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interact-aru6-c0af471b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interact-aru10-c0af471b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interact-aru9-c0af471b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interact-aru3-c0af471b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interact-aru7-c0af471b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pr