('bd2729ba-1b6e-5bdb-b26f-b7a7363d6352', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '20f0957e-0a11-5ba9-9d25-4b2358c0fcfb', '607a29ea-0dfb-5923-a037-e60ff317258f', 'prohibit', 'UK: /prəˈhɪbɪt/ | US: /proʊˈhɪbɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'ngăn cấm, cấm đoán', 'to officially forbid something by law, rule, or other formal authority', 'The regulations prohibit smoking in public indoor areas.', 'Các quy định cấm hút thuốc ở các khu vực công cộng trong nhà.', '{\"en\": \"Company policies strictly prohibit employees from sharing confidential client information.\", \"vi\": \"Quy định của công ty nghiêm cấm nhân viên chia sẻ thông tin bảo mật của khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prohibit-ljspeech-bf0abc00.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prohibit-cori-bf0abc00.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/prohibit-8392b679.webp', '[\"forbid\", \"ban\", \"bar\", \"disallow\"]', '[\"allow\", \"permit\", \"authorize\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"strictly prohibit\", \"meaning\": \"nghiêm cấm tuyệt đối\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prohibit from entering\", \"meaning\": \"cấm vào\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"inhibit\", \"note_vi\": \"Inhibit nghĩa là cản trở hoặc cản trở sự phát triển, còn prohibit là cấm đoán bằng luật lệ/quy định.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"prohibition\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"prohibitive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prohibit-cori-bf0abc00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prohibit-aru0-bf0abc00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prohibit-aru5-bf0abc00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prohibit-aru6-bf0abc00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prohibit-aru10-bf0abc00.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prohibit-aru9-bf0abc00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prohibit-aru3-bf0abc00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prohibit-aru7-bf0abc00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prohibit-aru8-bf0abc00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prohibit-aru2-bf0abc00.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prohibit-ljspeech-bf0abc00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prohibit-lt408-bf0abc00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prohibit-lt138-bf0abc00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prohibit-lt624-bf0abc00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prohibit-lt396-bf0abc00.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prohibit-lt498-bf0abc00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prohibit-lt132-bf0abc00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prohibit-lt288-bf0abc00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prohibit-lt42-bf0abc00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prohibit-lt90-bf0abc00.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc thường gặp: \"prohibit someone from doing something\" (cấm ai làm gì).', 'office regulations', 1, 29),
('d434c71f-4976-54bf-9c73-7f3580d0b52f', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '28afc5e3-08e1-5790-a545-4928fe321354', '5f550244-18cc-5079-ad9c-359e981f8956', 'joint stock company', '/dʒɔɪnt stɒk ˈkʌmpəni/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một loại hình công ty có vốn điều lệ chia thành nhiều cổ phần.', 'a business organization where ownership is divided into shares held by many different investors.', 'This joint stock company plans to issue additional shares to finance international expansion.', 'Công ty cổ phần này có kế hoạch phát hành thêm cổ phiếu để tài trợ cho việc mở rộng ra quốc tế.', '{\"en\": \"The joint stock company announced a significant increase in annual profits during the shareholders meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty cổ phần đã thông báo mức tăng lợi nhuận đáng kể trong cuộc họp cổ đông thường niên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joint-stock-company-ljspeech-a76f93f1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joint-stock-company-cori-a76f93f1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/joint-stock-company-d09b0bba.webp', '[\"public limited company\", \"corporation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"form a joint stock company\", \"meaning\": \"thành lập công ty cổ phần\"}, {\"phrase\": \"shares of a joint stock company\", \"meaning\": \"cổ phần của công ty cổ phần\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joint-stock-company-cori-a76f93f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joint-stock-company-aru0-a76f93f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joint-stock-company-aru5-a76f93f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joint-stock-company-aru6-a76f93f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joint-stock-company-aru10-a76f93f1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joint-stock-company-aru9-a76f93f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joint-stock-company-aru3-a76f93f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joint-stock-company-aru7-a76f93f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joint-stock-company-aru8-a76f93f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joint-stock-company-aru2-a76f93f1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joint-stock-company-ljspeech-a76f93f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joint-stock-company-lt408-a76f93f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joint-stock-company-lt138-a76f93f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joint-stock-company-lt624-a76f93f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joint-stock-company-lt396-a76f93f1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joint-stock-company-lt498-a76f93f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joint-stock-company-lt132-a76f93f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joint-stock-company-lt288-a76f93f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joint-stock-company-lt42-a76f93f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/joint-stock-company-lt90-a76f93f1.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường viết tắt là JSC trong tên các doanh nghiệp tại Việt Nam.', 'business', 1, 0),
('154e319b-3632-5106-b8b9-f41ca86c176e', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '28afc5e3-08e1-5790-a545-4928fe321354', '5f550244-18cc-5079-ad9c-359e981f8956', 'reincarnation', '/ˌriːɪnkɑːˈneɪʃn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Niềm tin rằng linh hồn sẽ tái sinh vào một cơ thể mới sau khi chết.', 'the belief that a dead person\'s spirit returns to life in another body or form.', 'The ancient philosopher explored the idea of reincarnation in his philosophical essays.', 'Nhà triết học cổ đại đã khám phá ý tưởng về sự luân hồi trong các bài luận triết học của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The author discussed the concept of reincarnation in her latest book about Eastern philosophies.\", \"vi\": \"Tác giả đã thảo luận về khái niệm luân hồi trong cuốn sách mới nhất của cô về triết học phương Đông.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reincarnation-ljspeech-52c281df.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reincarnation-cori-52c281df.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reincarnation-afeed885.webp', '[\"rebirth\", \"transmigration\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"belief in reincarnation\", \"meaning\": \"niềm tin vào luân hồi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cycle of reincarnation\", \"meaning\": \"vòng luân hồi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"incarnation\", \"note_vi\": \"incarnation là sự hiện thân hoặc một kiếp sống cụ thể\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"reincarnate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reincarnation-cori-52c281df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reincarnation-aru0-52c281df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reincarnation-aru5-52c281df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reincarnation-aru6-52c281df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reincarnation-aru10-52c281df.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reincarnation-aru9-52c281df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reincarnation-aru3-52c281df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reincarnation-aru7-52c281df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reincarnation-aru8-52c281df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reincarnation-aru2-52c281df.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reincarnation-ljspeech-52c281df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reincarnation-lt408-52c281df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reincarnation-lt138-52c281df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reincarnation-lt624-52c281df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reincarnation-lt396-52c281df.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reincarnation-lt498-52c281df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reincarnation-lt132-52c281df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reincarnation-lt288-52c281df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reincarnation-lt42-52c281df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reincarnation-lt90-52c281df.mp3\"]}}', 'Tiền tố \'re-\' mang nghĩa là lặp lại (đầu thai lại).', 'academic', 1, 1),
('206836a8-f56d-5af7-9088-a88bb03d2cb2', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '28afc5e3-08e1-5790-a545-4928fe321354', '5f550244-18cc-5079-ad9c-359e981f8956', 'ethical', '/ˈeθɪkl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Liên quan đến các nguyên tắc đạo đức, đúng đắn về mặt đạo đức.', 'relating to beliefs about what is morally right and wrong in professional behavior.', 'Companies are increasingly focusing on ethical practices in their supply chains.', 'Các công ty ngày càng tập trung vào các thực hành đạo đức trong chuỗi cung ứng của họ.', '{\"en\": \"All employees must follow the company\'s ethical guidelines when dealing with confidential client information.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả nhân viên phải tuân theo các hướng dẫn đạo đức của công ty khi xử lý thông tin khách hàng bảo mật.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-ljspeech-025e6dee.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-cori-025e6dee.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ethical-9c65cd71.webp', '[\"moral\", \"principled\"]', '[\"unethical\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"ethical standards\", \"meaning\": \"tiêu chuẩn đạo đức\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ethical behavior\", \"meaning\": \"hành vi đạo đức\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"ethics\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-cori-025e6dee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-aru0-025e6dee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-aru5-025e6dee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-aru6-025e6dee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-aru10-025e6dee.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-aru9-025e6dee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-aru3-025e6dee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-aru7-025e6dee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethical-aru8-025e6dee.mp3\", \"/storage/v