('97010667-cdc7-5e1c-9a42-65f4ee96e89b', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '28afc5e3-08e1-5790-a545-4928fe321354', '5f550244-18cc-5079-ad9c-359e981f8956', 'defend', '/dɪˈfend/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Bảo vệ khỏi sự tấn công hoặc nguy hiểm.', 'To guard an entity against physical assault, competitive threat, or verbal criticism.', 'The lawyer worked hard to defend his client in court.', 'Người luật sư đã làm việc chăm chỉ để bảo vệ thân chủ của mình trước tòa.', '{\"en\": \"The lawyer worked hard to defend the company against the false accusations made by competitors.\", \"vi\": \"Luật sư đã làm việc chăm chỉ để bảo vệ công ty trước những cáo buộc sai trái từ đối thủ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-ljspeech-a4555a4b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-cori-a4555a4b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/defend-9f9a76a7.webp', '[\"protect\", \"guard\"]', '[\"attack\", \"abandon\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"defend a position\", \"meaning\": \"bảo vệ quan điểm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"defend against\", \"meaning\": \"phòng thủ chống lại\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"defense\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"defensive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-cori-a4555a4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-aru0-a4555a4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-aru5-a4555a4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-aru6-a4555a4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-aru10-a4555a4b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-aru9-a4555a4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-aru3-a4555a4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-aru7-a4555a4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-aru8-a4555a4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-aru2-a4555a4b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-ljspeech-a4555a4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-lt408-a4555a4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-lt138-a4555a4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-lt624-a4555a4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-lt396-a4555a4b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-lt498-a4555a4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-lt132-a4555a4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-lt288-a4555a4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-lt42-a4555a4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defend-lt90-a4555a4b.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh pháp lý hoặc tranh luận trong công việc.', 'law', 1, 8),
('0410d368-6885-5ac4-9aba-123dc3e1f2af', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '28afc5e3-08e1-5790-a545-4928fe321354', '5f550244-18cc-5079-ad9c-359e981f8956', 'soulmate', '/ˈsəʊlmeɪt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một người mà bạn cảm thấy có sự kết nối sâu sắc, hoàn hảo về mặt tinh thần.', 'a person that you have a strong connection with and love very much.', 'After years of traveling together, she realized her best friend was her true soulmate.', 'Sau nhiều năm cùng nhau đi du lịch, cô ấy nhận ra người bạn thân nhất chính là tri kỷ thực sự của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The novel tells a story about a businessman who finally finds his soulmate while traveling abroad.\", \"vi\": \"Cuốn tiểu thuyết kể về câu chuyện một doanh nhân cuối cùng đã tìm thấy tri kỷ của mình khi đi du lịch nước ngoài.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soulmate-ljspeech-129bddbe.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soulmate-cori-129bddbe.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/soulmate-2f5f29f2.webp', '[\"partner\", \"companion\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"find a soulmate\", \"meaning\": \"tìm thấy tri kỷ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soulmate-cori-129bddbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soulmate-aru0-129bddbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soulmate-aru5-129bddbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soulmate-aru6-129bddbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soulmate-aru10-129bddbe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soulmate-aru9-129bddbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soulmate-aru3-129bddbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soulmate-aru7-129bddbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soulmate-aru8-129bddbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soulmate-aru2-129bddbe.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/obje