('d250ec6e-3b6d-5ea6-b17b-5e0de67e4c09', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '28afc5e3-08e1-5790-a545-4928fe321354', '5f550244-18cc-5079-ad9c-359e981f8956', 'creature', '/ˈkriːtʃə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một sinh vật sống, đặc biệt là động vật.', 'any living thing that can move independently, such as an animal.', 'The deep sea is home to many strange and wonderful creatures.', 'Biển sâu là nơi sinh sống của nhiều sinh vật kỳ lạ và tuyệt vời.', '{\"en\": \"The eco-resort created a natural sanctuary to protect every rare ocean creature near the beach.\", \"vi\": \"Khu nghỉ dưỡng sinh thái đã tạo ra một khu bảo tồn tự nhiên để bảo vệ mọi sinh vật biển quý hiếm gần bãi biển.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creature-ljspeech-93fda888.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creature-cori-93fda888.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/creature-9bd90646.webp', '[\"organism\", \"beast\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"living creature\", \"meaning\": \"sinh vật sống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sea creature\", \"meaning\": \"sinh vật biển\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"creation\", \"note_vi\": \"creation là sự tạo ra/tác phẩm, creature là sinh vật\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"create\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"creation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creature-cori-93fda888.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creature-aru0-93fda888.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creature-aru5-93fda888.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creature-aru6-93fda888.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creature-aru10-93fda888.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creature-aru9-93fda888.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creature-aru3-93fda888.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creature-aru7-93fda888.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creature-aru8-93fda888.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creature-aru2-93fda888.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creature-ljspeech-93fda888.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creature-lt408-93fda888.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creature-lt138-93fda888.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creature-lt624-93fda888.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creature-lt396-93fda888.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creature-lt498-93fda888.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creature-lt132-93fda888.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creature-lt288-93fda888.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creature-lt42-93fda888.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creature-lt90-93fda888.mp3\"]}}', 'Có thể dùng để chỉ động vật nói chung hoặc sinh vật huyền thoại.', 'nature', 1, 14),
('449abe16-b25c-58f7-9efa-6c7d4e88c47c', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '28afc5e3-08e1-5790-a545-4928fe321354', '5f550244-18cc-5079-ad9c-359e981f8956', 'chat up', '/tʃæt ʌp/', 'B2', 'phrasal verb', 'Bắt chuyện với ai đó một cách thân thiện, thường để tán tỉnh.', 'to talk to someone in a friendly way because you are attracted to them.', 'David attempted to chat up a colleague near the coffee machine during break time.', 'David đã cố gắng bắt chuyện với một đồng nghiệp gần máy pha cà phê trong giờ giải lao.', '{\"en\": \"The manager warned the employee not to chat up clients during the important business meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý cảnh báo nhân viên không được tán tỉnh khách hàng trong cuộc họp kinh doanh quan trọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-up-ljspeech-bd8e210b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-up-cori-bd8e210b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/chat-up-7b602c10.webp', '[\"flirt\", \"woo\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"chat up someone\", \"meaning\": \"bắt chuyện với ai đó\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"chat with\", \"note_vi\": \"Chat with chỉ là trò chuyện thông thường, không mang ý tán tỉnh.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-up-cori-bd8e210b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-up-aru0-bd8e210b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-up-aru5-bd8e210b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-up-aru6-bd8e210b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-up-aru10-bd8e210b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-up-aru9-bd8e210b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-up-aru3-bd8e210b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-up-aru7-bd8e210b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-up-aru8-bd8e210b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-up-aru2-bd8e210b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-up-ljspeech-bd8e210b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-up-lt408-bd8e210b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-up-lt138-bd8e210b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-up-lt624-bd8e210b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-up-lt396-bd8e210b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-up-lt498-bd8e210b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-up-lt132-bd8e210b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-up-lt288-bd8e210b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-up-lt42-bd8e210b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-up-lt90-bd8e210b.mp3\"]}}', 'Cẩn thận khi dùng trong môi trường công sở vì nó mang nghĩa tán tỉnh không chuyên nghiệp.', 'office', 1, 15),
('85e6e20f-eed2-5008-a951-6743a247e9f8', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '28afc5e3-08e1-5790-a545-4928fe321354', '5f550244-18cc-5079-ad9c-359e981f8956', 'dissolution', '/ˌdɪsəˈluːʃn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Hành động chấm dứt hoặc giải thể một tổ chức, thỏa thuận hoặc mối quan hệ.', 'the official act of ending a formal agreement, a business partnership, or a legislative body.', 'Lawyers prepared the legal paperwork required for the formal dissolution of the business partnership.', 'Các luật sư đã chuẩn bị giấy tờ pháp lý cần thiết cho việc giải thể chính thức mối quan hệ hợp tác kinh doanh.', '{\"en\": \"The board members voted for the dissolution of the partnership due to persistent financial losses.\", \"vi\": \"Các thành viên hội đồng quản trị đã bỏ phiếu cho việc giải thể quan hệ đối tác do thua lỗ tài chính kéo dài.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolution-ljspeech-973f8ad8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolution-cori-973f8ad8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dissolution-07a3eacc.webp', '[\"termination\", \"liquidation\"]', '[\"formation\", \"establishment\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"dissolution of a company\", \"meaning\": \"sự giải thể công ty\"}, {\"phrase\": \"formal dissolution\", \"meaning\": \"sự giải thể chính thức\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"dissolve\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolution-cori-973f8ad8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolution-aru0-973f8ad8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolution-aru5-973f8ad8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolution-aru6-973f8ad8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolution-aru10-973f8ad8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolution-aru9-973f8ad8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolution-aru3-973f8ad8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolution-aru7-973f8ad8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolution-aru8-973f8ad8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolution-aru2-973f8ad8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolution-ljspeech-973f8ad8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolution-lt408-973f8ad8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolution-lt138-973f8ad8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolution-lt624-973f8ad8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolution-lt396-973f8ad8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolution-lt498-973f8ad8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolution-lt132-973f8ad8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolution-lt288-973f8ad8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolution-lt42-973f8ad8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolution-lt90-973f8ad8.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng trong văn bản pháp lý hoặc kinh doanh khi kết thúc một tổ chức.', 'law', 1, 16),
('103e1c1b-29aa-54ad-ae7f-a06feeaf4572', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '28afc5e3-08e1-5790-a545-4928fe321354', '5f550244-18cc-5079-ad9c-359e981f8956', 'rear', 'UK: /rɪə/ | US: /rɪr/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'phía sau', 'located at or related to the back part or end of an object or vehicle.', 'The car has a rear view camera for parking.', 'Xe ô tô có camera chiếu hậu để đỗ xe.', '{\"en\": \"Deliveries should be brought to the rear entrance of the warehouse.\", \"vi\": \"Hàng giao nên được đưa đến lối vào phía sau của nhà kho.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rear-ljspeech-0f02135b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rear-cori-0f02135b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rear-eedfe6de.webp', '[\"back\", \"hind\", \"rearward\"]', '[\"front\", \"fore\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"rear entrance\", \"meaning\": \"lối vào phía sau\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rear door\", \"meaning\": \"cửa sau\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rear view\", \"meaning\": \"tầm nhìn phía sau\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"rare\", \"note_vi\": \"\'rare\' có nghĩa là hiếm có; \'rear\' là phía sau.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rear-cori-0f02135b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rear-aru0-0f02135b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rear-aru5-0f02135b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rear-aru6-0f02135b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rear-aru10-0f02135b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rear-aru9-0f02135b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rear-aru3-0f02135b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rear-aru7-0f02135b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rear-aru8-0f02135b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rear-aru2-0f02135b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rear-ljspeech-0f02135b.mp3\", \"/storage/