('3a1fca10-fa17-53b1-9266-16763d3cdd7e', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '28afc5e3-08e1-5790-a545-4928fe321354', '5f550244-18cc-5079-ad9c-359e981f8956', 'kill time', '/kɪl taɪm/', 'B1', 'idiom', 'Làm điều gì đó để thời gian trôi qua trong khi chờ đợi.', 'to do something to keep yourself busy while waiting for something else to happen later.', 'She browsed social media on her phone to kill time during the commute.', 'Cô ấy lướt mạng xã hội trên điện thoại để giết thời gian trong suốt chuyến đi lại.', '{\"en\": \"I checked my emails to kill time while waiting for the client to arrive today.\", \"vi\": \"Tôi kiểm tra email để giết thời gian trong lúc chờ khách hàng đến hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kill-time-ljspeech-d4841bde.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kill-time-cori-d4841bde.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/kill-time-99f0f53c.webp', '[\"pass the time\", \"fill time\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"kill time before\", \"meaning\": \"giết thời gian trước khi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"help to kill time\", \"meaning\": \"giúp giết thời gian\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kill-time-cori-d4841bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kill-time-aru0-d4841bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kill-time-aru5-d4841bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kill-time-aru6-d4841bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kill-time-aru10-d4841bde.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kill-time-aru9-d4841bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kill-time-aru3-d4841bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kill-time-aru7-d4841bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kill-time-aru8-d4841bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kill-time-aru2-d4841bde.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kill-time-ljspeech-d4841bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kill-time-lt408-d4841bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kill-time-lt138-d4841bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kill-time-lt624-d4841bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kill-time-lt396-d4841bde.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kill-time-lt498-d4841bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kill-time-lt132-d4841bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kill-time-lt288-d4841bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kill-time-lt42-d4841bde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kill-time-lt90-d4841bde.mp3\"]}}', 'cụm từ này mang nghĩa tiêu cực nhẹ, dùng khi bạn không có việc gì quan trọng để làm.', 'daily', 1, 18),
('1576ba7c-062c-5d18-bb8e-6f3a3733e441', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '28afc5e3-08e1-5790-a545-4928fe321354', '5f550244-18cc-5079-ad9c-359e981f8956', 'mediocre', '/ˌmiːdiˈəʊkə(r)/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Tầm thường, không xuất sắc nhưng cũng không quá tệ.', 'not very good or of only average quality when better is expected.', 'Despite the high price, the restaurant received mediocre reviews from local food critics.', 'Dù giá thành cao, nhà hàng chỉ nhận được những lời đánh giá xoàng xĩnh từ các nhà phê bình ẩm thực địa phương.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant received mediocre reviews from customers due to slow service and cold food.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng nhận được những đánh giá tầm thường từ khách hàng do dịch vụ chậm và đồ ăn nguội.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-ljspeech-962e42f0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-cori-962e42f0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mediocre-04f3e625.webp', '[\"average\", \"ordinary\", \"unremarkable\"]', '[\"excellent\", \"outstanding\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"mediocre results\", \"meaning\": \"kết quả xoàng xĩnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mediocre performance\", \"meaning\": \"màn thể hiện tầm thường\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"medium\", \"note_vi\": \"mức trung bình (trung tính), còn mediocre mang sắc thái chê bai (chỉ ở mức trung bình kém)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"mediocrity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-cori-962e42f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-aru0-962e42f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-aru5-962e42f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-aru6-962e42f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-aru10-962e42f0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-aru9-962e42f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-aru3-962e42f