('9b816cc6-4ef0-5af0-a7cd-a3a529768526', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '28afc5e3-08e1-5790-a545-4928fe321354', '5f550244-18cc-5079-ad9c-359e981f8956', 'patent', 'UK: /ˈpeɪtnt/ | US: /ˈpætnt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'bằng sáng chế', 'an official right granted by a government giving exclusive control over an invention.', 'She filed a patent for her new invention.', 'Cô ấy đã nộp bằng sáng chế cho phát minh mới của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The R&D team filed a patent application for their newly developed battery technology.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ R&D đã nộp đơn xin cấp bằng sáng chế cho công nghệ pin mới phát triển của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patent-ljspeech-6612af2e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patent-cori-6612af2e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/patent-ffeb15a3.webp', '[\"copyright\", \"license\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"file a patent\", \"meaning\": \"nộp đơn xin cấp bằng sáng chế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"patent rights\", \"meaning\": \"quyền sở hữu bằng sáng chế\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pattern\", \"note_vi\": \"Pattern có nghĩa là mẫu/kiểu dáng, khác với patent là bằng sáng chế.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"patent\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"patented\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patent-cori-6612af2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patent-aru0-6612af2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patent-aru5-6612af2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patent-aru6-6612af2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patent-aru10-6612af2e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patent-aru9-6612af2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patent-aru3-6612af2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patent-aru7-6612af2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patent-aru8-6612af2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patent-aru2-6612af2e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patent-ljspeech-6612af2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patent-lt408-6612af2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patent-lt138-6612af2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patent-lt624-6612af2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patent-lt396-6612af2e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patent-lt498-6612af2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patent-lt132-6612af2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patent-lt288-6612af2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patent-lt42-6612af2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patent-lt90-6612af2e.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường gặp cụm \'apply for a patent\' (nộp đơn xin cấp bằng sáng chế) hoặc \'patent pending\' (đang chờ cấp bằng).', 'legal', 1, 20),
('2d677e8f-2cbd-58b4-92be-bcbc089e633e', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '28afc5e3-08e1-5790-a545-4928fe321354', '5f550244-18cc-5079-ad9c-359e981f8956', 'back on my feet', '/bæk ɒn maɪ fiːt/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Hồi phục sức khỏe sau bệnh tật hoặc khó khăn tài chính.', 'healthy, strong, or successful again after a period of illness or trouble.', 'After a long illness, it took her a few weeks to get back on her feet completely.', 'Sau một trận ốm dài, cô ấy mất vài tuần để hoàn toàn hồi phục sức khỏe.', '{\"en\": \"After a week of sick leave, the lead developer is finally back on his feet.\", \"vi\": \"Sau một tuần nghỉ ốm, lập trình viên trưởng cuối cùng đã hồi phục sức khỏe.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-on-my-feet-ljspeech-35f58bc6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-on-my-feet-cori-35f58bc6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/back-on-my-feet-f100de32.webp', '[\"recovered\", \"well again\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"get back on one\'s feet\", \"meaning\": \"hồi phục, đứng dậy sau khó khăn\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-on-my-feet-cori-35f58bc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-on-my-feet-aru0-35f58bc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-on-my-feet-aru5-35f58bc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-on-my-feet-aru6-35f58bc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-on-my-feet-aru10-35f58bc6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-on-my-feet-aru9-35f58bc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-on-my-feet-aru3-35f58bc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-on-my-feet-aru7-35f58bc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-on-my-feet-aru8-35f58bc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-on-my-feet-aru2-35f58bc6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\"