('2b601c9f-11d6-5db5-bff6-3786f217862a', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '28afc5e3-08e1-5790-a545-4928fe321354', '5f550244-18cc-5079-ad9c-359e981f8956', 'archery', '/ˈɑːtʃəri/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Môn thể thao hoặc nghệ thuật dùng cung và tên.', 'the sport or skill of shooting arrows with a bow at a target.', 'She took up archery as a hobby and quickly became very skilled.', 'Cô ấy bắt đầu tập bắn cung như một sở thích và nhanh chóng trở nên rất giỏi.', '{\"en\": \"The resort added an outdoor archery range to attract more guests during summer.\", \"vi\": \"Khu nghỉ dưỡng đã thêm một sân bắn cung ngoài trời để thu hút thêm khách trong mùa hè.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archery-ljspeech-e601e393.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archery-cori-e601e393.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/archery-e80fac66.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"archery equipment\", \"meaning\": \"thiết bị bắn cung\"}, {\"phrase\": \"archery competition\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc thi bắn cung\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"archer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archery-cori-e601e393.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archery-aru0-e601e393.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archery-aru5-e601e393.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archery-aru6-e601e393.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archery-aru10-e601e393.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archery-aru9-e601e393.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archery-aru3-e601e393.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archery-aru7-e601e393.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archery-aru8-e601e393.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archery-aru2-e601e393.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archery-ljspeech-e601e393