('66e291aa-a909-5b4b-9011-69a7efa87bfb', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '28afc5e3-08e1-5790-a545-4928fe321354', '5f550244-18cc-5079-ad9c-359e981f8956', 'pork', '/pɔːk/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Thịt từ lợn, dùng làm thực phẩm.', 'the red meat from a common farm animal.', 'We often have grilled pork for dinner.', 'Chúng tôi thường ăn thịt lợn nướng vào bữa tối.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant ordered extra pork for the banquet next week.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng đã đặt thêm thịt lợn cho bữa tiệc cuối tuần tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pork-ljspeech-63aef24e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pork-cori-63aef24e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pork-fe20b8f4.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"roast pork\", \"meaning\": \"thịt lợn quay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pork chop\", \"meaning\": \"sườn lợn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pork sausage\", \"meaning\": \"xúc xích lợn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"park\", \"note_vi\": \"park là công viên, pork là thịt lợn.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pork-cori-63aef24e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pork-aru0-63aef24e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pork-aru5-63aef24e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pork-aru6-63aef24e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pork-aru10-63aef24e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pork-aru9-63aef24e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pork-aru3-63aef24e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pork-aru7-63aef24e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pork-aru8-63aef24e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pork-aru2-63aef24e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pork-ljspeech-63aef24e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pork-lt408-63aef24e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pork-lt138-63aef24e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pork-lt624-63aef24e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pork-lt396-63aef24e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pork-lt498-63aef24e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pork-lt132-63aef24e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pork-lt288-63aef24e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pork-lt42-63aef24e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pork-lt90-63aef24e.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhớ pork là thịt lợn, không phải park (công viên).', 'dining', 1, 24),
('62cd1c98-6d05-598b-a218-e31d3f909d0f', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '28afc5e3-08e1-5790-a545-4928fe321354', '5f550244-18cc-5079-ad9c-359e981f8956', 'atmosphere', '/ˈætməsfɪə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Lớp khí bao quanh Trái Đất hoặc một hành tinh khác.', 'the layer of gases that surrounds the earth or another planet.', 'Harmful industrial emissions pollute the atmosphere and accelerate global climate change.', 'Khí thải công nghiệp độc hại làm ô nhiễm bầu khí quyển và đẩy nhanh sự biến đổi khí hậu toàn cầu.', '{\"en\": \"The new office design creates a calm and productive atmosphere for all employees.\", \"vi\": \"Thiết kế văn phòng mới tạo ra bầu không khí yên tĩnh và hiệu quả cho tất cả nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-ljspeech-ffa2fbc7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-cori-ffa2fbc7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/atmosphere-61b92450.webp', '[\"air\", \"environment\", \"ambiance\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"Earth\'s atmosphere\", \"meaning\": \"khí quyển Trái Đất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pleasant atmosphere\", \"meaning\": \"bầu không khí dễ chịu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"working atmosphere\", \"meaning\": \"bầu không khí làm việc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"environment\", \"note_vi\": \"environment rộng hơn, atmosphere nhấn mạnh lớp khí hoặc cảm giác không khí nơi đó\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"atmospheric\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-cori-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-aru0-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-aru5-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-aru6-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-aru10-ffa2fbc7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-aru9-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-aru3-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-aru7-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-aru8-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-aru2-ffa2fbc7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-ljspeech-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-lt408-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-lt138-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-lt624-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-lt396-ffa2fbc7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-lt498-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-lt132-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-lt288-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-lt42-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-lt90-ffa2fbc7.mp3\"]}}', 'Atmosphere có hai nghĩa: khí quyển (khoa học) và bầu không khí/không khí chung (cảm giác nơi chốn).', 'nature', 1, 25),
('cc7f1d70-8762-5804-bb58-ff00a13b9249', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '28afc5e3-08e1-5790-a545-4928fe321354', '5f550244-18cc-5079-ad9c-359e981f8956', 'clean bill of health', '/kliːn bɪl əv helθ/', 'C1', 'idiom', 'Chứng nhận hoàn toàn khỏe mạnh hoặc không có vấn đề.', 'a statement from a doctor saying that someone is in very good physical condition.', 'The footballer received a clean bill of health before signing the new contract.', 'Cầu thủ bóng đá đã nhận được sự xác nhận hoàn toàn khỏe mạnh trước khi ký hợp đồng mới.', '{\"en\": \"The pilot received a clean bill of health after his annual medical examination last week.\", \"vi\": \"Phi công đã nhận được xác nhận sức khỏe tốt sau kỳ kiểm tra y tế hàng năm tuần trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clean-bill-of-health-ljspeech-99986ef8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clean-bill-of-health-cori-99986ef8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/clean-bill-of-health-5c50bcf6.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"get a clean bill of health\", \"meaning\": \"được xác nhận khỏe mạnh\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clean-bill-of-health-cori-99986ef8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clean-bill-of-health-aru0-99986ef8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clean-bill-of-health-aru5-99986ef8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clean-bill-of-health-aru6-99986ef8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clean-bill-of-health-aru10-99986ef8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clean-bill-of-health-aru9-99986ef8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clean-bill-of-health-aru3-99986ef8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clean-bill-of-health-aru7-99986ef8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clean-bill-of-health-aru8-99986ef8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pub