('a5f90bf1-b8a7-56a2-95ed-9448ba6ec2c2', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '2f807551-3736-51ab-9447-be04259e4e02', 'e2a045be-3588-5c44-8520-fa0339d40a6d', 'salmonella', '/ˌsælməˈnelə/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một loại vi khuẩn gây ngộ độc thực phẩm.', 'a type of bacteria that causes food poisoning when found in contaminated food products.', 'Cooking chicken thoroughly is important to prevent salmonella infection.', 'Nấu chín kỹ thịt gà là quan trọng để ngăn ngừa nhiễm khuẩn salmonella.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant was closed for inspection after several customers reported illness caused by salmonella.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng đã bị đóng cửa để kiểm tra sau khi vài khách hàng báo cáo bị bệnh do khuẩn salmonella.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salmonella-ljspeech-f6153f7c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salmonella-cori-f6153f7c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/salmonella-249b6c86.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"food poisoning\", \"meaning\": \"ngộ độc thực phẩm\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salmonella-cori-f6153f7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salmonella-aru0-f6153f7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salmonella-aru5-f6153f7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salmonella-aru6-f6153f7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salmonella-aru10-f6153f7c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salmonella-aru9-f6153f7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salmonella-aru3-f6153f7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salmonella-aru7-f6153f7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salmonella-aru8-f6153f7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salmonella-aru2-f6153f7c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salmonella-ljspeech-f6153f7c.mp3\", \"/stor