('f983f498-1f06-5b59-b4e5-ab7f97af48a8', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '2f807551-3736-51ab-9447-be04259e4e02', 'e2a045be-3588-5c44-8520-fa0339d40a6d', 'productive', 'UK: /prəˈdʌk.tɪv/ | US: /prəˈdʌk.tɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'có năng suất, hiệu quả', 'yielding positive outcomes or creating a large quantity of useful work or goods', 'The team had a very productive meeting this morning.', 'Nhóm đã có một cuộc họp rất hiệu quả sáng nay.', '{\"en\": \"The team had a very productive meeting and finalized the strategy for next year.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm đã có một cuộc họp rất hiệu quả và chốt xong chiến lược cho năm tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-ljspeech-f3f80621.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-cori-f3f80621.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/productive-7335048c.webp', '[\"fruitful\", \"efficient\", \"constructive\", \"prolific\"]', '[\"unproductive\", \"inefficient\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"highly productive\", \"meaning\": \"rất năng suất / hiệu quả cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"productive discussion\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc thảo luận hiệu quả\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"productivity\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"productively\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"produce\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-cori-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru0-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru5-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru6-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru10-f3f80621.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru9-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru3-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru7-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru8-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru2-f3f80621.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-ljspeech-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-lt408-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-lt138-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-lt624-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-lt396-f3f80621.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-lt498-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-lt132-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-lt288-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-lt42-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-lt90-f3f80621.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm các danh từ như \'meeting\', \'employee\', \'day\' để chỉ sự hiệu quả, ra được nhiều kết quả tốt.', 'office', 1, 4),
('39f663e3-f519-5376-9bdd-dffc3a94dde6', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '2f807551-3736-51ab-9447-be04259e4e02', 'e2a045be-3588-5c44-8520-fa0339d40a6d', 'breakfast', '/ˈbrekfəst/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Bữa ăn đầu tiên trong ngày, thường vào buổi sáng.', 'The initial meal consumed after waking up, traditionally eaten early in the morning.', 'I usually have a light breakfast, like toast and coffee, before starting my day.', 'Tôi thường ăn bữa sáng nhẹ, như bánh mì nướng và cà phê, trước khi bắt đầu ngày mới.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel offers a complimentary breakfast to all guests staying in deluxe rooms.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn cung cấp bữa sáng miễn phí cho tất cả khách lưu trú tại phòng sang trọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-ljspeech-9e3a8225.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-cori-9e3a8225.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/breakfast-ea09c203.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"have breakfast\", \"meaning\": \"ăn sáng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"complimentary breakfast\", \"meaning\": \"bữa sáng miễn phí\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-cori-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-aru0-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-aru5-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-aru6-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-aru10-9e3a8225.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-aru9-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-aru3-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-aru7-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-aru8-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-aru2-9e3a8225.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-ljspeech-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-lt408-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-lt138-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-lt624-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-lt396-9e3a8225.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-lt498-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-lt132-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-lt288-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-lt42-9e3a8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breakfast-lt90-9e3a8225.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh viết sai chính tả thành break fast (tách rời).', 'dining', 1, 5),
('7d1cc832-49d6-52d9-a32d-0476fad93809', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '2f807551-3736-51ab-9447-be04259e4e02', 'e2a045be-3588-5c44-8520-fa0339d40a6d', 'daughter-in-law', '/ˈdɔːtərɪnˌlɔː/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Con dâu, vợ của con trai mình.', 'the woman who is married to your son.', 'My daughter-in-law is a wonderful chef and always cooks delicious meals for the family.', 'Con dâu tôi là một đầu bếp tuyệt vời và luôn nấu những bữa ăn ngon cho gia đình.', '{\"en\": \"Mr. Miller invited his daughter-in-law to join the annual company gala dinner on Friday night.\", \"vi\": \"Ông Miller đã mời con dâu của mình cùng tham dự bữa tiệc Gala hàng năm của công ty vào tối thứ Sáu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daughter-in-law-ljspeech-29a21dd9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daughter-in-law-cori-29a21dd9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/daughter-in-law-49dd30fd.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"prospective daughter-in-law\", \"meaning\": \"con dâu tương lai\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sister-in-law\", \"note_vi\": \"sister-in-law là chị/em dâu hoặc chị/em chồng, daughter-in-law là con dâu.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daughter-in-law-cori-29a21dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daughter-in-law-aru0-29a21dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daughter-in-law-aru5-29a21dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daughter-in-law-aru6-29a21dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daughter-in-law-aru10-29a21dd9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daughter-in-law-aru9-29a21dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daughter-in-law-aru3-29a21dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daughter-in-law-aru7-29a21dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daughter-in-law-aru8-29a21dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daughter-in-law-aru2-29a21dd9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daughter-in-law-ljspeech-29a21dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daughter-in-law-lt408-29a21dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daughter-in-law-lt138-29a21dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daughter-in-law-lt624-29a21dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daughter-in-law-lt396-29a21dd9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daughter-in-law-lt498-29a21dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daughter-in-law-lt132-29a21dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daughter-in-law-lt288-29a21dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daughter-in-law-lt42-29a21dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/daughter-in-law-lt90-29a21dd9.mp3\"]}}', 'Lưu ý dạng số nhiều của từ này là daughters-in-law (thêm \'s\' vào daughter).', 'daily', 1, 6),
('a417b871-d0c4-54fa-9486-b489cb249586', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '2f807551-3736-51ab-9447-be04259e4e02', 'e2a045be-3588-5c44-8520-fa0339d40a6d', 'prescription', '/prɪˈskrɪpʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Đơn thuốc do bác sĩ kê để mua thuốc hoặc điều trị.', 'a piece of paper on which a doctor writes the medicine a sick person needs.', 'Patients can refill their prescription online through the hospital digital portal.', 'Bệnh nhân có thể lấy thêm thuốc theo đơn thuốc trực tuyến qua cổng thông tin điện tử của bệnh viện.', '{\"en\": \"You must present a valid prescription from your doctor to purchase these specific medications at the pharmacy.\", \"vi\": \"Bạn phải trình một đơn thuốc hợp lệ từ bác sĩ để mua những loại thuốc cụ thể này tại nhà thuốc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-ljspeech-9fd01ae4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-cori-9fd01ae4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/prescription-f20cc915.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fill a prescription\", \"meaning\": \"bốc thuốc theo đơn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"write a prescription\", \"meaning\": \"viết đơn thuốc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"description\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa là sự mô tả, dễ nhầm đuôi -scription\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"prescribe\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-cori-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru0-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru5-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru6-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru10-9fd01ae4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru9-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru3-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru7-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru8-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru2-9fd01ae4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-ljspeech-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-lt408-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-lt138-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-lt624-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-lt396-9fd01ae4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-lt498-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-lt132-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-lt288-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-lt42-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-lt90-9fd01ae4.mp3\"]}}', '\"Fill a prescription\" nghĩa là mua thuốc theo đơn đã có.', 'health', 1, 7),
('6d76b2f9-e959-561e-a49b-af7414416e9e', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '2f807551-3736-51ab-9447-be04259e4e02', 'e2a045be-3588-5c44-8520-fa0339d40a6d', 'distracted', '/dɪˈstræktɪd/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Không thể tập trung vì bị quấy rầy hoặc nghĩ về điều khác.', 'unable to pay attention to something because you are thinking about other things.', 'She got easily distracted by the noise outside and couldn\'t finish her homework.', 'Cô ấy dễ bị phân tâm bởi tiếng ồn bên ngoài và không thể hoàn thành bài tập về nhà.', '{\"en\": \"The manager became distracted by constant phone calls during the important project briefing session.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý bị mất tập trung bởi những cuộc gọi liên tục trong phiên họp tóm tắt dự án quan trọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distracted-ljspeech-7710f77c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distracted-cori-7710f77c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/distracted-22cfbc9e.webp', '[\"inattentive\", \"preoccupied\"]', '[\"focused\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"easily distracted\", \"meaning\": \"dễ bị xao nhãng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"distract\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"distraction\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distracted-cori-7710f77c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distracted-aru0-7710f77c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distracted-aru5-7710f77c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distracted-aru6-7710f77c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distracted-aru10-7710f77c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distracted-aru9-7710f77c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distracted-aru3-7710f77c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distracted-aru7-7710f77c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distracted-aru8-7710f77c.mp3\", \"/storag