('96acdbff-5ee5-5e6e-9f66-d92b478d479f', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '2f807551-3736-51ab-9447-be04259e4e02', 'e2a045be-3588-5c44-8520-fa0339d40a6d', 'inheritance', '/ɪnˈherɪtəns/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Tiền bạc, tài sản hoặc đặc điểm nhận được từ người đã mất.', 'money, property, or possessions that someone receives from a person who has died.', 'He decided to invest his inheritance wisely into several high-growth startup companies.', 'Anh ấy quyết định đầu tư khoản thừa kế của mình một cách khôn ngoan vào một số công ty khởi nghiệp tăng trưởng cao.', '{\"en\": \"He used his inheritance to invest in a small business after his father passed away.\", \"vi\": \"Anh ấy đã dùng tài sản thừa kế để đầu tư vào một doanh nghiệp nhỏ sau khi cha mất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inheritance-ljspeech-636f5f3d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inheritance-cori-636f5f3d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/inheritance-691cbad3.webp', '[\"legacy\", \"bequest\", \"estate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"receive an inheritance\", \"meaning\": \"nhận tài sản thừa kế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"inheritance tax\", \"meaning\": \"thuế thừa kế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"leave an inheritance\", \"meaning\": \"để lại tài sản thừa kế\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"heritage\", \"note_vi\": \"heritage là di sản văn hóa/lịch sử, không phải tài sản cá nhân để lại sau khi chết.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"inherit\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"inheritor\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"inherited\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inheritance-cori-636f5f3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inheritance-aru0-636f5f3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inheritance-aru5-636f5f3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inheritance-aru6-636f5f3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inheritance-aru10-636f5f3d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inheritance-aru9-636f5f3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inheritance-aru3-636f5f3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inheritance-aru7-636f5f3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inheritance-aru8-636f5f3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inheritance-aru2-636f5f3d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inheritance-ljspeech-636f5f3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inheritance-lt408-636f5f3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inheritance-lt138-636f5f3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inheritance-lt624-636f5f3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inheritance-lt396-636f5f3d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inheritance-lt498-636f5f3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inheritance-lt132-636f5f3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inheritance-lt288-636f5f3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inheritance-lt42-636f5f3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inheritance-lt90-636f5f3d.mp3\"]}}', 'Inheritance tax (thuế thừa kế) là cụm hay gặp trong đề TOEIC chủ đề tài chính và pháp lý.', 'finance', 1, 18),
('dc9a30fc-adff-56d6-825d-0c4c3d9b171d', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '2f807551-3736-51ab-9447-be04259e4e02', 'e2a045be-3588-5c44-8520-fa0339d40a6d', 'indulge', '/ɪnˈdʌldʒ/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Cho phép bản thân hoặc người khác tận hưởng điều gì đó; chiều chuộng.', 'to allow yourself or someone else to enjoy something special or pleasant.', 'During their vacation in Paris, the couple chose to indulge in fine dining.', 'Trong kỳ nghỉ tại Paris, cặp đôi đã chọn tự thưởng cho mình những bữa ăn xa hoa.', '{\"en\": \"Guests at the luxury hotel can indulge in premium spa treatments during their stay.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng tại khách sạn sang trọng có thể tự thưởng cho mình các dịch vụ spa cao cấp trong thời gian lưu trú.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulge-ljspeech-e99082ad.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulge-cori-e99082ad.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/indulge-47c7c356.webp', '[\"pamper\", \"gratify\"]', '[\"deprive\", \"restrain\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"indulge in\", \"meaning\": \"thưởng thức / đắm chìm trong\"}, {\"phrase\": \"indulge yourself\", \"meaning\": \"tự thưởng cho bản thân\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"divulge\", \"note_vi\": \"divulge nghĩa là tiết lộ bí mật, khác indulge là chiều chuộng/thỏa mãn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"indulgence\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"indulgent\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulge-cori-e99082ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulge-aru0-e99082ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulge-aru5-e99082ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulge-aru6-e99082ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulge-aru10-e99082ad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulge-aru9-e99082ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulge-aru3-e99082ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulge-aru7-e99082ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulge-aru8-e99082ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulge-aru2-e99082ad.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulge-ljspeech-e99082ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulge-lt408-e99082ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulge-lt138-e99082ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulge-lt624-e99082ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulge-lt396-e99082ad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulge-lt498-e99082ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulge-lt132-e99082ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulge-lt288-e99082ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulge-lt42-e99082ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulge-lt90-e99082ad.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm với giới từ \'in\' (indulge in something).', 'travel', 1, 19),
('8dcd82b7-fd00-594b-9cea-5ebc79f494ed', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '2f807551-3736-51ab-9447-be04259e4e02', 'e2a045be-3588-5c44-8520-fa0339d40a6d', 'intensive', 'UK: /ɪnˈtɛnsɪv/ | US: /ɪnˈtɛnsɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'chuyên sâu, chuyên sâu', 'involving a high degree of concentrated effort over a short time period.', 'The team underwent intensive training for the new project.', 'Đội đã trải qua khóa đào tạo chuyên sâu cho dự án mới.', '{\"en\": \"Newly recruited sales representatives must undergo a two-week intensive training program.\", \"vi\": \"Các đại diện kinh doanh mới được tuyển dụng phải trải qua một chương trình đào tạo chuyên sâu kéo dài hai tuần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensive-ljspeech-777615f6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensive-cori-777615f6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/intensive-0271b833.webp', '[\"thorough\", \"rigorous\", \"concentrated\", \"exhaustive\"]', '[\"superficial\", \"relaxed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"intensive training\", \"meaning\": \"đào tạo chuyên sâu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"labor-intensive\", \"meaning\": \"thâm dụng lao động / tốn nhiều nhân công\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"intense\", \"note_vi\": \"intensive mang tính tập trung cao độ (khóa học), intense chỉ cường độ mạnh/cảm xúc dữ dội.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"intensively\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"intensiveness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensive-cori-777615f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensive-aru0-777615f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensive-aru5-777615f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensive-aru6-777615f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensive-aru10-777615f6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensive-aru9-777615f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensive-aru3-777615f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensive-aru7-777615f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensive-aru8-777615f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensive-aru2-777615f6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensive-ljspeech-777615f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensive-lt408-777615f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensive-lt138-777615f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensive-lt624-777615f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensive-lt396-777615f6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensive-lt498-777615f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensive-lt132-777615f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensive-lt288-777615f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensive-lt42-777615f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensive-lt90-777615f6.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi cùng với các danh từ như \'training\', \'course\' để nói về hoạt động cấp tập, chuyên sâu.', 'training', 1, 20),
('ec597955-f42d-5581-8516-9210267b3d2f', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '2f807551-3736-51ab-9447-be04259e4e02', 'e2a045be-3588-5c44-8520-fa0339d40a6d', 'ecosystem', '/ˈiːkəʊsɪstəm/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cộng đồng sinh vật tương tác với môi trường của chúng.', 'all the living things in an area and the way they affect each other.', 'Protecting the rainforest ecosystem is crucial for global biodiversity.', 'Bảo vệ hệ sinh thái rừng nhiệt đới là rất quan trọng đối với đa dạng sinh học toàn cầu.', '{\"en\": \"The new factory was heavily fined for damaging the local marine ecosystem with chemical waste.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà máy mới đã bị phạt nặng vì làm tổn hại hệ sinh thái biển địa phương bằng chất thải hóa học.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecosystem-ljspeech-a07d95e6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecosystem-cori-a07d95e6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ecosystem-8dca5575.webp', '[\"environment\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"marine ecosystem\", \"meaning\": \"hệ sinh thái biển\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fragile ecosystem\", \"meaning\": \"hệ sinh thái mỏng manh\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"eco-friendly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecosystem-cori-a07d95e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecosystem-aru0-a07d95e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecosystem-aru5-a07d95e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecosystem-aru6-a07d95e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecosystem-aru10-a07d95e6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecosystem-aru9-a07d95e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecosystem-aru3-a07d95e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecosystem-aru7-a07d95e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecosystem-aru8-a07d95e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecosystem-aru2-a07d95e6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecosystem-ljspeech-a07d95e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecosystem-lt408-a07d95e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecosystem-lt138-a07d95e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecosystem-lt624-a07d95e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecosystem-lt396-a07d95e6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecosystem-lt498-a07d95e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecosystem-lt132-a07d95e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecosystem-lt288-a07d95e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecosystem-lt42-a07d95e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecosystem-lt90-a07d95e6.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong kinh doanh, từ này cũng dùng để chỉ \'hệ sinh thái sản phẩm\' (ví dụ: Apple ecosystem).', 'nature', 1, 21),
('a545f6a7-1797-5d8e-aaa9-aee2e33b8448', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '2f807551-3736-51ab-9447-be04259e4e02', 'e2a045be-3588-5c44-8520-fa0339d40a6d', 'childhood friend', '/tʃaɪldhʊd frend/', 'B1', 'phrase', 'Người bạn quen biết từ khi còn nhỏ.', 'a person you have known and been close to since you were a young child.', 'I still keep in touch with my childhood friend, even though we live in different cities.', 'Tôi vẫn giữ liên lạc với người bạn thời thơ ấu của mình, dù chúng tôi sống ở các thành phố khác nhau.', '{\"en\": \"I was surprised to find my childhood friend working as the new project manager today.\", \"vi\": \"Tôi đã rất ngạc nhiên khi thấy bạn thời thơ ấu của mình đang làm quản lý dự án mới hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/childhood-friend-ljspeech-7983e683.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/childhood-friend-cori-7983e683.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/childhood-friend-c2d68cae.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"close childhood friend\", \"meaning\": \"bạn thân thời thơ ấu\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/childhood-friend-cori-7983e683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/childhood-friend-aru0-7983e683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/childhood-friend-aru5-7983e683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/childhood-friend-aru6-7983e683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/childhood-friend-aru10-7983e683.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/childhood-friend-aru9-7983e683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/childhood-friend-aru3-7983e683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/childhood-friend-aru7-7983e683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/childhood-friend-aru8-7983e683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/childhood-friend-aru2-7983e683.mp3\"]}, \