('513c444b-bb17-5da3-9c72-d8b922dda9bc', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '2f807551-3736-51ab-9447-be04259e4e02', 'e2a045be-3588-5c44-8520-fa0339d40a6d', 'cardiologist', '/ˌkɑːdiˈɒlədʒɪst/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Bác sĩ chuyên về chẩn đoán và điều trị các bệnh về tim.', 'a medical doctor who specializes in diagnosing and treating conditions related to the human heart.', 'My grandmother sees a cardiologist regularly for her heart condition.', 'Bà tôi đi khám bác sĩ chuyên khoa tim thường xuyên vì tình trạng bệnh tim của bà.', '{\"en\": \"The insurance plan covers visits to a cardiologist if you require specialized heart medical care.\", \"vi\": \"Gói bảo hiểm chi trả cho các lần khám bác sĩ tim mạch nếu bạn cần chăm sóc y tế chuyên sâu về tim.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cardiologist-ljspeech-e9301ca6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cardiologist-cori-e9301ca6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cardiologist-f8061ed5.webp', '[\"heart specialist\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"consult a cardiologist\", \"meaning\": \"tham khảo ý kiến bác sĩ tim mạch\"}, {\"phrase\": \"refer to a cardiologist\", \"meaning\": \"chuyển đến bác sĩ tim mạch\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"cardiology\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cardiologist-cori-e9301ca6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cardiologist-aru0-e9301ca6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cardiologist-aru5-e9301ca6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cardiologist-aru6-e9301ca6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cardiologist-aru10-e9301ca6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cardiologist-aru9-e9301ca6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cardiologist-aru3-e9301ca6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cardiologist-aru7-e9301ca6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cardiologist-aru8-e9301ca6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cardiologist-aru2-e9301ca6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cardiologist-ljspeech-e9301ca6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cardiologist-lt408-e9301ca6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cardiologist-lt138-e9301ca6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cardiologist-lt624-e9301ca6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cardiologist-lt396-e9301ca6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cardiologist-lt498-e9301ca6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cardiologist-lt132-e9301ca6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cardiologist-lt288-e9301ca6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cardiologist-lt42-e9301ca6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cardiologist-lt90-e9301ca6.mp3\"]}}', 'Gốc từ \'cardio\' liên quan đến tim, rất phổ biến trong các thuật ngữ y tế.', 'health', 1, 27),
('91e2365b-f2a8-5d07-8df4-55f776819030', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '2f807551-3736-51ab-9447-be04259e4e02', 'e2a045be-3588-5c44-8520-fa0339d40a6d', 'proximity', '/prɒkˈsɪməti/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Sự gần gũi về vị trí hoặc thời gian.', 'the state of being near to something in distance, space, or time.', 'The hotel\'s proximity to the beach was a major selling point.', 'Vị trí gần bãi biển của khách sạn là một điểm cộng lớn.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel attracted business travelers due to its proximity to the international airport.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn thu hút khách du lịch công tác nhờ nằm gần sân bay quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proximity-ljspeech-8227614f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proximity-cori-8227614f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/proximity-ad0498e6.webp', '[\"closeness\", \"nearness\", \"vicinity\"]', '[\"distance\", \"remoteness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"in close proximity to\", \"meaning\": \"rất gần với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"proximity to facilities\", \"meaning\": \"sự gần các tiện ích\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"approximate\", \"note_vi\": \"Approximate là tính từ nghĩa là xấp xỉ, xấp xỉ số lượng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"proximate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proximity-cori-8227614f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proximity-aru0-8227614f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proximity-aru5-8227614f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proximity-aru6-8227614f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proximity-aru10-8227614f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proximity-aru9-8227614f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proximity-aru3-8227614f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proximity-aru7-8227614f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proximity-aru8-822