('3f418584-c89e-5a0e-b99c-be5ece9fb0ef', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '3ca6f498-3599-5d39-b1cb-cc8d32700962', 'd9edae77-ced6-56af-b491-c64dcec23257', 'swimming', '/ˈswɪmɪŋ/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Hoạt động bơi dưới nước.', 'the sport or activity of moving through water using limbs and body movements.', 'She enjoys swimming in the lake every summer morning.', 'Cô ấy thích bơi ở hồ vào mỗi sáng hè.', '{\"en\": \"The resort hotel features a large outdoor area dedicated to recreational swimming for guests.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn nghỉ dưỡng có một khu vực ngoài trời lớn dành cho hoạt động bơi lội giải trí của khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swimming-ljspeech-bb500fce.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swimming-cori-bb500fce.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/swimming-0b5d3186.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"swimming pool\", \"meaning\": \"hồ bơi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"go swimming\", \"meaning\": \"đi bơi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"swimming lesson\", \"meaning\": \"buổi học bơi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"swim\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"swimmer\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"swimmingly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swimming-cori-bb500fce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swimming-aru0-bb500fce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swimming-aru5-bb500fce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swimming-aru6-bb500fce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swimming-aru10-bb500fce.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swimming-aru9-bb500fce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swimming-aru3-bb500fce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swimming-aru7-bb500fce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swimming-aru8-bb500fce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swimming-