('943673ef-ee65-5c25-bd14-549dd1615e61', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '3ca6f498-3599-5d39-b1cb-cc8d32700962', 'd9edae77-ced6-56af-b491-c64dcec23257', 'under the weather', '/ˈʌndə ðə ˈwɛðə/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Cảm thấy không khỏe, hơi ốm hoặc mệt mỏi.', 'feeling slightly ill, sick, tired, or not as well as usual.', 'Several office members decided to stay home after feeling under the weather.', 'Một số nhân viên văn phòng đã quyết định ở nhà sau khi cảm thấy khó chịu trong người.', '{\"en\": \"Because the manager was feeling under the weather, he took a sick day today.\", \"vi\": \"Vì quản lý cảm thấy không được khỏe, ông ấy đã xin nghỉ phép ốm hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-ljspeech-9eb6e510.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-cori-9eb6e510.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/under-the-weather-e2e413b0.webp', '[\"unwell\", \"sick\", \"indisposed\"]', '[\"healthy\", \"well\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel under the weather\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy không khỏe trong người\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-cori-9eb6e510.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-aru0-9eb6e510.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-aru5-9eb6e510.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-aru6-9eb6e510.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-aru10-9eb6e510.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-aru9-9eb6e510.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-aru3-9eb6e510.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-aru7-9eb6e510.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-aru8-9eb6e510.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-aru2-9