('1c8470da-7995-563c-9df7-a1561a31d08f', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '3ca6f498-3599-5d39-b1cb-cc8d32700962', 'd9edae77-ced6-56af-b491-c64dcec23257', 'christianity', '/ˌkrɪstiˈænəti/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Tôn giáo dựa trên giáo lý của Chúa Giê-su Ki-tô.', 'the religion that is based on the teachings of Jesus Christ and the Bible.', 'Christianity is one of the world\'s largest religions.', 'Cơ Đốc giáo là một trong những tôn giáo lớn nhất thế giới.', '{\"en\": \"The cultural seminar provided an overview of Christianity and its influence on Western business traditions.\", \"vi\": \"Hội thảo văn hóa đã cung cấp cái nhìn tổng quan về đạo Cơ đốc và ảnh hưởng của nó.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/christianity-ljspeech-c67dd081.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/christianity-cori-c67dd081.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/christianity-c1a89b28.webp', '[\"the church\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"practice Christianity\", \"meaning\": \"thực hành đạo Cơ đốc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"history of Christianity\", \"meaning\": \"lịch sử đạo Cơ đốc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"Christian\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/christianity-cori-c67dd081.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/christianity-aru0-c67dd081.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/christianity-aru5-c67dd081.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/christianity-aru6-c67dd081.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/christianity-aru10-c67dd081.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/christianity-aru9-c67dd081.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/christianity-aru3-c67dd081.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/christianity-aru7-c67dd081.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/christianity-aru8-c67dd081.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/christia