('c3ce0b12-5e5f-556d-ba03-4738ce4150f9', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '3f4dc438-e3e4-5caf-80f8-8456ba9881b6', 'cc6480bc-cc70-58ba-a893-a567115d517d', 'full of beans', '/fʊl əv biːnz/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Tràn đầy năng lượng, rất hoạt bát và vui vẻ.', 'having a lot of energy and feeling very active and happy all the time.', 'The young athletes arrived at the stadium full of beans for their morning practice.', 'Các vận động viên trẻ đến sân vận động tràn đầy năng lượng cho buổi tập buổi sáng.', '{\"en\": \"The new intern is always full of beans when helping clients with their technical issues.\", \"vi\": \"Thực tập sinh mới luôn tràn đầy năng lượng khi hỗ trợ khách hàng giải quyết các vấn đề kỹ thuật.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-of-beans-ljspeech-ef4cfdf7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-of-beans-cori-ef4cfdf7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/full-of-beans-2743cea3.webp', '[\"energetic\", \"lively\"]', '[\"lethargic\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"be full of beans\", \"meaning\": \"tràn đầy năng lượng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"seem full of beans\", \"meaning\": \"có vẻ tràn đầy năng lượng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-of-beans-cori-ef4cfdf7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-of-beans-aru0-ef4cfdf7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-of-beans-aru5-ef4cfdf7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-of-beans-aru6-ef4cfdf7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-of-beans-aru10-ef4cfdf7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-of-beans-aru9-ef4cfdf7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-of-beans-aru3-ef4cfdf7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-of-beans-aru7-ef4cfdf7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-of-beans-aru8-ef4cfdf7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pub