('979ec906-fe01-5c36-8efe-ba940f514417', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '3f4dc438-e3e4-5caf-80f8-8456ba9881b6', 'cc6480bc-cc70-58ba-a893-a567115d517d', 'subordinate', '/səˈbɔːdɪnət/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Có địa vị hoặc tầm quan trọng thấp hơn.', 'having a lower position or rank than someone else in an organization or a group.', 'His personal ambitions were subordinate to his duty to the country.', 'Tham vọng cá nhân của anh ấy phụ thuộc vào nghĩa vụ đối với đất nước.', '{\"en\": \"The assistant manager is subordinate to the department head and must report all daily activities.\", \"vi\": \"Trợ lý quản lý là cấp dưới của trưởng phòng và phải báo cáo mọi hoạt động hàng ngày.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subordinate-ljspeech-eb581281.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subordinate-cori-eb581281.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/subordinate-65d6ab11.webp', '[\"inferior\", \"junior\"]', '[\"superior\", \"senior\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"subordinate to\", \"meaning\": \"thấp hơn, phụ thuộc vào\"}, {\"phrase\": \"subordinate position\", \"meaning\": \"vị trí cấp dưới\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"subordination\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subordinate-cori-eb581281.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subordinate-aru0-eb581281.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subordinate-aru5-eb581281.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subordinate-aru6-eb581281.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subordinate-aru10-eb581281.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subordinate-aru9-eb581281.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subordinate-aru3-eb581281.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subordinate-aru7-eb581281.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subordinate-aru8-eb581281.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subordinate-aru2-eb581281.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subordinate-ljspeech-eb581281.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subordinate-lt408-eb581281.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subordinate-lt138-eb581281.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subordinate-lt624-eb581281.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subordinate-lt396-eb581281.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subordinate-lt498-eb581281.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subordinate-lt132-eb581281.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subordinate-lt288-eb581281.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subordinate-lt42-eb581281.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subordinate-lt90-eb581281.mp3\"]}}', 'Trái nghĩa với \'superior\' (cấp trên).', 'office', 1, 14),
('187a0ee9-400d-55f8-a727-f85fa57e3618', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '3f4dc438-e3e4-5caf-80f8-8456ba9881b6', 'cc6480bc-cc70-58ba-a893-a567115d517d', 'keep in touch with', '/kiːp ɪn tʌtʃ wɪð/', 'A2', 'phrasal verb', 'Duy trì liên hệ hoặc giao tiếp với ai đó.', 'maintain regular contact among acquaintances after they part ways.', 'It\'s important to keep in touch with old friends, even if you live far apart.', 'Điều quan trọng là phải giữ liên lạc với những người bạn cũ, ngay cả khi bạn sống xa nhau.', '{\"en\": \"We should keep in touch with clients after the project ends.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta nên giữ liên lạc với khách hàng sau khi dự án kết thúc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-in-touch-with-ljspeech-48862cca.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-in-touch-with-cori-48862cca.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/keep-in-touch-with-4e913919.webp', '[\"stay in contact with\", \"remain in communication with\"]', '[\"lose contact with\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"keep in touch with friends\", \"meaning\": \"giữ liên lạc với bạn bè\"}, {\"phrase\": \"keep in touch with colleagues\", \"meaning\": \"giữ liên lạc với đồng nghiệp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"keep track of\", \"note_vi\": \"keep track of là theo dõi, khác với keep in touch with.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-in-touch-with-cori-48862cca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-in-touch-with-aru0-48862cca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-in-touch-with-aru5-48862cca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-in-touch-with-aru6-48862cca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-in-touch-with-aru10-48862cca.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-in-touch-with-aru9-48862cca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keep-in-touch-with-aru3-48862cca.mp3\", \"/storage