('50194d7b-03ca-5b64-bfb7-9fd5923dd588', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '3f4dc438-e3e4-5caf-80f8-8456ba9881b6', 'cc6480bc-cc70-58ba-a893-a567115d517d', 'victory', '/ˈvɪktəri/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Thành công trong một cuộc chiến, cuộc thi hoặc cuộc tranh luận.', 'the act of winning a contest or achieving a goal successfully.', 'The team celebrated their hard-fought victory in the championship game.', 'Đội đã ăn mừng chiến thắng khó khăn của mình trong trận chung kết.', '{\"en\": \"Our sales team secured a major victory in the quarterly contract bid.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ bán hàng của chúng tôi đã giành thắng lợi lớn trong đấu thầu hợp đồng quý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/victory-ljspeech-eaa6a041.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/victory-cori-eaa6a041.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/victory-9fc05e66.webp', '[\"win\", \"triumph\", \"success\"]', '[\"defeat\", \"loss\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"decisive victory\", \"meaning\": \"chiến thắng quyết định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"military victory\", \"meaning\": \"chiến thắng quân sự\"}, {\"phrase\": \"victory celebration\", \"meaning\": \"lễ ăn mừng chiến thắng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"victor\", \"note_vi\": \"victor là người chiến thắng, victory là sự kiện\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"victorious\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"victoriously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/victory-cori-eaa6a041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/victory-aru0-eaa6a041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/victory-aru5-eaa6a041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/victory-aru6-eaa6a041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/victory-aru10-eaa6a041.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/victory-aru9-eaa6a041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/victory-aru3-eaa6a041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/victory-aru7-eaa6a041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/victory-aru8-eaa6a041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/victory-aru2-eaa6a041.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/victory-ljspeech-eaa6a041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/victory-lt408-eaa6a041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/victory-lt138-eaa6a041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/victory-lt624-eaa6a041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/victory-lt396-eaa6a041.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/victory-lt498-eaa6a041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/victory-lt132-eaa6a041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/victory-lt288-eaa6a041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/victory-lt42-eaa6a041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/victory-lt90-eaa6a041.mp3\"]}}', 'Victory là danh từ chỉ sự thắng, không dùng như động từ.', 'business', 1, 23),
('afed5b90-1b9d-57d3-bbb4-f2959a9a2f39', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '3f4dc438-e3e4-5caf-80f8-8456ba9881b6', 'cc6480bc-cc70-58ba-a893-a567115d517d', 'sin', '/sɪn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hành động vi phạm đạo đức, quy tắc tôn giáo.', 'An offense against divine commandment or accepted ethical principles.', 'He felt deep remorse after committing what he believed was a grave sin.', 'Anh ấy cảm thấy hối hận sâu sắc sau khi phạm phải điều mà anh ấy tin là một tội lỗi nghiêm trọng.', '{\"en\": \"Making a mistake on the financial report is considered a major sin in this accounting firm.\", \"vi\": \"Mắc sai lầm trong báo cáo tài chính được coi là một tội lỗi lớn ở công ty kế toán này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sin-ljspeech-7d14c04a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sin-cori-7d14c04a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sin-0aa670da.webp', '[\"crime\", \"offense\", \"wrongdoing\"]', '[\"virtue\", \"goodness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"commit a sin\", \"meaning\": \"phạm tội\"}, {\"phrase\": \"confess a sin\", \"meaning\": \"xưng tội\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"crime\", \"note_vi\": \"crime là tội phạm pháp luật, sin là tội lỗi đạo đức/tôn giáo.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"sinful\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"sinner\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sin-cori-7d14c04a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sin-aru0-7d14c04a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sin-aru5-7d14c04a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sin-aru6-7d14c04a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sin-aru10-7d14c04a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sin-aru9-7d14c04a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sin-aru3-7d14c04a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sin-aru7-7d14c04a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sin-aru8-7d14c04a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sin-aru2-7d14c04a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sin-ljspeech-7d14c04a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sin-lt408-7d14c04a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sin-lt138-7d14c04a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sin-lt624-7d14c04a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sin-lt396-7d14c04a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sin-lt498-7d14c04a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sin-lt132-7d14c04a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sin-lt288-7d14c04a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sin-lt42-7d14c04a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sin-lt90-7d14c04a.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh tôn giáo hoặc đạo đức, ít dùng trong luật pháp.', 'other', 1, 24),
('e224dd00-7865-5fbf-aeb1-04189594e4d3', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '3f4dc438-e3e4-5caf-80f8-8456ba9881b6', 'cc6480bc-cc70-58ba-a893-a567115d517d', 'colleague', '/ˈkɒliːɡ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Người làm việc cùng một nơi hoặc ngành nghề.', 'a person that you work with, especially in a professional job.', 'A senior colleague gave valuable feedback on my presentation before the regional meeting.', 'Một đồng nghiệp cấp cao đã đưa ra phản hồi giá trị về bài thuyết trình của tôi trước cuộc họp khu vực.', '{\"en\": \"I need to consult with my colleague before finalizing the project budget.\", \"vi\": \"Tôi cần tham khảo ý kiến của đồng nghiệp trước khi hoàn thành ngân sách dự án.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-ljspeech-ace6752b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-cori-ace6752b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/colleague-e90ea70e.webp', '[\"coworker\", \"teammate\", \"associate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"close colleague\", \"meaning\": \"đồng nghiệp thân thiết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"work colleague\", \"meaning\": \"đồng nghiệp làm chung\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"college\", \"note_vi\": \"trường cao đẳng hoặc đại học, viết gần giống nhưng phát âm khác\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-cori-ace6752b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-aru0-ace6752b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-aru5-ace6752b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-aru6-ace6752b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-aru10-ace6752b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-aru9-ace6752b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-aru3-ace6752b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-aru7-ace6752b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-aru8-ace6752b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-aru2-ace6752b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-ljspeech-ace6752b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-lt408-ace6752b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-lt138-ace6752b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-lt624-ace6752b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-lt396-ace6752b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-lt498-ace6752b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-lt132-ace6752b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-lt288-ace6752b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-lt42-ace6752b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colleague-lt90-ace6752b.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn chính tả giữa colleague (đồng nghiệp) và college (trường cao đẳng).', 'office', 1, 25),
('049f047d-5509-53ce-bcb9-805aa840e385', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '3f4dc438-e3e4-5caf-80f8-8456ba9881b6', 'cc6480bc-cc70-58ba-a893-a567115d517d', 'vegetarianism', '/ˌvedʒəˈteəriənɪzəm/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Chế độ ăn kiêng không bao gồm thịt, cá, gia cầm.', 'the practice of eating only plant foods and avoiding meat or fish products.', 'She adopted vegetarianism for health reasons and ethical concerns.', 'Cô ấy đã áp dụng chế độ ăn chay vì lý do sức khỏe và mối quan tâm đạo đức.', '{\"en\": \"The corporate cafeteria promotes vegetarianism by serving plant-based meals every Friday.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà ăn công ty thúc đẩy chế độ ăn chay bằng cách phục vụ các bữa ăn từ thực vật vào mỗi thứ Sáu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vegetarianism-ljspeech-6341bb08.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vegetarianism-cori-6341bb08.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/vegetarianism-463ba3e1.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"strict vegetarianism\", \"meaning\": \"chế độ ăn chay nghiêm ngặt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"adopt vegetarianism\", \"meaning\": \"theo đuổi chế độ ăn chay\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"veganism\", \"note_vi\": \"chế độ ăn chay kiêng hoàn toàn sản phẩm từ động vật\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"vegetarian\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"vegetarian\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vegetarianism-cori-6341bb08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vegetarianism-aru0-6341bb08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vegetarianism-aru5-6341bb08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vegetarianism-aru6-6341bb08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vegetarianism-aru10-6341bb08.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vegetarianism-aru9-6341bb08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vegetarianism-aru3-6341bb08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pr