('f733af1f-92c1-5997-bfa0-8915c535c39d', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '4ad8ba14-339c-57f7-9054-51247bf175f8', '08accc5b-50b5-5bb2-9fc5-d29f79548176', 'misconception', '/ˌmɪskənˈsepʃn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một ý nghĩ hoặc niềm tin sai lầm.', 'an idea or belief that is wrong because it is based on a failure to understand.', 'There is a widespread misconception that working remotely reduces overall employee productivity.', 'Có một quan niệm sai lầm phổ biến rằng làm việc từ xa làm giảm năng suất tổng thể của nhân viên.', '{\"en\": \"There is a common misconception that working from home leads to lower productivity among office staff.\", \"vi\": \"Có một quan niệm sai lầm phổ biến rằng làm việc tại nhà dẫn đến năng suất thấp hơn trong nhân viên văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misconception-ljspeech-c37dcbb2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misconception-cori-c37dcbb2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/misconception-52cf0c0b.webp', '[\"misunderstanding\", \"fallacy\", \"error\"]', '[\"understanding\", \"fact\", \"truth\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"common misconception\", \"meaning\": \"quan niệm sai lầm phổ biến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"popular misconception\", \"meaning\": \"ngộ nhận phổ biến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clear up a misconception\", \"meaning\": \"làm rõ một hiểu lầm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"mistake\", \"note_vi\": \"lỗi lầm cụ thể, còn misconception là sai trong suy nghĩ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"misconceive\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"concept\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misconception-cori-c37dcbb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misconception-aru0-c37dcbb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misconception-aru5-c37dcbb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misconception-aru6-c37dcbb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misconception-aru10-c37dcbb2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misconception-aru9-c37dcbb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misconception-aru3-c37dcbb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misconception-aru7-c37dcbb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misconception-aru8-c37dcbb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misconception-aru2-c37dcbb2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misconception-ljspeech-c37dcbb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misconception-lt408-c37dcbb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misconception-lt138-c37dcbb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misconception-lt624-c37dcbb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misconception-lt396-c37dcbb2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misconception-lt498-c37dcbb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misconception-lt132-c37dcbb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misconception-lt288-c37dcbb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misconception-lt42-c37dcbb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misconception-lt90-c37dcbb2.mp3\"]}}', 'Tiền tố \"mis-\" mang nghĩa là sai, nhầm.', 'office', 1, 13),
('9cf8e779-219d-5876-893a-c1acd3aa3827', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '4ad8ba14-339c-57f7-9054-51247bf175f8', '08accc5b-50b5-5bb2-9fc5-d29f79548176', 'degree', '/dɪˈɡriː/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Bằng cấp học thuật nhận được sau khi hoàn thành khóa học.', 'a qualification given to a student after they have successfully completed their studies.', 'He earned his master\'s degree in engineering from a prestigious university.', 'Anh ấy đã lấy bằng thạc sĩ kỹ thuật từ một trường đại học danh tiếng.', '{\"en\": \"Applicants for the engineering position must hold a master\'s degree in a related field.\", \"vi\": \"Ứng viên cho vị trí kỹ sư phải có bằng thạc sĩ trong lĩnh vực liên quan.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/degree-ljspeech-7955b936.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/degree-cori-7955b936.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/degree-139bd74f.webp', '[\"qualification\", \"diploma\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"bachelor\'s degree\", \"meaning\": \"bằng cử nhân\"}, {\"phrase\": \"master\'s degree\", \"meaning\": \"bằng thạc sĩ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hold a degree\", \"meaning\": \"có bằng cấp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"certificate\", \"note_vi\": \"certificate là chứng chỉ ngắn hạn, degree là bằng cấp đại học\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/degree-cori-7955b936.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/degree-aru0-7955b936.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/degree-aru5-7955b936.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/degree-aru6-7955b936.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/degree-aru10-7955b936.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/degree-aru9-7955b936.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/degree-aru3-7955b936.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/degree-aru7-7955b936.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/degree-aru8-7955b936