('1e6e4744-b6c2-522d-8497-f613ff05dbfb', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '4ad8ba14-339c-57f7-9054-51247bf175f8', '08accc5b-50b5-5bb2-9fc5-d29f79548176', 'selection process', '/sɪˈlekʃən ˈprɒses/', 'B1', 'phrase', 'Quy trình chọn lựa ứng viên hoặc đối tượng.', 'a series of steps taken to choose the most suitable candidate or item.', 'The company has a rigorous selection process for new employees.', 'Công ty có một quy trình tuyển chọn nhân viên mới rất nghiêm ngặt.', '{\"en\": \"The human resources department streamlined the selection process to hire qualified candidates faster.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng nhân sự đã tinh giản quá trình tuyển chọn để tuyển các ứng viên đạt yêu cầu nhanh hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selection-process-ljspeech-0290948c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selection-process-cori-0290948c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/selection-process-07f247f8.webp', '[\"recruitment procedure\", \"screening procedure\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"rigorous selection process\", \"meaning\": \"quá trình tuyển chọn nghiêm ngặt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"finalize the selection process\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn tất quá trình tuyển chọn\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selection-process-cori-0290948c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selection-process-aru0-0290948c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selection-process-aru5-0290948c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selection-process-aru6-0290948c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selection-process-aru10-0290948c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selection-process-aru9-0290948c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selection-process-aru3-0290948c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selection-process-aru7-0290948c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selection-process-aru8-0290948c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selection-process-aru2-0290948c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selection-process-ljspeech-0290948c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selection-process-lt408-0290948c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selection-process-lt138-0290948c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selection-process-lt624-0290948c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selection-process-lt396-0290948c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selection-process-lt498-0290948c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selection-process-lt132-0290948c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selection-process-lt288-0290948c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selection-process-lt42-0290948c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/selection-process-lt90-0290948c.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm này dùng phổ biến trong tuyển dụng nhân sự và xét duyệt hồ sơ.', 'hr', 1, 17),
('2534582c-782c-5733-a0a8-fc93b63810f2', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '4ad8ba14-339c-57f7-9054-51247bf175f8', '08accc5b-50b5-5bb2-9fc5-d29f79548176', 'scarcity', '/ˈskeəsəti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng không có đủ số lượng của một thứ gì đó.', 'a situation where there is not enough of something that is needed or wanted.', 'The sudden scarcity of skilled labor led to severe delays in the construction project.', 'Sự khan hiếm lao động lành nghề đột ngột đã dẫn đến sự chậm trễ nghiêm trọng trong dự án xây dựng.', '{\"en\": \"The global scarcity of raw materials has caused significant delays in our manufacturing production schedule.\", \"vi\": \"Sự khan hiếm nguyên liệu thô trên toàn cầu đã gây ra sự chậm trễ đáng kể trong lịch trình sản xuất của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scarcity-ljspeech-503ab04b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scarcity-cori-503ab04b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/scarcity-644587fc.webp', '[\"shortage\", \"lack\"]', '[\"abundance\", \"plenty\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"scarcity of resources\", \"meaning\": \"sự khan hiếm tài nguyên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"severe scarcity\", \"meaning\": \"sự khan hiếm nghiêm trọng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"scarce\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scarcity-cori-503ab04b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scarcity-aru0-503ab04b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scarcity-aru5-503ab04b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scarcity-aru6-503ab04b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scarcity-aru10-503ab04b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scarcity-aru9-503ab04b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scarcity-aru3-503ab04b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scarcity-aru7-503ab04b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciati