('6e795066-5fc7-5bfe-ad86-a0b72e02fb48', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '4b227664-d3b8-571d-9f36-7d735eb435ef', 'c79e9c49-eee2-55d3-95f1-e84e4a1daf43', 'deteriorate', 'UK: /dɪˈtɪəriəreɪt/ | US: /dɪˈtɪriəˌreɪt/', 'C1', 'verb', 'xuống cấp, hư hỏng', 'To become progressively worse in quality, condition, value, or strength over time.', 'The building\'s condition will deteriorate if not maintained.', 'Tình trạng của tòa nhà sẽ xuống cấp nếu không được bảo trì.', '{\"en\": \"If market conditions deteriorate further, the board may decide to postpone the expansion plan.\", \"vi\": \"Nếu các điều kiện thị trường suy giảm thêm nữa, hội đồng quản trị có thể quyết định hoãn kế hoạch mở rộng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-ljspeech-9d24ea3b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-cori-9d24ea3b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/deteriorate-1e2b220e.webp', '[\"decline\", \"worsen\", \"degrade\"]', '[\"improve\", \"enhance\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"deteriorate rapidly\", \"meaning\": \"suy giảm nhanh chóng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deteriorating condition\", \"meaning\": \"tình trạng đang xấu đi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"deterioration\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-cori-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-aru0-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-aru5-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-aru6-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-aru10-9d24ea3b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-aru9-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-aru3-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-aru7-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-aru8-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-aru2-9d24ea3b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-ljspeech-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-lt408-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-lt138-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-lt624-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-lt396-9d24ea3b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-lt498-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-lt132-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-lt288-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-lt42-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-lt90-9d24ea3b.mp3\"]}}', 'Động từ thể hiện sự suy giảm, xuống cấp theo thời gian (thường dùng cho condition, health, relationship).', 'finance', 1, 0),
('501804c2-a5b5-55ba-986b-b66d29f9f44c', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '4b227664-d3b8-571d-9f36-7d735eb435ef', 'c79e9c49-eee2-55d3-95f1-e84e4a1daf43', 'readable', 'UK: /ˈriːdəbəl/ | US: /ˈriːdəbəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'dễ đọc', 'clear and easy to see, comprehend, or interpret when looking at written text.', 'The new font makes the document more readable.', 'Phông chữ mới làm cho tài liệu dễ đọc hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The annual report was formatted to make it more readable for potential investors.\", \"vi\": \"Báo cáo thường niên đã được định dạng để giúp các nhà đầu tư tiềm năng dễ đọc hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/readable-ljspeech-1d28e511.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/readable-cori-1d28e511.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/readable-796df19e.webp', '[\"comprehensible\", \"clear\", \"legible\"]', '[\"unreadable\", \"illegible\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"highly readable\", \"meaning\": \"rất dễ đọc/hấp dẫn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"easily readable\", \"meaning\": \"dễ dàng đọc được\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"legible\", \"note_vi\": \"\'legible\' nói về nét chữ rõ ràng dễ nhìn thấy; \'readable\' thiên về nội dung/trình bày lôi cuốn, dễ hiểu.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"read\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"readability\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/readable-cori-1d28e511.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/readable-aru0-1d28e511.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/readable-aru5-1d28e511.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/readable-aru6-1d28e511.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/readable-aru10-1d28e511.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/readable-aru9-1d28e511.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/readable-aru3-1d28e511.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/readable-aru7-1d28e511.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/readable-aru8-1d28e511.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/readable-aru2-1d28e511.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/readable-ljspeech-1d28e511.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/readable-lt408-1d28e511.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/readable-lt138-1d28e511.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/readable-lt624-1d28e511.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/readable-lt396-1d28e511.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/readable-lt498-1d28e511.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/readable-lt132-1d28e511.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/readable-lt288-1d28e511.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/readable-lt42-1d28e511.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/readable-lt90-1d28e511.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt \'readable\' (dễ đọc về văn phong, trình bày lôi cuốn) và \'legible\' (chữ viết rõ nét, dễ nhìn).', 'documents', 1, 1),
('3640cca2-205f-5128-836b-c33e5c65d234', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '4b227664-d3b8-571d-9f36-7d735eb435ef', 'c79e9c49-eee2-55d3-95f1-e84e4a1daf43', 'ecotourism', '/ˌiːkəʊˈtʊərɪzəm/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Loại hình du lịch có trách nhiệm với môi trường và cộng đồng địa phương.', 'traveling to natural areas in a way that protects the environment and helps local people.', 'The national park promotes ecotourism to protect its natural beauty.', 'Công viên quốc gia thúc đẩy du lịch sinh thái để bảo vệ vẻ đẹp tự nhiên của nó.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency is promoting ecotourism packages to attract visitors interested in sustainable and green travel.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty du lịch đang quảng bá các gói du lịch sinh thái để thu hút du khách quan tâm đến du lịch xanh và bền vững.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-ljspeech-6c634ca5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-cori-6c634ca5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ecotourism-d765c874.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"promote ecotourism\", \"meaning\": \"quảng bá du lịch sinh thái\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ecotourism project\", \"meaning\": \"dự án du lịch sinh thái\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-cori-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-aru0-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-aru5-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-aru6-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-aru10-6c634ca5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-aru9-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-aru3-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-aru7-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-aru8-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-aru2-6c634ca5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-ljspeech-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-lt408-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-lt138-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-lt624-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-lt396-6c634ca5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-lt498-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-lt132-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-lt288-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-lt42-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-lt90-6c634ca5.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ ghép giữa ecology và tourism, rất phổ biến trong các bài viết về xu hướng du lịch.', 'travel', 1, 2),
('736e5271-3c1a-52f3-9ba1-518f2ea855df', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '4b227664-d3b8-571d-9f36-7d735eb435ef', 'c79e9c49-eee2-55d3-95f1-e84e4a1daf43', 'productivity', '/ˌprɒdʌkˈtɪvəti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Khả năng sản xuất hoặc tạo ra sản phẩm, hiệu quả công việc.', 'the rate at which a company produces goods or services compared to the resources used.', 'Taking short regular breaks during long working hours can greatly boost employee productivity.', 'Nghỉ giải lao ngắn thường xuyên trong giờ làm việc kéo dài có thể thúc đẩy đáng kể năng suất của nhân viên.', '{\"en\": \"The manager implemented new training programs to boost the overall productivity of the sales team.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã thực hiện các chương trình đào tạo mới để thúc đẩy năng suất tổng thể của đội ngũ bán hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-ljspeech-0d117e42.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-cori-0d117e42.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/productivity-082c041a.webp', '[\"efficiency\", \"output\"]', '[\"inefficiency\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"increase productivity\", \"meaning\": \"tăng năng suất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"labor productivity\", \"meaning\": \"năng suất lao động\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"production\", \"note_vi\": \"production là quá trình sản xuất, productivity là hiệu quả của quá trình đó.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"productive\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"produce\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-cori-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-aru0-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-aru5-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-aru6-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-aru10-0d117e42.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-aru9-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-aru3-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-aru7-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-aru8-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-aru2-0d117e42.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-ljspeech-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-lt408-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-lt138-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-lt624-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-lt396-0d117e42.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-lt498-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-lt132-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-lt288-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-lt42-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-lt90-0d117e42.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhớ phân biệt với \'production\' (sản lượng/sự sản xuất) trong các bài thi TOEIC.', 'office', 1, 3),
('b30b648d-30b6-5a90-81cc-0a4274e05481', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '4b227664-d3b8-571d-9f36-7d735eb435ef', 'c79e9c49-eee2-55d3-95f1-e84e4a1daf43', 'private school', '/ˈpraɪvɪt skuːl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Trường học do tư nhân điều hành, không thuộc nhà nước.', 'a place of education that receives no money from the government.', 'Many parents choose to send their children to a private school for a specialized education.', 'Nhiều phụ huynh chọn gửi con cái họ đến trường tư thục để được giáo dục chuyên biệt.', '{\"en\": \"The educational company recently invested in building a new private school downtown.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty giáo dục gần đây đã đầu tư xây dựng một trường tư thục mới ở trung tâm thành phố.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/private-school-ljspeech-4323ab20.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/private-school-cori-4323ab20.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/private-school-568b6bd0.webp', '[\"independent school\"]', '[\"public school\", \"state school\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"attend a private school\", \"meaning\": \"theo học tại một trường tư thục\"}, {\"phrase\": \"private school tuition\", \"meaning\": \"học phí trường tư thục\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"public school\", \"note_vi\": \"Trường công lập (ở Mỹ) nhưng ở Anh lại là trường tư lâu đời.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/private-school-cori-4323ab20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/private-school-aru0-4323ab20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/private-school-aru5-4323ab20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/private-school-aru6-4323ab20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/private-school-aru10-4323ab20.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/private-school-aru9-4323ab20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/private-school-aru3-4323ab20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/p