('679c4160-73da-55ef-b81b-4f42a8539cba', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '4b3fd8d2-1145-5554-8b8b-2b909c1bd70a', 'e6a22b4e-35d5-5bcc-a7a5-93129f004382', 'physician', 'UK: /fɪˈzɪʃən/ | US: /fɪˈzɪʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'bác sĩ, thầy thuốc', 'a qualified medical doctor who treats patients suffering from various illnesses.', 'Consult a physician for any health concerns.', 'Hãy hỏi ý kiến bác sĩ về bất kỳ vấn đề sức khỏe nào.', '{\"en\": \"Before participating in the wellness program, employees are encouraged to consult their physician.\", \"vi\": \"Trước khi tham gia chương trình chăm sóc sức khỏe, nhân viên được khuyến khích tham vấn bác sĩ của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physician-ljspeech-f622146f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physician-cori-f622146f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/physician-912400bd.webp', '[\"doctor\", \"medical practitioner\", \"clinician\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"primary care physician\", \"meaning\": \"bác sĩ chăm sóc sức khỏe ban đầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"attending physician\", \"meaning\": \"bác sĩ điều trị chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"licensed physician\", \"meaning\": \"bác sĩ có giấy phép hành nghề\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"physicist\", \"note_vi\": \"physician là bác sĩ điều trị, còn physicist là nhà nghiên cứu khoa học vật lý.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"physics\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"physicist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physician-cori-f622146f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physician-aru0-f622146f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physician-aru5-f622146f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physician-aru6-f622146f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physician-aru10-f622146f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physician-aru9-f622146f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physician-aru3-f622146f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physician-aru7-f622146f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physician-aru8-f622146f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physician-aru2-f622146f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physician-ljspeech-f622146f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physician-lt408-f622146f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physician-lt138-f622146f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physician-lt624-f622146f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physician-lt396-f622146f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physician-lt498-f622146f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physician-lt132-f622146f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physician-lt288-f622146f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physician-lt42-f622146f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physician-lt90-f622146f.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với \'physicist\' (nhà vật lý). Physician là bác sĩ nội khoa / điều trị y khoa.', 'health', 1, 14),
('b5f5db7d-5cd1-526f-b892-eed829f24f45', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '4b3fd8d2-1145-5554-8b8b-2b909c1bd70a', 'e6a22b4e-35d5-5bcc-a7a5-93129f004382', 'perk', '/pɜːk/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một lợi ích hoặc đặc quyền bổ sung nhận được từ công việc hoặc vị trí.', 'an extra benefit or advantage that you receive from your employer in addition to your salary.', 'Free coffee and snacks are some of the perks of working at this company.', 'Cà phê và đồ ăn nhẹ miễn phí là một số bổng lộc khi làm việc tại công ty này.', '{\"en\": \"Free gym membership is a popular perk for employees working at our new office building.\", \"vi\": \"Thẻ tập gym miễn phí là một bổng lộc phổ biến cho nhân viên làm việc tại tòa nhà văn phòng mới của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perk-ljspeech-edc12fcc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perk-cori-edc12fcc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/perk-48c4de13.webp', '[\"benefit\", \"advantage\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"job perk\", \"meaning\": \"bổng lộc công việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"extra perk\", \"meaning\": \"phúc lợi thêm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"perk up\", \"note_vi\": \"perk up là cụm động từ nghĩa là trở nên vui vẻ, tỉnh táo hơn.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perk-cori-edc12fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perk-aru0-edc12fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perk-aru5-edc12fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perk-aru6-edc12fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perk-aru10-edc12fcc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perk-aru9-edc12fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perk-aru3-edc12fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perk-aru7-edc12fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perk-aru8-edc12fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perk-aru2-edc12fcc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perk-ljspeech-edc12fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perk-lt408-edc12fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perk-lt138-edc12fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perk-lt624-edc12fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perk-lt396-edc12fcc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perk-lt498-edc12fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perk-lt132-edc12fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perk-lt288-edc12fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perk-lt42-edc12fcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perk-lt90-edc12fcc.mp3\"]}}', 'thường dùng trong tuyển dụng để thu hút ứng viên (ví dụ: cà phê miễn phí, xe đưa đón).', 'hr', 1, 15),
('94df19c6-21fe-55bb-a312-ed730924393e', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '4b3fd8d2-1145-5554-8b8b-2b909c1bd70a', 'e6a22b4e-35d5-5bcc-a7a5-93129f004382', 'well-matched', '/wɛlˈmætʃt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Phù hợp, tương xứng với nhau (về khả năng, tính cách, ngoại hình...).', 'having similar qualities, interests, or abilities that make two people or things fit together nicely.', 'The two chess players were so well-matched that their game lasted for hours.', 'Hai kỳ thủ cờ vua đó quá tương xứng đến nỗi trận đấu của họ kéo dài hàng giờ.', '{\"en\": \"Both companies formed a well-matched partnership to expand their distribution network across Southeast Asia.\", \"vi\": \"Cả hai công ty đã tạo thành một mối quan hệ đối tác rất ăn ý để mở rộng mạng lưới phân phối khắp Đông Nam Á.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-matched-ljspeech-faa9e677.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-matched-cori-faa9e677.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/well-matched-103b7d34.webp', '[\"compatible\", \"well-suited\", \"harmonious\"]', '[\"mismatched\", \"incompatible\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"well-matched couple\", \"meaning\": \"cặp đôi xứng lứa vừa đôi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"well-matched team\", \"meaning\": \"đội ngũ phối hợp ăn ý\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"compatible\", \"note_vi\": \"compatible dùng cho cả máy móc/tính cách, well-matched dùng cho cặp đôi/đối tác ăn ý.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-matched-cori-faa9e677.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-matched-aru0-faa9e677.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-matched-aru5-faa9e677.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-matched-aru6-faa9e677.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-matched-aru10-faa9e677.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-matched-aru9-faa9e677.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-matched-aru3-faa9e677.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-matched-aru7-faa9e677.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-matched-aru8-faa9e677.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-matched-aru2-faa9e677.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-matched-ljspeech-faa9e677.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-matched-lt408-faa9e677.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-matched-lt138-faa9e677.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-matched-lt624-faa9e677.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-matched-lt396-faa9e677.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-matched-lt498-faa9e677.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-matched-lt132-faa9e677.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-matched-lt288-faa9e677.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-matched-lt42-faa9e677.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-matched-lt90-faa9e677.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để mô tả hai cá nhân hoặc hai tổ chức rất hợp nhau về tính cách, năng lực hay mục tiêu.', 'business', 1, 16),
('1a281473-ce1c-5043-80dd-8f11565e633b', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '4b3fd8d2-1145-5554-8b8b-2b909c1bd70a', 'e6a22b4e-35d5-5bcc-a7a5-93129f004382', 'immoral', '/ɪˈmɒrəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'không phù hợp với các nguyên tắc đạo đức hoặc chuẩn mực xã hội.', 'not following the accepted rules of right behavior or what is considered good by society.', 'Cheating on an exam is considered an immoral act by most people.', 'Gian lận trong thi cử bị hầu hết mọi người coi là hành vi vô đạo đức.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was fired because his immoral behavior violated the company\'s strict code of ethics.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã bị sa thải vì hành vi trái đạo đức của ông ta vi phạm bộ quy tắc đạo đức nghiêm ngặt của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immoral-ljspeech-399bbcc5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immoral-cori-399bbcc5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/immoral-d7936e17.webp', '[\"unethical\", \"wrong\"]', '[\"moral\", \"ethical\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"immoral behavior\", \"meaning\": \"hành vi trái đạo đức\"}, {\"phrase\": \"immoral act\", \"meaning\": \"hành động trái đạo đức\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"amoral\", \"note_vi\": \"Amoral là không quan tâm đến đạo đức, immoral là cố tình làm sai.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"immorality\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immoral-cori-399bbcc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immoral-aru0-399bbcc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immoral-aru5-399bbcc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immoral-aru6-399bbcc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immoral-aru10-399bbcc5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immoral-aru9-399bbcc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immoral-aru3-399bbcc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immoral-aru7-399bbcc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immoral-aru8-399bbcc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immoral-aru2-399bbcc5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immoral-ljspeech-399bbcc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immoral-lt408-399bbcc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immoral-lt138-399bbcc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immoral-lt624-399bbcc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immoral-lt396-399bbcc5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immoral-lt498-399bbcc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immoral-lt132-399bbcc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immoral-lt288-399bbcc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immoral-lt42-399bbcc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immoral-lt90-399bbcc5.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để chỉ hành vi sai trái nghiêm trọng trong môi trường làm việc.', 'office', 1, 17),
('9cb3b23a-b9b2-53b7-8dc0-5b7148e5fb3c', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '4b3fd8d2-1145-5554-8b8b-2b909c1bd70a', 'e6a22b4e-35d5-5bcc-a7a5-93129f004382', 'offering', 'UK: /ˈɒfərɪŋz/ | US: /ˈɔːfərɪŋz/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự cung cấp, hàng hóa/dịch vụ cung cấp', 'A product, service, or feature that is made available for public consumption or use.', 'The hotel offers complimentary breakfast to all guests.', 'Khách sạn cung cấp bữa sáng miễn phí cho mọi du khách.', '{\"en\": \"The software firm expanded its product offerings to meet the growing demand from corporate clients.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty phần mềm đã mở rộng các danh mục sản phẩm cung cấp để đáp ứng nhu cầu ngày càng tăng từ các khách hàng doanh nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offering-ljspeech-22bedc26.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offering-cori-22bedc26.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/offering-a2140da8.webp', '[\"product line\", \"service\", \"provision\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"product offering\", \"meaning\": \"danh mục sản phẩm cung ứng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"service offering\", \"meaning\": \"gói dịch vụ cung cấp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"offer\", \"note_vi\": \"Offer là lời đề nghị hoặc ưu đãi mua hàng ngắn hạn; Offering chỉ tổng thể sản phẩm/dịch vụ công ty thương mại hóa.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"offer\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"offer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offering-cori-22bedc26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offering-aru0-22bedc26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offering-aru5-22bedc26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offering-aru6-22bedc26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offering-aru10-22bedc26.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offering-aru9-22bedc26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offering-aru3-22bedc26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offering-aru7-22bedc26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offering-aru8-22bedc26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offering-aru2-22bedc26.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offering-ljspeech-22bedc26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offering-lt408-22bedc26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offering-lt138-22bedc26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offering-lt624-22bedc26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offering-lt396-22bedc26.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offering-lt498-22bedc26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offering-lt132-22bedc26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offering-lt288-22bedc26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offering-lt42-22bedc26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offering-lt90-22bedc26.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ \'offering\' thường ở dạng số nhiều (offerings) để chỉ toàn bộ danh mục sản phẩm hoặc gói dịch vụ mà doanh nghiệp đưa ra thị trường.', 'marketing', 1, 18),
('24e80a67-31b5-5013-9a3e-130fad62f92c', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '4b3fd8d2-1145-5554-8b8b-2b909c1bd70a', 'e6a22b4e-35d5-5bcc-a7a5-93129f004382', 'equilibrium', '/ˌiːkwɪˈlɪbriəm/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Trạng thái ổn định, cân bằng giữa các yếu tố đối lập.', 'a state in which opposing forces or influences are perfectly balanced.', 'The economy needs to find a new equilibrium after the recent crisis.', 'Nền kinh tế cần tìm một trạng thái cân bằng mới sau cuộc khủng hoảng gần đây.', '{\"en\": \"The market reached a state of equilibrium where supply and demand were finally equal.\", \"vi\": \"Thị trường đã đạt đến trạng thái cân bằng nơi cung và cầu cuối cùng đã bằng nhau.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equilibrium-ljspeech-255790fd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equilibrium-cori-255790fd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/equilibrium-cd51f1dd.webp', '[\"balance\", \"stability\"]', '[\"imbalance\", \"instability\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"reach equilibrium\", \"meaning\": \"đạt đến trạng thái cân bằng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"maintain equilibrium\", \"meaning\": \"duy trì sự cân bằng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"equilibrate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equilibrium-cori-255790fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equilibrium-aru0-255790fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equilibrium-aru5-255790fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equilibrium-aru6-255790fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equilibrium-aru10-255790fd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equilibrium-aru9-255790fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equilibrium-aru3-255790fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equilibrium-aru7-255790fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equilibrium-aru8-255790fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equilibrium-aru2-255790fd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equilibrium-ljspeech-255790fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equilibrium-lt408-255790fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equilibrium-lt138-255790fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equilibrium-lt624-255790fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equilibrium-lt396-255790fd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equilibrium-lt498-255790fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equilibrium-lt132-255790fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equilibrium-lt288-255790fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equilibrium-lt42-255790fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equilibrium-lt90-255790fd.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong kinh tế (cung-cầu) hoặc vật lý (thăng bằng).', 'finance', 1, 19),
('ffd578ad-80b7-5376-9af9-933dc9d14156', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '4b3fd8d2-1145-5554-8b8b-2b909c1bd70a', 'e6a22b4e-35d5-5bcc-a7a5-93129f004382', 'occurrence', 'UK: /əˈkʌrəns/ | US: /əˈkɜrəns/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự xảy ra', 'An event or incident that takes place in a particular situation or period.', 'The occurrence of system errors is rare.', 'Sự cố hệ thống rất hiếm khi xảy ra.', '{\"en\": \"Flight delays due to severe weather conditions are a common occurrence during the winter months.\", \"vi\": \"Sự hoãn chuyến bay do điều kiện thời tiết khắc nghiệt là một sự việc thường xảy ra trong những tháng mùa đông.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occurrence-ljspeech-7db36a79.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occurrence-cori-7db36a79.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/occurrence-3b1c3396.webp', '[\"event\", \"incident\", \"happening\", \"phenomenon\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"common occurrence\", \"meaning\": \"sự việc diễn ra phổ biến/thường xuyên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"everyday occurrence\", \"meaning\": \"sự việc xảy ra hàng ngày\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rare occurrence\", \"meaning\": \"sự việc hiếm khi xảy ra\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"occur\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occurrence-cori-7db36a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occurrence-aru0-7db36a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occurrence-aru5-7db36a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occurrence-aru6-7db36a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occurrence-aru10-7db36a79.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occurrence-aru9-7db36a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occurrence-aru3-7db36a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occurrence-aru7-7db36a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occurrence-aru8-7db36a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occurrence-aru2-7db36a79.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occurrence-ljspeech-7db36a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occurrence-lt408-7db36a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occurrence-lt138-7db36a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occurrence-lt624-7db36a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occurrence-lt396-7db36a79.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occurrence-lt498-7db36a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occurrence-lt132-7db36a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occurrence-lt288-7db36a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occurrence-lt42-7db36a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occurrence-lt90-7db36a79.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý chính tả có 2 chữ \'c\' và 2 chữ \'r\' (o-c-c-u-r-r-e-n-c-e). Cụm hay gặp: \'common occurrence\' (sự việc xảy ra phổ biến).', 'travel', 1, 20),
('45593e97-dcb5-5e04-af18-99b3a6cc84c3', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '4b3fd8d2-1145-5554-8b8b-2b909c1bd70a', 'e6a22b4e-35d5-5bcc-a7a5-93129f004382', 'backstroke', '/ˈbækstrəʊk/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Kiểu bơi mà người bơi nằm ngửa trên mặt nước.', 'a way of swimming on your back by moving your arms over your head.', 'The swimming instructor taught the beginners how to do the backstroke properly.', 'Huấn luyện viên bơi lội đã dạy những người mới bắt đầu cách bơi ngửa đúng kỹ thuật.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel pool is reserved for guests who want to practice their backstroke this morning.\", \"vi\": \"Hồ bơi của khách sạn được dành riêng cho những khách muốn luyện tập kiểu bơi ngửa vào sáng nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstroke-ljspeech-bedb25f2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstroke-cori-bedb25f2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/backstroke-c0882397.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"swim the backstroke\", \"meaning\": \"bơi ngửa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"backstroke champion\", \"meaning\": \"nhà vô địch bơi ngửa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"breaststroke\", \"note_vi\": \"breaststroke là bơi ếch, còn backstroke là bơi ngửa\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstroke-cori-bedb25f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstroke-aru0-bedb25f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstroke-aru5-bedb25f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstroke-aru6-bedb25f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstroke-aru10-bedb25f2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstroke-aru9-bedb25f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstroke-aru3-bedb25f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstroke-aru7-bedb25f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstroke-aru8-bedb25f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pub