('faf3ec32-1daf-5b34-8b68-b44a78398ccb', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '4b3fd8d2-1145-5554-8b8b-2b909c1bd70a', 'e6a22b4e-35d5-5bcc-a7a5-93129f004382', 'harass', '/ˈhærəs/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Làm phiền hoặc gây khó chịu cho ai đó một cách liên tục.', 'to annoy or trouble someone repeatedly with unwanted behavior or offensive comments.', 'It is illegal to harass someone at their workplace or online.', 'Việc quấy rối ai đó tại nơi làm việc hoặc trực tuyến là bất hợp pháp.', '{\"en\": \"The human resources policy clearly states that no employee should harass their colleagues.\", \"vi\": \"Chính sách nhân sự ghi rõ rằng không nhân viên nào được phép quấy rầy hay quấy rối đồng nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harass-ljspeech-8eaf22a6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harass-cori-8eaf22a6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/harass-a0f5609c.webp', '[\"pester\", \"annoy\", \"bother\"]', '[\"soothe\", \"comfort\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sexually harass\", \"meaning\": \"quấy rối tình dục\"}, {\"phrase\": \"continually harass\", \"meaning\": \"quấy rầy liên tục\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"embarrass\", \"note_vi\": \"harass là quấy rầy/quấy rối, embarrass là làm ai đó ngượng ngùng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"harassment\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"harassed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harass-cori-8eaf22a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harass-aru0-8eaf22a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harass-aru5-8eaf22a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harass-aru6-8eaf22a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harass-aru10-8eaf22a6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harass-aru9-8eaf22a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harass-aru3-8eaf22a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harass-aru7-8eaf22a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harass-aru8-8eaf22a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harass-aru2-8eaf22a6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harass-ljspeech-8eaf22a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harass-lt408-8eaf22a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harass-lt138-8eaf22a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harass-lt624-8eaf22a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harass-lt396-8eaf22a6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harass-lt498-8eaf22a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harass-lt132-8eaf22a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harass-lt288-8eaf22a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harass-lt42-8eaf22a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harass-lt90-8eaf22a6.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý chính tả: 1 chữ \'r\' và 2 chữ \'s\' (h-a-r-a-s-s).', 'hr', 1, 25),
('1502611e-4237-5067-8191-d21f908cee8c', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '4b3fd8d2-1145-5554-8b8b-2b909c1bd70a', 'e6a22b4e-35d5-5bcc-a7a5-93129f004382', 'neglect', 'UK: /nɪˈɡlɛkt/ | US: /nɪˈɡlɛkt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'bỏ bê, xao nhãng', 'to fail to give proper attention, care, or response to someone or something.', 'The company neglected to renew the software license.', 'Công ty đã bỏ bê việc gia hạn giấy phép phần mềm.', '{\"en\": \"The senior technician warned that neglecting routine maintenance could lead to severe machine breakdown.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên cao cấp cảnh báo rằng việc bỏ bê bảo trì định kỳ có thể dẫn đến hư hỏng máy móc nghiêm trọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neglect-ljspeech-02979a49.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neglect-cori-02979a49.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/neglect-68159f4c.webp', '[\"disregard\", \"overlook\", \"ignore\"]', '[\"attend to\", \"maintain\", \"nurture\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"neglect duties\", \"meaning\": \"bỏ bê công việc/nhiệm vụ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"gross neglect\", \"meaning\": \"sự xao nhãng nghiêm trọng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"ignore\", \"note_vi\": \"cố tình làm lơ/phớt lờ một ai đó hoặc thông tin nào đó\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"negligent\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"neglect\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"negligence\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neglect-cori-02979a49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neglect-aru0-02979a49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neglect-aru5-02979a49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neglect-aru6-02979a49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neglect-aru10-02979a49.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neglect-aru9-02979a49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neglect-aru3-02979a49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/objec