('cbecf11f-15bd-5178-af4c-bdd73406a9c1', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '644259f3-8155-5a53-a2f8-1cded8b06bc9', '24cdddb1-acc0-57a8-9777-a96cb1bd448a', 'grip', 'UK: /ɡrɪp/ | US: /ɡrɪp/', 'B2', 'verb', 'nắm chặt, giữ chặt', 'to hold something tightly and securely with one\'s hands to prevent it from slipping', 'He gripped the steering wheel tightly.', 'Anh ấy nắm chặt vô lăng.', '{\"en\": \"Workers must grip the safety handles tightly when operating high-altitude equipment.\", \"vi\": \"Công nhân phải nắm chặt các tay cầm an toàn khi vận hành thiết bị trên cao.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-ljspeech-e752c3b3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-cori-e752c3b3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/grip-0adda561.webp', '[\"grasp\", \"hold\", \"clutch\", \"clasp\"]', '[\"release\", \"drop\", \"loosen\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"grip firmly\", \"meaning\": \"nắm chặt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lose one\'s grip\", \"meaning\": \"mất thăng bằng / mất kiểm soát\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"grip\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-cori-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-aru0-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-aru5-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-aru6-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-aru10-e752c3b3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-aru9-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-aru3-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-aru7-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-aru8-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-aru2-e752c3b3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-ljspeech-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-lt408-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-lt138-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-lt624-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-lt396-e752c3b3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-lt498-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-lt132-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-lt288-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-lt42-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-lt90-e752c3b3.mp3\"]}}', 'Động từ \'grip\' mang nghĩa nắm chắc/kẹp chặt (tay cầm, công cụ). Trong bài thi TOEIC còn có thể mang nghĩa thu hút sự chú ý mạnh mẽ.', 'safety', 1, 4),
('2746eef1-0911-54ff-b36c-8450fc534c54', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '644259f3-8155-5a53-a2f8-1cded8b06bc9', '24cdddb1-acc0-57a8-9777-a96cb1bd448a', 'racquetball', '/ˈrækɪtbɔːl/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Môn thể thao dùng vợt đánh bóng vào tường trong phòng kín.', 'a game played on an indoor court where players use small rackets to hit a rubber ball.', 'We usually play racquetball on Tuesdays after work to stay active.', 'Chúng tôi thường chơi bóng quần vào các ngày thứ Ba sau giờ làm để giữ dáng.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel fitness center features a modern court where guests can play racquetball after work.\", \"vi\": \"Trung tâm thể hình của khách sạn có một sân hiện đại nơi khách có thể chơi bóng quần sau giờ làm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/racquetball-ljspeech-ac10b5cc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/racquetball-cori-ac10b5cc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/racquetball-4500b644.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"racquetball court\", \"meaning\": \"sân chơi bóng quần\"}, {\"phrase\": \"play racquetball\", \"meaning\": \"chơi bóng quần\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"badminton\", \"note_vi\": \"badminton là môn cầu lông\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/racquetball-cori-ac10b5cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/racquetball-aru0-ac10b5cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/racquetball-aru5-ac10b5cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/racquetball-aru6-ac10b5cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/racquetball-aru10-ac10b5cc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/racquetball-aru9-ac10b5cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/racquetball-aru3-ac10b5cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/racquetball-aru7-ac10b5cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/racquetball-aru8-ac10b5cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/