('37fa27d0-48e4-5255-8e23-fa118e1ebd28', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '644259f3-8155-5a53-a2f8-1cded8b06bc9', '24cdddb1-acc0-57a8-9777-a96cb1bd448a', 'patient', '/ˈpeɪʃnt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Người đang được điều trị y tế.', 'An individual undergoing evaluation, treatment, or care by healthcare professionals.', 'The doctor spent a lot of time explaining the diagnosis to her patient.', 'Bác sĩ đã dành nhiều thời gian để giải thích chẩn đoán cho bệnh nhân của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The nurse carefully checked the patient before the doctor arrived for the routine examination.\", \"vi\": \"Y tá đã cẩn thận kiểm tra bệnh nhân trước khi bác sĩ đến khám định kỳ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-ljspeech-b1b0b8de.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-cori-b1b0b8de.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/patient-b930295d.webp', '[\"sufferer\", \"sick person\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"patient care\", \"meaning\": \"sự chăm sóc bệnh nhân\"}, {\"phrase\": \"admit a patient\", \"meaning\": \"nhận bệnh nhân vào viện\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"patience\", \"note_vi\": \"Patience là danh từ nghĩa là sự kiên nhẫn, patient (danh từ) là bệnh nhân.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"patience\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"patient\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"patiently\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-cori-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-aru0-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-aru5-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-aru6-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-aru10-b1b0b8de.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-aru9-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-aru3-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-aru7-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-aru8-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-aru2-b1b0b8de.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-ljspeech-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-lt408-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-lt138-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-lt624-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-lt396-b1b0b8de.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-lt498-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-lt132-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-lt288-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-lt42-b1b0b8de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patient-lt90-b1b0b8de.mp3\"]}}', 'Cần phân biệt danh từ patient (bệnh nhân) và tính từ patient (kiên nhẫn).', 'health', 1, 15),
('a62674e2-52fd-542d-adc2-7d41184fa98b', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '644259f3-8155-5a53-a2f8-1cded8b06bc9', '24cdddb1-acc0-57a8-9777-a96cb1bd448a', 'dogs are barking', '/dɒɡz ɑː bɑːkɪŋ/', 'C2', 'idiom', '(Thành ngữ) Chân bị đau nhức, mỏi sau khi đi lại hoặc đứng lâu.', 'a spoken phrase used when a person feels that their feet are very sore or tired.', 'After walking all day at the amusement park, my dogs were barking.', 'Sau khi đi bộ cả ngày ở công viên giải trí, chân tôi đau nhức.', '{\"en\": \"After standing at the trade show booth all day, my dogs are barking.\", \"vi\": \"Sau khi đứng ở gian hàng triển lãm thương mại cả ngày, chân tôi đau rã rời.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dogs-are-barking-ljspeech-943b690e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dogs-are-barking-cori-943b690e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dogs-are-barking-29ca1f1a.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dogs-are-barking-cori-943b690e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dogs-are-barking-aru0-943b690e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dogs-are-barking-aru5-943b690e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dogs-are-barking-aru6-943b690e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dogs-are-barking-aru10-943b690e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dogs-are-barking-aru9-943b690e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dogs-are-barking-aru3-943b690e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dogs-are-barking-aru7-943b690e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dogs-are-barking-aru8-943b690e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dogs-are-barking-aru2-943b690e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dogs-are-barking-ljspeech-943b690e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronun