('a7727926-ecb2-5594-b893-21713cb5b4fb', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '644259f3-8155-5a53-a2f8-1cded8b06bc9', '24cdddb1-acc0-57a8-9777-a96cb1bd448a', 'gerrymander', '/ˈdʒerimændə(r)/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Thao túng ranh giới khu vực bầu cử để giành lợi thế chính trị.', 'to change the borders of an area to give one political party an unfair advantage.', 'The ruling council was criticized for attempting to gerrymander electoral boundaries before the election.', 'Hội đồng cầm quyền đã bị chỉ trích vì cố tình phân chia lại ranh giới bầu cử gian lận trước kỳ bầu cử.', '{\"en\": \"The legal department is investigating whether the local council attempted to gerrymander the new commercial districts.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận pháp lý đang điều tra xem liệu hội đồng địa phương có cố gắng phân chia gian lận các khu thương mại mới hay không.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gerrymander-ljspeech-d7b35813.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gerrymander-cori-d7b35813.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gerrymander-14f7e87b.webp', '[\"manipulate\", \"falsify\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"gerrymander districts\", \"meaning\": \"phân chia khu vực gian lận\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"gerrymandering\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gerrymander-cori-d7b35813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gerrymander-aru0-d7b35813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gerrymander-aru5-d7b35813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gerrymander-aru6-d7b35813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gerrymander-aru10-d7b35813.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gerrymander-aru9-d7b35813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gerrymander-aru3-d7b35813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gerrymander-aru7-d7b35813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gerrymander-aru8-d7b35813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gerrymander-aru2-d7b35813.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gerrymander-ljspeech-d7b35813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gerrymander-lt408-d7b35813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gerrymander-lt138-d7b35813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gerrymander-lt624-d7b35813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gerrymander-lt396-d7b35813.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gerrymander-lt498-d7b35813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gerrymander-lt132-d7b35813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gerrymander-lt288-d7b35813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gerrymander-lt42-d7b35813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gerrymander-lt90-d7b35813.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này thường dùng trong chính trị và luật pháp.', 'law', 1, 24),
('f03f6403-a15a-513c-91ef-9a67155fe9ce', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '644259f3-8155-5a53-a2f8-1cded8b06bc9', '24cdddb1-acc0-57a8-9777-a96cb1bd448a', 'numerous', '/ˈnjuːmərəs/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Rất nhiều, số lượng lớn.', 'existing in a very large quantity or consisting of many people or things.', 'There were numerous reasons why the plan failed.', 'Có rất nhiều lý do khiến kế hoạch thất bại.', '{\"en\": \"The company received numerous applications for the new project manager position.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã nhận được rất nhiều đơn ứng tuyển cho vị trí quản lý dự án mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-ljspeech-4bca8a0e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-cori-4bca8a0e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/numerous-88e280c7.webp', '[\"many\", \"abundant\", \"countless\"]', '[\"few\", \"scarce\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"numerous occasions\", \"meaning\": \"rất nhiều lần\"}, {\"phrase\": \"numerous studies\", \"meaning\": \"nhiều nghiên cứu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"numerical\", \"note_vi\": \"numerical thuộc về con số, numerous là rất nhiều\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"number\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"numerously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-cori-4bca8a0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-aru0-4bca8a0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-aru5-4bca8a0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-aru6-4bca8a0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-aru10-4bca8a0e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-aru9-4bca8a0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-aru3-4bca8a0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-aru7-4bca8a0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-aru8-4bca8a0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-aru2-4bca8a0e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-ljspeech-4bca8a0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-lt408-4bca8a0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-lt138-4bca8a0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-lt624-4bca8a0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-lt396-4bca8a0e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-lt498-4bca8a0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-lt132-4bca8a0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-lt288-4bca8a0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-lt42-4bca8a0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numerous-lt90-4bca8a0e.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với numerical (liên quan đến con số).', 'hr', 1, 25),
('f554329a-0531-5c54-a1ff-4db0bb5177b1', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '644259f3-8155-5a53-a2f8-1cded8b06bc9', '24cdddb1-acc0-57a8-9777-a96cb1bd448a', 'companion', '/kəmˈpænjən/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Người hoặc vật đi cùng, làm bạn với ai đó.', 'a person or animal with whom you spend a lot of time or travel.', 'The experienced tour guide served as a helpful companion throughout our mountain trekking journey.', 'Người hướng dẫn viên du lịch giàu kinh nghiệm đã đóng vai trò là một người bạn đồng hành hữu ích trong suốt hành trình leo núi của chúng tôi.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency offers special discounts for customers traveling with a companion.\", \"vi\": \"Đại lý du lịch cung cấp các ưu đãi đặc biệt cho khách hàng đi cùng bạn đồng hành.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/companion-ljspeech-ddca0a8d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/companion-cori-ddca0a8d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/companion-892ad36f.webp', '[\"partner\", \"associate\", \"comrade\"]', '[\"stranger\", \"enemy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"travel companion\", \"meaning\": \"bạn đồng hành chuyến đi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"constant companion\", \"meaning\": \"người bạn đồng hành liên tục\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"company\", \"note_vi\": \"công ty hoặc sự đồng hành, còn companion là người đồng hành\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"companionship\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"companionable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/companion-cori-ddca0a8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/companion-aru0-ddca0a8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/companion-aru5-ddca0a8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/companion-aru6-ddca0a8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/companion-aru10-ddca0a8d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/companion-aru9-ddca0a8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/companion-aru3-ddca0a8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/companion-aru7-ddca0a8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/companion-aru8-ddca0a8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/companion-aru2-ddca0a8d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/companion-ljspeech-ddca0a8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/companion-lt408-ddca0a8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/companion-lt138-ddca0a8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/companion-lt624-ddca0a8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/companion-lt396-ddca0a8d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/companion-lt498-ddca0a8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/companion-lt132-ddca0a8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/companion-lt288-ddca0a8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/companion-lt42-ddca0a8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/companion-lt90-ddca0a8d.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này chỉ người hoặc vật đồng hành, chia sẻ thời gian cùng bạn.', 'travel', 1, 26),
('5579cbfa-0a1c-54c9-a3a1-f878fa944581', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '644259f3-8155-5a53-a2f8-1cded8b06bc9', '24cdddb1-acc0-57a8-9777-a96cb1bd448a', 'realistic', 'UK: /ˌrɪəˈlɪstɪk/ | US: /ˌriːəˈlɪstɪk/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'thực tế', 'showing a sensible and practical awareness of what can actually be achieved in practice.', 'Managers should set realistic expectations for their team.', 'Các nhà quản lý nên đặt ra những kỳ vọng thực tế cho đội của họ.', '{\"en\": \"It is important to set realistic deadlines for project completion.\", \"vi\": \"Điều quan trọng là phải thiết lập thời hạn thực tế cho việc hoàn thành dự án.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/realistic-ljspeech-4dad6829.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/realistic-cori-4dad6829.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/realistic-1c16b340.webp', '[\"practical\", \"feasible\", \"achievable\"]', '[\"unrealistic\", \"impractical\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"realistic goal\", \"meaning\": \"mục tiêu thực tế/khả thi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"realistic budget\", \"meaning\": \"ngân sách thực tế/hợp lý\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"real-world\", \"note_vi\": \"\'realistic\' là thực tế, khả thi; \'real-world\' là thuộc về thế giới đời thực.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"realistically\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"realism\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/realistic-cori-4dad6829.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/realistic-aru0-4dad6829.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/realistic-aru5-4dad6829.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/realistic-aru6-4dad6829.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/realistic-aru10-4dad6829.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/realistic-aru9-4dad6829.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/realistic-aru3-4dad6829.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/re