('dc2a6114-0d61-5322-abe3-deadfe5c2121', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '6627d3ba-97b0-5da7-ade0-60f5be98b9cf', '48920c91-021c-55d2-8e70-6d388a5104da', 'favorite food', '/ˈfeɪvərɪt fuːd/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Món ăn mà một người đặc biệt ưa thích.', 'the specific meal or dish that a person likes more than any other.', 'Grilled salmon has always been her favorite food when dining at luxury restaurants.', 'Cá hồi nướng luôn là món ăn yêu thích của cô ấy khi đi ăn tại các nhà hàng sang trọng.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel kitchen staff prepared the CEO\'s favorite food for the anniversary banquet.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ bếp của khách sạn đã chuẩn bị món ăn yêu thích của giám đốc cho tiệc kỷ niệm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorite-food-ljspeech-8566d820.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorite-food-cori-8566d820.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/favorite-food-d0393a82.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"personal favorite food\", \"meaning\": \"món ăn yêu thích cá nhân\"}, {\"phrase\": \"order favorite food\", \"meaning\": \"gọi món ăn yêu thích\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorite-food-cori-8566d820.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorite-food-aru0-8566d820.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorite-food-aru5-8566d820.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorite-food-aru6-8566d820.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorite-food-aru10-8566d820.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorite-food-aru9-8566d820.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorite-food-aru3-8566d820.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorite-food-aru7-8566d820.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorite-food-aru8-8566d820.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorite-food-aru2-8566d820.