('c9f6c34f-4470-5816-8786-80676958df85', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '6627d3ba-97b0-5da7-ade0-60f5be98b9cf', '48920c91-021c-55d2-8e70-6d388a5104da', 'independent traveler', '/ˌɪndɪˈpendənt ˈtrævələ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Người tự lên kế hoạch và đi du lịch một mình hoặc theo nhóm nhỏ, không theo tour.', 'a person who visits different places without using a tour guide or organized group.', 'As an independent traveler, she prefers exploring local markets over guided tours.', 'Là một khách du lịch độc lập, cô ấy thích khám phá các chợ địa phương hơn là các chuyến du lịch có hướng dẫn.', '{\"en\": \"Our travel agency offers customized itineraries specifically designed for the adventurous independent traveler.\", \"vi\": \"Đại lý du lịch của chúng tôi cung cấp các lịch trình tùy chỉnh được thiết kế riêng cho khách du lịch độc lập thích phiêu lưu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-traveler-ljspeech-d52b3c1e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-traveler-cori-d52b3c1e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/independent-traveler-c85cb543.webp', '[\"solo traveler\", \"backpacker\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"independent travel\", \"meaning\": \"du lịch tự túc\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-traveler-cori-d52b3c1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-traveler-aru0-d52b3c1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-traveler-aru5-d52b3c1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-traveler-aru6-d52b3c1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-traveler-aru10-d52b3c1e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-traveler-aru9-d52b3c1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-traveler-aru3-d52b3c1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-traveler-aru7-d52b3c1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-traveler-aru8-d52b3c1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-traveler-aru2-d52b3c1e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-traveler-ljspeech-d52b3c1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-traveler-lt408-d52b3c1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-traveler-lt138-d52b3c1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-traveler-lt624-d52b3c1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-traveler-lt396-d52b3c1e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-traveler-lt498-d52b3c1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-traveler-lt132-d52b3c1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-traveler-lt288-d52b3c1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-traveler-lt42-d52b3c1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/independent-traveler-lt90-d52b3c1e.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhấn mạnh vào sự tự chủ trong việc lên kế hoạch và di chuyển.', 'travel', 1, 6),
('062f67ef-7a7d-5951-a490-51a9f4007855', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '6627d3ba-97b0-5da7-ade0-60f5be98b9cf', '48920c91-021c-55d2-8e70-6d388a5104da', 'frustration', 'UK: /frʌˈstreɪʃən/ | US: /frʌˈstreɪʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự bực bội, khó chịu', 'A feeling of annoyance and dissatisfaction caused by an inability to change something.', 'His constant tardiness caused frustration.', 'Sự đi trễ liên tục của anh ấy gây ra sự bực bội.', '{\"en\": \"The manager listened attentively to the staff\'s frustration regarding the new software delay.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã lắng nghe cẩn thận sự bực bội của nhân viên liên quan đến việc phần mềm mới bị chậm trễ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frustration-ljspeech-5697cf88.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frustration-cori-5697cf88.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/frustration-00739713.webp', '[\"annoyance\", \"dissatisfaction\", \"disappointment\", \"irritation\"]', '[\"satisfaction\", \"contentment\", \"pleasure\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"express frustration\", \"meaning\": \"bày tỏ sự thất vọng/bực bội\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cause frustration\", \"meaning\": \"gây ra sự khó chịu/bực bội\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"frustrated\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"frustrate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frustration-cori-5697cf88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frustration-aru0-5697cf88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frustration-aru5-5697cf88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frustration-aru6-5697cf88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frustration-aru10-5697cf88.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frustration-aru9-5697cf88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frustration-aru3-5697cf88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frustration-aru7-5697cf88