('99f53599-7fcf-5613-b839-0c108ffd8373', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '6627d3ba-97b0-5da7-ade0-60f5be98b9cf', '48920c91-021c-55d2-8e70-6d388a5104da', 'commission', '/kəˈmɪʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Tiền công dựa trên phần trăm doanh số bán hàng hoặc dịch vụ.', 'a payment given to a salesperson for selling goods or services for a company.', 'Sales representatives often earn a basic salary plus a commission on every sale they make.', 'Đại diện bán hàng thường nhận lương cơ bản cộng với tiền hoa hồng trên mỗi giao dịch họ thực hiện.', '{\"en\": \"Real estate agents often receive a percentage of the property price as their sales commission.\", \"vi\": \"Các đại lý bất động sản thường nhận được một phần trăm giá trị tài sản làm tiền hoa hồng bán hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-ljspeech-f138cedf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-cori-f138cedf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/commission-a4810738.webp', '[\"fee\", \"percentage\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sales commission\", \"meaning\": \"hoa hồng bán hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"earn a commission\", \"meaning\": \"kiếm được tiền hoa hồng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"committee\", \"note_vi\": \"Committee là ủy ban, commission là tiền hoa hồng hoặc hội đồng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"commissioner\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-cori-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-aru0-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-aru5-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-aru6-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-aru10-f138cedf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-aru9-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-aru3-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-aru7-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-aru8-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-aru2-f138cedf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-ljspeech-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-lt408-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-lt138-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-lt624-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-lt396-f138cedf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-lt498-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-lt132-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-lt288-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-lt42-f138cedf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commission-lt90-f138cedf.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong kinh doanh, đây là khoản thu nhập thêm dựa trên hiệu suất bán hàng.', 'finance', 1, 17),
('a810f654-40e8-5cfd-9585-28df16f268e0', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '6627d3ba-97b0-5da7-ade0-60f5be98b9cf', '48920c91-021c-55d2-8e70-6d388a5104da', 'overlook', 'UK: /ˌəʊvəˈlʊk/ | US: /ˌoʊvərˈlʊk/', 'B2', 'verb', 'bỏ sót, bỏ qua', 'to fail to notice, consider, or include something either accidentally or intentionally', 'Please ensure no details are overlooked in the report.', 'Vui lòng đảm bảo không có chi tiết nào bị bỏ sót trong báo cáo.', '{\"en\": \"When reviewing the final contract draft, the legal advisor made sure not to overlook any small details.\", \"vi\": \"Khi xem xét bản thảo hợp đồng cuối cùng, cố vấn pháp lý đã đảm bảo không bỏ sót bất kỳ chi tiết nhỏ nào.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overlook-ljspeech-1b8ee344.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overlook-cori-1b8ee344.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/overlook-7920b33b.webp', '[\"miss\", \"ignore\", \"disregard\", \"neglect\"]', '[\"notice\", \"observe\", \"spot\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"overlook a mistake\", \"meaning\": \"bỏ qua một lỗi sai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"overlook the ocean\", \"meaning\": \"nhìn ra phía đại dương\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"oversee\", \"note_vi\": \"Oversee nghĩa là quản lý, giám sát công việc; trong khi overlook nghĩa là bỏ qua/bỏ sót.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overlook-cori-1b8ee344.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overlook-aru0-1b8ee344.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overlook-aru5-1b8ee344.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overlook-aru6-1b8ee344.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overlook-aru10-1b8ee344.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overlook-aru9-1b8ee344.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overlook-aru3-1b8ee344.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overlook-aru7-1b8ee344.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overlook-aru8-1b8ee344.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overlook-aru2-1b8ee344.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overlook-ljspeech-1b8ee344.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overlook-lt408-1b8ee344.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overlook-lt138-1b8ee344.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overlook-lt624-1b8ee344.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overlook-lt396-1b8ee344.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overlook-lt498-1b8ee344.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overlook-lt132-1b8ee344.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overlook-lt288-1b8ee344.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overlook-lt42-1b8ee344.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overlook-lt90-1b8ee344.mp3\"]}}', '\'Overlook\' có 2 nghĩa: 1) Bỏ sót/bỏ qua (lỗi sai, tài liệu); 2) Nhìn ra hướng nào đó (phòng khách sạn nhìn ra biển). Khác với \'oversee\' (giám sát).', 'legal', 1, 18),
('bb7dfbc1-a2f8-568d-9d60-985ca5fd9a5b', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '6627d3ba-97b0-5da7-ade0-60f5be98b9cf', '48920c91-021c-55d2-8e70-6d388a5104da', 'badminton', '/ˈbædmɪntən/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Môn thể thao dùng vợt đánh quả cầu qua lưới.', 'a sport played with a light racket and a small feathered object hit over a high net.', 'We enjoy playing badminton in the park on sunny weekends.', 'Chúng tôi thích chơi cầu lông trong công viên vào những ngày cuối tuần nắng đẹp.', '{\"en\": \"The company organized a badminton tournament to promote teamwork among all departments.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty tổ chức giải đấu cầu lông để thúc đẩy tinh thần đồng đội giữa các phòng ban.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/badminton-ljspeech-364d83e1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/badminton-cori-364d83e1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/badminton-75de1875.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"play badminton\", \"meaning\": \"chơi cầu lông\"}, {\"phrase\": \"badminton court\", \"meaning\": \"sân cầu lông\"}, {\"phrase\": \"badminton tournament\", \"meaning\": \"giải đấu cầu lông\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tennis\", \"note_vi\": \"tennis dùng bóng cao su và sân lớn hơn, không dùng cầu lông (shuttlecock)\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/badminton-cori-364d83e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/badminton-aru0-364d83e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/badminton-aru5-364d83e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/badminton-aru6-364d83e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/badminton-aru10-364d83e1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/badminton-aru9-364d83e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/badminton-aru3-364d83e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/badminton-aru7-364d83e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/badminton-aru8-364d83e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/badminton-aru2-364d83e1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/badminton-ljspeech-364d83e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/badminton-lt408-364d83e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/badminton-lt138-364d83e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/badminton-lt624-364d83e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/badminton-lt396-364d83e1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/badminton-lt498-364d83e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/badminton-lt132-364d83e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/badminton-lt288-364d83e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/badminton-lt42-364d83e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/badminton-lt90-364d83e1.mp3\"]}}', 'Shuttlecock là tên gọi chính thức của quả cầu lông trong tiếng Anh, không phải feather ball.', 'daily', 1, 19),
('5b743c78-2fa5-5057-82d1-1b498bca16f5', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '6627d3ba-97b0-5da7-ade0-60f5be98b9cf', '48920c91-021c-55d2-8e70-6d388a5104da', 'fast food', '/fɑːst fuːd/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Thức ăn được chế biến và phục vụ nhanh chóng.', 'hot meals that are served very quickly in special restaurants and can be taken away.', 'Eating too much fast food can be unhealthy in the long run.', 'Ăn quá nhiều đồ ăn nhanh có thể không tốt cho sức khỏe về lâu dài.', '{\"en\": \"The new shopping mall features a large food court with several fast food options.\", \"vi\": \"Trung tâm thương mại mới có một khu ẩm thực lớn với nhiều lựa chọn đồ ăn nhanh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fast-food-ljspeech-36dc465b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fast-food-cori-36dc465b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fast-food-925ddcaf.webp', '[\"junk food\"]', '[\"slow food\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fast food restaurant\", \"meaning\": \"nhà hàng đồ ăn nhanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fast food chain\", \"meaning\": \"chuỗi cửa hàng đồ ăn nhanh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"junk food\", \"note_vi\": \"đồ ăn vặt không tốt cho sức khỏe, rộng nghĩa hơn\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fast-food-cori-36dc465b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fast-food-aru0-36dc465b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fast-food-aru5-36dc465b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fast-food-aru6-36dc465b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fast-food-aru10-36dc465b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fast-food-aru9-36dc465b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fast-food-aru3-36dc465b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fast-food-aru7-36dc465b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fast-food-aru8-36dc465b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/