('9743486e-ac0d-59f8-a880-ac6d1d07a5ba', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '6627d3ba-97b0-5da7-ade0-60f5be98b9cf', '48920c91-021c-55d2-8e70-6d388a5104da', 'impose', '/ɪmˈpəʊz/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Áp đặt một quy tắc, thuế, hoặc yêu cầu lên người khác.', 'to force someone to accept a rule, tax, or opinion.', 'The manager had to impose strict safety rules on all construction site workers.', 'Quản lý đã phải áp đặt các quy định an toàn nghiêm ngặt đối với tất cả công nhân công trường.', '{\"en\": \"The government decided to impose a new tax on imported electronic goods next month.\", \"vi\": \"Chính phủ đã quyết định áp đặt một loại thuế mới đối với hàng điện tử nhập khẩu vào tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-ljspeech-e6f9382d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-cori-e6f9382d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/impose-bb6519a2.webp', '[\"enforce\", \"inflict\", \"levy\"]', '[\"lift\", \"remove\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"impose a tax\", \"meaning\": \"áp thuế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"impose a fine\", \"meaning\": \"áp đặt hình phạt tiền\"}, {\"phrase\": \"impose restrictions\", \"meaning\": \"áp đặt các hạn chế\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"expose\", \"note_vi\": \"expose là phơi bày/tiếp xúc, impose là áp đặt\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"imposition\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"imposing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-cori-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-aru0-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-aru5-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-aru6-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-aru10-e6f9382d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-aru9-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-aru3-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-aru7-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-aru8-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-aru2-e6f9382d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-ljspeech-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-lt408-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-lt138-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-lt624-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-lt396-e6f9382d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-lt498-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-lt132-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-lt288-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-lt42-e6f9382d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impose-lt90-e6f9382d.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với giới từ \'on\' (impose something on someone).', 'law', 1, 28),
('3948390b-9256-5e13-8cbc-e71e8fc9a72b', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '6627d3ba-97b0-5da7-ade0-60f5be98b9cf', '48920c91-021c-55d2-8e70-6d388a5104da', 'rebound', '/rɪˈbaʊnd/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Nảy trở lại sau khi va chạm vào một bề mặt.', 'to move back after hitting a hard surface or to recover from a difficult situation.', 'The basketball rebounded off the backboard and into the player\'s hands.', 'Quả bóng rổ bật ra khỏi bảng rổ và vào tay cầu thủ.', '{\"en\": \"The company stock prices began to rebound after the positive quarterly earnings report.\", \"vi\": \"Giá cổ phiếu của công ty bắt đầu phục hồi sau báo cáo thu nhập quý tích cực.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rebound-ljspeech-9ffd1077.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rebound-cori-9ffd1077.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rebound-7e8ef46c.webp', '[\"recover\", \"bounce back\"]', '[\"decline\", \"drop\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"rebound from\", \"meaning\": \"phục hồi từ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"market rebound\", \"meaning\": \"thị trường phục hồi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"rebound\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rebound-cori-9ffd1077.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rebound-aru0-9ffd1077.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rebound-aru5-9ffd1077.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rebound-aru6-9ffd1077.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rebound-aru10-9ffd1077.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rebound-aru9-9ffd1077.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rebound-aru3-9ffd1077.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rebound-aru7-9ffd1077.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rebound-aru8-9ffd1077.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rebound-aru2-9ffd1077.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronu