('d304f026-49a0-5bbe-86a7-0cb78a31efe3', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '66e260c1-1df0-563c-a791-f90c2f73f5f5', '5c5a77e8-d7ce-5e6a-b997-2a38219224ff', 'prominent', 'UK: /ˈprɒmɪnənt/ | US: /ˈprɑmɪnənt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'dễ thấy, nổi bật', 'easily seen, noticeable, or holding an important position of distinction within a field', 'The new manager has a prominent role in the company\'s expansion.', 'Quản lý mới có vai trò nổi bật trong việc mở rộng của công ty.', '{\"en\": \"The keynote speaker at the conference is a prominent expert in artificial intelligence.\", \"vi\": \"Diễn giả chính tại hội thảo là một chuyên gia nổi tiếng trong lĩnh vực trí tuệ nhân tạo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-ljspeech-91383af9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-cori-91383af9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/prominent-e2b3f04f.webp', '[\"famous\", \"distinguished\", \"noticeable\", \"conspicuous\"]', '[\"obscure\", \"unknown\", \"unremarkable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"prominent feature\", \"meaning\": \"đặc điểm nổi bật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prominent role\", \"meaning\": \"vai trò quan trọng/nổi bật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dominant\", \"note_vi\": \"Dominant nghĩa là mang tính thống trị/chi phối, còn prominent nghĩa là nổi bật/kiệt xuất.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"prominently\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"prominence\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-cori-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-aru0-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-aru5-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-aru6-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-aru10-91383af9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-aru9-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-aru3-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-aru7-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-aru8-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-aru2-91383af9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-ljspeech-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-lt408-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-lt138-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-lt624-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-lt396-91383af9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-lt498-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-lt132-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-lt288-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-lt42-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-lt90-91383af9.mp3\"]}}', 'Có thể dùng cho đặc điểm vật lý (dễ thấy) hoặc người/tổ chức (nổi tiếng, có vị thế quan trọng).', 'general business', 1, 17),
('e26028e8-f75f-5802-b2d4-9cfc8b7d06be', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '66e260c1-1df0-563c-a791-f90c2f73f5f5', '5c5a77e8-d7ce-5e6a-b997-2a38219224ff', 'get on well with', '/ɡɛt ɒn wɛl wɪð/', 'B1', 'phrasal verb', 'có mối quan hệ tốt đẹp, thân thiện với ai đó.', 'to have a friendly and pleasant relationship with someone.', 'My new colleague and I get on well with each other, making work much more pleasant.', 'Đồng nghiệp mới của tôi và tôi rất hòa hợp với nhau, khiến công việc dễ chịu hơn nhiều.', '{\"en\": \"It is important to get on well with your colleagues in the office.\", \"vi\": \"Việc hòa hợp với các đồng nghiệp trong văn phòng là rất quan trọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-on-well-with-ljspeech-7154fade.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-on-well-with-cori-7154fade.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/get-on-well-with-f3a7ea7a.webp', '[\"get along with\", \"harmonize\"]', '[\"clash with\", \"disagree with\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"get on well with coworkers\", \"meaning\": \"hòa hợp với đồng nghiệp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"get on well with the boss\", \"meaning\": \"hòa hợp với sếp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"get on with\", \"note_vi\": \"get on with có thể nghĩa là tiếp tục làm việc, get on well with nhấn mạnh sự hòa hợp\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-on-well-with-cori-7154fade.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-on-well-with-aru0-7154fade.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-on-well-with-aru5-7154fade.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-on-well-with-aru6-7154fade.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-on-well-with-aru10-7154fade.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-on-well-with-aru9-7154fade.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-on-well-with-aru3-7154fade.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pr