('2f450d03-8f5d-57cb-a762-786b434d3d22', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '66e260c1-1df0-563c-a791-f90c2f73f5f5', '5c5a77e8-d7ce-5e6a-b997-2a38219224ff', 'bonus', '/ˈbəʊnəs/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Khoản tiền thưởng thêm cho nhân viên ngoài mức lương cơ bản.', 'an extra amount of money given to an employee for good work performance.', 'Our sales representatives earned a substantial bonus after hitting their quarterly performance targets.', 'Các đại diện kinh doanh của chúng tôi đã nhận được một khoản thưởng lớn sau khi đạt mục tiêu quý.', '{\"en\": \"The manager promised an annual bonus to team members who meet their sales targets.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý hứa thưởng hàng năm cho các thành viên trong đội đạt chỉ tiêu doanh số.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-ljspeech-57da3dfb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-cori-57da3dfb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bonus-eaa9f4a3.webp', '[\"reward\", \"incentive\", \"extra payment\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"annual bonus\", \"meaning\": \"tiền thưởng hàng năm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"performance bonus\", \"meaning\": \"tiền thưởng theo hiệu suất\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-cori-57da3dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-aru0-57da3dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-aru5-57da3dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-aru6-57da3dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-aru10-57da3dfb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-aru9-57da3dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-aru3-57da3dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-aru7-57da3dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-aru8-57da3dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-aru2-57da3dfb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-ljspeech-57da3dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-lt408-57da3dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-lt138-57da3dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-lt624-57da3dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-lt396-57da3dfb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-lt498-57da3dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-lt132-57da3dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-lt288-57da3dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-lt42-57da3dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-lt90-57da3dfb.mp3\"]}}', 'Bonus là khoản tiền thưởng thêm ngoài lương cố định.', 'hr', 1, 25),
('6da6d426-16b3-51be-8d30-b32e3847a43b', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '66e260c1-1df0-563c-a791-f90c2f73f5f5', '5c5a77e8-d7ce-5e6a-b997-2a38219224ff', 'breaststroke', '/ˈbreststrəʊk/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Kiểu bơi mà người bơi úp mặt xuống nước và quạt tay, đạp chân như con ếch.', 'a style of swimming where you move both arms together in circles in front.', 'The breaststroke is often considered one of the slower swimming styles.', 'Bơi ếch thường được coi là một trong những kiểu bơi chậm hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel resort features a large pool suitable for practicing breaststroke during morning exercise.\", \"vi\": \"Khu nghỉ dưỡng khách sạn có hồ bơi lớn phù hợp để tập bơi ếch trong giờ tập thể dục buổi sáng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breaststroke-ljspeech-5c7592d6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breaststroke-cori-5c7592d6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/breaststroke-fa9a2971.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"swim breaststroke\", \"meaning\": \"bơi kiểu bơi ếch\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"backstroke\", \"note_vi\": \"bơi ngửa, khác với bơi ếch (breaststroke)\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breaststroke-cori-5c7592d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breaststroke-aru0-5c7592d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breaststroke-aru5-5c7592d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breaststroke-aru6-5c7592d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breaststroke-aru10-5c7592d6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breaststroke-aru9-5c7592d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breaststroke-aru3-5c7592d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breaststroke-aru7-5c7592d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breaststroke-aru8-5c7592d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breaststroke-aru2-5c7592d6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breaststroke-ljspeech-5c7592d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breaststroke-lt408-5c7592d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breaststroke-lt138-5c7592d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breaststroke-lt624-5c7592d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breaststroke-lt396-5c7592d6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breaststroke-lt498-5c7592d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breaststroke-lt132-5c7592d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breaststroke-lt288-5c7592d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breaststroke-lt42-5c7592d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breaststroke-lt90-5c7592d6.mp3\"]}}', 'Breaststroke ghép từ breast (ngực) và stroke (sải tay/kiểu bơi).', 'daily', 1, 26),
('ac6e7edd-3b17-50a2-a0a8-b1567eeff073', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '66e260c1-1df0-563c-a791-f90c2f73f5f5', '5c5a77e8-d7ce-5e6a-b997-2a38219224ff', 'go green', '/ɡəʊ ɡriːn/', 'B1', 'idiom', 'Thực hành lối sống thân thiện với môi trường để bảo vệ hành tinh.', 'to change one\'s lifestyle or business practices to protect the natural environment.', 'Many companies are trying to go green by reducing their carbon footprint and using renewable energy.', 'Nhiều công ty đang cố gắng sống xanh bằng cách giảm lượng khí thải carbon và sử dụng năng lượng tái tạo.', '{\"en\": \"Many corporate offices decided to go green by reducing paper usage and recycling waste.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiều văn phòng doanh nghiệp quyết định sống xanh bằng cách giảm sử dụng giấy và tái chế rác thải.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-green-ljspeech-5da929e0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-green-cori-5da929e0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/go-green-9a0eac15.webp', '[\"recycle\", \"eco-friendly\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"go green initiative\", \"meaning\": \"sáng kiến sống xanh\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-green-cori-5da929e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-green-aru0-5da929e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-green-aru5-5da929e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-green-aru6-5da929e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-green-aru10-5da929e0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-green-aru9-5da929e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-green-aru3-5da929e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-green-aru7-5da929e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-green-aru8-5da929e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-green-aru2-5da929e0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-green-ljspeech-5da929e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-green-lt408-5da929e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-green-lt138-5da929e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-green-lt624-5da929e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-green-lt396-5da929e0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-green-lt498-5da929e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-green-lt132-5da929e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-green-lt288-5da929e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-green-lt42-5da929e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-green-lt90-5da929e0.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm từ chỉ hành động bảo vệ môi trường, tiết kiệm năng lượng.', 'nature', 1, 27),
('42f914d5-2495-5151-a304-6e90138f1a32', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '66e260c1-1df0-563c-a791-f90c2f73f5f5', '5c5a77e8-d7ce-5e6a-b997-2a38219224ff', 'general practitioner', '/ˈdʒɛnərəl prækˈtɪʃənə/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Bác sĩ khám chữa bệnh tổng quát.', 'a doctor who treats patients with common illnesses and does not specialize in one medical area.', 'You should see a general practitioner for your persistent cough.', 'Bạn nên đi khám bác sĩ đa khoa vì cơn ho dai dẳng của mình.', '{\"en\": \"You should visit a general practitioner before requesting an appointment with an orthopedic surgeon.\", \"vi\": \"Bạn nên đến khám bác sĩ đa khoa trước khi yêu cầu cuộc hẹn với bác sĩ phẫu thuật chỉnh hình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-practitioner-ljspeech-e6cedbf8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-practitioner-cori-e6cedbf8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/general-practitioner-fb4acfc5.webp', '[\"family doctor\", \"GP\"]', '[\"specialist\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"consult a general practitioner\", \"meaning\": \"tham vấn bác sĩ đa khoa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"local general practitioner\", \"meaning\": \"bác sĩ đa khoa tại địa phương\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"specialist\", \"note_vi\": \"specialist là bác sĩ chuyên khoa sâu một lĩnh vực\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-practitioner-cori-e6cedbf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-practitioner-aru0-e6cedbf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-practitioner-aru5-e6cedbf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-practitioner-aru6-e6cedbf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-practitioner-aru10-e6cedbf8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-practitioner-aru9-e6cedbf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-practitioner-aru3-e6cedbf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-practitioner-aru7-e6cedbf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-practitioner-aru8-e6cedbf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-practitioner-aru2-e6cedbf8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-practitioner-ljspeech-e6cedbf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-practitioner-lt408-e6cedbf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-practitioner-lt138-e6cedbf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-practitioner-lt624-e6cedbf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-practitioner-lt396-e6cedbf8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-practitioner-lt498-e6cedbf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-practitioner-lt132-e6cedbf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-practitioner-lt288-e6cedbf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-practitioner-lt42-e6cedbf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/general-practitioner-lt90-e6cedbf8.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường được viết tắt là GP trong tiếng Anh-Anh.', 'health', 1, 28),
('374f0906-a538-5c8d-bb94-01c917c7d506', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '66e260c1-1df0-563c-a791-f90c2f73f5f5', '5c5a77e8-d7ce-5e6a-b997-2a38219224ff', 'fat farm', '/fæt fɑːm/', 'C2', 'phrase', 'Trung tâm sức khỏe chuyên về giảm cân và tập luyện.', 'a place where people go to lose weight by exercising and eating healthy food.', 'My aunt decided to go to a fat farm to improve her health and lose some weight.', 'Dì tôi quyết định đến một trung tâm giảm cân để cải thiện sức khỏe và giảm bớt vài cân.', '{\"en\": \"The resort was rebranded as a luxury fat farm to attract health-conscious corporate clients.\", \"vi\": \"Khu nghỉ dưỡng đã được đổi thương hiệu thành một trung tâm giảm cân sang trọng để thu hút các khách hàng doanh nghiệp quan tâm đến sức khỏe.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-farm-ljspeech-05a89a33.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-farm-cori-05a89a33.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fat-farm-9a6f631f.webp', '[\"health spa\", \"weight-loss camp\", \"wellness retreat\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"spend a week at a fat farm\", \"meaning\": \"dành một tuần tại trung tâm giảm cân\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"farm\", \"note_vi\": \"trang trại nông nghiệp thông thường\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-farm-cori-05a89a33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-farm-aru0-05a89a33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-farm-aru5-05a89a33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-farm-aru6-05a89a33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-farm-aru10-05a89a33.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-farm-aru9-05a89a33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-farm-aru3-05a89a33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-farm-aru7-05a89a33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-farm-aru8-05a89a33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-farm-aru2-05a89a33.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-farm-ljspeech-05a89a33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-farm-lt408-05a89a33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-farm-lt138-05a89a33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-farm-lt624-05a89a33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-farm-lt396-05a89a33.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-farm-lt498-05a89a33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-farm-lt132-05a89a33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-farm-lt288-05a89a33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-farm-lt42-05a89a33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-farm-lt90-05a89a33.mp3\"]}}', 'Đây là từ lóng/khẩu ngữ, hiện nay người ta thường dùng cụm từ lịch sự hơn như health spa hay wellness retreat.', 'health', 1, 29)
INSERT INTO system_vocabulary_words (id, set_id, topic_id, part_id, word, ipa, cefr, part_of_speech, meaning_vi, definition_en, example_en, example_vi, example_toeic, audio_us, audio_uk, image_url, synonyms, antonyms, phrases, confusables, word_family, audio_voices, note_vi, toeic_topic, difficulty_level, order_index) VALUES
('ffdaf5cb-90f9-56c5-9531-422b3328f89e', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '673f9700-83a1-5604-8387-7ec6441e693d', '31d189f9-9691-5e4e-90e9-a2dadc184cc8', 'healthy relationship', '/ˈhelθi rɪˈleɪʃənʃɪp/', 'B1', 'phrase', 'Mối quan hệ dựa trên sự tôn trọng, tin tưởng và giao tiếp tốt.', 'a connection between people that is based on mutual respect, trust, and support.', 'Mutual respect and emotional support are essential components of maintaining a healthy relationship.', 'Sự tôn trọng lẫn nhau và hỗ trợ về mặt cảm xúc là những yếu tố thiết yếu để duy trì một mối quan hệ lành mạnh.', '{\"en\": \"Maintaining a healthy relationship with business partners requires honest communication and mutual respect.\", \"vi\": \"Duy trì mối quan hệ lành mạnh với các đối tác kinh doanh đòi hỏi sự giao tiếp trung thực và tôn trọng lẫn nhau.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/healthy-relationship-ljspeech-368dd055.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/healthy-relationship-cori-368dd055.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/healthy-relationship-89d73093.webp', '[\"good relationship\", \"positive connection\"]', '[\"toxic relationship\", \"unhealthy relationship\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"build a healthy relationship\", \"meaning\": \"xây dựng mối quan hệ lành mạnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"maintain a healthy relationship\", \"meaning\": \"duy trì mối quan hệ lành mạnh\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/healthy-relationship-cori-368dd055.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/healthy-relationship-aru0-368dd055.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/healthy-relationship-aru5-368dd055.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/healthy-relationship-aru6-368dd055.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/healthy-relationship-aru10-368dd055.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/healthy-relationship-aru9-368dd055.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/healthy-relationship-aru3-368dd055.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/healthy-relationship-aru7-368dd055.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/healthy-relationship-aru8-368dd055.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/healthy-relationship-aru2-368dd055.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/healthy-relationship-ljspeech-368dd055.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/healthy-relationship-lt408-368dd055.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/healthy-relationship-lt138-368dd055.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/healthy-relationship-lt624-368dd055.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/healthy-relationship-lt396-368dd055.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/healthy-relationship-lt498-368dd055.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/healthy-relationship-lt132-368dd055.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/healthy-relationship-lt288-368dd055.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/healthy-relationship-lt42-368dd055.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/healthy-relationship-lt90-368dd055.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để chỉ cả quan hệ cá nhân lẫn quan hệ công việc, đối tác.', 'hr', 1, 0),
('c8efe099-1ce4-540a-bb11-d8d48fecd0d7', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '673f9700-83a1-5604-8387-7ec6441e693d', '31d189f9-9691-5e4e-90e9-a2dadc184cc8', 'prevention', 'UK: /prɪˈvenʃən/ | US: /prɪˈvenʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự ngăn ngừa, phòng ngừa', 'the act of stopping something undesirable from happening or taking place in advance', 'Fire prevention is crucial for building safety.', 'Phòng ngừa cháy là rất quan trọng đối với an toàn tòa nhà.', '{\"en\": \"The safety officer introduced new guidelines for fire prevention in the warehouse.\", \"vi\": \"Cán bộ an toàn đã đưa ra các hướng dẫn mới về phòng chống cháy nổ trong nhà kho.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-ljspeech-94509ddf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-cori-94509ddf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/prevention-bae844f6.webp', '[\"avoidance\", \"deterrence\", \"precaution\", \"protection\"]', '[\"causation\", \"inducement\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"accident prevention\", \"meaning\": \"sự phòng tránh tai nạn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fire prevention\", \"meaning\": \"sự phòng cháy\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"prevent\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"preventive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-cori-94509ddf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-aru0-94509ddf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-aru5-94509ddf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-aru6-94509ddf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-aru10-94509ddf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-aru9-94509ddf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-aru3-94509ddf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-aru7-94509ddf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-aru8-94509ddf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-aru2-94509ddf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-ljspeech-94509ddf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-lt408-94509ddf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-lt138-94509ddf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-lt624-94509ddf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-lt396-94509ddf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-lt498-94509ddf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-lt132-94509ddf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-lt288-94509ddf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-lt42-94509ddf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevention-lt90-94509ddf.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm trong các cụm từ quy định an toàn lao động: \'accident prevention\', \'fire prevention\'.', 'personnel', 1, 1),
('937c351f-2bc8-5875-b525-93d8092bae03', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '673f9700-83a1-5604-8387-7ec6441e693d', '31d189f9-9691-5e4e-90e9-a2dadc184cc8', 'prospective', 'UK: /prəˈspɛktɪv/ | US: /prəˈspɛktɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'tiềm năng, có triển vọng', 'expected or likely to happen or become something specific in the near future.', 'We are meeting with prospective clients next week.', 'Chúng tôi sẽ gặp gỡ khách hàng tiềm năng vào tuần tới.', '{\"en\": \"The HR department will interview five prospective candidates for the managerial position.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận nhân sự sẽ phỏng vấn năm ứng viên tiềm năng cho vị trí quản lý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prospective-ljspeech-9dfc52d3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prospective-cori-9dfc52d3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/prospective-30ccc2f5.webp', '[\"potential\", \"future\", \"possible\", \"forthcoming\"]', '[\"current\", \"former\", \"past\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"prospective client\", \"meaning\": \"khách hàng tiềm năng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prospective buyer\", \"meaning\": \"người mua tiềm năng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prospective employee\", \"meaning\": \"nhân viên tiềm năng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"perspective\", \"note_vi\": \"perspective là góc nhìn/quan điểm, còn prospective là tiềm năng/tương lai.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"prospect\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prospective-cori-9dfc52d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prospective-aru0-9dfc52d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prospective-aru5-9dfc52d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prospective-aru6-9dfc52d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prospective-aru10-9dfc52d3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prospective-aru9-9dfc52d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prospective-aru3-9dfc52d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prospective-aru7-9dfc52d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prospective-aru8-9dfc52d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prospective-aru2-9dfc52d3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prospective-ljspeech-9dfc52d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prospective-lt408-9dfc52d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prospective-lt138-9dfc52d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prospective-lt624-9dfc52d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prospective-lt396-9dfc52d3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prospective-lt498-9dfc52d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prospective-lt132-9dfc52d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prospective-lt288-9dfc52d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prospective-lt42-9dfc52d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prospective-lt90-9dfc52d3.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đứng trước danh từ để chỉ người/hợp đồng tương lai (ví dụ: prospective buyers/employees).', 'personnel', 1, 2),
('37f003c3-b48f-5a11-bc4b-184d86c62265', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '673f9700-83a1-5604-8387-7ec6441e693d', '31d189f9-9691-5e4e-90e9-a2dadc184cc8', 'monarchy', '/ˈmɒnəki/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hệ thống chính phủ do một vị vua hoặc nữ hoàng đứng đầu.', 'a system of government that has a king or queen as its leader.', 'The country transitioned from a monarchy to a republic.', 'Đất nước đã chuyển đổi từ chế độ quân chủ sang chế độ cộng hòa.', '{\"en\": \"The country transitioned from a traditional monarchy to a modern democratic republic last year.\", \"vi\": \"Quốc gia này đã chuyển từ chế độ quân chủ truyền thống sang nước cộng hòa dân chủ hiện đại vào năm ngoái.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-ljspeech-27a9140e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-cori-27a9140e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/monarchy-2044f773.webp', '[\"kingdom\", \"sovereignty\"]', '[\"republic\", \"democracy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"absolute monarchy\", \"meaning\": \"quân chủ chuyên chế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"constitutional monarchy\", \"meaning\": \"quân chủ lập hiến\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"monarch\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-cori-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-aru0-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-aru5-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-aru6-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-aru10-27a9140e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-aru9-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-aru3-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-aru7-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-aru8-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-aru2-27a9140e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-ljspeech-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-lt408-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-lt138-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-lt624-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-lt396-27a9140e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-lt498-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-lt132-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-lt288-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-lt42-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-lt90-27a9140e.mp3\"]}}', 'Gốc từ \'mon-\' nghĩa là một, \'-archy\' là cai trị (một người cai trị).', 'academic', 1, 3),
('33077a21-b82c-54e7-bacf-2a6ade27e725', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '673f9700-83a1-5604-8387-7ec6441e693d', '31d189f9-9691-5e4e-90e9-a2dadc184cc8', 'explicit', 'UK: /ɪkˈsplɪsɪt/ | US: /ɪkˈsplɪsɪt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'rõ ràng, dứt khoát', 'expressed in a clear and direct manner, leaving no doubt about the meaning.', 'The instructions were explicit about the new policy.', 'Các hướng dẫn rất rõ ràng về chính sách mới.', '{\"en\": \"The supervisor gave explicit instructions on how to process the refund.\", \"vi\": \"Người giám sát đã đưa ra các hướng dẫn rõ ràng về cách xử lý khoản hoàn tiền.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-ljspeech-a45c2264.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-cori-a45c2264.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/explicit-6dcfdff6.webp', '[\"clear\", \"direct\", \"unambiguous\", \"precise\"]', '[\"implicit\", \"vague\", \"ambiguous\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"explicit instructions\", \"meaning\": \"hướng dẫn rõ ràng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"explicit permission\", \"meaning\": \"sự cho phép rõ ràng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"implicit\", \"note_vi\": \"Explicit là nói trực tiếp rõ ràng, còn implicit là ngầm hiểu/không thể hiện ra ngoài bằng lời.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"explicitly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-cori-a45c2264.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-aru0-a45c2264.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-aru5-a45c2264.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-aru6-a45c2264.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-aru10-a45c2264.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-aru9-a45c2264.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-aru3-a45c2264.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-aru7-a45c2264.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-aru8-a45c2264.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-aru2-a45c2264.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-ljspeech-a45c2264.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-lt408-a45c2264.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-lt138-a45c2264.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-lt624-a45c2264.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-lt396-a45c2264.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-lt498-a45c2264.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-lt132-a45c2264.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-lt288-a45c2264.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-lt42-a45c2264.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-lt90-a45c2264.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với \'instructions\' hoặc \'permission\' (explicit instructions = hướng dẫn rõ ràng).', 'office', 1, 4),
('8642a841-fcb3-5dbb-be72-e96af389e035', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '673f9700-83a1-5604-8387-7ec6441e693d', '31d189f9-9691-5e4e-90e9-a2dadc184cc8', 'respect', '/rɪˈspekt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Cảm giác ngưỡng mộ hoặc đánh giá cao ai đó/cái gì đó.', 'a feeling of deep admiration for someone because of their qualities or achievements.', 'Good managers treat all their team members with professional respect and fairness.', 'Các nhà quản lý tốt đối xử với tất cả thành viên trong nhóm bằng sự tôn trọng chuyên nghiệp và sự công bằng.', '{\"en\": \"The manager earned the respect of his team by always listening to their professional concerns.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã nhận được sự tôn trọng của nhóm bằng cách luôn lắng nghe những lo ngại chuyên môn của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-ljspeech-14012cd1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-cori-14012cd1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/respect-7165bb72.webp', '[\"admiration\", \"esteem\", \"regard\"]', '[\"disrespect\", \"contempt\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"show respect\", \"meaning\": \"thể hiện sự tôn trọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mutual respect\", \"meaning\": \"sự tôn trọng lẫn nhau\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"aspect\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa là khía cạnh, mặt của vấn đề\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"respect\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"respectful\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"respectable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-cori-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-aru0-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-aru5-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-aru6-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-aru10-14012cd1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-aru9-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-aru3-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-aru7-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-aru8-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-aru2-14012cd1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-ljspeech-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-lt408-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-lt138-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-lt624-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-lt396-14012cd1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-lt498-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-lt132-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-lt288-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-lt42-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-lt90-14012cd1.mp3\"]}}', '\"Respectful\" là lễ phép, còn \"respective\" là tương ứng.', 'office', 1, 5),
('a1a05f0d-52e4-5c30-b244-f3fadd4d62fb', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '673f9700-83a1-5604-8387-7ec6441e693d', '31d189f9-9691-5e4e-90e9-a2dadc184cc8', 'fund', '/fʌnd/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một khoản tiền lớn dành cho mục đích cụ thể.', 'an amount of money that is collected and kept for a particular purpose.', 'The charity is trying to raise funds for a new children\'s hospital.', 'Tổ chức từ thiện đang cố gắng gây quỹ cho một bệnh viện nhi mới.', '{\"en\": \"The company established a pension fund to support employees after they retire.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã thành lập một quỹ hưu trí để hỗ trợ nhân viên sau khi họ nghỉ hưu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fund-ljspeech-e2d13ab7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fund-cori-e2d13ab7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fund-e8b13772.webp', '[\"capital\", \"reserve\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pension fund\", \"meaning\": \"quỹ hưu trí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"raise funds\", \"meaning\": \"gây quỹ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"funding\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"fund\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fund-cori-e2d13ab7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fund-aru0-e2d13ab7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fund-aru5-e2d13ab7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fund-aru6-e2d13ab7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fund-aru10-e2d13ab7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fund-aru9-e2d13ab7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fund-aru3-e2d13ab7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fund-aru7-e2d13ab7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fund-aru8-e2d13ab7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fund-aru2-e2d13ab7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fund-ljspeech-e2d13ab7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1