('91aff24e-353a-5b65-b0f5-20e59fd66184', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '673f9700-83a1-5604-8387-7ec6441e693d', '31d189f9-9691-5e4e-90e9-a2dadc184cc8', 'get obese', '/ɡɛt əʊˈbiːs/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Trở nên quá cân, béo phì.', 'to become very fat in a way that is dangerous to one\'s health.', 'Eating too much fast food can cause people to get obese over time.', 'Ăn quá nhiều đồ ăn nhanh có thể khiến mọi người trở nên béo phì theo thời gian.', '{\"en\": \"Medical experts warn that office employees who sit continuously May get obese over time.\", \"vi\": \"Các chuyên gia y tế cảnh báo nhân viên văn phòng ngồi liên tục có thể trở nên béo phì theo thời gian.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-obese-ljspeech-fd0804e8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-obese-cori-fd0804e8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/get-obese-01c1b1fc.webp', '[\"become overweight\", \"put on weight\"]', '[\"lose weight\", \"slim down\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"get obese easily\", \"meaning\": \"dễ bị béo phì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"risk of getting obese\", \"meaning\": \"nguy cơ trở nên béo phì\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-obese-cori-fd0804e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-obese-aru0-fd0804e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-obese-aru5-fd0804e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-obese-aru6-fd0804e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-obese-aru10-fd0804e8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-obese-aru9-fd0804e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-obese-aru3-fd0804e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-obese-aru7-fd0804e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-obese-aru8-fd0804e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-obese-aru2-fd0804e8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-obese-ljspeech-fd0804e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-obese-lt408-fd0804e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-obese-lt138-fd0804e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-obese-lt624-fd0804e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-obese-lt396-fd0804e8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-obese-lt498-fd0804e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-obese-lt132-fd0804e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-obese-lt288-fd0804e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-obese-lt42-fd0804e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-obese-lt90-fd0804e8.mp3\"]}}', 'Obese là tính từ chỉ tình trạng béo phì, get obese là cụm động từ chỉ quá trình trở nên béo phì.', 'health', 1, 11),
('5da9490e-ce4a-5df7-9486-43a23ae4da1d', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '673f9700-83a1-5604-8387-7ec6441e693d', '31d189f9-9691-5e4e-90e9-a2dadc184cc8', 'death warmed up', '/deθ wɔːmd ʌp/', 'C2', 'idiom', 'Trông rất xanh xao, mệt mỏi, như sắp chết.', 'looking or feeling extremely ill, tired, or weak.', 'After working all night, he looked like death warmed up the next morning.', 'Sau khi làm việc cả đêm, sáng hôm sau anh ấy trông như người chết sống lại.', '{\"en\": \"After working three consecutive night shifts, the supervisor looked like death warmed up.\", \"vi\": \"Sau khi làm việc ba ca đêm liên tiếp, người giám sát trông rất ốm yếu và mệt mỏi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/death-warmed-up-ljspeech-fc742a3c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/death-warmed-up-cori-fc742a3c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/death-warmed-up-bf541918.webp', '[\"exhausted\", \"pale\", \"sickly\"]', '[\"healthy\", \"energetic\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"look like death warmed up\", \"meaning\": \"trông rất ốm yếu, nhợt nhạt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"feel like death warmed up\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy cực kỳ mệt mỏi, ốm yếu\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/death-warmed-up-cori-fc742a3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/death-warmed-up-aru0-fc742a3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/death-warmed-up-aru5-fc742a3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/death-warmed-up-aru6-fc742a3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/death-warmed-up-aru10-fc742a3c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/death-warmed-up-aru9-fc742a3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/death-warmed-up-aru3-fc742a3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/death-warmed-up-aru7-fc742a3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/death-warmed-up-aru8-fc742a3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/death-warmed-up-aru2-fc742a3c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/death-warmed-up-ljspeech-fc742a3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/death-warmed-up-lt408-fc742a3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/death-warmed-up-lt138-fc742a3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/death-warmed-up-lt624-fc742a3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/death-warmed-up-lt396-fc742a3c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/death-warmed-up-lt498-fc742a3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/death-warmed-up-lt132-fc742a3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/death-warmed-up-lt288-fc742a3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/death-warmed-up-lt42-fc742a3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/death-warmed-up-lt90-fc742a3c.mp3\"]}}', 'Thành ngữ này thường dùng ở dạng so sánh \'look/feel like death warmed up\' trong văn nói.', 'health', 1, 12),
('a15ce1ec-e1b3-535d-8c62-6965d10709e8', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '673f9700-83a1-5604-8387-7ec6441e693d', '31d189f9-9691-5e4e-90e9-a2dadc184cc8', 'diploma', '/dɪˈpləʊmə/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Giấy chứng nhận hoàn thành khóa học hoặc trình độ học vấn.', 'a document issued by a college or university showing that a person has finished a course.', 'After finishing the two-year program, she received her diploma in graphic design.', 'Sau khi hoàn thành chương trình hai năm, cô ấy đã nhận được văn bằng thiết kế đồ họa.', '{\"en\": \"Please submit a copy of your university diploma along with your job application form today.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng nộp bản sao bằng tốt nghiệp đại học của bạn cùng với đơn xin việc ngay hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diploma-ljspeech-c2a7adb2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diploma-cori-c2a7adb2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/diploma-152c531a.webp', '[\"certificate\", \"degree\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"university diploma\", \"meaning\": \"bằng tốt nghiệp đại học\"}, {\"phrase\": \"obtain a diploma\", \"meaning\": \"nhận bằng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"degree\", \"note_vi\": \"Degree thường chỉ bằng cấp đại học, diploma có thể là bằng chứng chỉ ngắn hạn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"diplomatic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diploma-cori-c2a7adb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diploma-aru0-c2a7adb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diploma-aru5-c2a7adb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diploma-aru6-c2a7adb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diploma-aru10-c2a7adb2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diploma-aru9-c2a7adb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diploma-aru3-c2a7adb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diploma-aru7-c2a7adb2.mp3\", \"/st