('aead4c86-1a37-508a-81c1-30cfc5eca4ce', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '673f9700-83a1-5604-8387-7ec6441e693d', '31d189f9-9691-5e4e-90e9-a2dadc184cc8', 'beef', '/biːf/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Thịt từ con bò, dùng làm thực phẩm.', 'meat that comes from a cow or bull used for food.', 'For dinner, we had roasted beef with potatoes and vegetables.', 'Bữa tối, chúng tôi ăn thịt bò nướng với khoai tây và rau củ.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant ordered more beef for the weekend banquet menu.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng đã đặt thêm thịt bò cho thực đơn bữa tiệc cuối tuần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-ljspeech-1b57bbec.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-cori-1b57bbec.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/beef-ecc8741e.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"beef steak\", \"meaning\": \"bít tết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ground beef\", \"meaning\": \"thịt bò xay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"beef stew\", \"meaning\": \"thịt bò hầm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"beer\", \"note_vi\": \"beer là bia, beef là thịt bò\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"beefy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-cori-1b57bbec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-aru0-1b57bbec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-aru5-1b57bbec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-aru6-1b57bbec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-aru10-1b57bbec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-aru9-1b57bbec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-aru3-1b57bbec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-aru7-1b57bbec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-aru8-1b57bbec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-aru2-1b57bbec.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beef-ljspeech-1b57bbec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/publ