('c9d94873-41d2-57ed-9b4d-3a5b4472cfb6', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '6b0730de-5e9e-51f1-8276-f2bbfc56edc2', '1ec398cb-ffe0-5da4-bf08-05f187db6590', 'freestyle', '/ˈfriːstaɪl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Kiểu bơi mà vận động viên có thể chọn bất kỳ phong cách nào.', 'a swimming race in which competitors can use any method they choose.', 'He won the gold medal in the 100-meter freestyle event.', 'Anh ấy đã giành huy chương vàng ở nội dung bơi tự do 100 mét.', '{\"en\": \"The resort pool will host a freestyle swimming competition for guests this weekend.\", \"vi\": \"Hồ bơi của khu nghỉ dưỡng sẽ tổ chức một cuộc thi bơi tự do cho khách vào cuối tuần này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freestyle-ljspeech-03a14bb1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freestyle-cori-03a14bb1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/freestyle-46e0c093.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"swim freestyle\", \"meaning\": \"bơi tự do\"}, {\"phrase\": \"freestyle event\", \"meaning\": \"nội dung thi bơi tự do\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"freestyle\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"freestyler\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freestyle-cori-03a14bb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freestyle-aru0-03a14bb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freestyle-aru5-03a14bb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freestyle-aru6-03a14bb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freestyle-aru10-03a14bb1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freestyle-aru9-03a14bb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freestyle-aru3-03a14bb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freestyle-aru7-03a14bb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freestyle-aru8-03a14bb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freestyle-aru2-03a14bb1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {