('da887915-c797-5bb3-9d6e-98b6072765cb', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '6b0730de-5e9e-51f1-8276-f2bbfc56edc2', '1ec398cb-ffe0-5da4-bf08-05f187db6590', 'exotic food', '/ɪɡˈzɒtɪk fuːd/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Món ăn từ một nền văn hóa xa lạ, thường độc đáo hoặc khác biệt.', 'unusual or exciting dishes that come from a foreign country.', 'During his travels, he enjoyed trying various exotic foods from different cultures.', 'Trong những chuyến đi của mình, anh ấy thích thử nhiều món ăn độc đáo từ các nền văn hóa khác nhau.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel restaurant serves exotic food to attract international business travelers.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng của khách sạn phục vụ món ăn kỳ lạ để thu hút khách doanh nhân quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exotic-food-ljspeech-3788bea8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exotic-food-cori-3788bea8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/exotic-food-28a97f21.webp', '[\"foreign cuisine\", \"unusual dishes\"]', '[\"local food\", \"traditional food\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"try exotic food\", \"meaning\": \"thử món ăn kỳ lạ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"serve exotic food\", \"meaning\": \"phục vụ món ăn kỳ lạ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exotic-food-cori-3788bea8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exotic-food-aru0-3788bea8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exotic-food-aru5-3788bea8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exotic-food-aru6-3788bea8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exotic-food-aru10-3788bea8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exotic-food-aru9-3788bea8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exotic-food-aru3-3788bea8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exotic-food-aru7-3788bea8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exotic-food-aru8-3788bea8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obj