('49370a54-b86f-5543-9357-823f19c3e1f3', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '6b0730de-5e9e-51f1-8276-f2bbfc56edc2', '1ec398cb-ffe0-5da4-bf08-05f187db6590', 'rapid', 'UK: /ˈræpɪd/ | US: /ˈræpɪd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'nhanh chóng, nhanh', 'happening, moving, or acting with high speed within a short period of time.', 'The company experienced rapid growth last quarter.', 'Công ty đã trải qua sự tăng trưởng nhanh chóng vào quý trước.', '{\"en\": \"The company experienced rapid growth after launching its new cloud-based software.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã trải qua sự tăng trưởng nhanh chóng sau khi ra mắt phần mềm điện toán đám mây mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-ljspeech-dc94ac81.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-cori-dc94ac81.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rapid-4c545fc8.webp', '[\"fast\", \"quick\", \"swift\", \"speedy\"]', '[\"slow\", \"gradual\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"rapid growth\", \"meaning\": \"sự tăng trưởng nhanh chóng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rapid expansion\", \"meaning\": \"sự mở rộng nhanh chóng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"rigid\", \"note_vi\": \"Cứng nhắc, khắt khe.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"rapidly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"rapidity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-cori-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-aru0-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-aru5-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-aru6-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-aru10-dc94ac81.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-aru9-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-aru3-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-aru7-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-aru8-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-aru2-dc94ac81.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-ljspeech-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-lt408-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-lt138-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-lt624-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-lt396-dc94ac81.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-lt498-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-lt132-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-lt288-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-lt42-dc94ac81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapid-lt90-dc94ac81.mp3\"]}}', '\'Rapid\' hay đi cùng các danh từ như \'growth\', \'change\', \'expansion\' để miêu tả sự gia tăng cực nhanh.', 'general business', 1, 5),
('659fea85-2bee-58a5-843f-cb1e6b708fa4', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '6b0730de-5e9e-51f1-8276-f2bbfc56edc2', '1ec398cb-ffe0-5da4-bf08-05f187db6590', 'supervision', '/ˌsuːpəˈvɪʒn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hành động theo dõi và chỉ đạo công việc hoặc hoạt động của ai đó.', 'the act of watching and directing a person or a piece of work to ensure safety.', 'All new employees work under close supervision for their first few weeks.', 'Tất cả nhân viên mới làm việc dưới sự giám sát chặt chẽ trong vài tuần đầu tiên.', '{\"en\": \"All interns must work under the direct supervision of a senior manager during their training period.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả thực tập sinh phải làm việc dưới sự giám sát trực tiếp của quản lý cấp cao trong thời gian đào tạo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervision-ljspeech-b795b70a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervision-cori-b795b70a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/supervision-544203e4.webp', '[\"management\", \"oversight\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"under the supervision of\", \"meaning\": \"dưới sự giám sát của\"}, {\"phrase\": \"close supervision\", \"meaning\": \"sự giám sát chặt chẽ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"supervise\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"supervisor\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervision-cori-b795b70a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervision-aru0-b795b70a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervision-aru5-b795b70a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervision-aru6-b795b70a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervision-aru10-b795b70a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervision-aru9-b795b70a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervision-aru3-b795b70a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervision-aru7-b795b70a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervision-aru8-b795b70a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervision-aru2-b795b70a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervision-ljspeech-b795b70a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervision-lt408-b795b70a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervision-lt138-b795b70a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervision-lt624-b795b70a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervision-lt396-b795b70a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervision-lt498-b795b70a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervision-lt132-b795b70a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervision-lt288-b795b70a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervision-lt42-b795b70a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervision-lt90-b795b70a.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này rất phổ biến trong các ngữ cảnh quản lý nhân sự và an toàn lao động.', 'office', 1, 6),
('b7c4d78a-15ab-58fa-bae4-a8ccbe72f333', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '6b0730de-5e9e-51f1-8276-f2bbfc56edc2', '1ec398cb-ffe0-5da4-bf08-05f187db6590', 'rival', '/ˈraɪvl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Người hoặc đội cạnh tranh với bạn trong cùng một lĩnh vực.', 'a person or company competing with another for the same target or advantage.', 'The two companies are fierce rivals in the smartphone market.', 'Hai công ty là đối thủ cạnh tranh gay gắt trên thị trường điện thoại thông minh.', '{\"en\": \"The company lowered its product prices to stay ahead of its main market rival.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã giảm giá sản phẩm để duy trì vị thế dẫn trước đối thủ thị trường chính của mình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-ljspeech-9ba5eef5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-cori-9ba5eef5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rival-706fec3d.webp', '[\"competitor\", \"opponent\", \"challenger\"]', '[\"partner\", \"ally\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"chief rival\", \"meaning\": \"đối thủ chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"business rival\", \"meaning\": \"đối thủ kinh doanh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"river\", \"note_vi\": \"dễ gõ nhầm mặt chữ với river (dòng sông).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"rivalry\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"rival\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-cori-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-aru0-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-aru5-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-aru6-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-aru10-9ba5eef5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-aru9-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-aru3-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-aru7-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-aru8-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-aru2-9ba5eef5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-ljspeech-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-lt408-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-lt138-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-lt624-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-lt396-9ba5eef5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-lt498-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-lt132-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-lt288-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-lt42-9ba5eef5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rival-lt90-9ba5eef5.mp3\"]}}', 'Có thể vừa là danh từ (đối thủ), tính từ (đối địch) vừa là động từ (cạnh tranh với).', 'business', 1, 7),
('1962745a-7655-53fa-b6eb-7cc38ca8d84a', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '6b0730de-5e9e-51f1-8276-f2bbfc56edc2', '1ec398cb-ffe0-5da4-bf08-05f187db6590', 'climate', '/ˈklaɪmət/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Điều kiện thời tiết chung của một khu vực trong thời gian dài.', 'the general weather conditions usually found in a particular place over a long period.', 'The tropical climate of the region supports diverse wildlife.', 'Khí hậu nhiệt đới của khu vực này hỗ trợ sự đa dạng của động vật hoang dã.', '{\"en\": \"The current economic climate makes it difficult for small businesses to secure bank loans.\", \"vi\": \"Môi trường kinh tế hiện tại khiến các doanh nghiệp nhỏ khó đảm bảo được các khoản vay ngân hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-ljspeech-9d7ccb90.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-cori-9d7ccb90.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/climate-27c90a89.webp', '[\"weather\", \"atmosphere\", \"environment\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"climate change\", \"meaning\": \"biến đổi khí hậu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"economic climate\", \"meaning\": \"môi trường kinh tế\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"weather\", \"note_vi\": \"weather là thời tiết ngắn hạn, climate là khí hậu dài hạn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"climatic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-cori-9d7ccb90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-aru0-9d7ccb90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-aru5-9d7ccb90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-aru6-9d7ccb90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-aru10-9d7ccb90.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-aru9-9d7ccb90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-aru3-9d7ccb90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-aru7-9d7ccb90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-aru8-9d7ccb90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-aru2-9d7ccb90.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-ljspeech-9d7ccb90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-lt408-9d7ccb90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-lt138-9d7ccb90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-lt624-9d7ccb90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-lt396-9d7ccb90.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-lt498-9d7ccb90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-lt132-9d7ccb90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-lt288-9d7ccb90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-lt42-9d7ccb90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-lt90-9d7ccb90.mp3\"]}}', 'Nghĩa bóng thường dùng trong TOEIC là \'môi trường/hoàn cảnh\' (ví dụ: economic climate).', 'nature', 1, 8),
('427a1ee0-05bf-5f96-9409-3ecb51c381bd', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', '6b0730de-5e9e-51f1-8276-f2bbfc56edc2', '1ec398cb-ffe0-5da4-bf08-05f187db6590', 'outlet', 'UK: /ˈaʊt.lɛt/ | US: /ˈaʊt.lɛt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'cửa hàng giảm giá', 'a retail store that sells goods or products at reduced prices', 'The company opened a new outlet store for discounted items.', 'Công ty đã mở một cửa hàng giảm giá mới cho các mặt hàng được giảm giá.', '{\"en\": \"The retail chain plans to open a new factory outlet near the highway next month.\", \"vi\": \"Chuỗi bán lẻ có kế hoạch mở một cửa hàng xả kho mới gần đường cao tốc vào tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlet-ljspeech-4f4a129b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlet-cori-4f4a129b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/outlet-3bbe5f94.webp', '[\"store\", \"shop\", \"market\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"retail outlet\", \"meaning\": \"cửa hàng bán lẻ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"factory outlet\", \"meaning\": \"cửa hàng giảm giá của nhà máy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"power outlet\", \"meaning\": \"ổ cắm điện\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"inlet\", \"note_vi\": \"Inlet nghĩa là lối vào, đầu vào của chất lỏng/khí hoặc vịnh nhỏ.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlet-cori-4f4a129b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlet-aru0-4f4a129b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlet-aru5-4f4a129b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlet-aru6-4f4a129b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlet-aru10-4f4a129b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlet-aru9-4f4a129b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlet-aru3-4f4a129b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlet-aru7-4f4a129b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlet-aru8-4f4a129b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciati