('90abb114-0ce3-5e9a-b080-53d22de1fe75', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', 'aeea99c4-25cb-569a-a6ec-8d0c2db03c03', '776018f6-0ae4-59b5-9712-e63f8e6627be', 'administration', '/ədˌmɪnɪˈstreɪʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự quản lý, điều hành một tổ chức hoặc công việc.', 'the activity or process of organizing and controlling the affairs of a business or institution.', 'She is responsible for the daily administration of the office.', 'Cô ấy chịu trách nhiệm quản lý hàng ngày các công việc văn phòng.', '{\"en\": \"The new manager introduced several improvements to the business administration of the company.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý mới đã đưa ra một số cải tiến cho việc quản trị doanh nghiệp của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-ljspeech-056cbe59.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-cori-056cbe59.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/administration-b2bb655b.webp', '[\"management\", \"direction\", \"governance\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"business administration\", \"meaning\": \"quản trị kinh doanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"public administration\", \"meaning\": \"quản lý công/hành chính công\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"administrator\", \"note_vi\": \"Administrator là người quản lý, administration là sự/bộ máy quản lý.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"administer\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"administrative\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"administrator\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-cori-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-aru0-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-aru5-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-aru6-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-aru10-056cbe59.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-aru9-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-aru3-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-aru7-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-aru8-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-aru2-056cbe59.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-ljspeech-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-lt408-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-lt138-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-lt624-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-lt396-056cbe59.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-lt498-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-lt132-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-lt288-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-lt42-056cbe59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/administration-lt90-056cbe59.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường viết tắt là admin trong giao tiếp công sở hàng ngày.', 'office', 1, 12),
('ef170b09-039e-5457-a3f5-be0bfd0157c6', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', 'aeea99c4-25cb-569a-a6ec-8d0c2db03c03', '776018f6-0ae4-59b5-9712-e63f8e6627be', 'look like', '/lʊk laɪk/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Có vẻ ngoài tương tự hoặc giống với ai đó/cái gì đó.', 'to have a similar appearance or to seem to be something else.', 'She doesn\'t look like her sister at all, even though they are twins.', 'Cô ấy trông không giống chị gái mình chút nào, mặc dù họ là chị em sinh đôi.', '{\"en\": \"The new office building will look like a modern glass tower when finished.\", \"vi\": \"Tòa nhà văn phòng mới sẽ trông giống như một tháp kính hiện đại khi hoàn thành.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-like-ljspeech-da92b27a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-like-cori-da92b27a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/look-like-5c406267.webp', '[\"resemble\", \"appear like\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"look like rain\", \"meaning\": \"trông có vẻ sắp mưa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"look like a success\", \"meaning\": \"trông có vẻ thành công\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"look after\", \"note_vi\": \"look after nghĩa là chăm sóc, khác với look like (trông giống như).\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-like-cori-da92b27a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-like-aru0-da92b27a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-like-aru5-da92b27a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-like-aru6-da92b27a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-like-aru10-da92b27a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-like-aru9-da92b27a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-like-aru3-da92b27a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-like-aru7-da92b27a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-like-aru8-da92b27a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronun