('51cce5c5-7d7e-5dbc-916a-e93d16945755', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', 'aeea99c4-25cb-569a-a6ec-8d0c2db03c03', '776018f6-0ae4-59b5-9712-e63f8e6627be', 'recline', 'UK: /rɪˈklaɪn/ | US: /rɪˈklaɪn/', 'B2', 'verb', 'ngả lưng', 'To lean back or lie down in a comfortable and relaxed position.', 'Please recline your seat gently.', 'Vui lòng ngả ghế của bạn nhẹ nhàng.', '{\"en\": \"Passengers are requested to return their seats to the upright position before landing and not to recline them during taxiing.\", \"vi\": \"Hành khách được yêu cầu dựng thẳng lưng ghế trước khi hạ cánh và không ngả ghế trong quá trình di chuyển trên đường băng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recline-ljspeech-cd055f96.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recline-cori-cd055f96.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/recline-f99646f6.webp', '[\"lean back\", \"lie back\", \"lounge\"]', '[\"sit up\", \"stand upright\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"recline a seat\", \"meaning\": \"ngả lưng ghế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"recline comfortably\", \"meaning\": \"ngả lưng một cách thoải mái\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"decline\", \"note_vi\": \"Decline có nghĩa là từ chối hoặc sụt giảm, không phải ngả lưng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"reclining\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"recliner\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recline-cori-cd055f96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recline-aru0-cd055f96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recline-aru5-cd055f96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recline-aru6-cd055f96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recline-aru10-cd055f96.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recline-aru9-cd055f96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recline-aru3-cd055f96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recline-aru7-cd055f96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recline-aru8-cd055f96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recline-aru2-cd055f96.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recline-ljspeech-cd055f96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recline-lt408-cd055f96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recline-lt138-cd055f96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recline-lt624-cd055f96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recline-lt396-cd055f96.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recline-lt498-cd055f96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recline-lt132-cd055f96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recline-lt288-cd055f96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recline-lt42-cd055f96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recline-lt90-cd055f96.mp3\"]}}', 'Cần phân biệt \'recline\' (tựa lưng, ngả ghế về phía sau) với \'decline\' (từ chối, suy giảm).', 'travel', 1, 16),
('8a3f55be-c7cc-5193-8b16-3dc0b74769eb', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', 'aeea99c4-25cb-569a-a6ec-8d0c2db03c03', '776018f6-0ae4-59b5-9712-e63f8e6627be', 'insularity', '/ˌɪnsjuˈlærəti/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Sự cô lập, hạn chế tiếp xúc với bên ngoài; hoặc sự hẹp hòi trong tư duy.', 'the quality of being unwilling to accept new ideas or foreign cultures.', 'The small community\'s insularity made it difficult for outsiders to integrate.', 'Sự cô lập của cộng đồng nhỏ đã khiến người ngoài khó hòa nhập.', '{\"en\": \"The company failed to grow internationally because of the insularity of its management team.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty không thể phát triển ra quốc tế vì tính hẹp hòi thiển cận của đội ngũ quản lý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insularity-ljspeech-9d85b289.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insularity-cori-9d85b289.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/insularity-6c5b13d3.webp', '[\"narrow-mindedness\", \"parochialism\"]', '[\"broad-mindedness\", \"openness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"cultural insularity\", \"meaning\": \"tính cách biệt về văn hóa\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"insular\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insularity-cori-9d85b289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insularity-aru0-9d85b289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insularity-aru5-9d85b289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insularity-aru6-9d85b289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insularity-aru10-9d85b289.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insularity-aru9-9d85b289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insularity-aru3-9d85b289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insularity-aru7-9d85b289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insularity-aru8-9d85b289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insularity-aru2-9d85b289.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insularity-ljspeech-9d85b289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insularity-lt408-9d85b289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insularity-lt138-9d85b289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insularity-lt624-9d85b289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insularity-lt396-9d85b289.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insularity-lt498-9d85b289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insularity-lt132-9d85b289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insularity-lt288-9d85b289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insularity-lt42-9d85b289.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insularity-lt90-9d85b289.mp3\"]}}', 'Xuất phát từ gốc insula (hòn đảo), ám chỉ sự cô lập, thiển cận.', 'business', 1, 17),
('f237a103-aa7e-57c9-803f-fd20c3538bea', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', 'aeea99c4-25cb-569a-a6ec-8d0c2db03c03', '776018f6-0ae4-59b5-9712-e63f8e6627be', 'proposal', '/prəˈpəʊzl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một kế hoạch hoặc ý tưởng được đưa ra để xem xét hoặc chấp thuận.', 'a formal plan or suggestion that is given to somebody to consider.', 'The board of directors carefully reviewed the budget proposal submitted last week.', 'Hội đồng quản trị đã xem xét kỹ lưỡng đề xuất ngân sách được nộp vào tuần trước.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors carefully reviewed the budget proposal submitted by the marketing team.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị đã xem xét kỹ lưỡng đề xuất ngân sách do đội ngũ tiếp thị đệ trình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proposal-ljspeech-426144f4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proposal-cori-426144f4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/proposal-e78edb32.webp', '[\"suggestion\", \"plan\", \"offer\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"submit a proposal\", \"meaning\": \"nộp một bản đề xuất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reject a proposal\", \"meaning\": \"bác bỏ một đề xuất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"business proposal\", \"meaning\": \"đề xuất kinh doanh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"proposition\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa rộng hơn hoặc liên quan đến luận điểm/lời đề nghị kinh doanh\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"propose\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proposal-cori-426144f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proposal-aru0-426144f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proposal-aru5-426144f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proposal-aru6-426144f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proposal-aru10-426144f4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proposal-aru9-426144f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proposal-aru3-426144f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/ob