('c54a656a-5ba6-5c31-815d-b3e94f03ed57', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', 'c2d09241-ddcf-5460-853d-208b3beba72d', '23bd32f8-e319-5371-90a7-e12817304a45', 'leak', 'UK: /liːk/ | US: /liːk/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự rò rỉ', 'an unintended hole or crack through which liquid or gas escapes from a container', 'Please report any water leak to maintenance staff immediately.', 'Vui lòng báo cáo bất kỳ sự rò rỉ nước nào cho nhân viên bảo trì ngay lập tức.', '{\"en\": \"Maintenance fixed the water leak in the basement office before any financial documents were damaged.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận bảo trì đã sửa sự rò rỉ nước ở văn phòng tầng hầm trước khi có bất kỳ tài liệu tài chính nào bị hư hỏng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-ljspeech-065c5c29.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-cori-065c5c29.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/leak-6126916b.webp', '[\"seepage\", \"drip\", \"escape\", \"discharge\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"data leak\", \"meaning\": \"sự rò rỉ dữ liệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"water leak\", \"meaning\": \"sự rò rỉ nước\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"leek\", \"note_vi\": \"Leek (phát âm giống hệt) có nghĩa là hành tỏi tây, khác hoàn toàn về nghĩa.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"leak\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"leaky\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-cori-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-aru0-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-aru5-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-aru6-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-aru10-065c5c29.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-aru9-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-aru3-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-aru7-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-aru8-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-aru2-065c5c29.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-ljspeech-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-lt408-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-lt138-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-lt624-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-lt396-065c5c29.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-lt498-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-lt132-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-lt288-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-lt42-065c5c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leak-lt90-065c5c29.mp3\"]}}', 'Có thể mang nghĩa sự rò rỉ nước/khí (sửa chữa bảo trì) hoặc rò rỉ thông tin bảo mật (data leak).', 'office', 1, 0),
('5ed8b4c8-058f-58c8-af78-527e2c2f06ab', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', 'c2d09241-ddcf-5460-853d-208b3beba72d', '23bd32f8-e319-5371-90a7-e12817304a45', 'business', '/ˈbɪznəs/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Hoạt động mua bán hàng hóa, dịch vụ để kiếm lợi nhuận.', 'the activity of making, buying, or selling goods or providing services for money.', 'Our company expands its business into emerging overseas markets this year.', 'Công ty chúng tôi mở rộng việc kinh doanh sang các thị trường mới nổi ở nước ngoài trong năm nay.', '{\"en\": \"The company plans to expand its business into several Asian markets next year.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty có kế hoạch mở rộng việc kinh doanh sang một số thị trường Châu Á vào năm tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-ljspeech-6a577a77.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-cori-6a577a77.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/business-e9f94fae.webp', '[\"commerce\", \"trade\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"do business\", \"meaning\": \"kinh doanh, làm ăn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"business strategy\", \"meaning\": \"chiến lược kinh doanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"business trip\", \"meaning\": \"chuyến công tác\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"busy\", \"note_vi\": \"busy là tính từ chỉ trạng thái bận rộn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"businessman\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"businesswoman\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-cori-6a577a77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-aru0-6a577a77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-aru5-6a577a77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-aru6-6a577a77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-aru10-6a577a77.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-aru9-6a577a77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-aru3-6a577a77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-aru7-6a577a77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-aru8-6a577a77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-aru2-6a577a77.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-ljspeech-6a577a77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-lt408-6a577a77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-lt138-6a577a77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-lt624-6a577a77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-lt396-6a577a77.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-lt498-6a577a77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-lt132-6a577a77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-lt288-6a577a77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-lt42-6a577a77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-lt90-6a577a77.mp3\"]}}', 'Business là danh từ không đếm được khi chỉ hoạt động kinh doanh nói chung.', 'business', 1, 1),
('49330d08-8b3c-5cba-9b69-0ea66768b941', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', 'c2d09241-ddcf-5460-853d-208b3beba72d', '23bd32f8-e319-5371-90a7-e12817304a45', 'blind as a bat', '/blaɪnd æz ə bæt/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Thị lực rất kém, hầu như không nhìn thấy gì.', 'having very poor eyesight and unable to see things clearly without wearing glasses or lenses.', 'My grandfather misplaces his reading glasses often because he is blind as a bat.', 'Ông tôi thường xuyên để quên kính đọc sách vì mắt ông kém lắm.', '{\"en\": \"I am blind as a bat without my glasses, so I cannot read the small print.\", \"vi\": \"Tôi bị cận nặng nếu không đeo kính, vì vậy tôi không thể đọc được chữ in nhỏ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-as-a-bat-ljspeech-007c4a48.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-as-a-bat-cori-007c4a48.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/blind-as-a-bat-8beb896c.webp', '[\"nearsighted\", \"shortsighted\"]', '[\"sharp-sighted\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"be as blind as a bat\", \"meaning\": \"mắt rất kém\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-as-a-bat-cori-007c4a48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-as-a-bat-aru0-007c4a48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-as-a-bat-aru5-007c4a48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-as-a-bat-aru6-007c4a48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-as-a-bat-aru10-007c4a48.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-as-a-bat-aru9-007c4a48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-as-a-bat-aru3-007c4a48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-as-a-bat-aru7-007c4a48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-as-a-bat-aru8-007c4a48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blind-as-a-bat-aru2-007c4a48.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/o