('2ea36013-4ed4-5da7-b6c3-49b9b22b25d5', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', 'c2d09241-ddcf-5460-853d-208b3beba72d', '23bd32f8-e319-5371-90a7-e12817304a45', 'bandage', '/ˈbændɪdʒ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Miếng vải hoặc vật liệu dùng để băng bó vết thương.', 'a piece of soft material used to cover and protect a hurt part of the body.', 'She carefully applied a bandage to the cut on his arm.', 'Cô ấy cẩn thận băng bó vết cắt trên cánh tay anh.', '{\"en\": \"The office first-aid kit contains a sterile bandage for minor workplace injuries.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ sơ cứu tại văn phòng có chứa băng vô trùng cho các chấn thương nhỏ tại nơi làm việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandage-ljspeech-210ff277.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandage-cori-210ff277.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bandage-f418b664.webp', '[\"dressing\", \"gauze\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"apply a bandage\", \"meaning\": \"băng bó vết thương\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sterile bandage\", \"meaning\": \"băng vô trùng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"bandage\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandage-cori-210ff277.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandage-aru0-210ff277.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandage-aru5-210ff277.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandage-aru6-210ff277.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandage-aru10-210ff277.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandage-aru9-210ff277.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandage-aru3-210ff277.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandage-aru7-210ff277.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandage-aru8-210ff277.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandage-aru2-210ff277.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandage-ljspeech-210ff27