('8557b484-ba5d-5c86-9662-5caafee8a2e8', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', 'c2d09241-ddcf-5460-853d-208b3beba72d', '23bd32f8-e319-5371-90a7-e12817304a45', 'work-life balance', '/wɜːk laɪf ˈbæl.əns/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sự cân bằng giữa thời gian dành cho công việc và cuộc sống cá nhân.', 'the state of having a healthy division between professional duties and personal time.', 'Flexible working hours can help staff maintain a healthy work-life balance effortlessly.', 'Giờ làm việc linh hoạt có thể giúp nhân viên duy trì sự cân bằng giữa công việc và cuộc sống một cách dễ dàng.', '{\"en\": \"Our company promotes a healthy work-life balance by offering flexible working hours to staff.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi thúc đẩy sự cân bằng giữa công việc và cuộc sống bằng cách cung cấp giờ làm linh hoạt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/work-life-balance-ljspeech-d4088be0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/work-life-balance-cori-d4088be0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/work-life-balance-43090991.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"achieve balance\", \"meaning\": \"đạt được sự cân bằng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/work-life-balance-cori-d4088be0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/work-life-balance-aru0-d4088be0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/work-life-balance-aru5-d4088be0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/work-life-balance-aru6-d4088be0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/work-life-balance-aru10-d4088be0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/work-life-balance-aru9-d4088be0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/work-life-balance-aru3-d4088be0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/work-life-balance-aru7-d4088be0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/work-life-balance-aru8-d4088be0.mp3\", \"/