('815c0dbc-f61d-5a67-99f4-09643650848a', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', 'c2d09241-ddcf-5460-853d-208b3beba72d', '23bd32f8-e319-5371-90a7-e12817304a45', 'protocol', 'UK: /ˈprəʊtəˌkɒl/ | US: /ˈproʊtəˌkɔl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'giao thức', 'a system of rules that explains the correct procedure for doing something formally.', 'We must follow the security protocol.', 'Chúng ta phải tuân theo giao thức an ninh.', '{\"en\": \"All staff members must follow the company\'s safety protocol during an emergency evacuation.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả nhân viên phải tuân theo giao thức an toàn của công ty trong trường hợp sơ tán khẩn cấp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protocol-ljspeech-6e9b4af6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protocol-cori-6e9b4af6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/protocol-b1379010.webp', '[\"procedure\", \"convention\", \"rule\", \"code\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"follow protocol\", \"meaning\": \"tuân theo giao thức/quy định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"strict protocol\", \"meaning\": \"giao thức nghiêm ngặt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"security protocol\", \"meaning\": \"giao thức bảo mật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"procedure\", \"note_vi\": \"Procedure là trình tự các bước công việc cụ thể, còn protocol là bộ quy tắc/nghi thức chuẩn.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protocol-cori-6e9b4af6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protocol-aru0-6e9b4af6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protocol-aru5-6e9b4af6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protocol-aru6-6e9b4af6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protocol-aru10-6e9b4af6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protocol-aru9-6e9b4af6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protocol-aru3-6e9b4af6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protocol-aru7-6e9b4af6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protocol-aru8-6e9b4af6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protocol-aru2-6e9b4af6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protocol-ljspeech-6e9b4af6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protocol-lt408-6e9b4af6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protocol-lt138-6e9b4af6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protocol-lt624-6e9b4af6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protocol-lt396-6e9b4af6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protocol-lt498-6e9b4af6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protocol-lt132-6e9b4af6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protocol-lt288-6e9b4af6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protocol-lt42-6e9b4af6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protocol-lt90-6e9b4af6.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ cảnh công sở, \'protocol\' chỉ quy trình/nghi thức xã giao hoặc quy định chuẩn, khác với \'procedure\' (bước thực hiện cụ thể).', 'office', 1, 27),
('a8c72b92-72b3-5340-bb8a-21256a77dbe1', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', 'c2d09241-ddcf-5460-853d-208b3beba72d', '23bd32f8-e319-5371-90a7-e12817304a45', 'seasoning', '/ˈsiːzənɪŋ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Các loại gia vị dùng để nêm nếm thức ăn.', 'substances such as salt or spices added to food to improve its flavour.', 'Chef Mario sprinkled a blend of Italian seasoning over the freshly baked pizza.', 'Đầu bếp Mario rắc một hỗn hợp gia vị Ý lên chiếc bánh pizza mới nướng.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant chef ordered premium organic seasoning from an international wholesale supplier.\", \"vi\": \"Đầu bếp nhà hàng đã đặt mua gia vị hữu cơ cao cấp từ một nhà cung cấp bán buôn quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasoning-ljspeech-ebdc3c77.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasoning-cori-ebdc3c77.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/seasoning-1e306e77.webp', '[\"condiment\", \"spice\", \"flavoring\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"add seasoning\", \"meaning\": \"thêm gia vị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"adjust seasoning\", \"meaning\": \"nêm nếm lại gia vị\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"season\", \"note_vi\": \"season là mùa (danh từ) hoặc nêm gia vị (động từ), seasoning là danh từ gia vị.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"season\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"seasoned\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasoning-cori-ebdc3c77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasoning-aru0-ebdc3c77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasoning-aru5-ebdc3c77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasoning-aru6-ebdc3c77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasoning-aru10-ebdc3c77.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasoning-aru9-ebdc3c77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasoning-aru3-ebdc3c77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasoning-aru7-ebdc3c77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasoning-aru8-ebdc3c77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasoning-aru2-ebdc3c77.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasoning-ljspeech-ebdc3c77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasoning-lt408-ebdc3c77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasoning-lt138-ebdc3c77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasoning-lt624-ebdc3c77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasoning-lt396-ebdc3c77.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasoning-lt498-ebdc3c77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasoning-lt132-ebdc3c77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasoning-lt288-ebdc3c77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasoning-lt42-ebdc3c77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasoning-lt90-ebdc3c77.mp3\"]}}', '\'Seasoning\' chỉ chung các chất nêm nếm (muối, tiêu, thảo mộc) để tăng vị cho món ăn.', 'dining', 1, 28),
('0874d372-3043-5388-ad8c-08a9a85809ba', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', 'c2d09241-ddcf-5460-853d-208b3beba72d', '23bd32f8-e319-5371-90a7-e12817304a45', 'drought', '/draʊt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Thời kỳ dài khô hạn, thiếu nước nghiêm trọng.', 'a long period of time when there is very little rain and the land becomes dry.', 'The prolonged drought caused severe water shortages and damaged crops across the region.', 'Đợt hạn hán kéo dài đã gây ra tình trạng thiếu nước trầm trọng và làm hư hại mùa màng trên khắp khu vực.', '{\"en\": \"The severe drought has negatively impacted the agricultural exports of the country this fiscal year.\", \"vi\": \"Đợt hạn hán nghiêm trọng đã ảnh hưởng tiêu cực đến xuất khẩu nông sản của đất nước trong năm tài chính này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drought-ljspeech-7d52e6d4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drought-cori-7d52e6d4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/drought-b79a8be3.webp', '[\"dry spell\", \"aridity\"]', '[\"flood\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"prolonged drought\", \"meaning\": \"hạn hán kéo dài\"}, {\"phrase\": \"suffer from drought\", \"meaning\": \"chịu ảnh hưởng của hạn hán\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"draught\", \"note_vi\": \"Draught là luồng gió lùa hoặc bản thảo, phát âm giống nhưng nghĩa khác hẳn.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drought-cori-7d52e6d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drought-aru0-7d52e6d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drought-aru5-7d52e6d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drought-aru6-7d52e6d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drought-aru10-7d52e6d4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drought-aru9-7d52e6d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drought-aru3-7d52e6d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drought-aru7-7d52e6d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v