('303e879a-0bf9-51ec-85e6-0b0e81ee179e', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', 'd0d0288c-8e3d-5c09-b46d-7f675c7d4538', 'aa1a5c93-e1b2-5adc-b0eb-1dc89fa5d7ab', 'flaw', 'UK: /flɔː/ | US: /flɔː/', 'B2', 'noun', 'lỗi, thiếu sót', 'A mistake, fault, or imperfection that reduces the overall quality of something.', 'The product has a minor design flaw.', 'Sản phẩm có một lỗi nhỏ trong thiết kế.', '{\"en\": \"Quality control detected a minor design flaw in the prototype before mass production began.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận kiểm soát chất lượng đã phát hiện một lỗi thiết kế nhỏ ở mẫu thử nghiệm trước khi bắt đầu sản xuất hàng loạt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaw-ljspeech-ba083804.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaw-cori-ba083804.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/flaw-c8a2fa16.webp', '[\"defect\", \"fault\", \"imperfection\", \"shortcoming\"]', '[\"perfection\", \"strength\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"design flaw\", \"meaning\": \"lỗi thiết kế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fatal flaw\", \"meaning\": \"khuyết điểm nghiêm trọng / sai lầm chết người\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"flow\", \"note_vi\": \"dòng chảy\"}, {\"word\": \"flee\", \"note_vi\": \"chạy trốn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"flawless\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"flawlessly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaw-cori-ba083804.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaw-aru0-ba083804.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaw-aru5-ba083804.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaw-aru6-ba083804.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaw-aru10-ba083804.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaw-aru9-ba083804.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaw-aru3-ba083804.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaw-aru7-ba083804.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaw-aru8-ba083804.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaw-aru2-ba083804.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaw-ljspeech-ba083804.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaw-lt408-ba083804.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaw-lt138-ba083804.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaw-lt624-ba083804.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaw-lt396-ba083804.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaw-lt498-ba083804.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaw-lt132-ba083804.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaw-lt288-ba083804.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaw-lt42-ba083804.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaw-lt90-ba083804.mp3\"]}}', '\'Flaw\' chỉ lỗi thiết kế hoặc khuyết điểm của sản phẩm/kế hoạch, khác với \'mistake\' hay \'error\' thường do hành động sai lầm của con người.', 'manufacturing', 1, 4),
('94b82d8a-c1a2-5f02-8bdd-2a5ffa3240e5', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', 'd0d0288c-8e3d-5c09-b46d-7f675c7d4538', 'aa1a5c93-e1b2-5adc-b0eb-1dc89fa5d7ab', 'stable relationship', '/ˈsteɪbl̩ rɪˈleɪʃənʃɪp/', 'B2', 'phrase', 'Mối quan hệ vững chắc, ổn định và lâu dài.', 'a connection between people that is steady, reliable, and likely to last.', 'They have been in a stable relationship for over five years.', 'Họ đã có một mối quan hệ bền vững hơn năm năm.', '{\"en\": \"Building a stable relationship with suppliers ensures a steady flow of raw materials.\", \"vi\": \"Xây dựng mối quan hệ bền vững với các nhà cung cấp đảm bảo dòng nguyên liệu thô ổn định.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stable-relationship-ljspeech-963709cb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stable-relationship-cori-963709cb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stable-relationship-6f17065a.webp', '[\"steady relationship\", \"lasting relationship\"]', '[\"unstable relationship\", \"rocky relationship\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"develop a stable relationship\", \"meaning\": \"phát triển mối quan hệ bền vững\"}, {\"phrase\": \"enjoy a stable relationship\", \"meaning\": \"có được mối quan hệ bền vững\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stable-relationship-cori-963709cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stable-relationship-aru0-963709cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stable-relationship-aru5-963709cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stable-relationship-aru6-963709cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stable-relationship-aru10-963709cb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stable-relationship-aru9-963709cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stable-relationship-aru3-963709cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stable-relationship-aru7-963709cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stable-relationship-aru8-963709cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stable-relationship-aru2-963709cb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stable-relationship-ljspeech-963709cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stable-relationship-lt408-963709cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stable-relationship-lt138-963709cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stable-relationship-lt624-963709cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stable-relationship-lt396-963709cb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stable-relationship-lt498-963709cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stable-relationship-lt132-963709cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stable-relationship-lt288-963709cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stable-relationship-lt42-963709cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stable-relationship-lt90-963709cb.mp3\"]}}', 'stable nghĩa là ổn định, bền vững; dùng được cho cả tình cảm và công việc.', 'business', 1, 5),
('1efd9b51-9fd5-5df5-b997-dedbe3db9907', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', 'd0d0288c-8e3d-5c09-b46d-7f675c7d4538', 'aa1a5c93-e1b2-5adc-b0eb-1dc89fa5d7ab', 'a cup of joe', '/ə kʌp əv dʒəʊ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Cách nói thân mật để chỉ một tách cà phê.', 'an informal expression used to refer to a single cup of coffee.', 'The exhausted programmer grabbed a quick cup of joe before continuing his project.', 'Lập trình viên kiệt sức đã lấy nhanh một tách cà phê trước khi tiếp tục dự án của mình.', '{\"en\": \"Most employees enjoy a cup of joe during their morning break at work.\", \"vi\": \"Hầu hết nhân viên thích thưởng thức một tách cà phê trong giờ nghỉ giải lao buổi sáng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cup-of-joe-ljspeech-42ff62d2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cup-of-joe-cori-42ff62d2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/a-cup-of-joe-359beb8c.webp', '[\"cup of coffee\", \"brew\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"hot cup of joe\", \"meaning\": \"tách cà phê nóng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"morning cup of joe\", \"meaning\": \"tách cà phê sáng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cup-of-joe-cori-42ff62d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cup-of-joe-aru0-42ff62d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cup-of-joe-aru5-42ff62d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cup-of-joe-aru6-42ff62d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cup-of-joe-aru10-42ff62d2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cup-of-joe-aru9-42ff62d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cup-of-joe-aru3-42ff62d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cup-of-joe-aru7-42ff62d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cup-of-joe-aru8-42ff62d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cup-of-joe-aru2-42ff62d2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\":