('eb711973-e79b-5da6-86f8-dbcede368022', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', 'd0d0288c-8e3d-5c09-b46d-7f675c7d4538', 'aa1a5c93-e1b2-5adc-b0eb-1dc89fa5d7ab', 'cereal', '/ˈsɪəriəl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Ngũ cốc ăn sáng hoặc cây lương thực như lúa mì, ngô.', 'a food made from grain that is often eaten with milk in the morning.', 'For breakfast, I usually have a bowl of cereal with milk and fruit.', 'Bữa sáng tôi thường ăn một bát ngũ cốc với sữa và trái cây.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel provides a variety of healthy cereal options for guests at the breakfast buffet.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn cung cấp nhiều lựa chọn ngũ cốc tốt cho sức khỏe cho khách tại bữa sáng tự chọn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cereal-ljspeech-1a44e948.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cereal-cori-1a44e948.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cereal-47ccea97.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"breakfast cereal\", \"meaning\": \"ngũ cốc ăn sáng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bowl of cereal\", \"meaning\": \"tô ngũ cốc\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cereal-cori-1a44e948.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cereal-aru0-1a44e948.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cereal-aru5-1a44e948.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cereal-aru6-1a44e948.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cereal-aru10-1a44e948.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cereal-aru9-1a44e948.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cereal-aru3-1a44e948.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cereal-aru7-1a44e948.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cereal-aru8-1a44e948.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cereal-aru2-1a44e948.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cereal-ljspeech-1a44e948.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cer