('c8859c34-e88c-5196-8894-07320ee0eb54', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', 'd0d0288c-8e3d-5c09-b46d-7f675c7d4538', 'aa1a5c93-e1b2-5adc-b0eb-1dc89fa5d7ab', 'asylum', '/əˈsaɪləm/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Nơi trú ẩn hoặc bảo vệ cho người tị nạn.', 'a safe place of protection given by a government to refugees fleeing danger.', 'The government established a new asylum to house the displaced families.', 'Chính phủ đã thành lập một trại tị nạn mới để làm nơi ở cho các gia đình di tản.', '{\"en\": \"The international organization provided temporary housing for refugees who requested political asylum.\", \"vi\": \"Tổ chức quốc tế đã cung cấp chỗ ở tạm thời cho những người tị nạn xin tị nạn chính trị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asylum-ljspeech-598b0ce9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asylum-cori-598b0ce9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/asylum-3edb9f70.webp', '[\"refuge\", \"sanctuary\", \"shelter\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"seek asylum\", \"meaning\": \"xin tị nạn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"grant asylum\", \"meaning\": \"cấp quyền tị nạn\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asylum-cori-598b0ce9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asylum-aru0-598b0ce9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asylum-aru5-598b0ce9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asylum-aru6-598b0ce9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asylum-aru10-598b0ce9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asylum-aru9-598b0ce9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asylum-aru3-598b0ce9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asylum-aru7-598b0ce9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asylum-aru8-598b0ce9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asylum-aru2-598b0ce9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asylum-ljspeech-598b0ce9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asylum-lt408-598b0ce9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asylum-lt138-598b0ce9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asylum-lt624-598b0ce9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asylum-lt396-598b0ce9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asylum-lt498-598b0ce9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asylum-lt132-598b0ce9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asylum-lt288-598b0ce9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asylum-lt42-598b0ce9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asylum-lt90-598b0ce9.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này thường đi với các động từ như \'seek\' (xin) hoặc \'grant\' (cho phép).', 'law', 1, 14),
('3559255f-05c2-595f-9b3a-7eea6fa53b0f', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', 'd0d0288c-8e3d-5c09-b46d-7f675c7d4538', 'aa1a5c93-e1b2-5adc-b0eb-1dc89fa5d7ab', 'hierarchy', '/ˈhaɪərɑːki/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hệ thống tổ chức có thứ bậc rõ ràng.', 'a system in which people or things are arranged according to their importance level.', 'In a traditional company, there is often a clear hierarchy of management.', 'Trong một công ty truyền thống, thường có một hệ thống cấp bậc quản lý rõ ràng.', '{\"en\": \"New management decided to flatten the corporate hierarchy to improve internal communication speed.\", \"vi\": \"Ban quản lý mới quyết định làm phẳng hệ thống cấp bậc doanh nghiệp để cải thiện tốc độ giao tiếp nội bộ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hierarchy-ljspeech-ff59e8b9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hierarchy-cori-ff59e8b9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hierarchy-fd55af00.webp', '[\"ranking system\", \"pecking order\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"corporate hierarchy\", \"meaning\": \"hệ thống cấp bậc doanh nghiệp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"strict hierarchy\", \"meaning\": \"hệ thống cấp bậc nghiêm ngặt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"hierarchical\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"hierarchically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hierarchy-cori-ff59e8b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hierarchy-aru0-ff59e8b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hierarchy-aru5-ff59e8b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hierarchy-aru6-ff59e8b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hierarchy-aru10-ff59e8b9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hierarchy-aru9-ff59e8b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hierarchy-aru3-ff59e8b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hierarchy-aru7-ff59e8b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hierarchy-aru8-ff59e8b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hierarchy-aru2-ff59e8b9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hierarchy-ljspeech-ff59e8b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hierarchy-lt408-ff59e8b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hierarchy-lt138-ff59e8b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hierarchy-lt624-ff59e8b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hierarchy-lt396-ff59e8b9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hierarchy-lt498-ff59e8b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hierarchy-lt132-ff59e8b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hierarchy-lt288-ff59e8b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hierarchy-lt42-ff59e8b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hierarchy-lt90-ff59e8b9.mp3\"]}}', 'Phát âm là /ˈhaɪə.rɑː.ki/, lưu ý nhóm chữ \'ch\' phát âm là /k/.', 'office', 1, 15),
('52c0a85d-ed88-5da4-b92f-c4f98bb9f4f9', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', 'd0d0288c-8e3d-5c09-b46d-7f675c7d4538', 'aa1a5c93-e1b2-5adc-b0eb-1dc89fa5d7ab', 'nuclear family', '/njuːklɪə fæmɪli/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Gia đình chỉ gồm cha, mẹ và các con.', 'a group consisting of two parents and their children living together as a unit.', 'In many Western societies, the nuclear family is considered the basic unit of society.', 'Ở nhiều xã hội phương Tây, gia đình hạt nhân được coi là đơn vị cơ bản của xã hội.', '{\"en\": \"The company offers benefits that support the needs of a typical nuclear family for employees.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty cung cấp các phúc lợi hỗ trợ nhu cầu của một gia đình hạt nhân điển hình cho nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuclear-family-ljspeech-12b692f1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuclear-family-cori-12b692f1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/nuclear-family-88e4b5af.webp', NULL, '[\"extended family\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"typical nuclear family\", \"meaning\": \"gia đình hạt nhân điển hình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"support a nuclear family\", \"meaning\": \"nuôi sống gia đình hạt nhân\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuclear-family-cori-12b692f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuclear-family-aru0-12b692f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuclear-family-aru5-12b692f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuclear-family-aru6-12b692f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuclear-family-aru10-12b692f1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuclear-family-aru9-12b692f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuclear-family-aru3-12b692f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuclear-family-aru7-12b692f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuclear-family-aru8-12b692f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuclear-family-aru2-12b692f1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuclear-family-ljspeech-12b692f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuclear-family-lt408-12b692f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuclear-family-lt138-12b692f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuclear-family-lt624-12b692f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuclear-family-lt396-12b692f1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuclear-family-lt498-12b692f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuclear-family-lt132-12b692f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuclear-family-lt288-12b692f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuclear-family-lt42-12b692f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nuclear-family-lt90-12b692f1.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhớ phân biệt với \'extended family\' (gia đình đa thế hệ).', 'hr', 1, 16),
('47aa2257-9b37-56ba-891f-1317fdc42fc0', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', 'd0d0288c-8e3d-5c09-b46d-7f675c7d4538', 'aa1a5c93-e1b2-5adc-b0eb-1dc89fa5d7ab', 'notable', 'UK: /ˈnəʊ.tə.bəl/ | US: /ˈnoʊ.tə.bəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'đáng chú ý, nổi bật', 'deserving attention or respect because of being important, unusual, or striking.', 'The company made notable progress in the last quarter.', 'Công ty đã đạt được tiến bộ đáng kể trong quý trước.', '{\"en\": \"The new manager made several notable improvements to the customer service department.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý mới đã thực hiện một số cải tiến đáng chú ý cho bộ phận dịch vụ khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-ljspeech-cb9c0b0b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-cori-cb9c0b0b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/notable-80420da4.webp', '[\"remarkable\", \"significant\", \"striking\", \"prominent\"]', '[\"unremarkable\", \"inconspicuous\", \"ordinary\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"notable achievement\", \"meaning\": \"thành tựu nổi bật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"notable increase\", \"meaning\": \"sự gia tăng đáng chú ý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"notable example\", \"meaning\": \"ví dụ tiêu biểu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"noticeable\", \"note_vi\": \"Noticeable là dễ dàng nhận thấy/dễ thấy bằng mắt, trong khi notable nhấn mạnh vào sự quan trọng và xuất sắc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"notably\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"notability\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-cori-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-aru0-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-aru5-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-aru6-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-aru10-cb9c0b0b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-aru9-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-aru3-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-aru7-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-aru8-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-aru2-cb9c0b0b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-ljspeech-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-lt408-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-lt138-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-lt624-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-lt396-cb9c0b0b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-lt498-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-lt132-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-lt288-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-lt42-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-lt90-cb9c0b0b.mp3\"]}}', '\'Notable\' dùng để miêu tả thành tựu, sự gia tăng hoặc đặc điểm đáng chú ý, nổi bật (mang tính tích cực hoặc quan trọng).', 'business', 1, 17),
('29cf63ef-e6fc-5563-89d4-4d770b4aa82d', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', 'd0d0288c-8e3d-5c09-b46d-7f675c7d4538', 'aa1a5c93-e1b2-5adc-b0eb-1dc89fa5d7ab', 'chat', '/tʃæt/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Trò chuyện thân mật, không trang trọng với ai đó.', 'to talk in a friendly and informal way with someone for a short time.', 'We often chat online for hours about our daily lives.', 'Chúng tôi thường tán gẫu trực tuyến hàng giờ về cuộc sống hàng ngày.', '{\"en\": \"I had a quick chat with the supervisor about the new project schedule this morning.\", \"vi\": \"Tôi đã có một cuộc trò chuyện nhanh với giám sát viên về lịch trình dự án mới sáng nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-ljspeech-7ecde348.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-cori-7ecde348.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/chat-06ea0126.webp', '[\"converse\", \"gossip\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"have a chat\", \"meaning\": \"có một cuộc trò chuyện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"quick chat\", \"meaning\": \"trò chuyện nhanh\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"chatter\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-cori-7ecde348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-aru0-7ecde348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-aru5-7ecde348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-aru6-7ecde348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-aru10-7ecde348.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-aru9-7ecde348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-aru3-7ecde348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-aru7-7ecde348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-aru8-7ecde348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-aru2-7ecde348.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chat-ljspeech-7ecde348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/p