('9968b4f3-ec44-5205-b2ae-11b26d588864', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', 'ee279822-02d5-54f2-bbde-6ed798ed7aa8', '163ef0ef-f9c8-5b0d-9310-443781b4faeb', 'ace', '/eɪs/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Trong tennis, một cú giao bóng mạnh mà đối thủ không thể chạm vào.', 'a serve in a game like tennis that is so good the opponent cannot touch the ball.', 'The tennis player served an ace to win the final point of the match.', 'Tay vợt đã giao một cú ace để giành điểm cuối cùng của trận đấu.', '{\"en\": \"The client hit an ace during the friendly tennis match with our executive team.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng đã ghi điểm trực tiếp từ cú giao bóng trong trận quần vợt giao hữu với ban quản lý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ace-ljspeech-d86caede.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ace-cori-d86caede.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ace-b0f371ec.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"serve an ace\", \"meaning\": \"giao bóng ăn điểm trực tiếp\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ace-cori-d86caede.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ace-aru0-d86caede.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ace-aru5-d86caede.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ace-aru6-d86caede.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ace-aru10-d86caede.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ace-aru9-d86caede.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ace-aru3-d86caede.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ace-aru7-d86caede.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ace-aru8-d86caede.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ace-aru2-d86caede.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ace-ljspeech-d86caede.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ace-lt408-d86caede.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ace-lt138-d