('8770f5fc-02d3-5b13-a259-1945ea44897a', 'bdf02489-631c-5698-862c-4839e11cf892', 'ee279822-02d5-54f2-bbde-6ed798ed7aa8', '163ef0ef-f9c8-5b0d-9310-443781b4faeb', 'golf', '/ɡɒlf/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Môn thể thao dùng gậy đánh bóng vào lỗ.', 'a game played outside on grass in which players hit a small ball into a hole.', 'The company organized a golf tournament for its business partners last month.', 'Công ty đã tổ chức một giải đấu golf cho các đối tác kinh doanh của mình vào tháng trước.', '{\"en\": \"The executives often discuss important business deals while playing a round of golf on weekends.\", \"vi\": \"Các giám đốc điều hành thường thảo luận các thỏa thuận kinh doanh quan trọng khi chơi một vòng golf vào cuối tuần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/golf-ljspeech-e53d92ca.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/golf-cori-e53d92ca.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/golf-ab4b72bb.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"play golf\", \"meaning\": \"chơi golf\"}, {\"phrase\": \"golf course\", \"meaning\": \"sân golf\"}, {\"phrase\": \"golf club\", \"meaning\": \"gậy đánh golf\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"golfer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/golf-cori-e53d92ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/golf-aru0-e53d92ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/golf-aru5-e53d92ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/golf-aru6-e53d92ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/golf-aru10-e53d92ca.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/golf-aru9-e53d92ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/golf-aru3-e53d92ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/golf-aru7-e53d92ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/golf-aru8-e53d92ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/golf-aru2-e53d92ca.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/stor