('b8a40883-d4b7-5ef0-914e-c53a5ffc678f', 'c7b3ddd5-2c80-524b-b92b-cc508d96889d', '15a36e9c-253c-525d-9d91-bb48b85a779c', 'ae4af781-b8d3-5e34-acb5-faaf017ff49a', 'banquet', '/ˈbæŋkwɪt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một bữa tiệc lớn, sang trọng, thường có nhiều món ăn và khách mời.', 'a formal dinner for many people, usually to celebrate a special event or achievement.', 'The wedding banquet was held in a grand hall with hundreds of guests.', 'Bữa tiệc cưới được tổ chức trong một sảnh lớn với hàng trăm khách mời.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel manager confirmed the booking details for the annual charity banquet next month.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý khách sạn đã xác nhận chi tiết đặt chỗ cho bữa tiệc từ thiện thường niên vào tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banquet-ljspeech-2040c3b9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banquet-cori-2040c3b9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/banquet-3064c002.webp', '[\"feast\", \"dinner\", \"reception\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"state banquet\", \"meaning\": \"quốc yến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"banquet hall\", \"meaning\": \"phòng đại tiệc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bouquet\", \"note_vi\": \"bó hoa, phát âm và viết gần giống banquet\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banquet-cori-2040c3b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banquet-aru0-2040c3b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banquet-aru5-2040c3b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banquet-aru6-2040c3b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banquet-aru10-2040c3b9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banquet-aru9-2040c3b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banquet-aru3-2040c3b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banquet-aru7-2040c3b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banquet-aru8-2040c3b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banquet-aru2-2040c3b9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banquet-ljspeech-2040c3b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banquet-lt408-2040c3b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banquet-lt138-2040c3b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banquet-lt624-2040c3b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banquet-lt396-2040c3b9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banquet-lt498-2040c3b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banquet-lt132-2040c3b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banquet-lt288-2040c3b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banquet-lt42-2040c3b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banquet-lt90-2040c3b9.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn với \'bouquet\' nghĩa là bó hoa.', 'dining', 1, 4),
('eaa3767a-d621-59b1-b357-079ce5364834', 'c7b3ddd5-2c80-524b-b92b-cc508d96889d', '15a36e9c-253c-525d-9d91-bb48b85a779c', 'ae4af781-b8d3-5e34-acb5-faaf017ff49a', 'red envelope', '/red ˈenvələʊp/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Phong bì màu đỏ dùng để đựng tiền lì xì, biểu tượng của may mắn.', 'a small paper container holding money given as a gift during special holiday celebrations.', 'Children eagerly await receiving red envelopes filled with lucky money during Tet.', 'Trẻ em háo hức chờ đợi nhận những bao lì xì chứa tiền may mắn trong dịp Tết.', '{\"en\": \"The director gave a red envelope to each employee as a bonus for their hard work.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc đã trao bao lì xì cho mỗi nhân viên như một khoản thưởng cho sự chăm chỉ của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-envelope-ljspeech-9d7af231.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-envelope-cori-9d7af231.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/red-envelope-0b0d51b7.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"give a red envelope\", \"meaning\": \"tặng bao lì xì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"receive a red envelope\", \"meaning\": \"nhận bao lì xì\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-envelope-cori-9d7af231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-envelope-aru0-9d7af231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-envelope-aru5-9d7af231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-envelope-aru6-9d7af231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-envelope-aru10-9d7af231.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-envelope-aru9-9d7af231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-envelope-aru3-9d7af231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-envelope-aru7-9d7af231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-envelope-aru8-9d7af231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-envelope-aru2-9d7af231.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-envelope-ljspeech-9d7af231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-envelope-lt408-9d7af231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-envelope-lt138-9d7af231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-envelope-lt624-9d7af231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-envelope-lt396-9d7af231.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-envelope-lt498-9d7af231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-envelope-lt132-9d7af231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-envelope-lt288-9d7af231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-envelope-lt42-9d7af231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/red-envelope-lt90-9d7af231.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong môi trường công sở, đây là tiền thưởng Tết hoặc quà may mắn.', 'office', 1, 5),
('eb56c4c0-7667-5ebc-b1b7-a11cc4b9e78b', 'c7b3ddd5-2c80-524b-b92b-cc508d96889d', '15a36e9c-253c-525d-9d91-bb48b85a779c', 'ae4af781-b8d3-5e34-acb5-faaf017ff49a', 'five-fruit tray', '/faɪv fruːt treɪ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Mâm trái cây gồm năm loại khác nhau, bày trên bàn thờ ngày Tết.', 'a decorative plate with selected produce for a festival.', 'The five-fruit tray is an essential part of Tet decorations, symbolizing wishes for the new year.', 'Mâm ngũ quả là một phần thiết yếu trong trang trí Tết, tượng trưng cho những ước nguyện cho năm mới.', '{\"en\": \"The lobby displayed a five-fruit tray to celebrate the lunar new year.\", \"vi\": \"Sảnh khách sạn trưng bày mâm ngũ quả để chào đón năm mới âm lịch.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/five-fruit-tray-ljspeech-288787d5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/five-fruit-tray-cori-288787d5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/five-fruit-tray-89b0bf3c.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"prepare a five-fruit tray\", \"meaning\": \"chuẩn bị mâm ngũ quả\"}, {\"phrase\": \"display five-fruit tray\", \"meaning\": \"trưng bày mâm ngũ quả\"}, {\"phrase\": \"traditional five-fruit tray\", \"meaning\": \"mâm ngũ quả truyền thống\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fruit basket\", \"note_vi\": \"giỏ trái cây, thường để ăn không phải trang trí lễ\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/five-fruit-tray-cori-288787d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/five-fruit-tray-aru0-288787d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/five-fruit-tray-aru5-288787d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/five-fruit-tray-aru6-288787d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/five-fruit-tray-aru10-288787d5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/five-fruit-tray-aru9-288787d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/five-fruit-tray-aru3-288787d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/five-fruit-tray-aru7-288787d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/five-fruit-tray-aru8-288787d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/five-fruit-tray-aru2-288787d5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/five-fruit-tray-ljspeech-288787d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/five-fruit-tray-lt408-288787d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/five-fruit-tray-lt138-288787d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/five-fruit-tray-lt624-288787d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/five-fruit-tray-lt396-288787d5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/five-fruit-tray-lt498-288787d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/five-fruit-tray-lt132-288787d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/five-fruit-tray-lt288-288787d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/five-fruit-tray-lt42-288787d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/five-fruit-tray-lt90-288787d5.mp3\"]}}', 'Thuật ngữ văn hóa Việt, khi thi TOEIC có thể gặp trong bài đọc về Tết.', 'other', 1, 6),
('fa1b0c0f-29a9-5374-af57-6513b75bb701', 'c7b3ddd5-2c80-524b-b92b-cc508d96889d', '15a36e9c-253c-525d-9d91-bb48b85a779c', 'ae4af781-b8d3-5e34-acb5-faaf017ff49a', 'year-end worship', '/ˈjɪərend ˈwɜːʃɪp/', 'B2', 'noun', 'nghi lễ thờ cúng tổ tiên vào cuối năm để tạ ơn và cầu an.', 'a traditional ceremony held at the close of December to honor ancestors.', 'Many Vietnamese families hold a special year-end worship ceremony to honor their ancestors.', 'Nhiều gia đình Việt Nam tổ chức một buổi cúng tất niên đặc biệt để tưởng nhớ tổ tiên.', '{\"en\": \"The company organized a year-end worship ceremony to pray for business success.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã tổ chức một lễ cúng tất niên để cầu mong kinh doanh thành công.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-end-worship-ljspeech-78d72cd1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-end-worship-cori-78d72cd1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/year-end-worship-3b84621d.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"perform year-end worship\", \"meaning\": \"cúng tất niên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"year-end worship ceremony\", \"meaning\": \"lễ cúng tất niên\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-end-worship-cori-78d72cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-end-worship-aru0-78d72cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-end-worship-aru5-78d72cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-end-worship-aru6-78d72cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-end-worship-aru10-78d72cd1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-end-worship-aru9-78d72cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-end-worship-aru3-78d72cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-end-worship-aru7-78d72cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-end-worship-aru8-78d72cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-end-worship-aru2-78d72cd1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-end-worship-ljspeech-78d72cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-end-worship-lt408-78d72cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-end-worship-lt138-78d72cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-end-worship-lt624-78d72cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-end-worship-lt396-78d72cd1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-end-worship-lt498-78d72cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-end-worship-lt132-78d72cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-end-worship-lt288-78d72cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-end-worship-lt42-78d72cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-end-worship-lt90-78d72cd1.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm từ mang tính văn hóa Á Đông, dùng để chỉ lễ cúng cuối năm.', 'daily', 1, 7),
('55c3c45b-4604-533d-902e-e8b32547fd89', 'c7b3ddd5-2c80-524b-b92b-cc508d96889d', '15a36e9c-253c-525d-9d91-bb48b85a779c', 'ae4af781-b8d3-5e34-acb5-faaf017ff49a', 'decorate the house', '/ˈdɛkəreɪt ðə haʊs/', 'A2', 'phrase', 'sửa sang và làm đẹp không gian sống bằng đồ vật, hoa, cây cảnh.', 'to make a home look beautiful by putting flowers, lights, or paintings in it.', 'My colleagues helped me decorate the house before the year-end company gathering.', 'Các đồng nghiệp của tôi đã giúp tôi trang trí nhà cửa trước buổi họp mặt cuối năm của công ty.', '{\"en\": \"The real estate agency hired a professional designer to decorate the house before the sale.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty bất động sản đã thuê một nhà thiết kế chuyên nghiệp để trang trí ngôi nhà trước khi bán.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorate-the-house-ljspeech-7daccfbe.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorate-the-house-cori-7daccfbe.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/decorate-the-house-17fdcef8.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"decorate the house for Tet\", \"meaning\": \"trang trí nhà cửa đón Tết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"help decorate the house\", \"meaning\": \"giúp trang trí nhà cửa\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorate-the-house-cori-7daccfbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorate-the-house-aru0-7daccfbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorate-the-house-aru5-7daccfbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorate-the-house-aru6-7daccfbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorate-the-house-aru10-7daccfbe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorate-the-house-aru9-7daccfbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorate-the-house-aru3-7daccfbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorate-the-house-aru7-7daccfbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorate-the-house-aru8-7daccfbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorate-the-house-aru2-7daccfbe.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorate-the-house-ljspeech-7daccfbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorate-the-house-lt408-7daccfbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorate-the-house-lt138-7daccfbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorate-the-house-lt624-7daccfbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorate-the-house-lt396-7daccfbe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorate-the-house-lt498-7daccfbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorate-the-house-lt132-7daccfbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorate-the-house-lt288-7daccfbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorate-the-house-lt42-7daccfbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorate-the-house-lt90-7daccfbe.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm từ này thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh chuẩn bị lễ hội hoặc sửa sang nhà cửa.', 'housing', 1, 8),
('2ca7cdc8-041e-5118-8fd0-3a90cec700fd', 'c7b3ddd5-2c80-524b-b92b-cc508d96889d', '15a36e9c-253c-525d-9d91-bb48b85a779c', 'ae4af781-b8d3-5e34-acb5-faaf017ff49a', 'longan', '/ˈlɒŋɡən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Loại quả nhỏ, vỏ nâu nhạt, ruột trắng trong, vị ngọt.', 'a small round tropical fruit with a brown shell, sweet white flesh, and a hard black seed.', 'My grandmother always offers us a big bowl of longans when we visit.', 'Bà tôi luôn đãi chúng tôi một bát nhãn lớn mỗi khi chúng tôi đến thăm.', '{\"en\": \"We ordered a special dessert made with fresh longan for the corporate dinner party.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi đã gọi một món tráng miệng đặc biệt làm từ nhãn tươi cho bữa tiệc tối của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longan-ljspeech-a77fbcac.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longan-cori-a77fbcac.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/longan-321427db.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fresh longan\", \"meaning\": \"nhãn tươi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dried longan\", \"meaning\": \"long nhãn (nhãn sấy khô)\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"lychee\", \"note_vi\": \"quả vải, vỏ sần sùi và màu đỏ khi chín\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longan-cori-a77fbcac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longan-aru0-a77fbcac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longan-aru5-a77fbcac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longan-aru6-a77fbcac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longan-aru10-a77fbcac.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longan-aru9-a77fbcac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longan-aru3-a77fbcac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longan-aru7-a77fbcac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longan-aru8-a77fbcac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/longan-aru2-a77fbcac.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/o