('83cfef79-6929-5c56-8ace-8c04200877e9', 'c7b3ddd5-2c80-524b-b92b-cc508d96889d', '15a36e9c-253c-525d-9d91-bb48b85a779c', 'ae4af781-b8d3-5e34-acb5-faaf017ff49a', 'boiled chicken', '/bɔɪld tʃɪkən/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Món gà được chế biến bằng cách luộc chín.', 'poultry cooked in hot water, commonly served as a traditional dish during festive meals.', 'Boiled chicken is a common dish served during Tet celebrations in Vietnam.', 'Gà luộc là một món ăn phổ biến trong các dịp lễ Tết ở Việt Nam.', '{\"en\": \"The catering company prepared traditional boiled chicken for the company\'s year-end banquet last night.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty cung cấp tiệc đã chuẩn bị món gà luộc truyền thống cho bữa tiệc tất niên của công ty tối qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boiled-chicken-ljspeech-bf653cac.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boiled-chicken-cori-bf653cac.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/boiled-chicken-c92985ac.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"whole boiled chicken\", \"meaning\": \"gà luộc nguyên con\"}, {\"phrase\": \"shredded boiled chicken\", \"meaning\": \"gà luộc xé phay\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boiled-chicken-cori-bf653cac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boiled-chicken-aru0-bf653cac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boiled-chicken-aru5-bf653cac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boiled-chicken-aru6-bf653cac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boiled-chicken-aru10-bf653cac.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boiled-chicken-aru9-bf653cac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boiled-chicken-aru3-bf653cac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boiled-chicken-aru7-bf653cac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boiled-chicken-aru8-bf653cac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2