('a413ad8a-5b82-5faa-924a-e397aab405cb', 'c7b3ddd5-2c80-524b-b92b-cc508d96889d', '15a36e9c-253c-525d-9d91-bb48b85a779c', 'ae4af781-b8d3-5e34-acb5-faaf017ff49a', 'lotus', '/ˈləʊtəs/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một loài hoa thủy sinh đẹp, tượng trưng cho sự thanh khiết, thường mọc ở ao hồ.', 'a water plant with large, beautiful flowers that grows in ponds or lakes.', 'The lotus flower is a significant symbol in many Asian cultures, representing purity and enlightenment.', 'Hoa sen là một biểu tượng quan trọng trong nhiều nền văn hóa châu Á, đại diện cho sự thanh khiết và giác ngộ.', '{\"en\": \"The company logo features a stylized lotus to represent purity and success in business.\", \"vi\": \"Logo của công ty có hình hoa sen cách điệu để đại diện cho sự thuần khiết và thành công trong kinh doanh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lotus-ljspeech-fc6edd7a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lotus-cori-fc6edd7a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lotus-bdfcb551.webp', '[\"water lily\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"blooming lotus\", \"meaning\": \"hoa sen nở\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lotus pond\", \"meaning\": \"ao sen\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lotus-cori-fc6edd7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lotus-aru0-fc6edd7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lotus-aru5-fc6edd7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lotus-aru6-fc6edd7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lotus-aru10-fc6edd7a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lotus-aru9-fc6edd7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lotus-aru3-fc6edd7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lotus-aru7-fc6edd7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lotus-aru8-fc6edd7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lotus-aru2-fc6edd7a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lotus-ljspeech-fc6edd7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lotus-lt408-fc6edd7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lotus-lt138-fc6edd7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lotus-lt624-fc6edd7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lotus-lt396-fc6edd7a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lotus-lt498-fc6edd7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lotus-lt132-fc6edd7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lotus-lt288-fc6edd7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lotus-lt42-fc6edd7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lotus-lt90-fc6edd7a.mp3\"]}}', 'Hoa sen thường được dùng làm biểu tượng văn hóa hoặc logo thương hiệu.', 'other', 1, 24),
('3e895c1e-faaa-5a3b-9745-db5d13410941', 'c7b3ddd5-2c80-524b-b92b-cc508d96889d', '15a36e9c-253c-525d-9d91-bb48b85a779c', 'ae4af781-b8d3-5e34-acb5-faaf017ff49a', 'release fish', '/rɪˈliːs fɪʃ/', 'A2', 'phrase', 'Hành động thả cá (hoặc các loài vật khác) về môi trường tự nhiên, thường mang ý nghĩa tâm linh.', 'allow a caught aquatic animal to go back to nature.', 'On special occasions, some people release fish into the river as a good deed.', 'Vào những dịp đặc biệt, một số người phóng sinh cá xuống sông như một việc làm tốt.', '{\"en\": \"The company organized a release fish event at the local river.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã tổ chức sự kiện phóng sinh cá tại con sông địa phương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-fish-ljspeech-1b7d9b51.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-fish-cori-1b7d9b51.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/release-fish-ef755413.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"release fish ceremony\", \"meaning\": \"lễ phóng sinh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"release fish into river\", \"meaning\": \"thả cá về sông\"}, {\"phrase\": \"release fish for merit\", \"meaning\": \"phóng sinh cầu phước\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"catch fish\", \"note_vi\": \"release là thả, catch là bắt.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-fish-cori-1b7d9b51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-fish-aru0-1b7d9b51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-fish-aru5-1b7d9b51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-fish-aru6-1b7d9b51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-fish-aru10-1b7d9b51.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-fish-aru9-1b7d9b51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-fish-aru3-1b7d9b51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-fish-aru7-1b7d9b51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-fish-aru8-1b7d9b51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-fish-aru2-1b7d9b51.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-fish-ljspeech-1b7d9b51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-fish-lt408-1b7d9b51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-fish-lt138-1b7d9b51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-fish-lt624-1b7d9b51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-fish-lt396-1b7d9b51.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-fish-lt498-1b7d9b51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-fish-lt132-1b7d9b51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-fish-lt288-1b7d9b51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-fish-lt42-1b7d9b51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-fish-lt90-1b7d9b51.mp3\"]}}', '', 'nature', 1, 25),
('cd6c8cb1-6bb3-5b7b-8030-d81831831dd7', 'c7b3ddd5-2c80-524b-b92b-cc508d96889d', '15a36e9c-253c-525d-9d91-bb48b85a779c', 'ae4af781-b8d3-5e34-acb5-faaf017ff49a', 'areca palm', '/əˈriːkə pɑːm/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một loại cây thân thẳng, lá to, thường được trồng để lấy quả ăn trầu.', 'a type of tall tropical tree that often has long leaves and produces small round fruits.', 'In many tropical countries, the nuts of the areca palm are chewed as a stimulant.', 'Ở nhiều nước nhiệt đới, quả của cây cau được nhai như một chất kích thích.', '{\"en\": \"The office manager placed an areca palm in the lobby to create a more welcoming atmosphere.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý văn phòng đã đặt một cây cau ở sảnh để tạo không khí chào đón hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/areca-palm-ljspeech-f251a840.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/areca-palm-cori-f251a840.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/areca-palm-652c68f1.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"plant an areca palm\", \"meaning\": \"trồng một cây cau\"}, {\"phrase\": \"areca palm tree\", \"meaning\": \"cây cau\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/areca-palm-cori-f251a840.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/areca-palm-aru0-f251a840.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/areca-palm-aru5-f251a840.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/areca-palm-aru6-f251a840.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/areca-palm-aru10-f251a840.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/areca-palm-aru9-f251a840.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/areca-palm-aru3-f251a840.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/areca-palm-aru7-f251a840.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/areca-palm-aru8-f251a840.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/areca-palm-aru2-f251a840.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/st