('b1e7ed9f-30b6-5b99-969d-602ea50ab908', 'c7b3ddd5-2c80-524b-b92b-cc508d96889d', '15a36e9c-253c-525d-9d91-bb48b85a779c', 'ae4af781-b8d3-5e34-acb5-faaf017ff49a', 'meat stewed in coconut juice', '/miːt stjuːd ɪn ˈkəʊkənʌt dʒuːs/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Món thịt kho với nước dừa, thường có trứng, là món ăn truyền thống ngày Tết.', 'a traditional vietnamese dish made by cooking pork slowly in the sweet liquid of a tropical fruit.', 'No Tet celebration is complete without a pot of meat stewed in coconut juice.', 'Không có lễ đón Tết nào trọn vẹn nếu thiếu nồi thịt kho nước dừa.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant menu features meat stewed in coconut juice to attract tourists during the holiday season.\", \"vi\": \"Thực đơn của nhà hàng có món thịt kho nước dừa để thu hút khách du lịch trong mùa lễ hội.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meat-stewed-in-coconut-juice-ljspeech-a196e9bb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meat-stewed-in-coconut-juice-cori-a196e9bb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/meat-stewed-in-coconut-juice-6171cb4d.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"serve meat stewed in coconut juice\", \"meaning\": \"phục vụ thịt kho nước dừa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"traditional meat stewed in coconut juice\", \"meaning\": \"thịt kho nước dừa truyền thống\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meat-stewed-in-coconut-juice-cori-a196e9bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meat-stewed-in-coconut-juice-aru0-a196e9bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meat-stewed-in-coconut-juice-aru5-a196e9bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meat-stewed-in-coconut-juice-aru6-a196e9bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meat-stewed-in-coconut-juice-aru10-a196e9bb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meat-stewed-in-coconut-juice-aru9-a196e9bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciat