('cceb6b99-060d-5655-b93e-a7e8a3ab549a', 'c7b3ddd5-2c80-524b-b92b-cc508d96889d', '4acc2666-522d-5246-b627-f3eafc968e73', 'aec2add1-8975-5cee-ad3f-50495d88ead6', 'watch the fireworks', '/wɒtʃ ðə faɪəwɜːks/', 'A2', 'phrase', 'Hoạt động ngắm nhìn pháo hoa được bắn trên bầu trời.', 'to look at explosive devices that produce bright colored lights and loud noises in the sky.', 'We\'re going to the park tonight to watch the fireworks display.', 'Tối nay chúng tôi sẽ ra công viên để xem màn trình diễn pháo hoa.', '{\"en\": \"After the annual company dinner, all employees gathered on the rooftop to watch the fireworks.\", \"vi\": \"Sau bữa tối thường niên của công ty, tất cả nhân viên tập trung trên sân thượng để xem pháo hoa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-the-fireworks-ljspeech-e4b7f96e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-the-fireworks-cori-e4b7f96e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/watch-the-fireworks-2d0f02f0.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"watch the fireworks display\", \"meaning\": \"xem màn trình diễn pháo hoa\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-the-fireworks-cori-e4b7f96e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-the-fireworks-aru0-e4b7f96e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-the-fireworks-aru5-e4b7f96e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-the-fireworks-aru6-e4b7f96e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-the-fireworks-aru10-e4b7f96e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-the-fireworks-aru9-e4b7f96e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-the-fireworks-aru3-e4b7f96e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-the-fireworks-aru7-e4b7f96e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-the-fireworks-aru8-e4b7f96e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-the-fireworks-aru2-e4b7f96e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-the-fireworks-ljspeech-e4b7f96e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-the-fireworks-lt408-e4b7f96e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-the-fireworks-lt138-e4b7f96e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-the-fireworks-lt624-e4b7f96e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-the-fireworks-lt396-e4b7f96e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-the-fireworks-lt498-e4b7f96e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-the-fireworks-lt132-e4b7f96e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-the-fireworks-lt288-e4b7f96e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-the-fireworks-lt42-e4b7f96e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/watch-the-fireworks-lt90-e4b7f96e.mp3\"]}}', '\"Fireworks\" luôn ở dạng số nhiều khi chỉ màn trình diễn pháo hoa.', 'office', 1, 3),
('a71da1fa-a807-5f9e-8897-287710d00d86', 'c7b3ddd5-2c80-524b-b92b-cc508d96889d', '4acc2666-522d-5246-b627-f3eafc968e73', 'aec2add1-8975-5cee-ad3f-50495d88ead6', 'expel evil', '/ɪkˈspɛl ˈiːvəl/', 'B2', 'phrase', 'Đuổi đi những điều xấu xa, xui xẻo hoặc linh hồn ma quỷ.', 'to force out or remove bad spirits or negative energy from a specific place.', 'Many cultures have rituals and traditions designed to expel evil from their homes.', 'Nhiều nền văn hóa có các nghi lễ và truyền thống được thiết kế để xua đuổi tà ma khỏi nhà của họ.', '{\"en\": \"The manager decided to clean the office thoroughly to expel evil luck before the new year.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý quyết định dọn dẹp văn phòng thật sạch để xua đuổi vận xui trước năm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expel-evil-ljspeech-eb231b45.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expel-evil-cori-eb231b45.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/expel-evil-9719c364.webp', '[\"banish\", \"drive away\"]', '[\"welcome\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"expel bad luck\", \"meaning\": \"xua đuổi vận xui\"}, {\"phrase\": \"expel negative energy\", \"meaning\": \"xua đuổi năng lượng tiêu cực\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"expulsion\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expel-evil-cori-eb231b45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expel-evil-aru0-eb231b45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expel-evil-aru5-eb231b45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expel-evil-aru6-eb231b45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expel-evil-aru10-eb231b45.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expel-evil-aru9-eb231b45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expel-evil-aru3-eb231b45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expel-evil-aru7-eb231b45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expel-evil-aru8-eb231b4