('4c3a8954-72d6-572e-a0d8-59bda6abe64c', 'c7b3ddd5-2c80-524b-b92b-cc508d96889d', '4acc2666-522d-5246-b627-f3eafc968e73', 'aec2add1-8975-5cee-ad3f-50495d88ead6', 'passion fruit', '/ˈpæʃ.ən fruːt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Loại quả tròn, vỏ tím hoặc vàng, ruột nhiều hạt, vị chua ngọt.', 'a round purple or yellow fruit with many seeds and a strong sweet taste.', 'I often add passion fruit juice to my smoothies for a tangy flavor.', 'Tôi thường thêm nước chanh leo vào sinh tố để có vị chua thanh.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel breakfast buffet now includes fresh passion fruit juice for all our guests.\", \"vi\": \"Bữa sáng tự chọn tại khách sạn hiện có thêm nước ép chanh leo tươi cho khách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-fruit-ljspeech-58f00ca3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-fruit-cori-58f00ca3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/passion-fruit-8194617d.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"passion fruit juice\", \"meaning\": \"nước ép chanh leo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fresh passion fruit\", \"meaning\": \"chanh leo tươi\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-fruit-cori-58f00ca3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-fruit-aru0-58f00ca3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-fruit-aru5-58f00ca3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-fruit-aru6-58f00ca3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-fruit-aru10-58f00ca3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-fruit-aru9-58f00ca3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-fruit-aru3-58f00ca3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-fruit-aru7-58f00ca3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-fruit-aru8-58f00ca3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passion-fruit-aru2-58f00ca3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/stora