('1ad65f41-77d4-5bee-b98a-3422076df254', 'c7b3ddd5-2c80-524b-b92b-cc508d96889d', '5c6bbcf1-9366-5118-a7ab-da63d0bbf130', 'b7f69adc-8bce-5b82-9527-7e1ef42788a5', 'salad', '/ˈsæləd/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Món ăn trộn rau sống, thường kèm thịt, cá, hoặc hạt, và nước sốt.', 'a cold dish of mixed raw vegetables, sometimes with meat or seafood, usually mixed with a dressing.', 'For lunch, I often eat a fresh green salad with grilled chicken.', 'Vào bữa trưa, tôi thường ăn một đĩa salad xanh tươi với gà nướng.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant manager suggested adding a fresh seafood salad to the summer lunch menu.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý nhà hàng đề xuất thêm món nộm hải sản tươi vào thực đơn bữa trưa mùa hè.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-ljspeech-f41c041b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-cori-f41c041b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/salad-db6a33c7.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"toss a salad\", \"meaning\": \"trộn nộm/salad\"}, {\"phrase\": \"a side salad\", \"meaning\": \"món nộm/salad ăn kèm\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-cori-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-aru0-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-aru5-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-aru6-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-aru10-f41c041b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-aru9-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-aru3-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-aru7-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-aru8-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-aru2-f41c041b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-ljspeech-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-lt408-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-lt138-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-lt624-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-lt396-f41c041b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-lt498-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-lt132-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-lt288-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-lt42-f41c041b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salad-lt90-f41c041b.mp3\"]}}', 'Ở Việt Nam, từ này thường được dùng để chỉ món nộm hoặc gỏi.', 'dining', 1, 18),
('863c4942-0b09-56ad-9ed2-be38f58e4e92', 'c7b3ddd5-2c80-524b-b92b-cc508d96889d', '5c6bbcf1-9366-5118-a7ab-da63d0bbf130', 'b7f69adc-8bce-5b82-9527-7e1ef42788a5', 'dragon fruit', '/ˈdræɡən fruːt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một loại trái cây nhiệt đới có vỏ màu hồng tươi và ruột trắng hoặc đỏ có hạt đen.', 'a tropical cactus plant with pink skin and sweet white flesh.', 'The vibrant pink skin of the dragon fruit makes it very attractive.', 'Lớp vỏ hồng rực rỡ của quả thanh long làm cho nó rất hấp dẫn.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel buffet included dragon fruit as a fresh dessert option.\", \"vi\": \"Buffet khách sạn bao gồm thanh long như một món tráng miệng tươi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragon-fruit-ljspeech-6592cde3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragon-fruit-cori-6592cde3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dragon-fruit-c4e9f99e.webp', '[\"pitaya\", \"pitahaya\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"dragon fruit smoothie\", \"meaning\": \"sinh tố thanh long\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dragon fruit salad\", \"meaning\": \"salad thanh long\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fresh dragon fruit\", \"meaning\": \"thanh long tươi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dragonfly\", \"note_vi\": \"dragonfly là chuồn chuồn, không phải quả.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragon-fruit-cori-6592cde3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragon-fruit-aru0-6592cde3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragon-fruit-aru5-6592cde3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragon-fruit-aru6-6592cde3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragon-fruit-aru10-6592cde3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragon-fruit-aru9-6592cde3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragon-fruit-aru3-6592cde3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragon-fruit-aru7-6592cde3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragon-fruit-aru8-6592cde3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragon-fruit-aru2-6592cde3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragon-fruit-ljspeech-6592cde3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragon-fruit-lt408-6592cde3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragon-fruit-lt138-6592cde3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragon-fruit-lt624-6592cde3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragon-fruit-lt396-6592cde3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragon-fruit-lt498-6592cde3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragon-fruit-lt132-6592cde3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragon-fruit-lt288-6592cde3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragon-fruit-lt42-6592cde3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragon-fruit-lt90-6592cde3.mp3\"]}}', '', 'dining', 1, 19),
('42691fc3-49bc-52ed-99cc-ba6a86be1017', 'c7b3ddd5-2c80-524b-b92b-cc508d96889d', '5c6bbcf1-9366-5118-a7ab-da63d0bbf130', 'b7f69adc-8bce-5b82-9527-7e1ef42788a5', 'cockscomb', '/ˈkɒkskəʊm/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một loài hoa có hình dáng giống mào gà trống, thường có màu đỏ, vàng hoặc tím.', 'a garden plant with a crested red or yellow inflorescence.', 'The vibrant cockscomb flowers added a splash of color to the garden.', 'Những bông hoa mào gà rực rỡ đã thêm một mảng màu sống động cho khu vườn.', '{\"en\": \"Our landscaping team planted cockscomb to add color near the entrance.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ cảnh quan đã trồng hoa mào gà để thêm màu sắc gần lối vào.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cockscomb-ljspeech-11ec7e78.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cockscomb-cori-11ec7e78.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cockscomb-f757d7d4.webp', '[\"celosia\", \"woolflower\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"red cockscomb\", \"meaning\": \"hoa mào gà đỏ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cockscomb flower bed\", \"meaning\": \"luống hoa mào gà\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cockscomb plant\", \"meaning\": \"cây hoa mào gà\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"comb\", \"note_vi\": \"comb là lược, không phải hoa.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cockscomb-cori-11ec7e78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cockscomb-aru0-11ec7e78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cockscomb-aru5-11ec7e78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cockscomb-aru6-11ec7e78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cockscomb-aru10-11ec7e78.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cockscomb-aru9-11ec7e78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cockscomb-aru3-11ec7e78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cockscomb-aru7-11ec7e78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cockscomb-aru8-11ec7e78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/