('61849533-064f-524b-a331-ac9d0dcf6267', 'c7b3ddd5-2c80-524b-b92b-cc508d96889d', '5c6bbcf1-9366-5118-a7ab-da63d0bbf130', 'b7f69adc-8bce-5b82-9527-7e1ef42788a5', 'pineapple', '/ˈpaɪnæpl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một loại trái cây nhiệt đới màu vàng, có vỏ gai và hương vị ngọt thanh.', 'a large tropical fruit with a rough brown skin and sweet yellow juicy flesh.', 'She enjoyed a refreshing slice of fresh pineapple on a hot day.', 'Cô ấy thích một lát dứa tươi mát lạnh vào một ngày nóng.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel breakfast buffet offers fresh pineapple slices for all the international guests daily.\", \"vi\": \"Bữa sáng tự chọn tại khách sạn cung cấp các lát dứa tươi cho tất cả khách quốc tế hàng ngày.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pineapple-ljspeech-ff9907a8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pineapple-cori-ff9907a8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pineapple-1291dd68.webp', '[\"ananas\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fresh pineapple\", \"meaning\": \"dứa tươi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pineapple juice\", \"meaning\": \"nước ép dứa\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pineapple-cori-ff9907a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pineapple-aru0-ff9907a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pineapple-aru5-ff9907a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pineapple-aru6-ff9907a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pineapple-aru10-ff9907a8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pineapple-aru9-ff9907a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pineapple-aru3-ff9907a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pineapple-aru7-ff9907a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pineapple-aru8-ff9907a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pineapple-aru2-ff9907a8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pineapple-ljspeech-ff9907a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pineapple-lt408-ff9907a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pineapple-lt138-ff9907a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pineapple-lt624-ff9907a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pineapple-lt396-ff9907a8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pineapple-lt498-ff9907a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pineapple-lt132-ff9907a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pineapple-lt288-ff9907a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pineapple-lt42-ff9907a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pineapple-lt90-ff9907a8.mp3\"]}}', 'Dứa còn được gọi là \'ananas\' trong một số ngôn ngữ khác.', 'dining', 1, 21),
('3eea6b19-f540-5f9e-b262-21f32cfabb50', 'c7b3ddd5-2c80-524b-b92b-cc508d96889d', '5c6bbcf1-9366-5118-a7ab-da63d0bbf130', 'b7f69adc-8bce-5b82-9527-7e1ef42788a5', 'release carp', '/rɪˈliːs kɑːp/', 'B1', 'phrase', 'Hành động thả cá chép xuống sông hoặc ao.', 'the traditional act of setting a specific type of fish free into a river or lake.', 'On Kitchen Gods Day, many families release carp into the river as a traditional custom.', 'Vào ngày Táo Quân, nhiều gia đình thả cá chép xuống sông như một phong tục truyền thống.', '{\"en\": \"Staff members often release carp into the pond during the traditional spring festival celebration.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên thường thả cá chép xuống ao trong lễ hội mùa xuân truyền thống.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-carp-ljspeech-5fba3686.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-carp-cori-5fba3686.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/release-carp-ff9f7eb2.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"traditional ritual\", \"meaning\": \"nghi thức truyền thống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"spring festival\", \"meaning\": \"lễ hội mùa xuân\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-carp-cori-5fba3686.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-carp-aru0-5fba3686.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-carp-aru5-5fba3686.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-carp-aru6-5fba3686.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-carp-aru10-5fba3686.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-carp-aru9-5fba3686.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-carp-aru3-5fba3686.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-carp-aru7-5fba3686.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-carp-aru8-5fba3686.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/release-carp-aru2-5fba3686.mp3\"