('4f86a5c6-e20f-5c49-920a-e36e1ea8a82a', 'c7b3ddd5-2c80-524b-b92b-cc508d96889d', '5c6bbcf1-9366-5118-a7ab-da63d0bbf130', 'b7f69adc-8bce-5b82-9527-7e1ef42788a5', 'dried bamboo shoots soup', '/draɪd bæmˈbuː ʃuːts suːp/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Món canh truyền thống làm từ măng khô, thường được nấu trong dịp lễ Tết.', 'a traditional hot liquid dish made with dehydrated young plant stems and broth.', 'My grandmother always prepares a delicious dried bamboo shoots soup for Tet.', 'Bà tôi luôn chuẩn bị món canh măng khô rất ngon cho dịp Tết.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant menu features authentic dried bamboo shoots soup during the annual holiday season.\", \"vi\": \"Thực đơn nhà hàng có món canh măng khô chính hiệu trong mùa lễ hội hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-bamboo-shoots-soup-ljspeech-e21b1a91.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-bamboo-shoots-soup-cori-e21b1a91.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dried-bamboo-shoots-soup-2b3abe01.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cook dried bamboo shoots soup\", \"meaning\": \"nấu canh măng khô\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bowl of dried bamboo shoots soup\", \"meaning\": \"tô canh măng khô\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-bamboo-shoots-soup-cori-e21b1a91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-bamboo-shoots-soup-aru0-e21b1a91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-bamboo-shoots-soup-aru5-e21b1a91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-bamboo-shoots-soup-aru6-e21b1a91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-bamboo-shoots-soup-aru10-e21b1a91.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-bamboo-shoots-soup-aru9-e21b1a91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-bamboo-shoots-soup-aru3-e21b1a91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-bamboo-shoots-soup-aru7-e2