('20883e2c-0f9f-5be3-9f6b-3d215cb63524', 'c7b3ddd5-2c80-524b-b92b-cc508d96889d', 'cdda737f-e85f-5234-bf30-c06f0ab8ffb9', 'bc324048-567e-51d9-a476-347683c9e4d3', 'coconut', '/ˈkəʊkənʌt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Quả của cây dừa, có vỏ cứng, cùi trắng và nước ngọt.', 'a large fruit with a hard brown shell and white flesh that provides milk and oil.', 'We enjoyed fresh coconut water on the beach during our vacation.', 'Chúng tôi đã thưởng thức nước dừa tươi trên bãi biển trong kỳ nghỉ của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel serves fresh coconut juice to guests relaxing by the outdoor swimming pool.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn phục vụ nước dừa tươi cho khách đang thư giãn bên hồ bơi ngoài trời.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coconut-ljspeech-211c1140.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coconut-cori-211c1140.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/coconut-b2f0d4c2.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"coconut milk\", \"meaning\": \"nước cốt dừa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"coconut oil\", \"meaning\": \"dầu dừa\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coconut-cori-211c1140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coconut-aru0-211c1140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coconut-aru5-211c1140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coconut-aru6-211c1140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coconut-aru10-211c1140.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coconut-aru9-211c1140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coconut-aru3-211c1140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coconut-aru7-211c1140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coconut-aru8-211c1140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coconut-aru2-211c1140.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coconut-ljspeech-211c1140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coconut-lt408-211c1140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coconut-lt138-211c1140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coconut-lt624-211c1140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coconut-lt396-211c1140.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coconut-lt498-211c1140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coconut-lt132-211c1140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coconut-lt288-211c1140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coconut-lt42-211c1140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coconut-lt90-211c1140.mp3\"]}}', 'Dừa là loại quả nhiệt đới phổ biến, thường dùng trong ẩm thực và mỹ phẩm.', 'dining', 1, 4),
('5a68e0ab-e678-5174-819c-29a38f6fcf1c', 'c7b3ddd5-2c80-524b-b92b-cc508d96889d', 'cdda737f-e85f-5234-bf30-c06f0ab8ffb9', 'bc324048-567e-51d9-a476-347683c9e4d3', 'first caller', '/fɜːst kɔːlə/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Người đầu tiên đến thăm nhà vào dịp năm mới, mang lại may mắn.', 'the first person to visit a house at the beginning of a new year to bring luck.', 'In some cultures, the first caller of the New Year is believed to bring good fortune to the household.', 'Ở một số nền văn hóa, người xông đất đầu năm được tin là sẽ mang lại may mắn cho gia đình.', '{\"en\": \"The office manager invited a successful client to be the first caller to ensure a prosperous year.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý văn phòng đã mời một khách hàng thành đạt đến xông đất để đảm bảo một năm thịnh vượng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-caller-ljspeech-f9e0c633.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-caller-cori-f9e0c633.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/first-caller-0b1facee.webp', '[\"first footer\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"bring luck\", \"meaning\": \"mang lại may mắn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"new year tradition\", \"meaning\": \"truyền thống năm mới\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"caller\", \"note_vi\": \"Caller thường chỉ người gọi điện, trong ngữ cảnh này là người đến thăm.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-caller-cori-f9e0c633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-caller-aru0-f9e0c633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-caller-aru5-f9e0c633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-caller-aru6-f9e0c633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-caller-aru10-f9e0c633.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-caller-aru9-f9e0c633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-caller-aru3-f9e0c633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-caller-aru7-f9e0c633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-caller-aru8-f9e0c633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-caller-aru2-f9e0c633.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-caller-ljspeech-f9e0c633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-caller-lt408-f9e0c633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-caller-lt138-f9e0c633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-caller-lt624-f9e0c633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-caller-lt396-f9e0c633.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-caller-lt498-f9e0c633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-caller-lt132-f9e0c633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-caller-lt288-f9e0c633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-caller-lt42-f9e0c633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-caller-lt90-f9e0c633.mp3\"]}}', 'Đây là khái niệm văn hóa đặc thù, thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh Tết ở Việt Nam.', 'daily', 1, 5),
('c4b8f0b4-6a65-519a-931b-13157947399e', 'c7b3ddd5-2c80-524b-b92b-cc508d96889d', 'cdda737f-e85f-5234-bf30-c06f0ab8ffb9', 'bc324048-567e-51d9-a476-347683c9e4d3', 'spring roll', '/sprɪŋ rəʊl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Món ăn cuộn nhân rau, thịt, bún, chiên hoặc ăn sống.', 'a savory Asian snack consisting of a thin pastry filled with vegetables and sometimes meat, usually fried.', 'Vietnamese spring rolls are a popular appetizer, often served with dipping sauce.', 'Nem rán Việt Nam là một món khai vị phổ biến, thường được ăn kèm nước chấm.', '{\"en\": \"The catering staff served a crispy spring roll to each guest during the networking event.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phục vụ tiệc đã dọn một chiếc nem rán giòn cho mỗi vị khách trong sự kiện giao lưu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-roll-ljspeech-05d959f2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-roll-cori-05d959f2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/spring-roll-5202539e.webp', '[\"egg roll\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fried spring roll\", \"meaning\": \"nem rán\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fresh spring roll\", \"meaning\": \"gỏi cuốn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"summer roll\", \"note_vi\": \"gỏi cuốn, thường không chiên và dùng bánh tráng trong\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-roll-cori-05d959f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-roll-aru0-05d959f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-roll-aru5-05d959f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-roll-aru6-05d959f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-roll-aru10-05d959f2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-roll-aru9-05d959f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-roll-aru3-05d959f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-roll-aru7-05d959f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-roll-aru8-05d959f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-roll-aru2-05d959f2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-roll-ljspeech-05d959f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-roll-lt408-05d959f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-roll-lt138-05d959f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-roll-lt624-05d959f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-roll-lt396-05d959f2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-roll-lt498-05d959f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-roll-lt132-05d959f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-roll-lt288-05d959f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-roll-lt42-05d959f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spring-roll-lt90-05d959f2.mp3\"]}}', 'Ở miền Nam Việt Nam gọi là chả giò, miền Bắc gọi là nem rán.', 'dining', 1, 6),
('a3a56780-759a-5252-abde-426b2d4d8a5c', 'c7b3ddd5-2c80-524b-b92b-cc508d96889d', 'cdda737f-e85f-5234-bf30-c06f0ab8ffb9', 'bc324048-567e-51d9-a476-347683c9e4d3', 'dress up', '/dres ʌp/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Mặc quần áo đẹp, trang trọng hoặc đặc biệt cho một dịp nào đó.', 'to put on formal or special clothes for a special event or occasion.', 'For the wedding, everyone decided to dress up in their finest clothes.', 'Cho đám cưới, mọi người quyết định chưng diện những bộ quần áo đẹp nhất của họ.', '{\"en\": \"All employees are expected to dress up for the annual company gala tonight.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả nhân viên được yêu cầu chưng diện cho buổi dạ tiệc thường niên của công ty tối nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dress-up-ljspeech-1e7c455c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dress-up-cori-1e7c455c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dress-up-d99594ad.webp', '[\"doll up\", \"spruce up\"]', '[\"dress down\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"dress up for\", \"meaning\": \"ăn mặc đẹp cho dịp nào đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dress up as\", \"meaning\": \"hóa trang thành\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dress down\", \"note_vi\": \"ăn mặc xuề xòa hoặc bị khiển trách, trái ngược với dress up.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dress-up-cori-1e7c455c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dress-up-aru0-1e7c455c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dress-up-aru5-1e7c455c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dress-up-aru6-1e7c455c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dress-up-aru10-1e7c455c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dress-up-aru9-1e7c455c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dress-up-aru3-1e7c455c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dress-up-aru7-1e7c455c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dress-up-aru8-1e7c455c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dress-up-aru2-1e7c455c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dress-up-ljspeech-1e7c455c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dress-up-lt408-1e7c455c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dress-up-lt138-1e7c455c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dress-up-lt624-1e7c455c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dress-up-lt396-1e7c455c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dress-up-lt498-1e7c455c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dress-up-lt132-1e7c455c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dress-up-lt288-1e7c455c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dress-up-lt42-1e7c455c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dress-up-lt90-1e7c455c.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm từ này đi với giới từ \'for\' khi chỉ mục đích sự kiện.', 'office', 1, 7),
('8c4d15b3-7c56-527d-9c1b-c1facbd22663', 'c7b3ddd5-2c80-524b-b92b-cc508d96889d', 'cdda737f-e85f-5234-bf30-c06f0ab8ffb9', 'bc324048-567e-51d9-a476-347683c9e4d3', 'dried candied fruits', '/draɪd ˈkæn.did fruːts/', 'B1', 'noun', 'các loại trái cây được sấy khô và ướp đường, dùng làm món ăn vặt.', 'sweet food made by boiling pieces of fruit in sugar syrup and letting them dry.', 'A tray of various dried candied fruits is an essential offering during Tet.', 'Một khay mứt hoa quả các loại là vật cúng không thể thiếu trong dịp Tết.', '{\"en\": \"The supermarket chain experienced a high demand for dried candied fruits during the holiday season.\", \"vi\": \"Chuỗi siêu thị đã trải qua nhu cầu cao về mứt hoa quả trong mùa lễ hội.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-candied-fruits-ljspeech-13c1cdd8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-candied-fruits-cori-13c1cdd8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dried-candied-fruits-23cfe447.webp', '[\"candied fruit\", \"glace fruit\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"a box of dried candied fruits\", \"meaning\": \"một hộp mứt hoa quả\"}, {\"phrase\": \"assorted dried candied fruits\", \"meaning\": \"các loại mứt hoa quả thập cẩm\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-candied-fruits-cori-13c1cdd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-candied-fruits-aru0-13c1cdd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-candied-fruits-aru5-13c1cdd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-candied-fruits-aru6-13c1cdd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-candied-fruits-aru10-13c1cdd8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-candied-fruits-aru9-13c1cdd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-candied-fruits-aru3-13c1cdd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-candied-fruits-aru7-13c1cdd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-candied-fruits-aru8-13c1cdd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-candied-fruits-aru2-13c1cdd8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-candied-fruits-ljspeech-13c1cdd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-candied-fruits-lt408-13c1cdd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-candied-fruits-lt138-13c1cdd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-candied-fruits-lt624-13c1cdd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-candied-fruits-lt396-13c1cdd8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-candied-fruits-lt498-13c1cdd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-candied-fruits-lt132-13c1cdd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-candied-fruits-lt288-13c1cdd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-candied-fruits-lt42-13c1cdd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dried-candied-fruits-lt90-13c1cdd8.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để chỉ các loại mứt Tết truyền thống.', 'shopping', 1, 8),
('32b8ef4a-40ed-50c6-b24c-4d0ed23eb343', 'c7b3ddd5-2c80-524b-b92b-cc508d96889d', 'cdda737f-e85f-5234-bf30-c06f0ab8ffb9', 'bc324048-567e-51d9-a476-347683c9e4d3', 'the New Year tree', '/ðə njuː jɪə triː/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Cây tre cao được dựng lên trong dịp Tết để xua đuổi tà ma và đón điều lành.', 'a decorated tree or pole set up to celebrate the new year, common in some Asian cultures.', 'In ancient Vietnamese tradition, people would erect the New Year tree to ward off evil spirits.', 'Trong truyền thống Việt Nam cổ xưa, mọi người sẽ dựng cây nêu để xua đuổi tà ma.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel lobby featured a traditional New Year tree as part of its festive decorations.\", \"vi\": \"Sảnh khách sạn trưng bày cây nêu truyền thống như một phần trang trí lễ hội.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-new-year-tree-ljspeech-7209886b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-new-year-tree-cori-7209886b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/the-new-year-tree-673b593c.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"decorate the New Year tree\", \"meaning\": \"trang trí cây nêu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"set up a New Year tree\", \"meaning\": \"dựng cây nêu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"traditional New Year tree\", \"meaning\": \"cây nêu truyền thống\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"Christmas tree\", \"note_vi\": \"Christmas tree là cây thông Noel, khác với cây nêu ngày Tết\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-new-year-tree-cori-7209886b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-new-year-tree-aru0-7209886b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-new-year-tree-aru5-7209886b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-new-year-tree-aru6-7209886b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-new-year-tree-aru10-7209886b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-new-year-tree-aru9-7209886b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-new-year-tree-aru3-7209886b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-new-year-tree-aru7-7209886b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-new-year-tree-aru8-7209886b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-new-year-tree-aru2-7209886b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-new-year-tree-ljspeech-7209886b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-new-year-tree-lt408-7209886b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-new-year-tree-lt138-7209886b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-new-year-tree-lt624-7209886b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-new-year-tree-lt396-7209886b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-new-year-tree-lt498-7209886b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-new-year-tree-lt132-7209886b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-new-year-tree-lt288-7209886b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-new-year-tree-lt42-7209886b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-new-year-tree-lt90-7209886b.mp3\"]}}', 'Cây nêu là phong tục Tết Việt Nam, không phổ biến trong văn hóa phương Tây.', 'daily', 1, 9),
('1436aaba-aef2-5774-8cf4-c3176d8dca83', 'c7b3ddd5-2c80-524b-b92b-cc508d96889d', 'cdda737f-e85f-5234-bf30-c06f0ab8ffb9', 'bc324048-567e-51d9-a476-347683c9e4d3', 'pistachio', '/pɪˈstæʃiəʊ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một loại hạt nhỏ màu xanh lá cây, thường được rang và ăn như món ăn vặt.', 'a small green nut with a hard shell that opens slightly when it is ready to eat.', 'I like adding pistachios to my salads for an extra crunch and flavor.', 'Tôi thích thêm hạt dẻ cười vào món salad của mình để có độ giòn và hương vị đậm đà hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The airline offered pistachio nuts as a complimentary snack in business class.\", \"vi\": \"Hãng hàng không cung cấp hạt dẻ cười như một món ăn nhẹ miễn phí ở hạng thương gia.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pistachio-ljspeech-d0c28f8b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pistachio-cori-d0c28f8b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pistachio-aff958a7.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pistachio ice cream\", \"meaning\": \"kem hạt dẻ cười\"}, {\"phrase\": \"roasted pistachio\", \"meaning\": \"hạt dẻ cười rang\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pistachio nuts\", \"meaning\": \"hạt dẻ cười\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cashew\", \"note_vi\": \"cashew là hạt điều, pistachio là hạt dẻ cười\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pistachio-cori-d0c28f8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pistachio-aru0-d0c28f8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pistachio-aru5-d0c28f8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pistachio-aru6-d0c28f8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pistachio-aru10-d0c28f8b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pistachio-aru9-d0c28f8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pistachio-aru3-d0c28f8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pistachio-aru7-d0c28f8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pistachio-aru8-d0c28f8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pistachio-aru2-d0c28f8b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pistachio-ljspeech-d0c28f8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pistachio-lt408-d0c28f8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pistachio-lt138-d0c28f8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pistachio-lt624-d0c28f8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pistachio-lt396-d0c28f8b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pistachio-lt498-d0c28f8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pistachio-lt132-d0c28f8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pistachio-lt288-d0c28f8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pistachio-lt42-d0c28f8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pistachio-lt90-d0c28f8b.mp3\"]}}', 'Phát âm: /pɪˈstæʃiəʊ/; người Việt hay nhầm với cashew (hạt điều) vì cả hai đều là hạt khô.', 'dining', 1, 10),
('fc312c86-98fc-543d-89aa-d3aa68cda660', 'c7b3ddd5-2c80-524b-b92b-cc508d96889d', 'cdda737f-e85f-5234-bf30-c06f0ab8ffb9', 'bc324048-567e-51d9-a476-347683c9e4d3', 'Kitchen Gods Day', '/ˈkɪtʃɪn ɡɒdz deɪ/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Ngày cúng ông Công ông Táo về trời.', 'a traditional event when spirits of the hearth report the family\'s deeds to heaven.', 'Vietnamese families prepare special meals on Kitchen Gods Day to bid farewell to the deities.', 'Các gia đình Việt Nam chuẩn bị bữa ăn đặc biệt vào Ngày Táo Quân để tiễn các vị thần.', '{\"en\": \"Many local shops close early on Kitchen Gods Day so employees can perform traditional rituals.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiều cửa hàng địa phương đóng cửa sớm vào Ngày Táo Quân để nhân viên có thể thực hiện các nghi lễ truyền thống.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kitchen-gods-day-ljspeech-bae2ec3f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kitchen-gods-day-cori-bae2ec3f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/kitchen-gods-day-d96c3976.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"celebrate Kitchen Gods Day\", \"meaning\": \"cúng Ngày Táo Quân\"}, {\"phrase\": \"Kitchen Gods Day ritual\", \"meaning\": \"nghi lễ Ngày Táo Quân\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kitchen-gods-day-cori-bae2ec3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kitchen-gods-day-aru0-bae2ec3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kitchen-gods-day-aru5-bae2ec3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kitchen-gods-day-aru6-bae2ec3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kitchen-gods-day-aru10-bae2ec3f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kitchen-gods-day-aru9-bae2ec3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kitchen-gods-day-aru3-bae2ec3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kitchen-gods-day-aru7-bae2ec3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kitchen-